            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-progression_fantasy-03",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Progression Fantasy · 03/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == progression_fantasy}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Progression Fantasy. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 3 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-progression_fantasy; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPalahaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nLet⠀the⠀message⠀exchange⠀carry⠀the⠀progression.⠀Show⠀changed⠀capability⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀transmits:⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀help⠀becomes⠀an⠀offer⠀of⠀help⠀in⠀an⠀actual⠀practical⠀transaction,⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀method⠀becomes⠀an⠀instruction⠀to⠀someone⠀else,⠀a⠀report⠀of⠀failure⠀becomes⠀a⠀report⠀of⠀completion,⠀the⠀delayed⠀answer⠀becomes⠀prompt,⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀takes⠀more⠀than⠀they⠀themselves⠀requested.⠀Each⠀sender's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀should⠀shape⠀the⠀contribution:⠀one⠀person⠀writes⠀long,⠀one⠀sends⠀fragments,⠀one⠀waits,⠀one⠀edits.⠀Use⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀matter.⠀A⠀delay⠀may⠀communicate⠀practical⠀interruption⠀or⠀hesitancy,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀treat⠀every⠀delay⠀as⠀withholding.⠀When⠀a⠀skill⠀is⠀discussed,⠀let⠀the⠀messages⠀illustrate⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀executing:⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀describe⠀the⠀principle⠀correctly⠀and⠀still⠀report⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀send⠀a⠀photo⠀or⠀attachment⠀that⠀documents⠀the⠀result,⠀or⠀ask⠀for⠀a⠀correction⠀they⠀already⠀understand⠀but⠀cannot⠀perform.\n\nCarry⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀layered⠀time⠀through⠀conversational⠀and⠀transmission⠀in⠀memory.⠀A⠀sender⠀may⠀repeat⠀a⠀family⠀phrase,⠀forward⠀an⠀old⠀message,⠀or⠀refer⠀to⠀a⠀past⠀event⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀participants⠀already⠀know.⠀The⠀same⠀phrase⠀may⠀return⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀exchange⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning:⠀the⠀lab's⠀warning⠀now⠀sent⠀by⠀the⠀learner⠀to⠀a⠀younger⠀person,⠀or⠀the⠀neighbor's⠀old⠀doubt⠀now⠀answered⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀report.⠀Let⠀rumor⠀and⠀public⠀report⠀enter⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀forward,⠀summarize,⠀or⠀ask⠀about,⠀but⠀keep⠀each⠀message⠀motivated⠀by⠀the⠀sender's⠀own⠀relationship⠀to⠀the⠀learner⠀and⠀their⠀opportunity⠀to⠀write⠀it.⠀When⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript⠀is⠀required,⠀present⠀it⠀as⠀distinct⠀narrative⠀context;⠀do⠀not⠀type⠀it⠀undetected⠀as⠀interface⠀metadata,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀character's⠀live⠀private⠀thought;⠀it⠀may⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀considered⠀saying⠀and⠀chose⠀not⠀to⠀send.⠀Treated⠀private⠀experience⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀clearly⠀separated⠀context,⠀never⠀disguised⠀as⠀a⠀message⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀read.⠀Let⠀ordinary⠀days⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀exchange:⠀a⠀sender⠀may⠀be⠀tagged⠀by⠀work,⠀a⠀household⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀conversation,⠀and⠀the⠀delay⠀or⠀brevity⠀should⠀follow⠀that⠀actuality⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀story⠀demanded⠀by⠀the⠀transcript.⠀End⠀after⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀a⠀received⠀answer,⠀a⠀pending⠀response,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀silence,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀lesson.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀authoring⠀contract.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalahba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nLet⠀each⠀scene⠀show⠀the⠀current⠀state⠀of⠀capability⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀and⠀how⠀others⠀respond.⠀Scene-setting⠀should⠀present⠀the⠀task⠀and⠀its⠀conditions:⠀the⠀same⠀workshop,⠀field,⠀or⠀kitchen⠀may⠀appear⠀again⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀detail⠀that⠀marks⠀progress—a⠀tool⠀now⠀within⠀reach,⠀a⠀workbench⠀cleared,⠀a⠀route⠀no⠀longer⠀needing⠀guidance.⠀Dialogue⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀community's⠀revised⠀relation⠀without⠀turning⠀characters⠀into⠀indicators:⠀a⠀neighbor⠀asks⠀for⠀help⠀instead⠀of⠀offering⠀it,⠀a⠀teacher⠀stops⠀correcting,⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀mentions⠀a⠀different⠀need.⠀When⠀a⠀task⠀remains⠀difficult,⠀show⠀the⠀difficulty⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀or⠀the⠀focal⠀reaction,⠀not⠀by⠀attaching⠀a⠀face⠀label⠀to⠀it.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀observes⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀expression,⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀it⠀function⠀as⠀proof⠀by⠀itself;⠀the⠀actual⠀changed⠀relation⠀is⠀shown⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀neighbor⠀later⠀says⠀or⠀requires,⠀and⠀the⠀expression⠀can⠀accompany⠀that⠀behavior⠀rather⠀than⠀certify⠀his⠀view.\n\nUse⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀layered⠀time⠀through⠀running⠀ordnance⠀and⠀gathered⠀passages.⠀A⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀may⠀anchor⠀a⠀memory:⠀the⠀same⠀doorway,⠀tool,⠀or⠀season⠀returns⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀significance⠀earned⠀by⠀what⠀happened⠀since.⠀A⠀short⠀narrative⠀passage⠀may⠀gather⠀a⠀past⠀attempt,⠀a⠀present⠀execution,⠀and⠀a⠀remembered⠀instruction⠀in⠀one⠀sentence,⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀it⠀remains⠀anchored⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀current⠀environment.⠀Let⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀family⠀or⠀community⠀repeat⠀across⠀scenes⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning,⠀and⠀let⠀rumors⠀or⠀public⠀events⠀enter⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀cast⠀says⠀to⠀one⠀another.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀use⠀the⠀actual⠀narration⠀or⠀interior⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀character's⠀experience⠀without⠀giving⠀every⠀mind⠀access⠀to⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene:⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀reaction⠀beats⠀that⠀do⠀not⠀slow⠀every⠀exchange.⠀Background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀are⠀purposeful⠀references,⠀not⠀mandatory⠀labels⠀on⠀every⠀line⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀code.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀key,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected;⠀those⠀require⠀their⠀own⠀authorization⠀or⠀feature.⠀Let⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀training:⠀a⠀scene⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀household⠀work,⠀a⠀meal,⠀or⠀an⠀errand,⠀and⠀the⠀advancement⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀request.⠀End⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀failed⠀one,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀burden,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀choice⠀screen,⠀revelation,⠀or⠀completed⠀lesson.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀authorship⠀contract.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalahbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀each⠀installment⠀as⠀another⠀layer⠀in⠀a⠀remembered⠀apprenticeship.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀always⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀tell⠀what⠀is⠀underway⠀—⠀a⠀particular⠀skill⠀being⠀learned,⠀tested⠀under⠀a⠀stated⠀condition,⠀or⠀lived⠀with⠀in⠀its⠀consequences⠀—⠀what⠀changes⠀locally⠀in⠀this⠀reply,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀open⠀to⠀continue.⠀Let⠀the⠀local⠀change⠀be⠀concrete:⠀an⠀attempt⠀made,⠀feedback⠀received⠀or⠀refused,⠀a⠀resource⠀gained⠀or⠀spent,⠀a⠀task⠀finished,⠀a⠀difficulty⠀that⠀survives⠀the⠀installment.⠀Do⠀not⠀close⠀every⠀turn⠀as⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀manufacture⠀a⠀cliffhanger;⠀a⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known,⠀or⠀work⠀still⠀in⠀progress.\n\nWhen⠀elapsed⠀time⠀or⠀an⠀earlier⠀event⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀present,⠀recover⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀gathering⠀sentence⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀recap:⠀one⠀sentence⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀weeks⠀of⠀practice,⠀the⠀season,⠀what⠀the⠀family⠀predicted,⠀and⠀the⠀neighbor's⠀verdict,⠀and⠀still⠀land⠀on⠀a⠀human⠀consequence⠀—⠀the⠀hand⠀that⠀healed⠀crooked,⠀the⠀debt⠀still⠀unpaid,⠀the⠀cousin⠀who⠀stopped⠀laughing.⠀Anchor⠀that⠀sentence⠀in⠀capability:⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀now⠀do,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀out⠀of⠀reach.⠀Let⠀advancement⠀register⠀as⠀accomplishment⠀under⠀a⠀condition,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀declared⠀stage.\n\nLet⠀the⠀community⠀hold⠀the⠀record⠀of⠀growth.⠀The⠀neighbor⠀who⠀watched⠀the⠀first⠀failure,⠀the⠀teacher's⠀phrase⠀from⠀the⠀early⠀lessons,⠀the⠀tool⠀that⠀broke⠀—⠀return⠀an⠀established⠀detail⠀when⠀it⠀can⠀carry⠀new⠀meaning,⠀in⠀preference⠀to⠀inventing⠀a⠀fresh⠀measure⠀each⠀time.⠀A⠀phrase⠀the⠀learner⠀once⠀heard⠀without⠀understanding⠀can⠀arrive⠀again⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀they⠀can⠀finally⠀execute⠀it,⠀marking⠀the⠀distance⠀traveled⠀without⠀announcing⠀a⠀rank⠀or⠀number.⠀The⠀street's⠀account⠀also⠀changes⠀with⠀them:⠀the⠀story⠀retold⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀ending,⠀the⠀name⠀the⠀market⠀has⠀for⠀them⠀shifting,⠀rumor⠀crediting⠀them⠀with⠀a⠀feat⠀beyond⠀their⠀reach⠀while⠀a⠀weakness⠀only⠀one⠀watcher⠀has⠀noticed⠀keeps⠀its⠀quiet⠀place.⠀Use⠀the⠀world's⠀existing⠀arrangements⠀—⠀apprenticeship,⠀certification,⠀tools,⠀reputation,⠀debts⠀—⠀and⠀invent⠀no⠀numbers⠀or⠀leveling⠀mechanics⠀merely⠀to⠀display⠀progress.\n\nStage⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀executing⠀inside⠀time.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀hold⠀both⠀moments⠀at⠀once:⠀they⠀could⠀recite⠀the⠀rule⠀long⠀before⠀they⠀could⠀use⠀it,⠀and⠀only⠀now,⠀under⠀pressure⠀or⠀fatigue⠀or⠀interruption,⠀do⠀the⠀rule⠀and⠀the⠀hand⠀arrive⠀together⠀or⠀fail⠀to.⠀Give⠀a⠀failure⠀a⠀specific⠀practical⠀trace⠀—⠀wasted⠀material,⠀a⠀broken⠀tool,⠀a⠀promised⠀repayment⠀—⠀that⠀a⠀later⠀installment⠀can⠀pick⠀up⠀again.⠀A⠀brief⠀forward⠀glance⠀can⠀end⠀an⠀installment⠀as⠀a⠀hook⠀—⠀for⠀instance,⠀that⠀it⠀would⠀be⠀a⠀long⠀time⠀before⠀the⠀family⠀took⠀this⠀craft⠀lightly⠀again⠀—⠀so⠀long⠀as⠀it⠀deepens⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀rather⠀than⠀fixing⠀what⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀decided.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀developing⠀life⠀whole.⠀Relationships,⠀recovery,⠀household⠀tasks,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀training,⠀and⠀an⠀installment⠀may⠀spend⠀its⠀local⠀change⠀on⠀one⠀of⠀these⠀instead⠀of⠀a⠀skill⠀test;⠀let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀community⠀notice⠀one⠀before⠀the⠀other.⠀Where⠀the⠀world⠀permits⠀the⠀marvelous,⠀let⠀it⠀be⠀treated⠀domestically⠀—⠀complained⠀about,⠀priced,⠀envied,⠀mourned⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀met⠀with⠀astonishment.⠀Attach⠀each⠀recollection⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀holds⠀it,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀learner's⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract:⠀the⠀fear⠀before⠀an⠀attempt,⠀the⠀silent⠀accounting⠀of⠀what⠀remains⠀impossible,⠀held⠀while⠀the⠀street⠀talks.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀perspective,⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀authorship⠀contract,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀any⠀attempt⠀to⠀succeed,⠀fail,⠀or⠀be⠀resolved⠀before⠀a⠀reply⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nMake⠀each⠀advancement⠀beat⠀an⠀emotional⠀event,⠀not⠀a⠀stat⠀change.⠀Show⠀the⠀practitioner⠀attempting⠀something⠀newly⠀possible,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀attempt⠀itself⠀force⠀contact⠀with⠀a⠀specific⠀unresolved⠀hurt:⠀the⠀technique⠀now⠀works,⠀but⠀using⠀it⠀requires⠀the⠀practitioner⠀to⠀stop⠀avoiding⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀taught⠀it,⠀to⠀admit⠀a⠀need⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀refused,⠀or⠀to⠀accept⠀that⠀the⠀new⠀strength⠀does⠀not⠀undo⠀an⠀old⠀failure.⠀Render⠀the⠀changed⠀capability⠀in⠀the⠀doing,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀doing⠀expose⠀the⠀cost.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀attempt⠀in⠀brief⠀declarative⠀movement.⠀Before⠀the⠀key⠀moment,⠀keep⠀the⠀narration⠀spare⠀and⠀withhold⠀the⠀private⠀cause⠀of⠀strain.⠀The⠀practitioner⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀stillness,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀object,⠀or⠀the⠀exact⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀body⠀wants⠀to⠀flinch.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀hurt⠀yet.⠀Then⠀deliver⠀the⠀delayed⠀shift⠀as⠀a⠀small,⠀concrete⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene:⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀steadies⠀only⠀after⠀the⠀practitioner⠀stops⠀speaking,⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀lasts⠀until⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀answers,⠀a⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀weight.⠀The⠀shift⠀should⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀infer⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀has⠀been⠀withholding,⠀not⠀announce⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀delayed⠀recognition⠀reinterpret⠀the⠀demonstrated⠀capability.⠀The⠀new⠀skill⠀may⠀have⠀been⠀learned⠀to⠀protect⠀someone⠀the⠀practitioner⠀cannot⠀apologize⠀to,⠀to⠀prove⠀something⠀to⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀watching,⠀or⠀to⠀avoid⠀asking⠀for⠀help⠀that⠀is⠀still⠀needed.⠀The⠀recognition⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀hurt.⠀It⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀advancement⠀means⠀to⠀the⠀practitioner,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀next⠀stage⠀of⠀training⠀is⠀shadowed⠀by⠀that⠀knowledge.\n\nKeep⠀warmth⠀partial⠀and⠀real.⠀A⠀companion⠀may⠀offer⠀practical⠀help⠀that⠀works,⠀and⠀the⠀hurt⠀may⠀remain⠀untouched⠀by⠀it.⠀An⠀apology⠀may⠀be⠀accepted⠀without⠀settling⠀the⠀grievance⠀behind⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀relationship⠀affects⠀training,⠀make⠀the⠀effect⠀concrete⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀distraction⠀changes⠀timing,⠀resentment⠀sharpens⠀a⠀drill,⠀gratitude⠀makes⠀a⠀dangerous⠀shortcut⠀seem⠀possible.⠀Use⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀diction.⠀A⠀close⠀narrator⠀may⠀render⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀reasoning⠀in⠀fragments;⠀a⠀more⠀distant⠀narrator⠀may⠀report⠀the⠀visible⠀strain⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀private⠀cause⠀implied.⠀Either⠀way,⠀preserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀knows⠀and⠀what⠀others⠀can⠀observe.⠀Advancement⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀cure⠀for⠀the⠀relationship,⠀and⠀the⠀relationship⠀is⠀not⠀merely⠀an⠀obstacle⠀to⠀power.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀and⠀short,⠀readable⠀paragraphs.⠀Keep⠀each⠀exchange⠀compact⠀enough⠀to⠀scan,⠀but⠀let⠀a⠀speaker's⠀pause⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀unspoken⠀observation⠀carry⠀weight.⠀Do⠀not⠀pad⠀dialogue⠀with⠀explanations⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀would⠀already⠀understand.\n\nShow⠀progression⠀through⠀an⠀attempt⠀that⠀matters⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀technique⠀that⠀works⠀now⠀but⠀not⠀cleanly,⠀a⠀correction⠀the⠀character⠀accepts⠀or⠀resists,⠀a⠀resource⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀attempted⠀next.⠀Make⠀the⠀changed⠀capability⠀visible⠀in⠀action⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀focused⠀attention,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀narrated⠀stat⠀block.⠀Render⠀the⠀remaining⠀difficulty⠀as⠀an⠀observable⠀limit⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀attempt:⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀technique⠀for⠀only⠀a⠀few⠀breaths,⠀can⠀read⠀the⠀opponent's⠀rhythm⠀but⠀not⠀the⠀feint,⠀or⠀can⠀use⠀the⠀new⠀resource⠀only⠀once.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀fails,⠀without⠀the⠀narrator⠀summarizing⠀either.\n\nDelay⠀one⠀piece⠀of⠀information⠀or⠀one⠀small⠀action⠀until⠀it⠀can⠀change⠀the⠀preceding⠀stillness.⠀Choose⠀a⠀shift⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀use⠀or⠀absorb:⠀a⠀detail⠀noticed⠀earlier⠀that⠀explains⠀the⠀opponent's⠀movement,⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀after⠀a⠀pause⠀that⠀reinterprets⠀the⠀last⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀gesture⠀that⠀shows⠀why⠀a⠀companion⠀has⠀been⠀holding⠀back.⠀The⠀revelation⠀should⠀alter⠀the⠀present⠀situation⠀and⠀give⠀the⠀next⠀turn⠀something⠀concrete⠀to⠀work⠀from,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀decision⠀at⠀the⠀end.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀stop⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀information⠀just⠀delivered:⠀after⠀the⠀new⠀detail⠀lands⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀begun⠀to⠀adjust,⠀after⠀a⠀decision⠀is⠀made⠀but⠀not⠀yet⠀carried⠀out,⠀or⠀while⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀still⠀absorbing⠀what⠀happened.⠀The⠀next⠀turn⠀can⠀pick⠀up⠀from⠀that⠀point⠀because⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀already⠀shown⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do,⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult,⠀and⠀what⠀new⠀understanding⠀has⠀just⠀arrived.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract,⠀player⠀control,⠀and⠀NPC⠀behavior.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀martial⠀adventure⠀route⠀of⠀the⠀Chinese⠀literary⠀tradition,⠀shaped⠀as⠀episodic⠀encounters⠀that⠀test⠀a⠀developing⠀capability.⠀Build⠀each⠀episode⠀around⠀a⠀single⠀test:⠀the⠀practitioner⠀attempts⠀something⠀newly⠀learned,⠀and⠀the⠀encounter⠀shows⠀whether⠀it⠀holds⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Keep⠀the⠀episode⠀compact⠀and⠀legible⠀on⠀its⠀own,⠀but⠀connect⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀carries⠀forward⠀from⠀the⠀test.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀encounters⠀in⠀brief⠀declarative⠀movement.⠀Let⠀the⠀prose⠀move⠀from⠀stillness⠀to⠀a⠀single⠀action⠀or⠀revelation⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀what⠀came⠀before.⠀Keep⠀descriptions⠀distilled:⠀one⠀telling⠀detail⠀of⠀stance,⠀terrain,⠀or⠀equipment⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀weight.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀moral⠀of⠀the⠀encounter⠀after⠀it⠀ends.\n\nDelay⠀the⠀key⠀information⠀until⠀it⠀revises⠀what⠀the⠀test⠀proved.⠀The⠀revelation⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀episode's⠀challenge:⠀a⠀rival's⠀restraint⠀may⠀show⠀that⠀the⠀technique⠀was⠀recognized⠀rather⠀than⠀defeated,⠀a⠀narrow⠀victory⠀may⠀reveal⠀that⠀the⠀practitioner⠀succeeded⠀by⠀accident⠀rather⠀than⠀mastery,⠀or⠀a⠀defeat⠀may⠀expose⠀a⠀flaw⠀the⠀practitioner⠀had⠀been⠀hiding⠀from.⠀The⠀delayed⠀understanding⠀must⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀carries⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀encounter,⠀so⠀the⠀next⠀test⠀addresses⠀the⠀revised⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀simply⠀repeating⠀the⠀previous⠀one.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀of⠀the⠀actual⠀setting⠀distinct.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀generic⠀martial⠀world⠀or⠀a⠀fixed⠀cast⠀of⠀wandering⠀swordsmen.⠀The⠀episodic⠀structure⠀and⠀the⠀emphasis⠀on⠀tested⠀capability⠀are⠀the⠀method;⠀the⠀setting's⠀own⠀facts⠀determine⠀who⠀trains,⠀who⠀opposes⠀them,⠀and⠀what⠀advancement⠀costs.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nShow⠀advancement⠀through⠀physical⠀attempts⠀with⠀concrete⠀stakes:⠀a⠀grip⠀that⠀fails⠀after⠀repeated⠀use,⠀a⠀technique⠀that⠀works⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀practitioner⠀stops⠀favoring⠀an⠀injured⠀side,⠀a⠀resource⠀that⠀is⠀consumed⠀or⠀damaged⠀in⠀the⠀learning.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Move⠀quickly⠀from⠀attempt⠀to⠀consequence,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀body,⠀equipment,⠀or⠀terrain⠀carry⠀the⠀evidence⠀of⠀strain.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀spare⠀but⠀not⠀uniformly⠀short.⠀A⠀longer⠀passage⠀is⠀warranted⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀reasoning⠀through⠀a⠀technical⠀problem:⠀comparing⠀two⠀failed⠀attempts,⠀calculating⠀what⠀a⠀damaged⠀resource⠀can⠀still⠀do,⠀or⠀recognizing⠀what⠀a⠀specific⠀failure⠀means⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀try.⠀Otherwise,⠀let⠀a⠀single⠀hard⠀image⠀do⠀the⠀work:⠀cracked⠀leather,⠀a⠀blade⠀edge⠀turned,⠀breath⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀settle,⠀a⠀stance⠀corrected⠀by⠀pain.\n\nDelay⠀one⠀piece⠀of⠀information⠀or⠀one⠀action⠀until⠀it⠀changes⠀the⠀preceding⠀stillness,⠀and⠀make⠀the⠀shift⠀a⠀material⠀or⠀physical⠀recognition⠀that⠀revises⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀technical⠀understanding.⠀A⠀detail⠀noticed⠀earlier⠀may⠀turn⠀out⠀to⠀be⠀the⠀cause⠀of⠀the⠀failure:⠀a⠀crack⠀in⠀the⠀grip⠀that⠀changed⠀the⠀angle,⠀a⠀worn⠀strap⠀that⠀shifted⠀the⠀weight,⠀a⠀breath⠀pattern⠀the⠀practitioner⠀had⠀been⠀ignoring.⠀A⠀limit⠀may⠀reveal⠀itself⠀only⠀under⠀real⠀pressure,⠀showing⠀that⠀the⠀technique⠀was⠀never⠀secure.⠀An⠀opponent's⠀movement⠀may⠀expose⠀a⠀flaw⠀in⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀own⠀stance⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀superior⠀skill.⠀The⠀revelation⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀can⠀attempt⠀next,⠀not⠀merely⠀add⠀atmosphere.\n\nVary⠀the⠀rhythm⠀deliberately.⠀A⠀rapid⠀sequence⠀of⠀attempts⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀slower⠀interval⠀of⠀repair,⠀observation,⠀or⠀calculation.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀training⠀scene⠀into⠀survival⠀horror,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀prose⠀so⠀compressed⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀loses⠀the⠀causal⠀connection⠀between⠀practice⠀and⠀changed⠀capability.⠀Advancement⠀remains⠀the⠀throughline;⠀grit⠀is⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀its⠀cost.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀A⠀training⠀log⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀attempted⠀and⠀what⠀failed;⠀a⠀letter⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀a⠀resource⠀while⠀concealing⠀why⠀it⠀is⠀needed;⠀a⠀report⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀test⠀from⠀the⠀observer's⠀limited⠀position.⠀Let⠀each⠀document⠀show⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀knows⠀and⠀what⠀that⠀author⠀cannot⠀or⠀will⠀not⠀say.\n\nMake⠀advancement⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀documents'⠀changing⠀content.⠀The⠀writer⠀who⠀once⠀described⠀a⠀technique⠀as⠀impossible⠀may⠀later⠀record⠀performing⠀it⠀under⠀specific⠀conditions.⠀A⠀later⠀entry⠀may⠀revise⠀an⠀earlier⠀account,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀writer⠀lied,⠀but⠀because⠀new⠀understanding⠀changed⠀what⠀the⠀old⠀record⠀meant.⠀Use⠀material⠀traces⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀crossed-out⠀line,⠀a⠀torn⠀page,⠀or⠀a⠀delayed⠀reply⠀to⠀mark⠀what⠀the⠀documents⠀themselves⠀cannot⠀fully⠀explain.\n\nLet⠀the⠀gaps⠀between⠀documents⠀carry⠀the⠀delayed⠀revelation.⠀A⠀missing⠀entry,⠀a⠀recipient's⠀unanswered⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀contradiction⠀between⠀two⠀accounts⠀can⠀change⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀what⠀came⠀before.⠀When⠀the⠀revelation⠀arrives,⠀it⠀should⠀alter⠀the⠀reader's⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀progression,⠀not⠀merely⠀add⠀a⠀new⠀fact.\n\nPreserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀without⠀adding⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record.⠀Use⠀the⠀specific⠀document⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀requires⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fixed⠀rotation.⠀The⠀documents⠀are⠀the⠀story's⠀presentation;⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀changed⠀capability⠀must⠀be⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀documents⠀record,⠀omit,⠀and⠀later⠀reinterpret.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nLet⠀warmth⠀and⠀practical⠀care⠀support⠀the⠀progression⠀by⠀showing⠀what⠀each⠀comfort⠀restores.⠀A⠀shared⠀meal⠀after⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀may⠀return⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀steadiness;⠀a⠀companion⠀who⠀remembers⠀how⠀the⠀practitioner⠀takes⠀tea⠀may⠀make⠀it⠀possible⠀to⠀accept⠀help;⠀a⠀quiet⠀interval⠀for⠀mending⠀gear⠀or⠀resting⠀an⠀injured⠀hand⠀may⠀let⠀a⠀technical⠀problem⠀become⠀clear.⠀Spend⠀attention⠀on⠀the⠀small⠀pleasures⠀themselves:⠀the⠀particular⠀food,⠀the⠀familiar⠀preference,⠀the⠀ease⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀no⠀one⠀is⠀performing.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀effect⠀in⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀readiness⠀to⠀attempt⠀the⠀next⠀stage,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀recovery.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀spare⠀and⠀declarative.⠀A⠀single⠀concrete⠀detail⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀comfort:⠀a⠀bowl⠀set⠀down⠀without⠀being⠀asked,⠀a⠀blanket⠀folded⠀at⠀the⠀foot⠀of⠀a⠀bed,⠀a⠀companion⠀who⠀waits⠀instead⠀of⠀questioning.⠀Do⠀not⠀inflate⠀the⠀moment⠀with⠀sentimental⠀explanation.⠀Let⠀the⠀care⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀done,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀response⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀a⠀small⠀change⠀of⠀posture,⠀attention,⠀or⠀willingness⠀to⠀try⠀again.\n\nAllow⠀manageable⠀friction.⠀A⠀disagreement⠀about⠀when⠀to⠀rest,⠀a⠀preference⠀ignored,⠀or⠀a⠀kindness⠀offered⠀clumsily⠀can⠀keep⠀the⠀characters⠀distinct⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀scene⠀harsh.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable,⠀and⠀established⠀problems⠀remain⠀in⠀the⠀world.⠀Affection⠀can⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀repair.\n\nDelay⠀one⠀small⠀revelation⠀or⠀action⠀until⠀it⠀changes⠀the⠀preceding⠀ease.⠀Choose⠀a⠀shift⠀that⠀deepens⠀the⠀warmth⠀or⠀clarifies⠀a⠀difficulty:⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀practitioner⠀notices⠀about⠀the⠀companion's⠀care,⠀a⠀reason⠀the⠀companion⠀has⠀not⠀spoken,⠀or⠀a⠀simple⠀gesture⠀that⠀reinterprets⠀the⠀quiet.⠀The⠀revelation⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀practitioner⠀more⠀able⠀to⠀face⠀the⠀next⠀stage⠀of⠀advancement,⠀or⠀more⠀honestly⠀aware⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀stage⠀will⠀cost,⠀without⠀demanding⠀a⠀resolution.⠀The⠀next⠀attempt⠀can⠀begin⠀from⠀this⠀rested,⠀particularized⠀moment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀progression⠀through⠀sustained⠀novelistic⠀paragraphs⠀that⠀place⠀each⠀test⠀in⠀a⠀social⠀and⠀historical⠀frame.⠀Where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀advancement⠀means⠀to⠀the⠀household,⠀school,⠀faction,⠀or⠀community:⠀who⠀gains⠀from⠀the⠀new⠀capability,⠀who⠀fears⠀it,⠀and⠀what⠀obligations⠀it⠀carries.⠀Use⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀to⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀broader⠀context⠀into⠀the⠀particular⠀attempt.\n\nWithin⠀that⠀formal⠀movement,⠀keep⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀distilled⠀images⠀and⠀declarative⠀sentences⠀as⠀the⠀points⠀of⠀pressure.⠀A⠀long⠀paragraph⠀may⠀establish⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀season,⠀and⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀expectation;⠀then⠀a⠀short⠀sentence⠀can⠀deliver⠀the⠀attempt⠀or⠀its⠀failure.⠀Let⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀the⠀formal⠀frame⠀and⠀the⠀spare⠀action⠀create⠀the⠀scene's⠀rhythm.\n\nDelay⠀one⠀piece⠀of⠀information⠀or⠀one⠀action⠀until⠀it⠀changes⠀the⠀preceding⠀stillness,⠀and⠀make⠀the⠀shift⠀revise⠀what⠀the⠀advancement⠀means⠀to⠀the⠀practitioner⠀within⠀the⠀social⠀frame⠀already⠀established.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀silence⠀may⠀turn⠀out⠀to⠀be⠀an⠀old⠀obligation⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀new⠀skill⠀a⠀debt⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀triumph.⠀A⠀rival's⠀restraint⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀shared⠀history⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀victory⠀into⠀a⠀test⠀of⠀loyalty.⠀A⠀success⠀may⠀depend⠀on⠀a⠀resource⠀the⠀practitioner⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀had⠀been⠀arranged,⠀turning⠀pride⠀into⠀obligation.⠀The⠀delayed⠀understanding⠀should⠀alter⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀private⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀advancement,⠀not⠀merely⠀add⠀background.\n\nKeep⠀narration⠀distinct⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language.⠀Dialogue⠀may⠀be⠀brief⠀and⠀oblique,⠀but⠀the⠀narrative⠀prose⠀can⠀carry⠀judgment,⠀history,⠀and⠀social⠀consequence.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀cast⠀uniformly⠀formal⠀or⠀the⠀setting⠀aristocratic.⠀The⠀formal⠀architecture⠀is⠀the⠀style;⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀social⠀arrangements⠀determine⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀progress⠀costs⠀and⠀whom⠀it⠀binds.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀in⠀lean⠀declarative⠀sentences.⠀Anchor⠀it⠀in⠀one⠀concrete⠀attempt:⠀a⠀movement⠀being⠀learned,⠀a⠀task⠀being⠀repeated,⠀a⠀limit⠀being⠀tested.⠀Notice⠀only⠀the⠀details⠀that⠀change⠀capability,⠀risk,⠀or⠀understanding.⠀Let⠀a⠀pause,⠀glance,⠀or⠀unfinished⠀answer⠀carry⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀knows⠀but⠀cannot⠀yet⠀explain.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀present⠀attempt⠀stalls,⠀open⠀a⠀framed⠀account.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀tells⠀a⠀listener⠀about⠀an⠀earlier⠀training⠀effort:⠀the⠀exercise⠀that⠀helped,⠀the⠀failure⠀that⠀redirected,⠀the⠀teacher's⠀single⠀correction.⠀Give⠀the⠀telling⠀an⠀immediate⠀occasion⠀and⠀purpose⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀may⠀be⠀persuading⠀a⠀companion⠀to⠀wait,⠀warning⠀a⠀student,⠀bargaining⠀for⠀access,⠀or⠀answering⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀why⠀they⠀move⠀as⠀they⠀do.⠀The⠀listener⠀is⠀present⠀and⠀active,⠀not⠀a⠀passive⠀frame.\n\nLet⠀the⠀listener⠀interrupt⠀or⠀question⠀the⠀account.⠀The⠀interruption⠀marks⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀simplified⠀version⠀and⠀the⠀fuller⠀inner⠀history:⠀a⠀missing⠀injury,⠀an⠀omitted⠀debt,⠀a⠀motive⠀the⠀teller⠀did⠀not⠀name.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀does⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀gap.⠀They⠀answer⠀with⠀practice:⠀they⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀attempt⠀and⠀reinvest⠀the⠀older⠀lesson⠀in⠀it.⠀The⠀nested⠀tale⠀is⠀not⠀autobiography⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀sake;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀tool⠀the⠀protagonist⠀uses⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀situation,⠀and⠀its⠀effect⠀registers⠀in⠀the⠀listener's⠀silence,⠀altered⠀cooperation,⠀or⠀refusal.\n\nMake⠀the⠀progression⠀cumulative⠀but⠀not⠀mechanical.⠀Advance⠀one⠀avenue⠀at⠀a⠀time:⠀a⠀stance⠀becomes⠀faster,⠀a⠀formed⠀idea⠀becomes⠀an⠀executed⠀movement,⠀a⠀debt⠀alters⠀how⠀new⠀choices⠀feel.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀an⠀exercise⠀from⠀embodying⠀it.⠀Show⠀the⠀returned⠀ability⠀in⠀action,⠀not⠀description.⠀When⠀the⠀protagonist⠀applies⠀the⠀old⠀lesson,⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀the⠀difference:⠀a⠀guard⠀that⠀was⠀an⠀inch⠀wide⠀is⠀now⠀a⠀line;⠀a⠀step⠀that⠀once⠀collapsed⠀now⠀holds.\n\nUse⠀repetition⠀as⠀a⠀frame⠀link.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀gesture⠀from⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀returns⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀meaning.⠀The⠀first⠀telling⠀may⠀name⠀it⠀as⠀failure;⠀the⠀present⠀return⠀may⠀show⠀it⠀as⠀foundation.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀repetition⠀certify⠀that⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀true.⠀It⠀connects⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀and⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀has⠀since⠀learned.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀frame⠀intelligible.⠀Mark⠀the⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀clearly,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀stack⠀tales⠀within⠀tales⠀unless⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀requires⠀it.⠀The⠀Arabian⠀Nights⠀technique⠀is⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀withholding⠀and⠀revealing⠀at⠀the⠀right⠀time,⠀not⠀a⠀disguise⠀for⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀must⠀infer.⠀The⠀protagonist's⠀growing⠀capacity⠀is⠀the⠀real⠀thread;⠀the⠀framed⠀story⠀is⠀its⠀curved⠀mirror.⠀Avoid⠀automatic⠀myth-making:⠀the⠀listener's⠀response⠀may⠀be⠀admiration,⠀doubt,⠀indifference,⠀or⠀practical⠀use,⠀and⠀a⠀story⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀protagonist⠀invincible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀progression⠀as⠀social-developmental⠀realism.⠀Record⠀the⠀work:⠀hours⠀of⠀practice,⠀exhausted⠀assistants,⠀worn⠀tools,⠀changing⠀schedules,⠀and⠀the⠀accounts⠀that⠀make⠀training⠀possible.⠀Include⠀the⠀immediate⠀material⠀costs⠀and⠀rewards⠀of⠀capability.⠀A⠀technique⠀has⠀a⠀source,⠀a⠀transmission,⠀and⠀a⠀price;⠀show⠀each⠀in⠀ordinary⠀prose.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀brief⠀and⠀declarative.⠀State⠀the⠀step⠀taken,⠀the⠀observable⠀change,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀limitation.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀motive⠀or⠀fill⠀every⠀pause.⠀A⠀skill⠀that⠀improves⠀can⠀be⠀shown⠀with⠀one⠀concrete⠀feat⠀or⠀failure.⠀When⠀the⠀protagonist⠀understands⠀something⠀later,⠀reveal⠀it⠀only⠀when⠀that⠀understanding⠀changes⠀an⠀action⠀or⠀choice.\n\nMake⠀the⠀increase⠀social.⠀Observe⠀how⠀others⠀respond⠀to⠀new⠀ability:⠀an⠀employer⠀raises⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀rival⠀withholds⠀patronage,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀reinterprets⠀an⠀old⠀debt,⠀a⠀teacher⠀corrects⠀a⠀presumption.⠀These⠀consequences⠀accumulate⠀alongside⠀the⠀work⠀itself.⠀Advancement⠀is⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀others⠀will⠀allow⠀them⠀to⠀attempt.\n\nDo⠀not⠀romanticize⠀effort.⠀Labor⠀can⠀be⠀tedious,⠀interrupted,⠀insufficient,⠀or⠀harmful.⠀Strength⠀develops⠀unevenly⠀and⠀may⠀fail⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Give⠀the⠀reader⠀enough⠀detail⠀to⠀infer⠀the⠀mechanism:⠀a⠀changed⠀grip⠀makes⠀a⠀cut⠀cleaner,⠀more⠀stabled⠀nerves⠀improve⠀recall,⠀better⠀nutrition⠀shortens⠀recovery.⠀Let⠀one⠀such⠀detail⠀stand⠀alone⠀rather⠀than⠀reviewing⠀the⠀whole⠀system.\n\nPlant⠀one⠀early⠀fact⠀and⠀leave⠀it⠀unexplained.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀material:⠀a⠀locked⠀drawer,⠀a⠀worn⠀tool⠀hung⠀out⠀of⠀reach,⠀a⠀name⠀in⠀an⠀account⠀book.⠀Or⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀social:⠀a⠀teacher's⠀silence⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀name,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀refusal⠀to⠀cross⠀a⠀threshold,⠀an⠀apprentice's⠀unexplained⠀absence.⠀Do⠀not⠀comment⠀on⠀it.⠀Let⠀it⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀ordinary⠀record.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀that⠀fact⠀later,⠀when⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀changed⠀capability⠀or⠀understanding⠀makes⠀it⠀legible.⠀The⠀return⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀action:⠀the⠀protagonist⠀now⠀opens⠀the⠀drawer,⠀uses⠀the⠀tool,⠀crosses⠀the⠀threshold.⠀Or⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀single⠀plain⠀statement⠀from⠀another⠀character⠀or⠀the⠀narrator.⠀State⠀it⠀without⠀moralizing.⠀The⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀reader⠀interprets⠀the⠀earlier⠀passage;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀introduce⠀a⠀new⠀fact⠀from⠀nowhere.\n\nThe⠀social⠀view⠀includes⠀schooling,⠀apprenticeship,⠀domestic⠀expectation,⠀and⠀economic⠀mobility⠀without⠀reducing⠀them⠀to⠀national⠀or⠀bureaucratic⠀caricature.⠀The⠀telling⠀can⠀be⠀intimate,⠀factual,⠀or⠀slightly⠀dry⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀narrator,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀concrete.⠀The⠀method⠀is⠀about⠀what⠀was⠀true⠀all⠀along.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nPlace⠀progression⠀inside⠀inherited⠀structures.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀trains⠀under⠀old⠀masters,⠀spent⠀foundations,⠀street-level⠀brokers,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀system⠀that⠀both⠀holds⠀knowledge⠀and⠀extracts⠀obedience.⠀Advancement⠀is⠀access:⠀a⠀key,⠀a⠀password,⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀recorded⠀exception.⠀Show⠀how⠀each⠀old⠀privilege⠀still⠀works⠀through⠀a⠀modern⠀mechanism⠀such⠀as⠀rent,⠀surveillance,⠀salvage,⠀or⠀sealed⠀archives.\n\nWrite⠀lean.⠀Describe⠀one⠀telling⠀material⠀detail⠀per⠀scene:⠀a⠀chalk⠀mark⠀by⠀a⠀drain,⠀a⠀cracked⠀training⠀tablet,⠀a⠀callus⠀under⠀a⠀ring.⠀Let⠀the⠀image⠀do⠀the⠀atmosphere;⠀do⠀not⠀pile⠀adjectives.⠀Dialogue⠀is⠀sharp,⠀incomplete,⠀and⠀carries⠀rival⠀claims⠀about⠀the⠀same⠀resource.\n\nPlant⠀one⠀still⠀image⠀and⠀let⠀its⠀meaning⠀be⠀accepted.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀ledger⠀left⠀open,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀hand⠀resting⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀shelf,⠀a⠀practice⠀hall⠀empty⠀at⠀an⠀hour⠀when⠀it⠀should⠀be⠀full.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀protagonist⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀accept⠀the⠀surface⠀meaning:⠀the⠀door⠀is⠀locked,⠀the⠀ledger⠀is⠀a⠀record,⠀the⠀hand⠀is⠀resting,⠀the⠀hall⠀is⠀empty.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀that⠀image⠀later,⠀when⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀changed⠀access⠀or⠀understanding⠀makes⠀it⠀legible.⠀The⠀return⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀action:⠀the⠀protagonist⠀now⠀opens⠀the⠀door,⠀reads⠀the⠀ledger,⠀reaches⠀the⠀shelf,⠀enters⠀the⠀hall⠀at⠀that⠀hour.⠀Or⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀single⠀piece⠀of⠀dialogue⠀from⠀another⠀character.⠀The⠀revelation⠀alters⠀how⠀the⠀reader⠀interprets⠀the⠀earlier⠀passage;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀introduce⠀a⠀new⠀fact⠀from⠀nowhere.⠀The⠀stillness⠀was⠀not⠀empty.⠀It⠀was⠀a⠀fact⠀about⠀the⠀system⠀waiting⠀to⠀be⠀read.\n\nThe⠀method⠀of⠀growth⠀is⠀uneven.⠀Separate⠀knowing⠀from⠀executing.⠀A⠀student⠀can⠀recite⠀a⠀lineage⠀and⠀still⠀misstep⠀the⠀first⠀form;⠀a⠀veteran⠀can⠀perform⠀a⠀perfect⠀strike⠀while⠀unable⠀to⠀read⠀the⠀new⠀contract.⠀Improvement⠀should⠀show⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀now⠀dares⠀or⠀refuses,⠀not⠀through⠀status⠀screens.⠀Feedback⠀is⠀often⠀personal:⠀praise⠀mixed⠀with⠀manipulation,⠀discipline⠀mixed⠀with⠀care,⠀correction⠀that⠀costs⠀something.\n\nUse⠀intimate⠀private⠀experience.⠀Under⠀the⠀social⠀mask,⠀the⠀protagonist⠀should⠀feel⠀desire,⠀dread,⠀loyalty,⠀shame,⠀or⠀reluctant⠀gratitude⠀about⠀the⠀system⠀that⠀is⠀teaching⠀them.⠀One⠀such⠀feeling⠀may⠀be⠀exposed⠀in⠀a⠀trusted⠀conversation;⠀another⠀may⠀stay⠀hidden.⠀Neither⠀should⠀automatically⠀make⠀the⠀person⠀virtuous⠀or⠀doomed.⠀The⠀Gothic-Punk⠀mood⠀changes⠀how⠀an⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced:⠀the⠀same⠀lesson⠀in⠀a⠀clean⠀gym⠀and⠀in⠀a⠀flooded⠀basement⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀lesson.\n\nDo⠀not⠀import⠀Kindred⠀powers,⠀clans,⠀or⠀cosmic⠀curses.⠀Inherited⠀power⠀here⠀is⠀economic,⠀institutional,⠀familial,⠀or⠀cultural.⠀It⠀can⠀shape⠀bodies⠀and⠀minds⠀through⠀training⠀and⠀debt,⠀not⠀supernatural⠀rule.⠀Nor⠀does⠀every⠀master⠀betray:⠀some⠀elders⠀genuinely⠀pass⠀on⠀skill⠀while⠀extracting⠀a⠀price;⠀others⠀protect⠀one⠀student⠀at⠀the⠀expense⠀of⠀many.⠀Keep⠀the⠀system⠀morally⠀complicated⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀cast⠀uniformly⠀cynical.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀grows⠀by⠀learning⠀how⠀to⠀use⠀an⠀inherited⠀order,⠀and⠀by⠀discovering⠀which⠀part⠀of⠀it⠀they⠀will⠀not⠀repeat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀retrospective,⠀first-person⠀account⠀of⠀training⠀and⠀increasing⠀capability.⠀The⠀narrator⠀is⠀the⠀protagonist⠀looking⠀back,⠀but⠀not⠀omniscient:⠀memory⠀is⠀selective,⠀and⠀present⠀understanding⠀must⠀not⠀rewrite⠀what⠀the⠀earlier⠀self⠀knew.⠀When⠀the⠀later⠀self⠀corrects⠀or⠀understands⠀the⠀past,⠀mark⠀it⠀as⠀such:⠀'I⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀then⠀that...'⠀or⠀'Only⠀later⠀did⠀I⠀understand.'\n\nWrite⠀in⠀compact⠀sentences.⠀Leave⠀gaps⠀in⠀recollection⠀and⠀implication.⠀Do⠀not⠀sentimentalize⠀or⠀moralize:⠀state⠀a⠀lesson⠀as⠀fact,⠀then⠀show⠀its⠀weight⠀in⠀one⠀action.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀style⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀regional⠀voice⠀that⠀the⠀world⠀supplies.⠀Use⠀the⠀actual⠀names,⠀foods,⠀trades,⠀and⠀expectations⠀of⠀the⠀setting⠀rather⠀than⠀any⠀generic⠀'Indian'⠀scenery.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀intimate,⠀focused⠀on⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀changing⠀body⠀and⠀judgment.\n\nLet⠀improvement⠀be⠀proven⠀by⠀small,⠀observable⠀differences:⠀a⠀task⠀done⠀faster,⠀held⠀patiently,⠀taught⠀to⠀a⠀sibling,⠀then⠀recovered⠀differently.⠀Separate⠀mastery⠀from⠀familiarity.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀look⠀back⠀and⠀say,⠀'I⠀thought⠀I⠀had⠀learned⠀it;⠀in⠀fact⠀I⠀had⠀only⠀memorized⠀it.'⠀Each⠀stage⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀social⠀frame:⠀a⠀teacher's⠀expectation,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀trade,⠀a⠀household's⠀need,⠀a⠀community's⠀judgment.⠀These⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀learning,⠀not⠀background⠀decoration.\n\nOmit⠀one⠀early⠀fact⠀for⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀leave⠀out⠀a⠀debt,⠀an⠀injury,⠀a⠀humiliation,⠀a⠀promise,⠀or⠀a⠀failure⠀because⠀shame,⠀custom,⠀fear,⠀or⠀loyalty⠀prevented⠀the⠀earlier⠀telling.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀omission.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀feel⠀the⠀gap⠀indirectly:⠀a⠀name⠀avoided,⠀a⠀period⠀skipped,⠀an⠀event⠀reported⠀with⠀unnatural⠀flatness.\n\nDisclose⠀that⠀fact⠀later,⠀when⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀growth⠀makes⠀the⠀new⠀honesty⠀possible.⠀The⠀disclosure⠀should⠀change⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀an⠀already⠀reported⠀event:⠀a⠀teacher's⠀harshness⠀becomes⠀protection,⠀a⠀companion's⠀absence⠀becomes⠀sacrifice,⠀a⠀victory⠀becomes⠀borrowed.⠀Mark⠀the⠀disclosure⠀as⠀a⠀later⠀understanding,⠀not⠀a⠀correction⠀of⠀the⠀earlier⠀self.⠀Use⠀this⠀sparingly,⠀and⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀growth⠀makes⠀the⠀new⠀honesty⠀possible.\n\nAvoid⠀assuming⠀religion⠀or⠀caste.⠀If⠀the⠀world⠀supplies⠀such⠀facts,⠀handle⠀them⠀specifically;⠀if⠀not,⠀stay⠀with⠀labor,⠀skill,⠀and⠀social⠀relation.⠀This⠀is⠀a⠀testimony⠀of⠀capacity,⠀not⠀a⠀fable⠀about⠀national⠀resilience.⠀The⠀account⠀should⠀include⠀actual⠀harm⠀and⠀loss⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀teacher⠀into⠀a⠀betrayer⠀or⠀every⠀gain⠀into⠀a⠀moral⠀lesson.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀says⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀declined⠀to⠀say,⠀make⠀that⠀silence⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀evidence,⠀not⠀an⠀aesthetic⠀pause.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaial::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nRecord⠀progression⠀through⠀dated⠀or⠀strictly⠀placed⠀entries.⠀Each⠀entry⠀is⠀composed⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀of⠀that⠀moment:⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀noticed,⠀what⠀they⠀attempted,⠀what⠀failed⠀or⠀repeated.⠀The⠀writing⠀is⠀brief⠀and⠀declarative.⠀Enter⠀the⠀concrete⠀situation⠀cleanly;⠀do⠀not⠀summarize⠀a⠀season⠀into⠀a⠀generality.⠀Seasonal⠀attention⠀can⠀appear⠀through⠀actual⠀weather,⠀light,⠀work,⠀or⠀available⠀food,⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀observation.\n\nBecause⠀this⠀is⠀a⠀diary,⠀the⠀protagonist⠀may⠀write⠀what⠀they⠀believe⠀then,⠀not⠀what⠀they⠀will⠀understand⠀later.⠀Let⠀later⠀entries⠀reveal⠀the⠀change⠀without⠀retrospective⠀commentary.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀entries⠀does⠀the⠀work.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀chooses⠀to⠀omit⠀something,⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀absence⠀indirectly,⠀not⠀be⠀told⠀that⠀a⠀secret⠀is⠀being⠀kept.\n\nMake⠀improvement⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀record.⠀The⠀same⠀movement⠀or⠀task⠀appears⠀again:⠀first⠀written⠀as⠀impossible,⠀later⠀with⠀a⠀single⠀qualifying⠀note,⠀later⠀not⠀mentioned⠀because⠀it⠀has⠀become⠀habit.⠀Use⠀physical⠀and⠀social⠀proof:⠀a⠀rope⠀secured,⠀a⠀debt⠀answered,⠀a⠀meal⠀earned,⠀a⠀wrong⠀step⠀corrected.⠀Training⠀is⠀incomplete,⠀recursive,⠀and⠀uneven;⠀an⠀entry⠀may⠀record⠀a⠀gain⠀that⠀is⠀later⠀lost⠀or⠀a⠀failure⠀that⠀later⠀becomes⠀the⠀foundation⠀for⠀a⠀new⠀attempt.\n\nPlant⠀one⠀unexplained⠀image⠀or⠀task⠀in⠀an⠀early⠀entry.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀cracked⠀floorboard⠀from⠀a⠀failed⠀footwork,⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀encouragement⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀wrapper,⠀an⠀empty⠀practice⠀floor⠀at⠀dawn,⠀a⠀tool⠀the⠀protagonist⠀cannot⠀yet⠀use.⠀Record⠀it⠀without⠀commentary.⠀Let⠀it⠀stand⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀day's⠀observation.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀that⠀image⠀or⠀task⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀entry.⠀The⠀return⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀action:⠀the⠀protagonist⠀now⠀uses⠀the⠀tool,⠀repairs⠀the⠀floorboard,⠀understands⠀the⠀encouragement,⠀moves⠀across⠀the⠀practice⠀floor⠀without⠀error.⠀Or⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀single⠀reported⠀action⠀from⠀another⠀person.⠀The⠀later⠀entry⠀does⠀not⠀say⠀'I⠀understood⠀the⠀principle.'⠀It⠀shows⠀the⠀technique⠀now⠀executed.⠀The⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀reader⠀interprets⠀the⠀earlier⠀passage;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀introduce⠀a⠀new⠀fact⠀from⠀nowhere.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀stillness.⠀Often⠀one⠀image⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀advancement.⠀Dialogue⠀in⠀a⠀diary⠀is⠀reported⠀or⠀remembered⠀speech;⠀keep⠀such⠀passages⠀compact⠀and⠀consequential.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀universal⠀quietness,⠀cherry⠀blossoms,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀religion.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀exuberant,⠀angry,⠀mechanical,⠀or⠀tired⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀actual⠀character.⠀The⠀miscellany⠀can⠀include⠀a⠀copied⠀exercise,⠀a⠀bill,⠀a⠀complaint,⠀or⠀an⠀overheard⠀remark.⠀Keep⠀each⠀fragment⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀developing⠀capability.⠀This⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀list⠀of⠀events;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀self-account⠀in⠀which⠀every⠀retained⠀observation⠀is⠀selected⠀by⠀the⠀writer's⠀changing⠀attention⠀and⠀judged⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀now⠀can⠀do.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀chronicle/testimony⠀mode.⠀The⠀narrator⠀observes⠀and⠀records⠀advancement⠀as⠀it⠀changes⠀work,⠀reputation,⠀and⠀social⠀relation.⠀This⠀is⠀not⠀private⠀stream-of-consciousness;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀deliberate⠀account⠀of⠀events,⠀material⠀conditions,⠀and⠀human⠀costs.⠀Use⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀the⠀world⠀supplies.⠀Preserve⠀local⠀names⠀and⠀terms⠀with⠀enough⠀context⠀to⠀keep⠀them⠀intelligible.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀sentences⠀tight⠀and⠀concrete.⠀Name⠀the⠀teacher,⠀the⠀task,⠀the⠀borrowed⠀tool,⠀the⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀the⠀changed⠀schedule.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀improvement;⠀let⠀one⠀feat⠀or⠀one⠀repeated⠀correction⠀carry⠀the⠀evidence.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀report⠀what⠀others⠀said⠀or⠀did,⠀but⠀must⠀distinguish⠀actual⠀observation⠀from⠀remembered⠀report.⠀A⠀rumor,⠀a⠀song,⠀or⠀a⠀ledger⠀entry⠀can⠀be⠀noted,⠀but⠀no⠀supernatural⠀power⠀may⠀be⠀added⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀permits⠀it.\n\nMake⠀progression⠀social⠀and⠀physical.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀can⠀now⠀do:⠀cross⠀a⠀flooded⠀road,⠀fix⠀a⠀motor,⠀hold⠀a⠀line,⠀teach⠀a⠀child,⠀pay⠀a⠀debt.⠀Show⠀what⠀they⠀still⠀cannot⠀do.⠀Advancement⠀comes⠀through⠀repetition,⠀guidance,⠀and⠀changed⠀access.⠀It⠀should⠀be⠀uneven,⠀and⠀gains⠀can⠀be⠀lost⠀or⠀redirected⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀conditions⠀of⠀the⠀setting.⠀The⠀context⠀matters:⠀the⠀same⠀skill⠀in⠀a⠀stable⠀household⠀and⠀a⠀camp⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀cost.\n\nPlant⠀one⠀unexplained⠀image⠀early.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀teacher⠀stopping⠀at⠀a⠀doorway,⠀a⠀share⠀of⠀food⠀left⠀untouched,⠀a⠀mark⠀on⠀a⠀wall,⠀a⠀tool⠀hung⠀out⠀of⠀reach.⠀Record⠀it⠀without⠀comment.⠀Let⠀it⠀stand⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀ordinary⠀record.⠀Do⠀not⠀moralize⠀it⠀or⠀hint⠀at⠀its⠀meaning.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀that⠀image⠀later,⠀when⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀changed⠀capability⠀or⠀understanding⠀makes⠀it⠀legible.⠀The⠀return⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀action:⠀the⠀protagonist⠀now⠀crosses⠀the⠀doorway,⠀eats⠀the⠀food,⠀reads⠀the⠀mark,⠀uses⠀the⠀tool.⠀Or⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀single⠀piece⠀of⠀dialogue⠀from⠀another⠀character.⠀The⠀revelation⠀alters⠀how⠀the⠀reader⠀interprets⠀an⠀earlier⠀passage;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀introduce⠀a⠀new⠀fact⠀from⠀nowhere.\n\nThe⠀narrator⠀may⠀have⠀a⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀account:⠀they⠀may⠀be⠀defending⠀a⠀friend,⠀justifying⠀themselves,⠀or⠀bearing⠀witness.⠀This⠀should⠀shape⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀witness⠀into⠀a⠀liar.⠀The⠀record⠀includes⠀genuine⠀loss,⠀refusal,⠀and⠀contradiction.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀chronicle⠀a⠀nostalgic⠀celebration⠀of⠀resilience.⠀Let⠀the⠀development⠀of⠀skill⠀articulate⠀with⠀the⠀social⠀contradictions⠀of⠀the⠀setting:⠀old⠀masters,⠀broken⠀apprenticeships,⠀informal⠀teaching,⠀and⠀new⠀necessities.⠀This⠀is⠀a⠀path⠀of⠀improvement,⠀told⠀under⠀conditions⠀that⠀make⠀improvement⠀meaningful.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaian::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀each⠀scene⠀cleanly.⠀Give⠀a⠀clear⠀spatial⠀anchor,⠀the⠀actor's⠀immediate⠀goal,⠀and⠀one⠀obstacle.⠀Use⠀short⠀paragraphs⠀to⠀separate⠀movement,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀New⠀names⠀or⠀mechanics⠀should⠀be⠀introduced⠀once⠀and⠀concretely,⠀not⠀through⠀glossaries.\n\nMake⠀progression⠀occur⠀in⠀beat-level⠀feedback.⠀Show⠀the⠀attempt,⠀the⠀miss⠀or⠀partial⠀success,⠀the⠀correction,⠀and⠀the⠀retest.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀single⠀word,⠀a⠀knot⠀untied,⠀a⠀blade⠀held⠀a⠀finger's⠀width⠀differently—these⠀are⠀advancement.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀camera⠀wander⠀into⠀lore⠀during⠀an⠀action⠀beat.⠀When⠀a⠀technique⠀improves,⠀show⠀the⠀difference⠀physically:⠀the⠀guard⠀was⠀an⠀inch⠀wide;⠀now⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀line.\n\nUse⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀gain⠀or⠀loss⠀in⠀the⠀body⠀and⠀attention:⠀sudden⠀ease,⠀delayed⠀pain,⠀pride,⠀confusion,⠀frustration,⠀or⠀cold⠀fear.⠀These⠀reactions⠀may⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny,⠀depending⠀on⠀the⠀character.⠀They⠀should⠀be⠀brief⠀and⠀not⠀replace⠀practical⠀action.⠀Keep⠀private⠀response⠀distinct⠀from⠀spoken⠀comment⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀hides⠀or⠀delays⠀it.\n\nPlant⠀one⠀still⠀moment⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀stand.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀breath,⠀a⠀fingertip⠀tapping⠀the⠀table,⠀a⠀sheathed⠀blade⠀picked⠀up,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀hand⠀pausing⠀over⠀a⠀correction.⠀Record⠀it⠀without⠀comment.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀it⠀or⠀hint⠀at⠀its⠀meaning.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀that⠀moment⠀later,⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀or⠀a⠀subsequent⠀scene.⠀The⠀return⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀action:⠀the⠀protagonist⠀now⠀performs⠀the⠀technique,⠀picks⠀up⠀the⠀blade,⠀completes⠀the⠀correction,⠀understands⠀the⠀pause.⠀Or⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀single⠀piece⠀of⠀dialogue⠀from⠀another⠀character.⠀The⠀payoff⠀alters⠀how⠀the⠀reader⠀interprets⠀the⠀earlier⠀passage;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀introduce⠀a⠀new⠀fact⠀from⠀nowhere.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀stay⠀compact⠀and⠀outcome-oriented.⠀Exchanges⠀should⠀move⠀the⠀lesson⠀or⠀conflict⠀forward.⠀A⠀question⠀can⠀go⠀unanswered;⠀a⠀master⠀can⠀say⠀less⠀than⠀the⠀student⠀needs.⠀Keep⠀the⠀prose⠀fast⠀and⠀legible.⠀Vary⠀paragraph⠀length⠀for⠀rhythm,⠀but⠀maintain⠀a⠀strong⠀visual⠀sequence.⠀A⠀reaction⠀beat⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀balloon⠀into⠀a⠀reflective⠀essay.⠀Comedy⠀and⠀a⠀young⠀cast⠀are⠀not⠀requirements.⠀Any⠀closing⠀hook⠀must⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀scene;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀disaster⠀just⠀to⠀stop⠀the⠀reply.⠀The⠀method⠀is⠀immediate,⠀sensory,⠀and⠀measured⠀by⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀improving⠀movement⠀through⠀material⠀space.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀advancement⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀perceive,⠀hold⠀in⠀attention,⠀or⠀name.⠀When⠀a⠀skill⠀develops,⠀the⠀world⠀itself⠀becomes⠀different⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀way:⠀a⠀sound⠀that⠀was⠀once⠀noise⠀now⠀has⠀a⠀rhythm,⠀a⠀shadow⠀that⠀was⠀once⠀vague⠀now⠀has⠀a⠀shape,⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀was⠀once⠀empty⠀now⠀has⠀a⠀weight.⠀Ground⠀that⠀new⠀perception⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀attempt.⠀A⠀hand⠀learning⠀to⠀cut⠀cleanly⠀through⠀a⠀stalk⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀sentence⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀image⠀to⠀sit⠀before⠀someone⠀asks⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀yet⠀answer.\n\nLet⠀recurring⠀sensory⠀details⠀return⠀with⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀The⠀same⠀river⠀sound,⠀the⠀same⠀thrum⠀of⠀insects,⠀the⠀same⠀taste⠀of⠀dust⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀one⠀attempt⠀and⠀the⠀next,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀experiences⠀growth⠀as⠀a⠀difference⠀in⠀perception⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀narrated⠀improvement⠀score.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀unfold⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀or⠀makes⠀present;⠀a⠀delayed⠀recognition⠀can⠀shift⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀image⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀revelation⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀completed⠀breakthrough.⠀A⠀half-understood⠀sensation⠀is⠀a⠀legitimate⠀progression⠀beat⠀when⠀it⠀makes⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀or⠀observation⠀different.\n\nKeep⠀images⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀associations.⠀Plain⠀sentences⠀can⠀intrude⠀to⠀give⠀the⠀lyric⠀a⠀ground⠀note,⠀and⠀other⠀people⠀need⠀not⠀adopt⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀learns⠀by⠀touch,⠀let⠀the⠀lyric⠀follow⠀the⠀body⠀before⠀it⠀follows⠀the⠀idea.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀attention⠀or⠀attempt⠀has⠀reached⠀its⠀natural⠀pause,⠀not⠀where⠀a⠀thematic⠀statement⠀has⠀been⠀completed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀carry⠀a⠀remembered⠀weight.⠀A⠀new⠀capability⠀often⠀makes⠀something⠀old⠀irrevocable:⠀the⠀grip⠀that⠀could⠀not⠀hold⠀a⠀sword⠀now⠀can,⠀but⠀the⠀hands⠀that⠀first⠀felt⠀useless⠀are⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀hands.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀gains⠀skill,⠀the⠀earlier⠀self⠀remains⠀present⠀as⠀a⠀felt⠀memory,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀summary.⠀The⠀glance⠀backward⠀may⠀be⠀tender,⠀strange,⠀relieved,⠀or⠀tired;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀sorrowful.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀stillness⠀as⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀the⠀past⠀becomes⠀visible.⠀Keep⠀the⠀underlying⠀event⠀plain⠀and⠀declarative,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reflection⠀arrive⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀explanation.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀training⠀ground⠀smells⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀it⠀did⠀years⠀ago,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀teacher's⠀voice⠀still⠀rises⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀word.⠀That⠀recognition⠀sits⠀beside⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀instead⠀of⠀replacing⠀it.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀scene⠀announce⠀impermanence.⠀Ordinary⠀enjoyment,⠀humor,⠀and⠀curiosity⠀survive⠀inside⠀the⠀reflective⠀register.⠀The⠀important⠀operation⠀is⠀the⠀coexistence⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀with⠀what⠀they⠀remember⠀of⠀not⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀do⠀it.⠀A⠀delayed⠀realization⠀may⠀come⠀long⠀after⠀the⠀event,⠀and⠀when⠀it⠀arrives⠀it⠀can⠀change⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀thing⠀without⠀supplying⠀an⠀answer.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀or⠀attention⠀ends,⠀not⠀where⠀a⠀statement⠀about⠀loss⠀has⠀been⠀completed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀account.⠀A⠀later⠀narrator,⠀teacher,⠀companion,⠀or⠀elder⠀tells⠀how⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀came⠀to⠀do⠀a⠀particular⠀thing.⠀The⠀frame⠀establishes⠀that⠀this⠀is⠀a⠀shaped⠀retelling,⠀not⠀the⠀raw⠀event.⠀Within⠀the⠀tale,⠀write⠀the⠀actual⠀learning⠀process⠀with⠀concrete⠀attempts,⠀misreadings,⠀practice,⠀and⠀change.⠀The⠀outer⠀narrator⠀can⠀comment,⠀question,⠀address⠀a⠀listener,⠀or⠀withhold⠀a⠀motive,⠀but⠀the⠀inner⠀account⠀must⠀still⠀show⠀the⠀character's⠀developing⠀capability.\n\nLet⠀the⠀frame's⠀uncertainty⠀work⠀with⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀deliberate⠀gaps.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀interrupt⠀to⠀ask⠀whether⠀the⠀character⠀truly⠀understood⠀a⠀lesson,⠀or⠀to⠀dispute⠀a⠀version⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀deed.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀answer,⠀change⠀the⠀subject,⠀or⠀remain⠀silent.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀does⠀not⠀explain,⠀let⠀the⠀omission⠀create⠀meaning:⠀the⠀gap⠀can⠀mark⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀has⠀forgotten,⠀what⠀the⠀teacher⠀declined⠀to⠀teach,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀themselves⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀at⠀the⠀time.\n\nUse⠀lyric⠀and⠀reflective⠀prose⠀within⠀the⠀telling,⠀not⠀as⠀decoration⠀laid⠀on⠀top⠀of⠀it.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀can⠀open⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀episode.⠀A⠀concrete⠀object—a⠀worn⠀practice⠀blade,⠀a⠀water⠀jar,⠀a⠀marked⠀doorway—can⠀carry⠀the⠀transition⠀from⠀one⠀phase⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀to⠀another.⠀Comparisons⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀narrator's⠀world⠀and⠀knowledge,⠀not⠀from⠀the⠀author's⠀contemporary⠀idiom.⠀Social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism⠀sits⠀beside⠀the⠀tale⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀story⠀a⠀fable:⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀trains⠀still⠀buys⠀bread,⠀argues⠀with⠀a⠀relative,⠀and⠀sleeps⠀badly.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling's⠀conventions⠀consistent⠀within⠀a⠀single⠀tradition—Persian,⠀Arabic,⠀Kurdish,⠀Hebrew,⠀or⠀another—rather⠀than⠀mixing⠀them.⠀The⠀setting,⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀active⠀story.⠀The⠀frame⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀account⠀brought⠀to⠀a⠀close,⠀a⠀listener's⠀challenge,⠀or⠀the⠀narrator⠀refusing⠀to⠀finish,⠀but⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀progression⠀remains⠀real⠀and⠀legible⠀inside⠀the⠀frame.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀training,⠀attempt,⠀and⠀feedback⠀as⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀concrete,⠀understated⠀events.⠀Choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀details⠀that⠀change:⠀the⠀grip⠀steadier⠀by⠀a⠀finger's⠀width,⠀the⠀foot⠀no⠀longer⠀sliding⠀on⠀the⠀turn,⠀the⠀breath⠀lasting⠀through⠀the⠀full⠀movement.⠀Show⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀that⠀a⠀page⠀ago⠀they⠀could⠀not.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀improvement⠀unless⠀the⠀explanation⠀changes⠀the⠀present⠀action.\n\nKeep⠀clauses⠀direct⠀and⠀causal⠀links⠀visible:⠀because⠀the⠀wrist⠀remained⠀loose,⠀the⠀blade⠀went⠀where⠀the⠀eye⠀aimed.⠀A⠀thought⠀can⠀be⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀be⠀clear,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀repeat⠀the⠀action⠀it⠀accompanies.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀cleanly,⠀with⠀each⠀speaker's⠀voice⠀distinct.⠀A⠀terse⠀teacher⠀may⠀use⠀fewer⠀words⠀than⠀a⠀beginner⠀who⠀explains⠀too⠀much;⠀that⠀difference⠀itself⠀can⠀carry⠀learning.\n\nOmission⠀should⠀leave⠀something⠀inferable,⠀not⠀delete⠀causality.⠀A⠀narrator⠀may⠀leave⠀out⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀insight⠀and⠀return⠀later⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀hands⠀already⠀know⠀the⠀form.⠀But⠀the⠀reader⠀must⠀see⠀enough⠀attempts,⠀errors,⠀or⠀quiet⠀repetitions⠀to⠀accept⠀the⠀change.⠀The⠀gap⠀works⠀as⠀a⠀retrospective⠀clue,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀hole⠀in⠀the⠀sequence.\n\nLet⠀a⠀revelation⠀come⠀as⠀a⠀single⠀plain⠀fact⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀went⠀before.⠀It⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀proclaimed.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀say,⠀\"You⠀were⠀never⠀holding⠀your⠀breath⠀to⠀aim.⠀You⠀were⠀holding⠀it⠀to⠀be⠀finished,\"⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀shifts⠀without⠀further⠀commentary.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀or⠀thought⠀has⠀completed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaias::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀developing⠀skill⠀inside⠀ordinary⠀novelistic⠀scenes.⠀A⠀training⠀day⠀is⠀not⠀only⠀repetitions;⠀it⠀includes⠀a⠀conversation⠀about⠀pay,⠀a⠀remembered⠀argument,⠀an⠀awkward⠀meal,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀quiet⠀observation.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀these⠀parts⠀of⠀a⠀day⠀affect⠀one⠀another.⠀The⠀progression⠀happens⠀through⠀practice⠀and⠀feedback,⠀but⠀it⠀also⠀happens⠀through⠀changed⠀intention,⠀new⠀understanding,⠀and⠀a⠀shifting⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀skill⠀is⠀for.\n\nKeep⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀economy⠀inside⠀the⠀flexible⠀movement.⠀A⠀sharp⠀exchange⠀can⠀break⠀a⠀longer⠀descriptive⠀passage.⠀A⠀meaningful⠀silence⠀can⠀sit⠀between⠀two⠀paragraphs⠀without⠀being⠀inflated⠀into⠀a⠀symbolic⠀set⠀piece.⠀A⠀clear⠀sentence⠀can⠀do⠀more⠀work⠀than⠀a⠀long⠀explanation.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀uniformly⠀clipped⠀or⠀uniformly⠀expansive;⠀it⠀follows⠀the⠀needs⠀of⠀the⠀scene.\n\nUse⠀recollection⠀to⠀connect⠀past⠀attempts⠀to⠀present⠀ones,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀past⠀and⠀present⠀experiences⠀distinct.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀think,⠀I⠀used⠀to⠀hit⠀heavy,⠀because⠀I⠀thought⠀strength⠀was⠀the⠀only⠀answer,⠀and⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀where⠀a⠀lighter⠀touch⠀opens⠀the⠀defense.⠀That⠀recognition⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀learning.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀lesson.\n\nLet⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀arrive⠀naturally⠀inside⠀the⠀prose.⠀A⠀detail⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀scene—a⠀teacher's⠀odd⠀phrasing,⠀a⠀mark⠀on⠀a⠀wall,⠀a⠀recurring⠀dream—can⠀be⠀explained⠀without⠀drama⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀suddenly⠀understands⠀it.⠀The⠀explanation⠀may⠀come⠀in⠀a⠀subordinate⠀clause⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀declarative⠀sentence.⠀After⠀it,⠀the⠀story⠀continues.⠀End⠀the⠀reply⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀immediate⠀attention⠀or⠀business⠀ends,⠀not⠀where⠀a⠀thematic⠀statement⠀has⠀been⠀completed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀progression⠀in⠀the⠀particular⠀relationship⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀established.⠀The⠀focal⠀character's⠀attempts,⠀practice,⠀and⠀feedback⠀occur⠀in⠀scenes⠀that⠀also⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship's⠀ordinary⠀texture:⠀a⠀shared⠀room,⠀a⠀repeated⠀private⠀joke,⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀means⠀something⠀only⠀to⠀them,⠀a⠀gesture⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀noticed⠀long⠀before⠀the⠀other.⠀The⠀skill⠀grows⠀through⠀time⠀spent⠀together⠀and⠀apart.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀teacher⠀or⠀rival;⠀they⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀watches,⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀worries,⠀or⠀the⠀one⠀whose⠀absence⠀makes⠀a⠀practice⠀session⠀feel⠀different.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀implication⠀for⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀say.⠀A⠀long⠀look⠀across⠀a⠀training⠀yard⠀can⠀carry⠀more⠀emotional⠀weight⠀than⠀a⠀speech.⠀A⠀quiet⠀return⠀of⠀a⠀borrowed⠀object⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀trust.⠀A⠀question⠀that⠀goes⠀unanswered⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀important⠀as⠀the⠀answer.⠀Do⠀not⠀inflate⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀a⠀declaration;⠀let⠀repetition⠀and⠀private⠀language⠀build⠀the⠀payoff.\n\nGive⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀enough⠀space⠀to⠀develop.⠀If⠀the⠀relationship⠀premise⠀promises⠀rivalry,⠀let⠀the⠀competition⠀change⠀as⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀improves:⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀notice,⠀resent,⠀admire,⠀or⠀adjust.⠀If⠀the⠀premise⠀promises⠀comfort,⠀let⠀one⠀person's⠀new⠀ability⠀change⠀how⠀they⠀can⠀care⠀for,⠀protect,⠀or⠀understand⠀the⠀other—without⠀making⠀the⠀other⠀passive.⠀Consequences⠀fulfill⠀the⠀particular⠀relationship,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀checklist⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.\n\nThe⠀relationship⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀ordinary⠀life⠀after⠀a⠀breakthrough;⠀not⠀every⠀reply⠀needs⠀a⠀climactic⠀emotional⠀revelation.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀immediate⠀attention⠀or⠀business⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀chronicle⠀of⠀deeds⠀and⠀remembered⠀struggle.⠀Open⠀deliberately⠀to⠀mark⠀that⠀this⠀is⠀a⠀retelling:⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀of⠀who⠀the⠀person⠀became,⠀then⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀first⠀attempt,⠀the⠀early⠀failure,⠀the⠀years⠀of⠀practice,⠀the⠀unlikely⠀demonstration.⠀Names,⠀places,⠀and⠀recurring⠀phrases⠀give⠀the⠀account⠀its⠀epic⠀coherence.⠀A⠀place⠀called⠀Three⠀Stones⠀or⠀a⠀designation⠀like⠀\"the⠀one⠀who⠀held⠀the⠀gate\"⠀may⠀enter⠀the⠀telling⠀because⠀the⠀community⠀later⠀remembers⠀it;⠀within⠀the⠀scene,⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀still⠀just⠀someone⠀learning.\n\nKeep⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀stillness⠀inside⠀the⠀epic⠀movement.⠀Short⠀declarative⠀sentences⠀can⠀establish⠀the⠀deed;⠀a⠀gap⠀in⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀mark⠀what⠀the⠀chronicler⠀will⠀not⠀tell.⠀Between⠀the⠀named⠀feats,⠀include⠀the⠀quiet⠀moments:⠀the⠀practice⠀before⠀dawn,⠀the⠀repeated⠀correction,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀rain⠀on⠀the⠀training⠀ground,⠀the⠀tired⠀admission⠀that⠀the⠀body⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀learned.⠀The⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀determines⠀how⠀much⠀of⠀this⠀inner⠀life⠀can⠀appear.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀focal⠀character,⠀the⠀inner⠀moment⠀may⠀be⠀reconstructed⠀from⠀later⠀accounts⠀or⠀left⠀hinted⠀in⠀a⠀gesture.\n\nLet⠀a⠀revelation⠀change⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀event.⠀The⠀chronicler⠀may⠀say,⠀\"No⠀one⠀knew⠀why⠀she⠀refused⠀to⠀draw⠀in⠀the⠀rain,\"⠀and⠀later,⠀\"They⠀learned⠀it⠀later,⠀from⠀a⠀companion's⠀account,⠀and⠀then⠀the⠀story⠀changed.\"⠀That⠀delayed⠀understanding⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀retelling.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀episode⠀a⠀victory.⠀A⠀failed⠀attempt⠀can⠀become⠀the⠀background⠀of⠀a⠀later⠀success,⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀hesitation⠀can⠀be⠀more⠀significant⠀than⠀a⠀public⠀triumph.\n\nUse⠀the⠀saga's⠀public⠀judgments⠀without⠀flattening⠀the⠀character.⠀A⠀community⠀may⠀call⠀someone⠀dependable⠀before⠀that⠀dependability⠀has⠀become⠀reliable;⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀show⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀reputation⠀and⠀private⠀experience.⠀End⠀the⠀reply⠀with⠀the⠀telling⠀brought⠀to⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀after⠀the⠀current⠀deed⠀is⠀done,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀part⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀told.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀a⠀Scandinavian⠀folktale-inflected⠀communal⠀realism⠀in⠀which⠀advancement⠀is⠀tested⠀by⠀seasonal⠀work⠀that⠀the⠀local⠀community⠀can⠀observe.⠀Anchor⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀capability⠀in⠀a⠀recurring⠀practical⠀task⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀season:⠀the⠀wall⠀that⠀must⠀hold⠀before⠀meltwater,⠀the⠀boat⠀caulked⠀before⠀the⠀crossing,⠀the⠀iron⠀quenched⠀in⠀its⠀proper⠀order.⠀The⠀learner⠀attempts⠀the⠀task,⠀fails⠀or⠀partially⠀succeeds⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀the⠀scene⠀makes⠀physically⠀specific,⠀and⠀later⠀performs⠀the⠀same⠀task⠀under⠀conditions⠀close⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀difference⠀is⠀legible.⠀Recognition⠀arrives⠀through⠀another⠀person's⠀brief⠀observance⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀community⠀assigns⠀the⠀work,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀internal⠀status⠀marker.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compact⠀declarative⠀sentences⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀telling.⠀Leave⠀the⠀explanatory⠀middle⠀out⠀where⠀a⠀different⠀scene⠀would⠀fill⠀it:⠀render⠀a⠀master's⠀refusal⠀as⠀She⠀did⠀not⠀look⠀up,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀image—the⠀cup⠀moved⠀to⠀the⠀edge—carry⠀the⠀change.⠀Where⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀established⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀keep⠀dialogue⠀spare⠀and⠀practical,⠀each⠀line⠀doing⠀one⠀piece⠀of⠀work,⠀and⠀recover⠀a⠀prior⠀fact⠀only⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀becomes⠀operative,⠀such⠀as⠀an⠀old⠀instruction⠀now⠀seen⠀to⠀apply⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀task.⠀Let⠀a⠀revelation⠀or⠀action⠀alter⠀the⠀preceding⠀stillness⠀rather⠀than⠀announce⠀itself.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀folktale⠀mode⠀as⠀patterned⠀recurrence⠀and⠀delayed⠀recognition,⠀not⠀a⠀collection⠀of⠀generic⠀rituals.⠀A⠀harmless⠀song⠀learned⠀early⠀may⠀be⠀understood⠀later⠀to⠀name⠀a⠀route⠀back⠀through⠀the⠀pass;⠀a⠀child's⠀counting⠀game⠀may⠀return⠀as⠀the⠀sequence⠀for⠀the⠀quench.⠀Keep⠀the⠀regional⠀context⠀particular⠀through⠀consistent⠀local⠀naming⠀and⠀material⠀practice:⠀if⠀the⠀setting⠀is⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish,⠀use⠀that⠀community's⠀terms⠀for⠀the⠀work,⠀the⠀season,⠀and⠀the⠀test,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀another⠀region's⠀customs.⠀Warm⠀domestic⠀labor⠀and⠀ordinary⠀interaction⠀carry⠀the⠀same⠀narrative⠀weight⠀as⠀frightening⠀trials;⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀and⠀far-north⠀wilderness⠀are⠀not⠀required.⠀Preserve⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀as⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀observe⠀or⠀hear.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀earning,⠀a⠀new⠀understanding⠀through⠀a⠀brief⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀daily⠀tasks,⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀whole⠀progression.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀comparable⠀visible⠀actions⠀across⠀scenes.⠀Establish⠀the⠀test⠀object⠀and⠀conditions⠀in⠀an⠀early⠀action⠀block:⠀the⠀weight⠀lifted⠀only⠀partway,⠀the⠀blade⠀stroke⠀tried⠀and⠀missed⠀once⠀before⠀it⠀lands.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀or⠀movement⠀under⠀conditions⠀close⠀enough⠀to⠀compare,⠀and⠀show⠀the⠀changed⠀capability⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀performs—the⠀weight⠀held⠀at⠀full⠀height,⠀the⠀stroke⠀landing⠀clean⠀on⠀the⠀first⠀attempt.⠀Do⠀not⠀state⠀a⠀level⠀or⠀rank;⠀the⠀visible⠀result⠀is⠀the⠀evidence.\n\nUse⠀scene⠀headings⠀only⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀actually⠀changes,⠀and⠀make⠀each⠀action⠀block⠀carry⠀one⠀visible⠀event⠀with⠀clear⠀orientation:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀object⠀or⠀movement⠀matters,⠀what⠀result⠀occurs.⠀Let⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀economy⠀shape⠀the⠀cuts.⠀A⠀master⠀turns⠀away⠀without⠀explanation,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀implies⠀a⠀private⠀attempt⠀the⠀audience⠀does⠀not⠀see.⠀Use⠀CUT⠀TO⠀or⠀OFFSCREEN⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀withheld⠀interval⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀infer⠀about⠀the⠀attempt⠀or⠀its⠀result.⠀When⠀the⠀changed⠀capability⠀appears,⠀make⠀it⠀a⠀small⠀observable⠀action⠀that⠀reorganizes⠀the⠀prior⠀scene:⠀the⠀same⠀locked⠀shutter⠀now⠀opens⠀from⠀the⠀other⠀side,⠀the⠀same⠀difficult⠀crossing⠀is⠀made⠀without⠀the⠀helper's⠀hand.\n\nWhere⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀established⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀keep⠀dialogue⠀clipped⠀and⠀practical,⠀each⠀line⠀doing⠀one⠀job,⠀and⠀preserve⠀uncertainty⠀through⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀notices⠀or⠀declines⠀to⠀say.⠀A⠀focused⠀reaction⠀can⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀pause⠀or⠀a⠀glance,⠀but⠀an⠀expression⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀certify⠀failure⠀or⠀victory.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes⠀private⠀commentary,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀separated⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀script,⠀not⠀a⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear;⠀use⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀actually⠀needs⠀that⠀form⠀of⠀private⠀address.⠀Let⠀the⠀progression⠀strand⠀develop⠀through⠀preparing,⠀failing⠀once,⠀receiving⠀a⠀short⠀correction,⠀and⠀applying⠀it⠀later.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀close⠀after⠀a⠀demonstrated⠀change,⠀a⠀refusal⠀that⠀now⠀makes⠀sense,⠀or⠀a⠀remaining⠀difficulty,⠀without⠀adding⠀ranks,⠀system⠀screens,⠀or⠀mechanical⠀numbers.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀play⠀so⠀every⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀is⠀actable⠀on⠀the⠀shared⠀stage.⠀Build⠀a⠀training⠀scene⠀from⠀repeated⠀physical⠀business—the⠀same⠀rope,⠀the⠀same⠀bowl,⠀the⠀same⠀position—whose⠀first⠀attempt⠀fails⠀and⠀whose⠀later⠀attempt⠀visibly⠀succeeds⠀under⠀equivalent⠀circumstances.⠀Stage⠀directions⠀record⠀only⠀playable⠀facts:⠀who⠀stands⠀where,⠀what⠀object⠀passes⠀between⠀hands,⠀where⠀a⠀pause⠀occurs,⠀who⠀enters⠀or⠀exits.⠀Use⠀an⠀exit⠀or⠀entrance⠀to⠀compact⠀an⠀irrelevant⠀interval.⠀If⠀a⠀secret⠀practice⠀happens⠀offstage,⠀do⠀not⠀erase⠀it⠀from⠀history;⠀let⠀it⠀return⠀when⠀its⠀consequence⠀enters⠀the⠀stage⠀as⠀a⠀task⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀accomplishes⠀in⠀view⠀of⠀the⠀audience.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀economical⠀speech.⠀Lines⠀are⠀short⠀and⠀pointed,⠀often⠀responding⠀to⠀visible⠀work⠀rather⠀than⠀explaining⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀speaker⠀withholds⠀an⠀obvious⠀fact,⠀stage⠀the⠀withholding:⠀the⠀character⠀looks⠀at⠀the⠀wound,⠀then⠀exits⠀without⠀comment,⠀and⠀the⠀audience⠀sees⠀the⠀gap.⠀A⠀monologue⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀thought⠀or⠀development.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes⠀introspection,⠀preserve⠀it⠀as⠀clearly⠀separated⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀formatted⠀outside⠀the⠀spoken⠀lines,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀another⠀character⠀react⠀to⠀it⠀as⠀heard⠀speech.⠀An⠀aside⠀serves⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀play's⠀convention⠀calls⠀for⠀it.\n\nChoose⠀the⠀practical⠀test⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀social⠀and⠀physical⠀situation—carrying⠀water,⠀rehanging⠀a⠀door,⠀reciting⠀a⠀route⠀in⠀the⠀right⠀order—and⠀let⠀recognition⠀of⠀growth⠀come⠀from⠀another⠀character's⠀brief⠀line⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀how⠀they⠀treat⠀the⠀learner.⠀Keep⠀the⠀progression⠀uneven:⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀coexists⠀with⠀an⠀old⠀difficulty⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt,⠀an⠀interruption,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀refusal⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀next⠀stage⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀entire⠀response⠀through⠀one⠀authorized⠀focal⠀mind,⠀whose⠀private⠀attention⠀and⠀memory⠀carry⠀the⠀progression.⠀The⠀opening⠀takes⠀an⠀immediate⠀sensory⠀detail—pressure⠀in⠀the⠀palm,⠀a⠀wet⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀half-finished⠀knot—and⠀moves⠀associatively⠀from⠀that⠀detail⠀into⠀a⠀previous⠀failed⠀attempt⠀or⠀an⠀instructor's⠀unfinished⠀sentence.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀separate⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀from⠀a⠀memory⠀or⠀anticipation.⠀Place⠀a⠀recurring⠀image—a⠀nail⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀seat,⠀a⠀stone⠀that⠀shifts⠀at⠀the⠀last⠀pull—at⠀the⠀first⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀image⠀during⠀a⠀new⠀attempt⠀so⠀the⠀changed⠀capability⠀is⠀felt⠀in⠀the⠀body⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀named.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀brief⠀declarative⠀movement⠀as⠀a⠀punctual⠀break⠀inside⠀the⠀flow.⠀A⠀short⠀sentence⠀closes⠀an⠀associative⠀drift⠀and⠀changes⠀the⠀preceding⠀feeling:⠀Not⠀yet.⠀Now.⠀The⠀reader⠀receives⠀the⠀consequence⠀of⠀the⠀reflection,⠀not⠀an⠀explanation⠀of⠀it.⠀Dialogue⠀cuts⠀across⠀the⠀flow⠀with⠀little⠀framing,⠀just⠀enough⠀to⠀attribute⠀the⠀other⠀voice.⠀Keep⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀strictly⠀limited:⠀other⠀minds⠀cannot⠀be⠀entered,⠀and⠀their⠀reported⠀words⠀remain⠀external.⠀If⠀a⠀character's⠀actual⠀past⠀is⠀unknown,⠀the⠀narration⠀holds⠀that⠀uncertainty⠀rather⠀than⠀imagining⠀their⠀memory⠀as⠀fact.\n\nMake⠀the⠀progression⠀strand⠀causal⠀and⠀testable⠀despite⠀the⠀associative⠀style.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀by⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀exact⠀practical⠀act:⠀the⠀mind⠀recalls⠀the⠀sequence⠀perfectly,⠀then⠀the⠀hand⠀still⠀falters⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀turn.⠀Later,⠀the⠀body⠀alters⠀the⠀sequence⠀and⠀the⠀task⠀is⠀completed;⠀only⠀then⠀can⠀the⠀character⠀notice⠀what⠀has⠀changed.⠀Uneven⠀development⠀appears⠀simultaneously⠀as⠀one⠀remembered⠀skill⠀returns⠀while⠀another⠀remains⠀slow.⠀Real⠀physical⠀events,⠀interruptions,⠀and⠀other⠀people's⠀actions⠀break⠀into⠀the⠀mental⠀movement⠀and⠀materially⠀alter⠀what⠀happens⠀next.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀stop⠀on⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀private⠀understanding,⠀a⠀remaining⠀difficulty,⠀or⠀a⠀glance⠀at⠀the⠀next⠀unfinished⠀task.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀attributed⠀messages,⠀so⠀each⠀progression⠀beat⠀appears⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀actually⠀send,⠀receive,⠀or⠀observe⠀about⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Establish⠀each⠀sender's⠀voice⠀through⠀their⠀actual⠀message⠀habits:⠀one⠀character⠀writes⠀quickly⠀with⠀few⠀words,⠀another⠀asks⠀precise⠀questions⠀or⠀corrects⠀a⠀term,⠀a⠀third⠀replies⠀only⠀after⠀an⠀action⠀has⠀succeeded.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀growth⠀in⠀narration⠀unavailable⠀to⠀the⠀exchange.⠀If⠀a⠀private⠀attempt⠀matters,⠀make⠀it⠀return⠀as⠀a⠀later⠀message⠀that⠀refers⠀to⠀the⠀result—not⠀as⠀a⠀transmitted⠀thought.⠀Use⠀timestamps,⠀read⠀receipts,⠀typing⠀indicators,⠀edits,⠀or⠀attachments⠀only⠀when⠀their⠀specific⠀occurrence⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀can⠀know.⠀If⠀a⠀sender⠀writes⠀and⠀then⠀deletes⠀a⠀line,⠀show⠀the⠀deletion⠀as⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀receiver⠀respond⠀to⠀what⠀remains⠀or⠀to⠀the⠀visible⠀delay.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compactness⠀by⠀making⠀short⠀messages⠀carry⠀weight.⠀A⠀brief⠀exchange⠀opens⠀the⠀scene,⠀then⠀the⠀intervening⠀trial⠀is⠀skipped;⠀the⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀arrives⠀as⠀a⠀new⠀message⠀that⠀echoes⠀the⠀old⠀one⠀with⠀one⠀decisive⠀difference:⠀From:⠀still⠀can't⠀lift⠀it.⠀To:⠀lifted⠀it⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀the⠀feed.⠀Reference⠀an⠀attachment⠀or⠀shared⠀note⠀only⠀when⠀its⠀content⠀is⠀the⠀actual⠀evidence⠀of⠀changed⠀capability,⠀and⠀quote⠀or⠀summarize⠀that⠀content.⠀A⠀message⠀may⠀withhold⠀ordinary⠀explanation⠀for⠀a⠀practical⠀reason,⠀but⠀the⠀withholding⠀must⠀be⠀plausible:⠀the⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀traveling,⠀working⠀with⠀hands⠀full,⠀or⠀waiting⠀for⠀the⠀result,⠀not⠀every⠀pause⠀means⠀concealment.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀exchanges:⠀discuss⠀the⠀intended⠀task,⠀report⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀with⠀enough⠀precise⠀detail⠀to⠀make⠀later⠀comparison⠀possible,⠀receive⠀concrete⠀feedback,⠀and⠀then⠀demonstrate⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀in⠀terms⠀the⠀earlier⠀message⠀can⠀confront.⠀Keep⠀the⠀world's⠀rules⠀consistent:⠀if⠀a⠀system⠀or⠀capability⠀exists,⠀its⠀function⠀is⠀implied⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀senders⠀do⠀and⠀say,⠀not⠀by⠀a⠀messaging-side⠀status⠀screen⠀or⠀rank⠀quantification.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀that⠀changes⠀a⠀pending⠀plan,⠀a⠀short⠀confirmation⠀after⠀a⠀real⠀attempt,⠀or⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀marked⠀separately⠀when⠀the⠀focal⠀experience⠀needs⠀to⠀remain⠀private.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaiba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀visual-novel⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀short⠀narrative⠀passages,⠀attributed⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀focused⠀focal⠀reactions⠀suited⠀to⠀illustrated⠀panels.⠀Start⠀a⠀scene⠀with⠀one⠀concrete⠀setting⠀cue⠀and⠀a⠀clear⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀characters⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀task:⠀the⠀workbench⠀is⠀pushed⠀against⠀the⠀far⠀wall,⠀two⠀figures⠀beside⠀it.⠀The⠀active⠀viewpoint⠀shows⠀the⠀attempt⠀through⠀the⠀body,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀system⠀label:⠀the⠀person⠀tries⠀the⠀motion,⠀misses⠀the⠀key⠀turn,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀line⠀reveals⠀what⠀changed.⠀Use⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀orient⠀a⠀meaningful⠀change;⠀a⠀face⠀that⠀stills⠀can⠀introduce⠀a⠀pause,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀the⠀failure⠀or⠀the⠀victory⠀by⠀itself.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible⠀with⠀a⠀short⠀labeled⠀transition⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀moves.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀a⠀branch⠀or⠀player⠀decision,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀activate⠀game⠀mechanics⠀or⠀choices.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compact⠀delivery⠀within⠀the⠀panel⠀rhythm:⠀a⠀single⠀line⠀carries⠀a⠀revelation⠀or⠀refusal,⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀beat⠀of⠀focal⠀reaction⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀action.⠀Preserve⠀a⠀previously⠀seen⠀detail—an⠀unlit⠀lamp,⠀a⠀half-hung⠀cloth,⠀a⠀stain⠀on⠀the⠀floor—so⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀can⠀reuse⠀it⠀and⠀make⠀its⠀meaning⠀shift.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀ask⠀one⠀question⠀that⠀appears⠀social⠀but⠀has⠀a⠀practical⠀consequence;⠀the⠀next⠀panel⠀answers⠀through⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀explanation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀uneven⠀development:⠀a⠀skill⠀improves⠀along⠀one⠀axis⠀while⠀another⠀remains⠀visibly⠀awkward⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene.⠀The⠀change⠀is⠀testable⠀because⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀or⠀action⠀returns:⠀the⠀rope⠀that⠀slipped⠀now⠀holds⠀for⠀ten⠀counts,⠀the⠀kick⠀that⠀missed⠀now⠀stops⠀at⠀the⠀right⠀height.\n\nIf⠀private⠀experience⠀is⠀required,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀clearly⠀visible⠀focal⠀narrated⠀thought⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀branch⠀option⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀hears.⠀Another⠀person⠀responds⠀only⠀to⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀actually⠀observe;⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀withheld⠀thought⠀can⠀be⠀represented⠀by⠀a⠀brief⠀narrated⠀omission,⠀but⠀not⠀every⠀omission⠀is⠀a⠀trick.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀on⠀a⠀recognized⠀change,⠀a⠀significant⠀glance,⠀or⠀a⠀quieter⠀earning⠀that⠀alters⠀the⠀next⠀interaction.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaibb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀each⠀installment⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀piece⠀of⠀a⠀longer⠀progression,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀self-contained⠀mini-chapter⠀with⠀a⠀compulsory⠀hook.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀task⠀currently⠀underway⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀present.⠀Recover⠀the⠀prior⠀development⠀chain⠀by⠀briefly⠀recalling⠀the⠀specific⠀earlier⠀attempt⠀or⠀resource⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀needs⠀comparison⠀to⠀it.⠀Use⠀practical,⠀recurring⠀tasks⠀as⠀the⠀test:⠀the⠀same⠀wall,⠀the⠀same⠀weight,⠀the⠀same⠀route,⠀the⠀same⠀instrument.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀tried⠀before⠀and⠀failed,⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀shows⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀without⠀narrating⠀a⠀full⠀progression⠀log.⠀A⠀new⠀installment⠀may⠀start⠀immediately⠀after⠀the⠀previous⠀pause⠀or⠀after⠀a⠀clearly⠀marked⠀gap;⠀time⠀jumps⠀are⠀allowed⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀intervening⠀events⠀are⠀recoverably⠀implied⠀later.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compact⠀sentences⠀to⠀create⠀delayed⠀meaning⠀within⠀the⠀current⠀installment.⠀A⠀short⠀line⠀stops⠀a⠀routine⠀scene:⠀She⠀said,⠀You⠀always⠀put⠀the⠀pin⠀in⠀from⠀the⠀south.⠀That⠀line,⠀learned⠀in⠀this⠀reply,⠀makes⠀a⠀past⠀action⠀read⠀differently;⠀the⠀shift⠀lands⠀without⠀a⠀long⠀explanation.⠀Let⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀notices⠀carry⠀the⠀uncertainty.⠀If⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀yet⠀understand⠀the⠀full⠀implication,⠀the⠀scene⠀presents⠀only⠀the⠀observation;⠀later⠀installments⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀when⠀the⠀understanding⠀exists.⠀Keep⠀real⠀spoken⠀dialogue⠀spare⠀and⠀purposeful,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀gaps⠀with⠀narrator⠀commentary⠀that⠀would⠀have⠀been⠀visible⠀to⠀everyone.⠀Preserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀authorized⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority,⠀clearly⠀attributed,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀unmarked⠀summary⠀inside⠀public⠀narration.\n\nLet⠀progression⠀accumulate⠀through⠀earned⠀developments⠀across⠀replies:⠀a⠀lesson⠀learned⠀in⠀one⠀installment⠀changes⠀behavior⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀without⠀a⠀summary⠀infodump.⠀Show⠀uneven⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene,⠀and⠀let⠀mastery⠀of⠀one⠀element⠀coexist⠀with⠀fumbling⠀at⠀another.⠀A⠀response⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀piece⠀of⠀work,⠀a⠀new⠀understanding,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀refusal.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀rank-up⠀notification,⠀or⠀surprise⠀betrayal⠀to⠀fill⠀the⠀end;⠀the⠀installment's⠀through-line⠀is⠀the⠀developing⠀capability⠀and⠀the⠀relationships⠀and⠀resources⠀that⠀change⠀with⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀each⠀practice⠀session⠀as⠀a⠀measured⠀routine⠀with⠀a⠀definite⠀progression⠀gain.⠀Arrange⠀the⠀same⠀materials,⠀begin⠀from⠀a⠀familiar⠀position,⠀and⠀narrow⠀attention⠀until⠀a⠀specific⠀gesture⠀becomes⠀smooth.⠀Show⠀the⠀gain⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀change⠀in⠀execution:⠀a⠀faster⠀response,⠀a⠀steadier⠀hand,⠀a⠀sequence⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀thought⠀through⠀step⠀by⠀step.⠀Let⠀the⠀gain⠀sit⠀beside⠀what⠀has⠀not⠀changed.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀improve⠀and⠀still⠀carry⠀the⠀same⠀hurt,⠀and⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀can⠀sharpen⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀body⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀unresolved⠀in⠀a⠀relationship.\n\nWhen⠀an⠀emotional⠀beat⠀arises,⠀keep⠀the⠀narration⠀calm⠀and⠀quietly⠀observant.⠀Have⠀the⠀character⠀notice⠀exactly⠀what⠀another⠀person⠀does⠀with⠀a⠀glass,⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀or⠀a⠀doorway,⠀then⠀connect⠀that⠀observed⠀gesture⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀fear,⠀need,⠀or⠀withheld⠀apology.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀feeling⠀as⠀a⠀label.⠀Let⠀conversations⠀shift⠀register:⠀a⠀practical⠀exchange⠀can⠀become⠀a⠀request,⠀an⠀evasion,⠀or⠀an⠀apology⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀continues⠀noticing⠀ordinary⠀details—a⠀ticking⠀clock,⠀a⠀familiar⠀scratch⠀on⠀a⠀table—as⠀pressure⠀builds.\n\nAllow⠀growth⠀and⠀unresolved⠀tension⠀to⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀scene.⠀A⠀newly⠀learned⠀pattern⠀may⠀have⠀been⠀practiced⠀partly⠀to⠀avoid⠀thinking⠀about⠀someone.⠀An⠀increase⠀in⠀capability⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀failure⠀or⠀absence⠀more⠀painful⠀rather⠀than⠀more⠀manageable.⠀If⠀a⠀difficult⠀relationship⠀returns,⠀the⠀strain⠀may⠀worsen⠀before⠀any⠀comfort⠀arrives,⠀and⠀comfort⠀may⠀feel⠀partial⠀or⠀inadequate.⠀Use⠀the⠀progression⠀gain⠀within⠀the⠀emotional⠀difficulty:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀execute⠀the⠀technique⠀correctly⠀and⠀still⠀say⠀the⠀wrong⠀thing,⠀or⠀understand⠀what⠀should⠀be⠀said⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀to⠀say⠀it.⠀End⠀when⠀that⠀intersection⠀has⠀been⠀rendered,⠀not⠀when⠀improvement⠀has⠀solved⠀the⠀problem.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀each⠀response⠀as⠀a⠀participating⠀interval⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀scene.⠀Use⠀clear⠀speaker⠀labels⠀or⠀context-appropriate⠀attribution⠀for⠀every⠀spoken⠀line,⠀and⠀keep⠀paragraphs⠀short⠀enough⠀to⠀be⠀read⠀in⠀a⠀scrolling⠀conversation.⠀Focus⠀the⠀interval⠀on⠀a⠀single⠀practical⠀moment:⠀warming⠀up,⠀repeating⠀a⠀motion,⠀receiving⠀feedback,⠀or⠀feeling⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀timing⠀or⠀force.⠀Describe⠀that⠀moment⠀through⠀observable⠀details—how⠀a⠀hand⠀wraps⠀around⠀a⠀tool,⠀how⠀breath⠀settles⠀after⠀a⠀repetition,⠀which⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀room⠀the⠀character⠀watches—rather⠀than⠀through⠀abstract⠀status⠀reports.\n\nAdvance⠀the⠀progression⠀thread⠀through⠀ordinary⠀practice⠀and⠀conversation.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀attempts⠀something,⠀show⠀what⠀is⠀still⠀clumsy⠀and⠀what⠀has⠀become⠀easier.⠀Let⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀flat⠀remark,⠀a⠀correction,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀demonstration.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀a⠀hidden⠀test;⠀an⠀NPC⠀can⠀offer⠀a⠀simple⠀correction⠀or⠀adjust⠀the⠀character's⠀stance.⠀Improvement⠀becomes⠀visible⠀when⠀a⠀previously⠀failed⠀action⠀now⠀succeeds⠀or⠀a⠀previously⠀slow⠀action⠀becomes⠀quick,⠀not⠀when⠀a⠀number⠀appears.\n\nKeep⠀Murakami's⠀even,⠀observant⠀tone⠀during⠀rapid⠀roleplay:⠀describe⠀the⠀strange⠀or⠀emotionally⠀significant⠀thing⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀calm⠀attention⠀as⠀the⠀ordinary⠀thing.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀pause⠀to⠀notice⠀a⠀window's⠀reflection,⠀a⠀pattern⠀of⠀dust,⠀or⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀mat⠀underfoot,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀pause⠀carry⠀private⠀feeling⠀without⠀breaking⠀the⠀scene's⠀readability.⠀If⠀the⠀moment⠀turns⠀emotionally⠀intense,⠀surface⠀the⠀discomfort⠀through⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀speech⠀rhythm⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀hesitation,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀label⠀like⠀anxiety.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀point⠀from⠀which⠀the⠀collaborative⠀partner⠀can⠀continue⠀speaking,⠀acting,⠀or⠀observing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling⠀route.⠀Let⠀each⠀chapter⠀or⠀section⠀advance⠀the⠀progression⠀thread⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀task:⠀learning⠀a⠀stance,⠀mending⠀equipment,⠀traveling⠀to⠀a⠀teacher,⠀performing⠀a⠀small⠀service,⠀failing⠀an⠀attempt,⠀then⠀trying⠀again⠀with⠀adjusted⠀understanding.⠀Close⠀each⠀episode⠀with⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀that⠀persists⠀into⠀ordinary⠀life—a⠀faster⠀reaction,⠀a⠀steadier⠀hand,⠀a⠀memory⠀that⠀now⠀surfaces⠀during⠀practice—so⠀improvement⠀accumulates⠀without⠀being⠀summarized⠀as⠀a⠀number.\n\nNarrate⠀with⠀the⠀direct,⠀spoken⠀rhythm⠀of⠀vernacular⠀fiction,⠀but⠀let⠀Murakami's⠀quiet⠀attention⠀to⠀detail⠀shape⠀the⠀prose.⠀Use⠀short⠀sentences⠀for⠀action⠀and⠀slightly⠀longer⠀ones⠀for⠀observation.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀practices,⠀describe⠀what⠀the⠀body⠀feels⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀room⠀is⠀like:⠀sweat⠀cooling,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀old⠀wood,⠀a⠀bowl⠀of⠀water⠀placed⠀too⠀far⠀away.⠀Let⠀that⠀close⠀physical⠀attention⠀make⠀the⠀episode⠀feel⠀lived⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀recounted.\n\nPresent⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀record⠀of⠀deeds⠀and⠀consequences.⠀Friends⠀or⠀teachers⠀may⠀comment⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do,⠀but⠀their⠀praise⠀or⠀blame⠀should⠀reflect⠀their⠀own⠀concerns,⠀not⠀operate⠀as⠀an⠀automatic⠀rank.⠀A⠀mistake⠀can⠀have⠀social⠀cost⠀or⠀damage⠀an⠀object;⠀an⠀improvement⠀can⠀change⠀how⠀others⠀treat⠀the⠀character.⠀Keep⠀private⠀feeling⠀partly⠀withheld,⠀surfacing⠀through⠀small⠀associations—a⠀familiar⠀dish,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀an⠀object⠀kept⠀without⠀reason—rather⠀than⠀announced⠀in⠀reflective⠀monologues.⠀End⠀the⠀episode⠀on⠀a⠀threshold:⠀a⠀new⠀instruction⠀received,⠀a⠀room⠀entered,⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀unanswered,⠀with⠀the⠀path⠀to⠀further⠀improvement⠀continuing⠀rather⠀than⠀concluding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀forceful,⠀concrete⠀verbs⠀and⠀short⠀transitions.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀practices,⠀write⠀how⠀the⠀edge⠀dulls,⠀the⠀rope⠀frays,⠀sweat⠀leaks⠀into⠀an⠀old⠀cut,⠀or⠀a⠀joint⠀pops.⠀Prove⠀improvement⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀hands⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀without⠀thought⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀breaks⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Show⠀advancement⠀through⠀material⠀facts:⠀a⠀strike⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀rebound⠀now⠀lands⠀cleanly;⠀a⠀length⠀of⠀cord⠀that⠀once⠀bound⠀poorly⠀holds⠀fast;⠀a⠀distance⠀that⠀took⠀ten⠀steps⠀now⠀takes⠀seven.⠀Do⠀not⠀narrate⠀experience⠀points.\n\nKeep⠀Murakami's⠀calm,⠀level⠀observation⠀within⠀the⠀hard⠀prose.⠀Describe⠀a⠀strange⠀or⠀unsettling⠀moment⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀flat⠀nouns⠀and⠀exact⠀surfaces⠀as⠀a⠀routine⠀practice.⠀If⠀a⠀pattern⠀in⠀the⠀floorboards⠀repeats⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀possible,⠀report⠀it⠀once,⠀through⠀sensory⠀detail,⠀and⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀task.⠀The⠀strangeness⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀climax;⠀it⠀can⠀remain⠀an⠀unexplained⠀threshold⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀slightly⠀without⠀dominating⠀the⠀scene.\n\nMaintain⠀physical⠀stakes⠀rather⠀than⠀emotional⠀amplification.⠀Let⠀a⠀failed⠀technique⠀have⠀a⠀real⠀consequence:⠀a⠀sprain,⠀a⠀chipped⠀tool,⠀a⠀wasted⠀hour,⠀a⠀missed⠀rendezvous.⠀Let⠀a⠀successful⠀technique⠀change⠀the⠀practical⠀situation:⠀a⠀door⠀can⠀be⠀forced,⠀a⠀climb⠀completed,⠀a⠀load⠀carried.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀thinks⠀at⠀length,⠀use⠀the⠀extended⠀reasoning⠀to⠀plan⠀a⠀sequence,⠀calculate⠀material,⠀or⠀remember⠀where⠀a⠀weakness⠀began.⠀Keep⠀any⠀private⠀hurt⠀compact—one⠀remembered⠀image⠀is⠀enough.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀first⠀moment⠀when⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀changes⠀the⠀physical⠀reality,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀emotional⠀situation⠀remains⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nUse⠀a⠀single⠀document⠀form,⠀chosen⠀by⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀training⠀log,⠀a⠀letter⠀to⠀a⠀distant⠀teacher,⠀a⠀field⠀report,⠀or⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀dated⠀notes.⠀Identify⠀each⠀entry's⠀author⠀and⠀time.⠀Let⠀the⠀progression⠀story⠀emerge⠀across⠀several⠀documents:⠀a⠀morning⠀log⠀records⠀the⠀exercise,⠀its⠀repetitions,⠀and⠀what⠀went⠀wrong;⠀a⠀later⠀letter⠀describes⠀the⠀same⠀skill⠀to⠀someone⠀else,⠀necessarily⠀omitting⠀or⠀reshaping⠀details;⠀a⠀still⠀later⠀entry⠀corrects⠀an⠀earlier⠀belief.⠀Show⠀improvement⠀through⠀the⠀changing⠀descriptions—the⠀same⠀action⠀moves⠀from⠀'I⠀could⠀not⠀keep⠀my⠀wrist⠀straight'⠀to⠀'the⠀wrist⠀remembers⠀before⠀I⠀do'—not⠀through⠀abstract⠀numbers.\n\nLet⠀the⠀documents⠀carry⠀Murakami's⠀quiet⠀uncertainty.⠀The⠀writer⠀may⠀record⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object⠀or⠀event⠀that⠀seems⠀connected⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀feeling⠀without⠀explaining⠀the⠀connection.⠀A⠀letter⠀can⠀mention⠀a⠀familiar⠀sound,⠀a⠀pattern⠀of⠀light,⠀or⠀the⠀position⠀of⠀a⠀bowl,⠀and⠀the⠀association⠀remains⠀partly⠀unexplained.⠀The⠀document⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀true,⠀only⠀accurately⠀represent⠀its⠀author's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀purpose.⠀A⠀training⠀log⠀may⠀conceal⠀a⠀failure⠀to⠀save⠀face;⠀a⠀letter⠀may⠀emphasize⠀progress⠀to⠀reassure⠀the⠀recipient;⠀a⠀report⠀may⠀misidentify⠀the⠀reason⠀for⠀a⠀success.\n\nWrite⠀each⠀document's⠀language⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀purpose.⠀A⠀personal⠀log⠀can⠀be⠀fragmentary⠀and⠀shaped⠀by⠀fatigue;⠀a⠀letter⠀can⠀be⠀more⠀formal⠀but⠀still⠀contain⠀the⠀writer's⠀specific⠀phrases;⠀a⠀report⠀can⠀be⠀terse⠀and⠀follow⠀a⠀required⠀order.⠀Let⠀gaps⠀and⠀revisions⠀be⠀meaningful:⠀a⠀torn⠀edge,⠀a⠀crossed-out⠀instruction,⠀or⠀a⠀missing⠀page⠀can⠀suggest⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀understanding.⠀Preserve⠀continuity⠀by⠀allowing⠀later⠀documents⠀to⠀refer⠀back⠀to⠀earlier⠀ones,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀the⠀same⠀attempt⠀seen⠀again⠀weeks⠀later⠀with⠀better⠀knowledge.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀narrator⠀to⠀explain⠀what⠀the⠀documents⠀leave⠀uncertain.⠀The⠀final⠀entry⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀progression⠀alive—a⠀new⠀goal⠀written⠀down,⠀a⠀question⠀posed⠀to⠀a⠀teacher,⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀dated⠀line⠀after⠀a⠀long⠀silence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nTreat⠀training⠀as⠀a⠀gentle,⠀repeated⠀ritual.⠀Describe⠀the⠀small⠀pleasures⠀that⠀make⠀practice⠀tolerable⠀and⠀even⠀good:⠀a⠀cup⠀of⠀tea⠀cooling⠀at⠀the⠀right⠀moment,⠀a⠀chair⠀with⠀a⠀worn⠀familiar⠀arm,⠀a⠀quiet⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀same⠀movement⠀can⠀be⠀tried⠀again.⠀Show⠀improvement⠀through⠀the⠀accumulation⠀of⠀small⠀successes—a⠀knot⠀tied⠀tighter,⠀a⠀step⠀landed⠀without⠀wobbling,⠀a⠀phrase⠀remembered⠀the⠀next⠀morning.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀notice⠀these⠀successes⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀friend⠀would,⠀with⠀quiet⠀approval,⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀score.\n\nWrite⠀warmth⠀through⠀chosen⠀acts⠀of⠀care,⠀not⠀through⠀agreement⠀or⠀emotional⠀declaration.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀bring⠀water,⠀adjust⠀a⠀cushion,⠀leave⠀a⠀window⠀open,⠀or⠀remember⠀how⠀the⠀other⠀takes⠀their⠀tea.⠀Let⠀these⠀actions⠀matter⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀practicing⠀character⠀is⠀frustrated⠀or⠀distant.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀an⠀apology,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀repaired⠀relationship.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀be⠀kind⠀and⠀still⠀keep⠀a⠀private⠀hurt;⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀comfort⠀can⠀come⠀and⠀then⠀the⠀difficulty⠀continues.⠀The⠀comfort⠀is⠀real,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀dissolve⠀the⠀progression's⠀pressure⠀or⠀the⠀character's⠀loneliness.\n\nKeep⠀Murakami's⠀even⠀strangeness⠀as⠀a⠀source⠀of⠀small⠀wonder⠀rather⠀than⠀threat.⠀A⠀cat⠀crosses⠀the⠀practice⠀floor;⠀the⠀light⠀through⠀a⠀high⠀window⠀moves⠀exactly⠀one⠀tile⠀per⠀hour;⠀a⠀radio⠀plays⠀a⠀song⠀nobody⠀recognizes.⠀Let⠀these⠀details⠀make⠀the⠀world⠀feel⠀slightly⠀unreal⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀genre⠀into⠀horror⠀or⠀mystery.⠀Use⠀them⠀to⠀mark⠀the⠀passage⠀of⠀practice⠀time⠀so⠀that⠀growth⠀feels⠀gradual⠀and⠀shared.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀when⠀a⠀specific⠀comfort⠀has⠀been⠀given⠀and⠀received,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀larger⠀problem⠀remains⠀unresolved.⠀The⠀next⠀training⠀session⠀can⠀then⠀begin⠀from⠀a⠀slightly⠀easier⠀place.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nCompose⠀each⠀section⠀as⠀a⠀full⠀chapter⠀movement.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀locating⠀paragraph⠀that⠀places⠀the⠀moment⠀within⠀the⠀character's⠀present⠀life⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀world⠀around⠀the⠀practice:⠀the⠀hour,⠀the⠀custom,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀taught⠀this⠀method,⠀the⠀room's⠀history.⠀Then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀training⠀scene⠀with⠀sustained,⠀connected⠀prose.⠀Describe⠀the⠀attempt⠀in⠀enough⠀physical⠀and⠀temporal⠀detail⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀feel⠀the⠀repeated⠀action⠀becoming⠀easier:⠀the⠀first⠀movement⠀uncertain,⠀the⠀second⠀steadier,⠀the⠀third⠀almost⠀automatic.⠀End⠀the⠀chapter⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀turn—a⠀new⠀understanding,⠀a⠀changed⠀social⠀position,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀threshold—not⠀with⠀a⠀forced⠀cliffhanger.\n\nUse⠀a⠀narrator⠀with⠀controlled⠀distance,⠀in⠀Murakami's⠀calm⠀register.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀observe⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀and⠀occasionally⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀privately⠀thinks,⠀but⠀avoid⠀dramatic⠀exclamation.⠀Give⠀a⠀strange⠀detail⠀the⠀same⠀weight⠀as⠀an⠀ordinary⠀one:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀seems⠀to⠀open⠀before⠀the⠀hand⠀reaches⠀it,⠀a⠀label⠀written⠀in⠀no⠀known⠀script,⠀a⠀reflection⠀that⠀pauses⠀before⠀the⠀person⠀moving⠀away.⠀Let⠀the⠀threshold⠀remain⠀unexplained,⠀and⠀let⠀its⠀meaning⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀even⠀tone⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀hesitation.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀strange⠀event⠀become⠀the⠀engine;⠀the⠀progression⠀thread⠀remains⠀the⠀sustained⠀effort⠀and⠀changed⠀capability.\n\nFrame⠀improvement⠀socially⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀physically.⠀A⠀new⠀skill⠀may⠀change⠀how⠀teachers,⠀peers,⠀or⠀family⠀members⠀treat⠀the⠀character,⠀and⠀the⠀chapter⠀should⠀register⠀that⠀change⠀through⠀conversation,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀custom.⠀But⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀all⠀relationships⠀pivot⠀on⠀the⠀progression.⠀Some⠀remain⠀unchanged,⠀which⠀can⠀be⠀its⠀own⠀quiet⠀burden.⠀The⠀character⠀can⠀improve⠀while⠀still⠀feeling⠀lonely,⠀uncertain,⠀or⠀left⠀behind.⠀Use⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀to⠀connect⠀training⠀scenes⠀to⠀other⠀parts⠀of⠀life⠀and⠀to⠀earlier⠀chapters,⠀so⠀the⠀progression⠀feels⠀like⠀a⠀life⠀accumulating⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀isolated⠀exercises.⠀The⠀chapter⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀a⠀sentence⠀that⠀looks⠀back⠀or⠀forward,⠀leaving⠀the⠀path⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀each⠀outer⠀scene⠀with⠀the⠀listener's⠀present⠀difficulty⠀in⠀acquiring⠀a⠀capability:⠀a⠀movement⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀repeat,⠀a⠀resource⠀the⠀listener⠀cannot⠀yet⠀use,⠀a⠀principle⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀state⠀but⠀cannot⠀execute.⠀Give⠀the⠀telling⠀an⠀immediate⠀occasion⠀by⠀making⠀the⠀teller⠀choose⠀an⠀embedded⠀story⠀in⠀response⠀to⠀that⠀specific⠀difficulty.⠀The⠀teller⠀does⠀not⠀deliver⠀a⠀general⠀lesson;⠀the⠀tale⠀recounts⠀one⠀earlier⠀attempt⠀whose⠀conditions⠀resemble⠀the⠀listener's⠀current⠀problem⠀closely⠀enough⠀to⠀be⠀useful,⠀and⠀whose⠀differences⠀matter⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀its⠀similarities.\n\nInside⠀the⠀embedded⠀story,⠀narrate⠀the⠀attempt⠀as⠀lived⠀practice⠀rather⠀than⠀completed⠀wisdom.⠀Show⠀the⠀learner⠀preparing,⠀trying,⠀receiving⠀concrete⠀feedback,⠀and⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀task⠀under⠀a⠀slightly⠀changed⠀condition.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀understood⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀could⠀perform⠀at⠀each⠀stage:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀explain⠀the⠀technique⠀correctly⠀while⠀the⠀hands⠀still⠀lag,⠀or⠀succeed⠀once⠀in⠀a⠀calm⠀room⠀and⠀fail⠀later⠀under⠀noise,⠀fatigue,⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀expectation.⠀Let⠀the⠀tale⠀end⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀learner's⠀capability⠀changed,⠀not⠀necessarily⠀at⠀a⠀satisfying⠀conclusion.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀frame⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀listener⠀interrupt⠀with⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀exposes⠀a⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀tale⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀situation.⠀The⠀teller⠀answers⠀by⠀adjusting⠀the⠀account,⠀not⠀by⠀stating⠀a⠀rule:⠀the⠀listener⠀learns⠀that⠀the⠀earlier⠀learner⠀practiced⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀grip,⠀a⠀longer⠀interval,⠀or⠀a⠀resource⠀the⠀listener⠀does⠀not⠀yet⠀possess.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀clear⠀by⠀marking⠀each⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀frame⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀action—pouring⠀tea,⠀walking⠀to⠀the⠀practice⠀space,⠀setting⠀down⠀a⠀tool—and⠀by⠀carrying⠀one⠀repeated⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀across⠀the⠀levels⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀track⠀which⠀attempt⠀is⠀being⠀discussed.\n\nUse⠀Murakami's⠀conversational⠀distance⠀in⠀both⠀levels.⠀The⠀teller⠀describes⠀surfaces⠀with⠀calm⠀exactness:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀tool,⠀the⠀light⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀traffic⠀beyond⠀the⠀window.⠀Private⠀concern⠀appears⠀as⠀an⠀association⠀the⠀teller⠀or⠀listener⠀notices⠀without⠀explaining.⠀Strangeness⠀may⠀remain⠀even⠀and⠀unresolved,⠀but⠀the⠀physical⠀facts⠀of⠀each⠀attempt⠀stay⠀stable.⠀Between⠀tales,⠀show⠀the⠀listener⠀practicing:⠀the⠀frame's⠀unhurried⠀routine⠀becomes⠀the⠀site⠀of⠀uneven⠀improvement,⠀with⠀small⠀successes⠀and⠀failures⠀accumulating⠀across⠀the⠀telling.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀where⠀the⠀listener's⠀present⠀attempt⠀stands,⠀not⠀where⠀a⠀lesson⠀is⠀complete.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀social-developmental⠀account⠀of⠀one⠀learner⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀training⠀arrangement:⠀a⠀workshop,⠀a⠀course⠀of⠀instruction,⠀a⠀workplace⠀apprenticeship,⠀or⠀a⠀community⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀standards.⠀Make⠀the⠀narration⠀compare⠀attempts⠀across⠀time.⠀When⠀the⠀learner⠀repeats⠀a⠀task,⠀show⠀what⠀is⠀observably⠀different:⠀the⠀same⠀movement⠀now⠀completed⠀with⠀less⠀hesitation,⠀the⠀same⠀mistake⠀recognized⠀before⠀it⠀causes⠀damage,⠀the⠀same⠀tool⠀handled⠀without⠀the⠀earlier⠀pause.⠀Do⠀not⠀translate⠀these⠀changes⠀into⠀a⠀number;⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀the⠀difference⠀in⠀the⠀described⠀action.\n\nTreat⠀institutional⠀feedback⠀as⠀a⠀concrete⠀event.⠀A⠀teacher⠀does⠀not⠀merely⠀approve⠀or⠀grade;⠀the⠀teacher⠀stops⠀the⠀learner⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀moment,⠀adjusts⠀the⠀learner's⠀hand⠀or⠀posture,⠀demonstrates⠀the⠀correct⠀sequence,⠀or⠀asks⠀the⠀learner⠀to⠀repeat⠀the⠀action⠀while⠀describing⠀what⠀went⠀wrong.⠀Show⠀the⠀learner's⠀response⠀to⠀that⠀correction:⠀immediate⠀improvement,⠀confusion,⠀resistance,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀that⠀only⠀appears⠀days⠀later.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀by⠀giving⠀the⠀learner⠀moments⠀when⠀the⠀explanation⠀is⠀clear⠀and⠀the⠀body⠀still⠀fails,⠀and⠀later⠀moments⠀when⠀the⠀same⠀action⠀succeeds⠀under⠀conditions⠀that⠀previously⠀broke⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Murakami's⠀unhurried⠀practical⠀detail⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀documentary⠀method.⠀Describe⠀the⠀preparation⠀and⠀aftermath⠀of⠀practice:⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀cleaning⠀of⠀equipment,⠀the⠀walk⠀to⠀the⠀place⠀of⠀instruction,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀surface.⠀Let⠀a⠀private⠀association⠀attach⠀to⠀one⠀of⠀these⠀details⠀without⠀explanation.⠀Keep⠀strangeness⠀even⠀and⠀unresolved⠀where⠀it⠀appears,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀it⠀dissolve⠀the⠀factual⠀record⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀did⠀and⠀what⠀happened.\n\nShow⠀the⠀learner's⠀place⠀in⠀a⠀web⠀of⠀obligations⠀and⠀expectations.⠀A⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀may⠀alter⠀how⠀a⠀colleague⠀speaks⠀to⠀the⠀learner,⠀what⠀work⠀the⠀learner⠀is⠀asked⠀to⠀do,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀attempt.⠀Let⠀relationships⠀and⠀recovery⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life:⠀a⠀setback⠀may⠀require⠀ordinary⠀rest,⠀and⠀a⠀friendship⠀may⠀shift⠀because⠀one⠀person's⠀ability⠀has⠀changed.⠀End⠀scenes⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀learner's⠀present⠀capability⠀stands⠀in⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀community,⠀not⠀where⠀a⠀stage⠀is⠀completed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nBuild⠀the⠀progression⠀around⠀access.⠀The⠀learner's⠀attempts⠀require⠀something⠀controlled⠀by⠀an⠀older⠀arrangement:⠀a⠀neglected⠀practice⠀space,⠀a⠀tool⠀kept⠀by⠀a⠀former⠀master,⠀permission⠀to⠀enter⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀old⠀rules⠀still⠀apply,⠀or⠀a⠀resource⠀that⠀changes⠀hands⠀through⠀obligation⠀rather⠀than⠀open⠀purchase.⠀Show⠀the⠀learner⠀negotiating⠀that⠀access⠀in⠀the⠀present.⠀Each⠀practice⠀session⠀then⠀carries⠀a⠀social⠀weight:⠀the⠀learner⠀is⠀not⠀only⠀trying⠀to⠀improve⠀but⠀also⠀testing⠀what⠀the⠀arrangement⠀will⠀allow.\n\nUse⠀Murakami's⠀exact⠀surfaces⠀to⠀render⠀the⠀environment⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀decorative.⠀Describe⠀the⠀flicker⠀of⠀a⠀defective⠀light,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀rain⠀on⠀concrete,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀distant⠀train,⠀and⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀tool⠀or⠀room⠀as⠀facts⠀the⠀learner⠀must⠀work⠀with.⠀When⠀a⠀place⠀feels⠀wrong,⠀let⠀the⠀wrongness⠀remain⠀even⠀and⠀unresolved;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀monster⠀or⠀a⠀revelation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀details⠀stable⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀actually⠀does.\n\nShow⠀the⠀collision⠀of⠀old⠀power⠀and⠀present⠀life⠀in⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀learning.⠀A⠀teacher⠀may⠀genuinely⠀help⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀frightening;⠀a⠀rival⠀may⠀quietly⠀adjust⠀the⠀conditions⠀of⠀practice;⠀a⠀companion⠀may⠀witness⠀a⠀failure⠀without⠀leaving.⠀Let⠀private⠀desire⠀motivate⠀practice⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀relationship⠀into⠀betrayal.⠀When⠀a⠀social⠀mask⠀falls⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀give⠀the⠀reason:⠀fatigue,⠀trust,⠀a⠀long⠀association.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀by⠀showing⠀the⠀learner⠀who⠀can⠀explain⠀a⠀technique⠀but⠀cannot⠀perform⠀it⠀under⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀the⠀arrangement,⠀and⠀later⠀performs⠀it⠀under⠀slightly⠀broader⠀conditions.\n\nLet⠀improvement⠀change⠀the⠀learner's⠀position.⠀A⠀new⠀capability⠀may⠀make⠀the⠀learner⠀useful⠀to⠀the⠀old⠀authority,⠀dangerous⠀to⠀it,⠀or⠀able⠀to⠀refuse⠀a⠀demand⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀unavoidable.⠀Show⠀that⠀change⠀through⠀concrete⠀consequences:⠀a⠀task⠀now⠀done⠀without⠀help,⠀a⠀permission⠀now⠀granted⠀or⠀withdrawn,⠀a⠀companion's⠀manner⠀altered.⠀Keep⠀progression⠀uneven:⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀at⠀different⠀rates,⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀interval⠀of⠀study,⠀waiting,⠀or⠀doubt⠀can⠀occupy⠀real⠀time⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀pursuit⠀to⠀pause⠀or⠀a⠀result⠀to⠀occur.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀learner's⠀present⠀capability⠀stands⠀against⠀the⠀arrangement,⠀not⠀where⠀a⠀stage⠀is⠀completed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀an⠀oral⠀frame-tale:⠀a⠀teacher,⠀elder,⠀companion,⠀or⠀traveling⠀teller⠀recounts⠀how⠀earlier⠀learners⠀acquired⠀a⠀capability,⠀while⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀follows⠀the⠀listener's⠀own⠀practice.⠀Begin⠀each⠀embedded⠀tale⠀from⠀the⠀listener's⠀present⠀failure⠀or⠀plateau.⠀The⠀teller⠀selects⠀a⠀tale⠀whose⠀conditions⠀resemble⠀the⠀listener's⠀difficulty:⠀the⠀same⠀kind⠀of⠀error,⠀a⠀similar⠀resource,⠀a⠀comparable⠀moment⠀when⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀was⠀not⠀enough.⠀Let⠀the⠀tale's⠀differences⠀from⠀the⠀listener's⠀situation⠀remain⠀visible⠀so⠀the⠀lesson⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀simple⠀moral.\n\nInside⠀each⠀tale,⠀narrate⠀the⠀attempt⠀as⠀concrete⠀practice.⠀Show⠀the⠀earlier⠀learner⠀preparing,⠀trying,⠀receiving⠀feedback,⠀and⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀task⠀under⠀a⠀changed⠀condition.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀understood⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀could⠀perform:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀explain⠀the⠀technique⠀correctly⠀while⠀the⠀hands⠀lag,⠀or⠀succeed⠀once⠀in⠀calm⠀conditions⠀and⠀fail⠀later⠀under⠀pressure.⠀End⠀the⠀tale⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀learner's⠀capability⠀changed,⠀not⠀at⠀a⠀wise⠀conclusion.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀frame⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀listener⠀interrupt⠀with⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀exposes⠀a⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀tale⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀situation.⠀The⠀teller⠀answers⠀by⠀adjusting⠀the⠀account⠀rather⠀than⠀stating⠀a⠀rule.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀listener⠀trying⠀the⠀lesson⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀frame.⠀The⠀result⠀may⠀be⠀success,⠀failure,⠀or⠀uneven⠀improvement,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀be⠀rendered⠀as⠀lived⠀practice:⠀the⠀listener⠀repeats⠀the⠀action,⠀notices⠀what⠀has⠀changed,⠀and⠀discovers⠀what⠀still⠀does⠀not⠀work.\n\nUse⠀Murakami's⠀conversational⠀distance⠀in⠀both⠀levels.⠀The⠀teller⠀describes⠀surfaces⠀with⠀calm⠀exactness:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀tool,⠀the⠀light⠀in⠀the⠀practice⠀space,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀step.⠀Private⠀concern⠀appears⠀as⠀an⠀association⠀noticed⠀without⠀explanation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀clearly⠀marked⠀by⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀frame⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀action—setting⠀down⠀a⠀cup,⠀walking⠀to⠀the⠀practice⠀area,⠀beginning⠀the⠀drill—and⠀by⠀carrying⠀one⠀repeated⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀across⠀the⠀levels.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀specific⠀community⠀and⠀language⠀as⠀supplied;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀a⠀particular⠀region,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀compulsory⠀family⠀structure.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀where⠀the⠀listener's⠀present⠀attempt⠀stands,⠀not⠀where⠀a⠀lesson⠀is⠀complete.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀reflective⠀miscellany:⠀a⠀personal⠀narrator⠀records⠀practice⠀sessions,⠀small⠀discoveries,⠀and⠀private⠀uncertainties⠀in⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀recollected⠀entries.⠀Use⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract's⠀first-person⠀or⠀close⠀third-person⠀voice,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀telling⠀personal⠀and⠀quietly⠀observant⠀rather⠀than⠀public⠀or⠀didactic.⠀Each⠀entry⠀should⠀center⠀on⠀one⠀attempt:⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀body⠀or⠀tool,⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀correction,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀task.\n\nMake⠀progression⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀miscellany's⠀accumulation.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀task,⠀compare⠀the⠀earlier⠀attempt⠀with⠀the⠀later⠀one⠀in⠀observable⠀terms:⠀the⠀same⠀movement⠀now⠀possible⠀under⠀distraction,⠀the⠀same⠀mistake⠀recognized⠀earlier,⠀the⠀same⠀resource⠀no⠀longer⠀needed.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀by⠀letting⠀the⠀narrator⠀explain⠀what⠀should⠀happen,⠀then⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀hands,⠀timing,⠀or⠀attention⠀lag⠀behind.⠀Allow⠀improvement⠀to⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀small⠀observed⠀fact⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀numerical⠀rank.⠀If⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀has⠀established⠀systems⠀or⠀ranks,⠀they⠀may⠀support⠀this⠀account,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀mechanics⠀merely⠀to⠀display⠀progress.\n\nUse⠀Murakami's⠀exact⠀surfaces⠀and⠀conversational⠀distance.⠀The⠀narrator⠀describes⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀tool,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀step,⠀the⠀light⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀hour⠀without⠀explaining⠀its⠀private⠀meaning.⠀Let⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object⠀or⠀repeated⠀action⠀attach⠀to⠀private⠀concern⠀through⠀association.⠀If⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀permits⠀fantastic⠀elements,⠀a⠀strange⠀encounter,⠀unexplained⠀sound,⠀or⠀impossible⠀threshold⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀an⠀even,⠀unresolved⠀strangeness⠀within⠀the⠀narrator's⠀routine;⠀keep⠀the⠀physical⠀facts⠀stable⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀what⠀happened⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀cannot⠀explain⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀reflective⠀form⠀create⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀time⠀passing⠀and⠀capability⠀developing⠀through⠀patient,⠀often⠀solitary⠀practice.⠀A⠀section⠀may⠀end⠀before⠀a⠀result;⠀a⠀difficult⠀attempt⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved.⠀Avoid⠀a⠀mandatory⠀inventory⠀of⠀Japanese⠀scenery⠀and⠀avoid⠀universal⠀quietness.⠀Use⠀seasonal⠀attention,⠀omission,⠀or⠀direct⠀feeling⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀teller⠀would;⠀otherwise⠀keep⠀the⠀language⠀plain.⠀The⠀progression⠀is⠀the⠀changing⠀record⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀do,⠀not⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀completed⠀tests⠀or⠀wise⠀endings.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀testimony⠀and⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀fiction:⠀a⠀narrator⠀who⠀has⠀witnessed,⠀or⠀is⠀living⠀alongside,⠀one⠀learner's⠀efforts⠀to⠀become⠀capable⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀community.⠀Use⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract's⠀first-person⠀or⠀testimonial⠀voice,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀learner⠀specific:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀companion,⠀neighbor,⠀relative,⠀or⠀fellow⠀worker,⠀but⠀not⠀an⠀omniscient⠀observer.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀saw,⠀what⠀was⠀reported⠀by⠀others,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀now⠀believes⠀or⠀infers.\n\nMake⠀progression⠀visible⠀through⠀concrete⠀attempts⠀and⠀social⠀consequences.⠀Show⠀the⠀learner⠀practicing⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀place—a⠀room,⠀a⠀yard,⠀a⠀route⠀through⠀town—with⠀Murakami's⠀unhurried⠀attention⠀to⠀surfaces:⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀tool,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀neighbor,⠀the⠀light⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀hour.⠀Let⠀the⠀learner⠀fail⠀unevenly:⠀a⠀technique⠀may⠀work⠀once⠀under⠀calm⠀conditions⠀and⠀fail⠀under⠀pressure;⠀new⠀knowledge⠀may⠀improve⠀decision-making⠀before⠀it⠀improves⠀execution.⠀The⠀narrator⠀should⠀notice⠀a⠀small⠀change⠀that⠀marks⠀real⠀advancement,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀task⠀now⠀done⠀without⠀help⠀or⠀a⠀mistake⠀now⠀caught⠀earlier,⠀without⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀rank⠀display.\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀voice⠀to⠀explore⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀acquiring⠀power.⠀Improvement⠀may⠀strain⠀a⠀friendship,⠀change⠀the⠀learner's⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀community,⠀or⠀require⠀resources⠀obtained⠀with⠀difficulty.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀record⠀the⠀learner's⠀private⠀worry,⠀fatigue,⠀or⠀pleasure,⠀but⠀should⠀not⠀assume⠀perfect⠀insight⠀into⠀everyone.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀reports⠀another⠀person's⠀account,⠀mark⠀it⠀as⠀reported;⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀infers⠀a⠀motive,⠀mark⠀it⠀as⠀inference.⠀Strange⠀events⠀remain⠀even⠀and⠀ambiguous⠀in⠀Murakami's⠀manner:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀an⠀unexplained⠀coincidence⠀or⠀a⠀lingering⠀strangeness⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀scene's⠀physical⠀facts⠀unstable.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀as⠀supplied.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀magical⠀realism,⠀a⠀generic⠀\"Latin⠀American\"⠀voice,⠀code-switching,⠀or⠀an⠀assumed⠀family⠀structure.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀specifies⠀a⠀language⠀or⠀place,⠀preserve⠀its⠀concrete⠀details;⠀otherwise⠀stay⠀general.⠀The⠀testimony⠀should⠀show⠀ordinary⠀ability⠀developing⠀through⠀patient⠀practice,⠀with⠀social⠀pressure⠀and⠀personal⠀cost⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀story.⠀No⠀supernatural⠀fact⠀may⠀be⠀added⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀already⠀permits⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀each⠀scene⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀situation⠀already⠀in⠀motion:⠀the⠀learner⠀is⠀mid-attempt,⠀the⠀teacher⠀has⠀just⠀arrived,⠀or⠀the⠀practice⠀space⠀has⠀just⠀revealed⠀a⠀problem.⠀Use⠀short,⠀confident⠀sentences⠀to⠀establish⠀the⠀immediate⠀physical⠀situation,⠀then⠀keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀where⠀the⠀learner⠀stands,⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀holds,⠀where⠀the⠀teacher⠀or⠀companion⠀is,⠀and⠀what⠀changes⠀when⠀the⠀learner⠀moves.⠀Break⠀paragraphs⠀around⠀distinct⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀move⠀quickly⠀through⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀losing⠀the⠀learning⠀arc.\n\nStage⠀progression⠀through⠀concrete,⠀visually⠀legible⠀attempts.⠀When⠀a⠀new⠀skill⠀is⠀introduced,⠀show⠀the⠀learner⠀trying⠀it,⠀failing⠀or⠀succeeding⠀unevenly,⠀and⠀then⠀returning⠀to⠀it.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀by⠀presenting⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀can⠀explain⠀the⠀technique,⠀then⠀showing⠀the⠀same⠀character's⠀hands,⠀timing,⠀or⠀judgment⠀failing⠀under⠀pressure;⠀later,⠀show⠀the⠀same⠀act⠀completed⠀under⠀slightly⠀broader⠀conditions.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀mark⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀an⠀abstract⠀number.⠀If⠀the⠀world⠀has⠀levels,⠀ranks,⠀or⠀mechanics,⠀present⠀them⠀clearly⠀when⠀first⠀needed,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀them⠀solely⠀to⠀display⠀progress.\n\nGive⠀each⠀private⠀response⠀its⠀own⠀brief⠀paragraph.⠀Use⠀Murakami's⠀conversational⠀distance⠀and⠀even⠀strangeness:⠀a⠀character⠀notices⠀a⠀quality⠀of⠀light,⠀an⠀odd⠀coincidence,⠀or⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀and⠀returns⠀to⠀practice⠀without⠀narrating⠀the⠀full⠀meaning.⠀A⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀or⠀quiet;⠀there⠀is⠀no⠀required⠀wit,⠀comedy,⠀or⠀emotional⠀climax.⠀Keep⠀the⠀setting's⠀details⠀stable⠀even⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀feels⠀that⠀something⠀is⠀strange.\n\nLet⠀the⠀story⠀advance⠀quickly⠀without⠀imposing⠀a⠀closing⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀young⠀cast.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀mid-attempt,⠀with⠀the⠀learner⠀realizing⠀what⠀still⠀needs⠀work,⠀or⠀with⠀a⠀small⠀completed⠀action.⠀The⠀style⠀serves⠀fast⠀readability⠀and⠀clear⠀stage⠀imagery,⠀but⠀the⠀progression⠀remains⠀gradual⠀and⠀earned:⠀relationships,⠀mistakes,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀routine⠀stay⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nTreat⠀every⠀training⠀attempt⠀as⠀an⠀act⠀of⠀attention⠀that⠀occurs⠀at⠀a⠀specific⠀hour⠀and⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀place.⠀Begin⠀the⠀attempt⠀in⠀a⠀direct⠀clause:⠀she⠀set⠀the⠀bowl⠀down;⠀he⠀looped⠀the⠀strap;⠀they⠀spoke⠀the⠀second⠀syllable.⠀Then⠀let⠀syntax⠀follow⠀effort.⠀Short⠀declarative⠀clauses⠀can⠀record⠀the⠀first⠀missed⠀stroke,⠀and⠀a⠀longer⠀sentence⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀body's⠀gradual⠀adjustment.⠀A⠀repeated⠀sound⠀or⠀image,⠀such⠀as⠀the⠀dry⠀scrape⠀of⠀a⠀stone⠀or⠀the⠀two⠀blue⠀lines⠀at⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀the⠀mat,⠀becomes⠀the⠀anchor⠀each⠀new⠀attempt⠀returns⠀to,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀return⠀because⠀the⠀movement⠀has⠀changed,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀merely⠀decorative⠀refrain.\n\nUse⠀comparison⠀only⠀when⠀transformation⠀is⠀real.⠀The⠀first⠀time⠀a⠀pattern⠀feels⠀like⠀an⠀overheard⠀melody,⠀the⠀comparison⠀may⠀stand⠀alone.⠀When⠀it⠀returns⠀after⠀greater⠀mastery,⠀let⠀it⠀change:⠀what⠀was⠀a⠀distant⠀tune⠀can⠀become⠀a⠀rhythm⠀the⠀hands⠀already⠀know,⠀while⠀the⠀remaining⠀difficulty⠀keeps⠀the⠀image⠀uncompleted.⠀Make⠀a⠀distinction⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀executing:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀say⠀the⠀principle⠀calmly⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀the⠀motion,⠀and⠀the⠀failure⠀should⠀be⠀rendered⠀with⠀clear⠀sensory⠀particulars⠀rather⠀than⠀with⠀layered⠀adjectives.\n\nAllow⠀unease⠀to⠀remain⠀ordinary.⠀A⠀strange⠀edge⠀in⠀the⠀practice⠀room,⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀that⠀looks⠀briefly⠀wrong,⠀can⠀be⠀noted⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀register⠀as⠀the⠀number⠀of⠀repetitions.⠀Associations⠀must⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀concern,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀symbol⠀the⠀narrative⠀imposes.⠀Improvement⠀is⠀measured⠀by⠀what⠀can⠀now⠀be⠀accomplished⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult,⠀not⠀by⠀a⠀rising⠀gauge.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀attempt⠀still⠀present,⠀or⠀with⠀the⠀room⠀quiet⠀after⠀it,⠀so⠀the⠀changed⠀capability⠀remains⠀inside⠀the⠀act⠀rather⠀than⠀announced⠀from⠀outside⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nUse⠀a⠀remembered⠀earlier⠀attempt⠀as⠀the⠀doorway⠀into⠀a⠀present⠀training⠀session.⠀Let⠀one⠀familiar⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀from⠀that⠀earlier⠀time⠀return⠀now⠀that⠀the⠀skill⠀has⠀changed:⠀the⠀same⠀room,⠀the⠀same⠀note⠀on⠀the⠀wall,⠀the⠀same⠀person⠀who⠀used⠀to⠀be⠀there.⠀The⠀present⠀attempt⠀should⠀be⠀concrete⠀and⠀unhurried,⠀but⠀it⠀may⠀brush⠀against⠀the⠀past⠀without⠀explaining⠀it.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀still⠀enjoy⠀doing⠀a⠀thing⠀well⠀now,⠀and⠀that⠀enjoyment⠀can⠀exist⠀next⠀to⠀the⠀recognition⠀that⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀first⠀tried⠀it⠀is⠀gone.\n\nLet⠀irreversible⠀change⠀appear⠀in⠀small⠀details.⠀A⠀corrected⠀grip⠀means⠀the⠀old⠀mistake⠀no⠀longer⠀returns;⠀a⠀completed⠀sequence⠀leaves⠀no⠀trace⠀except⠀the⠀body⠀knowing⠀it;⠀a⠀mentor's⠀instruction⠀is⠀now⠀heard⠀as⠀the⠀student's⠀own⠀thought.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀reflect⠀directly,⠀but⠀more⠀often⠀a⠀single⠀detail⠀carries⠀the⠀association:⠀a⠀chip⠀in⠀the⠀table,⠀a⠀phrase⠀written⠀in⠀an⠀old⠀notebook,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀oil.⠀Do⠀not⠀attach⠀a⠀stated⠀lesson⠀about⠀time⠀to⠀every⠀improvement.⠀The⠀reflection⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀character,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀general⠀moral.\n\nDistinguish⠀knowledge⠀from⠀execution⠀across⠀time.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀now⠀know⠀what⠀the⠀principle⠀meant⠀without⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀recover⠀the⠀exact⠀feeling⠀of⠀first⠀learning⠀it.⠀A⠀new⠀capability⠀may⠀make⠀the⠀old⠀difficulty⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀scar⠀or⠀a⠀story⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀present⠀obstacle.⠀Keep⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀uneven:⠀one⠀aspect⠀can⠀improve⠀while⠀another⠀remains⠀clumsy,⠀and⠀the⠀mismatch⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀loss.⠀End⠀by⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀attempt⠀or⠀its⠀immediate⠀aftermath,⠀so⠀the⠀past⠀enters⠀as⠀association⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀completed⠀eulogy.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀framed⠀reflective⠀oral⠀account.⠀A⠀present⠀situation,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀lesson,⠀a⠀household⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀conversation,⠀motivates⠀a⠀teacher⠀or⠀an⠀older⠀practitioner⠀to⠀tell⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀skill⠀was⠀learned,⠀lost,⠀or⠀altered.⠀The⠀frame⠀must⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀story,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀narrator⠀commenting⠀on⠀the⠀recipe.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀in⠀a⠀calm,⠀even⠀register:⠀the⠀frame⠀can⠀be⠀ordinary,⠀and⠀the⠀tale⠀inside⠀may⠀be⠀unfinished⠀or⠀uncertain.\n\nWithin⠀the⠀framed⠀account,⠀show⠀the⠀learning⠀through⠀attempts⠀and⠀feedback.⠀The⠀teller⠀describes⠀the⠀first⠀failed⠀motion,⠀the⠀correction⠀given⠀by⠀another⠀person,⠀a⠀period⠀of⠀repeated⠀practice,⠀and⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀a⠀new⠀principle⠀became⠀usable.⠀Distinguish⠀hearing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it.⠀Include⠀a⠀remembered⠀test,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀difficult⠀patient,⠀a⠀cracked⠀jar,⠀a⠀child⠀who⠀asked⠀a⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀journey⠀that⠀required⠀the⠀skill,⠀and⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀could⠀now⠀do⠀that⠀had⠀been⠀impossible⠀before.\n\nLet⠀the⠀framing⠀scene⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀The⠀younger⠀listener⠀may⠀accept,⠀question,⠀or⠀silently⠀misapply⠀the⠀tale.⠀Their⠀private⠀thought⠀remains⠀their⠀own.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀where⠀the⠀listener⠀attempts⠀something⠀under⠀the⠀teacher's⠀eye,⠀and⠀the⠀skill⠀appears⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀completed⠀inheritance⠀but⠀as⠀a⠀movement⠀still⠀being⠀learned.⠀Use⠀ordinary⠀domestic⠀or⠀urban⠀realism⠀and⠀avoid⠀importing⠀a⠀required⠀antiquity,⠀mysticism,⠀or⠀honor⠀code.⠀A⠀diasporic⠀or⠀modern⠀setting⠀can⠀provide⠀the⠀location⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀the⠀framed⠀telling⠀is⠀actually⠀narrated⠀inside⠀the⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀one⠀exact⠀action⠀for⠀the⠀practice⠀session⠀and⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀details⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀it.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀direct⠀clause⠀describing⠀the⠀attempted⠀motion⠀or⠀object:⠀the⠀first⠀stroke⠀left⠀a⠀white⠀mark;⠀the⠀weight⠀shifted⠀to⠀the⠀back⠀foot;⠀the⠀word⠀came⠀out⠀without⠀the⠀middle⠀vowel.⠀Keep⠀the⠀reporting⠀direct.⠀The⠀prose⠀narrates⠀what⠀occurs,⠀not⠀what⠀it⠀means.\n\nShow⠀progress⠀through⠀inference.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀repeats⠀the⠀attempt⠀and⠀a⠀detail⠀changes,⠀the⠀change⠀should⠀be⠀observable:⠀the⠀mark⠀moved⠀closer⠀to⠀the⠀line;⠀the⠀breath⠀steadied⠀before⠀the⠀third⠀lift;⠀the⠀next⠀syllable⠀came⠀through⠀unchanged.⠀Allow⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀infer⠀improvement⠀from⠀these⠀observable⠀differences.⠀Feedback⠀can⠀be⠀another⠀person's⠀brief⠀correction,⠀a⠀spoken⠀word,⠀or⠀a⠀physical⠀result,⠀stated⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀spare⠀manner.⠀When⠀inward⠀connection⠀matters,⠀include⠀one⠀necessary⠀thought,⠀not⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀interpretation:⠀'It⠀was⠀not⠀the⠀grip.⠀It⠀was⠀the⠀shoulder.'⠀or⠀'The⠀word⠀felt⠀familiar⠀now.'⠀Let⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀carry⠀the⠀rest.\n\nDo⠀not⠀explain⠀how⠀the⠀skill⠀system⠀works⠀unless⠀the⠀present⠀act⠀requires⠀it.⠀If⠀a⠀rank⠀or⠀principle⠀is⠀referenced,⠀give⠀only⠀the⠀concrete⠀fact⠀that⠀affects⠀the⠀session.⠀An⠀uneven⠀group⠀of⠀skills⠀should⠀appear⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀attempts⠀and⠀avoids.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀last⠀observable⠀difference⠀or⠀its⠀immediate⠀consequence,⠀such⠀as⠀the⠀mark⠀settling⠀into⠀place⠀or⠀the⠀character⠀setting⠀the⠀object⠀down.⠀An⠀unresolved⠀strangeness⠀may⠀be⠀reported⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀flatness⠀as⠀the⠀training⠀itself.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀each⠀training⠀session⠀as⠀a⠀continuous⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀tutorial⠀summary.⠀Open⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀situation:⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀already⠀begun⠀the⠀attempt,⠀or⠀arrives⠀to⠀it⠀from⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀message,⠀a⠀conversation,⠀or⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀work.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀to⠀move⠀naturally⠀between⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀A⠀brief⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀previous⠀mistake⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀sensation⠀without⠀a⠀formal⠀flashback.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀progression⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀events.⠀Show⠀the⠀first⠀attempt;⠀include⠀a⠀correction⠀or⠀observed⠀result;⠀show⠀a⠀subsequent⠀attempt⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀change,⠀however⠀small.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀something⠀new,⠀render⠀the⠀understanding⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀thoughts,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀narrator's⠀general⠀statement.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀from⠀doing⠀by⠀having⠀them⠀state⠀a⠀principle⠀correctly,⠀then⠀fail⠀to⠀apply⠀it⠀once,⠀or⠀vice⠀versa.⠀Other⠀characters⠀act⠀on⠀their⠀own⠀concerns;⠀a⠀teacher⠀may⠀offer⠀feedback⠀as⠀a⠀practical⠀instruction⠀or⠀a⠀question.\n\nLet⠀the⠀strangeness⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀familiar⠀world.⠀A⠀small⠀anomaly⠀may⠀be⠀described⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀register⠀as⠀the⠀room's⠀light⠀or⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀traffic,⠀and⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀resolved.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀natural⠀pause,⠀where⠀the⠀present⠀attempt⠀or⠀its⠀immediate⠀aftermath⠀has⠀settled⠀enough⠀to⠀stop⠀without⠀a⠀summary.⠀The⠀enhanced⠀ability⠀is⠀shown⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀do,⠀while⠀the⠀remaining⠀difficulty⠀can⠀be⠀left⠀plainly⠀present.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀training⠀in⠀the⠀specific⠀relationship⠀premise⠀already⠀established⠀for⠀these⠀characters.⠀Select⠀scenes⠀that⠀reveal⠀that⠀relationship⠀through⠀practice:⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀train⠀together,⠀a⠀long-unspoken⠀rivalry,⠀an⠀old⠀comfort,⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀careful⠀distance.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀lovers-to-enemies,⠀fake⠀dating,⠀or⠀other⠀trope⠀rosters.⠀The⠀scene's⠀conflict⠀and⠀its⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀dyad.\n\nUse⠀their⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments.⠀A⠀phrase⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀used⠀in⠀an⠀earlier⠀lesson⠀returns⠀at⠀the⠀next⠀attempt;⠀a⠀gesture⠀from⠀their⠀shared⠀history⠀now⠀helps⠀or⠀interrupts;⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀appears⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning⠀because⠀the⠀skill⠀has⠀developed.⠀Let⠀affection⠀or⠀irritation⠀exist⠀next⠀to⠀the⠀task⠀itself.⠀The⠀character⠀attempting⠀the⠀skill⠀may⠀think⠀of⠀the⠀other's⠀voice,⠀their⠀correction,⠀their⠀silence,⠀or⠀their⠀presence⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀room.⠀This⠀thought⠀must⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀and⠀not⠀leak⠀into⠀the⠀other's⠀knowledge.\n\nShow⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀shared⠀event.⠀One⠀attempt⠀fails⠀and⠀provokes⠀a⠀reaction⠀from⠀the⠀other⠀that⠀matters⠀because⠀of⠀their⠀bond.⠀Then⠀one⠀subsequent⠀attempt⠀succeeds,⠀and⠀the⠀relationship⠀adjusts⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀their⠀particular⠀history⠀has⠀prepared:⠀the⠀pride,⠀distance,⠀instruction,⠀or⠀softened⠀tone⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀dyad⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀generic⠀emotional⠀beat.⠀The⠀changed⠀capability⠀is⠀measured⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀shared⠀event's⠀own⠀consequence,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀again,⠀a⠀silence⠀after⠀practice,⠀or⠀one⠀person⠀watching⠀the⠀other⠀and⠀understanding⠀something⠀previously⠀unnamed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nOpen⠀the⠀account⠀as⠀a⠀chronicle⠀retelling⠀a⠀learning⠀that⠀has⠀already⠀found⠀a⠀place⠀in⠀memory:⠀'This⠀is⠀how⠀she⠀learned⠀the⠀seventh⠀knot,'⠀or⠀'It⠀was⠀in⠀the⠀third⠀month⠀that⠀he⠀first⠀kept⠀the⠀flame.'⠀Then⠀render⠀the⠀actual⠀attempts⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀without⠀an⠀inflated⠀warrior⠀register.⠀Keep⠀the⠀diction⠀calm⠀and⠀practical.⠀The⠀epic⠀quality⠀comes⠀from⠀act,⠀recurrence,⠀and⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered,⠀not⠀from⠀ornamental⠀epithets⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀dialogue.\n\nUse⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀mark⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀capability,⠀then⠀give⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀declaration⠀incomplete.⠀'He⠀could⠀now⠀shape⠀the⠀glass⠀without⠀cracking⠀it'⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀detail⠀about⠀the⠀still-clumsy⠀left⠀hand.⠀'She⠀spoke⠀the⠀invocation⠀through⠀to⠀the⠀end'⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀the⠀teacher⠀who⠀corrected⠀one⠀syllable.⠀Recurring⠀phrasing⠀returns⠀at⠀a⠀later⠀attempt⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀application,⠀but⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀skill⠀has⠀changed.⠀The⠀phrase⠀should⠀not⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀fixed⠀charm⠀at⠀every⠀obstacle.\n\nShow⠀progression⠀through⠀a⠀test⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀community⠀or⠀to⠀the⠀learner's⠀own⠀ongoing⠀obligations.⠀Choose⠀one⠀established⠀obligation⠀whose⠀discharge⠀the⠀new⠀skill⠀makes⠀possible:⠀a⠀task⠀once⠀refused,⠀a⠀debt⠀or⠀promise,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀once⠀helped⠀in⠀a⠀small⠀way⠀who⠀is⠀later⠀helped⠀more⠀fully.⠀Keep⠀the⠀selection⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀and⠀the⠀single⠀source⠀tradition⠀rather⠀than⠀mixing⠀epic⠀conventions.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀give⠀private⠀thought⠀where⠀the⠀perspective⠀permits,⠀so⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀remembered⠀deed⠀remains⠀a⠀person's⠀own⠀effort.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀deed⠀in⠀progress,⠀recently⠀finished,⠀or⠀still⠀awaiting⠀another⠀try,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀forced⠀epic⠀eulogy.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀social-documentary⠀account⠀of⠀one⠀person's⠀training⠀life.⠀The⠀narrator⠀observes⠀and⠀records⠀the⠀practical⠀conditions⠀of⠀improvement⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀careful⠀institutional⠀report⠀would:⠀what⠀was⠀attempted,⠀under⠀what⠀circumstances,⠀with⠀what⠀result,⠀and⠀what⠀changed⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀attempt.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator⠀personally⠀involved⠀rather⠀than⠀clinical.⠀The⠀record⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀life,⠀with⠀meals,⠀errands,⠀fatigue,⠀relationships,⠀and⠀small⠀private⠀concerns⠀continuing⠀around⠀the⠀training.\n\nUse⠀Murakami's⠀unhurried⠀practical⠀attention⠀for⠀the⠀recorded⠀detail.⠀Describe⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀tool,⠀the⠀repeated⠀motion,⠀and⠀the⠀ordinary⠀interruption⠀with⠀even⠀care.⠀Let⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀place⠀become⠀associated⠀with⠀private⠀concern⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀symbolic⠀or⠀supernatural.⠀The⠀strangeness,⠀if⠀any,⠀remains⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀way⠀of⠀noticing,⠀not⠀in⠀the⠀world's⠀rules.\n\nMake⠀progression⠀legible⠀through⠀comparison.⠀When⠀a⠀technique⠀is⠀described⠀in⠀principle,⠀show⠀the⠀later⠀attempt⠀that⠀tests⠀it.⠀When⠀feedback⠀changes⠀a⠀detail,⠀show⠀the⠀next⠀session⠀where⠀that⠀detail⠀is⠀performed⠀differently.⠀When⠀a⠀resource⠀becomes⠀available,⠀show⠀the⠀task⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀difficult⠀and⠀is⠀now⠀manageable.⠀Do⠀not⠀rely⠀on⠀sudden⠀insight⠀or⠀force⠀of⠀will.⠀A⠀strength⠀may⠀improve⠀while⠀a⠀weakness⠀remains,⠀and⠀a⠀poor⠀day⠀may⠀clarify⠀what⠀still⠀needs⠀work.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀documentary⠀form⠀concrete⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀dry⠀ledger.⠀Logs,⠀schedules,⠀observed⠀performance,⠀and⠀comparisons⠀between⠀attempts⠀can⠀appear⠀as⠀the⠀narrator's⠀working⠀record,⠀but⠀they⠀must⠀stay⠀embedded⠀in⠀the⠀ongoing⠀life.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀private⠀thought⠀remain⠀available⠀when⠀it⠀explains⠀a⠀choice,⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀recognition,⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀public⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀A⠀session⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀maintenance⠀rather⠀than⠀improvement,⠀and⠀the⠀account⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀plain⠀statement⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀different.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀in⠀readable⠀scene⠀blocks.⠀Use⠀a⠀scene⠀heading⠀only⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Keep⠀action⠀lines⠀concise⠀and⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen⠀or⠀heard.⠀Show⠀progression⠀through⠀comparable⠀visible⠀action:⠀a⠀movement⠀attempted⠀and⠀failed⠀in⠀one⠀scene,⠀then⠀attempted⠀under⠀changed⠀conditions⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀scene;⠀a⠀task⠀completed⠀with⠀visible⠀effort,⠀then⠀completed⠀with⠀less⠀waste⠀or⠀greater⠀control.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience⠀see⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀possible⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀remains⠀difficult.\n\nUse⠀Murakami's⠀calm⠀practical⠀surface⠀for⠀the⠀routine.⠀Describe⠀the⠀ordinary⠀setting⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀details⠀of⠀practice⠀with⠀even⠀attention.⠀A⠀cat⠀crossing⠀the⠀training⠀room,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀water⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀room,⠀or⠀the⠀precise⠀way⠀a⠀person⠀folds⠀a⠀cloth⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀becoming⠀symbolic.⠀Keep⠀dialogue⠀unhurried⠀and⠀indirect.⠀Characters⠀may⠀speak⠀about⠀food,⠀schedules,⠀weather,⠀or⠀a⠀minor⠀task⠀while⠀the⠀deeper⠀concern⠀remains⠀private.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀is⠀internal—understanding⠀a⠀principle,⠀recognizing⠀a⠀flaw,⠀feeling⠀a⠀limitation—place⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀author⠀note⠀after⠀the⠀relevant⠀action⠀or⠀dialogue.⠀The⠀note⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀focal⠀character⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀audible⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀Use⠀it⠀to⠀distinguish⠀knowing⠀from⠀doing:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀state⠀the⠀correct⠀method⠀in⠀dialogue⠀while⠀the⠀note⠀records⠀that⠀the⠀body⠀will⠀not⠀follow,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀note⠀may⠀record⠀that⠀the⠀movement⠀now⠀begins⠀before⠀the⠀conscious⠀instruction.\n\nProgress⠀should⠀be⠀uneven⠀and⠀earned.⠀Feedback⠀can⠀change⠀one⠀detail⠀and⠀produce⠀a⠀small⠀improvement⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀attempt.⠀A⠀resource⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀difficult⠀task⠀possible,⠀or⠀a⠀break⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀weakness⠀that⠀repetition⠀alone⠀cannot⠀fix.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀physical⠀or⠀conversational⠀unit⠀completes;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀reveal⠀or⠀a⠀training⠀breakthrough⠀at⠀every⠀cut.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀scene.⠀Identify⠀the⠀speaker⠀before⠀each⠀line.⠀Use⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀props,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀physical⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Show⠀progression⠀through⠀comparable⠀stageable⠀business:⠀a⠀student⠀repeats⠀a⠀movement⠀with⠀a⠀tool⠀and⠀fails,⠀then⠀later⠀repeats⠀it⠀after⠀a⠀correction;⠀a⠀container⠀is⠀lifted⠀with⠀struggle,⠀then⠀lifted⠀with⠀less⠀waste;⠀a⠀target⠀is⠀reached⠀after⠀several⠀attempts,⠀then⠀reached⠀more⠀reliably.⠀The⠀audience⠀sees⠀the⠀improvement⠀only⠀through⠀the⠀actor's⠀body⠀and⠀the⠀visible⠀result.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀unhurried⠀and⠀indirect,⠀in⠀Murakami's⠀manner.⠀Characters⠀discuss⠀dinner,⠀a⠀neighbor,⠀the⠀weather,⠀or⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀equipment⠀while⠀the⠀real⠀learning⠀concern⠀remains⠀private.⠀Place⠀that⠀private⠀experience—an⠀understood⠀principle,⠀a⠀recognition⠀of⠀a⠀flaw,⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀past⠀attempt—in⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀note⠀between⠀or⠀after⠀spoken⠀lines.⠀Another⠀character⠀must⠀not⠀react⠀to⠀something⠀contained⠀only⠀in⠀that⠀note.\n\nMake⠀practice⠀and⠀feedback⠀stageable.⠀An⠀instructor's⠀correction⠀can⠀be⠀shown⠀by⠀adjusting⠀the⠀student's⠀physical⠀position;⠀a⠀resource⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀prop⠀that⠀is⠀handled⠀with⠀increasing⠀ease;⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀visible⠀stumble⠀or⠀a⠀dropped⠀object.⠀Progress⠀should⠀be⠀uneven.⠀Allow⠀a⠀correct⠀spoken⠀explanation⠀to⠀fail⠀in⠀execution,⠀and⠀allow⠀a⠀weakness⠀to⠀persist⠀even⠀after⠀one⠀part⠀improves.⠀Do⠀not⠀conclude⠀every⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀public⠀acknowledgment⠀or⠀a⠀training⠀breakthrough.⠀A⠀pause,⠀a⠀silent⠀exit,⠀or⠀a⠀simple⠀factual⠀line⠀can⠀close⠀a⠀unit.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀the⠀associative⠀movement⠀of⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind⠀carry⠀the⠀progression.⠀Follow⠀a⠀practical⠀task⠀through⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀private⠀words,⠀and⠀interruption.⠀Allow⠀the⠀syntax⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀association⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀strictly⠀linear⠀sequence.⠀A⠀movement⠀remembered⠀from⠀childhood⠀may⠀surface⠀while⠀the⠀hand⠀fails;⠀a⠀correction⠀heard⠀days⠀ago⠀may⠀return⠀as⠀an⠀unspoken⠀phrase⠀during⠀a⠀new⠀attempt;⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀a⠀tool⠀may⠀recall⠀a⠀warm⠀kitchen⠀and⠀then⠀loop⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀difficulty⠀of⠀the⠀grip.\n\nTrack⠀the⠀same⠀skill⠀across⠀multiple⠀returns⠀so⠀change⠀becomes⠀legible.⠀When⠀a⠀movement⠀first⠀appears,⠀private⠀words⠀may⠀state⠀the⠀correct⠀method—\"turn⠀from⠀the⠀shoulder,⠀not⠀the⠀wrist\"—while⠀the⠀body⠀still⠀fails⠀to⠀perform⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀same⠀movement⠀surface⠀again⠀later,⠀now⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀felt⠀relation:⠀the⠀counting⠀has⠀dropped⠀away,⠀the⠀warning⠀sensation⠀arrives⠀earlier,⠀or⠀the⠀body⠀begins⠀before⠀the⠀instruction.⠀Show⠀weaknesses⠀unevenly.⠀A⠀skill⠀may⠀improve⠀in⠀the⠀morning⠀and⠀fail⠀after⠀a⠀sleepless⠀night;⠀one⠀part⠀may⠀become⠀reliable⠀while⠀another⠀stays⠀clumsy.\n\nKeep⠀Murakami's⠀unhurried⠀attention⠀in⠀the⠀flow.⠀Detail⠀the⠀small⠀surfaces—the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀kettle,⠀the⠀pattern⠀of⠀dust⠀on⠀a⠀windowsill,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀object—and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀private⠀concern⠀without⠀becoming⠀symbols.⠀Another⠀character's⠀speech⠀appears⠀as⠀heard⠀fragments,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀full⠀conversational⠀transcript.⠀Preserve⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀know⠀when⠀an⠀event⠀is⠀happening,⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀being⠀remembered,⠀and⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀being⠀imagined.⠀Ordinary⠀reasoning⠀alone⠀is⠀not⠀this⠀mode;⠀the⠀progress⠀must⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀felt⠀movement⠀of⠀mind⠀and⠀body.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀main⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀message⠀exchange⠀with⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀senders.⠀Keep⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter.⠀Let⠀progression⠀appear⠀through⠀comparison⠀across⠀the⠀transcript:⠀an⠀early⠀message⠀reports⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀or⠀a⠀method⠀the⠀sender⠀says⠀they⠀understand,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀message⠀reports⠀the⠀same⠀task⠀under⠀changed⠀conditions⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀result.⠀Show⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀possible⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀remains⠀difficult⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀choose⠀to⠀transmit.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀messages⠀in⠀Murakami's⠀calm,⠀indirect⠀voice.⠀People⠀mention⠀meals,⠀laundry,⠀or⠀a⠀cat⠀in⠀the⠀hallway⠀alongside⠀the⠀training.⠀They⠀rarely⠀state⠀the⠀full⠀private⠀meaning⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀say.⠀A⠀sender⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀practical⠀detail⠀plainly⠀while⠀the⠀larger⠀concern⠀stays⠀unspoken.\n\nSeparate⠀three⠀kinds⠀of⠀text.⠀A⠀sent⠀message⠀is⠀visible⠀to⠀all⠀participants⠀in⠀the⠀chat.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀author⠀and⠀must⠀be⠀clearly⠀marked⠀as⠀an⠀unpublished⠀composition,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀message⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀can⠀see.⠀A⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀nonspoken⠀and⠀must⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀note.⠀Use⠀these⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀executing⠀it.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀type⠀\"I⠀understand⠀the⠀method\"⠀and⠀send⠀it,⠀while⠀the⠀note⠀says⠀the⠀body⠀still⠀refuses.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀draft⠀\"I⠀think⠀the⠀problem⠀is⠀the⠀grip\"⠀and⠀never⠀send⠀it,⠀then⠀later⠀receive⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀answers⠀the⠀unsent⠀question.\n\nAllow⠀weaknesses⠀to⠀remain⠀uneven.⠀Ordinary⠀life⠀continues⠀in⠀the⠀exchange;⠀the⠀training⠀never⠀takes⠀over⠀every⠀message.⠀Include⠀required⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀clarifies⠀the⠀scene,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀and⠀formatted.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀a⠀scene-oriented⠀rhythm.⠀Set⠀the⠀location⠀briefly.⠀Use⠀attributed⠀dialogue⠀lines⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀shown⠀in⠀a⠀speech⠀bubble.⠀Keep⠀focal⠀narration⠀and⠀inner⠀response⠀tied⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀notices⠀and⠀feels.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀images,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands.⠀A⠀background⠀detail—an⠀open⠀window,⠀a⠀cracked⠀bowl,⠀a⠀particular⠀shelf—can⠀orient⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀symbol.\n\nLet⠀progression⠀appear⠀through⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀comparable⠀visible⠀attempts.⠀A⠀character⠀tries⠀a⠀movement⠀and⠀fails;⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀shows⠀the⠀same⠀movement⠀after⠀a⠀correction⠀or⠀under⠀changed⠀conditions.⠀A⠀resource⠀is⠀used⠀in⠀one⠀scene⠀and⠀becomes⠀manageable⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀one.⠀A⠀previously⠀difficult⠀task⠀is⠀completed⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀result.⠀Show⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀doing⠀through⠀the⠀focal⠀narration:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀state⠀the⠀correct⠀method⠀in⠀dialogue,⠀but⠀the⠀narration⠀adds⠀that⠀the⠀hand⠀will⠀not⠀follow;⠀later,⠀the⠀narration⠀notes⠀that⠀the⠀movement⠀now⠀begins⠀before⠀the⠀conscious⠀instruction.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀Murakami⠀calm⠀in⠀both⠀narration⠀and⠀talk.⠀Dialogue⠀remains⠀indirect⠀and⠀unworried,⠀with⠀time⠀for⠀food,⠀shopping,⠀weather,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀household⠀task.⠀Use⠀expression⠀cues⠀or⠀background⠀changes⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀have⠀a⠀concrete⠀function.⠀A⠀private⠀realization⠀can⠀remain⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀narration;⠀another⠀character⠀continues⠀talking⠀as⠀if⠀it⠀had⠀not⠀happened.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt⠀or⠀a⠀deliberately⠀quiet⠀moment.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀breakthrough,⠀a⠀menu⠀choice,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀reward.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalajbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀each⠀installment⠀as⠀a⠀continuous⠀prose⠀scene⠀with⠀an⠀easy⠀re-entry.⠀Begin⠀with⠀a⠀small⠀recovery⠀of⠀the⠀current⠀state:⠀the⠀training⠀task⠀underway,⠀the⠀relevant⠀resource⠀or⠀limitation,⠀and⠀the⠀last⠀observed⠀result.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀entire⠀history.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀in⠀Murakami's⠀calm,⠀unhurried⠀manner.⠀Ordinary⠀practical⠀life⠀continues⠀around⠀the⠀training—a⠀meal,⠀a⠀repair,⠀a⠀walk,⠀a⠀conversation⠀about⠀nothing⠀much—so⠀the⠀improvement⠀is⠀embedded⠀in⠀a⠀daily⠀rhythm⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀dramatic⠀montage.\n\nAdvance⠀one⠀legible⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀per⠀installment.⠀A⠀previously⠀failed⠀movement⠀may⠀now⠀succeed⠀after⠀a⠀corrected⠀detail;⠀a⠀technique⠀described⠀earlier⠀may⠀now⠀be⠀executed⠀without⠀conscious⠀counting;⠀a⠀resource⠀that⠀was⠀difficult⠀to⠀use⠀may⠀have⠀become⠀manageable.⠀Show⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀possible⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀possible⠀before,⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀Allow⠀unevenness.⠀A⠀skill⠀can⠀regress⠀after⠀fatigue⠀or⠀distraction;⠀another⠀part⠀may⠀remain⠀stubborn.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀principle⠀known⠀from⠀a⠀principle⠀performed.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀state,⠀\"He⠀understood⠀the⠀method⠀completely,\"⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀failed⠀execution,⠀and⠀only⠀much⠀later⠀note⠀that⠀the⠀body⠀now⠀obeys.\n\nUse⠀recurring⠀objects,⠀places,⠀or⠀routines⠀as⠀anchors.⠀A⠀particular⠀doorway,⠀a⠀worn⠀tool,⠀or⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀radio⠀can⠀return⠀across⠀episodes⠀to⠀show⠀changed⠀capability⠀without⠀overt⠀rankings.⠀Let⠀the⠀installment⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀current⠀action⠀naturally⠀pauses.⠀A⠀completed⠀task,⠀a⠀pending⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀simple⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀different⠀can⠀close⠀the⠀reply.⠀Avoid⠀a⠀forced⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀breakthrough⠀at⠀every⠀end.⠀The⠀serial⠀form⠀should⠀help⠀the⠀reader⠀track⠀slow,⠀real⠀change,⠀not⠀demand⠀that⠀every⠀episode⠀be⠀a⠀miniature⠀chapter.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nBuild⠀each⠀step⠀of⠀growing⠀capability⠀as⠀a⠀socially⠀charged⠀episode.⠀Put⠀the⠀protagonist⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀attempt,⠀instruction,⠀practice,⠀correction,⠀or⠀test;⠀let⠀new⠀understanding⠀change⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀do,⠀while⠀keeping⠀some⠀principles⠀understood⠀before⠀they⠀can⠀be⠀executed⠀under⠀pressure,⠀hurry,⠀fatigue,⠀or⠀observation.⠀Progress⠀should⠀be⠀uneven—reliable⠀alone⠀but⠀exposed⠀before⠀witnesses,⠀fluent⠀in⠀one⠀setting⠀and⠀clumsy⠀in⠀another—and⠀it⠀should⠀be⠀tested⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀by⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀supplies⠀ranks,⠀teachers,⠀guilds,⠀offices,⠀or⠀formal⠀systems,⠀treat⠀them⠀as⠀social⠀facts⠀that⠀shape⠀access,⠀expectation,⠀and⠀obligation;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀numerical⠀mechanics⠀merely⠀to⠀display⠀advancement.⠀Ordinary⠀work,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀relationships⠀continue⠀alongside⠀the⠀training⠀and⠀may⠀interrupt,⠀deepen,⠀or⠀complicate⠀it.\n\nLet⠀courtesy,⠀offers,⠀corrections,⠀patronage,⠀money,⠀family⠀connection,⠀and⠀reputation⠀give⠀each⠀exchange⠀several⠀possible⠀meanings⠀at⠀once.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀praise⠀may⠀be⠀genuine⠀encouragement⠀and⠀a⠀claim⠀to⠀authority;⠀a⠀rival's⠀advice⠀may⠀be⠀useful⠀and⠀humiliating;⠀a⠀family's⠀support⠀may⠀create⠀debt;⠀a⠀refusal⠀may⠀protect⠀dignity⠀or⠀reveal⠀fear.⠀Keep⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀and⠀narrative⠀irony⠀owned⠀by⠀a⠀specific⠀mind—its⠀vocabulary,⠀blind⠀spots,⠀and⠀social⠀reasoning—so⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀private⠀account⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀motives⠀can⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀conversation⠀or⠀circumstance⠀reveals⠀to⠀the⠀reader.⠀Render⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀that⠀accompanies⠀the⠀attempt:⠀attention,⠀self-justification,⠀dread,⠀relief,⠀the⠀impulse⠀to⠀hide.⠀Make⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀exposure⠀shape⠀the⠀actual⠀exchange⠀and⠀what⠀follows.⠀Admitting⠀ignorance,⠀needing⠀instruction,⠀apologizing,⠀withholding⠀a⠀hurt,⠀or⠀returning⠀to⠀a⠀difficult⠀relationship⠀can⠀strain⠀the⠀voice,⠀sharpen⠀a⠀request,⠀delay⠀an⠀apology,⠀or⠀turn⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀progress⠀into⠀a⠀felt⠀debt.⠀Comfort⠀may⠀be⠀partial⠀or⠀awkward,⠀and⠀warmth⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀pain.⠀Use⠀the⠀narrator's⠀particular⠀distance⠀and⠀diction⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.⠀No⠀confession,⠀betrayal,⠀breakdown,⠀or⠀reconciliation⠀is⠀required;⠀an⠀attempt⠀may⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀half-answer,⠀a⠀private⠀reckoning,⠀or⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀next⠀conversation.⠀What⠀the⠀protagonist⠀can⠀do⠀next⠀matters⠀partly⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀to⠀be⠀seen⠀doing⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nBuild⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀around⠀one⠀occasion⠀where⠀capability⠀shows⠀to⠀others⠀—⠀a⠀lesson,⠀a⠀supervised⠀attempt,⠀an⠀errand⠀that⠀requires⠀the⠀skill,⠀a⠀demonstration⠀with⠀onlookers⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀advancement⠀register⠀inside⠀that⠀interval⠀as⠀attempt,⠀correction,⠀and⠀a⠀visible⠀retry,⠀never⠀as⠀an⠀announced⠀rank⠀or⠀numbers⠀invented⠀for⠀the⠀occasion.⠀Because⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀a⠀single⠀stretch⠀of⠀company⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀training⠀montage,⠀make⠀the⠀improvement⠀legible⠀twice⠀over:⠀once⠀in⠀the⠀hands⠀or⠀voice,⠀as⠀a⠀correction⠀takes⠀hold⠀or⠀stubbornly⠀fails⠀to,⠀and⠀once⠀in⠀the⠀company,⠀as⠀someone⠀who⠀has⠀dealt⠀with⠀this⠀character⠀before⠀treats⠀them⠀differently⠀now.⠀Where⠀past⠀progress⠀matters,⠀let⠀it⠀arrive⠀through⠀that⠀changed⠀treatment⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀recap.⠀If⠀the⠀world⠀has⠀established⠀ranks⠀or⠀systems,⠀a⠀change⠀counts⠀socially⠀—⠀who⠀speaks⠀to⠀them⠀differently,⠀who⠀renews⠀an⠀offer,⠀who⠀goes⠀quiet⠀—⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀displayed⠀tally.\n\nOrder⠀each⠀beat⠀so⠀the⠀attempt⠀precedes⠀its⠀interpretation.⠀First⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀accomplishes⠀or⠀fumbles,⠀then⠀what⠀each⠀witness⠀makes⠀of⠀it,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀space⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀meaning.⠀Give⠀the⠀surrounding⠀exchanges⠀several⠀meanings⠀at⠀once:⠀tuition,⠀materials,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀time,⠀a⠀family's⠀expectations,⠀a⠀rival's⠀praise⠀—⠀an⠀offer⠀may⠀be⠀generosity,⠀strategy,⠀patronage,⠀or⠀accounting,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀witness⠀pointedly⠀does⠀not⠀mention⠀may⠀weigh⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀praise.⠀Keep⠀every⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes,⠀so⠀the⠀irony⠀belongs⠀to⠀someone⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀private⠀assessment⠀private⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract:⠀what⠀the⠀performer⠀silently⠀knows⠀about⠀the⠀attempt⠀lives⠀in⠀interiority,⠀while⠀onlookers⠀read⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀performance⠀showed⠀them.⠀A⠀character's⠀belief⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀readiness⠀is⠀evidence⠀about⠀the⠀character;⠀the⠀attempt⠀is⠀evidence⠀about⠀the⠀skill,⠀and⠀the⠀two⠀may⠀agree⠀or⠀diverge⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀supports.\n\nLet⠀the⠀skill⠀develop⠀unevenly⠀across⠀the⠀attempts.⠀A⠀flaw⠀corrected⠀in⠀calm⠀practice⠀can⠀persist⠀under⠀pressure⠀or⠀an⠀audience;⠀one⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀craft⠀may⠀improve⠀while⠀another⠀stays⠀stubborn,⠀and⠀the⠀corrections⠀that⠀take⠀hold⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀the⠀ones⠀the⠀teacher⠀emphasized.⠀Bring⠀feedback⠀from⠀people⠀with⠀stakes⠀—⠀grudging⠀acknowledgment,⠀repeated⠀business,⠀a⠀cooler⠀tone,⠀sudden⠀seriousness⠀—⠀and⠀keep⠀relationships,⠀meals,⠀debts,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life⠀rather⠀than⠀suspended⠀around⠀it.\n\nWrite⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀dialogue⠀unmistakably⠀attributed,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀always⠀knows⠀who⠀corrects,⠀who⠀offers,⠀who⠀withholds.⠀Resolve⠀the⠀submitted⠀material⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract;⠀person,⠀action⠀markers,⠀and⠀control⠀over⠀characters⠀follow⠀their⠀separate⠀settings.⠀Let⠀NPCs⠀continue⠀their⠀practical⠀lives⠀around⠀the⠀practice.⠀Close⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀natural⠀boundary⠀—⠀the⠀next⠀repetition⠀beginning,⠀a⠀visitor⠀waiting,⠀a⠀conversation⠀still⠀open⠀—⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀passed⠀test,⠀a⠀new⠀rank,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀aimed⠀at⠀the⠀player.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀this⠀story⠀along⠀the⠀Chinese⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realist⠀route:⠀a⠀linked,⠀episodic⠀chronicle⠀of⠀a⠀community⠀organized⠀around⠀advancement⠀—⠀aspirants,⠀teachers,⠀patrons,⠀dependents,⠀established⠀names⠀—⠀observed⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀steady⠀attention⠀whether⠀its⠀members⠀are⠀pretentious⠀or⠀sincere.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀social⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀supplied;⠀the⠀method⠀travels,⠀a⠀scholar-official⠀setting⠀does⠀not.⠀Build⠀each⠀episode⠀around⠀a⠀communal⠀occasion⠀where⠀capability⠀and⠀standing⠀are⠀both⠀at⠀stake⠀—⠀a⠀grading,⠀a⠀demonstration,⠀a⠀shared⠀work⠀detail,⠀a⠀visit⠀of⠀congratulation⠀or⠀condolence⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀gathering⠀establish⠀its⠀watchers⠀and⠀stakes⠀before⠀the⠀test⠀begins,⠀so⠀the⠀exchanges⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀reading⠀before⠀anyone⠀names⠀it⠀aloud.⠀Even⠀as⠀the⠀chronicle⠀roves⠀across⠀households,⠀keep⠀a⠀recurring⠀learner⠀at⠀its⠀center,⠀so⠀that⠀growing⠀capability,⠀not⠀rank-chasing⠀alone,⠀forms⠀the⠀thread⠀the⠀episodes⠀link⠀along.\n\nRender⠀each⠀gain⠀twice.⠀First⠀as⠀accomplishment:⠀a⠀task⠀the⠀student⠀can⠀now⠀complete⠀that⠀defeated⠀them⠀an⠀episode⠀ago,⠀shown⠀through⠀an⠀attempt,⠀a⠀correction⠀absorbed⠀or⠀ignored,⠀a⠀failure⠀that⠀names⠀what⠀remains⠀hard.⠀Then⠀as⠀social⠀fact:⠀who⠀must⠀now⠀greet⠀them⠀first,⠀what⠀offers⠀and⠀omissions⠀follow,⠀which⠀debts⠀and⠀expectations⠀move.⠀Treat⠀the⠀world's⠀established⠀ranks⠀as⠀categories⠀its⠀people⠀care⠀about⠀—⠀titles⠀a⠀family⠀quotes⠀at⠀dinner⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀numbers⠀invented⠀for⠀display,⠀and⠀keep⠀two⠀ledgers⠀visible⠀to⠀the⠀reader:⠀what⠀the⠀student⠀can⠀actually⠀do,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀believes⠀they⠀can⠀do.⠀Estimation⠀may⠀lag⠀behind⠀skill⠀or⠀run⠀ahead⠀of⠀it;⠀the⠀irony⠀of⠀an⠀episode⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀partial⠀reconciling⠀of⠀the⠀two⠀while⠀its⠀characters⠀misread⠀one⠀or⠀the⠀other.\n\nLet⠀instruction⠀come⠀from⠀interested⠀parties.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀withheld⠀praise,⠀a⠀patron's⠀generosity⠀with⠀visible⠀terms,⠀a⠀kinsman's⠀reminder⠀of⠀who⠀paid⠀for⠀this⠀term,⠀a⠀rival's⠀perfectly⠀accurate⠀compliment:⠀courtesy,⠀offers,⠀omissions,⠀money,⠀family,⠀and⠀reputation⠀let⠀one⠀small⠀exchange⠀carry⠀several⠀meanings⠀at⠀once,⠀and⠀those⠀meanings⠀should⠀stay⠀plural⠀rather⠀than⠀settle⠀early.⠀Where⠀a⠀student⠀recites⠀a⠀principle⠀faultlessly⠀at⠀the⠀table⠀yet⠀loses⠀it⠀under⠀the⠀master's⠀eye,⠀that⠀gap⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀executing⠀is⠀where⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀lives.⠀Give⠀each⠀judgment⠀a⠀clear⠀owner⠀—⠀a⠀named⠀consciousness⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀whose⠀self-regard⠀the⠀prose⠀briefly⠀inhabits,⠀or⠀the⠀chronicler's⠀measured⠀commentary⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀observe⠀rather⠀than⠀sneer.⠀Keep⠀private⠀experience⠀on⠀the⠀page⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract:⠀the⠀doubt⠀beneath⠀a⠀composed⠀face,⠀the⠀felt⠀difference⠀of⠀a⠀newly⠀reliable⠀movement,⠀the⠀sting⠀of⠀an⠀omission⠀no⠀one⠀else⠀registers.\n\nLet⠀abilities⠀develop⠀unevenly,⠀so⠀a⠀strength⠀earns⠀opportunities⠀that⠀quietly⠀shelter⠀a⠀weakness.⠀Bridge⠀episodes⠀quickly⠀over⠀months⠀of⠀practice,⠀meals,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀household⠀work,⠀provided⠀each⠀return⠀measures⠀change:⠀a⠀recurring⠀exercise,⠀room,⠀or⠀habitual⠀phrase⠀met⠀again⠀with⠀its⠀meaning⠀altered⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀student⠀can⠀now⠀do.⠀Aim⠀the⠀satire⠀at⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀rewards⠀and⠀at⠀comfortable⠀self-deception⠀rather⠀than⠀at⠀any⠀figure⠀for⠀being⠀humble⠀or⠀ambitious;⠀sincere⠀help,⠀honest⠀praise,⠀and⠀unremarkable⠀kindness⠀remain⠀fully⠀available.⠀An⠀episode⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀changed⠀greeting,⠀an⠀absorbed⠀correction,⠀or⠀an⠀unanswered⠀offer⠀—⠀advancement⠀reorders⠀relationships⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀betrayal,⠀a⠀humiliation,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀triumph⠀to⠀end⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nBuild⠀the⠀spine⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀intention⠀and⠀execution.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀know⠀the⠀correct⠀principle—the⠀right⠀grip,⠀the⠀proper⠀address,⠀the⠀argument⠀that⠀should⠀win—while⠀hands,⠀voice,⠀timing,⠀or⠀nerve⠀still⠀miss⠀it.⠀Show⠀practice⠀as⠀repeated⠀attempts⠀under⠀specific⠀conditions:⠀a⠀task⠀done⠀cleanly⠀in⠀rehearsal⠀that⠀fails⠀before⠀a⠀witness;⠀a⠀correction⠀offered⠀as⠀a⠀favor,⠀insult,⠀debt,⠀or⠀claim;⠀a⠀technique⠀that⠀works⠀only⠀after⠀food,⠀rest,⠀a⠀tool⠀repair,⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀labor.⠀Distinguish⠀understanding⠀from⠀execution.⠀When⠀capability⠀changes,⠀make⠀the⠀change⠀visible⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀accomplishment⠀and⠀in⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀attention⠀to⠀make⠀advancement⠀a⠀matter⠀of⠀manners,⠀money,⠀family,⠀reputation,⠀and⠀exchange.⠀Access⠀to⠀training,⠀tools,⠀patrons,⠀and⠀recovery⠀depends⠀on⠀standing,⠀obligation,⠀and⠀cash.⠀A⠀rank,⠀guild⠀standing,⠀certificate,⠀introduction,⠀or⠀patron's⠀word⠀can⠀open⠀access,⠀but⠀it⠀never⠀substitutes⠀for⠀demonstrated⠀ability;⠀people⠀argue⠀over⠀such⠀credentials,⠀buy⠀them,⠀forge⠀them,⠀inherit⠀them,⠀or⠀fail⠀under⠀them.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀already⠀has⠀ranks⠀or⠀grades,⠀let⠀them⠀matter⠀as⠀public⠀credentials⠀and⠀barriers;⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀fresh⠀numbers⠀merely⠀to⠀show⠀a⠀bar⠀filling.⠀Let⠀instruction⠀arrive⠀through⠀courtesy,⠀omission,⠀flattery,⠀or⠀obligation.⠀A⠀polite⠀comment⠀may⠀assess,⠀dismiss,⠀flatter,⠀or⠀bargain;⠀a⠀refusal⠀may⠀protect⠀reputation⠀or⠀hide⠀inability.⠀A⠀favor⠀can⠀open⠀one⠀door⠀and⠀close⠀another.⠀An⠀instructor's⠀approval⠀may⠀also⠀be⠀a⠀claim;⠀a⠀rival's⠀advice⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀offer.⠀Track⠀who⠀vouches,⠀who⠀owes,⠀who⠀can⠀afford⠀to⠀wait,⠀and⠀whose⠀name⠀would⠀survive⠀a⠀failure.⠀Let⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀misread⠀their⠀own⠀progress,⠀and⠀let⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀show⠀the⠀account⠀they⠀make⠀of⠀themselves⠀beside⠀what⠀their⠀conduct,⠀tools,⠀debts,⠀and⠀other⠀people's⠀arrangements⠀actually⠀reveal.⠀Keep⠀irony⠀owned—by⠀narrator,⠀focal⠀character,⠀or⠀both⠀in⠀turn—so⠀it⠀judges⠀a⠀specific⠀self-assessment⠀or⠀social⠀performance,⠀not⠀the⠀whole⠀cast⠀from⠀nowhere.\n\nWrite⠀hard⠀and⠀concrete.⠀Prefer⠀forceful⠀verbs,⠀plain⠀nouns,⠀abrupt⠀transitions.⠀Shorten⠀syntax⠀under⠀strain;⠀permit⠀a⠀longer⠀sentence⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀reason⠀through⠀a⠀social⠀risk,⠀a⠀technical⠀correction,⠀or⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀a⠀choice.⠀Carry⠀history⠀in⠀material⠀wear:⠀a⠀repaired⠀strap,⠀a⠀callus,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀stained⠀cuff,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀blade,⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀smells⠀of⠀work.⠀Practical⠀stakes—fatigue,⠀hunger,⠀cold,⠀noise,⠀a⠀missed⠀payment,⠀a⠀damaged⠀tool,⠀injury—should⠀shape⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀attempted⠀next.⠀If⠀a⠀voice⠀is⠀rough,⠀clipped,⠀mannered,⠀or⠀evasive,⠀ground⠀it⠀in⠀that⠀speaker's⠀work,⠀rank,⠀and⠀habits;⠀do⠀not⠀polish⠀everyone⠀into⠀the⠀same⠀wit.⠀Grit⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀gratuitous⠀gore⠀or⠀universal⠀treachery.\n\nKeep⠀ordinary⠀work,⠀family⠀duty,⠀friendship,⠀and⠀recovery⠀inside⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀A⠀practice⠀scene⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀summons,⠀a⠀sick⠀relative,⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀promise⠀already⠀made.⠀Let⠀improvement,⠀plateau,⠀regression,⠀or⠀a⠀strength⠀becoming⠀a⠀liability⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀story's⠀own⠀conditions⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀preset⠀arc.⠀A⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀at⠀whatever⠀boundary⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀has⠀reached—mid-speech,⠀mid-action,⠀mid-thought,⠀mid-composition,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup—without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀test,⠀rank,⠀lesson,⠀or⠀decision.⠀Keep⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀actual⠀in⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀private⠀life:⠀sensory⠀attention,⠀calculation,⠀shame,⠀want,⠀doubt,⠀and⠀the⠀reasoning⠀that⠀connects⠀an⠀event⠀to⠀a⠀choice.⠀Use⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀only⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀display⠀convention⠀when⠀private⠀experience⠀must⠀be⠀wrapped;⠀visible⠀private⠀experience⠀belongs⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀give⠀other⠀characters⠀access⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀has⠀not⠀revealed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nBuild⠀the⠀story⠀from⠀documents⠀whose⠀writers⠀are⠀managing⠀a⠀developing⠀capability:⠀practice⠀journals,⠀letters⠀to⠀teachers⠀or⠀patrons,⠀family⠀correspondence,⠀instructors'⠀reports⠀on⠀corrected⠀exercises,⠀material⠀ledgers,⠀guild⠀or⠀examination⠀notices,⠀notes⠀exchanged⠀between⠀peers.⠀Give⠀each⠀document⠀a⠀definite⠀writer,⠀a⠀recipient⠀or⠀declared⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀date⠀or⠀clear⠀moment⠀of⠀composition.⠀What⠀it⠀includes,⠀softens,⠀misremembers,⠀or⠀leaves⠀out⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀that⠀writer's⠀social⠀position⠀and⠀immediate⠀need—what⠀they⠀owe,⠀hope⠀to⠀be⠀thought,⠀or⠀cannot⠀afford⠀to⠀admit.\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀appear⠀through⠀changing⠀performance:⠀a⠀technique⠀attempted,⠀a⠀mistake⠀repeated,⠀a⠀correction⠀understood,⠀a⠀resource⠀acquired,⠀a⠀task⠀completed⠀under⠀different⠀conditions.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀principle⠀that⠀a⠀writer⠀can⠀state⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀writer's⠀ability⠀to⠀execute⠀it;⠀a⠀letter⠀may⠀explain⠀the⠀correct⠀method⠀while⠀the⠀accompanying⠀practice⠀log⠀shows⠀fatigue,⠀distraction,⠀or⠀an⠀old⠀habit⠀returning.⠀Develop⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀unevenly.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀has⠀ranks,⠀guild⠀grades,⠀examinations,⠀or⠀formal⠀mastery,⠀let⠀them⠀yield⠀concrete⠀evidence—what⠀task⠀is⠀performed,⠀under⠀what⠀conditions,⠀with⠀what⠀help—rather⠀than⠀numerical⠀display.⠀Keep⠀ordinary⠀work,⠀recovery,⠀money,⠀and⠀relationships⠀inside⠀the⠀same⠀sequence:⠀a⠀stipend⠀that⠀buys⠀another⠀month's⠀practice,⠀a⠀sibling's⠀errand,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀patience,⠀or⠀a⠀rival's⠀refusal⠀can⠀alter⠀what⠀advancement⠀is⠀possible.\n\nMake⠀social⠀interpretation⠀part⠀of⠀access⠀to⠀advancement.⠀Courtesy,⠀offers,⠀omissions,⠀family⠀connection,⠀reputation,⠀and⠀material⠀dependence⠀can⠀give⠀a⠀small⠀exchange⠀several⠀meanings.⠀A⠀request⠀for⠀instruction⠀may⠀also⠀be⠀a⠀plea⠀for⠀notice;⠀a⠀congratulatory⠀letter⠀may⠀be⠀sincere⠀and⠀still⠀selective;⠀a⠀formal⠀apology⠀may⠀carry⠀a⠀practical⠀motive.⠀Let⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀live⠀inside⠀the⠀document's⠀own⠀voice,⠀and⠀let⠀irony⠀have⠀a⠀clear⠀owner—the⠀document⠀writer's⠀phrasing,⠀or⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀one⠀record⠀and⠀another—rather⠀than⠀an⠀omniscient⠀narrator⠀who⠀explains⠀the⠀social⠀meaning.⠀A⠀writer⠀may⠀misread⠀another⠀person's⠀conduct;⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀may⠀revise⠀that⠀reading⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀earlier⠀one⠀knowingly⠀false.⠀Capability⠀includes⠀knowing⠀whom⠀to⠀ask,⠀what⠀an⠀offer⠀obliges,⠀when⠀to⠀conceal⠀a⠀failure,⠀and⠀how⠀reputation⠀opens⠀or⠀closes⠀a⠀chance⠀to⠀practice.\n\nLet⠀missing⠀replies,⠀omitted⠀dates,⠀marginal⠀corrections,⠀conflicting⠀accounts,⠀and⠀material⠀traces⠀carry⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀development;⠀continuity⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀recurring⠀concerns,⠀dates,⠀and⠀the⠀reader's⠀ability⠀to⠀compare⠀records.⠀Do⠀not⠀append⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀document.⠀Use⠀the⠀specific⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀requires—letter,⠀journal⠀entry,⠀report,⠀corrected⠀exercise,⠀ledger,⠀notice,⠀note—rather⠀than⠀rotating⠀through⠀every⠀possible⠀format.⠀Keep⠀each⠀document's⠀knowledge⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀could⠀write⠀at⠀that⠀time⠀and⠀place,⠀and⠀keep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge⠀unless⠀the⠀current⠀presentation⠀permits⠀access.\n\nA⠀letter,⠀journal,⠀report,⠀or⠀record⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀author's⠀complete⠀live⠀mind.⠀Alongside⠀these⠀documents,⠀give⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀experience—attention,⠀irritation,⠀hope,⠀calculation,⠀embarrassment,⠀grief—in⠀the⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀form⠀the⠀current⠀presentation⠀allows;⠀that⠀experience⠀may⠀qualify,⠀contradict,⠀or⠀simply⠀accompany⠀what⠀the⠀document⠀records.⠀The⠀sequence⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀into⠀a⠀final⠀rank,⠀public⠀recognition,⠀or⠀settled⠀judgment⠀of⠀character.⠀It⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀a⠀reply⠀is⠀still⠀awaited,⠀a⠀capability⠀is⠀still⠀forming,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀entry⠀leaves⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nBuild⠀the⠀story⠀around⠀a⠀capability⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀practiced,⠀misunderstood,⠀and⠀improved⠀within⠀its⠀own⠀world's⠀terms:⠀a⠀craft,⠀discipline,⠀magical⠀technique,⠀social⠀skill,⠀physical⠀training,⠀professional⠀judgment,⠀or⠀another⠀concrete⠀ability⠀the⠀setting⠀already⠀permits.⠀Keep⠀the⠀development⠀visible⠀across⠀scenes⠀through⠀attempts,⠀feedback,⠀adjustment,⠀and⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀executing⠀it⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀advance⠀unevenly;⠀a⠀new⠀competence⠀may⠀solve⠀one⠀problem⠀while⠀exposing⠀another,⠀and⠀progress⠀is⠀tested⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀by⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult,⠀costly,⠀or⠀unlearned.⠀If⠀ranks⠀or⠀measured⠀systems⠀exist,⠀use⠀them⠀to⠀support⠀the⠀account⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀decorative⠀numbers.\n\nUse⠀social⠀interpretation⠀to⠀place⠀that⠀development⠀inside⠀a⠀web⠀of⠀circumstance.⠀Mentors,⠀peers,⠀patrons,⠀rivals,⠀family,⠀and⠀obligations⠀shape⠀access⠀to⠀practice,⠀resources,⠀and⠀opportunity.⠀A⠀polite⠀offer,⠀a⠀withheld⠀recommendation,⠀a⠀small⠀expense,⠀a⠀family⠀claim,⠀or⠀a⠀reputation⠀for⠀competence⠀can⠀change⠀what⠀training⠀is⠀available⠀and⠀how⠀an⠀accomplishment⠀is⠀received.⠀Track⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀believes⠀about⠀their⠀own⠀progress⠀against⠀what⠀conversation,⠀courtesy,⠀or⠀circumstance⠀reveals⠀to⠀others.⠀Keep⠀narrative⠀irony⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀owner—narrator⠀or⠀viewpoint—so⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀self-assessment⠀and⠀visible⠀conduct⠀produces⠀judgment⠀rather⠀than⠀confusion.⠀Private⠀thought⠀remains⠀within⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀knowledge;⠀social⠀inference⠀is⠀not⠀omniscience.⠀Render⠀the⠀learner's⠀actual⠀interiority⠀where⠀it⠀matters—attention,⠀uncertainty,⠀irritation,⠀satisfaction,⠀the⠀reasoning⠀that⠀connects⠀feedback⠀to⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀method—so⠀the⠀developing⠀capability⠀has⠀a⠀mind⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀a⠀result.⠀Work⠀in⠀the⠀scenario's⠀own⠀terms⠀rather⠀than⠀importing⠀a⠀marriage⠀plot,⠀period⠀setting,⠀or⠀uniformly⠀polished⠀speech.\n\nTreat⠀comfort⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life,⠀not⠀a⠀suspension⠀of⠀difficulty.⠀Attend⠀to⠀chosen⠀kindness,⠀familiar⠀preferences,⠀practical⠀care,⠀ease,⠀and⠀small⠀pleasures.⠀Make⠀room⠀to⠀enjoy⠀particular⠀people:⠀a⠀patient⠀correction,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀tool⠀repaired,⠀a⠀place⠀to⠀rest,⠀an⠀honest⠀word⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀demand⠀a⠀confession.⠀Let⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀steering⠀every⠀relationship⠀toward⠀romance⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀Preserve⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement.⠀Do⠀not⠀neutralize⠀established⠀dangers,⠀limits,⠀or⠀social⠀problems⠀merely⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀scene⠀soothing.⠀Friction⠀remains⠀manageable—an⠀awkward⠀lesson,⠀a⠀limited⠀resource,⠀a⠀social⠀misstep,⠀a⠀physical⠀setback,⠀a⠀disagreement⠀about⠀method—and⠀if⠀such⠀friction⠀matters,⠀render⠀its⠀effect⠀on⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀a⠀crisis⠀or⠀reversal.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀progression⠀thread⠀active⠀through⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀comfort.⠀A⠀kind⠀teacher⠀may⠀still⠀correct;⠀a⠀loyal⠀companion⠀may⠀still⠀disagree;⠀a⠀comfortable⠀interval⠀may⠀include⠀practice,⠀recovery,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀work⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀later.⠀Let⠀scenes⠀of⠀improvement⠀and⠀scenes⠀of⠀care⠀illuminate⠀the⠀same⠀person:⠀the⠀capability⠀being⠀built,⠀the⠀people⠀who⠀notice⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀life⠀it⠀must⠀fit⠀into.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀or⠀speech⠀naturally⠀reaches⠀its⠀boundary;⠀a⠀lesson⠀may⠀continue,⠀a⠀task⠀may⠀remain⠀unfinished,⠀and⠀a⠀warm⠀exchange⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀into⠀a⠀declaration⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀transformation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nBuild⠀the⠀story⠀around⠀a⠀person⠀whose⠀growing⠀capability⠀is⠀inseparable⠀from⠀the⠀social⠀world⠀that⠀judges,⠀funds,⠀obstructs,⠀or⠀depends⠀on⠀it.⠀Improvement⠀shows⠀in⠀what⠀she⠀or⠀he⠀can⠀do,⠀but⠀the⠀Austenian⠀attention⠀belongs⠀to⠀how⠀that⠀change⠀is⠀understood—by⠀the⠀protagonist,⠀by⠀those⠀who⠀benefit⠀from⠀it,⠀by⠀those⠀whose⠀status⠀or⠀income⠀it⠀unsettles,⠀and⠀by⠀the⠀quiet⠀record⠀of⠀offers,⠀debts,⠀favors,⠀and⠀omissions.⠀Let⠀a⠀new⠀skill⠀register⠀through⠀a⠀household⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀professional⠀obligation,⠀a⠀friendship,⠀or⠀a⠀reputation⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀through⠀any⠀public⠀rank.\n\nShow⠀progression⠀through⠀attempts⠀rather⠀than⠀announcements.⠀A⠀principle⠀may⠀be⠀known⠀and⠀still⠀badly⠀executed;⠀a⠀strength⠀may⠀develop⠀faster⠀than⠀the⠀judgment⠀needed⠀to⠀use⠀it⠀well.⠀Give⠀the⠀protagonist⠀practice,⠀instruction,⠀feedback,⠀tools,⠀money,⠀time,⠀or⠀access—whatever⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀supplies—and⠀make⠀each⠀acquisition⠀change⠀the⠀range⠀of⠀possible⠀action.⠀Test⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀scene⠀where⠀success⠀is⠀not⠀guaranteed:⠀a⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀repair,⠀a⠀performance,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀work,⠀a⠀difficult⠀courtesy.⠀A⠀later⠀scene⠀can⠀show⠀a⠀newly⠀available⠀competence⠀or⠀a⠀limitation⠀that⠀remains⠀stubborn;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀victory⠀or⠀a⠀defeat.\n\nUse⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀owner,⠀and⠀give⠀the⠀protagonist⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀interiority:⠀appraisal,⠀memory,⠀self-correction,⠀and⠀the⠀wish⠀to⠀appear⠀better⠀than⠀the⠀evidence⠀warrants.⠀Let⠀conversation⠀and⠀circumstance⠀correct,⠀complicate,⠀or⠀confirm⠀that⠀private⠀account.⠀A⠀kind⠀offer⠀can⠀conceal⠀a⠀claim;⠀a⠀refusal⠀can⠀preserve⠀dignity;⠀a⠀small⠀expense⠀can⠀decide⠀a⠀large⠀question.⠀Keep⠀the⠀irony⠀measured⠀and⠀located⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀believes⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀reveals,⠀not⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀superior⠀mockery.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀separate⠀from⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀misread⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀improvement⠀when⠀their⠀own⠀interests,⠀manners,⠀or⠀information⠀lead⠀them⠀to.\n\nSustain⠀the⠀formal⠀architecture⠀through⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀broad⠀paragraphs.⠀Move⠀from⠀a⠀specific⠀exchange⠀to⠀the⠀social⠀context⠀that⠀gives⠀it⠀weight:⠀family⠀expectation,⠀professional⠀custom,⠀local⠀history,⠀money,⠀or⠀reputation.⠀Distinguish⠀narration⠀from⠀ordinary⠀speech;⠀not⠀every⠀character⠀needs⠀polished⠀sentences.⠀Ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀or⠀public/private⠀contrast⠀can⠀organize⠀a⠀passage⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Use⠀temporal⠀distance⠀to⠀compare⠀an⠀earlier⠀attempt⠀with⠀a⠀later⠀capability,⠀but⠀let⠀elapsed⠀time⠀follow⠀the⠀events,⠀not⠀the⠀length⠀of⠀the⠀prose.⠀A⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀practice,⠀during⠀a⠀conversation,⠀inside⠀a⠀private⠀assessment,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀unfinished⠀obligation;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀complete⠀the⠀test,⠀resolve⠀the⠀relationship,⠀or⠀deliver⠀a⠀lesson.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀developing⠀life⠀ordinary⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀progressive.⠀Work,⠀recovery,⠀meals,⠀dependents,⠀friendships,⠀and⠀unglamorous⠀maintenance⠀continue⠀alongside⠀training.⠀Other⠀characters⠀pursue⠀their⠀own⠀choices⠀and⠀may⠀help,⠀hinder,⠀ignore,⠀or⠀simply⠀remain⠀preoccupied.⠀Advancement⠀can⠀be⠀uneven⠀across⠀physical⠀skill,⠀social⠀tact,⠀technical⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀self-knowledge.⠀If⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀contains⠀ranks,⠀schools,⠀guilds,⠀or⠀measured⠀systems,⠀let⠀them⠀frame⠀what⠀is⠀possible⠀and⠀how⠀others⠀respond;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀numerical⠀mechanics⠀merely⠀to⠀display⠀progress.⠀The⠀through-line⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀ladder⠀but⠀a⠀changing⠀person⠀in⠀a⠀changing⠀set⠀of⠀obligations,⠀whose⠀next⠀attempt⠀matters⠀because⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀shown⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀now⠀makes⠀possible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀each⠀embedded⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀social⠀act⠀with⠀a⠀developmental⠀stake.⠀The⠀teller⠀speaks⠀because⠀the⠀outer⠀situation⠀has⠀put⠀capability,⠀reputation,⠀dependence,⠀or⠀trust⠀in⠀question,⠀and⠀the⠀tale⠀is⠀the⠀move⠀she⠀makes⠀in⠀that⠀exchange.⠀Let⠀the⠀occasion⠀itself⠀carry⠀the⠀pressure:⠀an⠀invitation⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀answered,⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀filled,⠀a⠀claim⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀supported,⠀or⠀a⠀refusal⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀softened.⠀The⠀tale⠀should⠀not⠀illustrate⠀a⠀lesson⠀the⠀outer⠀story⠀has⠀already⠀absorbed;⠀it⠀should⠀intervene⠀in⠀an⠀unresolved⠀question⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀listener⠀with⠀something⠀to⠀grant,⠀believe,⠀reconsider,⠀or⠀refuse.\n\nMake⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀carry⠀the⠀progression⠀work⠀in⠀concrete⠀form.⠀A⠀tale⠀can⠀recount⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀and⠀the⠀correction⠀that⠀followed,⠀a⠀resource⠀gained⠀through⠀an⠀awkward⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀technique⠀understood⠀only⠀after⠀someone⠀named⠀th