in⠀order⠀to⠀improve.⠀Let⠀the⠀prose⠀shift⠀between⠀the⠀intimate⠀texture⠀of⠀private⠀practice⠀and⠀the⠀sharper⠀social⠀exchanges⠀where⠀masks⠀are⠀maintained⠀or⠀dropped.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nAdvancement⠀passes⠀through⠀particular⠀tellers,⠀lineages,⠀and⠀audiences.⠀Each⠀transmission⠀carries⠀an⠀obligation,⠀a⠀reputation,⠀or⠀a⠀gap.⠀A⠀teacher⠀recounts⠀an⠀episode⠀to⠀correct⠀a⠀student's⠀error.⠀A⠀relative⠀tells⠀a⠀family⠀story⠀to⠀justify⠀withholding⠀a⠀resource.⠀A⠀rival⠀retells⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀to⠀diminish⠀a⠀gain.⠀The⠀outer⠀story⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀does⠀with⠀the⠀account⠀afterward:⠀which⠀detail⠀she⠀repeats,⠀which⠀she⠀questions,⠀and⠀which⠀she⠀only⠀understands⠀after⠀attempting⠀the⠀practice⠀herself.\n\nThe⠀embedded⠀accounts⠀are⠀concrete⠀developmental⠀material,⠀not⠀decorative⠀lore.⠀A⠀tale⠀describes⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀and⠀the⠀exact⠀correction⠀that⠀followed,⠀a⠀resource⠀obtained⠀through⠀an⠀obligation⠀the⠀listener⠀must⠀now⠀weigh,⠀or⠀a⠀skill⠀demonstrated⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀reveals⠀its⠀remaining⠀limits.⠀The⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀remain⠀visible:⠀what⠀is⠀included,⠀what⠀is⠀softened,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀does⠀not⠀know.⠀The⠀listener's⠀response⠀becomes⠀feedback⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀frame,⠀whether⠀as⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀new⠀offer,⠀or⠀a⠀corrected⠀reading⠀of⠀the⠀teller's⠀motives.\n\nAusten's⠀social⠀precision⠀makes⠀the⠀frame⠀itself⠀a⠀site⠀of⠀learning.⠀A⠀small⠀exchange⠀about⠀who⠀may⠀speak,⠀who⠀interrupts,⠀who⠀offers⠀hospitality,⠀or⠀who⠀changes⠀the⠀subject⠀can⠀reveal⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀standing⠀that⠀no⠀rank⠀or⠀statistic⠀states⠀directly.⠀Free⠀indirect⠀style⠀shows⠀the⠀learner⠀mistaking⠀deference⠀for⠀agreement⠀or⠀confusing⠀access⠀to⠀a⠀story⠀with⠀mastery⠀of⠀its⠀lesson.⠀Improvement⠀is⠀tested⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀situation:⠀a⠀negotiation⠀attempted,⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀caught⠀before⠀it⠀costs,⠀a⠀skill⠀performed⠀under⠀scrutiny,⠀or⠀a⠀relationship⠀repaired⠀through⠀a⠀more⠀accurate⠀account⠀of⠀someone⠀else's⠀motives.\n\nKeep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀when⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀provides⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀frame-tale⠀structure⠀should⠀remain⠀intelligible⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀royal⠀court,⠀a⠀magical⠀bargain,⠀or⠀a⠀compulsory⠀cliffhanger⠀between⠀every⠀nested⠀account.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nAdvancement⠀appears⠀through⠀dated,⠀partial⠀entries⠀written⠀by⠀the⠀focal⠀character,⠀each⠀recording⠀a⠀particular⠀attempt,⠀exchange,⠀or⠀correction.⠀The⠀entry⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact:⠀the⠀diarist⠀chooses⠀what⠀to⠀include,⠀what⠀to⠀excuse,⠀and⠀what⠀to⠀present⠀as⠀progress.⠀The⠀diary⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀transparent⠀transcript⠀of⠀live⠀thought⠀or⠀a⠀complete⠀record⠀of⠀the⠀character's⠀mind.\n\nThe⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀diarist's⠀self-assessment⠀and⠀the⠀recorded⠀scene⠀carries⠀the⠀developmental⠀irony.⠀The⠀entry⠀may⠀claim⠀a⠀technique⠀is⠀mastered⠀while⠀the⠀described⠀attempt⠀shows⠀hesitation,⠀borrowed⠀help,⠀or⠀a⠀lucky⠀result.⠀It⠀may⠀record⠀a⠀social⠀victory⠀while⠀the⠀quoted⠀exchange⠀reveals⠀the⠀other⠀party's⠀patience⠀or⠀condescension.⠀The⠀narration⠀around⠀the⠀entry,⠀if⠀present,⠀keeps⠀the⠀diarist's⠀perspective⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀reader's⠀ability⠀to⠀notice⠀what⠀the⠀diarist⠀omits.⠀Free⠀indirect⠀style⠀renders⠀the⠀diarist's⠀self-justifications⠀without⠀endorsing⠀them.\n\nImprovement⠀is⠀testable⠀through⠀recurrence.⠀The⠀same⠀type⠀of⠀task⠀appears⠀in⠀later⠀entries⠀under⠀different⠀conditions:⠀a⠀skill⠀that⠀works⠀alone⠀but⠀fails⠀before⠀an⠀audience,⠀a⠀negotiation⠀that⠀succeeds⠀only⠀after⠀the⠀diarist⠀recognizes⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀party⠀wanted,⠀or⠀a⠀principle⠀the⠀diarist⠀can⠀state⠀but⠀cannot⠀yet⠀execute.⠀Feedback⠀arrives⠀through⠀conversation,⠀correction,⠀refusal,⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀consequences⠀of⠀error,⠀and⠀the⠀diarist⠀sometimes⠀misattributes⠀that⠀feedback.⠀A⠀real⠀gain⠀may⠀be⠀recorded⠀flatly⠀or⠀with⠀embarrassment,⠀while⠀a⠀false⠀gain⠀may⠀be⠀recorded⠀with⠀pride.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀miscellany⠀varied:⠀an⠀entry⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀brief⠀note,⠀a⠀longer⠀reflection,⠀a⠀remembered⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀list⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀practiced⠀and⠀what⠀went⠀wrong.⠀Seasonal⠀attention,⠀omission,⠀direct⠀feeling,⠀and⠀plain⠀argument⠀are⠀available⠀where⠀appropriate,⠀but⠀no⠀universal⠀quietness⠀or⠀mandatory⠀inventory⠀of⠀Japanese⠀scenery⠀applies.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀entry⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀lesson;⠀requests⠀can⠀remain⠀unanswered⠀and⠀tasks⠀can⠀span⠀entries.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nAdvancement⠀is⠀a⠀character's⠀developing⠀ability⠀to⠀read⠀particular⠀people,⠀manage⠀her⠀own⠀reputation,⠀and⠀act⠀under⠀material⠀constraint.⠀Each⠀stage⠀of⠀learning⠀is⠀grounded⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀place⠀and⠀relationship:⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀household,⠀a⠀neighborhood,⠀a⠀creditor,⠀a⠀patron,⠀a⠀rival,⠀or⠀a⠀friend⠀whose⠀goodwill⠀must⠀be⠀maintained.⠀Improvement⠀is⠀tested⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀in⠀those⠀settings,⠀not⠀through⠀abstract⠀self-improvement.\n\nThe⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀is⠀a⠀site⠀of⠀both⠀progress⠀and⠀error.⠀She⠀interprets⠀an⠀offer,⠀a⠀silence,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀someone's⠀tone,⠀or⠀a⠀delay⠀in⠀payment,⠀and⠀then⠀acts⠀on⠀that⠀interpretation.⠀Free⠀indirect⠀style⠀renders⠀her⠀reasoning⠀closely⠀while⠀keeping⠀the⠀reader⠀able⠀to⠀notice⠀what⠀she⠀misses.⠀A⠀gain⠀in⠀social⠀understanding⠀may⠀be⠀real⠀and⠀still⠀insufficient:⠀she⠀may⠀correctly⠀identify⠀a⠀rival's⠀motive⠀but⠀fail⠀to⠀see⠀her⠀own⠀patron's⠀impatience,⠀or⠀she⠀may⠀learn⠀to⠀negotiate⠀a⠀better⠀price⠀while⠀remaining⠀unable⠀to⠀refuse⠀a⠀relative's⠀claim.\n\nFeedback⠀arrives⠀through⠀conversation⠀and⠀consequence.⠀A⠀polite⠀phrase⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀correction,⠀a⠀compliment⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀warning,⠀and⠀a⠀favor⠀may⠀create⠀an⠀obligation⠀the⠀character⠀only⠀recognizes⠀later.⠀The⠀same⠀type⠀of⠀social⠀or⠀practical⠀task⠀recurs⠀under⠀different⠀conditions⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀track⠀uneven⠀growth.⠀Knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀executing⠀it⠀remain⠀distinct:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀explain⠀what⠀she⠀should⠀have⠀said⠀while⠀still⠀failing⠀to⠀say⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀moment,⠀or⠀she⠀may⠀perform⠀a⠀skill⠀reliably⠀without⠀understanding⠀why⠀it⠀worked.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀setting's⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀specific⠀when⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀provides⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts,⠀magical⠀realism,⠀or⠀marvelous⠀events⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them.⠀The⠀psychological⠀and⠀urban⠀route⠀should⠀remain⠀intimate⠀and⠀concrete,⠀with⠀the⠀narration's⠀irony⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀narrator⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀every⠀self-assessment⠀into⠀a⠀joke.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEach⠀scene⠀opens⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀developmental⠀attempt⠀or⠀social⠀exchange⠀is⠀already⠀in⠀motion.⠀The⠀space,⠀the⠀relevant⠀people,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀do⠀are⠀established⠀in⠀clean,⠀readable⠀prose.⠀Short⠀paragraphs⠀separate⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response,⠀and⠀spatial⠀changes⠀are⠀explicit⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀always⠀knows⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀and⠀what⠀she⠀can⠀act⠀on.\n\nThe⠀reaction⠀beats⠀carry⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation.⠀After⠀a⠀significant⠀exchange,⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀response⠀is⠀a⠀specific⠀reading⠀of⠀what⠀just⠀happened:⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀wanted,⠀what⠀the⠀offer⠀cost,⠀what⠀the⠀silence⠀meant,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀herself⠀failed⠀to⠀say.⠀The⠀reaction⠀may⠀be⠀correct,⠀partial,⠀or⠀mistaken,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀keeps⠀the⠀character's⠀perspective⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀reader's⠀ability⠀to⠀notice⠀what⠀she⠀misses.⠀A⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀always⠀an⠀interpretation⠀of⠀a⠀social⠀situation,⠀not⠀merely⠀an⠀emotional⠀label.\n\nProgression⠀is⠀visible⠀through⠀recurrence.⠀The⠀same⠀type⠀of⠀task⠀or⠀negotiation⠀appears⠀in⠀later⠀scenes⠀under⠀different⠀conditions,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀accomplishes⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀The⠀attempt⠀itself⠀is⠀shown:⠀the⠀hesitation,⠀the⠀borrowed⠀help,⠀the⠀misread⠀cue,⠀or⠀the⠀correction⠀that⠀finally⠀works.⠀Knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀executing⠀it⠀remain⠀distinct:⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀explain⠀a⠀method⠀but⠀cannot⠀yet⠀perform⠀it,⠀or⠀performs⠀it⠀without⠀understanding⠀why⠀it⠀worked.⠀When⠀unfamiliar⠀names,⠀ranks,⠀or⠀mechanics⠀appear,⠀they⠀are⠀presented⠀clearly⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀use⠀without⠀pausing⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀glossary.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀first⠀person,⠀comedy,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀composition,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.⠀The⠀prose⠀remains⠀fast-readable⠀without⠀sacrificing⠀the⠀social⠀precision⠀that⠀makes⠀a⠀small⠀exchange⠀carry⠀several⠀meanings.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀advancement⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀quality⠀of⠀attention.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀practices⠀a⠀skill,⠀learns⠀a⠀principle,⠀or⠀acquires⠀a⠀resource,⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀register⠀what⠀that⠀change⠀makes⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀senses⠀and⠀to⠀social⠀interpretation:⠀a⠀new⠀sound⠀in⠀a⠀familiar⠀room,⠀a⠀different⠀weight⠀in⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀now⠀yields⠀a⠀second⠀meaning.⠀The⠀capability⠀itself⠀should⠀be⠀shown⠀through⠀concrete⠀perception⠀and⠀execution,⠀not⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀rank⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀milestone.\n\nUse⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀new⠀understanding⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀narrator's.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀she⠀can⠀now⠀follow⠀the⠀timing⠀of⠀a⠀negotiation⠀or⠀recognize⠀the⠀strain⠀behind⠀a⠀courteous⠀refusal,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀render⠀that⠀recognition⠀in⠀her⠀own⠀figurative⠀language.⠀Let⠀the⠀image⠀develop⠀across⠀the⠀paragraph⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀she⠀understands:⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀sensory⠀detail,⠀extend⠀it⠀through⠀association,⠀and⠀return⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀social⠀exchange⠀that⠀prompted⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀comparison⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀associations,⠀and⠀let⠀plain⠀statements⠀provide⠀contrast⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀still⠀uncertain⠀or⠀the⠀capability⠀is⠀incomplete.\n\nLet⠀syntax⠀mark⠀the⠀unevenness⠀of⠀improvement.⠀A⠀practiced⠀movement⠀can⠀arrive⠀in⠀a⠀longer,⠀more⠀assured⠀sentence⠀whose⠀clauses⠀follow⠀one⠀another⠀like⠀the⠀steps⠀of⠀a⠀task⠀now⠀known;⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀may⠀break⠀into⠀shorter⠀clauses⠀or⠀a⠀more⠀guarded⠀image,⠀as⠀though⠀the⠀sentence⠀itself⠀hesitates⠀before⠀the⠀thing⠀not⠀yet⠀mastered.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀execute⠀a⠀technique⠀cleanly⠀in⠀private⠀and⠀still⠀falter⠀before⠀witnesses,⠀or⠀may⠀understand⠀a⠀principle⠀without⠀yet⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀apply⠀it⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀advance⠀a⠀triumph⠀of⠀perception.⠀Some⠀growth⠀is⠀practical,⠀partial,⠀or⠀unnoticed⠀by⠀others,⠀and⠀some⠀exchanges⠀remain⠀opaque⠀even⠀to⠀a⠀character⠀whose⠀abilities⠀have⠀increased.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀arrive⠀with⠀the⠀awareness⠀of⠀what⠀it⠀has⠀displaced.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀gains⠀a⠀capability,⠀a⠀resource,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀understanding,⠀place⠀it⠀beside⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀in⠀which⠀that⠀capability⠀was⠀absent.⠀The⠀comparison⠀should⠀be⠀specific:⠀the⠀same⠀room⠀where⠀she⠀once⠀misread⠀a⠀tone⠀of⠀voice,⠀the⠀same⠀task⠀she⠀once⠀attempted⠀with⠀less⠀skill,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀that⠀now⠀means⠀something⠀different⠀because⠀she⠀can⠀do⠀what⠀she⠀could⠀not⠀do⠀then.⠀The⠀gain⠀remains⠀real,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀the⠀earlier⠀self⠀or⠀the⠀time⠀already⠀spent.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀concrete.⠀A⠀past⠀offer,⠀refusal,⠀omission,⠀or⠀family⠀obligation⠀can⠀return⠀with⠀its⠀old⠀weight⠀and⠀its⠀new⠀significance.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀reflect⠀on⠀what⠀she⠀believed⠀about⠀herself⠀then⠀and⠀what⠀conversation⠀or⠀circumstance⠀has⠀since⠀revealed.⠀The⠀new⠀meaning⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀reversal:⠀a⠀courtesy⠀once⠀accepted⠀as⠀kindness⠀may⠀now⠀read⠀as⠀strategy,⠀but⠀it⠀may⠀also⠀read⠀as⠀a⠀kindness⠀offered⠀from⠀a⠀position⠀she⠀now⠀understands⠀better.⠀Keep⠀the⠀reflection⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀or⠀the⠀narrator,⠀not⠀distributed⠀as⠀a⠀general⠀mood.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀progression⠀to⠀remain⠀uneven⠀and⠀the⠀melancholy⠀to⠀remain⠀partial.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀more⠀capable⠀and⠀still⠀lonely,⠀more⠀perceptive⠀and⠀still⠀unable⠀to⠀repair⠀a⠀particular⠀attachment,⠀or⠀better⠀resourced⠀and⠀still⠀bound⠀by⠀an⠀old⠀obligation.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀pleasurable,⠀and⠀a⠀present⠀competence⠀can⠀be⠀enjoyed⠀without⠀forgetting⠀its⠀cost.⠀The⠀reflective⠀register⠀should⠀deepen⠀the⠀account⠀of⠀growth,⠀not⠀replace⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀fixed⠀mood⠀of⠀regret⠀or⠀require⠀each⠀scene⠀to⠀end⠀by⠀announcing⠀impermanence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀account⠀as⠀the⠀route⠀for⠀this⠀combination.⠀A⠀situated⠀teller⠀relates⠀how⠀a⠀person's⠀growing⠀capability⠀changed⠀her⠀place⠀in⠀a⠀household,⠀a⠀trade,⠀a⠀patronage⠀network,⠀or⠀a⠀community.⠀Establish⠀the⠀teller's⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀events:⠀what⠀she⠀witnessed,⠀what⠀she⠀was⠀told,⠀what⠀she⠀infers,⠀and⠀what⠀she⠀chooses⠀to⠀withhold⠀or⠀delay.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience's⠀questions,⠀assumptions,⠀and⠀interruptions⠀shape⠀the⠀telling⠀without⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀dialogue⠀transcript.⠀The⠀frame⠀remains⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀story,⠀not⠀a⠀decorative⠀introduction.\n\nMake⠀advancement⠀matter⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀account⠀of⠀attempts,⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changed⠀execution.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀describe⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀could⠀not⠀do,⠀what⠀she⠀attempted,⠀who⠀corrected⠀her,⠀and⠀what⠀she⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀teller's⠀report⠀from⠀the⠀learner's⠀private⠀experience.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀know⠀that⠀a⠀skill⠀improved⠀without⠀knowing⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀practice,⠀or⠀may⠀repeat⠀a⠀reputation⠀that⠀the⠀learner⠀herself⠀would⠀qualify.⠀Use⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀to⠀give⠀small⠀exchanges⠀several⠀meanings:⠀an⠀offer⠀of⠀instruction⠀may⠀also⠀be⠀a⠀claim⠀on⠀loyalty,⠀a⠀gift⠀of⠀materials⠀may⠀carry⠀an⠀obligation,⠀and⠀a⠀compliment⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀attempt⠀to⠀fix⠀a⠀person⠀in⠀a⠀lower⠀place.\n\nLet⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀serve⠀the⠀progression⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀decorate⠀it.⠀A⠀capability⠀may⠀be⠀introduced⠀through⠀its⠀visible⠀effect⠀before⠀the⠀teller⠀explains⠀how⠀it⠀was⠀acquired,⠀or⠀a⠀social⠀consequence⠀may⠀be⠀withheld⠀until⠀the⠀audience⠀has⠀formed⠀a⠀mistaken⠀judgment.⠀The⠀teller's⠀irony⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀clear⠀owner⠀and⠀a⠀social⠀point.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀coherent⠀as⠀a⠀domestic⠀account⠀given⠀to⠀guests:⠀the⠀teller⠀speaks⠀from⠀her⠀own⠀household⠀knowledge,⠀returns⠀to⠀familiar⠀rooms⠀and⠀recurring⠀exchanges,⠀and⠀lets⠀the⠀audience's⠀curiosity⠀about⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀rise⠀or⠀fall⠀pull⠀the⠀next⠀episode⠀forward.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀tale⠀a⠀nested⠀labyrinth⠀or⠀every⠀audience⠀a⠀chorus⠀of⠀wonder.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nShow⠀advancement⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀has⠀gained⠀a⠀capability,⠀let⠀the⠀difference⠀appear⠀in⠀what⠀she⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀or⠀notice:⠀she⠀completes⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀once⠀stopped⠀her,⠀she⠀hears⠀the⠀hesitation⠀in⠀an⠀offer,⠀she⠀recognizes⠀the⠀cost⠀implied⠀by⠀a⠀polite⠀phrase.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀improvement⠀unless⠀the⠀explanation⠀materially⠀contributes⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀A⠀principle⠀may⠀be⠀stated⠀briefly,⠀but⠀the⠀proof⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀execution.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀to⠀make⠀each⠀selected⠀detail⠀carry⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀meaning.⠀A⠀single⠀observed⠀gesture⠀can⠀indicate⠀deference,⠀calculation,⠀or⠀fatigue,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀new⠀capability⠀may⠀let⠀her⠀distinguish⠀among⠀those⠀possibilities.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀direct.⠀A⠀sentence⠀may⠀say⠀that⠀she⠀now⠀understood⠀the⠀offer⠀was⠀not⠀kindness,⠀without⠀adding⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀analysis.⠀Let⠀the⠀omission⠀leave⠀something⠀inferable:⠀the⠀changed⠀action⠀or⠀the⠀changed⠀reading⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀exchange⠀shows⠀the⠀new⠀capability,⠀while⠀the⠀earlier⠀failure⠀or⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀learning⠀remains⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀say.\n\nAllow⠀improvement⠀to⠀remain⠀uneven.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀execute⠀a⠀skill⠀in⠀private⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀before⠀witnesses,⠀or⠀may⠀understand⠀a⠀social⠀principle⠀without⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀apply⠀it⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Show⠀the⠀difference⠀through⠀what⠀happens,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀her⠀limitations.⠀A⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀may⠀serve⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀performed⠀fragments,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀selected⠀detail⠀doing⠀the⠀work⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀second⠀explanation⠀where⠀the⠀first⠀action⠀already⠀carries⠀the⠀meaning.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀advancement⠀inside⠀sustained⠀scenes.⠀Let⠀a⠀character's⠀growing⠀capability⠀appear⠀through⠀what⠀she⠀attempts,⠀how⠀she⠀practices,⠀what⠀feedback⠀she⠀receives,⠀and⠀what⠀she⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀in⠀an⠀ordinary⠀exchange⠀or⠀task.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience,⠀using⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀display⠀a⠀stat⠀sheet⠀or⠀to⠀announce⠀a⠀rank;⠀let⠀the⠀changed⠀capability⠀become⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀she⠀handles⠀a⠀familiar⠀situation.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀to⠀give⠀the⠀progression⠀its⠀particular⠀texture.⠀A⠀lesson⠀may⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀courteous⠀correction,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀an⠀offer⠀with⠀hidden⠀terms,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀obligation⠀that⠀forces⠀a⠀new⠀skill⠀into⠀use.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀judgment⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀she⠀says⠀or⠀from⠀what⠀others⠀assume,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀exchange⠀a⠀duel⠀of⠀wit⠀or⠀a⠀contest⠀of⠀hidden⠀meanings.⠀Free⠀indirect⠀style⠀may⠀carry⠀her⠀recognition⠀that⠀a⠀compliment⠀is⠀also⠀a⠀claim,⠀or⠀that⠀her⠀new⠀competence⠀has⠀altered⠀someone's⠀manner⠀toward⠀her.⠀Keep⠀the⠀judgment⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀character⠀or⠀the⠀narrator,⠀and⠀let⠀conversation⠀reveal⠀what⠀people⠀believe⠀about⠀themselves⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀gives⠀that⠀revelation⠀room⠀to⠀matter.\n\nAllow⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀to⠀develop⠀unevenly⠀within⠀the⠀scene's⠀movement.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀know⠀a⠀principle⠀without⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀execute⠀it⠀under⠀pressure,⠀or⠀may⠀perform⠀well⠀in⠀private⠀and⠀falter⠀before⠀witnesses.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀show⠀the⠀difference⠀through⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀action,⠀a⠀hesitation⠀in⠀dialogue,⠀or⠀a⠀recollection⠀that⠀interrupts⠀the⠀present⠀task,⠀rather⠀than⠀summarizing⠀the⠀limitation⠀afterward.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀voice,⠀the⠀Austen⠀profile,⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀should⠀set⠀the⠀register⠀and⠀rhythm.⠀Contemporary⠀presentation⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀contemporary⠀setting,⠀understated⠀emotion,⠀or⠀a⠀lesson⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nLet⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀organize⠀the⠀account⠀of⠀advancement.⠀Choose⠀scenes⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀character's⠀growing⠀capability⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀person:⠀she⠀can⠀now⠀offer⠀help⠀she⠀once⠀could⠀not,⠀she⠀understands⠀a⠀private⠀signal⠀she⠀once⠀missed,⠀or⠀her⠀new⠀competence⠀changes⠀the⠀balance⠀of⠀a⠀rivalry,⠀a⠀comfort,⠀or⠀a⠀discovery.⠀Make⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise⠀legible⠀through⠀repeated⠀moments⠀and⠀private⠀language.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀task⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀new⠀meaning⠀because⠀the⠀capability⠀behind⠀it⠀has⠀changed.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀to⠀give⠀the⠀emotional⠀beats⠀their⠀texture.⠀Affection⠀may⠀be⠀expressed⠀through⠀an⠀offer⠀that⠀also⠀carries⠀obligation;⠀jealousy⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀careful⠀question⠀about⠀who⠀provided⠀the⠀new⠀resource;⠀comfort⠀may⠀be⠀offered⠀with⠀an⠀unspoken⠀awareness⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀cannot⠀yet⠀do.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀she⠀says.⠀She⠀may⠀accept⠀a⠀compliment⠀while⠀privately⠀knowing⠀the⠀skill⠀is⠀still⠀incomplete,⠀or⠀she⠀may⠀offer⠀help⠀while⠀aware⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀pride⠀will⠀refuse⠀it.⠀Give⠀each⠀emotional⠀beat⠀enough⠀space⠀to⠀develop⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.\n\nMake⠀progression⠀uneven⠀and⠀consequential⠀within⠀the⠀relationship.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀improve⠀in⠀one⠀area⠀and⠀remain⠀unable⠀to⠀meet⠀a⠀particular⠀need,⠀or⠀may⠀gain⠀a⠀capability⠀that⠀creates⠀a⠀new⠀distance⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀a⠀new⠀closeness.⠀Let⠀the⠀payoff⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀repeated⠀moment⠀or⠀private⠀signal⠀whose⠀meaning⠀the⠀changed⠀capability⠀has⠀altered:⠀the⠀help⠀now⠀accepted,⠀the⠀phrase⠀now⠀understood,⠀the⠀task⠀now⠀shared.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀emotional⠀consequence⠀still⠀unfolding,⠀but⠀the⠀changed⠀capability⠀should⠀be⠀felt⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀the⠀characters⠀now⠀see⠀and⠀treat⠀one⠀another.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀advancement⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀the⠀deeds⠀by⠀which⠀a⠀person's⠀growing⠀capability⠀will⠀be⠀remembered.⠀Use⠀deliberate⠀openings⠀and⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀establish⠀a⠀learner's⠀place,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀of⠀attempts,⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changed⠀execution.⠀A⠀recurring⠀designation⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀assigned⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀same⠀words⠀mark⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀could⠀once⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀she⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀judgments⠀precise.⠀The⠀community⠀may⠀remember⠀a⠀person⠀as⠀capable,⠀generous,⠀or⠀proud,⠀but⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀show⠀how⠀that⠀reputation⠀was⠀formed⠀through⠀offers,⠀omissions,⠀courtesies,⠀and⠀material⠀obligations.⠀A⠀gift⠀may⠀be⠀remembered⠀as⠀generosity⠀when⠀it⠀was⠀also⠀a⠀claim;⠀a⠀refusal⠀may⠀be⠀remembered⠀as⠀pride⠀when⠀it⠀was⠀also⠀necessity.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀account⠀differ⠀from⠀the⠀shared⠀reputation⠀where⠀the⠀perspective⠀permits.⠀Being⠀remembered⠀as⠀skilled⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀learning⠀was⠀effortless,⠀cheerful,⠀or⠀free⠀of⠀cost.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀authority⠀of⠀the⠀chronicle.⠀The⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀may⠀object⠀to⠀one⠀detail,⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀parody.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀Nordic⠀pantheon,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀dialogue⠀into⠀every⠀speaker.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀latest⠀attempt⠀concluded⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀lesson⠀still⠀ahead,⠀leaving⠀the⠀person's⠀growing⠀capability⠀open⠀to⠀further⠀deeds⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀the⠀full⠀measure⠀of⠀her⠀skill⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀advancement⠀as⠀a⠀social-realist⠀Scandinavian⠀account⠀of⠀capability⠀acquired⠀through⠀repeated⠀practical⠀attempts,⠀observed⠀in⠀ordinary⠀rooms⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work.⠀The⠀narration⠀stays⠀close⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀community's⠀material⠀conditions,⠀obligations,⠀and⠀unspoken⠀judgments.⠀Any⠀fantastic⠀or⠀progression-system⠀element⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀that⠀community's⠀actual⠀working⠀life:⠀it⠀appears⠀through⠀the⠀tools⠀people⠀use,⠀the⠀permissions⠀they⠀seek,⠀the⠀costs⠀they⠀pay,⠀and⠀the⠀competence⠀they⠀can⠀demonstrate⠀before⠀others,⠀not⠀through⠀mythic⠀framing⠀or⠀landscape⠀symbolism.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀to⠀render⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀believes⠀about⠀their⠀own⠀improvement⠀and⠀what⠀circumstance⠀reveals.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀practices⠀a⠀technique,⠀manages⠀a⠀resource,⠀or⠀claims⠀a⠀new⠀rank,⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀move⠀between⠀their⠀private⠀explanation⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀attempt:⠀who⠀must⠀be⠀asked,⠀what⠀it⠀costs,⠀who⠀notices⠀the⠀failure,⠀and⠀what⠀courtesy⠀or⠀omission⠀accompanies⠀the⠀result.⠀Advancement⠀becomes⠀legible⠀through⠀changed⠀capability,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀character's⠀confident⠀summary⠀of⠀it.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀understand⠀a⠀principle⠀long⠀before⠀they⠀can⠀execute⠀it⠀under⠀pressure,⠀and⠀a⠀strength⠀in⠀one⠀setting⠀may⠀remain⠀unreliable⠀in⠀another.\n\nMake⠀each⠀test⠀concrete⠀and⠀uneven.⠀Show⠀the⠀particular⠀task⠀that⠀now⠀succeeds⠀or⠀still⠀fails:⠀a⠀working⠀relationship⠀repaired,⠀a⠀material⠀shortage⠀navigated,⠀a⠀technique⠀performed⠀before⠀witnesses,⠀an⠀obligation⠀met⠀without⠀the⠀old⠀hesitation.⠀Let⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀through⠀conversation,⠀consequence,⠀and⠀the⠀quiet⠀recalibration⠀of⠀another⠀person's⠀opinion.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀every⠀practice⠀session⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀clean⠀increment.⠀Some⠀attempts⠀expose⠀a⠀remaining⠀difficulty;⠀some⠀improvements⠀matter⠀only⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀attempting⠀them;⠀some⠀are⠀noticed⠀by⠀the⠀community⠀for⠀reasons⠀that⠀have⠀little⠀to⠀do⠀with⠀the⠀skill⠀itself.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀social⠀world⠀active⠀around⠀the⠀developing⠀person.⠀Money,⠀family,⠀reputation,⠀and⠀daily⠀labor⠀remain⠀present,⠀and⠀a⠀small⠀exchange⠀can⠀carry⠀several⠀meanings⠀at⠀once.⠀A⠀polite⠀offer⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀test⠀of⠀competence,⠀a⠀refusal⠀may⠀protect⠀someone⠀from⠀an⠀unfinished⠀skill,⠀and⠀a⠀compliment⠀may⠀conceal⠀a⠀material⠀reservation.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀judge⠀these⠀exchanges⠀with⠀Austen's⠀measured⠀irony,⠀but⠀the⠀judgment⠀must⠀belong⠀to⠀a⠀clear⠀focal⠀perspective⠀and⠀must⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀uniformly⠀perceptive⠀or⠀uniformly⠀witty.\n\nTreat⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀emotional⠀reserve⠀as⠀practical⠀conditions⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀includes⠀them.⠀If⠀they⠀are⠀present,⠀render⠀them⠀through⠀their⠀effect⠀on⠀work,⠀travel,⠀and⠀social⠀access⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀automatic⠀regional⠀atmosphere.⠀Otherwise,⠀let⠀the⠀domestic⠀and⠀institutional⠀textures⠀of⠀the⠀actual⠀setting⠀carry⠀the⠀regional⠀method.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀world's⠀rules⠀about⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀learned⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀impossible,⠀and⠀keep⠀required⠀interiority⠀available⠀as⠀ordinary⠀private⠀prose⠀rather⠀than⠀converting⠀it⠀into⠀performed⠀speech⠀or⠀public⠀knowledge.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀developing⠀capability⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀readable⠀scenes⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀character⠀attempts⠀something⠀concrete⠀and⠀the⠀result⠀is⠀visible⠀or⠀audible.⠀Use⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀keep⠀action⠀lines⠀concise,⠀and⠀give⠀each⠀speaker⠀a⠀clear⠀cue.⠀Advancement⠀appears⠀through⠀the⠀changed⠀behavior⠀and⠀its⠀consequence:⠀the⠀task⠀completed⠀without⠀the⠀old⠀hesitation,⠀the⠀resource⠀used⠀correctly,⠀the⠀technique⠀performed⠀under⠀a⠀new⠀constraint,⠀or⠀the⠀failure⠀that⠀reveals⠀which⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀skill⠀remains⠀unreliable.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀a⠀rank⠀or⠀stat⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀line.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀through⠀dialogue,⠀blocking,⠀and⠀material⠀circumstance.⠀A⠀courteous⠀offer,⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀answering,⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀leaves⠀a⠀room⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀moment,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀omission⠀about⠀money⠀or⠀family⠀can⠀give⠀an⠀exchange⠀several⠀meanings.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀read⠀those⠀meanings⠀differently.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀treat⠀a⠀compliment⠀as⠀proof⠀of⠀acceptance⠀while⠀the⠀visible⠀arrangement⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀shows⠀the⠀compliment⠀was⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀ending⠀the⠀conversation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀irony⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀action⠀or⠀later⠀scene⠀reveals,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀voice-over⠀explaining⠀it.\n\nWhen⠀private⠀thought⠀or⠀judgment⠀is⠀required,⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀dialogue⠀and⠀action.⠀The⠀note⠀may⠀render⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience:⠀their⠀reasoning,⠀uncertainty,⠀resentment,⠀or⠀misreading⠀of⠀another⠀person.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀the⠀cast⠀access⠀to⠀that⠀thought.⠀Use⠀such⠀notes⠀when⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀contributes⠀to⠀the⠀progression⠀or⠀the⠀social⠀reading;⠀do⠀not⠀replace⠀every⠀reaction⠀with⠀an⠀interior⠀monologue.\n\nUse⠀cuts,⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀scene⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀to⠀skip⠀practice⠀time,⠀move⠀between⠀locations,⠀or⠀withhold⠀a⠀visible⠀event⠀legitimately.⠀If⠀a⠀training⠀interval⠀is⠀compressed,⠀preserve⠀the⠀changes⠀that⠀matter:⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀or⠀the⠀remaining⠀difficulty⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀stating⠀that⠀time⠀passed.⠀Let⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀through⠀another⠀character's⠀changed⠀manner,⠀a⠀practical⠀consequence,⠀or⠀a⠀spoken⠀correction.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀directions⠀or⠀make⠀every⠀scene⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀test.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀attempt,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀the⠀plain⠀fact⠀that⠀someone⠀now⠀sees⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀differently.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀developing⠀capability⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀scene⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀character⠀attempts⠀something⠀concrete⠀and⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀see⠀or⠀hear⠀the⠀result.⠀Use⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Advancement⠀appears⠀through⠀the⠀changed⠀behavior⠀and⠀its⠀consequence⠀in⠀the⠀shared⠀space:⠀the⠀task⠀completed⠀without⠀the⠀help⠀it⠀once⠀required,⠀the⠀prop⠀or⠀resource⠀handled⠀correctly,⠀the⠀technique⠀performed⠀while⠀another⠀character⠀watches,⠀or⠀the⠀particular⠀step⠀that⠀fails⠀and⠀reveals⠀the⠀remaining⠀difficulty.⠀Do⠀not⠀put⠀a⠀progression-system⠀explanation⠀in⠀the⠀stage⠀directions.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀through⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business.⠀A⠀polite⠀offer,⠀a⠀pause,⠀an⠀entrance⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment,⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀moves⠀toward⠀or⠀away⠀from⠀an⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀omission⠀about⠀money⠀or⠀family⠀can⠀give⠀an⠀exchange⠀several⠀meanings.⠀Let⠀one⠀character⠀read⠀a⠀gesture⠀as⠀acceptance⠀while⠀the⠀audience⠀sees⠀the⠀gesture⠀also⠀serves⠀a⠀practical⠀or⠀evasive⠀purpose.⠀Keep⠀the⠀irony⠀in⠀that⠀gap⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀character⠀announcing⠀the⠀subtext.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀uniformly⠀witty⠀or⠀uniformly⠀perceptive.\n\nWhen⠀private⠀thought⠀or⠀judgment⠀is⠀required,⠀preserve⠀it⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀dialogue⠀and⠀stage⠀directions.⠀It⠀may⠀render⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience:⠀their⠀reasoning,⠀uncertainty,⠀resentment,⠀or⠀misreading⠀of⠀another⠀person.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀aside⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀the⠀cast⠀access⠀to⠀that⠀thought.⠀Use⠀monologues⠀or⠀asides⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀dramatic⠀situation⠀calls⠀for⠀performed⠀speech,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀interiority.\n\nLet⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀through⠀another⠀character's⠀changed⠀manner,⠀a⠀practical⠀consequence,⠀or⠀a⠀spoken⠀correction.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀attempt,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀the⠀plain⠀fact⠀that⠀someone⠀now⠀sees⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀differently.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀film-camera⠀instructions,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀scene⠀to⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀test⠀or⠀a⠀theatrical⠀revelation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀developing⠀capability⠀as⠀associative⠀mental⠀movement⠀through⠀a⠀particular⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Braid⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀experiences⠀the⠀mind's⠀changing⠀relation⠀to⠀a⠀task⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀linear⠀report⠀of⠀practice.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀attempts⠀a⠀technique⠀or⠀manages⠀a⠀resource,⠀let⠀the⠀syntax⠀follow⠀the⠀attempt:⠀the⠀remembered⠀instruction⠀surfaces,⠀the⠀body⠀resists⠀or⠀complies,⠀a⠀past⠀failure⠀interrupts,⠀a⠀social⠀worry⠀intrudes,⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀resumes⠀or⠀breaks⠀apart.⠀Enough⠀orientation⠀must⠀remain⠀to⠀distinguish⠀the⠀actual⠀event⠀from⠀recollection,⠀anticipation,⠀or⠀fantasy.\n\nMake⠀advancement⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀changing⠀texture⠀of⠀that⠀mental⠀movement.⠀A⠀skill⠀that⠀once⠀required⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀rehearse⠀each⠀step⠀may⠀now⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀single⠀bodily⠀response,⠀interrupted⠀only⠀by⠀a⠀stray⠀thought.⠀A⠀difficulty⠀that⠀once⠀produced⠀panic⠀may⠀now⠀produce⠀a⠀narrower,⠀more⠀specific⠀hesitation.⠀Show⠀uneven⠀development:⠀the⠀mind⠀may⠀be⠀fluent⠀in⠀one⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀task⠀while⠀still⠀fumbling⠀another,⠀and⠀a⠀principle⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀recite⠀may⠀remain⠀disconnected⠀from⠀execution.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀stream⠀of⠀consciousness⠀turn⠀every⠀practice⠀session⠀into⠀a⠀clean⠀increment⠀or⠀a⠀tidy⠀insight.\n\nKeep⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀inside⠀the⠀focal⠀mind's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀notice⠀a⠀courteous⠀phrase,⠀an⠀omission,⠀a⠀sum⠀of⠀money,⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀someone's⠀manner,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀notice⠀interrupt⠀or⠀color⠀the⠀present⠀task.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀conversation,⠀test⠀its⠀own⠀explanation,⠀or⠀misread⠀another⠀person's⠀motive.⠀Preserve⠀a⠀clear⠀owner⠀for⠀that⠀judgment:⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀render⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀irony⠀or⠀self-deception,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀share⠀a⠀mind⠀or⠀grant⠀the⠀focal⠀mind⠀access⠀to⠀excluded⠀thoughts.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀all⠀scene⠀facts⠀indeterminate;⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀still⠀know⠀what⠀happened,⠀what⠀was⠀remembered,⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀only⠀imagined.\n\nLet⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀mind's⠀later⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀event:⠀a⠀remembered⠀correction,⠀a⠀changed⠀bodily⠀response,⠀or⠀the⠀slow⠀recognition⠀that⠀another⠀person's⠀offer⠀meant⠀something⠀different.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀thought,⠀a⠀recurring⠀concern,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀easier⠀or⠀still⠀difficult.⠀Ordinary⠀reasoning⠀alone⠀is⠀not⠀this⠀stylistic⠀mode;⠀the⠀movement⠀must⠀be⠀genuinely⠀associative,⠀but⠀it⠀remains⠀the⠀experience⠀of⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀developing⠀capability⠀as⠀a⠀story⠀carried⠀by⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀character⠀writes⠀in⠀short⠀bursts,⠀another⠀revises⠀before⠀sending,⠀another⠀leaves⠀a⠀message⠀unanswered⠀while⠀they⠀work.⠀Advancement⠀appears⠀through⠀the⠀changed⠀competence⠀in⠀the⠀messages⠀themselves⠀and⠀in⠀the⠀practical⠀consequences⠀they⠀set⠀in⠀motion:⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀once⠀asked⠀for⠀help⠀now⠀gives⠀a⠀clear⠀instruction,⠀the⠀technique⠀once⠀described⠀vaguely⠀is⠀now⠀summarized⠀with⠀the⠀particular⠀step⠀that⠀matters,⠀the⠀resource⠀problem⠀once⠀avoided⠀is⠀now⠀addressed⠀directly.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀transcript⠀into⠀a⠀progression⠀log⠀or⠀a⠀stat⠀report.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀through⠀digital⠀manners.⠀A⠀polite⠀formula,⠀a⠀delay,⠀an⠀edit⠀that⠀softens⠀a⠀request,⠀a⠀message⠀left⠀on⠀read,⠀an⠀omitted⠀sum⠀of⠀money,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀obligation⠀mentioned⠀only⠀in⠀passing⠀can⠀give⠀a⠀small⠀exchange⠀several⠀meanings.⠀Let⠀one⠀sender⠀read⠀a⠀reply⠀as⠀acceptance⠀while⠀the⠀transcript⠀shows⠀the⠀reply⠀was⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀ending⠀the⠀conversation.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀sent⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀not⠀sent:⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀may⠀contain⠀the⠀sender's⠀actual⠀private⠀thought,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀transmitted⠀text⠀and⠀no⠀other⠀character⠀can⠀know⠀it.⠀Distinguish⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text⠀at⠀every⠀point.\n\nWhen⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀required,⠀present⠀it⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀It⠀may⠀render⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience,⠀the⠀physical⠀task⠀they⠀are⠀attempting,⠀or⠀the⠀material⠀conditions⠀that⠀explain⠀a⠀delay.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀timestamps,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀interface⠀events⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀exchange⠀or⠀the⠀progression.⠀Let⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀through⠀another⠀sender's⠀changed⠀manner,⠀a⠀practical⠀consequence⠀reported⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀message,⠀or⠀a⠀spoken⠀correction⠀quoted⠀in⠀the⠀transcript.⠀The⠀exchange⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀request,⠀a⠀pending⠀reply,⠀or⠀the⠀plain⠀fact⠀that⠀someone⠀now⠀understands⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀differently.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀developing⠀capability⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Advancement⠀appears⠀through⠀the⠀changed⠀behavior⠀and⠀its⠀consequence⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀the⠀task⠀completed⠀without⠀the⠀help⠀it⠀once⠀required,⠀the⠀resource⠀handled⠀correctly,⠀the⠀technique⠀performed⠀while⠀another⠀character⠀watches,⠀or⠀the⠀particular⠀step⠀that⠀fails⠀and⠀reveals⠀the⠀remaining⠀difficulty.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀a⠀rank⠀or⠀stat⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀narration.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀through⠀dialogue⠀and⠀focal⠀reaction.⠀A⠀courteous⠀offer,⠀a⠀pause,⠀an⠀omission⠀about⠀money⠀or⠀family,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀shift⠀in⠀another⠀character's⠀manner⠀can⠀give⠀an⠀exchange⠀several⠀meanings.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀read⠀a⠀gesture⠀as⠀acceptance⠀while⠀the⠀scene's⠀arrangement⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀line⠀shows⠀the⠀gesture⠀also⠀served⠀a⠀practical⠀or⠀evasive⠀purpose.⠀Keep⠀the⠀irony⠀in⠀that⠀gap⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀character⠀announcing⠀the⠀subtext.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀uniformly⠀witty⠀or⠀uniformly⠀perceptive.\n\nWhen⠀private⠀thought⠀or⠀judgment⠀is⠀required,⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀as⠀ordinary⠀private⠀prose.⠀It⠀may⠀render⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience:⠀their⠀reasoning,⠀uncertainty,⠀resentment,⠀or⠀misreading⠀of⠀another⠀person.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀the⠀cast⠀access⠀to⠀that⠀thought.⠀Use⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀purposeful⠀references⠀when⠀they⠀orient⠀the⠀moment,⠀not⠀as⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicators⠀or⠀mandatory⠀labels⠀on⠀every⠀line.⠀A⠀changed⠀expression⠀may⠀attract⠀attention,⠀but⠀a⠀contradiction⠀in⠀an⠀arrangement⠀or⠀account⠀must⠀do⠀the⠀interpretive⠀work.\n\nKeep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.⠀Let⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀through⠀another⠀character's⠀changed⠀manner,⠀a⠀practical⠀consequence,⠀or⠀a⠀spoken⠀correction.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀images,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀attempt,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀the⠀plain⠀fact⠀that⠀someone⠀now⠀sees⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀differently.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalakbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀the⠀developing⠀capability⠀as⠀an⠀installment-oriented⠀through-line.⠀Each⠀reply⠀should⠀make⠀clear⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Advancement⠀appears⠀through⠀cumulative⠀developments:⠀the⠀technique⠀that⠀failed⠀in⠀an⠀earlier⠀installment⠀now⠀succeeds⠀under⠀a⠀particular⠀condition,⠀the⠀resource⠀problem⠀is⠀navigated⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀competence,⠀the⠀relationship⠀shifts⠀because⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀something⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀do⠀before.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀installment⠀into⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources,⠀and⠀it⠀should⠀remain⠀uneven:⠀a⠀strength⠀in⠀one⠀area⠀may⠀coexist⠀with⠀a⠀difficulty⠀in⠀another.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀across⠀replies.⠀Let⠀a⠀courteous⠀offer,⠀an⠀omission,⠀a⠀sum⠀of⠀money,⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀shift⠀in⠀someone's⠀manner⠀carry⠀meaning⠀that⠀may⠀change⠀as⠀later⠀installments⠀reveal⠀more.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀read⠀an⠀exchange⠀one⠀way⠀in⠀the⠀moment⠀and⠀later⠀understand⠀it⠀differently⠀without⠀the⠀earlier⠀event⠀being⠀erased.⠀Keep⠀the⠀irony⠀in⠀that⠀changing⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀narrator⠀announcing⠀the⠀subtext.⠀Preserve⠀a⠀clear⠀owner⠀for⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment:⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀render⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀misreading⠀or⠀self-deception,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀uniformly⠀perceptive⠀or⠀uniformly⠀witty.\n\nRecover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀the⠀reader⠀re-enter.⠀When⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail⠀becomes⠀newly⠀significant,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀fact⠀rather⠀than⠀retelling⠀the⠀whole⠀sequence⠀that⠀established⠀it.⠀For⠀example,⠀if⠀a⠀character⠀now⠀performs⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀once⠀required⠀help,⠀recall⠀the⠀earlier⠀failure⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀helped,⠀not⠀the⠀entire⠀training⠀history.⠀Let⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀through⠀another⠀character's⠀changed⠀manner,⠀a⠀practical⠀consequence,⠀or⠀a⠀spoken⠀correction.⠀Keep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀as⠀ordinary⠀private⠀prose⠀when⠀it⠀contributes⠀feeling⠀or⠀thought,⠀even⠀if⠀no⠀immediate⠀decision⠀changes.⠀The⠀installment⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nMake⠀advancement⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀attempt⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀costs⠀them.⠀A⠀new⠀technique,⠀resource,⠀or⠀understanding⠀should⠀enter⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀changed⠀capability:⠀the⠀character⠀reaches⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀impossible,⠀holds⠀a⠀stance⠀under⠀pressure,⠀or⠀recognizes⠀a⠀principle⠀they⠀had⠀only⠀recited⠀before.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀improvement⠀erase⠀the⠀difficulty⠀that⠀produced⠀it.⠀Show⠀the⠀unevenness⠀of⠀growth⠀by⠀keeping⠀some⠀old⠀failure⠀active⠀beside⠀the⠀new⠀competence.\n\nTreat⠀each⠀significant⠀advance⠀as⠀a⠀negotiation⠀between⠀private⠀need⠀and⠀public⠀obligation.⠀A⠀teacher,⠀ally,⠀rival,⠀or⠀family⠀member⠀may⠀have⠀a⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀progress,⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀decision⠀to⠀accept⠀help,⠀reveal⠀weakness,⠀or⠀claim⠀a⠀new⠀standing⠀should⠀strain⠀that⠀relationship.⠀Let⠀the⠀strain⠀appear⠀in⠀actual⠀conversation:⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀instruction⠀can⠀sound⠀like⠀an⠀admission,⠀an⠀offer⠀of⠀help⠀can⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀judgment,⠀and⠀a⠀demonstration⠀of⠀new⠀skill⠀can⠀reopen⠀an⠀old⠀grievance.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀before⠀they⠀have⠀fully⠀decided⠀what⠀to⠀admit,⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀may⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀need⠀behind⠀the⠀words⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀words⠀alone.\n\nUse⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀generous⠀scenic⠀movement⠀to⠀give⠀these⠀exchanges⠀room.⠀A⠀training⠀attempt,⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀test⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀emotional⠀material⠀without⠀stopping⠀the⠀plot⠀for⠀a⠀therapy⠀scene.⠀Show⠀technique,⠀restraint,⠀and⠀reputation⠀through⠀particular⠀decisions:⠀the⠀character⠀chooses⠀to⠀hold⠀back,⠀to⠀spend⠀a⠀resource,⠀to⠀protect⠀someone,⠀or⠀to⠀accept⠀a⠀consequence⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀others⠀regard⠀them.⠀The⠀cost⠀of⠀that⠀decision⠀should⠀remain⠀visible⠀afterward,⠀not⠀dissolve⠀into⠀a⠀clean⠀lesson.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀diction.⠀If⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀is⠀close,⠀render⠀the⠀character's⠀uncertainty,⠀resentment,⠀longing,⠀or⠀relief⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀idiom⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀more⠀distant,⠀let⠀the⠀strain⠀show⠀through⠀gesture,⠀timing,⠀and⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀done.⠀Comfort⠀may⠀arrive⠀partially⠀or⠀awkwardly:⠀a⠀hand⠀on⠀the⠀shoulder,⠀a⠀shared⠀silence,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀favor⠀can⠀matter⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀hurt.⠀Warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀may⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀reconciliation,⠀or⠀tragic⠀turn;⠀let⠀the⠀emotional⠀outcome⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀events.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀each⠀reply⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs.⠀Attribute⠀every⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀unmistakably,⠀and⠀keep⠀action⠀markers⠀and⠀narrative⠀person⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice⠀at⠀the⠀end;⠀the⠀continuation⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀what⠀has⠀just⠀happened,⠀whether⠀the⠀scene⠀pauses⠀during⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.\n\nAdvance⠀progression⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀attempt⠀within⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀character⠀practices⠀a⠀form,⠀tests⠀a⠀new⠀understanding,⠀uses⠀a⠀resource,⠀receives⠀feedback,⠀or⠀discovers⠀that⠀a⠀principle⠀they⠀could⠀recite⠀still⠀fails⠀in⠀execution.⠀Show⠀the⠀attempt⠀rather⠀than⠀summarizing⠀it:⠀the⠀movement,⠀the⠀mistake,⠀the⠀correction,⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀something⠀works⠀for⠀the⠀first⠀time.⠀Let⠀the⠀result⠀be⠀partial.⠀A⠀success⠀can⠀reveal⠀the⠀next⠀difficulty,⠀and⠀a⠀failure⠀can⠀produce⠀useful⠀information⠀without⠀ending⠀the⠀character's⠀effort.\n\nGive⠀the⠀scene⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀generous⠀movement.⠀Include⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀or⠀relationship⠀material⠀when⠀the⠀interval⠀calls⠀for⠀it,⠀and⠀let⠀technique,⠀restraint,⠀alliances,⠀and⠀reputation⠀matter⠀through⠀particular⠀decisions.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀choose⠀to⠀hold⠀back⠀in⠀a⠀sparring⠀match,⠀share⠀a⠀technique⠀with⠀an⠀ally,⠀refuse⠀a⠀shortcut,⠀or⠀accept⠀a⠀public⠀test⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀others⠀regard⠀them.⠀Let⠀NPCs⠀remain⠀active:⠀they⠀offer⠀help,⠀withhold⠀it,⠀ask⠀questions,⠀make⠀demands,⠀or⠀continue⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀lives⠀rather⠀than⠀waiting⠀for⠀the⠀player⠀or⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀to⠀act.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀scannable⠀without⠀flattening⠀the⠀characters.⠀Short⠀paragraphs,⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀and⠀concrete⠀physical⠀detail⠀help⠀the⠀reader⠀follow⠀the⠀scene,⠀but⠀the⠀characters⠀should⠀still⠀have⠀particular⠀voices⠀and⠀motives.⠀When⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀thinks⠀or⠀feels⠀something,⠀render⠀it⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀idiom⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀reaction⠀line.⠀End⠀the⠀reply⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀next⠀writer⠀can⠀naturally⠀continue,⠀not⠀at⠀a⠀manufactured⠀decision⠀point.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀classical⠀or⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling⠀route.⠀Organize⠀the⠀narrative⠀as⠀chapter-like⠀episodes,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀definite⠀scene⠀or⠀sequence⠀of⠀scenes,⠀a⠀clear⠀beginning⠀and⠀end,⠀and⠀a⠀title⠀or⠀opening⠀line⠀that⠀orients⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀the⠀episode's⠀concern.⠀Make⠀significant⠀developments⠀in⠀capability,⠀understanding,⠀or⠀relationships⠀legible⠀when⠀they⠀occur.⠀A⠀new⠀teacher,⠀revealed⠀limit,⠀debt,⠀response,⠀or⠀journey⠀may⠀carry⠀into⠀a⠀later⠀episode⠀if⠀earned;⠀neither⠀a⠀gain⠀nor⠀a⠀new⠀direction⠀is⠀required⠀at⠀every⠀close.\n\nMake⠀progression⠀cumulative⠀across⠀episodes.⠀A⠀technique⠀learned⠀in⠀one⠀episode⠀should⠀return⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀one⠀under⠀changed⠀conditions,⠀and⠀a⠀weakness⠀exposed⠀early⠀should⠀remain⠀a⠀live⠀difficulty⠀until⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀actually⠀worked⠀on⠀it.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀by⠀showing⠀the⠀character⠀recite⠀or⠀understand⠀something⠀in⠀one⠀episode⠀and⠀then⠀fail⠀or⠀succeed⠀in⠀applying⠀it⠀in⠀another.⠀Let⠀resources,⠀alliances,⠀and⠀reputation⠀accumulate⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀episodic⠀logic:⠀a⠀favor⠀given⠀in⠀one⠀chapter⠀can⠀be⠀called⠀due⠀later,⠀and⠀a⠀public⠀act⠀can⠀shape⠀how⠀strangers⠀receive⠀the⠀character⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀town⠀or⠀hall.\n\nUse⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀as⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀episodic⠀conflict.⠀Each⠀episode⠀can⠀place⠀a⠀personal⠀loyalty⠀against⠀a⠀duty,⠀a⠀promise,⠀or⠀a⠀reputation,⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀decision⠀should⠀have⠀consequences⠀that⠀carry⠀into⠀later⠀episodes.⠀Give⠀encounters⠀room⠀for⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀relationships.⠀A⠀meeting⠀with⠀a⠀teacher⠀or⠀rival⠀can⠀include⠀the⠀journey⠀to⠀reach⠀them,⠀the⠀history⠀they⠀share,⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀decision⠀that⠀tests⠀their⠀bond.⠀Do⠀not⠀reduce⠀action⠀to⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀blows;⠀let⠀technique⠀and⠀restraint⠀express⠀values,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀fight⠀or⠀contest⠀change⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀the⠀participants.\n\nWrite⠀with⠀the⠀clarity⠀and⠀forward⠀movement⠀of⠀episodic⠀vernacular⠀telling.⠀Keep⠀the⠀prose⠀direct⠀and⠀concrete,⠀with⠀transitions⠀that⠀move⠀the⠀reader⠀from⠀place⠀to⠀place⠀and⠀from⠀one⠀episode's⠀concern⠀to⠀the⠀next.⠀Recurrence⠀is⠀a⠀structural⠀tool:⠀a⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀place,⠀or⠀person⠀can⠀return⠀to⠀mark⠀how⠀much⠀has⠀changed.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀specific⠀historical⠀Chinese⠀setting,⠀sect⠀system,⠀or⠀cast⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀supplies⠀them;⠀the⠀episodic⠀method⠀and⠀the⠀craft⠀of⠀loyalty⠀and⠀consequence⠀are⠀what⠀travel.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀with⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Move⠀from⠀one⠀beat⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀without⠀explanatory⠀padding:⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀correction,⠀a⠀new⠀attempt,⠀a⠀result.⠀Use⠀concrete⠀physical⠀detail⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀progression:⠀the⠀ache⠀in⠀a⠀shoulder,⠀the⠀worn⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀practice⠀weapon,⠀the⠀cracked⠀skin⠀on⠀a⠀hand,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀stance⠀held⠀too⠀long.⠀Let⠀material⠀wear⠀and⠀physical⠀stakes⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀spending⠀to⠀improve.\n\nShow⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀under⠀pressure.⠀A⠀technique⠀is⠀not⠀learned⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀recited⠀or⠀performed⠀slowly⠀in⠀safety;⠀it⠀is⠀learned⠀when⠀it⠀holds⠀during⠀a⠀real⠀test.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀by⠀putting⠀the⠀character⠀in⠀a⠀situation⠀where⠀the⠀principle⠀must⠀survive⠀fatigue,⠀injury,⠀distraction,⠀or⠀fear.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀gain⠀speed⠀while⠀losing⠀precision,⠀or⠀master⠀a⠀form⠀while⠀still⠀failing⠀to⠀read⠀an⠀opponent.⠀Do⠀not⠀smooth⠀over⠀the⠀cost.\n\nPreserve⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀particular⠀decisions⠀about⠀technique,⠀restraint,⠀alliances,⠀and⠀reputation,⠀but⠀compress⠀their⠀presentation.⠀A⠀choice⠀to⠀hold⠀back,⠀spend⠀a⠀resource,⠀protect⠀someone,⠀or⠀accept⠀a⠀public⠀consequence⠀should⠀be⠀shown⠀in⠀the⠀act⠀and⠀its⠀immediate⠀result⠀rather⠀than⠀explained⠀at⠀length.⠀Give⠀encounters⠀enough⠀physical⠀room⠀for⠀travel⠀and⠀relationship⠀material⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀it,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀prose⠀hard-edged:⠀a⠀journey⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀sentence⠀about⠀the⠀road⠀and⠀the⠀weight⠀carried,⠀a⠀relationship⠀can⠀be⠀shown⠀in⠀who⠀shares⠀water⠀or⠀who⠀steps⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀whom.⠀Do⠀not⠀reduce⠀action⠀to⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀blows;⠀a⠀fight⠀or⠀contest⠀should⠀express⠀values⠀and⠀change⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀the⠀participants.\n\nVary⠀the⠀rhythm.⠀Short,⠀high-contrast⠀sentences⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀burst⠀of⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀failure.⠀Retain⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀it:⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀whether⠀to⠀use⠀a⠀dangerous⠀technique,⠀a⠀calculation⠀of⠀risk,⠀or⠀a⠀memory⠀that⠀explains⠀why⠀a⠀particular⠀restraint⠀matters.⠀Ground⠀abrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker⠀rather⠀than⠀making⠀every⠀character⠀sound⠀the⠀same.⠀The⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀story⠀into⠀survival⠀horror;⠀it⠀keeps⠀the⠀progression⠀genre's⠀learning⠀and⠀the⠀author's⠀loyalty⠀and⠀consequence⠀visible⠀through⠀pressure⠀and⠀material⠀detail.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Use⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀requires:⠀a⠀letter⠀to⠀a⠀teacher⠀reporting⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀journal⠀entry⠀recording⠀a⠀practice⠀session,⠀a⠀report⠀from⠀an⠀observer⠀who⠀saw⠀a⠀public⠀test,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀for⠀an⠀ally,⠀a⠀record⠀of⠀resources⠀spent⠀or⠀promised.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀formats⠀mechanically.\n\nLet⠀each⠀document⠀know⠀and⠀conceal⠀only⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀would⠀know⠀and⠀choose⠀to⠀record.⠀A⠀student's⠀letter⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀breakthrough⠀without⠀understanding⠀why⠀it⠀worked.⠀A⠀rival's⠀report⠀may⠀emphasize⠀a⠀weakness⠀the⠀student⠀did⠀not⠀notice.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀reply⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀principle⠀the⠀student⠀recited⠀but⠀failed⠀to⠀execute.⠀Gaps⠀between⠀documents⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀story:⠀a⠀missing⠀reply,⠀a⠀torn⠀page,⠀a⠀letter⠀never⠀sent,⠀a⠀record⠀revised⠀after⠀later⠀events.⠀Conflicting⠀accounts⠀should⠀reveal⠀different⠀positions⠀and⠀loyalties⠀rather⠀than⠀simply⠀contradicting⠀each⠀other⠀for⠀effect.\n\nMake⠀improvement⠀legible⠀across⠀entries.⠀A⠀technique⠀mentioned⠀as⠀impossible⠀in⠀one⠀document⠀can⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀and⠀a⠀partial⠀success⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀report.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀by⠀letting⠀a⠀writer⠀describe⠀understanding⠀something⠀and⠀then,⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀document,⠀describe⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀the⠀understanding⠀had⠀to⠀survive⠀pressure.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly:⠀one⠀correspondent⠀may⠀praise⠀a⠀new⠀speed⠀while⠀another⠀notes⠀the⠀character's⠀deteriorating⠀form.⠀Resources,⠀alliances,⠀and⠀reputation⠀should⠀accumulate⠀through⠀the⠀paper⠀trail:⠀a⠀letter⠀of⠀introduction,⠀a⠀record⠀of⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀public⠀notice⠀of⠀a⠀contest⠀result.\n\nUse⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀through⠀what⠀writers⠀choose⠀to⠀say⠀and⠀to⠀whom.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀write⠀one⠀version⠀to⠀a⠀teacher⠀and⠀another⠀to⠀a⠀friend,⠀or⠀omit⠀a⠀personal⠀motive⠀from⠀an⠀official⠀report.⠀The⠀choice⠀to⠀record,⠀conceal,⠀or⠀delay⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀information⠀is⠀itself⠀a⠀particular⠀decision⠀with⠀consequences.⠀Preserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀without⠀adding⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀document;⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀assemble⠀the⠀sequence⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀documents⠀reveal⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀leave⠀out.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nTreat⠀progression⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀developing⠀life⠀that⠀includes⠀rest,⠀care,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀pleasures.⠀A⠀practice⠀session⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀long⠀journey⠀can⠀pause⠀for⠀a⠀night⠀of⠀easy⠀conversation,⠀and⠀a⠀difficult⠀lesson⠀can⠀be⠀softened⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀remembers⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀takes⠀their⠀tea⠀or⠀which⠀shoulder⠀aches.⠀Spend⠀attention⠀on⠀chosen⠀kindness⠀and⠀familiar⠀preferences:⠀the⠀food⠀prepared⠀without⠀being⠀asked,⠀the⠀blanket⠀left⠀within⠀reach,⠀the⠀quiet⠀company⠀after⠀a⠀hard⠀attempt.\n\nKeep⠀improvement⠀active⠀within⠀the⠀comfort.⠀Show⠀the⠀character⠀practicing,⠀receiving⠀feedback,⠀or⠀testing⠀a⠀new⠀understanding,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀warmth⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀support⠀rather⠀than⠀replace⠀that⠀work.⠀A⠀friend⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀stance⠀gently,⠀a⠀teacher⠀may⠀praise⠀a⠀small⠀advance,⠀or⠀a⠀companion⠀may⠀simply⠀stay⠀nearby⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀tries⠀again.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it:⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀understand⠀something⠀in⠀conversation⠀and⠀still⠀need⠀the⠀practice⠀that⠀follows.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀failure⠀be⠀met⠀with⠀patience⠀rather⠀than⠀erased.\n\nUse⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀particular⠀decisions⠀about⠀technique,⠀restraint,⠀alliances,⠀and⠀reputation⠀through⠀acts⠀of⠀care.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀choose⠀to⠀share⠀a⠀resource,⠀protect⠀a⠀companion's⠀rest,⠀or⠀accept⠀help⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀they⠀are⠀seen.⠀Let⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀Comfort⠀can⠀be⠀partial:⠀a⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀cared⠀for⠀without⠀being⠀fully⠀understood,⠀and⠀warmth⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀a⠀disagreement⠀that⠀remains⠀unresolved.⠀Keep⠀personality⠀and⠀privacy⠀intact;⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable⠀or⠀remove⠀established⠀problems⠀from⠀the⠀world.\n\nGive⠀the⠀scene⠀room⠀for⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀relationships.⠀A⠀journey⠀can⠀include⠀the⠀small⠀rituals⠀of⠀camp,⠀a⠀lesson⠀can⠀include⠀the⠀history⠀behind⠀a⠀technique,⠀and⠀an⠀alliance⠀can⠀be⠀strengthened⠀by⠀a⠀favor⠀done⠀without⠀fanfare.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀fluff⠀swallow⠀the⠀genre:⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀still⠀learning,⠀still⠀facing⠀difficulty,⠀still⠀making⠀choices⠀that⠀matter.⠀The⠀warmth⠀is⠀how⠀the⠀developing⠀life⠀is⠀lived,⠀not⠀a⠀pause⠀from⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Let⠀each⠀scene⠀open⠀into⠀its⠀social⠀context⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits⠀it:⠀the⠀hall⠀where⠀a⠀test⠀will⠀be⠀held,⠀the⠀household⠀that⠀depends⠀on⠀the⠀character's⠀success,⠀the⠀history⠀between⠀a⠀teacher⠀and⠀a⠀rival,⠀the⠀public⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀rank⠀or⠀title.⠀Distinguish⠀narration⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language;⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀frame⠀a⠀decision⠀through⠀judgment,⠀history,⠀or⠀social⠀consequence,⠀but⠀the⠀characters'⠀speech⠀should⠀remain⠀their⠀own.\n\nMake⠀progression⠀legible⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀standing⠀and⠀understanding,⠀not⠀only⠀in⠀technique.⠀A⠀new⠀capability⠀should⠀alter⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀received,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀asked⠀to⠀do,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀now⠀owe.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀by⠀letting⠀the⠀narrator⠀observe⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀a⠀character's⠀confident⠀explanation⠀and⠀their⠀uncertain⠀performance,⠀or⠀between⠀a⠀teacher's⠀instruction⠀and⠀the⠀student's⠀first⠀real⠀application.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀note⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀gained⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀beyond⠀them.\n\nUse⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀as⠀the⠀novel's⠀central⠀pressure.⠀A⠀decision⠀to⠀accept⠀instruction,⠀reveal⠀a⠀limit,⠀protect⠀a⠀companion,⠀or⠀claim⠀a⠀new⠀standing⠀should⠀be⠀framed⠀through⠀both⠀its⠀private⠀cost⠀and⠀its⠀public⠀consequence.⠀Give⠀encounters⠀room⠀for⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀relationships.⠀A⠀journey⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀left⠀behind;⠀a⠀conversation⠀can⠀revisit⠀shared⠀history;⠀a⠀contest⠀can⠀test⠀not⠀only⠀skill⠀but⠀restraint,⠀loyalty,⠀and⠀reputation.⠀Do⠀not⠀reduce⠀action⠀to⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀blows;⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀show⠀what⠀a⠀technique⠀or⠀a⠀refusal⠀expresses⠀about⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀uses⠀it.\n\nUse⠀public/private⠀contrast⠀to⠀organize⠀passages⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀relevant.⠀A⠀formal⠀ceremony,⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀public⠀announcement,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀private⠀preparation⠀can⠀frame⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀differently.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀move⠀between⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀of⠀their⠀actions⠀without⠀granting⠀access⠀to⠀minds⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀cannot⠀enter.⠀The⠀formal⠀architecture⠀is⠀the⠀style;⠀do⠀not⠀supply⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting,⠀archaic⠀vocabulary,⠀or⠀uniformly⠀elaborate⠀speech⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀calls⠀for⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀advancement⠀as⠀a⠀tale⠀told⠀for⠀a⠀present⠀purpose.⠀Give⠀the⠀telling⠀its⠀audience,⠀occasion,⠀and⠀stake:⠀the⠀teller⠀recounts⠀an⠀attempt,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀correction,⠀a⠀hard-won⠀resource,⠀or⠀a⠀failure⠀survived⠀in⠀order⠀to⠀persuade,⠀warn,⠀repay,⠀delay,⠀or⠀bind⠀the⠀listeners.⠀Let⠀that⠀purpose⠀govern⠀emphasis⠀and⠀omission,⠀so⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀acts⠀on⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀standing⠀as⠀a⠀neutral⠀lecture.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀two⠀levels⠀intelligible⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀act⠀on⠀each⠀other.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀frame⠀in⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀voice⠀—⠀an⠀interruption,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀hesitation⠀over⠀a⠀name⠀—⠀and⠀mark⠀each⠀transition⠀into⠀the⠀recounted⠀past⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀always⠀knows⠀which⠀level⠀holds⠀the⠀action.⠀When⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀next⠀demands⠀the⠀recounted⠀principle⠀be⠀executed⠀—⠀under⠀fatigue,⠀imperfect⠀conditions,⠀divided⠀loyalties⠀—⠀show⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀knowing⠀the⠀story⠀and⠀performing⠀its⠀lesson:⠀a⠀technique⠀recited⠀correctly⠀and⠀fumbled⠀in⠀its⠀timing,⠀a⠀warning⠀that⠀changes⠀one⠀decision⠀and⠀not⠀another.⠀Let⠀capabilities⠀advance⠀unevenly,⠀so⠀a⠀gained⠀strength⠀leaves⠀a⠀related⠀weakness⠀for⠀a⠀later⠀telling⠀to⠀face.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀and⠀delayed⠀revelation.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀named⠀technique⠀from⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀can⠀reappear⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀with⠀altered⠀meaning;⠀a⠀formula⠀the⠀teller⠀repeats⠀can⠀accrue⠀weight⠀each⠀time⠀it⠀is⠀tested.⠀Part⠀of⠀an⠀account⠀may⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀or⠀withheld,⠀its⠀meaning⠀arriving⠀when⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀finally⠀requires⠀it⠀—⠀withheld⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀the⠀teller⠀has,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀trick⠀played⠀on⠀the⠀reader.\n\nLet⠀loyalty⠀and⠀reputation⠀shape⠀the⠀telling.⠀A⠀generous⠀account⠀of⠀a⠀rival's⠀skill⠀can⠀be⠀an⠀honest⠀tribute⠀that⠀also⠀serves⠀a⠀present⠀alliance;⠀an⠀omission⠀may⠀protect⠀a⠀companion⠀or⠀guard⠀a⠀shame⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀not⠀faced.⠀Listeners⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀emphasis,⠀ask⠀a⠀concrete⠀question⠀about⠀timing⠀or⠀sequence,⠀or⠀answer⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀obligations.⠀The⠀tale⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀false;⠀its⠀interest⠀lies⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀telling⠀does.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀spacious:⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀relationship⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life,⠀and⠀a⠀breakthrough⠀matters⠀through⠀what⠀it⠀lets⠀a⠀person⠀attempt,⠀whom⠀it⠀lets⠀them⠀protect,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀in⠀obligation.⠀The⠀frame⠀is⠀a⠀craft⠀device,⠀not⠀a⠀setting⠀—⠀it⠀brings⠀no⠀palace,⠀djinn,⠀or⠀bargain⠀with⠀it⠀—⠀and⠀no⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀owed⠀between⠀nested⠀accounts.⠀End⠀a⠀response⠀wherever⠀the⠀current⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀composition⠀pauses.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀advancement⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀do⠀within⠀a⠀specific⠀community⠀—⠀a⠀workshop,⠀a⠀household,⠀a⠀school,⠀a⠀company,⠀or⠀whatever⠀institution⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀—⠀whose⠀expectations⠀shape⠀every⠀stage⠀of⠀the⠀learner's⠀path.⠀Ground⠀practice⠀in⠀its⠀material⠀conditions:⠀who⠀gives⠀instruction⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀them,⠀what⠀tools⠀and⠀time⠀exist,⠀what⠀ordinary⠀work⠀must⠀be⠀done⠀alongside⠀training,⠀and⠀what⠀happens⠀to⠀standing⠀and⠀livelihood⠀when⠀those⠀conditions⠀fail.⠀Make⠀progress⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀institution's⠀own⠀signs⠀—⠀a⠀task⠀entrusted,⠀a⠀bench⠀changed,⠀a⠀correction⠀that⠀stops⠀coming⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀numerical⠀measures⠀invented⠀for⠀display.\n\nLet⠀private⠀ambition⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀pull⠀against⠀each⠀other⠀in⠀concrete⠀decisions.⠀A⠀learner⠀wants⠀a⠀technique⠀for⠀personal⠀reasons⠀while⠀owing⠀labor,⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀protection⠀to⠀others,⠀and⠀each⠀new⠀capability⠀rewrites⠀those⠀debts:⠀it⠀can⠀make⠀someone⠀useful⠀to⠀a⠀patron,⠀dangerous⠀to⠀a⠀rival,⠀or⠀responsible⠀for⠀work⠀they⠀once⠀escaped.⠀Show⠀reputation⠀and⠀alliance⠀shifting⠀through⠀particular⠀acts⠀and⠀their⠀delayed⠀consequences⠀rather⠀than⠀announced⠀morals.⠀Connect⠀a⠀day's⠀work⠀to⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀standing⠀across⠀longer⠀developmental⠀paragraphs⠀while⠀staying⠀particular⠀about⠀rooms,⠀tools,⠀meals,⠀and⠀conversations.\n\nDistinguish⠀understanding⠀from⠀execution⠀through⠀ordinary⠀difficulty.⠀A⠀principle⠀explained⠀in⠀a⠀lesson⠀becomes⠀real⠀only⠀when⠀attempted⠀under⠀fatigue,⠀distraction,⠀or⠀emotional⠀strain:⠀the⠀attempt⠀fails⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀way,⠀a⠀teacher⠀or⠀companion⠀corrects⠀it,⠀the⠀learner⠀adjusts,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀test⠀shows⠀what⠀changed⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀stubborn.⠀Where⠀the⠀narrator⠀permits,⠀give⠀the⠀learner's⠀silent⠀accounting⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀asked⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀delivered⠀alongside⠀what⠀the⠀institution⠀can⠀see.⠀Strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly⠀—⠀speed⠀bought⠀with⠀precision,⠀a⠀form⠀mastered⠀while⠀a⠀real⠀confrontation⠀still⠀freezes⠀the⠀body.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀syntax⠀fit⠀this⠀social⠀world:⠀sentences⠀that⠀expand⠀to⠀carry⠀a⠀working⠀day,⠀an⠀apprenticeship's⠀slow⠀turn,⠀or⠀a⠀household's⠀recalibration⠀of⠀someone's⠀prospects,⠀and⠀compress⠀when⠀a⠀test⠀goes⠀wrong.⠀The⠀working⠀tradition⠀is⠀social⠀and⠀developmental⠀realism,⠀not⠀a⠀national⠀temperament⠀—⠀no⠀bureaucratic⠀severity,⠀no⠀translated⠀word⠀order,⠀no⠀coldness⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀sake.⠀The⠀effect⠀comes⠀from⠀close⠀attention⠀to⠀how⠀people⠀live⠀inside⠀institutions⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀choose.\n\nDo⠀not⠀schedule⠀rewards⠀or⠀punishments.⠀Some⠀progress⠀is⠀quiet,⠀some⠀effort⠀is⠀wasted,⠀some⠀obligations⠀survive⠀a⠀breakthrough.⠀End⠀a⠀response⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀learner's⠀work,⠀speech,⠀thought,⠀or⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀at⠀a⠀completed⠀examination.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nWrite⠀improvement⠀as⠀a⠀lived⠀negotiation⠀between⠀capability⠀and⠀obligation⠀in⠀a⠀decaying⠀city⠀whose⠀old⠀powers⠀still⠀shape⠀present⠀access.⠀Let⠀advancement⠀come⠀through⠀attempts,⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀new⠀understanding,⠀resources,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability,⠀and⠀keep⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀distinct⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀under⠀strain.⠀Strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly:⠀a⠀form⠀that⠀works⠀in⠀a⠀borrowed⠀training⠀room⠀may⠀fail⠀when⠀exhausted,⠀a⠀new⠀resource⠀may⠀solve⠀one⠀problem⠀while⠀creating⠀a⠀debt,⠀and⠀recovery⠀may⠀restore⠀function⠀without⠀returning⠀the⠀same⠀confidence.⠀Ordinary⠀work,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀relationships⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life,⠀not⠀pauses⠀from⠀it.\n\nUse⠀expansive⠀clarity⠀to⠀make⠀technique,⠀restraint,⠀alliances,⠀and⠀reputation⠀matter⠀through⠀particular⠀decisions.⠀Technique⠀is⠀also⠀a⠀social⠀fact:⠀who⠀taught⠀it,⠀who⠀recognizes⠀it,⠀who⠀is⠀owed⠀for⠀it,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀permits⠀in⠀public.⠀Give⠀encounters⠀room⠀for⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀relationship—two⠀people⠀may⠀test⠀each⠀other⠀through⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀careful⠀demonstration,⠀or⠀a⠀long⠀walk⠀before⠀a⠀fight,⠀and⠀a⠀fight⠀itself⠀should⠀express⠀values⠀rather⠀than⠀only⠀settle⠀strength.⠀Keep⠀competing⠀loyalties⠀live:⠀a⠀patron⠀may⠀be⠀generous⠀and⠀compromised,⠀an⠀opponent⠀honorable⠀and⠀wrong,⠀a⠀shared⠀history⠀binding⠀enemies⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀allies.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀advances,⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀advance⠀alters⠀what⠀they⠀owe,⠀what⠀others⠀expect,⠀and⠀which⠀old⠀compromise⠀becomes⠀harder⠀to⠀hide.⠀Progress⠀often⠀means⠀learning⠀when⠀not⠀to⠀use⠀a⠀new⠀ability,⠀or⠀discovering⠀that⠀a⠀hard-won⠀technique⠀carries⠀a⠀cost⠀no⠀one⠀anticipated.⠀Whatever⠀institutions,⠀trades,⠀or⠀techniques⠀the⠀story's⠀world⠀supplies,⠀render⠀their⠀lineages,⠀obligations,⠀and⠀reputations⠀through⠀concrete⠀choices⠀rather⠀than⠀importing⠀a⠀ready-made⠀martial⠀sect⠀or⠀historical⠀setting.\n\nLet⠀Gothic-Punk⠀atmosphere⠀change⠀how⠀each⠀step⠀is⠀experienced.⠀Old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life⠀collide:⠀access⠀to⠀training,⠀tools,⠀or⠀safe⠀passage⠀may⠀depend⠀on⠀inherited⠀arrangements—a⠀family⠀contract,⠀a⠀guild's⠀decaying⠀charter,⠀a⠀landlord's⠀favor,⠀a⠀buried⠀office—still⠀enforced⠀by⠀modern⠀systems.⠀Urban⠀material⠀detail⠀should⠀be⠀concrete:⠀bad⠀wiring,⠀rented⠀rooms,⠀transit⠀schedules,⠀borrowed⠀equipment,⠀rain⠀on⠀hot⠀pavement,⠀the⠀paperwork⠀that⠀keeps⠀a⠀privilege⠀alive.⠀Morally⠀complicated⠀intimacy⠀makes⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀social⠀masks⠀matter.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀perform⠀confidence⠀in⠀public⠀and⠀reveal⠀uncertainty⠀only⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀and⠀a⠀trusted⠀companion⠀may⠀also⠀be⠀implicated⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀old⠀power⠀the⠀protagonist⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀escape.⠀Personal⠀horror⠀belongs⠀to⠀what⠀progress⠀reveals⠀or⠀demands—not⠀as⠀a⠀guaranteed⠀betrayal,⠀but⠀as⠀the⠀felt⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀capability⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀city.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀supernatural⠀rules⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀contains.\n\nUse⠀the⠀progression⠀system,⠀if⠀one⠀exists,⠀for⠀what⠀it⠀can⠀actually⠀measure:⠀ranks,⠀licenses,⠀access⠀levels,⠀documented⠀training,⠀or⠀acknowledged⠀mastery.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀numbers⠀merely⠀to⠀display⠀progress.⠀Test⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀A⠀new⠀rank⠀may⠀grant⠀entrance⠀to⠀a⠀building⠀but⠀not⠀the⠀trust⠀of⠀the⠀people⠀inside;⠀a⠀mastered⠀form⠀may⠀work⠀against⠀one⠀opponent⠀and⠀fail⠀against⠀another⠀because⠀of⠀terrain,⠀injury,⠀or⠀different⠀training.⠀Anchor⠀a⠀breakthrough⠀in⠀prior⠀attempts⠀and⠀specific⠀feedback.⠀If⠀the⠀advance⠀is⠀incomplete,⠀show⠀the⠀next⠀concrete⠀obstacle⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀a⠀plateau.⠀Keep⠀outcomes⠀contingent:⠀the⠀story⠀may⠀grant⠀a⠀hard-won⠀success,⠀a⠀partial⠀gain,⠀a⠀setback,⠀or⠀a⠀discovery⠀that⠀the⠀old⠀measure⠀of⠀progress⠀was⠀wrong.\n\nWrite⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀as⠀actual⠀private⠀experience—reasoning,⠀sensation,⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀desire—rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀letter,⠀diary,⠀monologue,⠀or⠀voice-over.⠀A⠀character's⠀spoken⠀and⠀private⠀content⠀may⠀differ⠀for⠀a⠀specific⠀reason:⠀embarrassment,⠀utility,⠀concealment,⠀habit,⠀care,⠀or⠀uncertainty.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀pause⠀a⠀loyalty⠀test⠀or⠀every⠀intimacy⠀a⠀trap;⠀trusted⠀company⠀can⠀be⠀genuinely⠀trusted.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀attempt;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀complete⠀a⠀training⠀arc,⠀resolve⠀a⠀loyalty⠀conflict,⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀new⠀power⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀boundary.⠀Let⠀the⠀city⠀and⠀its⠀inherited⠀powers⠀shape⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀learned,⠀but⠀make⠀each⠀new⠀capability⠀change⠀the⠀terms⠀of⠀the⠀relationships⠀around⠀the⠀protagonist.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nCarry⠀advancement⠀through⠀remembered⠀episodes⠀recited⠀on⠀a⠀present⠀occasion.⠀Frame⠀each⠀telling⠀with⠀the⠀formal⠀turns⠀of⠀a⠀living⠀oral⠀tradition⠀—⠀a⠀repeated⠀opening⠀formula,⠀a⠀formal⠀naming⠀of⠀the⠀line⠀of⠀teachers,⠀a⠀closing⠀that⠀hands⠀the⠀episode⠀to⠀the⠀listener⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀recitation⠀itself⠀marks⠀where⠀instruction⠀begins⠀and⠀ends.⠀Let⠀the⠀occasion⠀give⠀the⠀telling⠀its⠀purpose:⠀a⠀gathering,⠀a⠀departure,⠀a⠀debt⠀falling⠀due,⠀a⠀dispute⠀to⠀be⠀settled,⠀a⠀younger⠀person⠀standing⠀where⠀an⠀older⠀one⠀once⠀stood.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀episodes⠀as⠀an⠀inherited⠀chain⠀rather⠀than⠀isolated⠀anecdotes.⠀Each⠀remembered⠀link⠀carries⠀one⠀stage⠀of⠀capability⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀could⠀not⠀do,⠀what⠀was⠀practiced,⠀what⠀went⠀wrong,⠀what⠀became⠀possible⠀afterward⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀chain⠀may⠀name⠀teachers,⠀places,⠀and⠀techniques⠀as⠀things⠀recited⠀and⠀counted,⠀giving⠀the⠀tradition⠀its⠀breadth.⠀Link⠀the⠀episodes⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀transmit:⠀a⠀victory⠀in⠀one⠀leaves⠀a⠀related⠀weakness⠀a⠀later⠀episode⠀must⠀address;⠀a⠀technique⠀learned⠀in⠀one⠀is⠀tested⠀under⠀new⠀conditions⠀in⠀another;⠀a⠀name⠀earned⠀in⠀the⠀past⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀present⠀occasion⠀receives⠀the⠀teller.\n\nMake⠀the⠀frame⠀active.⠀The⠀teller⠀selects⠀and⠀emphasizes⠀according⠀to⠀present⠀obligations⠀—⠀warning⠀a⠀student,⠀justifying⠀an⠀old⠀decision,⠀preparing⠀someone⠀for⠀a⠀task⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀listeners⠀interrupt,⠀question,⠀or⠀answer⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀loyalties.⠀An⠀embedded⠀episode⠀can⠀change⠀the⠀outer⠀scene:⠀firm⠀a⠀listener's⠀resolve,⠀expose⠀a⠀misunderstanding,⠀create⠀an⠀obligation.⠀Place⠀each⠀remembered⠀test⠀in⠀fatigue,⠀fear,⠀or⠀divided⠀loyalty⠀so⠀that⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀stays⠀distinct⠀from⠀executing⠀it,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀listener's⠀own⠀practice⠀begin⠀to⠀answer⠀what⠀the⠀episode⠀taught.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀across⠀the⠀chain:⠀a⠀named⠀technique,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀place,⠀or⠀an⠀object⠀returns⠀from⠀the⠀remembered⠀past⠀into⠀the⠀present⠀occasion⠀and⠀accrues⠀meaning⠀with⠀each⠀return.⠀Keep⠀the⠀levels⠀separate⠀through⠀clear⠀transitions⠀between⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀recounted⠀action.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀be⠀generous,⠀partial,⠀or⠀shaped⠀by⠀love⠀and⠀shame⠀without⠀being⠀false;⠀its⠀interest⠀lies⠀in⠀what⠀it⠀transmits⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀leaves⠀for⠀the⠀listener⠀to⠀test.\n\nGive⠀the⠀story⠀its⠀spaciousness:⠀journeys⠀between⠀episodes⠀matter⠀for⠀whom⠀the⠀learner⠀meets,⠀what⠀they⠀owe,⠀and⠀how⠀their⠀reputation⠀changes.⠀Keep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀exactly⠀as⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀them;⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀telling⠀or⠀the⠀outer⠀occasion⠀pauses.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nStage⠀advancement⠀as⠀performance⠀before⠀aware⠀onlookers.⠀Present⠀learning⠀through⠀audience-facing⠀scenes⠀—⠀a⠀lesson⠀delivered⠀with⠀comic⠀exaggeration,⠀a⠀contest⠀mounted⠀before⠀a⠀crowd,⠀a⠀recognition⠀scene⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀is⠀displayed,⠀a⠀challenge⠀that⠀puts⠀reputation⠀and⠀technique⠀on⠀the⠀same⠀line⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀carry⠀theatrical⠀energy:⠀entrances⠀and⠀exits⠀noticed,⠀voices⠀mimicked⠀in⠀the⠀telling,⠀a⠀pattern⠀set⠀up⠀and⠀overturned.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀character,⠀timing,⠀and⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀self-presentation⠀and⠀actual⠀ability,⠀not⠀from⠀slapstick⠀imposed⠀on⠀every⠀exchange.\n\nMake⠀each⠀test⠀legible⠀as⠀staging.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀attempts,⠀what⠀the⠀teacher⠀or⠀opponent⠀does⠀in⠀answer,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀outcome⠀reveals⠀about⠀changed⠀capability:⠀a⠀technique⠀performed⠀brilliantly⠀in⠀practice⠀and⠀fumbled⠀before⠀an⠀audience;⠀a⠀flashy⠀move⠀that⠀works⠀only⠀under⠀conditions⠀its⠀owner⠀cannot⠀control.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀what⠀was⠀previously⠀impossible⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀Use⠀sentence⠀rhythm⠀for⠀comic⠀timing⠀—⠀the⠀run-up,⠀the⠀pause,⠀the⠀overturn⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀serious⠀beat⠀land⠀suddenly⠀inside⠀a⠀lively⠀exchange.\n\nLet⠀reputation⠀and⠀obligation⠀drive⠀the⠀staging.⠀A⠀contest⠀may⠀be⠀fought⠀for⠀a⠀patron,⠀a⠀companion,⠀a⠀promise,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀claim⠀the⠀learner⠀must⠀then⠀honor;⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀pull⠀against⠀each⠀other⠀in⠀particular⠀decisions⠀—⠀holding⠀back⠀to⠀shield⠀a⠀friend,⠀revealing⠀a⠀technique⠀to⠀save⠀a⠀stranger,⠀accepting⠀a⠀challenge⠀that⠀will⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀household⠀treats⠀them.⠀Around⠀the⠀performed⠀action,⠀keep⠀room⠀for⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀relationship.\n\nLet⠀personal⠀language⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀teller.⠀Direct⠀feeling,⠀exuberance,⠀boasting,⠀plain⠀argument,⠀and⠀omission⠀are⠀all⠀available⠀where⠀they⠀fit⠀that⠀voice;⠀no⠀universal⠀quietness⠀applies⠀and⠀no⠀inventory⠀of⠀scenery⠀is⠀required⠀—⠀seasonal⠀attention,⠀if⠀used,⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀meaning⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀it.⠀A⠀boast⠀may⠀be⠀sincere;⠀a⠀defeat⠀may⠀be⠀comic⠀without⠀being⠀meaningless.\n\nDo⠀not⠀demand⠀victory,⠀humiliation,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀lesson⠀in⠀every⠀scene.⠀A⠀performance⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted,⠀a⠀recognition⠀partial,⠀a⠀new⠀understanding⠀left⠀untested.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀action,⠀speech,⠀thought,⠀or⠀unfinished⠀setup⠀pauses.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nPresent⠀advancement⠀through⠀accounts⠀someone⠀witnessed,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀reports.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀move⠀between⠀attributed⠀tellers⠀—⠀a⠀companion⠀describing⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀teacher⠀testifying⠀to⠀a⠀student's⠀progress,⠀a⠀rival⠀recounting⠀a⠀contest,⠀a⠀community⠀recording⠀what⠀changed⠀after⠀someone⠀returned⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀account⠀carry⠀its⠀teller's⠀partial⠀knowledge⠀and⠀present⠀purpose.⠀Keep⠀testimony's⠀basic⠀distinction⠀in⠀play:⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀saw⠀and⠀did⠀personally,⠀versus⠀what⠀they⠀heard,⠀inferred,⠀or⠀repeat⠀from⠀others,⠀marked⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀phrased⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀clinical⠀labels.\n\nHold⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀capability.⠀Show⠀what⠀a⠀teller⠀claims,⠀what⠀that⠀teller⠀could⠀actually⠀have⠀observed,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀later⠀confirms,⠀complicates,⠀or⠀leaves⠀untested.⠀A⠀reported⠀breakthrough⠀becomes⠀real⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀learner⠀attempts⠀the⠀technique⠀under⠀conditions⠀no⠀teller⠀controlled.⠀Place⠀the⠀attempt⠀in⠀fatigue,⠀fear,⠀or⠀divided⠀loyalty⠀so⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀stays⠀distinct⠀from⠀executing⠀it,⠀and⠀let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly⠀across⠀accounts⠀—⠀one⠀witness's⠀speed,⠀another's⠀precision,⠀neither⠀the⠀whole⠀person.\n\nLet⠀obligation⠀shape⠀the⠀testimony.⠀A⠀teller⠀may⠀speak⠀to⠀honor⠀a⠀companion,⠀protect⠀a⠀patron,⠀settle⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀justify⠀a⠀decision⠀that⠀still⠀troubles⠀them;⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀pull⠀against⠀each⠀other⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀recorded⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀left⠀out.⠀An⠀account⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀false⠀to⠀be⠀partial.⠀Give⠀the⠀chronicle⠀lived⠀thickness⠀—⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀relationship⠀—⠀so⠀it⠀reads⠀as⠀remembered⠀history⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀list⠀of⠀deeds,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀the⠀story⠀actually⠀supplies.⠀Chronicle⠀and⠀testimony⠀add⠀no⠀marvelous⠀events⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them;⠀the⠀accounts⠀record⠀what⠀that⠀world⠀permits.\n\nDo⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀account⠀to⠀be⠀confirmed,⠀corrected,⠀or⠀exposed⠀within⠀a⠀response.⠀A⠀testimony⠀may⠀stand⠀as⠀partial⠀evidence,⠀a⠀listener⠀may⠀accept⠀it⠀with⠀reservations,⠀and⠀the⠀learner's⠀next⠀test⠀may⠀still⠀lie⠀ahead.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀telling⠀or⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀pauses.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀reader⠀oriented⠀in⠀space:⠀when⠀a⠀scene⠀changes⠀location,⠀make⠀the⠀move⠀explicit⠀—⠀where⠀the⠀learner⠀is,⠀who⠀else⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing.⠀Break⠀paragraphs⠀readably⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀a⠀practice⠀session,⠀a⠀lesson,⠀or⠀a⠀confrontation⠀stays⠀easy⠀to⠀follow⠀without⠀losing⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀happens.\n\nMake⠀progression⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀beats.⠀Show⠀the⠀attempt⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀tries,⠀how⠀the⠀body⠀or⠀tool⠀answers,⠀what⠀goes⠀wrong.⠀Show⠀the⠀feedback⠀—⠀a⠀teacher's⠀correction,⠀a⠀companion's⠀observation,⠀the⠀learner's⠀own⠀recognition⠀of⠀the⠀miss.⠀Show⠀the⠀adjusted⠀attempt⠀and⠀what⠀changes.⠀Let⠀the⠀learner⠀understand⠀a⠀technique⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀its⠀timing,⠀spacing,⠀or⠀application⠀under⠀pressure,⠀and⠀let⠀one⠀skill⠀improve⠀while⠀another⠀stays⠀stubborn.\n\nPresent⠀unfamiliar⠀names,⠀techniques,⠀and⠀mechanics⠀clearly⠀when⠀they⠀appear:⠀pair⠀a⠀technique's⠀name⠀with⠀its⠀visible⠀effect,⠀and⠀show⠀a⠀rank⠀or⠀title⠀through⠀how⠀others⠀respond⠀to⠀it.⠀Give⠀the⠀reader⠀what⠀is⠀needed⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀action⠀without⠀pausing⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀manual.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀numerical⠀mechanics⠀for⠀display;⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀progress⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀defeats⠀them.\n\nUse⠀reaction⠀beats⠀for⠀the⠀loyalties⠀underneath⠀the⠀action.⠀After⠀an⠀exchange,⠀the⠀learner's⠀private⠀response⠀can⠀reveal⠀what⠀the⠀event⠀means⠀—⠀loyalty⠀to⠀a⠀teacher,⠀worry⠀for⠀a⠀companion,⠀shame⠀at⠀a⠀failure,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀reputation⠀—⠀and⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner,⠀never⠀a⠀compulsory⠀quip.⠀Encounters⠀keep⠀their⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀relationship⠀around⠀the⠀action,⠀so⠀a⠀fight⠀or⠀lesson⠀is⠀not⠀reduced⠀to⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀blows.\n\nFirst⠀person,⠀comedy,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀and⠀a⠀closing⠀cliffhanger⠀are⠀not⠀requirements⠀here;⠀use⠀them⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀story's⠀actual⠀narrator⠀and⠀situation⠀call⠀for⠀them.⠀A⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀during⠀continuing⠀action,⠀speech,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup⠀without⠀owing⠀a⠀reversal⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀test.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀advancement⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀body⠀meets⠀the⠀world,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀make⠀that⠀change⠀felt⠀before⠀anyone⠀names⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀technique⠀is⠀first⠀executed,⠀slow⠀into⠀the⠀moment:⠀weight⠀moving⠀through⠀a⠀stance,⠀breath⠀finding⠀a⠀new⠀timing,⠀a⠀hand⠀traveling⠀a⠀line⠀the⠀learner⠀could⠀not⠀previously⠀hold.⠀Shape⠀the⠀sentences⠀so⠀their⠀rhythm⠀enacts⠀the⠀act⠀—⠀a⠀long⠀clause⠀that⠀gathers⠀and⠀releases⠀as⠀the⠀strike⠀gathers,⠀a⠀shorter⠀one⠀where⠀the⠀learner⠀falters.⠀Let⠀a⠀comparison⠀unfold⠀across⠀the⠀paragraph⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀perceives⠀or⠀understands,⠀and⠀keep⠀its⠀materials⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀associations⠀—⠀water⠀the⠀learner⠀has⠀trained⠀beside,⠀a⠀rope⠀worn⠀smooth⠀by⠀other⠀hands,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀weathered⠀grip⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀borrowed⠀decorative⠀register.⠀Knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀should⠀read⠀differently⠀from⠀performing⠀it;⠀render⠀the⠀gap⠀as⠀sensation⠀and⠀attention,⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀now⠀hear⠀in⠀a⠀movement⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀only⠀noise,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀announced⠀rank.\n\nGive⠀the⠀whole⠀arc⠀of⠀practice⠀the⠀same⠀shaped⠀attention⠀as⠀the⠀breakthrough.⠀Failed⠀attempts,⠀a⠀correction⠀repeated⠀until⠀it⠀lands,⠀fatigue,⠀a⠀resource⠀spent:⠀these⠀deserve⠀rhythm⠀too.⠀A⠀recurring⠀sound⠀or⠀image⠀can⠀mark⠀developing⠀skill⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀application⠀—⠀the⠀river⠀that⠀once⠀set⠀the⠀learner's⠀pace⠀now⠀too⠀slow⠀for⠀it⠀—⠀and⠀it⠀can⠀just⠀as⠀well⠀record⠀a⠀misstep⠀or⠀exhaustion,⠀because⠀progression⠀includes⠀what⠀stays⠀difficult.⠀Between⠀figurative⠀passages,⠀let⠀plain⠀statements⠀carry⠀the⠀facts.⠀Characters⠀speak⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀voices;⠀the⠀figurative⠀register⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narration,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀mouth⠀on⠀the⠀road.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀scenic⠀movement⠀generous⠀inside⠀this⠀register.⠀Travel,⠀explanation,⠀meals,⠀argument,⠀and⠀reunion⠀occupy⠀real⠀narrative⠀space,⠀and⠀a⠀contest's⠀stakes⠀travel⠀through⠀its⠀rhythm:⠀a⠀loyal⠀refusal,⠀a⠀protected⠀person,⠀a⠀private⠀attachment⠀made⠀visible⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀technique⠀restrains⠀rather⠀than⠀by⠀what⠀it⠀destroys.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀always⠀leave⠀the⠀passage⠀knowing⠀who⠀acted,⠀why⠀it⠀mattered,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀cost.⠀Inward⠀experience⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀and⠀stays⠀unknown⠀to⠀the⠀others⠀unless⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀narration⠀discloses⠀it,⠀and⠀advancement⠀can⠀be⠀tested⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀for⠀someone⠀else⠀or⠀under⠀a⠀particular⠀obligation.⠀Relationships,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀keep⠀their⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀developing⠀life,⠀and⠀their⠀prose⠀may⠀be⠀as⠀rhythmically⠀shaped⠀as⠀any⠀duel.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀each⠀advancement⠀arrive⠀with⠀the⠀awareness⠀that⠀something⠀else⠀has⠀already⠀changed.⠀Test⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀where⠀an⠀earlier⠀failure⠀happened,⠀or⠀beside⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀knew⠀the⠀learner⠀at⠀a⠀worse⠀stage:⠀the⠀task⠀that⠀took⠀all⠀night⠀now⠀takes⠀an⠀hour,⠀the⠀daily⠀correction⠀no⠀longer⠀comes,⠀the⠀familiar⠀route⠀is⠀walked⠀without⠀the⠀old⠀hesitation.⠀Measure⠀progress⠀through⠀small⠀irreversible⠀changes⠀and⠀remembered⠀occasions,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀present⠀accomplishment⠀and⠀the⠀unavailable⠀past⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀scene⠀instead⠀of⠀separating⠀into⠀event⠀and⠀lesson.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀stays⠀pleasurable⠀—⠀a⠀good⠀meal⠀on⠀the⠀road,⠀a⠀technique⠀finally⠀comfortable,⠀a⠀duty⠀fulfilled⠀and⠀steady⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀reflective⠀weight⠀lands⠀on⠀particular⠀gains⠀and⠀particular⠀absences⠀rather⠀than⠀on⠀a⠀mood⠀spread⠀over⠀everything.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀causal⠀account⠀of⠀improvement⠀intact.⠀The⠀reader⠀still⠀sees⠀what⠀was⠀practiced,⠀which⠀feedback⠀or⠀resource⠀changed⠀the⠀execution,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀out⠀of⠀reach;⠀reflection⠀gives⠀those⠀events⠀their⠀weight⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀them.⠀Feel⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀executing⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀specific⠀regret⠀or⠀relief⠀—⠀the⠀understanding⠀that⠀arrived⠀a⠀season⠀too⠀late⠀to⠀help⠀someone,⠀the⠀skill⠀that⠀finally⠀matches⠀an⠀old⠀intention.⠀A⠀remembered⠀failure⠀may⠀surface⠀during⠀a⠀current⠀success⠀to⠀make⠀its⠀cost⠀and⠀incompleteness⠀legible⠀without⠀cancelling⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀gained.\n\nGive⠀the⠀melancholy⠀its⠀social⠀shape⠀through⠀the⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation:⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀could⠀not⠀be⠀protected,⠀a⠀loyalty⠀that⠀required⠀leaving,⠀a⠀duty⠀that⠀made⠀a⠀private⠀wish⠀impossible.⠀Let⠀that⠀pressure⠀appear⠀in⠀particular⠀decisions⠀—⠀a⠀restraint⠀in⠀a⠀contest,⠀an⠀alliance⠀kept⠀or⠀declined⠀—⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀convert⠀every⠀attachment⠀into⠀loss⠀or⠀every⠀obligation⠀into⠀regret.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀reflect⠀directly⠀or⠀let⠀a⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀association;⠀either⠀way,⠀remembered⠀occasions⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀access⠀and⠀are⠀not⠀known⠀to⠀others⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀unless⠀spoken.⠀Advancement⠀remains⠀testable⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀for⠀another⠀person⠀or⠀under⠀a⠀standing⠀obligation,⠀and⠀the⠀account⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀task⠀still⠀in⠀progress,⠀its⠀full⠀meaning⠀not⠀yet⠀settled.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀the⠀advancement⠀through⠀a⠀situated⠀teller:⠀a⠀particular⠀voice⠀addressing⠀a⠀particular⠀audience⠀—⠀apprentices⠀after⠀a⠀lesson,⠀travelers⠀sharing⠀a⠀road,⠀a⠀household⠀at⠀evening⠀—⠀who⠀has⠀chosen,⠀received,⠀or⠀lived⠀part⠀of⠀this⠀account⠀and⠀now⠀shapes⠀it⠀for⠀these⠀listeners.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀teller's⠀framing⠀of⠀who⠀the⠀learner⠀was⠀and⠀what⠀stood⠀before⠀them,⠀then⠀deliver⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀the⠀tale's⠀engine,⠀in⠀episodes⠀ordered⠀for⠀this⠀occasion.⠀Let⠀the⠀frame⠀return⠀as⠀a⠀living⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀telling:⠀a⠀listener's⠀question⠀pulls⠀an⠀explanation⠀forward,⠀a⠀rival⠀version⠀of⠀an⠀incident⠀is⠀mentioned⠀and⠀argued⠀past,⠀a⠀detail⠀is⠀withheld⠀this⠀evening⠀because⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀holding⠀the⠀room's⠀attention,⠀and⠀the⠀withheld⠀cause⠀surfaces⠀later⠀inside⠀the⠀tale⠀rather⠀than⠀vanishing⠀from⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀improvement⠀recoverable⠀inside⠀the⠀telling.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀compress⠀years⠀into⠀a⠀sentence,⠀but⠀the⠀incidents⠀that⠀carry⠀advancement⠀show⠀attempts,⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀resources,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability:⠀the⠀season⠀of⠀failed⠀executions,⠀the⠀correction⠀that⠀finally⠀landed,⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀the⠀principle⠀held⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Narrate⠀both⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀learner⠀could⠀explain⠀the⠀technique⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀it⠀and⠀the⠀later⠀moment⠀of⠀performance,⠀so⠀understanding⠀and⠀execution⠀stay⠀distinct.⠀When⠀a⠀listener⠀asks⠀how⠀the⠀improvement⠀came,⠀answer⠀with⠀a⠀scene,⠀not⠀a⠀summary.\n\nLet⠀loyalties⠀and⠀obligations⠀supply⠀the⠀tale's⠀substance.⠀The⠀teller⠀dwells⠀on⠀decisions⠀—⠀protecting⠀someone⠀at⠀a⠀cost,⠀refusing⠀a⠀fight⠀and⠀paying⠀for⠀the⠀refusal,⠀a⠀public⠀duty⠀that⠀crossed⠀a⠀private⠀attachment⠀—⠀so⠀that⠀technique,⠀restraint,⠀alliances,⠀and⠀reputation⠀matter⠀through⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀chosen.⠀When⠀the⠀tale⠀praises⠀a⠀deed,⠀let⠀the⠀audience⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀incident⠀complicate⠀the⠀praise,⠀keeping⠀the⠀account⠀a⠀living⠀retelling⠀in⠀dispute⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀settled⠀legend.⠀Draw⠀the⠀setting,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀and⠀keep⠀distinct⠀traditions⠀distinct⠀where⠀that⠀world⠀distinguishes⠀them;⠀antiquity,⠀mysticism,⠀exile,⠀religion,⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀honor⠀code⠀are⠀available⠀materials,⠀never⠀universal⠀requirements.⠀Inside⠀the⠀tale,⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀their⠀own:⠀the⠀teller⠀reports⠀what⠀was⠀seen⠀and⠀said,⠀and⠀grants⠀inward⠀knowledge⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀earned⠀the⠀right⠀to⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nCarry⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀advancement⠀in⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀details.⠀One⠀changed⠀grip,⠀one⠀corrected⠀breath,⠀one⠀resource⠀spent,⠀one⠀task⠀finished⠀in⠀half⠀the⠀former⠀time:⠀the⠀selected⠀detail⠀does⠀the⠀work⠀a⠀rank⠀summary⠀would⠀do,⠀and⠀nothing⠀restates⠀it⠀afterward.⠀Write⠀direct⠀clauses,⠀and⠀keep⠀only⠀the⠀explanation⠀or⠀inward⠀connection⠀that⠀materially⠀serves⠀the⠀present⠀moment;⠀when⠀a⠀thought⠀must⠀be⠀long⠀to⠀make⠀sense,⠀let⠀it⠀run⠀its⠀full⠀length.⠀Arrange⠀omissions⠀so⠀causality⠀stays⠀inferable⠀—⠀a⠀missed⠀season⠀of⠀practice⠀shows⠀up⠀as⠀a⠀slower⠀start⠀and⠀a⠀blistered⠀palm,⠀not⠀as⠀announced⠀backstory;⠀a⠀failure⠀to⠀apply⠀a⠀known⠀principle⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀itself,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀reveals⠀what⠀changed,⠀whether⠀feedback,⠀resource,⠀or⠀correction⠀finally⠀understood.\n\nSpend⠀the⠀economy⠀where⠀technique⠀expresses⠀a⠀value.⠀Loyalties⠀arrive⠀as⠀particular⠀decisions⠀in⠀a⠀few⠀clauses:⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀strike,⠀a⠀person⠀steered⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀line,⠀an⠀alliance⠀declined.⠀Travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀relationship⠀keep⠀their⠀place,⠀compressed⠀to⠀what⠀changes⠀the⠀decision⠀or⠀the⠀capability⠀—⠀the⠀meal⠀where⠀the⠀teacher⠀says⠀the⠀one⠀thing⠀that⠀unlocks⠀the⠀stance,⠀the⠀road⠀conversation⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀obligation⠀the⠀learner⠀will⠀later⠀honor.⠀Action⠀is⠀never⠀a⠀bare⠀sequence⠀of⠀blows;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀short⠀chain⠀of⠀precise⠀movements⠀whose⠀restraint⠀or⠀release⠀tells⠀the⠀reader⠀who⠀this⠀person⠀is⠀becoming⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀resists⠀them.\n\nPreserve⠀individual⠀voices.⠀Minimalism⠀does⠀not⠀flatten⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀traded⠀fragments:⠀a⠀teacher's⠀circumlocution,⠀a⠀rival's⠀taunt,⠀a⠀companion's⠀practicality⠀each⠀keep⠀their⠀own⠀length,⠀and⠀a⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀may⠀serve⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀performed⠀fragments.⠀Advancement⠀remains⠀testable⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀resists,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀the⠀detail⠀that⠀implies⠀the⠀next⠀attempt.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained,⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀in⠀which⠀advancement⠀surfaces⠀through⠀the⠀ordinary⠀movement⠀of⠀a⠀developing⠀life.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀whatever⠀inner⠀experience⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes,⠀and⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀with⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀—⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀room,⠀a⠀lapse⠀of⠀hours,⠀a⠀topic⠀taken⠀up⠀again⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀A⠀practice⠀session,⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀conversation⠀with⠀a⠀teacher,⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀witnesses:⠀each⠀carries⠀the⠀progression⠀by⠀showing⠀in⠀scene⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀understands,⠀attempts,⠀and⠀can⠀or⠀cannot⠀yet⠀do,⠀instead⠀of⠀summarizing⠀it⠀afterward.\n\nKeep⠀improvement⠀causally⠀specific.⠀Stage⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀executing⠀inside⠀the⠀scene⠀—⠀the⠀character⠀explains⠀the⠀principle⠀correctly,⠀then⠀falters⠀in⠀performance;⠀later,⠀under⠀pressure⠀or⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀resource,⠀the⠀same⠀principle⠀becomes⠀executable,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀marks⠀what⠀made⠀the⠀difference.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly,⠀one⠀skill⠀steadying⠀while⠀another⠀regresses⠀under⠀a⠀new⠀demand,⠀and⠀let⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀as⠀dialogue,⠀a⠀corrected⠀movement,⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀consequence⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀attempts⠀next,⠀so⠀the⠀flexible⠀prose⠀never⠀dissolves⠀the⠀genre's⠀engine⠀into⠀atmosphere.\n\nGive⠀encounters⠀their⠀room.⠀A⠀journey⠀includes⠀practical⠀talk,⠀shared⠀meals,⠀disagreement⠀about⠀obligation,⠀and⠀private⠀attachments⠀that⠀later⠀shape⠀public⠀decisions.⠀When⠀a⠀fight⠀or⠀contest⠀occurs,⠀narrate⠀technique,⠀restraint,⠀and⠀consequence⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀who⠀acted,⠀why⠀it⠀mattered,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀cost;⠀reputation⠀and⠀alliances⠀shift⠀through⠀particular⠀choices,⠀not⠀statements⠀about⠀honor⠀in⠀general.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀register⠀—⠀contemporary⠀presentation⠀requires⠀neither⠀a⠀contemporary⠀setting,⠀flat⠀affect,⠀realism⠀as⠀world⠀physics,⠀nor⠀a⠀closing⠀lesson.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀a⠀task⠀still⠀in⠀progress⠀or⠀a⠀relationship⠀consequence⠀still⠀unsettled,⠀provided⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀has⠀been⠀fully⠀inhabited.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀both⠀the⠀lens⠀and⠀the⠀measure⠀of⠀the⠀progression.⠀Select⠀scenes⠀because⠀they⠀reveal,⠀test,⠀or⠀change⠀what⠀these⠀particular⠀people⠀are⠀to⠀each⠀other,⠀and⠀let⠀advancement⠀become⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀one⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀for,⠀with,⠀or⠀because⠀of⠀the⠀other:⠀keep⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀was⠀once⠀beyond⠀their⠀skill,⠀return⠀from⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀would⠀earlier⠀have⠀ended⠀them,⠀protect⠀without⠀needing⠀protection,⠀or⠀fail⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀alters⠀standing⠀between⠀them.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise;⠀its⠀particular⠀promise⠀decides⠀which⠀moments⠀of⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀receive⠀space,⠀never⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀shared⠀history⠀through⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀gesture,⠀correction,⠀or⠀meeting⠀place⠀returns⠀with⠀altered⠀meaning⠀as⠀capability⠀shifts:⠀the⠀instruction⠀first⠀given⠀in⠀frustration⠀is⠀offered⠀calmly⠀after⠀months⠀of⠀practice;⠀the⠀drill⠀that⠀once⠀shamed⠀the⠀slower⠀partner⠀becomes⠀the⠀ground⠀they⠀train⠀on⠀together.⠀Let⠀a⠀callback⠀fulfill⠀the⠀earlier⠀moment⠀—⠀completing,⠀reversing,⠀or⠀outgrowing⠀it⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀repeat⠀it,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀events⠀rather⠀than⠀by⠀timing⠀or⠀announcement.\n\nSet⠀the⠀stakes⠀through⠀the⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation.⠀The⠀pair⠀may⠀disagree⠀about⠀a⠀duty,⠀conceal⠀a⠀worry⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀other⠀focused,⠀or⠀weigh⠀loyalty⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀against⠀an⠀obligation⠀to⠀a⠀larger⠀group;⠀equally,⠀they⠀may⠀cooperate,⠀train⠀each⠀other,⠀and⠀find⠀the⠀relationship⠀itself⠀is⠀what⠀advances⠀them,⠀since⠀cooperation⠀and⠀genuine⠀help⠀are⠀also⠀choices.⠀Technique,⠀restraint,⠀alliances,⠀and⠀reputation⠀matter⠀through⠀particular⠀decisions⠀taken⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀each⠀other.⠀Beneath⠀the⠀emotional⠀focus⠀the⠀progression⠀stays⠀causal⠀—⠀the⠀reader⠀still⠀understands⠀what⠀was⠀practiced,⠀which⠀feedback⠀or⠀resource⠀changed⠀the⠀execution,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult⠀—⠀and⠀private⠀language⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀two⠀who⠀established⠀it,⠀unreadable⠀on⠀demand⠀to⠀everyone⠀else⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀relationship⠀consequence⠀may⠀stay⠀unsettled⠀after⠀a⠀practical⠀question⠀is⠀answered,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀can⠀open⠀inside⠀that⠀unfinished⠀territory.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀advancement⠀as⠀a⠀chronicle⠀of⠀deeds⠀that⠀will⠀be⠀remembered.⠀Open⠀deliberately⠀—⠀who⠀the⠀learner⠀was⠀when⠀the⠀account⠀begins,⠀what⠀task⠀or⠀obligation⠀stood⠀before⠀them⠀—⠀then⠀expand⠀each⠀compact⠀declaration⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀Relate⠀every⠀stage⠀of⠀improvement⠀as⠀an⠀act⠀with⠀consequences:⠀the⠀first⠀execution⠀of⠀a⠀technique⠀under⠀pressure,⠀the⠀refusal⠀that⠀cost⠀an⠀alliance,⠀the⠀journey⠀that⠀changed⠀what⠀could⠀be⠀attempted.⠀Behind⠀each⠀remembered⠀deed⠀keep⠀the⠀practice⠀visible⠀—⠀the⠀failed⠀seasons,⠀the⠀teacher's⠀feedback,⠀the⠀resource⠀found⠀or⠀spent⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀claims⠀are⠀shown⠀true⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀asserted,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult⠀stays⠀in⠀the⠀account⠀alongside⠀the⠀praise.⠀Give⠀the⠀tale⠀both⠀moments:⠀the⠀learner⠀who⠀understood⠀the⠀principle⠀and⠀could⠀not⠀yet⠀perform⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀later⠀occasion⠀when⠀the⠀same⠀principle⠀held.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀and⠀names⠀as⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀connective⠀tissue.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀place,⠀or⠀obligation⠀returns⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀application,⠀and⠀a⠀recurring⠀designation⠀grows⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀attached⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Relate⠀each⠀act⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀of⠀it,⠀and⠀leave⠀remembrance⠀in⠀dispute⠀where⠀it⠀is:⠀one⠀hall⠀praises⠀the⠀restraint,⠀another⠀counts⠀the⠀cost,⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀need⠀not⠀settle⠀every⠀reputation⠀at⠀once.⠀Dialogue⠀may⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority⠀—⠀the⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀corrects⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀answers⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀concern⠀—⠀in⠀each⠀speaker's⠀own⠀voice⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀register.\n\nLet⠀loyalties⠀organize⠀which⠀deeds⠀the⠀chronicle⠀keeps.⠀Technique,⠀restraint,⠀alliances,⠀and⠀reputation⠀matter⠀through⠀particular⠀decisions⠀—⠀protecting⠀someone,⠀refusing⠀a⠀fight,⠀choosing⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀duty⠀—⠀and⠀action⠀is⠀never⠀reduced⠀to⠀a⠀bare⠀sequence⠀of⠀blows.⠀Draw⠀names,⠀customs,⠀and⠀world⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting;⠀the⠀telling⠀requires⠀no⠀imported⠀pantheon,⠀obligatory⠀doom,⠀or⠀an⠀oath⠀in⠀every⠀mouth.⠀When⠀the⠀account⠀records⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀thought⠀or⠀feared,⠀let⠀it⠀be⠀actual⠀remembered⠀experience⠀within⠀the⠀access⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective⠀allows,⠀since⠀being⠀remembered⠀as⠀dependable⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀help⠀was⠀effortless.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀leaving⠀another⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀social-realist⠀route⠀with⠀an⠀inward⠀register,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀story's⠀progress⠀happen⠀inside⠀the⠀institutions⠀and⠀households⠀of⠀the⠀world⠀as⠀supplied⠀—⠀the⠀workplace,⠀the⠀school,⠀the⠀family,⠀the⠀routines⠀of⠀care⠀and⠀provision.⠀A⠀gained⠀capability⠀first⠀appears⠀as⠀a⠀small⠀altered⠀function⠀in⠀a⠀familiar⠀routine:⠀the⠀apprentice⠀reads⠀the⠀weather⠀before⠀the⠀older⠀worker⠀points⠀to⠀it,⠀the⠀clerk⠀recalls⠀the⠀regulation⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀decision,⠀the⠀daughter⠀manages⠀the⠀conversation⠀her⠀parent⠀used⠀to⠀manage.⠀Keep⠀knowing⠀and⠀doing⠀distinct⠀—⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀can⠀say⠀what⠀should⠀be⠀done⠀may⠀still⠀not⠀do⠀it⠀under⠀pressure⠀—⠀and⠀stage⠀the⠀attempt⠀and⠀its⠀feedback⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene,⠀with⠀another⠀person's⠀adjusted⠀reliance,⠀a⠀task⠀handed⠀over⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀asked⠀instead⠀of⠀an⠀instruction⠀given,⠀confirming⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀privately⠀registers⠀what⠀still⠀resists.\n\nGive⠀the⠀season,⠀the⠀housing,⠀the⠀commute,⠀and⠀the⠀shared⠀work⠀their⠀real⠀weight,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀encounters⠀generous:⠀arrivals,⠀meals,⠀explanations,⠀renewals⠀of⠀relationship⠀around⠀the⠀task⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀bare⠀sequence⠀of⠀task⠀results.⠀Place⠀the⠀pull⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀inside⠀these⠀networks,⠀and⠀let⠀advancement⠀cost⠀something⠀countable⠀—⠀the⠀duty⠀accepted⠀at⠀work⠀is⠀the⠀family⠀obligation⠀missed;⠀the⠀friend⠀protected⠀at⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀a⠀reputation⠀the⠀character⠀never⠀chose;⠀the⠀new⠀responsibility⠀that⠀exposes⠀an⠀older,⠀unexamined⠀loyalty.⠀Restraint,⠀alliance,⠀and⠀standing⠀operate⠀through⠀particular⠀decisions⠀about⠀who⠀is⠀visited,⠀who⠀is⠀telephoned,⠀which⠀account⠀is⠀corrected⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀whom.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀sects,⠀martial⠀lineages,⠀or⠀a⠀historical⠀Chinese⠀setting.\n\nTie⠀the⠀inward⠀narration⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀observe⠀and⠀remember.⠀Reserve⠀and⠀understatement⠀belong⠀to⠀particular⠀people,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀national⠀temperament;⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀and⠀bleakness⠀are⠀scenery⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀has⠀them,⠀and⠀if⠀that⠀world⠀is⠀specifically⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish,⠀keep⠀its⠀particulars⠀distinct⠀instead⠀of⠀blending⠀a⠀generic⠀Nordic⠀texture.⠀Render⠀uneven⠀growth⠀concretely⠀—⠀reliability⠀in⠀one⠀area⠀beside⠀a⠀failure⠀just⠀as⠀specific,⠀both⠀measured⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀unaided⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀requires⠀help.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀finished⠀task,⠀an⠀obligation⠀left⠀open,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀recognition⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀changed,⠀with⠀relationships,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀continuing⠀around⠀the⠀developing⠀life⠀and⠀no⠀rank⠀or⠀displayed⠀system⠀to⠀certify⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nUse⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀and⠀write⠀action⠀lines⠀a⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀hear,⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Make⠀a⠀gained⠀capability⠀a⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀difference⠀in⠀behavior⠀between⠀sequences:⠀the⠀movement⠀that⠀failed⠀last⠀time⠀now⠀completes,⠀the⠀character⠀reads⠀the⠀room⠀before⠀anyone⠀explains⠀it,⠀or⠀withholds⠀a⠀response⠀an⠀earlier⠀scene⠀showed⠀them⠀giving⠀too⠀quickly.⠀Put⠀the⠀attempt⠀and⠀its⠀feedback⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀sequence⠀—⠀the⠀try,⠀then⠀another⠀character's⠀adjusted⠀reaction⠀or⠀request⠀—⠀so⠀advancement⠀is⠀established⠀by⠀what⠀plays⠀on⠀screen.⠀A⠀principle⠀stated⠀in⠀one⠀scene's⠀dialogue⠀is⠀fulfilled⠀or⠀failed⠀by⠀action⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀one,⠀and⠀the⠀sequence⠀shows⠀which;⠀never⠀announce⠀a⠀level⠀or⠀an⠀understanding⠀through⠀voice-over.\n\nGive⠀the⠀sequences⠀their⠀scenic⠀room:⠀arrivals,⠀exchanges⠀of⠀explanation,⠀relationship⠀beats⠀around⠀the⠀practical⠀work,⠀rather⠀than⠀cutting⠀blow⠀to⠀blow⠀to⠀result.⠀Stage⠀the⠀pull⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀as⠀competing⠀on-screen⠀choices⠀—⠀the⠀public⠀task⠀that⠀cannot⠀wait⠀keeps⠀the⠀character⠀from⠀the⠀family⠀table;⠀the⠀alliance⠀is⠀declined⠀because⠀a⠀private⠀bond⠀would⠀pay⠀for⠀it⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀particular⠀decision.⠀Technique,⠀restraint,⠀and⠀reputation⠀appear⠀as⠀behavior:⠀who⠀speaks⠀first,⠀who⠀lets⠀a⠀silence⠀stand,⠀how⠀a⠀newcomer⠀addresses⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀compared⠀with⠀before.\n\nUse⠀cuts⠀and⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.⠀A⠀cut⠀may⠀compress⠀practice⠀time⠀or⠀travel,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀replace⠀a⠀specific⠀attempt⠀with⠀a⠀montage⠀of⠀improvement.⠀Where⠀the⠀story⠀requires⠀private⠀experience,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀not⠀dialogue⠀the⠀cast⠀can⠀hear⠀and⠀not⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀showing⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀action.⠀Growth⠀stays⠀uneven⠀and⠀concrete:⠀one⠀task⠀now⠀handled⠀alone⠀beside⠀another⠀still⠀fumbled⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene,⠀the⠀fumble⠀as⠀filmable⠀as⠀the⠀success.⠀The⠀sequence⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀change⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summarizing⠀speech⠀or⠀an⠀obligatory⠀hook.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nTreat⠀the⠀shared⠀stage⠀space⠀as⠀the⠀test⠀of⠀growth:⠀what⠀the⠀cast⠀can⠀see,⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀verify.⠀The⠀task⠀attempted⠀in⠀an⠀earlier⠀scene⠀is⠀attempted⠀again⠀in⠀view⠀and⠀now⠀completes;⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀used⠀to⠀interrupt⠀holds⠀through⠀a⠀pause;⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀misread⠀rooms⠀enters⠀at⠀the⠀right⠀moment⠀with⠀the⠀right⠀object.⠀Carry⠀the⠀attempt⠀and⠀its⠀response⠀in⠀blocking⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀—⠀the⠀hands⠀that⠀hesitate,⠀the⠀weight⠀set⠀down⠀too⠀soon,⠀the⠀exit⠀a⠀beat⠀late⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀speech⠀about⠀improvement.⠀Let⠀a⠀character⠀recite⠀the⠀method⠀and⠀still⠀fumble⠀its⠀execution⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀everyone;⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀saying⠀and⠀doing⠀is⠀playable⠀in⠀itself.⠀When⠀something⠀remains⠀difficult,⠀stage⠀the⠀difficulty⠀rather⠀than⠀summarizing⠀it.\n\nShape⠀the⠀pull⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀through⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀the⠀relation⠀of⠀lines⠀to⠀business.⠀A⠀character⠀enters⠀carrying⠀an⠀object⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀bond⠀while⠀a⠀public⠀duty⠀calls;⠀one⠀exits⠀toward⠀the⠀obligation⠀while⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀pays⠀its⠀cost⠀remains⠀on⠀stage.⠀Give⠀encounters⠀their⠀room⠀—⠀greeting,⠀explanation,⠀renewed⠀relationship⠀—⠀so⠀a⠀meeting⠀is⠀an⠀event⠀with⠀consequence,⠀not⠀a⠀compressed⠀exchange⠀of⠀outcomes.⠀Technique,⠀restraint,⠀alliance,⠀and⠀reputation⠀read⠀as⠀particular⠀choices:⠀who⠀speaks⠀first,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀accepts⠀the⠀task,⠀who⠀declines⠀it⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀witnesses.\n\nWrite⠀monologue⠀and⠀aside⠀only⠀where⠀they⠀serve⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose;⠀they⠀are⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀an⠀audience,⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀container⠀for⠀thought.⠀Keep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation,⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀characters'⠀hearing,⠀and⠀let⠀stage⠀directions⠀establish⠀observable⠀conditions⠀without⠀certifying⠀what⠀is⠀hidden.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀film-camera⠀instructions.⠀Advancement⠀stays⠀uneven⠀and⠀embodied:⠀one⠀staged⠀success⠀beside⠀one⠀staged⠀failure,⠀both⠀concrete.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀an⠀exit,⠀a⠀held⠀pause,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀change⠀—⠀no⠀curtain-line⠀summary,⠀no⠀obligatory⠀gathering.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
