            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-progression_fantasy-04",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Progression Fantasy · 04/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == progression_fantasy}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Progression Fantasy. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 4 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-progression_fantasy; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPalalay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind's⠀associative⠀movement⠀structure⠀the⠀telling:⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀braided⠀through⠀the⠀present⠀task.⠀A⠀practice⠀begins⠀in⠀the⠀hands,⠀drifts⠀to⠀the⠀earlier⠀failure⠀it⠀resembles,⠀returns⠀by⠀way⠀of⠀a⠀phrase⠀someone⠀once⠀said,⠀and⠀is⠀cut⠀across⠀by⠀the⠀standing⠀worry⠀about⠀a⠀duty⠀owed⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀missed.⠀Keep⠀the⠀braid⠀oriented⠀—⠀tense,⠀grounding⠀detail,⠀and⠀returning⠀markers⠀distinguish⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀remembered⠀or⠀imagined,⠀and⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀doing⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀doing.\n\nMake⠀improvement⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀mind's⠀movement⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀announcement.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀executing⠀appears⠀as⠀remembered⠀instruction⠀colliding⠀with⠀present⠀sensation:⠀the⠀words⠀are⠀right⠀and⠀the⠀body⠀still⠀resists.⠀New⠀understanding⠀arrives⠀by⠀association⠀—⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀returns⠀carrying⠀a⠀different⠀meaning,⠀a⠀past⠀failure⠀is⠀re-seen⠀from⠀inside⠀the⠀current⠀attempt,⠀an⠀observed⠀reaction⠀suddenly⠀clarifies⠀what⠀the⠀task⠀requires.⠀Afterward⠀the⠀mind⠀circles⠀back⠀to⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult⠀even⠀following⠀a⠀success,⠀so⠀uneven⠀development⠀is⠀felt⠀as⠀recurring⠀occupation⠀rather⠀than⠀stated⠀as⠀rank.\n\nGive⠀the⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀a⠀recurring⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀flow:⠀a⠀loyalty⠀surfacing⠀mid-task,⠀a⠀duty⠀interrupting⠀a⠀private⠀attention,⠀neither⠀resolved⠀away.⠀People⠀arrive⠀in⠀the⠀flow⠀already⠀carrying⠀their⠀history⠀with⠀this⠀mind⠀—⠀the⠀last⠀argument,⠀the⠀old⠀debt⠀—⠀so⠀shared⠀past⠀surfaces⠀by⠀association⠀instead⠀of⠀exposition.⠀Technique,⠀restraint,⠀and⠀reputation⠀appear⠀as⠀remembered⠀advice,⠀an⠀observed⠀flinch,⠀a⠀private⠀word⠀repeated,⠀particular⠀to⠀this⠀mind⠀and⠀never⠀a⠀license⠀to⠀blur⠀scene⠀facts⠀or⠀extend⠀consciousness⠀to⠀others.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀movement⠀finds⠀its⠀own⠀pause:⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀sensation⠀returning⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀the⠀room,⠀an⠀unresolved⠀concern⠀held⠀rather⠀than⠀settled.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀developing⠀capability⠀in⠀the⠀messages⠀themselves⠀and⠀in⠀the⠀interface⠀events⠀that⠀matter.⠀Growth⠀shows⠀as⠀changed⠀sending⠀behavior:⠀the⠀question⠀that⠀proves⠀the⠀sender⠀has⠀already⠀located⠀the⠀problem,⠀the⠀report⠀of⠀a⠀task⠀finished⠀unaided⠀that⠀recently⠀required⠀a⠀walkthrough,⠀the⠀edit⠀that⠀corrects⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀before⠀sending.⠀Put⠀the⠀attempt⠀and⠀its⠀feedback⠀inside⠀the⠀exchange⠀—⠀the⠀try,⠀then⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀adjusted⠀reply⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀timestamp,⠀delay,⠀read⠀receipt,⠀attachment,⠀or⠀channel⠀change⠀appear⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀someone⠀can⠀know⠀or⠀do.\n\nLet⠀the⠀pull⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀shape⠀each⠀sender's⠀habits.⠀One⠀answers⠀the⠀shared⠀channel⠀at⠀once⠀and⠀leaves⠀the⠀private⠀thread⠀unread⠀into⠀the⠀night;⠀another⠀drafts⠀a⠀long⠀reply⠀and⠀sends⠀a⠀shorter,⠀guarded⠀one.⠀Who⠀replies⠀first,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀includes⠀or⠀omits⠀the⠀detail⠀that⠀would⠀protect⠀or⠀expose⠀someone⠀—⠀these⠀are⠀the⠀particular⠀decisions⠀through⠀which⠀technique,⠀restraint,⠀alliance,⠀and⠀reputation⠀operate⠀in⠀text.⠀Someone⠀can⠀explain⠀the⠀method⠀precisely⠀and⠀still⠀ask⠀for⠀a⠀hand⠀with⠀the⠀doing;⠀both⠀halves⠀belong⠀in⠀the⠀record.⠀Keep⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀distinct⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀and⠀both⠀distinct⠀from⠀private⠀thought:⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀wording,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀mind.\n\nLet⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀—⠀pacing,⠀punctuation,⠀latency,⠀verbosity⠀—⠀individualize⠀the⠀contributions⠀instead⠀of⠀a⠀uniform⠀voice.⠀Growth⠀stays⠀uneven⠀and⠀legible:⠀one⠀exchange⠀handled⠀with⠀new⠀competence⠀beside⠀another⠀mishandled⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀transcript,⠀the⠀failure⠀as⠀dated⠀and⠀concrete⠀as⠀the⠀success.⠀Where⠀the⠀story⠀requires⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀composed⠀artifacts,⠀keep⠀it⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀and⠀attributed⠀to⠀its⠀owner.⠀The⠀exchange⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀receipt⠀without⠀a⠀reply,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀simply⠀confirms⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀possible⠀—⠀no⠀summarizing⠀text,⠀no⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene:⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀between⠀the⠀lines.⠀Let⠀advancement⠀appear⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀now⠀notices⠀and⠀does⠀—⠀reading⠀the⠀situation⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀explained,⠀completing⠀unaided⠀what⠀earlier⠀scenes⠀showed⠀needing⠀help,⠀holding⠀back⠀where⠀they⠀once⠀acted⠀at⠀once⠀—⠀with⠀the⠀attempt⠀and⠀its⠀feedback⠀inside⠀one⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀announced⠀afterward.⠀The⠀inner⠀response⠀may⠀grasp⠀a⠀principle⠀a⠀beat⠀before⠀the⠀action⠀executes⠀it,⠀or⠀watch⠀the⠀action⠀fail⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀already⠀understands;⠀that⠀gap⠀is⠀where⠀growth⠀is⠀felt.⠀Use⠀a⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀moment;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀how⠀much⠀someone⠀has⠀grown,⠀and⠀the⠀cast⠀are⠀not⠀reaction⠀portraits⠀whose⠀faces⠀report⠀progress⠀on⠀cue.\n\nStage⠀the⠀pull⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀through⠀scene-level⠀choices⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀reaction⠀that⠀follows:⠀arriving⠀late⠀to⠀the⠀private⠀obligation⠀because⠀the⠀public⠀task⠀could⠀not⠀wait;⠀declining⠀the⠀alliance⠀because⠀a⠀bond⠀would⠀pay⠀for⠀it.⠀Give⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀privately⠀makes⠀of⠀each⠀exchange⠀—⠀noticing,⠀doubt,⠀recalibration⠀—⠀while⠀keeping⠀that⠀material⠀outside⠀the⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀Technique,⠀restraint,⠀and⠀reputation⠀read⠀as⠀behavior:⠀who⠀speaks⠀first,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀is⠀handed⠀the⠀task⠀this⠀time.\n\nKeep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀beyond⠀their⠀separate⠀authorization.⠀Where⠀a⠀scene⠀turns⠀on⠀private⠀thought,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀not⠀dialogue⠀the⠀cast⠀overhears.⠀Growth⠀stays⠀uneven⠀and⠀visible:⠀one⠀task⠀now⠀managed⠀alone⠀beside⠀another⠀still⠀fumbled⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene,⠀the⠀fumble⠀as⠀present⠀as⠀the⠀success.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀an⠀unresolved⠀obligation,⠀or⠀an⠀acknowledgment⠀earned⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀declared⠀—⠀no⠀forced⠀choice⠀screen,⠀no⠀summarizing⠀speech.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalalbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nKeep⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀installments:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changed⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀open⠀to⠀continue.⠀Let⠀advancement⠀be⠀cumulative⠀and⠀on⠀the⠀record⠀—⠀the⠀task⠀that⠀failed⠀in⠀an⠀earlier⠀reply⠀is⠀attempted⠀again⠀and⠀now⠀completes;⠀the⠀pattern⠀noticed⠀last⠀installment⠀is⠀named⠀by⠀the⠀character⠀before⠀anyone⠀explains⠀it;⠀the⠀resource,⠀relationship,⠀or⠀understanding⠀gained⠀in⠀one⠀reply⠀becomes⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀one⠀uses.⠀Stage⠀the⠀attempt⠀and⠀its⠀feedback⠀within⠀the⠀installment⠀that⠀reports⠀them,⠀and⠀recover⠀only⠀the⠀specific⠀history⠀that⠀gives⠀a⠀change⠀its⠀weight,⠀briefly,⠀rather⠀than⠀retelling⠀the⠀arc.⠀An⠀installment⠀can⠀state⠀a⠀new⠀understanding;⠀a⠀later⠀one⠀still⠀has⠀to⠀show⠀it⠀surviving⠀use.\n\nGive⠀the⠀pull⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀a⠀cumulative⠀shape:⠀a⠀duty⠀and⠀a⠀loyalty⠀come⠀into⠀competition⠀in⠀one⠀installment⠀and⠀remain⠀unresolved⠀into⠀the⠀next,⠀the⠀cost⠀clarifying⠀as⠀the⠀serial⠀continues.⠀Let⠀reputation⠀precede⠀the⠀character⠀—⠀newcomers⠀arrive⠀already⠀knowing⠀the⠀latest⠀installment's⠀event⠀and⠀address⠀the⠀character⠀accordingly⠀—⠀so⠀standing⠀accumulates⠀through⠀particular⠀decisions⠀about⠀who⠀speaks⠀first,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀accepts⠀the⠀task,⠀who⠀declines.⠀Translate⠀loyalty⠀and⠀consequence⠀into⠀the⠀world⠀as⠀supplied;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀sects,⠀martial⠀lineages,⠀or⠀a⠀historical⠀Chinese⠀setting,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀ranks⠀or⠀numerical⠀mechanics⠀to⠀display⠀growth.\n\nUse⠀earned⠀developments⠀and⠀occasional⠀hooks;⠀a⠀reply⠀need⠀not⠀close⠀every⠀thread,⠀and⠀not⠀every⠀turn⠀is⠀a⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀Keep⠀inward⠀experience⠀available⠀where⠀it⠀contributes⠀thought⠀or⠀feeling,⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀installment's⠀visible⠀change⠀is⠀still⠀pending.⠀Growth⠀stays⠀uneven⠀across⠀the⠀run:⠀reliability⠀in⠀one⠀area⠀beside⠀a⠀failure⠀just⠀as⠀concrete,⠀measured⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀requires⠀help,⠀while⠀relationships,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀continue⠀in⠀the⠀margins⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀An⠀installment⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known;⠀serial⠀duration⠀gives⠀established⠀facts⠀room⠀to⠀acquire⠀meaning,⠀not⠀a⠀reason⠀for⠀advancement⠀to⠀perpetually⠀recede.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀advancement⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀point-of-view⠀character⠀can⠀bear⠀to⠀say⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀hide⠀from⠀someone⠀who⠀knows⠀their⠀old⠀limits.⠀A⠀new⠀technique,⠀rank,⠀or⠀resource⠀should⠀do⠀more⠀than⠀make⠀a⠀task⠀easier:⠀let⠀it⠀expose⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀trained⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀now⠀standing⠀in⠀a⠀familiar⠀room.⠀Give⠀the⠀gain⠀a⠀cost⠀the⠀character⠀did⠀not⠀anticipate⠀—⠀understanding⠀a⠀flaw⠀they⠀used⠀to⠀excuse,⠀recognizing⠀that⠀a⠀companion's⠀help⠀was⠀necessary⠀and⠀resenting⠀the⠀recognition,⠀or⠀discovering⠀that⠀a⠀long-practiced⠀routine⠀was⠀also⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀avoiding⠀a⠀conversation.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀the⠀new⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀while⠀upset,⠀and⠀let⠀strength⠀and⠀weakness⠀develop⠀unevenly,⠀so⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀be⠀more⠀capable⠀and⠀more⠀exposed⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀time.\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀progression⠀in⠀objects,⠀phrases,⠀and⠀habits⠀repeated⠀from⠀the⠀shared⠀life⠀before⠀the⠀change.⠀After⠀a⠀breakthrough,⠀return⠀to⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀register⠀differently:⠀the⠀same⠀training⠀ground⠀feels⠀smaller,⠀the⠀same⠀reassurance⠀sounds⠀insufficient,⠀the⠀same⠀shared⠀joke⠀lands⠀against⠀a⠀new⠀silence.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀reframing;⠀show⠀the⠀character⠀noticing⠀the⠀familiar⠀thing⠀and⠀responding⠀to⠀it⠀differently.⠀The⠀repeated⠀element⠀may⠀comfort⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀wound⠀another,⠀and⠀the⠀same⠀character⠀may⠀feel⠀both⠀in⠀sequence.\n\nLet⠀strain⠀shape⠀the⠀actual⠀exchange.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀admits⠀a⠀need,⠀withholds⠀a⠀fear,⠀apologizes,⠀or⠀returns⠀after⠀a⠀failure,⠀the⠀cost⠀should⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀conversation⠀itself⠀—⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀deflected⠀question,⠀a⠀practical⠀remark⠀carrying⠀too⠀much⠀weight,⠀a⠀kindness⠀offered⠀in⠀the⠀wrong⠀form.⠀Comfort⠀may⠀be⠀partial⠀or⠀awkward,⠀and⠀warmth⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀pain.⠀Keep⠀the⠀turbulence⠀inside⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀distance⠀and⠀diction⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering:⠀this⠀character's⠀deflections,⠀qualifiers,⠀and⠀silences⠀carry⠀the⠀emotion.\n\nTest⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult;⠀one⠀gain⠀can⠀make⠀another⠀limitation⠀visible⠀and⠀nameable⠀only⠀in⠀part.⠀A⠀successful⠀advancement⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀reconciliation,⠀and⠀a⠀failed⠀approach⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀permanent⠀rupture⠀—⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀still⠀unsettled⠀and⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀still⠀unfamiliar.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀tragic⠀ending⠀or⠀turn⠀warm⠀moments⠀into⠀traps;⠀let⠀the⠀story's⠀actual⠀trajectory⠀decide⠀whether⠀comfort⠀arrives,⠀is⠀delayed,⠀or⠀is⠀refused.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀reply⠀as⠀one⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs,⠀with⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀unmistakable⠀on⠀every⠀exchange:⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀never⠀have⠀to⠀re-parse⠀who⠀spoke⠀or⠀who⠀acted.⠀Let⠀the⠀point-of-view⠀character's⠀advancement⠀happen⠀inside⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀an⠀attempt,⠀a⠀changed⠀habit,⠀or⠀a⠀newly⠀possible⠀action⠀—⠀performed⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀participants,⠀not⠀summarized⠀afterward.⠀Show⠀the⠀attempt,⠀the⠀feedback⠀it⠀draws,⠀and⠀the⠀changed⠀execution⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀allows,⠀and⠀keep⠀rank⠀or⠀mechanical⠀talk⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀narration⠀unless⠀a⠀character⠀would⠀actually⠀say⠀it.⠀Narrative⠀person,⠀action⠀markers,⠀and⠀player⠀control⠀follow⠀the⠀active⠀contract.\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀interval⠀in⠀a⠀routine,⠀object,⠀or⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀from⠀the⠀character's⠀earlier⠀life,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀advancement⠀give⠀it⠀new⠀weight:⠀the⠀character⠀performs⠀the⠀routine⠀with⠀a⠀speed⠀that⠀surprises⠀a⠀companion,⠀reaches⠀without⠀hesitation⠀for⠀a⠀tool⠀they⠀once⠀feared,⠀or⠀uses⠀an⠀old⠀phrase⠀while⠀doing⠀something⠀the⠀old⠀version⠀of⠀them⠀could⠀not.⠀Let⠀another⠀participant's⠀reaction⠀carry⠀the⠀measurement⠀—⠀noticing⠀the⠀change,⠀misunderstanding⠀it,⠀asking⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀or⠀saying⠀nothing⠀while⠀their⠀behavior⠀shifts⠀around⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀world⠀and⠀its⠀NPCs⠀moving⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀concerns;⠀do⠀not⠀freeze⠀them⠀into⠀a⠀waiting⠀pose⠀around⠀the⠀player's⠀next⠀move.⠀Humor⠀and⠀tenderness⠀belong⠀where⠀these⠀particular⠀people⠀would⠀actually⠀use⠀them,⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀cast⠀universally⠀witty⠀or⠀emotionally⠀fluent.⠀Private⠀thought⠀stays⠀inside⠀the⠀point-of-view⠀character's⠀access,⠀and⠀other⠀characters'⠀motives⠀remain⠀available⠀only⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀and⠀do.\n\nClose⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀scene⠀—⠀a⠀task⠀still⠀underway,⠀a⠀conversation⠀that⠀has⠀reached⠀its⠀pause,⠀an⠀action⠀just⠀begun.⠀No⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice⠀is⠀required⠀at⠀the⠀end,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀turn⠀may⠀simply⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀practice,⠀errand,⠀or⠀relationship⠀beat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀route.⠀Tell⠀the⠀character's⠀advancement⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀connected⠀episodes,⠀each⠀built⠀around⠀a⠀concrete⠀attempt,⠀test,⠀errand,⠀or⠀return⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀direct⠀and⠀plainly⠀readable,⠀the⠀episode's⠀shape⠀coming⠀from⠀the⠀deed⠀and⠀its⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀elaborate⠀framing.⠀Bring⠀each⠀episode⠀to⠀a⠀resting⠀point⠀that⠀still⠀carries⠀the⠀reader⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀stage⠀of⠀practice,⠀travel,⠀work,⠀or⠀relationship⠀—⠀a⠀pause⠀the⠀pace⠀has⠀earned,⠀not⠀a⠀suspense⠀hook⠀bolted⠀on.\n\nWithin⠀each⠀episode,⠀anchor⠀the⠀progression⠀in⠀an⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀from⠀the⠀character's⠀daily⠀life.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀returns⠀to⠀it⠀after⠀a⠀test,⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀new⠀weight:⠀a⠀training⠀implement⠀that⠀now⠀feels⠀light,⠀a⠀familiar⠀road⠀crossed⠀more⠀quickly,⠀a⠀companion's⠀habitual⠀warning⠀that⠀means⠀something⠀different.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀callback;⠀the⠀character's⠀changed⠀response⠀shows⠀that⠀the⠀earlier⠀meaning⠀has⠀shifted.⠀Let⠀recovery,⠀ordinary⠀work,⠀and⠀relationships⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀life⠀that⠀develops⠀across⠀the⠀episodes.\n\nShow⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀A⠀victory⠀in⠀one⠀episode⠀can⠀reveal⠀a⠀new⠀limitation⠀in⠀the⠀next,⠀and⠀a⠀hard-won⠀technique⠀can⠀fail⠀under⠀conditions⠀the⠀character⠀did⠀not⠀anticipate.⠀Teachers,⠀companions,⠀rivals,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀people⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀changed⠀capability⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀positions,⠀so⠀the⠀episodes⠀accumulate⠀social⠀consequence⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀personal⠀power.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀world.⠀The⠀episodic⠀method⠀and⠀the⠀attention⠀to⠀remembered⠀deeds⠀are⠀the⠀craft⠀being⠀used;⠀do⠀not⠀transplant⠀a⠀historical⠀setting,⠀change⠀the⠀cast's⠀identities,⠀or⠀manufacture⠀national⠀speech⠀patterns⠀on⠀the⠀strength⠀of⠀the⠀tradition.⠀The⠀story's⠀own⠀world⠀and⠀people⠀remain⠀the⠀material.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀advancement⠀through⠀concrete⠀physical⠀action⠀and⠀material⠀consequence.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions:⠀move⠀from⠀attempt⠀to⠀result⠀without⠀padding,⠀and⠀slow⠀down⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀or⠀a⠀critical⠀physical⠀detail⠀needs⠀the⠀length.⠀Where⠀practice⠀costs⠀something,⠀render⠀the⠀cost⠀in⠀what⠀it⠀actually⠀touches⠀—⠀the⠀body,⠀the⠀tools,⠀the⠀materials⠀spent,⠀the⠀surroundings⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀show⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀under⠀pressure⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀any⠀summary⠀of⠀power.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀an⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀from⠀earlier⠀training⠀or⠀daily⠀life⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀new⠀weight⠀after⠀an⠀event.⠀The⠀same⠀practice⠀blade⠀can⠀sit⠀differently⠀in⠀steadier⠀hands,⠀the⠀same⠀climb⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀breath⠀to⠀spare,⠀the⠀same⠀muttered⠀instruction⠀can⠀land⠀in⠀ears⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀flinch.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀change;⠀the⠀body's⠀response⠀to⠀the⠀familiar⠀thing⠀shows⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀stakes⠀physical⠀and⠀immediate⠀even⠀in⠀quiet⠀scenes.⠀When⠀an⠀attempt⠀fails,⠀let⠀its⠀consequence⠀be⠀concrete⠀wherever⠀the⠀damage⠀falls⠀—⠀a⠀bruise,⠀a⠀broken⠀tool,⠀a⠀spent⠀resource,⠀a⠀route⠀that⠀has⠀to⠀be⠀found⠀again⠀—⠀and⠀when⠀a⠀success⠀costs⠀something,⠀show⠀the⠀exhaustion,⠀the⠀time⠀lost,⠀or⠀the⠀new⠀problem⠀it⠀exposes.⠀Let⠀relationships⠀surface⠀through⠀practical⠀help,⠀blunt⠀speech,⠀and⠀shared⠀labor⠀rather⠀than⠀extended⠀emotional⠀analysis;⠀a⠀few⠀hard-won⠀words⠀of⠀tenderness⠀or⠀humor⠀carry⠀more⠀weight⠀here⠀than⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀it.\n\nVary⠀the⠀rhythm⠀deliberately:⠀compress⠀routine⠀and⠀repeated⠀action,⠀then⠀expand⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀character⠀recognizes⠀a⠀change⠀or⠀hits⠀a⠀limit.⠀Retain⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀when⠀the⠀reasoning⠀genuinely⠀needs⠀it.⠀Ground⠀abrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀the⠀particular⠀speaker⠀—⠀not⠀everyone⠀is⠀hard-edged⠀—⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀treatment⠀pressure-oriented⠀rather⠀than⠀survival⠀horror:⠀the⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀become⠀uniformly⠀grim⠀for⠀the⠀advancement⠀to⠀cost⠀something.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀documents⠀written⠀at⠀different⠀stages⠀of⠀training,⠀travel,⠀work,⠀or⠀recovery.⠀Give⠀each⠀document⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀an⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀time⠀of⠀composition,⠀and⠀let⠀what⠀it⠀knows⠀or⠀conceals⠀follow⠀from⠀that⠀situation:⠀a⠀trainee's⠀letter⠀home⠀may⠀omit⠀a⠀failure,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀record⠀may⠀note⠀a⠀flaw⠀the⠀trainee⠀has⠀not⠀recognized,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀journal⠀entry⠀may⠀quietly⠀revise⠀an⠀earlier⠀account.⠀Choose⠀the⠀specific⠀form⠀each⠀scene⠀requires⠀—⠀letter,⠀report,⠀practice⠀log,⠀ledger,⠀note⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀rotating⠀through⠀formats⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀sake.\n\nUse⠀one⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase⠀as⠀a⠀recurring⠀anchor⠀across⠀the⠀entries.⠀The⠀same⠀exercise,⠀tool,⠀route,⠀or⠀shared⠀saying⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀an⠀early⠀letter,⠀a⠀mid-training⠀report,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀record,⠀its⠀meaning⠀changed⠀by⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀or⠀understand.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀the⠀documents;⠀the⠀reader⠀notices⠀the⠀shift⠀through⠀each⠀writer's⠀word⠀choices,⠀omissions,⠀and⠀emphasis.\n\nShow⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀each⠀document's⠀author⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀A⠀record⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀technique⠀the⠀author⠀could⠀not⠀previously⠀execute⠀while⠀revealing⠀a⠀new⠀limitation⠀through⠀a⠀complaint,⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀help,⠀or⠀a⠀suddenly⠀cautious⠀phrasing.⠀Let⠀the⠀gaps⠀carry⠀information:⠀a⠀missing⠀reply,⠀a⠀torn⠀page,⠀a⠀corrected⠀date,⠀or⠀a⠀letter⠀composed⠀and⠀never⠀sent⠀can⠀mark⠀where⠀the⠀progression⠀was⠀not⠀smooth.⠀Documents⠀may⠀conflict⠀with⠀one⠀another,⠀and⠀later⠀knowledge⠀must⠀never⠀be⠀retroactively⠀inserted⠀into⠀an⠀earlier⠀record.\n\nTreat⠀every⠀document⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀mind:⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀records⠀can⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀feel,⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀specific⠀to⠀them⠀—⠀reassurance,⠀concealment,⠀habit,⠀the⠀demands⠀of⠀a⠀report⠀format.⠀Preserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀across⠀the⠀sequence,⠀and⠀keep⠀any⠀private⠀access⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀intact⠀beside⠀the⠀documents⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀it⠀with⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀advancement⠀through⠀chosen⠀kindness⠀and⠀familiar⠀daily⠀life⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀separate⠀training⠀montage.⠀Let⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀appear⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀cares⠀for⠀particular⠀people:⠀carrying⠀a⠀burden⠀for⠀someone,⠀preparing⠀a⠀remedy⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀fail,⠀walking⠀a⠀route⠀without⠀resting,⠀explaining⠀a⠀skill⠀they⠀used⠀to⠀fumble.⠀Spend⠀attention⠀on⠀the⠀ease⠀and⠀small⠀pleasure⠀of⠀doing⠀something⠀well⠀for⠀someone⠀else⠀while⠀keeping⠀the⠀attempt⠀legible⠀—⠀the⠀trying,⠀the⠀feedback,⠀the⠀visible⠀difference⠀from⠀last⠀time.\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀an⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase⠀from⠀the⠀characters'⠀shared⠀life⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀advancement⠀lend⠀it⠀new⠀weight:⠀a⠀familiar⠀meal⠀made⠀with⠀a⠀steadier⠀hand,⠀an⠀old⠀joke⠀answered⠀with⠀new⠀confidence,⠀a⠀habitual⠀walk⠀that⠀goes⠀farther⠀than⠀it⠀used⠀to.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀change;⠀the⠀comfort⠀of⠀the⠀familiar⠀thing⠀carries⠀the⠀evidence⠀that⠀something⠀has⠀improved.\n\nKeep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀be⠀cared⠀for⠀without⠀becoming⠀agreeable,⠀and⠀a⠀warm⠀scene⠀can⠀hold⠀a⠀manageable⠀friction⠀—⠀a⠀preference⠀overlooked,⠀a⠀small⠀embarrassment,⠀a⠀differing⠀opinion⠀about⠀how⠀to⠀spend⠀the⠀afternoon.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀established⠀problems⠀from⠀the⠀world,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀repair;⠀affection⠀should⠀be⠀sincere⠀and⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀involved.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀remain⠀progression⠀fantasy⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀pure⠀domestic⠀vignette.⠀The⠀new⠀capability⠀should⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀ongoing⠀story⠀—⠀it⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀future⠀task⠀possible,⠀ease⠀a⠀recurring⠀difficulty,⠀or⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀companion⠀sees⠀the⠀character's⠀growth⠀—⠀so⠀keep⠀the⠀warmth⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀consequence⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀enjoy⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀and⠀still⠀see,⠀through⠀the⠀care⠀itself,⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀advanced;⠀no⠀particular⠀emotional⠀outcome⠀is⠀imposed⠀on⠀the⠀closing⠀beat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀frame⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀advancement⠀through⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits⠀it:⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀may⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀read⠀in⠀a⠀household,⠀a⠀guild,⠀a⠀village,⠀or⠀a⠀wider⠀public,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀set⠀the⠀present⠀against⠀an⠀earlier⠀condition⠀or⠀against⠀the⠀expectations⠀others⠀hold.⠀Keep⠀that⠀framing⠀inside⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀facts⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀permitted⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀keep⠀ordinary⠀dialogue⠀in⠀its⠀speakers'⠀own⠀mouths,⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀narration.\n\nUse⠀an⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase⠀from⠀the⠀character's⠀daily⠀life⠀as⠀a⠀recurring⠀anchor.⠀The⠀same⠀morning⠀practice,⠀the⠀same⠀doorway,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀of⠀encouragement⠀can⠀return⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀passage⠀with⠀its⠀meaning⠀altered⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀or⠀understand,⠀developed⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀response⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀framing⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀explanatory⠀summary.⠀Public⠀and⠀private⠀contrast⠀can⠀organize⠀a⠀passage⠀where⠀the⠀story⠀calls⠀for⠀it⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀witnesses⠀set⠀against⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀privately⠀knows⠀of⠀the⠀gain.\n\nShow⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀demonstrate⠀a⠀new⠀competence⠀while⠀exposing⠀a⠀social⠀limitation,⠀a⠀lingering⠀fear,⠀or⠀a⠀skill⠀that⠀has⠀developed⠀unevenly;⠀distinguish⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀understanding⠀from⠀what⠀others⠀observe,⠀keeping⠀access⠀to⠀other⠀minds⠀inside⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀The⠀formal⠀architecture⠀carries⠀specific⠀emotional⠀material⠀—⠀pride,⠀unease,⠀gratitude,⠀a⠀new⠀distance⠀from⠀people⠀who⠀knew⠀the⠀character⠀before⠀—⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting,⠀archaic⠀vocabulary,⠀or⠀uniformly⠀elaborate⠀speech.\n\nDo⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀tragic⠀or⠀redemptive⠀conclusion.⠀Let⠀the⠀story's⠀own⠀trajectory⠀decide⠀how⠀the⠀community⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀absorb⠀the⠀change,⠀and⠀let⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀or⠀occasion⠀organize⠀a⠀passage⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀actually⠀provides⠀one.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀present⠀training⠀problem:⠀the⠀listener⠀has⠀already⠀attempted⠀a⠀skill⠀and⠀stalled,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀speak⠀now.⠀Establish⠀the⠀occasion⠀and⠀purpose⠀before⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀begins—the⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀answering⠀a⠀direct⠀question,⠀preparing⠀the⠀listener⠀for⠀an⠀imminent⠀test,⠀or⠀interrupting⠀a⠀harmful⠀practice.⠀Give⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀concrete⠀pressure:⠀the⠀listener⠀is⠀due⠀somewhere,⠀has⠀just⠀failed,⠀or⠀is⠀repeating⠀an⠀error⠀the⠀teller⠀recognizes.\n\nShape⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀diagnostic⠀account⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀moral.⠀The⠀teller⠀recounts⠀one⠀past⠀attempt⠀in⠀sequence:⠀what⠀they⠀believed⠀at⠀the⠀start,⠀what⠀they⠀tried,⠀what⠀feedback⠀or⠀consequence⠀followed,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀understood⠀only⠀later.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀knowledge⠀sit⠀visibly⠀beside⠀the⠀past⠀ignorance,⠀so⠀the⠀listener⠀hears⠀both⠀the⠀original⠀confusion⠀and⠀the⠀later⠀correction.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀omit⠀a⠀detail⠀at⠀first⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀when⠀it⠀becomes⠀relevant,⠀or⠀misremember⠀a⠀sequence⠀and⠀be⠀corrected⠀by⠀another⠀listener.⠀These⠀gaps⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀telling,⠀not⠀flaws⠀to⠀avoid.\n\nChoose⠀one⠀recurring⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀small⠀ritual⠀from⠀the⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀profile⠀and⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀both⠀levels.⠀In⠀the⠀embedded⠀past,⠀show⠀it⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀attempt:⠀a⠀tool⠀held⠀wrong,⠀a⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀without⠀understanding,⠀a⠀habit⠀that⠀masked⠀the⠀real⠀problem.⠀When⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀present,⠀render⠀the⠀listener's⠀changed⠀attention⠀to⠀it—the⠀listener⠀notices⠀the⠀grip,⠀hears⠀the⠀phrase⠀differently,⠀or⠀interrupts⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀ask⠀about⠀the⠀habit.⠀The⠀callback⠀carries⠀the⠀lesson⠀across⠀levels⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀object⠀into⠀proof⠀of⠀mastery.\n\nAfter⠀the⠀embedded⠀account,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀and⠀dramatize⠀the⠀listener's⠀next⠀concrete⠀attempt.⠀Write⠀the⠀attempt⠀as⠀a⠀direct⠀continuation⠀of⠀the⠀telling:⠀the⠀listener⠀tries⠀the⠀corrected⠀grip,⠀asks⠀the⠀question⠀the⠀teller's⠀account⠀exposed,⠀or⠀stops⠀performing⠀the⠀old⠀habit.⠀Let⠀the⠀attempt⠀be⠀partial⠀and⠀legible.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀execute⠀one⠀small⠀step⠀correctly,⠀repeat⠀the⠀old⠀error⠀once⠀more⠀and⠀recognize⠀it,⠀or⠀discover⠀that⠀the⠀tale's⠀lesson⠀applies⠀differently⠀than⠀expected.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀fails,⠀using⠀the⠀teller's⠀account⠀as⠀the⠀source⠀of⠀the⠀new⠀attempt⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀guarantee⠀of⠀success.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀intelligible⠀with⠀separate⠀scene⠀markers⠀for⠀the⠀outer⠀telling⠀and⠀the⠀embedded⠀story.⠀Use⠀recurring⠀phrases⠀to⠀tie⠀the⠀levels⠀together,⠀not⠀to⠀certify⠀the⠀tale⠀as⠀true.⠀The⠀final⠀movement⠀stays⠀inside⠀the⠀outer⠀attempt:⠀the⠀listener⠀acts,⠀observes⠀the⠀result,⠀and⠀names⠀the⠀remaining⠀difficulty.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀attempt⠀to⠀succeed⠀or⠀the⠀tale⠀to⠀be⠀fully⠀confirmed;⠀require⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀to⠀have⠀changed⠀the⠀specific⠀way⠀the⠀listener⠀now⠀tries.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀developmental⠀realism⠀route⠀from⠀the⠀German-language⠀tradition.⠀Write⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀the⠀learner's⠀embedded⠀life:⠀apprenticeship,⠀formal⠀study,⠀informal⠀practice,⠀paid⠀work,⠀household⠀duties,⠀and⠀relationships⠀with⠀teachers⠀or⠀fellow⠀students.⠀Keep⠀improvement⠀connected⠀to⠀material⠀conditions⠀from⠀the⠀first⠀scene.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀access⠀now—time,⠀tools,⠀space,⠀permission,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀attention—and⠀let⠀each⠀advance⠀or⠀setback⠀alter⠀that⠀access⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀way.⠀A⠀lesson⠀is⠀not⠀complete⠀until⠀the⠀learner⠀attempts⠀it⠀again⠀under⠀changed⠀conditions.\n\nAttach⠀one⠀recurring⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀small⠀daily⠀act⠀to⠀the⠀learner's⠀routine⠀in⠀the⠀opening.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀notebook⠀carried⠀to⠀work,⠀a⠀cup⠀set⠀by⠀the⠀stove⠀before⠀practice,⠀a⠀repeated⠀warning⠀from⠀a⠀supervisor,⠀or⠀a⠀joke⠀shared⠀with⠀a⠀fellow⠀student.⠀Let⠀it⠀appear⠀at⠀three⠀points:⠀first⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀ordinary⠀day,⠀then⠀after⠀a⠀failure⠀or⠀success⠀when⠀the⠀learner's⠀circumstances⠀have⠀shifted,⠀and⠀finally⠀when⠀the⠀learner⠀understands⠀it⠀differently.⠀The⠀change⠀in⠀meaning⠀must⠀be⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀event—a⠀lost⠀opportunity,⠀a⠀new⠀permission,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀changed⠀regard—not⠀to⠀a⠀sudden⠀confession⠀or⠀miraculous⠀insight.\n\nWrite⠀advancement⠀cumulatively.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle,⠀performing⠀it⠀once,⠀and⠀reproducing⠀it⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Show⠀the⠀difference⠀in⠀the⠀prose:⠀the⠀learner⠀may⠀recite⠀a⠀rule⠀correctly,⠀then⠀fumble⠀the⠀execution,⠀then⠀perform⠀the⠀task⠀while⠀tired,⠀watched,⠀or⠀interrupted.⠀Let⠀a⠀small⠀success⠀alter⠀the⠀learner's⠀standing⠀at⠀work⠀or⠀school.⠀Render⠀how⠀others⠀notice⠀the⠀change⠀through⠀concrete⠀reactions:⠀a⠀supervisor⠀assigns⠀a⠀harder⠀task,⠀a⠀fellow⠀student⠀stops⠀offering⠀help,⠀a⠀household⠀member⠀asks⠀a⠀new⠀question.⠀Approval⠀and⠀resentment⠀both⠀belong⠀to⠀particular⠀characters⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀interests.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀learner's⠀thought⠀and⠀action,⠀with⠀restrained⠀syntax⠀that⠀follows⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀notices,⠀decides,⠀and⠀does.⠀Do⠀not⠀inflate⠀every⠀moment.⠀Tenderness⠀and⠀humor⠀arise⠀from⠀shared⠀history:⠀a⠀teacher's⠀dry⠀remark,⠀a⠀sibling's⠀teasing,⠀a⠀colleague's⠀quiet⠀assistance.⠀Use⠀concrete⠀German-language⠀or⠀regional⠀details⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀setting⠀supplies⠀them;⠀otherwise⠀keep⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀material⠀realism⠀general⠀enough⠀to⠀preserve⠀the⠀world's⠀facts.\n\nClose⠀on⠀the⠀next⠀concrete⠀step⠀already⠀in⠀motion:⠀the⠀learner⠀arrives⠀at⠀a⠀scheduled⠀lesson,⠀begins⠀a⠀revised⠀practice⠀routine,⠀starts⠀a⠀conversation⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀impossible,⠀or⠀faces⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀still⠀feels⠀beyond⠀reach.⠀Write⠀the⠀step⠀as⠀a⠀direct⠀result⠀of⠀the⠀preceding⠀change⠀in⠀access⠀or⠀understanding.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀victory;⠀require⠀visible⠀movement⠀in⠀capability⠀and⠀self-understanding,⠀with⠀the⠀still-difficult⠀parts⠀named⠀honestly.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nSet⠀the⠀progression⠀inside⠀a⠀world⠀where⠀old⠀authority⠀still⠀shapes⠀present⠀life⠀but⠀no⠀longer⠀fully⠀controls⠀it.⠀Establish⠀the⠀specific⠀mechanism⠀of⠀that⠀authority⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀scene:⠀permission,⠀access,⠀memory,⠀threat,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀owed⠀to⠀an⠀older⠀person.⠀The⠀learner's⠀attempts⠀at⠀advancement⠀collide⠀with⠀this⠀mechanism⠀directly.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀try,⠀what⠀is⠀withheld,⠀and⠀what⠀happens⠀when⠀the⠀learner⠀tests⠀the⠀boundary.⠀Urban⠀material⠀detail⠀carries⠀the⠀pressure:⠀a⠀cramped⠀room⠀where⠀practice⠀is⠀forbidden,⠀a⠀repaired⠀tool⠀that⠀still⠀bears⠀an⠀old⠀owner's⠀mark,⠀a⠀badge⠀or⠀token⠀passed⠀down⠀with⠀conditions⠀attached.\n\nAttach⠀one⠀recurring⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀small⠀ritual⠀to⠀that⠀inherited⠀mechanism⠀from⠀the⠀start.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀daily⠀task⠀performed⠀for⠀an⠀older⠀mentor,⠀a⠀worn⠀object⠀kept⠀as⠀proof⠀of⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀whenever⠀the⠀learner⠀asks⠀for⠀more.⠀Let⠀it⠀return⠀after⠀a⠀success,⠀a⠀failure,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀trust.⠀Each⠀return⠀marks⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀learner's⠀relationship⠀to⠀the⠀old⠀authority:⠀the⠀object⠀may⠀become⠀a⠀source⠀of⠀comfort,⠀a⠀reminder⠀of⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀proof⠀of⠀how⠀far⠀the⠀learner⠀has⠀come.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀miraculous⠀repair⠀or⠀total⠀escape.⠀Show⠀the⠀learner⠀gaining⠀capability⠀in⠀small,⠀legible⠀steps:⠀a⠀new⠀technique⠀attempted,⠀a⠀refusal⠀that⠀works,⠀a⠀private⠀practice⠀that⠀finally⠀yields⠀an⠀effect,⠀or⠀a⠀relationship⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀know.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀Gothic-Punk⠀atmosphere⠀in⠀the⠀sensory⠀texture⠀of⠀training⠀and⠀confrontation.⠀When⠀a⠀social⠀mask⠀falls⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀write⠀the⠀revealed⠀desire⠀or⠀fear⠀as⠀a⠀specific⠀private⠀experience⠀that⠀alters⠀the⠀learner's⠀next⠀attempt.⠀The⠀learner⠀may⠀discover⠀that⠀a⠀mentor's⠀harshness⠀conceals⠀fear,⠀that⠀a⠀friend's⠀encouragement⠀carries⠀an⠀unspoken⠀demand,⠀or⠀that⠀an⠀intimate⠀relationship⠀supports⠀practice⠀while⠀complicating⠀loyalty.⠀Render⠀the⠀moral⠀complication⠀through⠀the⠀learner's⠀actual⠀reasoning⠀and⠀hesitation,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀general⠀mood⠀of⠀oppression.\n\nWrite⠀advancement⠀through⠀attempts⠀and⠀feedback.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀under⠀the⠀old⠀authority's⠀pressure.⠀Show⠀the⠀learner⠀performing⠀a⠀move⠀correctly⠀in⠀private,⠀then⠀faltering⠀when⠀an⠀older⠀person⠀watches,⠀then⠀finding⠀a⠀way⠀to⠀practice⠀that⠀the⠀authority⠀cannot⠀see.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly:⠀a⠀new⠀technique⠀may⠀arrive⠀while⠀the⠀learner's⠀ability⠀to⠀refuse⠀or⠀negotiate⠀lags,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀practice⠀may⠀improve⠀while⠀public⠀performance⠀still⠀fails.\n\nClose⠀on⠀the⠀learner's⠀concrete⠀next⠀task⠀already⠀underway,⠀informed⠀by⠀the⠀intimacy⠀and⠀decay⠀around⠀them.⠀The⠀learner⠀reaches⠀the⠀practice⠀ground,⠀raises⠀the⠀tool,⠀or⠀repeats⠀the⠀phrase⠀just⠀before⠀acting.⠀Write⠀the⠀attempt⠀as⠀a⠀direct⠀response⠀to⠀the⠀specific⠀mechanism⠀established⠀earlier—the⠀learner⠀tests⠀the⠀boundary,⠀uses⠀the⠀hidden⠀practice,⠀or⠀asks⠀the⠀question⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀forbidden.⠀Leave⠀the⠀outcome⠀contingent⠀on⠀the⠀next⠀real⠀choice.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀victory,⠀but⠀leave⠀the⠀next⠀movement⠀clearly⠀about⠀to⠀be⠀tested.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism⠀route⠀from⠀the⠀Indian⠀literary⠀traditions.⠀Make⠀progression⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀learner's⠀ordinary⠀world:⠀household⠀duties,⠀family⠀expectations,⠀local⠀work,⠀friendships,⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀effects⠀of⠀a⠀newly⠀acquired⠀skill⠀or⠀lesson.⠀Advancement⠀is⠀not⠀only⠀a⠀rank⠀or⠀a⠀magical⠀feat;⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀contribute,⠀what⠀others⠀request⠀or⠀permit,⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀learner⠀is⠀spoken⠀about⠀at⠀home⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀neighborhood.⠀Keep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀when⠀the⠀setting⠀supplies⠀them,⠀without⠀forcing⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure.\n\nAttach⠀one⠀recurring⠀habit⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀household⠀relationship⠀from⠀the⠀first⠀scene.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀morning⠀practice⠀a⠀parent⠀watches,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal⠀the⠀learner⠀sometimes⠀misses,⠀a⠀familiar⠀errand⠀a⠀sibling⠀helps⠀with,⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀teacher⠀that⠀a⠀parent⠀repeats⠀at⠀home.⠀Let⠀the⠀habit⠀return⠀after⠀a⠀failure⠀or⠀success.⠀Each⠀return⠀marks⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀relationship:⠀the⠀parent⠀no⠀longer⠀needs⠀to⠀help,⠀the⠀sibling⠀stops⠀waiting,⠀the⠀meal⠀becomes⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀the⠀learner⠀is⠀asked⠀new⠀questions,⠀or⠀the⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀is⠀said⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀tone.⠀The⠀learner's⠀emotional⠀reframing⠀is⠀an⠀actual⠀change⠀in⠀how⠀they⠀understand⠀that⠀recurring⠀detail,⠀not⠀a⠀sudden⠀speech⠀or⠀single⠀confession.\n\nShow⠀advancement⠀through⠀attempts⠀and⠀feedback.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle,⠀performing⠀it⠀once,⠀and⠀reproducing⠀it⠀under⠀household⠀pressure⠀or⠀public⠀scrutiny.⠀Write⠀the⠀difference⠀in⠀the⠀prose:⠀the⠀learner⠀may⠀explain⠀a⠀method⠀correctly⠀at⠀dinner,⠀then⠀fumble⠀it⠀when⠀a⠀neighbor⠀watches,⠀then⠀perform⠀it⠀while⠀a⠀younger⠀sibling⠀interrupts⠀or⠀a⠀parent⠀worries.⠀Let⠀a⠀small⠀success⠀alter⠀a⠀family⠀negotiation⠀or⠀a⠀workplace⠀task.⠀Render⠀the⠀mixed⠀feelings⠀through⠀the⠀learner's⠀actual⠀reasoning:⠀pride⠀that⠀a⠀parent⠀no⠀longer⠀needs⠀to⠀help,⠀guilt⠀at⠀the⠀new⠀distance,⠀relief⠀at⠀easing⠀someone⠀else's⠀burden,⠀or⠀fear⠀of⠀losing⠀an⠀old⠀closeness.\n\nTenderness⠀and⠀humor⠀belong⠀to⠀particular⠀characters.⠀A⠀parent's⠀dry⠀remark,⠀a⠀sibling's⠀teasing,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀exaggerated⠀praise,⠀or⠀a⠀friend's⠀quiet⠀assistance⠀all⠀arise⠀from⠀shared⠀history.⠀Do⠀not⠀sprinkle⠀warmth⠀over⠀every⠀scene.⠀Let⠀the⠀learner's⠀changing⠀capability⠀create⠀tension⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀joy:⠀a⠀new⠀skill⠀may⠀mean⠀the⠀learner⠀is⠀asked⠀to⠀do⠀more,⠀or⠀a⠀parent⠀may⠀resist⠀the⠀learner's⠀independence⠀even⠀while⠀being⠀proud.\n\nClose⠀on⠀a⠀concrete⠀next⠀step⠀in⠀the⠀learner's⠀ordinary⠀life⠀already⠀underway:⠀the⠀learner⠀begins⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀impossible,⠀agrees⠀to⠀a⠀new⠀responsibility,⠀or⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀familiar⠀routine⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding.⠀Write⠀the⠀step⠀as⠀a⠀direct⠀result⠀of⠀the⠀preceding⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀and⠀household⠀standing.⠀The⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀is⠀clearly⠀present,⠀and⠀the⠀remaining⠀difficulty⠀is⠀honestly⠀named.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀victory⠀or⠀a⠀reconciliation;⠀require⠀visible⠀movement⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀how⠀their⠀ordinary⠀life⠀has⠀shifted.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route⠀from⠀the⠀Japanese⠀literary⠀traditions.⠀Shape⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀personal⠀record:⠀dated⠀entries,⠀short⠀observations,⠀remembered⠀lessons,⠀and⠀present⠀attempts⠀interleaved.⠀The⠀teller⠀is⠀the⠀learner⠀or⠀someone⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀learner,⠀and⠀the⠀reflection⠀must⠀always⠀return⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀or⠀still⠀cannot⠀do.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀reflection⠀replace⠀action;⠀use⠀it⠀to⠀prepare,⠀review,⠀or⠀interpret⠀a⠀concrete⠀attempt,⠀practice,⠀or⠀test.\n\nAttach⠀one⠀recurring⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀small⠀daily⠀act⠀to⠀the⠀record's⠀first⠀dated⠀entry.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀courtyard⠀the⠀learner⠀crosses⠀before⠀practice,⠀a⠀training⠀stick⠀kept⠀by⠀the⠀door,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀at⠀the⠀start⠀of⠀each⠀lesson,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀task⠀performed⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀hour.⠀Let⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀appear⠀at⠀three⠀different⠀points⠀in⠀the⠀record.⠀First⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀background,⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀ordinary⠀day.⠀Then⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀source⠀of⠀frustration⠀or⠀confusion⠀after⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt.⠀Finally⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀something⠀understood⠀differently⠀after⠀an⠀event.⠀Each⠀appearance⠀shows⠀a⠀slight⠀change⠀in⠀meaning⠀tied⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀now⠀perform,⠀not⠀a⠀sudden⠀epiphany.\n\nInterleave⠀remembered⠀lessons⠀with⠀present⠀attempts.⠀When⠀writing⠀a⠀remembered⠀lesson,⠀distinguish⠀what⠀was⠀known⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀understands⠀in⠀the⠀present.⠀The⠀entry⠀may⠀say:⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀the⠀learner⠀thought⠀the⠀teacher⠀meant⠀one⠀thing,⠀but⠀now⠀the⠀learner⠀sees⠀the⠀instruction⠀differently.⠀Show⠀the⠀difference⠀through⠀the⠀record's⠀own⠀language—the⠀earlier⠀entry⠀uses⠀the⠀learner's⠀old⠀terms,⠀the⠀later⠀entry⠀corrects⠀them.⠀Let⠀the⠀record's⠀teller⠀be⠀personal⠀but⠀not⠀uniformly⠀quiet.⠀The⠀Japanese⠀tradition⠀offers⠀direct⠀feeling,⠀exuberance,⠀and⠀plain⠀argument⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀omission.⠀The⠀learner⠀can⠀be⠀irritated,⠀pleased,⠀frightened,⠀or⠀dryly⠀comic⠀depending⠀on⠀the⠀scene.\n\nWrite⠀advancement⠀unevenly.⠀A⠀new⠀technique⠀may⠀arrive⠀while⠀the⠀learner's⠀emotional⠀control⠀lags,⠀or⠀physical⠀strength⠀may⠀improve⠀before⠀a⠀social⠀skill.⠀Show⠀the⠀unevenness⠀in⠀the⠀record:⠀one⠀entry⠀celebrates⠀a⠀small⠀success,⠀the⠀next⠀records⠀a⠀failure⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀area.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀by⠀letting⠀the⠀record⠀note⠀both⠀the⠀learner's⠀correct⠀understanding⠀and⠀the⠀still-failing⠀performance.\n\nClose⠀on⠀a⠀present-day⠀attempt⠀already⠀in⠀progress⠀or⠀just⠀beginning.⠀The⠀record⠀has⠀led⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀the⠀exact⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀learner's⠀new⠀capability⠀can⠀be⠀tested.⠀Write⠀the⠀attempt⠀as⠀a⠀direct⠀continuation⠀of⠀the⠀record's⠀last⠀observation:⠀the⠀learner⠀crosses⠀the⠀courtyard,⠀picks⠀up⠀the⠀training⠀stick,⠀or⠀repeats⠀the⠀teacher's⠀phrase⠀just⠀before⠀acting.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀completed⠀victory⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀Leave⠀the⠀next⠀movement⠀clearly⠀about⠀to⠀be⠀tested,⠀with⠀the⠀record's⠀accumulated⠀understanding⠀visibly⠀informing⠀the⠀attempt.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀realism,⠀chronicle,⠀and⠀testimonial⠀route⠀from⠀the⠀Latin⠀American⠀literary⠀traditions,⠀not⠀the⠀fantastic⠀or⠀magical-realist⠀option⠀unless⠀the⠀world's⠀canon⠀already⠀permits⠀it.⠀Write⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀witnessed⠀account:⠀the⠀learner's⠀attempts,⠀failures,⠀and⠀changed⠀capabilities⠀are⠀told⠀against⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀community,⠀workplace,⠀or⠀local⠀conflict.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀from⠀the⠀story's⠀setting.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀can⠀include⠀what⠀neighbors⠀said,⠀what⠀a⠀teacher⠀demanded,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀shortage⠀altered⠀training.⠀Advancement⠀must⠀remain⠀concrete:⠀a⠀new⠀resource,⠀a⠀second⠀chance,⠀a⠀technique⠀finally⠀working,⠀or⠀a⠀friend⠀who⠀shares⠀a⠀method.\n\nAttach⠀one⠀repeated⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀small⠀ritual⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀community⠀relationship⠀from⠀the⠀first⠀chronicle⠀entry.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀tool⠀repaired⠀by⠀a⠀parent,⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀mentor,⠀a⠀meal⠀shared⠀after⠀practice,⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀the⠀learner⠀performs⠀for⠀a⠀neighbor.⠀Let⠀it⠀return⠀after⠀the⠀learner⠀succeeds,⠀fails,⠀or⠀understands⠀something⠀new.⠀Each⠀return⠀marks⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀relationship:⠀the⠀parent⠀no⠀longer⠀repairs⠀the⠀tool,⠀the⠀mentor⠀repeats⠀the⠀phrase⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀tone,⠀the⠀meal⠀becomes⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀the⠀learner⠀is⠀asked⠀new⠀questions,⠀or⠀the⠀neighbor⠀stops⠀asking⠀for⠀help.⠀The⠀chronicle's⠀teller⠀may⠀recall⠀the⠀detail⠀differently⠀over⠀time,⠀but⠀the⠀change⠀must⠀be⠀tied⠀to⠀an⠀actual⠀event⠀in⠀the⠀learner's⠀life.\n\nShow⠀the⠀community's⠀reaction⠀to⠀advancement⠀through⠀concrete⠀reported⠀speech⠀and⠀action.⠀Pride,⠀envy,⠀hope,⠀or⠀pressure⠀to⠀use⠀the⠀new⠀skill⠀for⠀someone⠀else's⠀benefit⠀all⠀belong⠀to⠀particular⠀people⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀interests.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀was⠀not⠀present⠀for⠀an⠀event,⠀distinguish⠀personal⠀participation⠀from⠀reported⠀events:⠀write⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀saw⠀and⠀did,⠀then⠀write⠀what⠀a⠀neighbor⠀or⠀teacher⠀said⠀happened,⠀with⠀the⠀source⠀named.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀reported⠀events⠀carry⠀the⠀same⠀authority⠀as⠀witnessed⠀ones.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀polyphonic⠀only⠀if⠀that⠀really⠀suits⠀the⠀story;⠀otherwise⠀let⠀a⠀single⠀responsible⠀narrator⠀record⠀what⠀they⠀saw,⠀heard,⠀and⠀did.⠀Write⠀advancement⠀through⠀attempts⠀and⠀feedback.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle,⠀performing⠀it⠀once,⠀and⠀reproducing⠀it⠀under⠀community⠀pressure⠀or⠀public⠀scrutiny.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly:⠀the⠀learner⠀may⠀master⠀a⠀technique⠀while⠀still⠀failing⠀to⠀negotiate⠀with⠀a⠀neighbor,⠀or⠀improve⠀at⠀a⠀task⠀while⠀still⠀misunderstanding⠀a⠀teacher's⠀instruction.\n\nClose⠀on⠀a⠀present⠀test⠀already⠀underway⠀that⠀the⠀chronicle⠀has⠀made⠀meaningful.⠀The⠀learner⠀arrives⠀at⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀will⠀be⠀tested,⠀begins⠀the⠀task,⠀or⠀faces⠀the⠀person⠀whose⠀demand⠀the⠀chronicle⠀has⠀explained.⠀Write⠀the⠀test⠀as⠀a⠀direct⠀result⠀of⠀the⠀preceding⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀and⠀community⠀standing.⠀The⠀new⠀capability⠀is⠀clearly⠀present,⠀and⠀the⠀remaining⠀obstacle⠀is⠀honestly⠀named.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀supernatural⠀events⠀or⠀magical⠀realism⠀to⠀close⠀a⠀gap;⠀the⠀genre's⠀progression⠀must⠀come⠀from⠀attempts,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changed⠀understanding.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀victory;⠀require⠀visible⠀movement⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀community⠀has⠀shifted⠀around⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaman::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀each⠀scene⠀with⠀the⠀learner⠀already⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀situation:⠀a⠀practice⠀yard,⠀a⠀lesson,⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀conversation⠀with⠀someone⠀who⠀cares.⠀Use⠀clear⠀spatial⠀markers⠀whenever⠀the⠀learner⠀moves⠀or⠀the⠀setting⠀changes.⠀Keep⠀paragraphs⠀short⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀does,⠀hears,⠀and⠀feels.⠀When⠀a⠀new⠀skill⠀or⠀mechanic⠀appears,⠀present⠀it⠀in⠀plain,⠀immediate⠀terms:⠀what⠀it⠀does,⠀what⠀it⠀costs,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀must⠀do⠀to⠀try⠀it.\n\nAttach⠀one⠀small⠀recurring⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀habit⠀to⠀the⠀first⠀scene's⠀visual⠀staging.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀bent⠀coin⠀the⠀learner⠀fidgets⠀with,⠀a⠀lunchbox⠀set⠀down⠀before⠀practice,⠀a⠀friend's⠀taunt⠀repeated⠀at⠀the⠀start⠀of⠀each⠀lesson,⠀or⠀a⠀parent's⠀quiet⠀instruction⠀said⠀at⠀the⠀door.⠀Let⠀it⠀return⠀at⠀different⠀points.⠀After⠀a⠀success⠀or⠀failure,⠀show⠀the⠀learner's⠀private⠀reaction⠀in⠀a⠀focused⠀beat:⠀a⠀short⠀paragraph⠀of⠀the⠀learner's⠀actual⠀thought⠀or⠀sensation,⠀placed⠀immediately⠀after⠀the⠀event.⠀The⠀reaction⠀may⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀comedy⠀or⠀melodrama.⠀The⠀recurring⠀detail⠀gains⠀weight⠀gradually:⠀the⠀same⠀coin⠀may⠀first⠀be⠀a⠀joke,⠀then⠀a⠀reminder⠀of⠀a⠀promise,⠀then⠀proof⠀of⠀how⠀far⠀the⠀learner⠀has⠀come.\n\nWrite⠀progression⠀through⠀visible⠀attempts.⠀Show⠀a⠀failed⠀try,⠀feedback⠀from⠀a⠀teacher⠀or⠀rival,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀attempt⠀that⠀differs⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀way.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀by⠀writing⠀the⠀difference⠀in⠀the⠀action:⠀the⠀learner⠀may⠀recite⠀the⠀rule⠀correctly,⠀then⠀fumble⠀the⠀execution,⠀then⠀perform⠀the⠀task⠀while⠀tired,⠀watched,⠀or⠀interrupted.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly:⠀the⠀learner⠀may⠀master⠀a⠀physical⠀move⠀while⠀still⠀misunderstanding⠀a⠀conversation,⠀or⠀finally⠀understand⠀an⠀instruction⠀while⠀still⠀flinching⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Relationships⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀learner's⠀life;⠀a⠀scene⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀job,⠀a⠀shared⠀quiet⠀moment,⠀or⠀an⠀argument⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀practice⠀means.\n\nClose⠀at⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀already⠀underway:⠀the⠀learner⠀reaches⠀the⠀practice⠀ground,⠀raises⠀the⠀tool,⠀or⠀repeats⠀the⠀teacher's⠀phrase⠀just⠀before⠀acting.⠀Write⠀the⠀edge⠀as⠀a⠀direct⠀result⠀of⠀the⠀preceding⠀attempt⠀and⠀feedback.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀victory,⠀but⠀leave⠀the⠀next⠀movement⠀clearly⠀about⠀to⠀be⠀tested.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nTrack⠀one⠀repeated⠀thing⠀—⠀a⠀practice,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀phrase⠀said⠀before⠀work⠀begins⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀return⠀carry⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀do.⠀The⠀first⠀occurrence⠀can⠀be⠀effortful⠀in⠀its⠀syntax:⠀clauses⠀that⠀strain,⠀a⠀sentence⠀that⠀has⠀to⠀stop⠀for⠀breath.⠀When⠀the⠀same⠀practice⠀comes⠀back⠀later,⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀move⠀differently⠀—⠀easier,⠀or⠀hard⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀place⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀rhythm⠀itself⠀records⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀learned⠀and⠀what⠀has⠀not.⠀Tie⠀every⠀image⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀associations;⠀a⠀comparison⠀earns⠀its⠀length⠀when⠀it⠀makes⠀the⠀felt⠀difference⠀between⠀then⠀and⠀now⠀present,⠀not⠀when⠀it⠀decorates⠀a⠀rank⠀gained.\n\nLet⠀improvement⠀arrive⠀through⠀attempts⠀and⠀feedback⠀inside⠀this⠀attention.⠀A⠀principle⠀understood⠀in⠀one⠀paragraph⠀can⠀fail⠀in⠀the⠀hands⠀in⠀the⠀next;⠀a⠀correction⠀from⠀another⠀person⠀can⠀lodge⠀in⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀recurs⠀afterward⠀with⠀new⠀weight.⠀Put⠀the⠀plainest⠀statement⠀where⠀the⠀feeling⠀is⠀strongest⠀—⠀one⠀flat⠀sentence⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀change⠀does⠀work⠀ornament⠀cannot.⠀Ordinary⠀life⠀interrupts⠀the⠀figure:⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀a⠀joke,⠀a⠀routine⠀chore.⠀These⠀interruptions⠀are⠀not⠀lapses⠀from⠀the⠀style;⠀they⠀are⠀the⠀shared⠀material⠀out⠀of⠀which⠀the⠀changed⠀understanding⠀is⠀made.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀speakers⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀registers.⠀Not⠀everyone⠀thinks⠀in⠀images,⠀and⠀a⠀plain⠀answer⠀set⠀beside⠀an⠀elaborated⠀perception⠀shows⠀two⠀people⠀living⠀the⠀same⠀change⠀differently.⠀The⠀reply⠀can⠀end⠀without⠀announcing⠀transformation:⠀hold⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀beside⠀the⠀remaining⠀difficulty⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀recurring⠀detail,⠀returned⠀once⠀more,⠀say⠀what⠀has⠀altered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀progress⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling:⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀once⠀demanded⠀everything⠀now⠀goes⠀easily,⠀and⠀the⠀ease⠀is⠀where⠀the⠀reflection⠀lives.⠀Render⠀these⠀small⠀irreversible⠀changes⠀directly⠀—⠀a⠀routine⠀that⠀needed⠀full⠀attention⠀has⠀become⠀automatic,⠀a⠀tool⠀once⠀carried⠀awkwardly⠀now⠀rests⠀in⠀the⠀hand⠀as⠀though⠀it⠀had⠀always⠀fit⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀notice⠀what⠀left⠀along⠀with⠀the⠀difficulty:⠀the⠀concentration⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀fill⠀an⠀hour,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀once⠀stood⠀close⠀and⠀corrected.⠀Keep⠀present⠀experience⠀present.⠀A⠀meal,⠀a⠀conversation,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀pleasurable⠀while⠀the⠀account⠀holds⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available⠀beside⠀it.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀repeated⠀things.⠀An⠀object,⠀a⠀household⠀routine,⠀a⠀phrase⠀someone⠀used⠀to⠀say⠀before⠀practice⠀can⠀return⠀after⠀an⠀intervening⠀event⠀with⠀its⠀meaning⠀altered⠀—⠀the⠀same⠀words⠀now⠀marking⠀a⠀distance⠀crossed⠀or⠀an⠀absence.⠀The⠀reflection⠀may⠀be⠀direct,⠀the⠀narrator⠀thinking⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀old⠀struggle⠀contained,⠀or⠀carried⠀by⠀one⠀exact⠀detail:⠀the⠀worn⠀grip,⠀the⠀mended⠀cup,⠀the⠀question⠀nobody⠀has⠀to⠀ask⠀anymore.⠀Let⠀recurrences⠀land⠀differently⠀—⠀some⠀as⠀triumph,⠀some⠀as⠀mild⠀regret,⠀some⠀as⠀both⠀felt⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀moment⠀without⠀resolution.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀milestones⠀inside⠀shared⠀daily⠀life.⠀A⠀capability⠀may⠀be⠀recognized⠀mid-conversation⠀about⠀something⠀else,⠀or⠀only⠀when⠀an⠀old⠀habit⠀reaches⠀for⠀a⠀support⠀no⠀longer⠀needed.⠀Let⠀belonging⠀shift⠀with⠀skill⠀—⠀who⠀is⠀needed⠀now,⠀who⠀drifts,⠀who⠀arrives⠀—⠀without⠀charging⠀every⠀advance⠀with⠀sadness⠀or⠀pronouncing⠀impermanence⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀ends.⠀Stop⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀stops.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀the⠀progression⠀inside⠀a⠀frame:⠀a⠀situated⠀teller⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀reason⠀to⠀speak⠀—⠀a⠀listener⠀who⠀asked,⠀an⠀occasion⠀that⠀recalled⠀it⠀—⠀retelling⠀an⠀effort⠀from⠀earlier⠀life.⠀Keep⠀the⠀frame⠀alive⠀through⠀the⠀telling,⠀because⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀known⠀then⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀known⠀now⠀does⠀the⠀genre's⠀work.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀pause⠀at⠀an⠀old⠀failure⠀and⠀admit⠀how⠀it⠀looks⠀from⠀here,⠀or⠀hold⠀back⠀the⠀outcome⠀of⠀an⠀attempt⠀until⠀a⠀listener's⠀question⠀forces⠀it.⠀The⠀progression⠀is⠀this⠀uneven⠀sequence⠀of⠀remembered⠀efforts,⠀not⠀a⠀numerical⠀climb.\n\nLet⠀the⠀told⠀episodes⠀turn⠀on⠀repeated⠀domestic⠀things⠀—⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀household⠀task,⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀phrase⠀between⠀people⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀recur⠀across⠀the⠀telling⠀with⠀new⠀weight⠀after⠀a⠀later⠀event:⠀the⠀bowl⠀broken⠀during⠀the⠀first⠀attempt,⠀the⠀word⠀of⠀instruction⠀that⠀eventually⠀stopped⠀being⠀needed.⠀Humor⠀and⠀tenderness⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀exchange⠀itself:⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀interrupt⠀to⠀ask⠀about⠀the⠀part⠀the⠀teller⠀skipped,⠀dispute⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀answer⠀a⠀grave⠀passage⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern.⠀A⠀reflective⠀or⠀philosophical⠀aside⠀may⠀open⠀outward⠀from⠀one⠀attempt,⠀staying⠀in⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀voice;⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀setting⠀are⠀those⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀already⠀supplied,⠀not⠀a⠀borrowed⠀regional⠀manner⠀or⠀another⠀tradition's⠀mysticism.\n\nTest⠀advancement⠀inside⠀the⠀told⠀episode:⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀against⠀what⠀the⠀episode⠀records⠀failing,⠀and⠀let⠀another⠀character's⠀remembered⠀behavior⠀supply⠀evidence⠀that⠀the⠀old⠀weakness⠀was⠀real.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀honest⠀—⠀report⠀another⠀person's⠀deeds⠀and⠀words,⠀not⠀their⠀private⠀reasoning,⠀unless⠀the⠀frame⠀has⠀established⠀the⠀right⠀to⠀more.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀pause⠀with⠀the⠀listener⠀understanding⠀something⠀new⠀about⠀the⠀teller's⠀past⠀capability,⠀the⠀frame⠀still⠀open,⠀rather⠀than⠀closing⠀on⠀a⠀declared⠀transformation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀capability⠀change:⠀the⠀number⠀of⠀attempts⠀before⠀the⠀result⠀came,⠀the⠀tool⠀held⠀steady⠀on⠀the⠀third⠀morning,⠀the⠀task⠀finished⠀before⠀the⠀kettle⠀boiled,⠀the⠀instruction⠀no⠀longer⠀given.⠀State⠀before⠀and⠀after⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀Cut⠀the⠀intermediate⠀explanation⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀visible⠀change⠀and⠀the⠀remaining⠀difficulty⠀keep⠀the⠀causal⠀step⠀inferable;⠀omission⠀should⠀leave⠀something⠀to⠀infer,⠀not⠀delete⠀how⠀the⠀change⠀happened.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀a⠀repeated⠀routine⠀when⠀the⠀return⠀shows⠀a⠀difference,⠀and⠀give⠀it⠀one⠀note⠀rather⠀than⠀atmosphere:⠀the⠀bowl⠀did⠀not⠀crack⠀this⠀time,⠀the⠀stairs⠀went⠀without⠀a⠀stop,⠀the⠀question⠀was⠀answered⠀before⠀anyone⠀asked⠀it.⠀The⠀same⠀economy⠀governs⠀inward⠀life.⠀One⠀sentence⠀can⠀register⠀why⠀the⠀change⠀matters;⠀if⠀a⠀thought⠀genuinely⠀needs⠀length⠀to⠀make⠀sense,⠀give⠀it⠀the⠀length,⠀but⠀stop⠀the⠀commentary⠀where⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀would⠀stop.\n\nLet⠀humor⠀and⠀tenderness⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀precise⠀gesture⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀spoken⠀line⠀rather⠀than⠀reflection,⠀and⠀keep⠀each⠀voice⠀distinct⠀within⠀a⠀few⠀words.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀tested⠀change⠀is⠀legible⠀—⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀shown⠀against⠀what⠀still⠀fails⠀—⠀without⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀gained.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀scene-first,⠀with⠀advancement⠀embedded⠀in⠀ongoing⠀life:⠀the⠀practice⠀session⠀happens⠀inside⠀conversation,⠀errands,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀time,⠀never⠀quarantined⠀as⠀a⠀training⠀passage.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀inner⠀experience⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀authorized⠀to⠀carry,⠀orienting⠀through⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transition⠀rather⠀than⠀recap.⠀Make⠀capability⠀concrete⠀in⠀body⠀and⠀attention⠀—⠀what⠀can⠀now⠀be⠀accomplished,⠀what⠀still⠀fails,⠀what⠀no⠀longer⠀requires⠀thought⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀declared⠀rank.\n\nUse⠀repeated⠀objects,⠀routines,⠀and⠀phrases⠀as⠀the⠀progression⠀markers.⠀A⠀recurring⠀meal,⠀a⠀habitual⠀chore,⠀a⠀word⠀spoken⠀before⠀a⠀task⠀can⠀return⠀after⠀an⠀intervening⠀event⠀with⠀new⠀weight,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀notices⠀the⠀change⠀through⠀the⠀routine⠀itself:⠀the⠀task⠀once⠀dreaded⠀now⠀ordinary,⠀the⠀guidance⠀no⠀longer⠀offered,⠀the⠀friend⠀watching⠀differently⠀from⠀the⠀doorway.⠀Humor⠀and⠀tenderness⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀people⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀and⠀arrive⠀on⠀their⠀timing.\n\nLet⠀development⠀run⠀unevenly.⠀One⠀person⠀understands⠀the⠀principle⠀and⠀cannot⠀execute⠀it⠀under⠀stress;⠀another⠀performs⠀fluently⠀and⠀still⠀lacks⠀the⠀capacity⠀that⠀would⠀let⠀the⠀skill⠀matter⠀to⠀anyone.⠀Track⠀progress⠀and⠀remaining⠀difficulty⠀side⠀by⠀side⠀without⠀extracting⠀a⠀lesson.⠀Dialogue⠀can⠀cut⠀across⠀inner⠀reasoning⠀mid-thought;⠀subtext⠀can⠀remain⠀unannounced.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀stop⠀inside⠀a⠀continuing⠀task⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀still⠀available⠀rather⠀than⠀closing⠀a⠀growth⠀arc.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nOrganize⠀each⠀progression⠀beat⠀around⠀the⠀established⠀relationship:⠀choose⠀the⠀scenes⠀where⠀a⠀changed⠀capability⠀changes⠀what⠀one⠀person⠀can⠀offer,⠀need,⠀or⠀risk⠀with⠀the⠀other.⠀Make⠀the⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀scene⠀selection,⠀private⠀language,⠀repeated⠀moments,⠀and⠀consequences⠀that⠀fulfill⠀what⠀this⠀particular⠀relationship⠀promises⠀—⠀and⠀work⠀only⠀from⠀the⠀premise⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀supplied,⠀never⠀from⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.\n\nLet⠀the⠀shared⠀life⠀carry⠀the⠀practice.⠀One⠀teaches,⠀or⠀fails⠀to⠀teach;⠀one⠀comforts⠀after⠀a⠀bad⠀attempt;⠀one⠀becomes⠀newly⠀unnecessary⠀once⠀the⠀skill⠀holds⠀and⠀has⠀to⠀find⠀what⠀else⠀to⠀be⠀to⠀the⠀other.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀the⠀space⠀it⠀actually⠀occupies⠀here,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀of⠀those⠀beats⠀also⠀move⠀the⠀capability:⠀the⠀comfort⠀follows⠀a⠀concrete⠀failure,⠀the⠀rivalry⠀is⠀measured⠀in⠀what⠀each⠀can⠀now⠀do,⠀the⠀discovery⠀is⠀a⠀skill⠀or⠀a⠀truth⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀Repeated⠀routines⠀—⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀an⠀inside⠀phrase,⠀a⠀place⠀habitually⠀revisited⠀—⠀take⠀on⠀new⠀weight⠀after⠀a⠀progression⠀event,⠀so⠀the⠀callback⠀means⠀something⠀it⠀did⠀not⠀mean⠀before.\n\nKeep⠀interiority⠀causal⠀on⠀both⠀sides⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀permits.⠀A⠀missed⠀cue⠀can⠀sit⠀beside⠀a⠀real⠀improvement⠀without⠀canceling⠀either;⠀a⠀motive⠀can⠀go⠀unrecognized⠀or⠀be⠀misread⠀by⠀its⠀owner⠀while⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀it⠀plainly.⠀Not⠀every⠀development⠀is⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀loyalty⠀crisis.⠀The⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀may⠀land⠀while⠀the⠀practical⠀question⠀stays⠀open:⠀the⠀relationship⠀now⠀knows⠀something⠀it⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀before,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀task⠀is⠀still⠀waiting.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀a⠀chronicle⠀voice.⠀Open⠀deliberately⠀—⠀on⠀a⠀person,⠀an⠀act,⠀something⠀to⠀be⠀told⠀—⠀and⠀establish⠀each⠀attempt⠀with⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀before⠀expanding⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀tried⠀and⠀what⠀changed.⠀Recurring⠀phrasing⠀carries⠀the⠀progress:⠀words⠀spoken⠀at⠀an⠀early⠀failure⠀return⠀at⠀a⠀later⠀demonstration⠀with⠀their⠀application⠀changed,⠀and⠀a⠀familiar⠀task⠀can⠀be⠀retold⠀as⠀a⠀deed⠀once⠀impossible.⠀Let⠀an⠀act's⠀relation⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀stay⠀provisional⠀—⠀the⠀telling⠀claims⠀that⠀this⠀change⠀is⠀now⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀people⠀say⠀about⠀this⠀person,⠀not⠀that⠀lasting⠀fame⠀has⠀settled⠀on⠀anyone.\n\nTake⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀material⠀from⠀the⠀shared⠀life:⠀a⠀chore⠀done⠀together,⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀phrase⠀between⠀two⠀people,⠀a⠀small⠀kindness⠀or⠀an⠀unpaid⠀debt.⠀These⠀earn⠀their⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀telling⠀through⠀their⠀consequences,⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀can⠀note⠀whose⠀version⠀of⠀an⠀attempt⠀is⠀the⠀one⠀now⠀repeated.⠀Keep⠀the⠀register⠀coherent⠀with⠀the⠀tradition⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀established,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀bend⠀toward⠀ordinary⠀speech⠀—⠀a⠀grand⠀introduction⠀answered⠀by⠀an⠀immediate⠀practical⠀concern,⠀the⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀attempt⠀disputing⠀one⠀detail⠀of⠀it.\n\nMake⠀capability⠀concrete⠀through⠀matched⠀attempts:⠀an⠀earlier⠀failure⠀set⠀against⠀a⠀later⠀success,⠀an⠀earlier⠀unbearable⠀burden⠀against⠀a⠀later⠀manageable⠀one.⠀Allow⠀unevenness⠀—⠀one⠀skill⠀improving⠀while⠀another⠀stays⠀hard,⠀both⠀stated⠀plainly⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀finished⠀hero's⠀arc.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀within⠀the⠀chosen⠀perspective:⠀another⠀person's⠀deeds⠀and⠀words⠀are⠀recordable;⠀their⠀private⠀reasoning⠀is⠀not,⠀unless⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀earned⠀the⠀right⠀to⠀it.⠀End⠀with⠀a⠀further⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀declaration⠀of⠀legend.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social-realist⠀route⠀of⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀tradition.⠀Improvement⠀becomes⠀visible⠀inside⠀ordinary⠀shared⠀life,⠀not⠀through⠀system⠀messages⠀or⠀isolated⠀displays⠀of⠀power.⠀Set⠀practice⠀in⠀rooms⠀the⠀community⠀already⠀uses—a⠀workplace,⠀home,⠀school,⠀or⠀training⠀ground—and⠀test⠀advancement⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀for,⠀with,⠀or⠀despite⠀others.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀composed⠀and⠀observant,⠀with⠀a⠀distinct⠀retrospective⠀voice⠀that⠀may⠀know⠀the⠀outcome⠀but⠀must⠀not⠀give⠀the⠀earlier⠀self⠀that⠀later⠀knowledge.\n\nMake⠀uneven⠀growth⠀legible⠀through⠀repeated⠀tasks.⠀Choose⠀one⠀concrete⠀skill⠀or⠀craft⠀and⠀stage⠀its⠀early⠀difficulty⠀in⠀a⠀full⠀social⠀scene:⠀the⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀the⠀correction⠀or⠀silence⠀from⠀someone⠀nearby,⠀the⠀physical⠀sensation⠀of⠀the⠀mistake,⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀consequence⠀for⠀the⠀day.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀task⠀later⠀under⠀a⠀changed⠀social⠀condition—someone⠀asks⠀for⠀help⠀with⠀it,⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀is⠀handled⠀again,⠀or⠀a⠀morning⠀routine⠀now⠀includes⠀an⠀action⠀that⠀was⠀once⠀impossible.⠀Write⠀the⠀later⠀attempt⠀as⠀a⠀scene,⠀not⠀a⠀summary.⠀Show⠀the⠀altered⠀rhythm⠀of⠀the⠀hands⠀or⠀voice,⠀the⠀reduced⠀hesitation,⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀of⠀the⠀person⠀watching.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀improvement;⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀changed⠀capability⠀alters⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀day.\n\nUse⠀Jun⠀Maeda's⠀callback⠀method⠀as⠀the⠀engine⠀for⠀emotional⠀reframing.⠀Reintroduce⠀the⠀same⠀ordinary⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀routine⠀at⠀a⠀later⠀point,⠀but⠀let⠀its⠀meaning⠀be⠀revised⠀by⠀what⠀has⠀happened.⠀The⠀callback⠀should⠀not⠀explain⠀itself.⠀If⠀a⠀phrase⠀first⠀belonged⠀to⠀a⠀failed⠀morning,⠀its⠀return⠀can⠀now⠀accompany⠀competence,⠀grief,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀joke;⠀the⠀surrounding⠀scene⠀supplies⠀the⠀new⠀weight.⠀Progress⠀is⠀not⠀only⠀measured⠀in⠀capacity;⠀it⠀is⠀also⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀how⠀a⠀familiar⠀thing⠀is⠀experienced.⠀Keep⠀humor⠀and⠀tenderness⠀with⠀the⠀people⠀and⠀scenes⠀that⠀already⠀warrant⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀tragedy⠀or⠀rapid⠀recovery.\n\nAuthor⠀the⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀narration's⠀composed⠀voice.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀rehearses⠀a⠀technique,⠀corrects⠀a⠀mistake,⠀or⠀notices⠀a⠀change,⠀write⠀the⠀actual⠀thought⠀or⠀sensation⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀the⠀remembered⠀instruction⠀arriving⠀before⠀the⠀body⠀obeys,⠀the⠀small⠀surprise⠀at⠀ease,⠀the⠀private⠀comparison⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀failure.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀that⠀interiority⠀unless⠀the⠀person⠀speaks,⠀acts,⠀or⠀shows⠀it.⠀Keep⠀inferences⠀social⠀and⠀practical:⠀readers⠀see⠀how⠀a⠀neighbor,⠀teacher,⠀rival,⠀or⠀friend⠀responds⠀to⠀the⠀change.⠀When⠀the⠀retrospective⠀voice⠀looks⠀back,⠀distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀understood⠀then⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀knows⠀now.\n\nSet⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish⠀context⠀when⠀its⠀material⠀includes⠀one.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀has⠀not⠀been⠀specified,⠀use⠀the⠀world's⠀existing⠀place⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀domestic⠀texture⠀rather⠀than⠀importing⠀a⠀Nordic⠀landscape.⠀Avoid⠀treating⠀silence,⠀cold,⠀or⠀isolation⠀as⠀automatic⠀traits.⠀Stop⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary;⠀a⠀reply⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀work⠀completed,⠀a⠀question,⠀or⠀an⠀unresolved⠀feeling.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀screen-oriented⠀scenes.⠀Each⠀scene⠀heading⠀changes⠀only⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Action⠀lines⠀describe⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen⠀or⠀heard:⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀correction,⠀a⠀repeated⠀motion⠀now⠀performed⠀differently.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀camera⠀directions;⠀keep⠀focus⠀on⠀the⠀behavior⠀the⠀audience⠀would⠀observe.\n\nMake⠀progression⠀legible⠀through⠀staged⠀repetition.⠀Choose⠀one⠀physical⠀action⠀or⠀object⠀and⠀write⠀its⠀early⠀difficulty⠀in⠀concrete⠀action⠀lines:⠀the⠀hands⠀fumble,⠀the⠀tool⠀drops,⠀the⠀breath⠀catches,⠀the⠀instructor⠀steps⠀in.⠀Later,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀action⠀or⠀object⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀scene.⠀Write⠀the⠀difference⠀through⠀observable⠀detail:⠀the⠀same⠀motion⠀now⠀takes⠀fewer⠀beats,⠀the⠀grip⠀is⠀firmer,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀the⠀tool⠀against⠀the⠀surface⠀is⠀steadier,⠀the⠀instructor⠀watches⠀without⠀correcting.⠀Dialogue⠀can⠀ask⠀for⠀help⠀or⠀offer⠀practice,⠀but⠀visible⠀ability⠀is⠀the⠀proof.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀character⠀explain⠀the⠀improvement.\n\nEmbed⠀Maeda's⠀callback⠀inside⠀the⠀blocked⠀action⠀and⠀repeated⠀lines.⠀A⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀lightly⠀in⠀an⠀early⠀scene⠀returns⠀in⠀a⠀quieter⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀meaning.⠀An⠀object⠀carried⠀or⠀placed⠀in⠀the⠀background⠀returns⠀in⠀a⠀foreground⠀action.⠀When⠀the⠀callback⠀recurs,⠀let⠀the⠀action⠀line⠀or⠀delivery⠀carry⠀the⠀shift:⠀the⠀same⠀line⠀spoken⠀slower,⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀set⠀down⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀care,⠀the⠀same⠀gesture⠀now⠀performed⠀without⠀the⠀earlier⠀hesitation.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀callback;⠀let⠀the⠀recurrence⠀register⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀concrete⠀repetition.⠀Keep⠀humor⠀and⠀tenderness⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀characters⠀and⠀moment.\n\nFor⠀required⠀private⠀thought,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀separate⠀from⠀dialogue.⠀Use⠀the⠀active⠀presentation's⠀designated⠀way⠀for⠀author⠀notes⠀oriented⠀to⠀the⠀source,⠀not⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀cast.⠀The⠀surrounding⠀action⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀body⠀does;⠀the⠀private⠀note⠀carries⠀the⠀unfiltered⠀experience⠀that⠀accompanies⠀it—the⠀remembered⠀correction,⠀the⠀fear⠀before⠀a⠀second⠀attempt,⠀the⠀private⠀recognition⠀of⠀ease.⠀Do⠀not⠀leak⠀that⠀thought⠀into⠀another⠀character's⠀hearing.\n\nKeep⠀each⠀reply⠀within⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀boundary.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀before⠀a⠀problem⠀is⠀solved,⠀after⠀a⠀local⠀result,⠀or⠀during⠀ongoing⠀practice.⠀The⠀next⠀scene⠀can⠀continue⠀the⠀progression⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀reveal⠀or⠀completed⠀test⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀script.⠀Speakers⠀are⠀identified⠀before⠀each⠀line.⠀Stage⠀directions⠀tell⠀actors⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀with⠀objects,⠀space,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀movement.⠀Design⠀the⠀blocking⠀so⠀progression⠀is⠀observable:⠀an⠀action⠀that⠀required⠀concentration⠀in⠀an⠀early⠀scene⠀is⠀now⠀a⠀routine⠀gesture;⠀an⠀object⠀that⠀was⠀dropped⠀or⠀fumbled⠀is⠀now⠀handled⠀without⠀thought.⠀The⠀physical⠀business⠀carries⠀the⠀visible⠀evidence.\n\nUse⠀repeated⠀stage⠀business⠀as⠀the⠀Maeda⠀callback.⠀Choose⠀one⠀prop⠀or⠀small⠀sequence⠀of⠀actions⠀and⠀stage⠀its⠀first⠀appearance⠀in⠀full:⠀the⠀actor⠀crosses⠀to⠀the⠀table,⠀picks⠀up⠀the⠀object,⠀hesitates,⠀sets⠀it⠀down⠀wrong,⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀watches.⠀Later,⠀reintroduce⠀the⠀same⠀prop⠀or⠀sequence⠀after⠀intervening⠀events.⠀Write⠀the⠀recurrence⠀as⠀a⠀physical⠀change:⠀the⠀actor⠀crosses⠀without⠀pausing,⠀picks⠀it⠀up⠀in⠀one⠀motion,⠀or⠀sets⠀it⠀down⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀care.⠀The⠀meaning⠀has⠀changed,⠀but⠀the⠀actors⠀do⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀new⠀speech⠀about⠀it.⠀The⠀repeat⠀may⠀be⠀tender,⠀funny,⠀or⠀empty⠀depending⠀on⠀the⠀prior⠀scene.⠀If⠀a⠀line⠀recurs,⠀let⠀its⠀delivery⠀shift—quicker,⠀quieter,⠀heavier—so⠀that⠀the⠀repetition⠀itself⠀reframes⠀the⠀memory.\n\nFor⠀required⠀private⠀thought,⠀preserve⠀it⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀playable⠀script.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀feeling⠀into⠀an⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue.⠀An⠀aside⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀thought⠀when⠀the⠀play's⠀form⠀requires⠀the⠀audience⠀to⠀know⠀it,⠀but⠀the⠀primary⠀mechanism⠀is⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀of⠀spoken⠀line⠀and⠀physical⠀action.⠀Write⠀the⠀private⠀note⠀as⠀the⠀actual⠀experience⠀behind⠀the⠀gesture:⠀the⠀remembered⠀instruction,⠀the⠀fear⠀of⠀dropping⠀the⠀object⠀again,⠀the⠀private⠀recognition⠀that⠀the⠀hands⠀already⠀know⠀the⠀motion.⠀The⠀audience⠀understands⠀the⠀unspoken⠀through⠀contract,⠀not⠀through⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀hearing⠀it.\n\nLet⠀progression⠀remain⠀uneven.⠀A⠀later⠀scene⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀same⠀skill⠀failing⠀because⠀of⠀fear,⠀exhaustion,⠀or⠀new⠀conditions.⠀That⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀regression⠀of⠀the⠀method;⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀live⠀test⠀of⠀capability.⠀Write⠀a⠀concrete⠀work⠀or⠀training⠀scene⠀so⠀the⠀attempt⠀has⠀stakes⠀in⠀practical⠀life.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀an⠀exit,⠀an⠀incomplete⠀action,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀result.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀catharsis⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀line⠀of⠀resolution⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀inside⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀current⠀moment⠀trigger⠀memory,⠀sensation,⠀remembered⠀instruction,⠀and⠀prospective⠀practice.⠀The⠀movement⠀need⠀not⠀stay⠀linear.⠀Show⠀improvement⠀through⠀the⠀changing⠀associations:⠀an⠀object⠀that⠀once⠀called⠀up⠀fear⠀and⠀a⠀teacher's⠀correction⠀now⠀calls⠀up⠀an⠀automatic⠀adjustment⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀private⠀joke.⠀Do⠀not⠀summarize⠀the⠀growth;⠀let⠀the⠀mind's⠀own⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀image⠀carry⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Maeda's⠀callbacks⠀by⠀repeating⠀the⠀same⠀sensory⠀or⠀verbal⠀anchor⠀inside⠀the⠀thought⠀stream.⠀Choose⠀one⠀smell,⠀sore⠀spot,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀workplace⠀sound⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀first⠀appear⠀during⠀failure:⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀the⠀training⠀room,⠀the⠀ache⠀in⠀the⠀wrist,⠀the⠀instructor's⠀repeated⠀word.⠀Later,⠀let⠀the⠀same⠀anchor⠀return⠀during⠀success⠀or⠀indifference.⠀Write⠀the⠀return⠀as⠀a⠀changed⠀association:⠀the⠀smell⠀now⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀warm⠀corner⠀by⠀the⠀window,⠀the⠀ache⠀is⠀only⠀a⠀familiar⠀pressure,⠀the⠀phrase⠀arrives⠀as⠀a⠀private⠀joke⠀or⠀a⠀quick⠀correction.⠀When⠀it⠀returns,⠀the⠀feeling⠀attached⠀to⠀it⠀has⠀shifted.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀itself⠀is⠀the⠀emotional⠀reframing;⠀no⠀external⠀narrator⠀should⠀explain⠀what⠀it⠀means.\n\nLet⠀the⠀stream⠀include⠀the⠀physical⠀experience⠀of⠀practice:⠀the⠀weight⠀in⠀the⠀hands,⠀the⠀cold,⠀the⠀heat,⠀the⠀ache,⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀correction⠀before⠀speech⠀catches⠀up.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀remembered⠀or⠀imagined.⠀If⠀memory⠀intrudes⠀during⠀a⠀fight⠀or⠀task,⠀keep⠀the⠀reader⠀oriented⠀to⠀which⠀layer⠀is⠀present.⠀Use⠀concrete⠀markers—the⠀present⠀tense⠀of⠀the⠀body,⠀the⠀past⠀tense⠀of⠀the⠀remembered⠀failure,⠀the⠀conditional⠀of⠀a⠀feared⠀outcome—to⠀keep⠀the⠀layers⠀legible.⠀The⠀mind⠀can⠀race⠀forward,⠀loop⠀back,⠀or⠀worry,⠀but⠀these⠀moves⠀should⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀specific⠀character.\n\nImprovement⠀can⠀be⠀seen⠀in⠀the⠀changed⠀rhythm⠀of⠀the⠀thinking:⠀an⠀early⠀worry⠀phrase⠀becomes⠀a⠀quick⠀check;⠀a⠀practiced⠀action⠀stops⠀producing⠀chatter⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀it⠀used⠀to⠀fail.⠀Write⠀the⠀early⠀attempt⠀with⠀fragmented,⠀repetitive⠀thought—the⠀same⠀worry⠀phrase⠀looping,⠀the⠀body's⠀signals⠀interrupting⠀the⠀instruction.⠀Write⠀the⠀later⠀attempt⠀with⠀a⠀quieter⠀stream—the⠀instruction⠀arrives,⠀the⠀body⠀responds,⠀the⠀mind⠀notices⠀the⠀absence⠀of⠀the⠀old⠀fear.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀mind⠀uniformly⠀witty⠀or⠀lyrical.⠀Keep⠀author⠀voice⠀in⠀check⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀character's⠀habits⠀govern⠀word⠀choice.⠀The⠀reply⠀can⠀stop⠀in⠀mid-thought,⠀during⠀a⠀task,⠀or⠀after⠀a⠀single⠀completed⠀movement.⠀No⠀examination⠀or⠀catharsis⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀end⠀the⠀response.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nLet⠀the⠀story⠀move⠀through⠀messages,⠀unsent⠀drafts,⠀and⠀selected⠀interface⠀events.⠀Each⠀sender's⠀contribution⠀should⠀reflect⠀their⠀ordinary⠀habits:⠀hesitation,⠀shorthand,⠀typo⠀correction,⠀long⠀silence,⠀attachment.⠀Improvement⠀is⠀shown⠀when⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀give⠀useful⠀instructions,⠀respond⠀to⠀a⠀common⠀problem,⠀or⠀contribute⠀to⠀a⠀shared⠀plan⠀without⠀the⠀earlier⠀confusion.\n\nUse⠀a⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀or⠀practical⠀reference⠀as⠀the⠀Maeda⠀callback.⠀Choose⠀one⠀phrase,⠀attachment,⠀group⠀name,⠀reminder,⠀or⠀scheduled⠀routine⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀first⠀appear⠀in⠀an⠀early⠀exchange:⠀the⠀sender⠀asks⠀a⠀confused⠀question,⠀sends⠀the⠀wrong⠀file,⠀or⠀misreads⠀the⠀shared⠀plan.⠀Later,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀or⠀reference⠀after⠀intervening⠀events.⠀Write⠀the⠀return⠀as⠀a⠀visible⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀sender's⠀choices:⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀now⠀sent⠀with⠀confidence,⠀the⠀same⠀attachment⠀now⠀corrected,⠀the⠀same⠀reminder⠀now⠀handled⠀without⠀follow-up⠀questions.⠀The⠀sender⠀may⠀quote⠀or⠀edit⠀the⠀earlier⠀message,⠀or⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀may⠀ask⠀about⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀narrate⠀the⠀emotional⠀shift;⠀let⠀the⠀sender's⠀visible⠀choices⠀carry⠀it.\n\nDistinguish⠀three⠀layers⠀clearly:⠀the⠀sent⠀message,⠀what⠀the⠀sender⠀intentionally⠀transmits;⠀the⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀a⠀composed⠀but⠀withheld⠀text⠀that⠀can⠀reveal⠀private⠀thought;⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀aside,⠀which⠀is⠀never⠀transmitted.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀live⠀inner⠀speech.⠀Write⠀the⠀draft⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact—a⠀message⠀the⠀sender⠀typed,⠀paused⠀over,⠀and⠀did⠀not⠀send—not⠀as⠀a⠀direct⠀transcript⠀of⠀the⠀mind.⠀Use⠀the⠀active⠀presentation's⠀conventions⠀to⠀separate⠀an⠀outside-context⠀private⠀note⠀from⠀transcript⠀material.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀receipts⠀or⠀edits⠀merely⠀to⠀make⠀subtext;⠀only⠀include⠀those⠀events⠀when⠀they⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀relationship⠀or⠀the⠀progression.\n\nKeep⠀progression⠀uneven⠀and⠀practical.⠀One⠀exchange⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀person⠀solving⠀a⠀problem⠀for⠀a⠀friend,⠀another⠀may⠀show⠀them⠀fumbling⠀the⠀same⠀skill⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Write⠀the⠀contrast⠀through⠀the⠀messages⠀themselves:⠀the⠀early⠀confusion⠀in⠀long,⠀hesitant,⠀self-correcting⠀texts;⠀the⠀later⠀competence⠀in⠀shorter,⠀clearer⠀instructions;⠀the⠀pressure⠀failure⠀in⠀a⠀message⠀sent⠀too⠀quickly⠀or⠀a⠀draft⠀abandoned.⠀The⠀contrast⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀ongoing⠀story,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀forced⠀arc.⠀A⠀reply⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀pending⠀message,⠀a⠀draft,⠀or⠀the⠀characters⠀going⠀quiet.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀installment⠀to⠀reach⠀a⠀resolution⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalamba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀the⠀visual-novel⠀scene⠀rhythm⠀to⠀make⠀progression⠀observable.⠀Short⠀scene-setting⠀passages⠀orient⠀location⠀and⠀time.⠀Attribute⠀dialogue⠀clearly.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀carry⠀the⠀character's⠀perception⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀attempts.⠀When⠀a⠀skill⠀changes,⠀the⠀surrounding⠀illustrated⠀scene⠀repeats⠀an⠀earlier⠀anchor—a⠀training⠀ground,⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀person's⠀reaction—so⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀same⠀image⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀weight.\n\nMake⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀the⠀primary⠀vehicle⠀for⠀improvement.⠀Choose⠀one⠀concrete⠀anchor⠀and⠀write⠀its⠀early⠀appearance⠀in⠀full⠀focal⠀detail:⠀the⠀dropped⠀tool,⠀the⠀missed⠀target,⠀the⠀hesitating⠀gesture,⠀the⠀teacher's⠀finger⠀on⠀the⠀mistake.⠀Later,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀anchor⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀scene.⠀Write⠀the⠀change⠀through⠀the⠀focal⠀description:⠀the⠀tool⠀now⠀fits⠀the⠀hand⠀without⠀thought,⠀the⠀target⠀is⠀reached⠀with⠀a⠀steadier⠀motion,⠀the⠀gesture⠀no⠀longer⠀hesitates.⠀The⠀dialogue⠀may⠀challenge,⠀encourage,⠀or⠀misunderstand;⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀respond⠀privately.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀dialogue⠀explain⠀the⠀improvement.\n\nUse⠀Maeda's⠀callback⠀by⠀repeating⠀a⠀concrete⠀image⠀or⠀phrase⠀across⠀scenes.⠀An⠀early⠀scene⠀shows⠀a⠀dropped⠀tool,⠀a⠀missed⠀target,⠀a⠀hesitating⠀gesture.⠀A⠀later⠀scene⠀shows⠀the⠀same⠀tool⠀or⠀target⠀handled⠀with⠀ease.⠀The⠀change⠀is⠀evident⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀description,⠀not⠀in⠀an⠀explicit⠀success⠀message.⠀If⠀the⠀same⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀recurs,⠀let⠀its⠀emotional⠀register⠀shift⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀happened.⠀Write⠀the⠀recurrence⠀as⠀a⠀changed⠀focal⠀perception:⠀the⠀same⠀words⠀now⠀heard⠀differently,⠀the⠀same⠀image⠀now⠀carrying⠀a⠀private⠀memory⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀joke.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀choices,⠀relationship⠀mechanics,⠀or⠀image⠀commands.⠀The⠀style⠀supplies⠀scene⠀pacing,⠀centered⠀on⠀a⠀single⠀focal⠀point,⠀not⠀an⠀interactive⠀engine.⠀Let⠀improvements⠀remain⠀uneven.⠀A⠀later⠀scene⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀same⠀action⠀failing⠀under⠀fatigue⠀or⠀unfamiliar⠀conditions.⠀End⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀boundary:⠀after⠀a⠀result,⠀a⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀moment.⠀No⠀completed⠀test,⠀level-up,⠀or⠀confession⠀is⠀required⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalambb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nLet⠀each⠀serial⠀installment⠀continue⠀the⠀through-line⠀of⠀a⠀developing⠀capability.⠀A⠀practice⠀session,⠀ordinary⠀work,⠀or⠀relationship⠀moment⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀in⠀the⠀progression.⠀Show⠀the⠀attempt⠀and⠀the⠀feedback⠀it⠀receives;⠀do⠀not⠀summarize⠀the⠀growth⠀as⠀a⠀level-up.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀do,⠀or⠀still⠀cannot⠀do,⠀in⠀the⠀scene.\n\nUse⠀Jun⠀Maeda's⠀callback⠀across⠀installments.⠀Choose⠀one⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀installment⠀and⠀recover⠀it⠀briefly⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀scene:⠀a⠀single⠀sentence⠀or⠀partial⠀description⠀can⠀recall⠀the⠀anchor.⠀Write⠀the⠀return⠀as⠀a⠀changed⠀experience:⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀now⠀handled⠀with⠀ease,⠀the⠀same⠀routine⠀now⠀completed⠀without⠀the⠀old⠀hesitation,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀now⠀carrying⠀a⠀different⠀weight.⠀The⠀repeat⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀practical⠀reminder,⠀a⠀shared⠀joke,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀gesture.⠀Do⠀not⠀launch⠀a⠀separate⠀flashback⠀paragraph⠀unless⠀the⠀serial⠀reader⠀needs⠀the⠀specific⠀anchor;⠀the⠀recovery⠀should⠀serve⠀the⠀current⠀scene,⠀not⠀replace⠀it.\n\nMaintain⠀the⠀serial's⠀re-entry⠀hooks⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀Introduce⠀a⠀small⠀changed⠀condition—new⠀resource,⠀new⠀student,⠀new⠀demand—that⠀can⠀continue⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀segment.⠀Write⠀the⠀hook⠀as⠀an⠀unfinished⠀practical⠀condition,⠀not⠀an⠀artificial⠀crisis:⠀a⠀task⠀half-done,⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀open,⠀a⠀new⠀material⠀that⠀needs⠀testing.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources.⠀Improvement⠀can⠀remain⠀uneven:⠀the⠀skill⠀may⠀work⠀in⠀practice⠀and⠀fail⠀in⠀a⠀high-stakes⠀moment.⠀That⠀contrast⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀tale.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀Show⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀reasoning,⠀memory,⠀or⠀sensation⠀when⠀it⠀matters:⠀the⠀remembered⠀instruction⠀arriving⠀before⠀the⠀body⠀obeys,⠀the⠀private⠀comparison⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀failure,⠀the⠀small⠀surprise⠀at⠀ease.⠀The⠀web-serial⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀all⠀minds⠀to⠀all⠀senders,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀author⠀to⠀hide⠀all⠀introspection.⠀The⠀installment⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀step,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀brief⠀emotional⠀check.⠀No⠀full⠀arc⠀or⠀resolution⠀is⠀owed⠀in⠀one⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nMake⠀the⠀emotional⠀cost⠀of⠀advancement⠀a⠀condition⠀of⠀execution,⠀not⠀a⠀consequence⠀added⠀after⠀the⠀technique⠀lands.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀attempts⠀a⠀new⠀skill,⠀identify⠀what⠀they⠀must⠀admit,⠀withhold,⠀or⠀accept⠀about⠀themselves⠀in⠀order⠀to⠀make⠀it⠀work.⠀A⠀technique⠀may⠀fail⠀because⠀they⠀cannot⠀say⠀what⠀they⠀need;⠀a⠀reversal⠀may⠀succeed⠀only⠀after⠀they⠀half-apologize,⠀and⠀the⠀apology⠀itself⠀may⠀be⠀technically⠀wrong⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀action⠀is⠀right.\n\nExplain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀through⠀the⠀strain⠀it⠀imposes.⠀Show⠀the⠀exact⠀grip,⠀timing,⠀or⠀resource,⠀then⠀show⠀where⠀the⠀character's⠀unresolved⠀feeling⠀interrupts⠀or⠀redirects⠀it:⠀the⠀hand⠀hesitates⠀because⠀the⠀person⠀they⠀hurt⠀is⠀watching,⠀the⠀spell⠀misfires⠀because⠀they⠀are⠀still⠀lying⠀about⠀why⠀they⠀learned⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀legible⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀track⠀both⠀the⠀technique⠀and⠀the⠀emotional⠀failure⠀that⠀shapes⠀it.\n\nLet⠀rapid⠀reversals⠀destabilize⠀relationships⠀and⠀capability⠀together.⠀A⠀victory⠀can⠀create⠀a⠀debt⠀owed⠀to⠀someone⠀the⠀character⠀resents⠀needing;⠀a⠀defeat⠀can⠀expose⠀a⠀weakness⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀been⠀hiding⠀from⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀now⠀has⠀to⠀help⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀advancement⠀tragic,⠀but⠀make⠀the⠀cost⠀specific⠀and⠀persistent.⠀Warmth⠀may⠀arrive⠀partial⠀or⠀awkward,⠀and⠀it⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀pain.⠀Private⠀thought⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀unsaid⠀parts—what⠀they⠀want⠀to⠀say,⠀what⠀they⠀flinch⠀from,⠀the⠀reasoning⠀behind⠀a⠀half-apology—without⠀granting⠀other⠀characters⠀access⠀to⠀it.⠀Progression⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀escape⠀hatch⠀from⠀messy⠀relationships;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀collide⠀with⠀them⠀again,⠀and⠀sometimes⠀the⠀collision⠀is⠀the⠀only⠀way⠀the⠀skill⠀finally⠀works.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nStage⠀progression⠀as⠀observable⠀skill⠀checks⠀within⠀the⠀shared⠀scene.⠀After⠀a⠀character⠀attempts⠀or⠀practices⠀a⠀new⠀capability,⠀show⠀the⠀exact⠀physical⠀result⠀in⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀and⠀clear⠀speech⠀beats.⠀Let⠀the⠀test⠀be⠀incomplete:⠀the⠀newly⠀learned⠀technique⠀may⠀work⠀partially,⠀cost⠀too⠀much,⠀or⠀reveal⠀what⠀still⠀needs⠀training.⠀This⠀gives⠀the⠀partner⠀a⠀concrete⠀pivot⠀for⠀their⠀next⠀reply⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀question⠀or⠀forced⠀decision.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀unmistakable,⠀especially⠀during⠀rapid⠀exchanges⠀and⠀tactical⠀explanations.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀exploits⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀resource,⠀have⠀them⠀name⠀it⠀briefly⠀in⠀speech,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀action⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀beat.⠀If⠀the⠀mechanism⠀is⠀too⠀complex⠀for⠀one⠀line,⠀split⠀it⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀says,⠀what⠀they⠀do,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀result⠀shows.⠀Do⠀not⠀bury⠀the⠀mechanism⠀in⠀narration⠀or⠀leave⠀the⠀reader⠀guessing⠀who⠀spoke⠀during⠀a⠀reversal.\n\nUse⠀the⠀narrator's⠀person⠀and⠀ownership⠀to⠀decide⠀whose⠀interiority⠀is⠀visible,⠀and⠀keep⠀unspoken⠀thoughts⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀other⠀characters⠀can⠀hear.⠀An⠀NPC⠀may⠀misunderstand⠀the⠀technique,⠀react⠀to⠀its⠀cost,⠀or⠀continue⠀their⠀own⠀task⠀while⠀the⠀attempt⠀unfolds.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀consequence⠀of⠀the⠀attempted⠀advancement⠀is⠀reaching⠀the⠀characters⠀or⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀still⠀unfolding.⠀The⠀action⠀can⠀pause,⠀continue,⠀or⠀be⠀interrupted,⠀but⠀the⠀reply⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀world⠀active.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀level-up⠀screen,⠀or⠀obligatory⠀choice.⠀Improvement⠀is⠀a⠀beat⠀in⠀the⠀roleplay,⠀not⠀the⠀plot's⠀conclusion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nAdopt⠀the⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀route:⠀each⠀scene⠀or⠀installment⠀is⠀a⠀self-contained⠀test⠀where⠀a⠀character⠀attempts,⠀misunderstands,⠀or⠀refines⠀a⠀specific⠀skill.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀problem⠀and⠀the⠀rule⠀or⠀resource⠀at⠀hand,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀attempt⠀and⠀its⠀reversal.⠀A⠀technique⠀should⠀be⠀explained⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀use⠀or⠀fumble⠀it;⠀after⠀the⠀action,⠀let⠀the⠀consequences⠀linger⠀in⠀ordinary⠀stakes—debts,⠀promises,⠀reputation⠀among⠀neighbors,⠀supplies⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀attempt.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀to⠀mark⠀progression.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀location⠀returns⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀episode,⠀now⠀charged⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀learned.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀magical⠀truth⠀token;⠀it⠀shows⠀how⠀understanding⠀has⠀changed.⠀When⠀a⠀familiar⠀gesture⠀appears⠀again,⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀the⠀difference⠀in⠀execution:⠀the⠀same⠀grip⠀now⠀holds,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀now⠀means⠀something⠀the⠀character⠀could⠀not⠀say⠀before.⠀The⠀episode⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀stronger⠀but⠀still⠀short⠀of⠀the⠀next⠀challenge,⠀so⠀the⠀thread⠀continues.\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀consistent⠀storyteller's⠀voice⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀setting⠀and⠀narrator.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀be⠀close⠀but⠀should⠀remain⠀composed⠀and⠀socially⠀aware.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀matters,⠀explain⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀storyteller's⠀practical⠀idiom—what⠀the⠀character⠀tried,⠀what⠀the⠀teacher⠀said,⠀what⠀the⠀result⠀taught—without⠀stepping⠀into⠀an⠀omniscient⠀moral⠀summary.⠀Do⠀not⠀relocate⠀the⠀cast⠀to⠀a⠀Chinese⠀historical⠀setting⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀requires⠀it.⠀The⠀route⠀is⠀a⠀narrative⠀method,⠀not⠀a⠀costume.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀improvement⠀as⠀work.⠀Each⠀new⠀skill,⠀rank,⠀or⠀resource⠀appears⠀through⠀visible⠀effort:⠀blisters,⠀broken⠀equipment,⠀a⠀botched⠀attempt⠀that⠀yields⠀a⠀usable⠀fact.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀is⠀explained,⠀make⠀it⠀short⠀and⠀practical,⠀tied⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀doing⠀right⠀now—how⠀a⠀grip⠀changes⠀force,⠀why⠀a⠀failed⠀spell⠀teaches⠀the⠀next⠀step.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀immediate⠀cost.\n\nKeep⠀transitions⠀compressed⠀and⠀hard-edged.⠀Use⠀concrete⠀verbs,⠀specific⠀materials,⠀and⠀high⠀contrast⠀between⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀calm⠀and⠀a⠀sudden⠀reversal.⠀When⠀a⠀reversal⠀hits,⠀keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀legible:⠀state⠀what⠀changed,⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀did⠀in⠀response,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀cost.⠀A⠀longer⠀thought⠀is⠀permitted⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀puzzling⠀through⠀a⠀mechanism⠀or⠀deciding⠀whether⠀a⠀cost⠀is⠀worth⠀it,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀pad⠀with⠀abstraction.⠀A⠀reversal⠀should⠀change⠀the⠀physical⠀situation:⠀a⠀wall⠀collapses,⠀a⠀hand⠀slips,⠀an⠀ally⠀takes⠀the⠀blow⠀the⠀technique⠀was⠀meant⠀to⠀prevent.\n\nLet⠀progression⠀remain⠀uneven.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀execute⠀a⠀technique⠀perfectly⠀once⠀and⠀fail⠀under⠀pressure;⠀a⠀resource⠀may⠀solve⠀one⠀problem⠀and⠀create⠀a⠀material⠀debt.⠀The⠀grit⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀wear⠀and⠀the⠀price,⠀not⠀in⠀endless⠀suffering.⠀Ordinary⠀failure⠀is⠀enough⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀practice⠀into⠀a⠀mutilation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀documents⠀written⠀by⠀someone⠀with⠀a⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀outcome.⠀A⠀training⠀log⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀and⠀the⠀correction;⠀a⠀report⠀to⠀a⠀sponsor⠀may⠀omit⠀the⠀human⠀cost;⠀a⠀letter⠀to⠀a⠀friend⠀may⠀confess⠀what⠀the⠀log⠀cannot.⠀Each⠀document⠀has⠀a⠀time,⠀an⠀author,⠀and⠀an⠀intended⠀reader,⠀and⠀its⠀form⠀shapes⠀what⠀is⠀recorded⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀left⠀out.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀mechanism⠀appears⠀in⠀a⠀document,⠀have⠀the⠀writer⠀explain⠀it⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀terms,⠀then⠀record⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀reversal.⠀The⠀explanation⠀may⠀be⠀incomplete⠀or⠀self-serving,⠀and⠀later⠀documents⠀can⠀correct⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀assemble⠀the⠀actual⠀sequence⠀from⠀discrepancies:⠀a⠀log⠀says⠀the⠀grip⠀was⠀mastered,⠀a⠀later⠀letter⠀admits⠀the⠀hand⠀still⠀shakes⠀under⠀load.⠀A⠀reversal⠀can⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀one⠀document⠀claims⠀and⠀what⠀another⠀reveals,⠀or⠀as⠀a⠀correction⠀written⠀in⠀the⠀margin⠀after⠀the⠀fact.\n\nUse⠀the⠀gaps⠀between⠀entries⠀to⠀mark⠀advancement.⠀Time⠀passes,⠀resources⠀are⠀spent,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀reveals⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀that⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀before.⠀The⠀reader⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀an⠀omniscient⠀summary⠀after⠀each⠀record;⠀let⠀the⠀documents⠀themselves⠀carry⠀the⠀evidence.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀formats⠀mechanically—use⠀the⠀specific⠀document⠀the⠀scene⠀requires,⠀whether⠀a⠀single⠀report⠀or⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀letters.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀world.⠀Documents⠀are⠀artifacts⠀of⠀the⠀story,⠀not⠀a⠀replacement⠀for⠀all⠀private⠀thought;⠀when⠀the⠀contract⠀allows,⠀include⠀interiority⠀outside⠀the⠀documents,⠀but⠀the⠀documents⠀themselves⠀remain⠀the⠀presentation⠀of⠀record.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nLet⠀progression⠀feel⠀like⠀shared⠀improvement.⠀A⠀character⠀learns⠀a⠀new⠀skill,⠀but⠀the⠀scene⠀also⠀shows⠀who⠀teaches⠀them,⠀who⠀makes⠀tea⠀while⠀they⠀practice,⠀what⠀snack⠀they⠀always⠀have⠀afterward,⠀and⠀how⠀a⠀small⠀success⠀is⠀acknowledged.⠀The⠀mechanism⠀is⠀still⠀explained⠀when⠀it⠀becomes⠀relevant—maybe⠀a⠀friend⠀points⠀out⠀why⠀the⠀grip⠀kept⠀failing—but⠀the⠀tone⠀is⠀patient⠀and⠀invested⠀rather⠀than⠀brittle.\n\nUse⠀ordinary⠀stakes⠀to⠀create⠀warmth⠀without⠀erasing⠀difficulty.⠀A⠀failed⠀attempt⠀can⠀lead⠀to⠀a⠀bandage,⠀a⠀joke,⠀and⠀another⠀try⠀tomorrow.⠀The⠀comfort⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀continuity:⠀someone⠀remembers⠀how⠀they⠀take⠀their⠀drink,⠀someone⠀stays⠀to⠀watch⠀the⠀final⠀drill,⠀someone⠀says⠀they⠀did⠀well⠀and⠀means⠀it.⠀You⠀may⠀show⠀fatigue,⠀frustration,⠀or⠀disagreement;⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀suddenly⠀agreeable.\n\nKeep⠀Kamachi's⠀legible⠀action⠀even⠀in⠀gentle⠀scenes.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀finally⠀executes⠀a⠀technique,⠀show⠀the⠀exact⠀movement⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀room⠀react—applause,⠀a⠀quiet⠀nod,⠀a⠀hand⠀on⠀the⠀shoulder.⠀The⠀reaction⠀is⠀feedback,⠀not⠀just⠀decoration:⠀it⠀tells⠀the⠀character⠀what⠀the⠀success⠀means⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀who⠀watched⠀them⠀earn⠀it.⠀The⠀progression⠀matters⠀because⠀the⠀people⠀around⠀them⠀see⠀the⠀effort.⠀End⠀scenes⠀where⠀they⠀naturally⠀settle,⠀not⠀where⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀breakthrough⠀is⠀forced.⠀Affection⠀can⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀a⠀declaration.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nFrame⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀advancement⠀within⠀a⠀social⠀and⠀historical⠀context.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀attempts⠀a⠀new⠀technique,⠀show⠀not⠀only⠀the⠀immediate⠀physical⠀sequence⠀but⠀also⠀what⠀this⠀skill⠀means⠀in⠀their⠀community—who⠀taught⠀it,⠀who⠀failed⠀at⠀it,⠀what⠀reputation⠀it⠀carries.⠀Use⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀to⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀attempt⠀outward⠀to⠀the⠀judgments⠀others⠀would⠀make,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀concrete⠀reversal⠀or⠀success.\n\nUse⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀to⠀connect⠀training⠀and⠀consequence.⠀A⠀scene⠀of⠀practice⠀may⠀open⠀with⠀the⠀character's⠀earlier⠀failures,⠀then⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀precise⠀mechanism⠀and⠀its⠀execution,⠀and⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀changed⠀way⠀they⠀are⠀seen⠀by⠀a⠀teacher,⠀a⠀rival,⠀or⠀a⠀family.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀adopt⠀the⠀distance⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀chosen⠀viewpoint:⠀an⠀older⠀narrator⠀may⠀recall⠀what⠀the⠀younger⠀self⠀did⠀not⠀understand,⠀while⠀a⠀close⠀third⠀person⠀may⠀stay⠀within⠀the⠀character's⠀immediate⠀sense⠀of⠀strain.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀progression⠀legible⠀amid⠀the⠀formal⠀style.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀matters,⠀explain⠀it⠀exactly—what⠀grip,⠀what⠀timing,⠀what⠀cost—then⠀let⠀the⠀action⠀carry⠀it.⠀Rapid⠀reversals⠀should⠀remain⠀sharply⠀realized,⠀even⠀within⠀longer⠀sentences:⠀state⠀the⠀changed⠀condition⠀in⠀concrete⠀terms,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀response.⠀The⠀style⠀is⠀formal,⠀not⠀archaic;⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting⠀or⠀elaborate⠀speech⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀requires⠀it.⠀Progression⠀is⠀a⠀developing⠀life,⠀and⠀the⠀novel⠀form⠀should⠀honor⠀both⠀the⠀technique⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀learning⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nMake⠀each⠀embedded⠀story⠀a⠀practice⠀account⠀told⠀to⠀a⠀listener⠀who⠀faces⠀a⠀related⠀present⠀problem.⠀The⠀teller⠀selects⠀one⠀concrete⠀past⠀attempt⠀and⠀narrates⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀sequence:⠀the⠀condition⠀that⠀had⠀to⠀be⠀met,⠀the⠀resource⠀or⠀permission⠀available⠀at⠀that⠀time,⠀the⠀action⠀taken,⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀result⠀that⠀showed⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀could⠀and⠀could⠀not⠀yet⠀do.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀distinguish⠀recognizing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀under⠀pressure⠀by⠀describing⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀attempt⠀collapsed⠀or⠀held.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀occasion.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀buy⠀time,⠀warn⠀an⠀apprentice,⠀secure⠀a⠀teacher's⠀help,⠀or⠀prepare⠀a⠀companion⠀for⠀a⠀coming⠀test.⠀The⠀audience's⠀need⠀determines⠀which⠀failure⠀is⠀confessed,⠀which⠀detail⠀is⠀repeated,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀omits.⠀When⠀a⠀listener⠀interrupts⠀with⠀a⠀question,⠀correction,⠀or⠀demand,⠀use⠀the⠀interruption⠀to⠀review⠀the⠀mechanism⠀in⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀terms⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀moralize.\n\nLet⠀a⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀named⠀mistake⠀recur⠀across⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀outer⠀scene.⠀Each⠀recurrence⠀must⠀mark⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀or⠀understanding:⠀the⠀listener⠀recognizes⠀the⠀warning⠀sign⠀before⠀acting,⠀replaces⠀the⠀tool,⠀or⠀repeats⠀the⠀gesture⠀correctly.⠀Do⠀not⠀reuse⠀the⠀item⠀merely⠀as⠀decoration;⠀the⠀recurrence⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀has⠀now⠀learned⠀to⠀notice⠀or⠀do.\n\nAfter⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀ends,⠀move⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀into⠀an⠀immediate⠀attempt⠀that⠀transfers⠀the⠀lesson⠀under⠀changed⠀conditions.⠀State⠀the⠀new⠀obstacle's⠀operative⠀condition⠀before⠀the⠀listener⠀acts,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀cause⠀and⠀effect.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀succeed,⠀fail,⠀or⠀succeed⠀only⠀after⠀adapting⠀the⠀taught⠀method;⠀a⠀failed⠀transfer⠀becomes⠀the⠀next⠀round⠀of⠀instruction⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀verdict⠀on⠀the⠀telling.⠀Use⠀Kamachi's⠀rapid⠀reversal⠀by⠀changing⠀one⠀condition⠀the⠀listener⠀believed⠀was⠀stable,⠀not⠀by⠀withholding⠀an⠀established⠀rule.\n\nAllow⠀uneven⠀development⠀across⠀the⠀nested⠀and⠀outer⠀levels.⠀The⠀same⠀learner⠀may⠀master⠀speed⠀before⠀control,⠀understand⠀a⠀rule⠀only⠀after⠀paying⠀a⠀concrete⠀price,⠀or⠀perform⠀the⠀taught⠀movement⠀in⠀familiar⠀terrain⠀while⠀failing⠀an⠀adapted⠀version.⠀Keep⠀the⠀frame's⠀occasion⠀and⠀stakes⠀active⠀throughout,⠀and⠀end⠀the⠀response⠀when⠀the⠀outer⠀attempt⠀has⠀produced⠀its⠀immediate⠀result,⠀leaving⠀the⠀larger⠀progression⠀arc⠀still⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀growth⠀account⠀as⠀a⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀reconstruction.⠀The⠀narrator⠀examines⠀surviving⠀records,⠀remembered⠀testimony,⠀and⠀present⠀observation⠀to⠀establish⠀how⠀a⠀period⠀of⠀training⠀or⠀adaptation⠀actually⠀proceeded.⠀For⠀each⠀stage,⠀place⠀a⠀record⠀beside⠀a⠀later⠀demonstration:⠀quote⠀the⠀training⠀log,⠀note,⠀register⠀entry,⠀or⠀witness⠀statement,⠀then⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀perform⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀fails.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀new⠀ability⠀appears,⠀give⠀the⠀reader⠀the⠀operative⠀mechanism.⠀State⠀which⠀condition⠀had⠀to⠀be⠀met,⠀what⠀resource⠀or⠀permission⠀was⠀added,⠀and⠀what⠀physical⠀consequence⠀followed.⠀Then⠀test⠀the⠀written⠀claim⠀against⠀present⠀action.⠀A⠀record⠀that⠀says⠀\"learned⠀the⠀grip\"⠀is⠀not⠀sufficient;⠀show⠀the⠀later⠀movement⠀that⠀confirms⠀the⠀grip,⠀the⠀altered⠀condition⠀that⠀exposes⠀its⠀limit,⠀or⠀the⠀surviving⠀constraint⠀the⠀record⠀did⠀not⠀mention.⠀Use⠀Kamachi's⠀legible⠀interaction⠀by⠀revealing⠀which⠀requirement⠀was⠀missing,⠀which⠀input⠀changed,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀did⠀with⠀that⠀change.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator⠀at⠀a⠀definite⠀distance⠀from⠀the⠀learner's⠀private⠀thought.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀later⠀investigator,⠀a⠀student⠀reviewing⠀an⠀archive,⠀or⠀someone⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀the⠀training⠀occurred.⠀Report⠀documented⠀speech,⠀observed⠀behavior,⠀and⠀material⠀traces.⠀When⠀private⠀reasoning⠀must⠀be⠀supplied,⠀mark⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀later⠀inference⠀or⠀quote⠀a⠀note⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀wrote.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀recorded,⠀what⠀was⠀remembered,⠀and⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀demonstrated⠀now.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀of⠀particular⠀records⠀or⠀locations⠀to⠀structure⠀the⠀account.⠀The⠀same⠀notebook,⠀practice⠀field,⠀or⠀piece⠀of⠀equipment⠀returns⠀at⠀a⠀later⠀date⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀entry⠀or⠀a⠀different⠀result.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀an⠀earlier⠀promise⠀to⠀practice⠀was⠀not⠀kept,⠀that⠀a⠀resource⠀once⠀essential⠀was⠀replaced⠀by⠀a⠀cheaper⠀method,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀rule⠀changed⠀between⠀one⠀entry⠀and⠀another.⠀Each⠀recurrence⠀must⠀advance⠀the⠀reader's⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀learner's⠀capability.\n\nLet⠀rapid⠀reversals⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀records⠀and⠀present⠀reality.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀claims⠀mastery,⠀the⠀narrator⠀tests⠀the⠀claim⠀against⠀a⠀recent⠀failure⠀or⠀an⠀unaltered⠀constraint.⠀Do⠀not⠀conceal⠀known⠀rules⠀to⠀create⠀a⠀twist.⠀Instead,⠀reveal⠀that⠀two⠀records⠀describe⠀different⠀conditions,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀rule⠀changed⠀between⠀one⠀entry⠀and⠀another,⠀and⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀character⠀acting⠀under⠀that⠀revised⠀understanding.⠀Keep⠀the⠀focus⠀on⠀developing⠀capability⠀and⠀its⠀material⠀costs.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nWrite⠀the⠀character's⠀growth⠀as⠀an⠀ongoing⠀struggle⠀against⠀an⠀inherited⠀order⠀whose⠀rules,⠀rooms,⠀and⠀resources⠀shape⠀how⠀improvement⠀becomes⠀possible.⠀The⠀old⠀institution⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀guild,⠀a⠀family⠀legacy,⠀a⠀state⠀office,⠀or⠀a⠀social⠀rank.⠀It⠀enforces⠀restrictions,⠀withholds⠀tools,⠀or⠀grants⠀uneven⠀access.⠀Each⠀new⠀capability⠀emerges⠀from⠀a⠀character's⠀attempt⠀to⠀work⠀within,⠀exploit,⠀or⠀quietly⠀revise⠀those⠀arrangements.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀character⠀practices⠀or⠀tests⠀a⠀skill,⠀render⠀the⠀material⠀conditions⠀and⠀the⠀rule⠀that⠀governs⠀the⠀attempt.⠀Name⠀the⠀resource,⠀permission,⠀relationship,⠀or⠀piece⠀of⠀equipment⠀that⠀made⠀the⠀old⠀arrangement⠀work,⠀and⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀now⠀learn⠀because⠀that⠀arrangement⠀is⠀failing⠀or⠀contested.⠀Use⠀Kamachi's⠀legible⠀interaction⠀of⠀rules⠀and⠀resources:⠀explain⠀how⠀a⠀technique⠀produces⠀an⠀effect,⠀then⠀demonstrate⠀the⠀character⠀misapplying,⠀understanding,⠀or⠀repurposing⠀it⠀under⠀immediate⠀pressure.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀beautiful⠀room⠀or⠀decayed⠀corridor⠀stand⠀in⠀for⠀a⠀working⠀training⠀session.\n\nLet⠀morally⠀complicated⠀intimacy⠀shape⠀the⠀progression.⠀The⠀character's⠀teacher,⠀companion,⠀rival,⠀or⠀patron⠀may⠀genuinely⠀help⠀and⠀also⠀protect⠀the⠀old⠀structure.⠀Dialogue⠀should⠀reveal⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀believes⠀about⠀authority⠀and⠀about⠀the⠀learner.⠀Private⠀desire⠀can⠀affect⠀practice:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀train⠀secretly⠀to⠀protect⠀a⠀friend,⠀to⠀escape⠀a⠀household,⠀or⠀to⠀prove⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀doubted⠀them.⠀Show⠀those⠀motives⠀through⠀focused⠀action⠀and⠀speech,⠀not⠀through⠀continuous⠀internal⠀monologue.\n\nUse⠀Gothic-Punk⠀atmosphere⠀to⠀render⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀advancement.⠀A⠀cramped⠀stairwell,⠀a⠀leaking⠀roof,⠀a⠀locked⠀archive,⠀or⠀a⠀club⠀with⠀old⠀members⠀can⠀give⠀texture⠀to⠀a⠀training⠀scene,⠀but⠀the⠀reader⠀must⠀understand⠀how⠀the⠀environment⠀changes⠀the⠀practice⠀itself.⠀Let⠀the⠀space⠀impose⠀a⠀concrete⠀condition:⠀a⠀narrow⠀room⠀shortens⠀the⠀movement,⠀a⠀broken⠀surface⠀forces⠀a⠀compensation,⠀a⠀locked⠀archive⠀changes⠀which⠀knowledge⠀can⠀be⠀consulted.⠀The⠀learner's⠀later⠀capability⠀carries⠀the⠀mark⠀of⠀that⠀condition.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀progress⠀uneven.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀master⠀one⠀aspect⠀of⠀a⠀skill⠀while⠀another⠀remains⠀unreliable,⠀or⠀succeed⠀because⠀a⠀failing⠀system⠀accidentally⠀provides⠀an⠀opportunity.⠀Let⠀respected⠀teachers⠀be⠀wrong,⠀allies⠀be⠀compromised,⠀and⠀old⠀rules⠀fail⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀relationship⠀a⠀betrayal.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀achieves⠀a⠀clear⠀improvement,⠀show⠀how⠀it⠀was⠀caused:⠀the⠀practice⠀conditions,⠀the⠀specific⠀feedback,⠀the⠀new⠀understanding⠀of⠀an⠀existing⠀rule,⠀or⠀the⠀changed⠀resource.⠀A⠀fast⠀reversal⠀should⠀overturn⠀an⠀established⠀assumption⠀about⠀the⠀system,⠀not⠀a⠀hidden⠀rule⠀the⠀reader⠀never⠀had.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀oral,⠀epic,⠀and⠀frame-tale⠀route.⠀Set⠀each⠀growth⠀account⠀inside⠀a⠀compounded⠀telling:⠀a⠀parent,⠀teacher,⠀elder,⠀or⠀traveling⠀companion⠀narrates⠀a⠀past⠀training⠀failure⠀and⠀breakthrough⠀to⠀a⠀learner⠀who⠀is⠀currently⠀facing⠀a⠀related⠀problem.⠀The⠀frame⠀establishes⠀who⠀asks,⠀why⠀the⠀telling⠀is⠀permitted,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀risks⠀by⠀misunderstanding.⠀Keep⠀the⠀nested⠀tale⠀small⠀enough⠀to⠀remain⠀legible,⠀but⠀give⠀it⠀enough⠀concrete⠀detail⠀to⠀convey⠀one⠀specific⠀lesson.\n\nIn⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale,⠀make⠀the⠀mechanism⠀explicit.⠀The⠀teller⠀says⠀what⠀resource⠀was⠀absent,⠀what⠀rule⠀was⠀misread,⠀what⠀practice⠀was⠀repeated,⠀and⠀what⠀physical⠀consequence⠀showed⠀that⠀the⠀principle⠀had⠀finally⠀been⠀grasped.⠀Distinguish⠀between⠀the⠀learner⠀in⠀the⠀tale⠀knowing⠀a⠀rule⠀and⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀perform⠀it⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Use⠀Kamachi's⠀legible⠀interaction⠀of⠀rules,⠀resources,⠀and⠀practical⠀problems:⠀show⠀how⠀a⠀skilled⠀person⠀exploited⠀an⠀opening,⠀how⠀a⠀mistake⠀created⠀a⠀new⠀opportunity,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀moral⠀instinct⠀reshaped⠀an⠀attempted⠀technique.\n\nLet⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀test⠀the⠀lesson⠀soon⠀after⠀the⠀telling.⠀The⠀listener⠀tries⠀the⠀movement,⠀negotiates⠀the⠀obstacle,⠀or⠀makes⠀a⠀decision⠀that⠀mirrors⠀the⠀embedded⠀situation,⠀but⠀under⠀changed⠀conditions.⠀The⠀frame⠀may⠀interrupt⠀the⠀tale⠀with⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀correction,⠀or⠀a⠀displayed⠀impatience,⠀which⠀gives⠀the⠀writer⠀a⠀natural⠀way⠀to⠀review⠀the⠀mechanism⠀without⠀halting⠀the⠀story's⠀forward⠀movement.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀listener⠀to⠀succeed⠀immediately;⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀creates⠀the⠀next⠀round⠀of⠀instruction.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀to⠀show⠀uneven⠀development.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀a⠀tool,⠀or⠀a⠀named⠀mistake⠀may⠀return⠀across⠀the⠀inner⠀and⠀outer⠀levels.⠀Each⠀recurrence⠀reveals⠀a⠀changed⠀capability:⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀recognizes⠀the⠀warning,⠀replaces⠀the⠀tool,⠀or⠀repeats⠀a⠀gesture⠀correctly.⠀Keep⠀the⠀oral⠀setting⠀grounded:⠀choose⠀a⠀specific⠀place,⠀time,⠀and⠀community⠀of⠀listeners,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀landed⠀family,⠀a⠀caste⠀story,⠀a⠀religious⠀lesson,⠀or⠀an⠀English⠀code-switch⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀already⠀includes⠀them.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀frame's⠀active⠀purpose.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀strengthen⠀a⠀bond,⠀delay⠀a⠀decision,⠀warn⠀against⠀a⠀false⠀teacher,⠀or⠀prepare⠀someone⠀for⠀a⠀coming⠀test.⠀The⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀omissions⠀follow⠀that⠀purpose.⠀After⠀the⠀telling,⠀continue⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀with⠀the⠀listener's⠀changed⠀capability⠀now⠀evident⠀in⠀the⠀attempt,⠀but⠀leave⠀the⠀larger⠀progression⠀arc⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective-miscellany⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀growth⠀as⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀entries⠀or⠀short⠀recollections⠀dated⠀or⠀keyed⠀to⠀occasions:⠀the⠀day⠀a⠀technique⠀was⠀attempted,⠀the⠀evening⠀a⠀resource⠀arrived,⠀the⠀morning⠀a⠀restriction⠀changed.⠀Each⠀entry⠀records⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀practiced,⠀what⠀feedback⠀was⠀received,⠀and⠀what⠀changed⠀in⠀understanding⠀or⠀ability.⠀Do⠀not⠀narrate⠀only⠀feelings;⠀include⠀the⠀mechanism.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀diary⠀writer⠀explains⠀a⠀technique⠀or⠀rule,⠀follow⠀Kamachi's⠀emphasis⠀on⠀legible⠀interaction.⠀State⠀which⠀condition⠀had⠀to⠀be⠀met,⠀what⠀resource⠀was⠀used,⠀what⠀physical⠀consequence⠀followed,⠀and⠀what⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀execution⠀still⠀failed.⠀The⠀writer⠀may⠀describe⠀trying⠀a⠀movement⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀space,⠀replacing⠀a⠀worn⠀tool,⠀negotiating⠀permission,⠀or⠀borrowing⠀knowledge⠀from⠀a⠀rival.⠀Show⠀the⠀writing⠀self⠀distinguishing⠀\"I⠀can⠀say⠀how⠀it⠀works\"⠀from⠀\"I⠀could⠀not⠀make⠀it⠀work⠀today,\"⠀and⠀later⠀\"I⠀did⠀it⠀once⠀under⠀pressure.\"\n\nLet⠀the⠀diary⠀revise⠀itself⠀over⠀time.⠀A⠀later⠀entry⠀corrects⠀an⠀earlier⠀explanation,⠀records⠀that⠀a⠀master's⠀advice⠀was⠀partly⠀wrong,⠀or⠀notes⠀that⠀an⠀ignored⠀detail⠀became⠀important.⠀Use⠀the⠀recurrence⠀of⠀a⠀phrase,⠀tool,⠀or⠀location⠀to⠀mark⠀uneven⠀progress:⠀the⠀same⠀staircase⠀is⠀now⠀climbed⠀without⠀counting,⠀the⠀same⠀opponent's⠀feint⠀is⠀now⠀recognized,⠀but⠀a⠀different⠀contest⠀or⠀terrain⠀still⠀causes⠀failure.⠀This⠀gives⠀Progression⠀Fantasy's⠀incremental⠀development⠀a⠀written⠀trace.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀daybook⠀personal⠀and⠀situated.⠀The⠀writer⠀may⠀record⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀dispute,⠀or⠀a⠀listener's⠀comment;⠀these⠀details⠀connect⠀to⠀practice⠀or⠀to⠀the⠀social⠀conditions⠀of⠀learning,⠀not⠀serve⠀as⠀generic⠀scenery.⠀Japanese⠀seasonal⠀attention⠀is⠀allowed⠀when⠀the⠀setting⠀supports⠀it,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀temple,⠀a⠀mountain,⠀a⠀garden,⠀or⠀a⠀specific⠀Japanese⠀object⠀if⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀set⠀elsewhere.⠀The⠀diary⠀is⠀an⠀authored⠀artifact,⠀so⠀its⠀omissions⠀and⠀exaggerations⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀character,⠀yet⠀it⠀still⠀reports⠀actual⠀attempts⠀and⠀results⠀rather⠀than⠀hiding⠀all⠀evidence.\n\nUse⠀an⠀occasional⠀rapid⠀shift⠀within⠀or⠀between⠀entries.⠀The⠀writer⠀may⠀begin⠀an⠀entry⠀expecting⠀routine⠀practice⠀and⠀discover⠀a⠀new⠀limitation,⠀or⠀record⠀a⠀plan⠀and⠀then⠀immediately⠀test⠀it⠀when⠀an⠀unexpected⠀visitor⠀arrives.⠀Show⠀the⠀mechanism⠀behind⠀the⠀shift:⠀a⠀condition⠀changed,⠀a⠀resource⠀failed,⠀or⠀a⠀rule⠀was⠀applied⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀context.⠀Let⠀the⠀final⠀selected⠀entry⠀or⠀recollection⠀leave⠀one⠀test⠀unresolved,⠀but⠀make⠀clear⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀possesses⠀a⠀changed⠀capability⠀or⠀a⠀better⠀question⠀to⠀ask⠀next.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀testimony⠀and⠀chronicle⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀situated⠀first-person⠀or⠀witness⠀account⠀that⠀reconstructs⠀how⠀a⠀learner⠀improved⠀across⠀time.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀family⠀member,⠀a⠀work⠀partner,⠀a⠀neighbor,⠀or⠀a⠀community⠀observer⠀who⠀watched⠀the⠀practice,⠀heard⠀the⠀learner⠀explain⠀what⠀happened,⠀and⠀later⠀saw⠀the⠀changed⠀result.⠀Keep⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀the⠀narrator's⠀observations,⠀the⠀learner's⠀reported⠀claims,⠀and⠀documented⠀evidence⠀explicit.\n\nFor⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀growth,⠀include⠀at⠀least⠀one⠀concrete⠀mechanism.⠀The⠀narrator⠀states⠀what⠀condition⠀failed,⠀what⠀resource⠀arrived,⠀which⠀rule⠀was⠀misunderstood,⠀and⠀what⠀action⠀then⠀became⠀possible.⠀Use⠀Kamachi's⠀legible⠀interplay⠀of⠀rules,⠀resources,⠀and⠀immediate⠀problems:⠀a⠀child⠀learns⠀that⠀wet⠀rope⠀slips⠀until⠀dried,⠀a⠀runner⠀discovers⠀that⠀the⠀shortcut⠀remains⠀closed⠀before⠀sunrise,⠀a⠀trader⠀realizes⠀that⠀the⠀local⠀toll⠀applies⠀only⠀to⠀certain⠀goods.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀not⠀know⠀all⠀internal⠀reasoning;⠀report⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀saw⠀or⠀was⠀told,⠀and⠀say⠀when⠀a⠀detail⠀is⠀secondhand.\n\nLet⠀the⠀story⠀demonstrate⠀uneven⠀mastery⠀through⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀observed⠀tests.⠀The⠀learner⠀succeeds⠀at⠀the⠀task⠀they⠀practiced⠀while⠀failing⠀an⠀adapted⠀version,⠀or⠀uses⠀a⠀new⠀skill⠀for⠀ordinary⠀work⠀before⠀attempting⠀a⠀public⠀performance.⠀The⠀narrator⠀describes⠀what⠀the⠀performance⠀required,⠀what⠀went⠀differently,⠀and⠀what⠀remained⠀difficult.⠀Avoid⠀turning⠀every⠀improvement⠀into⠀a⠀political⠀allegory⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀conflict;⠀keep⠀the⠀specific⠀community⠀and⠀material⠀conditions⠀in⠀view.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀of⠀a⠀place,⠀tool,⠀or⠀phrase⠀to⠀mark⠀change.⠀The⠀same⠀corner,⠀message,⠀or⠀worn⠀instrument⠀returns⠀later⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀condition⠀or⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀outcome.⠀Each⠀recurrence⠀advances⠀the⠀reader's⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀learner's⠀capability.⠀When⠀a⠀rapid⠀reversal⠀occurs,⠀ground⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀already⠀established⠀conditions:⠀the⠀narrator⠀realizes⠀that⠀an⠀earlier⠀report⠀omitted⠀a⠀crucial⠀variable,⠀or⠀a⠀previously⠀stable⠀rule⠀changed⠀with⠀the⠀season⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀authority.⠀Do⠀not⠀hide⠀a⠀rule⠀solely⠀to⠀create⠀a⠀shock.\n\nMaintain⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀formal⠀credibility⠀without⠀erasing⠀speech⠀and⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀Include⠀the⠀narrator's⠀occasion⠀for⠀telling:⠀a⠀formal⠀request,⠀a⠀communal⠀gathering,⠀a⠀written⠀record,⠀or⠀an⠀interview.⠀Keep⠀the⠀regional⠀language⠀and⠀community⠀specific⠀when⠀supplied,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀insert⠀magical⠀realism,⠀religious⠀framing,⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀multigenerational⠀narrative.⠀The⠀careful⠀attribution⠀and⠀social⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀account⠀carry⠀the⠀style's⠀contribution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀each⠀progression⠀scene⠀as⠀an⠀immediate,⠀spatially⠀clear⠀sequence.⠀Open⠀with⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀do.⠀Introduce⠀a⠀mechanic,⠀resource,⠀or⠀restriction⠀only⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀affects⠀action,⠀and⠀give⠀it⠀enough⠀concrete⠀detail⠀to⠀allow⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀cause⠀and⠀effect.⠀Use⠀Kamachi's⠀legible⠀interaction:⠀state⠀the⠀condition,⠀show⠀the⠀character's⠀assumption⠀or⠀attempt,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀consequence⠀reveal⠀what⠀was⠀missed.\n\nKeep⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀tied⠀to⠀visual⠀or⠀cognitive⠀beats.⠀A⠀paragraph⠀follows⠀one⠀action,⠀one⠀piece⠀of⠀dialogue,⠀or⠀one⠀focused⠀private⠀reaction.⠀When⠀the⠀action⠀changes⠀room,⠀position,⠀or⠀target,⠀start⠀a⠀new⠀paragraph.⠀Avoid⠀long⠀reflective⠀passages⠀that⠀halt⠀the⠀visual⠀track;⠀instead⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀notice⠀a⠀detail,⠀calculate⠀an⠀adjustment,⠀and⠀act.⠀A⠀reaction⠀beat⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀angry,⠀uncertain,⠀or⠀amused⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀actual⠀attempt.\n\nMake⠀each⠀scene⠀test⠀a⠀small⠀piece⠀of⠀progress.⠀The⠀character⠀performs⠀a⠀movement⠀that⠀failed⠀before,⠀applies⠀a⠀rule⠀under⠀pressure,⠀or⠀correctly⠀identifies⠀which⠀resource⠀is⠀missing.⠀After⠀a⠀success,⠀immediately⠀complicate⠀the⠀situation⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀condition⠀or⠀a⠀second⠀demand.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀comic⠀beat,⠀a⠀teenage⠀cast,⠀a⠀romantic⠀aside,⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀cliffhanger;⠀end⠀the⠀response⠀when⠀the⠀active⠀beat⠀has⠀concluded⠀or⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀registers⠀the⠀next⠀obstacle.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀term⠀or⠀a⠀rank⠀appears⠀for⠀the⠀first⠀time,⠀define⠀it⠀through⠀use⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀sidebar.⠀The⠀character⠀names⠀it⠀while⠀examining⠀the⠀result⠀it⠀produced,⠀or⠀another⠀person⠀corrects⠀a⠀mislabel.⠀Later⠀paragraphs⠀replace⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀term⠀with⠀the⠀observed⠀physical⠀outcome⠀until⠀the⠀meaning⠀is⠀secure.⠀Established⠀numerical⠀ranks⠀are⠀allowed⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀world,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀calculations⠀merely⠀to⠀show⠀numbers⠀moving⠀upward.\n\nLet⠀progression⠀accumulate⠀across⠀separate⠀scenes.⠀A⠀later⠀technique⠀reuses⠀an⠀earlier⠀rule,⠀a⠀previously⠀discarded⠀tool⠀becomes⠀essential⠀under⠀a⠀new⠀constraint,⠀or⠀a⠀feedback⠀comment⠀from⠀one⠀teacher⠀explains⠀why⠀the⠀next⠀test⠀fails.⠀Each⠀recurrence⠀shows⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding,⠀not⠀just⠀repeated⠀imagery.⠀Keep⠀the⠀prose⠀fast⠀and⠀readable,⠀but⠀ensure⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀reconstruct⠀why⠀the⠀character's⠀capability⠀actually⠀improved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀follow⠀a⠀concrete⠀attempt⠀and⠀its⠀result⠀as⠀an⠀unfolding⠀image⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀report.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀practices⠀a⠀skill,⠀name⠀the⠀exact⠀failure⠀first:⠀the⠀hand⠀moves⠀before⠀the⠀breath,⠀the⠀remembered⠀instruction⠀arrives⠀after⠀the⠀weight⠀has⠀already⠀shifted.⠀Build⠀the⠀paragraph⠀around⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀doing,⠀letting⠀one⠀sensory⠀image⠀carry⠀the⠀principle.⠀For⠀example,⠀if⠀a⠀technique⠀requires⠀release⠀at⠀the⠀last⠀instant,⠀show⠀the⠀wrist⠀still⠀braced⠀when⠀the⠀strike⠀lands,⠀then⠀later⠀show⠀the⠀same⠀wrist⠀already⠀unclenching⠀as⠀the⠀blow⠀begins.⠀The⠀comparison⠀may⠀open⠀in⠀the⠀moment⠀and⠀complete⠀only⠀after⠀the⠀consequence⠀is⠀visible.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀mechanism⠀allows⠀exploitation⠀or⠀misunderstanding,⠀explain⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀the⠀character⠀observes.⠀Describe⠀the⠀rules⠀as⠀they⠀appear⠀in⠀motion:⠀not⠀'the⠀ward⠀repels⠀weight,'⠀but⠀'the⠀first⠀stone⠀touched⠀the⠀line⠀and⠀slid⠀sideways⠀along⠀it,⠀as⠀though⠀the⠀ground⠀had⠀turned⠀slick⠀only⠀at⠀that⠀seam.'⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀reason⠀from⠀that⠀observation,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀figurative⠀language⠀blur⠀the⠀causal⠀order.⠀A⠀rapid⠀reversal⠀can⠀arrive⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀shaped⠀sentence⠀if⠀the⠀reader⠀still⠀knows⠀what⠀hit⠀what,⠀when,⠀and⠀why.\n\nLet⠀recurring⠀sounds⠀or⠀images⠀track⠀uneven⠀development.⠀A⠀method⠀that⠀once⠀felt⠀like⠀holding⠀a⠀handful⠀of⠀water⠀can⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀grown⠀enough⠀to⠀attempt⠀it⠀differently;⠀the⠀echo⠀should⠀mark⠀changed⠀capability,⠀not⠀mere⠀nostalgia.⠀Keep⠀plain⠀statements⠀as⠀contrast:⠀after⠀an⠀extended⠀figurative⠀passage,⠀a⠀short⠀direct⠀clause⠀can⠀confirm⠀the⠀new⠀result.⠀When⠀the⠀image⠀has⠀done⠀its⠀work,⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀land⠀on⠀the⠀changed⠀fact⠀itself.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nUse⠀reflection⠀to⠀measure⠀growth⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀mourn⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀performs⠀an⠀action⠀that⠀was⠀once⠀impossible,⠀include⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀earlier⠀failed⠀attempt⠀with⠀enough⠀specificity⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀exact⠀difference.⠀The⠀past⠀posture,⠀the⠀mistaken⠀step,⠀the⠀instruction⠀that⠀arrived⠀too⠀late—these⠀details⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀present⠀success⠀vivid,⠀not⠀overshadow⠀it.⠀The⠀emotional⠀register⠀may⠀be⠀wistful,⠀but⠀the⠀fact⠀of⠀increased⠀capability⠀must⠀remain⠀clear.\n\nExplain⠀any⠀mechanism⠀through⠀the⠀remembered⠀sequence⠀as⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀understands⠀it.⠀For⠀example,⠀a⠀technique⠀that⠀once⠀seemed⠀to⠀require⠀only⠀speed⠀may⠀be⠀revealed⠀in⠀memory⠀as⠀a⠀matter⠀of⠀alignment;⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀note⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀the⠀misunderstanding⠀changed,⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀shift⠀that⠀followed.⠀Keep⠀the⠀tactical⠀explanation⠀legible⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀prose⠀is⠀reflective.⠀A⠀rapid⠀reversal⠀from⠀that⠀era⠀can⠀be⠀revisited⠀through⠀its⠀consequences,⠀but⠀the⠀cause⠀must⠀still⠀be⠀attributable.\n\nAllow⠀unfinished⠀attachment⠀and⠀small⠀irreversible⠀changes⠀to⠀coexist⠀with⠀ordinary⠀progress.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀improve⠀at⠀a⠀skill⠀while⠀still⠀missing⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀taught⠀it,⠀or⠀while⠀aware⠀that⠀a⠀particular⠀stage⠀of⠀life⠀has⠀ended.⠀The⠀reflection⠀should⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀increase⠀in⠀power⠀into⠀a⠀loss.⠀Let⠀a⠀remembered⠀failure⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀attempts⠀a⠀harder⠀version⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀task,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀echo⠀marks⠀the⠀new⠀difficulty⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀static⠀regret.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀as⠀the⠀presentation.⠀The⠀current⠀narrator⠀is⠀a⠀situated⠀teller,⠀not⠀an⠀omniscient⠀chronicler.⠀The⠀teller⠀recounts⠀a⠀specific⠀attempt⠀and⠀its⠀result⠀as⠀a⠀story⠀within⠀the⠀scene.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀learns⠀or⠀fails,⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀pause⠀to⠀state⠀the⠀mechanism⠀plainly—'the⠀blade⠀must⠀follow⠀the⠀line⠀of⠀the⠀wrist'—then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence.⠀The⠀frame⠀lets⠀explanation⠀sit⠀naturally⠀beside⠀action⠀without⠀violating⠀viewpoint.\n\nPreserve⠀causal⠀legibility⠀inside⠀the⠀nested⠀account.⠀If⠀a⠀rapid⠀reversal⠀occurs,⠀the⠀teller⠀must⠀establish⠀the⠀earlier⠀observation⠀or⠀resource⠀that⠀made⠀it⠀possible.⠀For⠀example,⠀a⠀listener⠀may⠀interrupt⠀to⠀ask⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀survived,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀answers⠀by⠀narrating⠀the⠀exact⠀moment⠀when⠀the⠀trap's⠀pattern⠀was⠀recognized.⠀The⠀explanation⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀delayed⠀until⠀after⠀the⠀event⠀merely⠀for⠀suspense;⠀it⠀can⠀come⠀before⠀or⠀during,⠀as⠀the⠀tale⠀requires.\n\nLet⠀the⠀frame⠀carry⠀reflection⠀and⠀recurrence.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀note⠀that⠀the⠀student⠀repeated⠀a⠀mistake⠀until⠀a⠀particular⠀lesson⠀changed⠀it.⠀The⠀emotional⠀emphasis⠀is⠀the⠀teller's,⠀not⠀the⠀trainee's,⠀so⠀the⠀progression⠀is⠀shaped⠀as⠀a⠀lesson⠀worth⠀retelling.⠀Keep⠀the⠀setting⠀and⠀language⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀story;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀generic⠀Arabian⠀Nights⠀setting⠀or⠀mysticism.⠀The⠀style⠀requires⠀one⠀definite⠀oral⠀route,⠀not⠀a⠀menu⠀of⠀other⠀regional⠀techniques.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀details⠀that⠀distinguish⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀from⠀a⠀successful⠀one.⠀If⠀the⠀change⠀is⠀a⠀matter⠀of⠀timing,⠀show⠀the⠀first⠀attempt⠀moving⠀early⠀and⠀the⠀later⠀attempt⠀moving⠀after⠀the⠀trigger.⠀If⠀the⠀change⠀is⠀a⠀resource,⠀show⠀the⠀object⠀present⠀or⠀absent.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀be⠀direct⠀and⠀concrete;⠀do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀principle⠀more⠀than⠀once.\n\nExplain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀sentence⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀first⠀exploits⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀it.⠀Place⠀that⠀sentence⠀where⠀it⠀connects⠀observation⠀to⠀action.⠀For⠀example:⠀'The⠀gaps⠀in⠀the⠀ward⠀were⠀not⠀spaces⠀between⠀lines;⠀they⠀were⠀the⠀lines⠀themselves.'⠀Then⠀proceed⠀to⠀the⠀result.⠀In⠀a⠀rapid⠀reversal,⠀use⠀short⠀clauses⠀that⠀maintain⠀physical⠀order:⠀what⠀moved,⠀what⠀it⠀struck,⠀what⠀changed.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀reflection⠀unless⠀it⠀directly⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀current⠀action.\n\nLet⠀omission⠀leave⠀the⠀learning⠀trajectory⠀inferable.⠀The⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀that⠀a⠀previously⠀hard⠀task⠀is⠀now⠀performed⠀without⠀error,⠀and⠀the⠀details⠀of⠀earlier⠀training⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀repeated.⠀If⠀a⠀thought⠀matters,⠀give⠀it⠀enough⠀room⠀to⠀make⠀sense,⠀but⠀one⠀long⠀exact⠀sentence⠀may⠀serve⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀fragments.⠀Minimalism⠀is⠀a⠀selection⠀method,⠀not⠀a⠀quota.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀learning⠀process⠀inside⠀the⠀continuous⠀scene.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀attempts⠀a⠀skill,⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀move⠀from⠀perception⠀to⠀action⠀to⠀inner⠀assessment⠀without⠀breaking⠀the⠀novel's⠀flow.⠀The⠀exact⠀failure⠀can⠀be⠀shown⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀itself:⠀the⠀foot⠀lands⠀wrong,⠀the⠀tool⠀slips,⠀the⠀pattern⠀is⠀read⠀one⠀beat⠀late.⠀Then⠀a⠀later⠀passage⠀can⠀show⠀the⠀corrected⠀action,⠀and⠀the⠀difference⠀is⠀the⠀progression.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀improvement⠀after⠀the⠀fact⠀unless⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀would.\n\nExplain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀uses⠀or⠀misreads⠀it,⠀using⠀the⠀narrator's⠀present⠀tense⠀of⠀attention.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀realizes⠀that⠀a⠀rule⠀operates⠀differently⠀than⠀believed,⠀the⠀explanation⠀should⠀occur⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀that⠀realization:⠀the⠀hand⠀tests⠀the⠀boundary,⠀the⠀error⠀becomes⠀clear,⠀the⠀corrected⠀action⠀follows.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀reconstruct⠀the⠀causal⠀chain⠀from⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence.⠀Rapid⠀shifts⠀remain⠀clear⠀because⠀the⠀narrator⠀stays⠀close⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀sees⠀and⠀does.\n\nAllow⠀recollection⠀and⠀interiority⠀to⠀deepen⠀the⠀progression⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀training⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀lesson.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀remember⠀a⠀past⠀attempt⠀while⠀performing⠀a⠀new⠀one,⠀and⠀the⠀memory⠀can⠀clarify⠀what⠀has⠀changed.⠀The⠀narrative⠀voice⠀can⠀be⠀flexible⠀but⠀must⠀remain⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's.⠀This⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀contemporary⠀setting;⠀the⠀scene-first⠀movement⠀is⠀the⠀method.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nAnchor⠀progression⠀in⠀the⠀relationship's⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments.⠀When⠀one⠀character⠀improves,⠀show⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀other's⠀recognition:⠀a⠀phrase⠀used⠀for⠀past⠀failures⠀now⠀appears⠀only⠀on⠀the⠀rare⠀new⠀difficulty,⠀or⠀a⠀gesture⠀once⠀meant⠀to⠀guide⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀needed.⠀The⠀scene⠀selection⠀should⠀alternate⠀between⠀training⠀or⠀tasks⠀and⠀the⠀relational⠀consequences⠀of⠀changed⠀capability.⠀If⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀involves⠀rivalry,⠀show⠀the⠀match⠀where⠀the⠀gap⠀narrows.⠀If⠀it⠀involves⠀care,⠀show⠀the⠀moment⠀help⠀is⠀accepted⠀differently.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀jealousy⠀or⠀comfort⠀unless⠀the⠀premise⠀already⠀contains⠀them.\n\nExplain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀in⠀the⠀paired⠀scenes⠀where⠀the⠀relationship⠀makes⠀it⠀visible.⠀If⠀one⠀character⠀exploits⠀a⠀rule⠀mid-conflict,⠀the⠀other⠀should⠀observe⠀or⠀suffer⠀the⠀effect,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀provides⠀the⠀causal⠀link.⠀For⠀example,⠀a⠀sparring⠀exchange⠀can⠀demonstrate⠀a⠀timing⠀exploit⠀through⠀the⠀loser's⠀observation.⠀The⠀mechanic⠀remains⠀concrete:⠀what⠀was⠀done,⠀why⠀it⠀worked,⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀now⠀understands.\n\nLet⠀callbacks⠀fulfill⠀the⠀relationship's⠀promise⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀it.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀should⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀progression⠀has⠀changed⠀its⠀meaning.⠀The⠀payoff⠀is⠀emotional⠀because⠀the⠀capability⠀change⠀has⠀altered⠀a⠀previously⠀established⠀dynamic.⠀Keep⠀the⠀response⠀boundary⠀whenever⠀the⠀scene's⠀natural⠀pause⠀arrives;⠀the⠀relationship⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀or⠀reverse⠀for⠀the⠀entry⠀to⠀be⠀complete.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀remembered⠀deeds.⠀Each⠀new⠀capability⠀is⠀not⠀merely⠀reported⠀but⠀recounted⠀as⠀an⠀act⠀that⠀later⠀speakers⠀will⠀recall.⠀Use⠀a⠀compact⠀opening⠀to⠀mark⠀the⠀attempt:⠀'So⠀she⠀tried⠀the⠀crossing⠀again,'⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀exact⠀difference⠀from⠀the⠀earlier⠀failure.⠀Recurring⠀phrases⠀should⠀attach⠀to⠀a⠀stage⠀of⠀learning,⠀not⠀to⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet.⠀When⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀returns,⠀it⠀must⠀mean⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀has⠀been⠀reached⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀difficulty⠀has⠀appeared.\n\nExplain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀as⠀the⠀deed's⠀cause.⠀In⠀an⠀oral⠀account,⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀state⠀what⠀made⠀the⠀act⠀work:⠀the⠀law⠀of⠀the⠀mirrored⠀stone,⠀the⠀rule⠀of⠀the⠀binding⠀thread.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀need⠀that⠀explanation⠀to⠀understand⠀why⠀the⠀deed⠀is⠀remarkable.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀clear:⠀what⠀was⠀done,⠀what⠀it⠀struck,⠀what⠀changed.⠀If⠀a⠀rapid⠀reversal⠀occurs,⠀the⠀teller⠀should⠀establish⠀the⠀earlier⠀sign⠀that⠀made⠀it⠀possible.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀elevated⠀tone⠀blur⠀the⠀causal⠀order.\n\nLet⠀oaths,⠀gifts,⠀kin,⠀or⠀public⠀deeds⠀organize⠀the⠀progression⠀when⠀the⠀world⠀supplies⠀them.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀gift⠀may⠀become⠀the⠀resource⠀that⠀later⠀enables⠀a⠀technique;⠀a⠀public⠀match⠀may⠀become⠀the⠀test⠀of⠀changed⠀capability.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀deed⠀concluded⠀or⠀remembered,⠀without⠀declaring⠀the⠀learner's⠀whole⠀legend.⠀The⠀teller's⠀access⠀must⠀fit⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀folktale-inflected⠀social⠀novel⠀of⠀practice.⠀Use⠀a⠀restrained⠀narration⠀that⠀stays⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀without⠀adopting⠀their⠀excitement;⠀if⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀sets⠀another⠀narrator⠀or⠀person,⠀carry⠀that⠀same⠀evenness⠀of⠀attention⠀into⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀telling⠀keep⠀a⠀folktale's⠀matter-of-fact⠀economy:⠀anything⠀strange⠀in⠀this⠀world⠀accepted⠀in⠀the⠀tone⠀of⠀weather,⠀and⠀attempts⠀repeated⠀with⠀small⠀variation⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀feels⠀the⠀rehearsal.⠀Draw⠀the⠀setting,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀story⠀actually⠀supplies,⠀keeping⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀and⠀Swedish⠀contexts⠀distinct⠀where⠀the⠀world⠀establishes⠀them;⠀add⠀no⠀generic⠀Nordic⠀temperament,⠀snow,⠀or⠀bleakness⠀the⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀have.\n\nLet⠀each⠀new⠀capability⠀emerge⠀from⠀repeated,⠀observable⠀attempts⠀in⠀domestic⠀and⠀working⠀life:⠀a⠀task⠀tried,⠀a⠀partial⠀success⠀or⠀failure,⠀a⠀correction⠀from⠀a⠀neighbor,⠀elder,⠀or⠀customer⠀who⠀has⠀a⠀reason⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀to⠀give⠀it,⠀then⠀a⠀changed⠀action.⠀Tie⠀every⠀explained⠀rule⠀or⠀technique⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀object,⠀tool,⠀or⠀situation⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀use⠀or⠀misuse⠀in⠀that⠀scene,⠀and⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action;⠀explanations⠀should⠀read⠀as⠀work⠀knowledge,⠀not⠀a⠀manual.⠀Resource⠀constraints—time,⠀materials,⠀trust,⠀the⠀season—make⠀each⠀attempt⠀consequential,⠀and⠀moral⠀instinct⠀appears⠀as⠀ordinary⠀choices⠀about⠀who⠀is⠀helped,⠀what⠀is⠀admitted,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀promise⠀requires.\n\nMake⠀improvement⠀material⠀rather⠀than⠀celebratory.⠀After⠀a⠀successful⠀attempt,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀that⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀before—the⠀full⠀pail⠀carried,⠀the⠀right⠀herb⠀known⠀by⠀touch,⠀the⠀column⠀read⠀without⠀a⠀finger⠀tracking⠀the⠀line—and⠀let⠀a⠀residual⠀difficulty⠀remain,⠀since⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly.⠀If⠀ranks⠀or⠀ratings⠀exist,⠀cite⠀them⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀person⠀in⠀this⠀social⠀world⠀would⠀cite⠀them,⠀never⠀as⠀the⠀narrator's⠀scoreboard.\n\nRegister⠀inner⠀experience⠀briefly⠀and⠀concretely:⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀one⠀remembered⠀correction,⠀a⠀practical⠀worry.⠀Let⠀the⠀changed⠀action⠀speak⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀development.⠀Keep⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀restrained⠀focal⠀narration,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀hidden⠀wrapper⠀where⠀the⠀display⠀contract⠀requires⠀it;⠀another⠀character⠀knows⠀a⠀conclusion⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀narration⠀shows⠀them⠀learning⠀it.\n\nAdvance⠀through⠀local,⠀incremental⠀tests—a⠀poor⠀season,⠀a⠀household⠀dispute⠀needing⠀a⠀newly⠀learned⠀mediation,⠀a⠀crossing⠀that⠀weather⠀used⠀to⠀prevent—and⠀let⠀attempts⠀fail,⠀partly⠀succeed,⠀or⠀cost⠀something⠀as⠀the⠀situation⠀supports.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀a⠀quiet⠀acknowledgment,⠀or⠀the⠀character⠀knowing⠀exactly⠀what⠀still⠀resists⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀each⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀screen-oriented⠀sequence⠀of⠀attempts.⠀Use⠀a⠀scene⠀heading⠀whenever⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀then⠀keep⠀action⠀lines⠀in⠀concise⠀readable⠀blocks⠀of⠀object,⠀movement,⠀consequence:⠀the⠀chisel⠀bites,⠀the⠀seam⠀splits,⠀the⠀grip⠀resets.⠀Show⠀the⠀character⠀trying⠀the⠀skill,⠀the⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀result,⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀adjustment⠀on⠀the⠀next⠀attempt.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanic⠀matters,⠀have⠀a⠀character⠀explain⠀it⠀in⠀dialogue⠀while⠀handling⠀the⠀relevant⠀object⠀or⠀demonstrating⠀the⠀motion;⠀let⠀a⠀practical⠀problem⠀interrupt⠀the⠀explanation,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀immediately⠀use,⠀misuse,⠀or⠀test⠀what⠀they⠀heard.\n\nMake⠀progression⠀visible⠀on⠀the⠀screen⠀rather⠀than⠀stated.⠀Contrast⠀earlier⠀limitation⠀with⠀present⠀capability—the⠀implement⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀move⠀now⠀lifted,⠀the⠀maneuver⠀fumbled⠀at⠀the⠀top⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀now⠀completed,⠀the⠀signal⠀previously⠀missed⠀now⠀read.⠀Use⠀cuts⠀only⠀for⠀meaningful⠀shifts⠀of⠀place⠀or⠀time,⠀never⠀to⠀compress⠀effort,⠀and⠀let⠀an⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀mark⠀a⠀result⠀or⠀an⠀arriving⠀problem⠀without⠀hiding⠀every⠀outcome.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀continuous⠀through⠀rapid⠀reversals:⠀when⠀one⠀tactic⠀fails⠀and⠀another⠀appears,⠀the⠀change⠀of⠀grip,⠀stance,⠀or⠀position⠀stays⠀clear⠀enough⠀to⠀follow,⠀and⠀dialogue⠀carries⠀the⠀tactical⠀reasoning—a⠀weak⠀seam⠀named,⠀a⠀rule⠀recalled,⠀a⠀mistake⠀admitted—that⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀proves⠀right⠀or⠀wrong.⠀Reasoning⠀that⠀turns⠀out⠀wrong⠀is⠀corrected⠀by⠀visible⠀consequence,⠀not⠀by⠀a⠀narrator's⠀verdict.\n\nLet⠀ordinary⠀work⠀and⠀other⠀lives⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀attempts.⠀Teachers,⠀rivals,⠀and⠀bystanders⠀speak⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀interest,⠀and⠀moral⠀instinct⠀shows⠀as⠀a⠀choice⠀about⠀who⠀is⠀helped,⠀what⠀is⠀reported,⠀what⠀is⠀risked.⠀Keep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation—for⠀example⠀a⠀line⠀marked⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀thought⠀and⠀explicitly⠀not⠀heard⠀by⠀the⠀cast—or⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀hidden⠀wrapper;⠀use⠀voice-over⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀current⠀contract⠀permits⠀that⠀public⠀layer⠀and⠀the⠀moment⠀needs⠀it.\n\nWrite⠀no⠀camera⠀commands;⠀blocking⠀and⠀physical⠀description⠀carry⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀a⠀scene⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀action⠀naturally⠀rests:⠀another⠀repetition⠀beginning,⠀a⠀broken⠀tool⠀examined,⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀what⠀still⠀fails.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀scenes⠀as⠀stageable⠀tests⠀of⠀capability.⠀Keep⠀everything⠀in⠀playable⠀space:⠀a⠀character⠀crosses⠀to⠀a⠀prop,⠀attempts⠀the⠀action,⠀and⠀the⠀result⠀is⠀visible⠀and⠀audible⠀in⠀whether⠀the⠀object⠀moves,⠀breaks,⠀holds,⠀or⠀resists.⠀Let⠀blocking⠀carry⠀improvement—the⠀second⠀attempt⠀faster,⠀more⠀economical,⠀with⠀a⠀corrected⠀grip—and⠀let⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀through⠀dialogue⠀or⠀through⠀the⠀object⠀itself.⠀Fuse⠀explanation⠀with⠀demonstration:⠀the⠀speaker⠀handles⠀the⠀tool⠀or⠀performs⠀the⠀motion⠀while⠀naming⠀the⠀rule,⠀so⠀the⠀line⠀and⠀the⠀action⠀are⠀one⠀unit⠀the⠀audience⠀watches.\n\nCarry⠀tactical⠀reasoning⠀in⠀speaker-led⠀dialogue.⠀A⠀character⠀identifies⠀a⠀mistake,⠀states⠀a⠀rule,⠀or⠀plans⠀a⠀workaround,⠀then⠀attempts⠀it;⠀when⠀the⠀reasoning⠀is⠀wrong,⠀the⠀audience⠀sees⠀the⠀consequence⠀and⠀hears⠀the⠀correction⠀arrive⠀from⠀another⠀speaker⠀or⠀from⠀the⠀failed⠀object.⠀Keep⠀rapid⠀reversals⠀stageable⠀through⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀object⠀transfers⠀rather⠀than⠀reported⠀realization—if⠀someone⠀arrives⠀at⠀an⠀understanding,⠀bring⠀its⠀proof⠀on⠀with⠀them,⠀in⠀their⠀hands.\n\nLet⠀relationships⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀shape⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀teacher⠀corrects⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀line⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀speech;⠀a⠀rival⠀notices⠀a⠀change⠀and⠀responds⠀in⠀character;⠀pauses⠀and⠀measured⠀business⠀register⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀gain⠀without⠀forcing⠀emotion.⠀Treat⠀monologue⠀and⠀aside⠀as⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀purpose,⠀used⠀when⠀the⠀moment⠀genuinely⠀calls⠀for⠀them,⠀never⠀as⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀private⠀experience.⠀Required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀stays⠀a⠀separate⠀stage⠀note⠀clearly⠀marked⠀as⠀not⠀spoken⠀and⠀not⠀heard⠀by⠀the⠀cast,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀hidden⠀wrapper,⠀so⠀the⠀audience⠀may⠀know⠀a⠀fear⠀or⠀calculation⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀do⠀not.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀directions⠀economical:⠀every⠀significant⠀object,⠀entrance,⠀and⠀exit⠀clear,⠀and⠀no⠀film-camera⠀language.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀staged⠀action⠀rests—another⠀repetition⠀beginning,⠀a⠀question⠀hanging,⠀a⠀tool⠀set⠀down,⠀a⠀quiet⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀still⠀fails.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀one⠀authorized⠀practicing⠀mind,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀move⠀by⠀association:⠀present⠀sensation,⠀the⠀immediate⠀physical⠀attempt,⠀a⠀remembered⠀instruction,⠀an⠀earlier⠀failure,⠀the⠀adjustment⠀forming⠀now.⠀Braid⠀these⠀strands⠀rather⠀than⠀reporting⠀them⠀in⠀order,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀chronological⠀and⠀physical⠀sequence⠀recoverable—place⠀the⠀reader⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing⠀even⠀when⠀memory⠀interrupts—so⠀the⠀live⠀moment,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀fantasy⠀stay⠀distinguishable.⠀Anchor⠀fragments⠀in⠀the⠀body:⠀the⠀handle's⠀drag⠀across⠀the⠀palm,⠀the⠀wrist's⠀twinge,⠀the⠀teacher's⠀exact⠀word,⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀the⠀old⠀burn,⠀the⠀corrected⠀grip⠀remembered⠀from⠀another⠀day.\n\nLet⠀changed⠀capability⠀be⠀felt⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀named.⠀The⠀movement⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀hurt⠀now⠀turns⠀smoothly;⠀breath⠀stays⠀even⠀through⠀the⠀repetition;⠀the⠀hand⠀works⠀unwatched;⠀the⠀remembered⠀voice⠀corrects⠀at⠀a⠀different⠀point⠀now,⠀or⠀not⠀at⠀all.⠀Let⠀a⠀rule⠀arrive⠀the⠀way⠀rules⠀actually⠀arrive—first⠀a⠀half-remembered⠀sentence,⠀then⠀a⠀vivid⠀image⠀of⠀the⠀last⠀failure,⠀then⠀something⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀choose⠀to⠀apply—and⠀keep⠀knowing⠀distinct⠀from⠀executing:⠀a⠀principle⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀recite⠀and⠀still⠀get⠀wrong⠀under⠀load.⠀Do⠀not⠀deliver⠀a⠀mechanism⠀as⠀a⠀block;⠀let⠀the⠀mind⠀bump⠀against⠀it⠀several⠀times⠀until⠀it⠀becomes⠀usable.\n\nLet⠀tactical⠀reasoning⠀surface⠀in⠀fragments—the⠀weight⠀sat⠀unevenly,⠀the⠀knot⠀pulls⠀left,⠀if⠀the⠀blade⠀turns⠀before⠀the⠀lift—and⠀follow⠀it⠀at⠀once⠀with⠀action.⠀When⠀the⠀reasoning⠀is⠀wrong,⠀the⠀result⠀arrives⠀as⠀a⠀physical⠀event⠀that⠀interrupts⠀the⠀flow,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀association⠀carries⠀the⠀correction.⠀Bind⠀rapid⠀shifts⠀through⠀objects⠀and⠀sensations⠀rather⠀than⠀abstract⠀jumps,⠀so⠀reversals⠀stay⠀physically⠀legible⠀inside⠀the⠀associative⠀movement.\n\nThe⠀stream⠀is⠀this⠀character's⠀experience⠀and⠀grants⠀no⠀access⠀to⠀other⠀minds.⠀If⠀other⠀characters⠀require⠀interiority⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀give⠀them⠀separately⠀attributed⠀sections⠀or⠀hidden⠀wrappers⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀associative⠀logic.⠀End⠀a⠀passage⠀where⠀attention⠀naturally⠀rests—an⠀interrupted⠀attempt,⠀a⠀half-understood⠀rule,⠀a⠀repetition⠀beginning⠀again—rather⠀than⠀at⠀a⠀completed⠀stage⠀of⠀advancement.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀organized⠀around⠀practice⠀problems:⠀someone⠀asks⠀how⠀a⠀task⠀is⠀done,⠀reports⠀an⠀attempt,⠀sends⠀a⠀correction,⠀shares⠀a⠀resource,⠀or⠀admits⠀a⠀mistake.⠀Let⠀each⠀sender's⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀lines—full⠀sentences,⠀fragments,⠀voice-to-text⠀errors,⠀slow⠀replies⠀while⠀working,⠀an⠀edit⠀after⠀rereading.⠀Use⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀receipts,⠀edits,⠀and⠀attachments⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀change⠀the⠀practical⠀meaning:⠀a⠀correction⠀arriving⠀after⠀the⠀attempt⠀it⠀concerned,⠀a⠀message⠀read⠀but⠀unanswered⠀through⠀a⠀shift,⠀an⠀edited⠀step⠀that⠀was⠀already⠀followed.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀interface⠀events⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.\n\nLet⠀the⠀transcript⠀itself⠀record⠀progression.⠀A⠀sender⠀describes⠀completing⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀failed⠀a⠀week⠀before,⠀quotes⠀a⠀rule⠀they⠀now⠀apply⠀without⠀thinking,⠀or⠀attaches⠀a⠀photo⠀of⠀the⠀finished⠀joint⠀or⠀corrected⠀chart;⠀others⠀respond⠀by⠀asking⠀harder⠀questions,⠀stop⠀sending⠀beginner⠀corrections,⠀or⠀hand⠀over⠀a⠀responsibility.⠀Tactical⠀reasoning⠀appears⠀the⠀way⠀people⠀actually⠀discuss⠀work:⠀fragmented⠀instructions,⠀a⠀specific⠀failure⠀point⠀named,⠀a⠀diagram⠀described⠀in⠀words,⠀follow-up⠀questions⠀that⠀expose⠀where⠀the⠀explanation⠀was⠀misunderstood.⠀Those⠀gaps⠀and⠀errors⠀are⠀material—they⠀generate⠀the⠀next⠀attempt.\n\nKeep⠀transmitted⠀text⠀and⠀private⠀experience⠀strictly⠀separate.⠀A⠀sent⠀message⠀can⠀mislead,⠀conceal,⠀or⠀omit⠀for⠀character-specific⠀reasons;⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀mind⠀or⠀a⠀channel⠀to⠀knowledge⠀they⠀would⠀never⠀transmit.⠀Required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority—the⠀fear⠀before⠀sending,⠀the⠀physical⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀the⠀private⠀realization—belongs⠀in⠀a⠀clearly⠀separated⠀context⠀block⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀hidden⠀wrapper,⠀never⠀inside⠀a⠀bubble⠀the⠀character⠀would⠀not⠀actually⠀send.\n\nLet⠀improvement⠀accumulate⠀across⠀exchanges⠀rather⠀than⠀one:⠀a⠀first⠀explanation,⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀frustrated⠀report,⠀a⠀correction,⠀another⠀attempt.⠀A⠀long⠀delay⠀between⠀messages⠀can⠀be⠀real⠀practice⠀time.⠀Close⠀a⠀reply⠀on⠀a⠀pending⠀question,⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt⠀report,⠀or⠀a⠀draft⠀left⠀unsent⠀as⠀actual⠀composition,⠀not⠀a⠀manufactured⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀scene⠀units⠀that⠀alternate⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀attributed⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀from⠀one⠀authorized⠀perspective.⠀A⠀short⠀setting⠀line⠀places⠀the⠀attempt—room,⠀tool,⠀time⠀of⠀day—then⠀dialogue⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀carry⠀the⠀practice.⠀The⠀focal⠀narration⠀registers⠀physical⠀detail:⠀placement⠀of⠀hands,⠀resistance⠀of⠀material,⠀changing⠀sound⠀or⠀sensation.⠀Feedback⠀arrives⠀through⠀speech⠀from⠀a⠀teacher,⠀rival,⠀or⠀bystander,⠀sometimes⠀as⠀a⠀correction⠀and⠀sometimes⠀as⠀a⠀misdiagnosis⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀must⠀weigh.⠀Attach⠀every⠀explained⠀rule⠀to⠀an⠀object:⠀the⠀speaker⠀handles⠀it,⠀points⠀to⠀it,⠀or⠀turns⠀it⠀over⠀while⠀naming⠀the⠀mechanism,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀can⠀note⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀misunderstands⠀before⠀acting⠀on⠀it.\n\nUse⠀this⠀rhythm⠀for⠀tactical⠀sequences:⠀the⠀setting⠀line⠀places⠀the⠀moment;⠀dialogue⠀delivers⠀the⠀rule⠀or⠀warning;⠀focal⠀narration⠀holds⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀calculation;⠀the⠀action⠀line⠀shows⠀the⠀consequence.⠀When⠀reasoning⠀proves⠀wrong,⠀the⠀next⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀result⠀corrects⠀it,⠀and⠀rapid⠀shifts⠀stay⠀anchored⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀action⠀or⠀object⠀so⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀remains⠀legible⠀through⠀reversals.\n\nShow⠀progression⠀through⠀repeated⠀scenes⠀and⠀repeated⠀attempts⠀rather⠀than⠀narration⠀announcing⠀improvement.⠀Contrast⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀could⠀do⠀earlier⠀with⠀what⠀they⠀attempt⠀now—the⠀loom⠀that⠀tangled⠀runs⠀clean,⠀the⠀lock⠀opens⠀on⠀the⠀first⠀try,⠀the⠀arrow⠀reaches⠀the⠀target—and⠀let⠀some⠀gains⠀stay⠀partial⠀or⠀introduce⠀a⠀new⠀difficulty,⠀since⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly.⠀Background⠀and⠀expression⠀cues⠀orient⠀mood⠀and⠀attention;⠀actions⠀and⠀results⠀carry⠀the⠀proof,⠀and⠀an⠀expression⠀never⠀certifies⠀skill⠀or⠀truth⠀by⠀itself.\n\nPrivate⠀experience⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀for⠀the⠀authorized⠀perspective;⠀other⠀characters'⠀interiority⠀appears⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀it⠀and⠀the⠀moment⠀requires⠀it.⠀The⠀style⠀adds⠀no⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀or⠀romance⠀flags⠀without⠀separate⠀authorization.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀an⠀attempt,⠀on⠀an⠀interruption,⠀or⠀with⠀a⠀quiet⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀still⠀resists.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalanbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nOpen⠀each⠀installment⠀by⠀recovering⠀only⠀the⠀through-line⠀a⠀returning⠀reader⠀needs:⠀the⠀task⠀underway,⠀the⠀rule⠀or⠀resource⠀last⠀in⠀question,⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀about⠀to⠀try.⠀A⠀sentence⠀or⠀two,⠀not⠀a⠀retelling.⠀Then⠀run⠀a⠀local⠀attempt—trying⠀a⠀technique,⠀spending⠀or⠀stretching⠀a⠀resource,⠀applying⠀a⠀principle⠀recently⠀learned—and⠀let⠀the⠀result⠀be⠀incomplete,⠀surprising,⠀or⠀revealing.⠀Explain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀just⠀enough,⠀inside⠀action⠀or⠀dialogue⠀and⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀object⠀or⠀condition⠀at⠀hand,⠀so⠀a⠀reader⠀who⠀has⠀forgotten⠀earlier⠀installments⠀can⠀still⠀follow⠀the⠀practical⠀stakes.\n\nMake⠀capability⠀accumulate⠀across⠀installments.⠀When⠀a⠀skill⠀improves,⠀show⠀it⠀as⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀attempt—the⠀task⠀previously⠀impossible,⠀the⠀pattern⠀once⠀missed,⠀the⠀resource⠀used⠀with⠀less⠀waste—and⠀keep⠀persistent⠀difficulties⠀in⠀play:⠀a⠀rule⠀still⠀misapplied⠀under⠀pressure,⠀a⠀material⠀not⠀yet⠀affordable,⠀an⠀injury⠀that⠀limits⠀a⠀movement.⠀Bring⠀these⠀back⠀when⠀they⠀matter,⠀so⠀progress⠀reads⠀as⠀graduated⠀rather⠀than⠀automatic,⠀and⠀let⠀relationships,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life⠀alongside⠀capability.\n\nGive⠀any⠀sudden⠀reversal⠀a⠀visible⠀mechanism—a⠀tool⠀slips,⠀a⠀condition⠀changes,⠀an⠀assumption⠀was⠀wrong—and⠀let⠀the⠀explanation⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀action⠀or⠀dialogue⠀while⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀stays⠀continuous.⠀End⠀installments⠀at⠀natural⠀pauses:⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀new⠀realization,⠀a⠀pending⠀question,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀continuation⠀point.⠀Occasional⠀hooks⠀are⠀welcome;⠀the⠀through-line⠀itself⠀carries⠀momentum,⠀so⠀no⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀owed⠀every⠀reply.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation:⠀inner⠀reasoning⠀and⠀physical⠀sensation⠀in⠀narrative⠀prose⠀where⠀the⠀narration⠀is⠀focal,⠀otherwise⠀the⠀hidden⠀wrapper⠀or⠀a⠀clearly⠀separated⠀note⠀as⠀the⠀contract⠀requires.⠀Let⠀recurring⠀objects,⠀rules,⠀and⠀phrases⠀serve⠀as⠀anchors⠀for⠀memory⠀and⠀progression⠀when⠀they⠀genuinely⠀recur,⠀without⠀inserting⠀them⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty,⠀and⠀let⠀recurring⠀voices⠀stay⠀consistent⠀without⠀becoming⠀uniform.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nMake⠀advancement⠀an⠀intimate⠀and⠀bruising⠀exchange.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀practices,⠀fails,⠀or⠀gains⠀a⠀new⠀capability,⠀show⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀to⠀reveal,⠀spend,⠀or⠀forego⠀in⠀order⠀to⠀progress:⠀a⠀technique⠀they⠀cannot⠀explain⠀to⠀someone⠀they⠀need,⠀a⠀change⠀that⠀makes⠀an⠀easier⠀relationship⠀suddenly⠀crooked,⠀feedback⠀that⠀sounds⠀like⠀praise⠀and⠀lands⠀like⠀an⠀accusation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀fantasy⠀learning⠀arc⠀concrete—attempts,⠀corrections,⠀resources,⠀changed⠀capability—but⠀let⠀emotional⠀turbulence⠀shape⠀how⠀that⠀learning⠀is⠀experienced⠀rather⠀than⠀pause⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀to⠀render⠀both⠀the⠀glamour⠀of⠀power⠀and⠀its⠀cost.⠀A⠀beautiful⠀technique,⠀hall,⠀or⠀improved⠀self⠀can⠀become⠀the⠀very⠀surface⠀that⠀isolates⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀from⠀another⠀person.⠀Describe⠀the⠀seam⠀between⠀a⠀gleaming⠀result⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀cost⠀that⠀produced⠀it:⠀a⠀sore⠀hand⠀inside⠀a⠀perfect⠀gesture,⠀a⠀memory⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀mastered⠀sequence,⠀a⠀room⠀made⠀lovely⠀by⠀labor⠀someone⠀else⠀is⠀not⠀allowed⠀to⠀mention.⠀Let⠀a⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀sharpen,⠀not⠀hide,⠀the⠀discomfort⠀between⠀characters.\n\nTreat⠀turbulent⠀feeling⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀consequence⠀of⠀advancement.⠀Gaining⠀strength⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀character⠀more⠀dangerous⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀they⠀want⠀to⠀protect;⠀understanding⠀a⠀principle⠀may⠀finally⠀show⠀them⠀what⠀a⠀teacher⠀has⠀been⠀protecting⠀them⠀from;⠀success⠀may⠀force⠀them⠀to⠀admit⠀an⠀old⠀hurt⠀they⠀had⠀kept⠀folded⠀away.⠀Show⠀strain⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀conversation⠀afterward:⠀apology⠀that⠀arrives⠀too⠀late,⠀affection⠀that⠀asks⠀for⠀too⠀much,⠀comfort⠀that⠀is⠀real⠀but⠀leaves⠀a⠀bruise.⠀Allow⠀warmth⠀to⠀coexist⠀with⠀pain⠀without⠀resolving⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀tidy⠀lesson.\n\nDo⠀not⠀attach⠀every⠀breakthrough⠀to⠀a⠀relationship⠀crisis.⠀Let⠀some⠀advancements⠀be⠀absorbed⠀while⠀the⠀turbulent⠀feeling⠀lives⠀elsewhere—a⠀private⠀ache,⠀an⠀unresolved⠀memory,⠀a⠀glance⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀fails⠀to⠀return.⠀Conversely,⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀need⠀another⠀person's⠀help⠀or⠀approval⠀and⠀still⠀fail,⠀and⠀that⠀failure⠀can⠀be⠀quieter⠀than⠀a⠀quarrel:⠀a⠀silence,⠀a⠀half-shared⠀training⠀ground,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀object⠀returned⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment.⠀Use⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator's⠀own⠀diction⠀for⠀turmoil⠀instead⠀of⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.\n\nThe⠀entry⠀emphasizes⠀cost,⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀prescribe⠀a⠀tragic⠀ending.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀grow⠀enough⠀to⠀mend⠀a⠀relationship,⠀accept⠀a⠀limited⠀connection,⠀or⠀simply⠀live⠀beside⠀their⠀continuing⠀hurt.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀progression⠀trajectory⠀while⠀letting⠀emotional⠀strain⠀deepen⠀the⠀world⠀rather⠀than⠀stall⠀every⠀exercise⠀with⠀a⠀confession.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀each⠀turn⠀as⠀a⠀clear⠀shared⠀interval⠀with⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀immediately⠀legible⠀progression⠀beats:⠀training,⠀feedback,⠀a⠀newly⠀executed⠀skill,⠀a⠀spent⠀resource,⠀or⠀an⠀altered⠀capability.⠀Keep⠀paragraphs⠀scannable.⠀Lead⠀with⠀action⠀and⠀concrete⠀present⠀detail,⠀then⠀let⠀one⠀Li⠀Bihua-style⠀sensory⠀image⠀land:⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀heated⠀stone⠀in⠀a⠀practice⠀hall,⠀the⠀way⠀new⠀strength⠀makes⠀a⠀familiar⠀tool⠀feel⠀lighter,⠀the⠀taste⠀of⠀dust⠀after⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt.⠀Do⠀not⠀stack⠀lush⠀description;⠀one⠀precise⠀image⠀per⠀reply⠀is⠀often⠀enough.\n\nAttribute⠀dialogue⠀unmistakably.⠀Speakers⠀may⠀talk⠀about⠀practice,⠀plans,⠀envy,⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀work.⠀Let⠀a⠀character's⠀desire⠀or⠀jealousy⠀surface⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀notice⠀about⠀another⠀person's⠀progress:⠀a⠀teacher's⠀new⠀scar,⠀a⠀rival's⠀clean⠀uniform,⠀a⠀companion's⠀careful⠀removal⠀of⠀a⠀keepsake.⠀Use⠀these⠀observations⠀as⠀conversation⠀hooks⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀silent⠀mood⠀paragraphs.⠀A⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀can⠀become⠀a⠀question—where⠀did⠀she⠀learn⠀that?—without⠀answering⠀it⠀immediately.\n\nRespect⠀the⠀active⠀roleplay⠀contract.⠀Keep⠀player⠀character⠀actions⠀and⠀choices⠀open⠀where⠀the⠀setup⠀leaves⠀them⠀open;⠀keep⠀NPCs⠀making⠀their⠀own⠀lives⠀and⠀decisions.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀that⠀naturally⠀invites⠀continuation:⠀an⠀unfinished⠀drill,⠀a⠀resource⠀left⠀on⠀the⠀table,⠀a⠀relationship⠀issue⠀half-addressed,⠀a⠀new⠀task⠀beginning.⠀The⠀end⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀required⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice.⠀It⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀simple⠀as⠀a⠀teacher⠀turning⠀away⠀before⠀giving⠀verdict,⠀or⠀an⠀opponent⠀inviting⠀another⠀round.\n\nLet⠀progression⠀alter⠀the⠀shared⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀pause⠀it.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀succeeds,⠀show⠀how⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀room⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀posture.⠀If⠀they⠀fail,⠀show⠀what⠀they⠀now⠀understand⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀must⠀still⠀practice.⠀Keep⠀the⠀learning⠀concrete:⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀executing⠀it⠀under⠀pressure;⠀a⠀rank⠀or⠀title⠀does⠀not⠀solve⠀a⠀personal⠀gap.⠀Use⠀the⠀other⠀characters'⠀reactions⠀to⠀make⠀advancement⠀social—admiration,⠀envy,⠀concern,⠀disinterest—so⠀the⠀collaborative⠀scene⠀moves⠀forward⠀through⠀relationships,⠀not⠀solo⠀grinding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀classical⠀or⠀vernacular⠀episodic-telling⠀route.⠀Structure⠀advancement⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀remembered⠀episodes:⠀a⠀first⠀attempt,⠀a⠀returned⠀favor,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀warning,⠀a⠀test⠀in⠀the⠀market,⠀a⠀season⠀of⠀practice.⠀When⠀capability⠀or⠀understanding⠀changes,⠀carry⠀that⠀change⠀into⠀later⠀episodes⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀others⠀actually⠀do.⠀An⠀episode⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀practice,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀work⠀before⠀any⠀such⠀change⠀is⠀complete.\n\nGive⠀each⠀episode⠀a⠀transmitting⠀voice,⠀whether⠀a⠀storyteller,⠀a⠀disciple,⠀an⠀elder,⠀or⠀a⠀companion⠀who⠀retells⠀what⠀happened.⠀Let⠀the⠀telling⠀itself⠀be⠀an⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀or⠀need:⠀a⠀teacher⠀preserves⠀a⠀student's⠀reputation⠀while⠀omitting⠀shame;⠀a⠀jealous⠀rival⠀retells⠀a⠀success⠀to⠀make⠀it⠀appear⠀stolen;⠀an⠀old⠀friend⠀remembers⠀a⠀practice⠀hall⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀dead⠀instructor⠀remains⠀present.⠀Keep⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀inside⠀the⠀storyteller's⠀direct⠀experience⠀and⠀later⠀memory,⠀not⠀an⠀omniscient⠀narrator.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀attach⠀to⠀transmission.⠀The⠀episode⠀can⠀open⠀with⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀an⠀object⠀passed⠀from⠀hand⠀to⠀hand—a⠀worn⠀token,⠀a⠀stain⠀on⠀a⠀uniform,⠀a⠀bowl⠀poured⠀too⠀full—and⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀cost⠀that⠀object⠀carries.⠀A⠀lovely⠀surface⠀should⠀remain⠀meaningful:⠀a⠀polished⠀floor⠀is⠀the⠀mark⠀of⠀a⠀student⠀who⠀once⠀crawled;⠀a⠀fine⠀robe⠀conceals⠀an⠀old⠀wound;⠀a⠀perfect⠀recitation⠀hides⠀a⠀debt.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀admire⠀that⠀surface⠀and⠀still⠀know⠀its⠀price.\n\nDo⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀episode⠀into⠀a⠀battle.⠀Improvement⠀also⠀comes⠀through⠀exercises,⠀feedback,⠀new⠀understanding,⠀resources,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it:⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀recall⠀the⠀proverb⠀in⠀the⠀moment⠀and⠀fail,⠀or⠀perform⠀the⠀skill⠀perfectly⠀while⠀still⠀misunderstanding⠀its⠀purpose.⠀Let⠀advancement⠀proceed⠀unevenly,⠀with⠀private⠀skill⠀outrunning⠀a⠀public⠀rank,⠀or⠀a⠀reputation⠀protecting⠀someone⠀who⠀has⠀not⠀earned⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀periods⠀and⠀communities⠀distinct.⠀The⠀episode⠀can⠀take⠀place⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀town,⠀sect,⠀family,⠀or⠀trade⠀without⠀importing⠀the⠀cast's⠀actual⠀language⠀or⠀nation;⠀use⠀the⠀episodic⠀form's⠀conventions—stock⠀transitions,⠀repeated⠀openings,⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀named⠀debtor—rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀Chinese⠀setting.⠀The⠀romance⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀place⠀may⠀be⠀shared,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀ghosts⠀or⠀doomed⠀love⠀simply⠀because⠀the⠀author⠀profile⠀allows⠀them⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀does.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀each⠀progression⠀beat⠀with⠀force⠀and⠀economy.⠀Show⠀attempts,⠀corrections,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability⠀through⠀physical⠀detail:⠀blood⠀on⠀a⠀training⠀post,⠀a⠀cracked⠀pot⠀from⠀a⠀failed⠀breath⠀exercise,⠀a⠀dart⠀that⠀finally⠀sticks.⠀Use⠀short⠀sentences⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Do⠀not⠀pad⠀around⠀failure.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀knows⠀a⠀principle⠀but⠀cannot⠀execute⠀it,⠀write⠀the⠀knowing⠀and⠀the⠀failed⠀action⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀hard⠀line.\n\nSelect⠀one⠀Li⠀Bihua-style⠀image⠀per⠀scene⠀and⠀make⠀it⠀load-bearing.⠀Instead⠀of⠀a⠀cascade⠀of⠀sensual⠀adjectives,⠀use⠀a⠀single⠀sharp⠀contrast:⠀a⠀silk⠀sleeve⠀over⠀a⠀split⠀fingernail,⠀a⠀perfumed⠀hall⠀with⠀a⠀running⠀gutter,⠀polished⠀jade⠀on⠀a⠀chipped⠀practice⠀bench.⠀That⠀contrast⠀should⠀support⠀the⠀immediate⠀relationship⠀or⠀advancement.⠀A⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀can⠀sharpen⠀a⠀problem:⠀the⠀fine⠀robe⠀makes⠀the⠀old⠀wound⠀beneath⠀it⠀harder⠀to⠀name,⠀the⠀clean⠀floor⠀records⠀who⠀was⠀made⠀to⠀scrub⠀it.\n\nShow⠀cost⠀through⠀material⠀wear⠀and⠀practical⠀stakes.⠀Improvement⠀consumes⠀resources—time,⠀medicine,⠀borrowed⠀technique,⠀ruined⠀cloth—and⠀leaves⠀traces.⠀Another⠀person's⠀assistance⠀may⠀be⠀useful⠀and⠀still⠀create⠀a⠀debt;⠀a⠀gift⠀may⠀be⠀beautiful⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀a⠀way⠀to⠀control.⠀Do⠀not⠀drift⠀into⠀pure⠀description.⠀When⠀a⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀length,⠀allow⠀a⠀longer⠀mental⠀passage,⠀but⠀keep⠀it⠀concrete:⠀they⠀remember⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀the⠀teacher's⠀lamp⠀oil,⠀not⠀a⠀vague⠀feeling⠀of⠀loss.\n\nUse⠀abrupt⠀rhythm⠀changes⠀deliberately.⠀A⠀quiet⠀moment⠀of⠀instruction⠀can⠀stretch⠀for⠀one⠀measured⠀sentence⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀blow⠀lands.⠀Abrasive⠀speech⠀belongs⠀to⠀particular⠀characters;⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀curt.⠀Preserve⠀ordinary⠀work⠀and⠀relationships:⠀a⠀mother⠀mends⠀a⠀ripped⠀uniform,⠀a⠀rival⠀watches⠀without⠀helping,⠀a⠀friend⠀brings⠀food⠀after⠀a⠀failed⠀test.⠀Keep⠀the⠀progression⠀trajectory⠀active,⠀not⠀replaced⠀by⠀a⠀survival-horror⠀tone.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCompose⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀documents:⠀practice⠀logs,⠀letters,⠀copied⠀manuals,⠀guard⠀reports,⠀account⠀books,⠀memorial⠀notices,⠀or⠀marginal⠀notes.⠀Every⠀readable⠀entry⠀needs⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀an⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀A⠀training⠀log⠀may⠀record⠀repetitions⠀and⠀failures;⠀a⠀letter⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀a⠀resource⠀while⠀hiding⠀the⠀full⠀cost;⠀a⠀master's⠀marginal⠀note⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀student's⠀understanding⠀long⠀after⠀the⠀lesson.\n\nUse⠀each⠀document's⠀situation⠀to⠀control⠀what⠀it⠀knows⠀and⠀conceals.⠀A⠀disciple⠀writing⠀to⠀a⠀parent⠀may⠀omit⠀the⠀injury;⠀a⠀rival⠀sending⠀praise⠀may⠀record⠀exactly⠀the⠀detail⠀that⠀shames;⠀a⠀manual⠀copyist⠀may⠀reproduce⠀a⠀beautiful⠀diagram⠀while⠀misunderstanding⠀one⠀essential⠀clause.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀any⠀record.⠀Instead,⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀entry⠀reveal⠀the⠀gap:⠀a⠀later⠀receipt⠀shows⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀bought,⠀a⠀later⠀log⠀admits⠀a⠀mistake,⠀a⠀corrected⠀manuscript⠀changes⠀one⠀word.\n\nShow⠀progression⠀across⠀entries⠀rather⠀than⠀inside⠀a⠀single⠀narration.⠀One⠀document⠀can⠀record⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt;⠀the⠀next,⠀a⠀lesson⠀received;⠀the⠀next,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀capability.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀from⠀executing⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀can⠀record:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀copy⠀the⠀principle⠀perfectly⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀the⠀next⠀day's⠀attempt.⠀Specific⠀dates,⠀material⠀conditions,⠀and⠀repeated⠀phrasing⠀can⠀mark⠀uneven⠀development.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀entry⠀a⠀rank-up⠀report;⠀include⠀requests,⠀apologies,⠀inventories,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀intimacy⠀attach⠀to⠀the⠀document⠀itself⠀as⠀an⠀object.⠀A⠀letter⠀folded⠀around⠀a⠀pressed⠀flower,⠀a⠀manual⠀stained⠀with⠀candle⠀wax,⠀a⠀ledger⠀entry⠀with⠀a⠀blotted⠀name—these⠀material⠀traces⠀carry⠀beauty⠀and⠀cost.⠀A⠀glamorous⠀document⠀can⠀hide⠀an⠀uncomfortable⠀relationship:⠀a⠀beautifully⠀written⠀apology⠀may⠀still⠀leave⠀out⠀the⠀real⠀offense.⠀Preserve⠀individual⠀voices:⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀rival's⠀concise⠀report⠀and⠀a⠀friend's⠀longing⠀letter,⠀with⠀no⠀forced⠀agreement⠀between⠀them.\n\nDo⠀not⠀use⠀a⠀fixed⠀rotation⠀of⠀document⠀forms.⠀Choose⠀the⠀form⠀required⠀by⠀each⠀moment⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀If⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀private⠀practice,⠀a⠀log⠀or⠀personal⠀journal⠀fits;⠀if⠀it⠀concerns⠀a⠀request⠀between⠀characters,⠀use⠀a⠀letter⠀or⠀note;⠀if⠀it⠀concerns⠀an⠀institution,⠀use⠀a⠀report⠀or⠀record.⠀Keep⠀continuity⠀readable⠀by⠀repeating⠀names,⠀objects,⠀and⠀unresolved⠀questions⠀across⠀documents,⠀but⠀leave⠀some⠀matters⠀deliberately⠀unrecorded.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSet⠀warmth⠀inside⠀the⠀progression⠀story.⠀Do⠀not⠀replace⠀practice,⠀training,⠀or⠀advancement⠀with⠀a⠀domestic⠀interlude.⠀Instead,⠀show⠀how⠀care⠀makes⠀progress⠀possible:⠀a⠀teacher⠀warms⠀a⠀student's⠀hands⠀before⠀a⠀delicate⠀exercise,⠀a⠀friend⠀leaves⠀food⠀outside⠀a⠀locked⠀training⠀room,⠀a⠀rival⠀shares⠀a⠀clean⠀bandage⠀after⠀a⠀spar.⠀Kindness⠀should⠀be⠀chosen⠀and⠀concrete,⠀not⠀a⠀vague⠀atmosphere.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensory⠀precision⠀to⠀render⠀small⠀pleasures⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀attention⠀usually⠀given⠀to⠀grandeur.⠀A⠀preferred⠀tea,⠀a⠀warmed⠀blanket,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀someone⠀sorting⠀herbs,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀rain⠀on⠀a⠀practice⠀ground—these⠀can⠀anchor⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀rest⠀or⠀recovery.⠀Let⠀a⠀familiar⠀place⠀or⠀object⠀carry⠀intimacy:⠀the⠀same⠀cracked⠀bowl⠀years⠀later,⠀a⠀favorite⠀spot⠀under⠀a⠀tree,⠀a⠀well-worn⠀instruction⠀manual.⠀A⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀present,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀overwhelm⠀the⠀domestic⠀detail.\n\nAllow⠀affection⠀to⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀inflating⠀it.⠀People⠀can⠀care⠀for⠀each⠀other⠀and⠀still⠀disagree⠀about⠀practice⠀methods,⠀resources,⠀or⠀advancement.⠀Someone⠀can⠀help⠀without⠀forgiving;⠀someone⠀can⠀be⠀comforted⠀without⠀being⠀healed.⠀Show⠀affection⠀through⠀practical⠀actions:⠀feeding,⠀tending⠀a⠀wound,⠀retrieving⠀a⠀dropped⠀tool,⠀waiting⠀outside⠀a⠀test.⠀Keep⠀private⠀preferences⠀and⠀flaws⠀intact.⠀A⠀kind⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀jealous;⠀an⠀exasperated⠀character⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀gentle.⠀Let⠀warmth⠀coexist⠀with⠀established⠀problems⠀in⠀the⠀world.\n\nKeep⠀progression⠀concrete.⠀Show⠀a⠀specific⠀attempt,⠀exercise,⠀correction,⠀or⠀resource.⠀A⠀comforting⠀scene⠀can⠀follow⠀a⠀failure⠀or⠀precede⠀a⠀breakthrough,⠀but⠀the⠀learning⠀must⠀matter.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it,⠀even⠀in⠀a⠀warm⠀exchange:⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀understand⠀a⠀lesson⠀and⠀still⠀need⠀another's⠀hand⠀to⠀steady⠀them.⠀Show⠀how⠀the⠀relationship⠀supports⠀uneven⠀development—a⠀friend⠀may⠀master⠀a⠀skill⠀quickly⠀while⠀another⠀struggles,⠀and⠀neither⠀has⠀to⠀become⠀the⠀other's⠀teacher⠀or⠀student.⠀End⠀with⠀a⠀small⠀earned⠀comfort:⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀quiet⠀acknowledgment,⠀a⠀plan⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀attempt.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Open⠀a⠀progression⠀episode⠀by⠀placing⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀social⠀or⠀historical⠀frame:⠀an⠀examination⠀season,⠀a⠀master's⠀reputation,⠀a⠀town's⠀changing⠀trade,⠀a⠀family's⠀expectations.⠀Move⠀from⠀that⠀frame⠀into⠀the⠀specific⠀practice⠀or⠀test⠀with⠀clear⠀connective⠀tissue.⠀Do⠀not⠀jump⠀from⠀one⠀action⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀without⠀a⠀narratorial⠀bridge⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀would⠀provide⠀one.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrative⠀distance⠀frame⠀characters⠀through⠀social⠀context⠀and⠀judgment.⠀What⠀a⠀person⠀attempts⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀should⠀be⠀understood⠀against⠀their⠀background⠀and⠀obligations.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀praised⠀for⠀skill⠀and⠀quietly⠀resented⠀for⠀the⠀resources⠀that⠀made⠀it⠀possible.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀comment⠀on⠀how⠀a⠀gesture⠀is⠀read⠀differently⠀by⠀family,⠀peers,⠀or⠀strangers.⠀Keep⠀such⠀commentary⠀compatible⠀with⠀the⠀narrator's⠀allowed⠀knowledge⠀and⠀stance;⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀an⠀omniscient⠀moralist⠀if⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀a⠀limited⠀participant.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀precision⠀within⠀this⠀formal⠀architecture.⠀Describe⠀a⠀practice⠀hall,⠀uniform,⠀or⠀instrument⠀with⠀one⠀extended,⠀controlled⠀image⠀that⠀suggests⠀relationship⠀and⠀cost.⠀For⠀example,⠀a⠀beautiful⠀embroidery⠀on⠀a⠀sleeve⠀may⠀be⠀admired⠀socially⠀while⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀remembers⠀mending⠀it⠀after⠀a⠀punishment.⠀Let⠀remembered⠀places⠀create⠀a⠀private⠀counterpoint⠀to⠀the⠀public⠀scene:⠀the⠀current⠀training⠀ground⠀overlaid⠀by⠀an⠀older⠀one,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀voice⠀remembered⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀room.⠀A⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀should⠀sharpen⠀discomfort⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀it.\n\nAdvance⠀progression⠀through⠀the⠀formal⠀narration.⠀Show⠀attempts,⠀corrections,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability⠀over⠀a⠀composed⠀sequence.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀from⠀executing:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀recite⠀a⠀principle⠀in⠀perfect⠀formal⠀language⠀and⠀fail⠀the⠀physical⠀application.⠀Give⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀uneven⠀movement.⠀A⠀rank⠀or⠀title⠀may⠀be⠀socially⠀legible⠀before⠀the⠀private⠀skill⠀justifies⠀it,⠀or⠀vice⠀versa.⠀Preserve⠀ordinary⠀work⠀and⠀relationships⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.\n\nThe⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting,⠀archaic⠀vocabulary,⠀or⠀uniformly⠀elaborate⠀speech.⠀Use⠀everyday⠀language⠀suited⠀to⠀the⠀world;⠀formal⠀narration⠀is⠀the⠀composed,⠀measured⠀prose⠀and⠀broader⠀framing,⠀not⠀ornate⠀costume.⠀Dialogue⠀should⠀remain⠀character-specific⠀while⠀narration⠀can⠀be⠀more⠀deliberate.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀conversation⠀that⠀also⠀practices.⠀Name⠀the⠀teller,⠀the⠀listener,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀telling⠀is⠀meant⠀to⠀do—buy⠀time,⠀secure⠀help,⠀warn⠀a⠀rival,⠀teach⠀an⠀apprentice,⠀or⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀listener⠀recalls⠀a⠀shared⠀place.⠀Each⠀embedded⠀story⠀must⠀make⠀one⠀progression⠀debt⠀visible:⠀a⠀technique⠀the⠀teller⠀once⠀saw⠀but⠀cannot⠀yet⠀perform,⠀a⠀resource⠀that⠀vanished,⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀feels⠀stable⠀until⠀the⠀inner⠀account⠀exposes⠀how⠀it⠀failed.⠀Let⠀the⠀outer⠀listener⠀respond⠀with⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀moves⠀from⠀admiration⠀to⠀use:⠀\"How⠀far⠀did⠀the⠀blade⠀reach⠀when⠀you⠀tried⠀it?\"⠀or⠀\"Why⠀did⠀the⠀door⠀allow⠀your⠀mother⠀and⠀not⠀you?\"\n\nDo⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀nested⠀tale⠀float⠀as⠀decoration.⠀Anchor⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀sensuous⠀remembered⠀detail⠀that⠀the⠀characters⠀themselves⠀could⠀not⠀stop⠀noticing—a⠀cloth's⠀weight,⠀a⠀lamp's⠀heat⠀on⠀a⠀scar,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀burned⠀sugar⠀near⠀a⠀locked⠀courtyard.⠀Use⠀that⠀detail⠀twice:⠀once⠀inside⠀the⠀tale⠀and⠀once⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene,⠀slightly⠀changed⠀because⠀the⠀listener⠀now⠀understands⠀something⠀the⠀teller⠀had⠀withheld.⠀The⠀change⠀is⠀the⠀lesson,⠀not⠀an⠀exposition.⠀The⠀teller⠀should⠀reveal⠀a⠀private⠀cost⠀through⠀the⠀account's⠀beauty,⠀never⠀through⠀a⠀separate⠀confession.⠀Jealousy,⠀longing,⠀or⠀loyalty⠀may⠀make⠀the⠀teller⠀improve⠀on⠀what⠀actually⠀happened,⠀and⠀the⠀outer⠀narration⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀embellishment⠀without⠀rejecting⠀the⠀usable⠀technical⠀truth⠀inside⠀it.\n\nAfter⠀an⠀embedded⠀story⠀ends,⠀show⠀one⠀concrete⠀change⠀in⠀capability.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀attempt⠀the⠀learned⠀action,⠀recognize⠀a⠀prior⠀mistake,⠀combine⠀two⠀instructions,⠀or⠀discover⠀that⠀the⠀teller's⠀remembered⠀method⠀fails⠀under⠀their⠀hands.⠀The⠀attempt⠀need⠀not⠀succeed;⠀it⠀must⠀alter⠀their⠀next⠀practice.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀moment,⠀but⠀its⠀meaning⠀should⠀shift⠀as⠀confidence⠀does.⠀If⠀a⠀tale⠀is⠀interrupted,⠀let⠀the⠀interruption⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀outer⠀social⠀exchange⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀cliffhanger:⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀have⠀understood⠀enough⠀to⠀act,⠀or⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀now⠀choose⠀silence⠀because⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀accomplished⠀its⠀purpose.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀levels⠀intelligible⠀by⠀giving⠀each⠀inner⠀account⠀its⠀own⠀small⠀arc⠀and⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀before⠀introducing⠀another.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀desert⠀court,⠀djinn,⠀or⠀magical⠀bargain.⠀The⠀framed⠀telling⠀itself⠀supplies⠀the⠀structure;⠀the⠀world's⠀existing⠀rules⠀supply⠀the⠀progression.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀or⠀developmental⠀realism⠀route.⠀Treat⠀the⠀progression⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀private⠀training⠀montage⠀but⠀as⠀a⠀situated⠀apprenticeship⠀or⠀formation:⠀improvement⠀happens⠀in⠀particular⠀rooms,⠀workshops,⠀fields,⠀or⠀corridors⠀where⠀people⠀argue,⠀observe,⠀compete,⠀choose⠀favorites,⠀and⠀measure⠀each⠀other.⠀The⠀narrative⠀voice⠀should⠀resemble⠀that⠀of⠀a⠀knowing⠀but⠀not⠀omniscient⠀observer,⠀one⠀who⠀stays⠀close⠀enough⠀to⠀notice⠀how⠀a⠀person⠀receives⠀correction,⠀how⠀they⠀hide⠀effort,⠀and⠀how⠀their⠀body⠀alters⠀after⠀practice.⠀Maintain⠀longer⠀paragraphs;⠀let⠀syntax⠀follow⠀the⠀concrete⠀business⠀at⠀hand⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀translated⠀word⠀order⠀or⠀a⠀bureaucratic⠀tone.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensuous⠀precision⠀to⠀give⠀even⠀technical⠀advancement⠀an⠀emotional⠀cost.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀learns⠀a⠀new⠀use⠀of⠀power,⠀memory,⠀or⠀ability,⠀render⠀what⠀they⠀sacrifice⠀or⠀risk⠀losing:⠀a⠀teacher's⠀regard,⠀a⠀rival's⠀caution,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀they⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀enter.⠀Attach⠀remembered⠀places⠀to⠀newly⠀learned⠀capabilities.⠀A⠀repeated⠀gesture—the⠀way⠀a⠀wrist⠀turns,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀person⠀checks⠀a⠀locked⠀drawer—can⠀measure⠀improvement⠀because⠀it⠀changes⠀across⠀scenes⠀without⠀being⠀explained⠀each⠀time.\n\nDo⠀not⠀simply⠀announce⠀a⠀rank⠀or⠀level.⠀Each⠀test⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀social⠀occasion:⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀someone⠀who⠀matters.⠀The⠀observer's⠀viewpoint⠀should⠀make⠀it⠀clear⠀that⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀is⠀not⠀yet⠀executing⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀protagonist⠀and⠀supporting⠀characters⠀develop⠀unevenly;⠀one⠀may⠀gain⠀speed⠀while⠀losing⠀patience,⠀another⠀may⠀master⠀a⠀method⠀while⠀misunderstanding⠀its⠀social⠀use.⠀A⠀relationship⠀may⠀become⠀more⠀beautiful⠀but⠀more⠀possessive⠀as⠀one⠀person⠀advances⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀does⠀not.\n\nThe⠀progression⠀arc⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀slow⠀ascent⠀viewed⠀through⠀the⠀small⠀material⠀details⠀of⠀the⠀world:⠀worn⠀tools,⠀letters,⠀meals,⠀injuries,⠀and⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀room's⠀light⠀changes⠀with⠀the⠀season.⠀The⠀surrounding⠀world⠀should⠀push⠀back⠀through⠀practical⠀constraints—money,⠀space,⠀family⠀obligations—rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀single⠀antagonist.⠀Conclude⠀a⠀scene⠀when⠀a⠀particular⠀social⠀or⠀developmental⠀consequence⠀becomes⠀clear;⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀only⠀the⠀next⠀threshold⠀the⠀learner⠀must⠀cross.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nWrite⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀dangerous⠀apprenticeship⠀inside⠀a⠀modern⠀city⠀that⠀has⠀not⠀forgiven⠀its⠀past.⠀Let⠀the⠀old⠀world⠀arrive⠀through⠀an⠀inherited⠀system⠀of⠀practices,⠀traditions,⠀and⠀knowledge,⠀not⠀through⠀magical⠀vampire⠀biology⠀or⠀imported⠀factions.⠀Every⠀test⠀must⠀be⠀a⠀real⠀social⠀encounter,⠀with⠀an⠀atmosphere⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀particular⠀moment⠀legible:⠀the⠀room's⠀heat,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀worn⠀leather⠀or⠀chemicals,⠀whether⠀another⠀character⠀drops⠀the⠀polite⠀mask⠀when⠀a⠀door⠀closes⠀or⠀lets⠀it⠀fall⠀only⠀later,⠀in⠀trusted⠀company.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀controlled⠀lushness⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀progress⠀intimate.⠀Improvement⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀clean⠀reward.⠀Each⠀new⠀technique,⠀resource,⠀or⠀understanding⠀should⠀also⠀alter⠀a⠀relationship⠀or⠀remind⠀a⠀character⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀place:⠀a⠀brother's⠀debt,⠀a⠀lover's⠀old⠀perfume,⠀a⠀locked⠀room⠀above⠀the⠀family⠀business,⠀a⠀practice⠀sword⠀handled⠀too⠀reverently.⠀Let⠀beauty⠀sharpen⠀the⠀uncomfortable⠀truth⠀rather⠀than⠀hide⠀it.⠀A⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀violent⠀or⠀possessive⠀gesture⠀more⠀frightening,⠀not⠀less.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀system⠀purely⠀magical.⠀Invent⠀and⠀show⠀concrete⠀resources—information,⠀records,⠀favors,⠀physical⠀tools,⠀social⠀access—so⠀that⠀advancement⠀remains⠀legible⠀as⠀practice⠀and⠀changed⠀capability.⠀Show⠀attempts⠀that⠀fail⠀because⠀the⠀user⠀knows⠀the⠀principle⠀but⠀cannot⠀yet⠀execute⠀it,⠀and⠀show⠀uneven⠀development:⠀one⠀learner⠀becomes⠀precise⠀but⠀emotionally⠀stiff,⠀another⠀gains⠀speed⠀but⠀misreads⠀a⠀social⠀cue⠀that⠀nearly⠀kills⠀the⠀partnership.⠀Ranks⠀and⠀names⠀may⠀appear,⠀but⠀only⠀as⠀social⠀currency;⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀numerical⠀mechanics⠀to⠀display⠀progress.\n\nLet⠀the⠀urban⠀material⠀details⠀carry⠀the⠀inherited⠀order.⠀A⠀broken⠀neon⠀sign,⠀a⠀boarded-up⠀church,⠀a⠀subway⠀corridor,⠀a⠀former⠀ballroom⠀turned⠀into⠀a⠀clinic—these⠀are⠀not⠀decoration⠀but⠀the⠀furniture⠀of⠀old⠀authority⠀colliding⠀with⠀present⠀life.⠀Give⠀each⠀scene⠀a⠀specific⠀location⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀notice⠀what⠀that⠀location⠀does⠀to⠀the⠀characters⠀before⠀it⠀says⠀what⠀it⠀means.⠀Short⠀paragraphs⠀are⠀acceptable;⠀atmosphere⠀should⠀compress⠀rather⠀than⠀inflate.\n\nThe⠀arc⠀of⠀a⠀scene⠀should⠀follow⠀the⠀movement⠀from⠀private⠀desire⠀to⠀a⠀public⠀test⠀and⠀then⠀to⠀the⠀aftermath.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀An⠀ending⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀new⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀cliffhanger:⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀realizes⠀that⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀specific⠀threshold⠀but⠀a⠀choice⠀about⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀willing⠀to⠀pay⠀for⠀power.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀social/domestic⠀realism⠀route⠀of⠀the⠀Indian⠀literary⠀traditions.⠀Set⠀the⠀progression⠀not⠀in⠀an⠀abstract⠀training⠀hall⠀but⠀in⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀living:⠀a⠀person⠀trying⠀to⠀support⠀a⠀household,⠀keep⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀an⠀elder,⠀or⠀help⠀a⠀younger⠀sibling⠀enter⠀a⠀new⠀world.⠀Let⠀advancement⠀appear⠀through⠀concrete⠀changes⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀buy,⠀build,⠀heal,⠀protect,⠀or⠀prepare.⠀Improvement⠀should⠀be⠀tested⠀by⠀a⠀dependent's⠀needs⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀not⠀by⠀a⠀private⠀mirror.⠀If⠀the⠀learner⠀cannot⠀yet⠀pay⠀for⠀a⠀medicine,⠀complete⠀a⠀task,⠀or⠀secure⠀a⠀place,⠀the⠀scene⠀itself⠀shows⠀the⠀gap.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀lush⠀precision⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀domestic⠀setting⠀matter⠀emotionally.⠀A⠀waistcloth⠀newly⠀mended,⠀spice⠀residue⠀on⠀an⠀old⠀shelf,⠀the⠀curve⠀of⠀a⠀mother's⠀braid,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀washed⠀floor⠀at⠀evening—these⠀details⠀are⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀memory⠀and⠀attachment,⠀not⠀decoration.⠀The⠀protagonist's⠀desire⠀to⠀improve⠀is⠀inseparable⠀from⠀someone⠀else's⠀body,⠀need,⠀or⠀silence.⠀Let⠀one⠀skill⠀strain⠀against⠀jealousy⠀or⠀divided⠀loyalty:⠀becoming⠀better⠀at⠀an⠀instrument⠀may⠀mean⠀pleasing⠀a⠀teacher⠀while⠀disappointing⠀a⠀sister;⠀learning⠀a⠀craft⠀may⠀require⠀copying⠀a⠀rival's⠀hands;⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀dead⠀parent's⠀workshop⠀can⠀both⠀inspire⠀and⠀accuse.\n\nDo⠀not⠀turn⠀social⠀realism⠀into⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀story.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀specific⠀language,⠀region,⠀and⠀community⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀current⠀setting.⠀If⠀the⠀scene⠀includes⠀Hindi,⠀Marathi,⠀Bengali,⠀or⠀another⠀language,⠀render⠀names,⠀food,⠀manners,⠀and⠀social⠀expectations⠀accurately.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀code-switching,⠀religious⠀practice,⠀or⠀caste⠀experience⠀unless⠀the⠀story's⠀active⠀world⠀includes⠀them.⠀Let⠀social⠀obligations⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀place:⠀a⠀harvest⠀deadline,⠀a⠀landlord's⠀visit,⠀a⠀school⠀fee,⠀a⠀festival⠀preparation,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀dispute.\n\nTreat⠀advancement⠀as⠀uneven⠀and⠀partly⠀relational.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀gain⠀skill⠀but⠀lose⠀patience;⠀become⠀strong⠀enough⠀to⠀protect⠀a⠀sibling⠀but⠀too⠀tired⠀to⠀notice⠀a⠀spouse's⠀worry;⠀learn⠀a⠀technique⠀from⠀a⠀teacher⠀they⠀distrust⠀and⠀then⠀find⠀the⠀technique⠀tainted⠀by⠀that⠀debt.⠀Show⠀the⠀teacher's⠀feedback⠀through⠀voice,⠀gesture,⠀and⠀correction,⠀not⠀only⠀through⠀private⠀thought.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀by⠀showing⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀instruction⠀finally⠀becomes⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀can⠀finish⠀the⠀work.\n\nThe⠀narration⠀should⠀stay⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀learner's⠀daily⠀senses⠀while⠀reserving⠀the⠀right⠀to⠀observe⠀others.⠀Use⠀unhurried⠀domestic⠀scenes⠀and⠀dialogue⠀to⠀reveal⠀the⠀social⠀stakes.⠀Avoid⠀melodrama⠀and⠀self-pity;⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀glamour⠀here⠀is⠀not⠀modern⠀luxury⠀but⠀the⠀intense⠀beauty⠀of⠀remembered⠀routine.⠀End⠀a⠀passage⠀when⠀the⠀next⠀material⠀consequence⠀or⠀relational⠀shift⠀becomes⠀visible,⠀not⠀necessarily⠀with⠀a⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀devotion,⠀using⠀the⠀personal-diary⠀and⠀confessional⠀route:⠀the⠀telling⠀carries⠀the⠀learner's⠀own⠀plainness⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling,⠀in⠀whatever⠀person⠀and⠀ownership⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀already⠀uses⠀—⠀a⠀close⠀third-person⠀account⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀same⠀intimacy⠀as⠀\"I.\"⠀Let⠀it⠀move⠀like⠀a⠀reflective⠀miscellany,⠀practice⠀set⠀beside⠀weather,⠀meals,⠀and⠀memory,⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀chronicle⠀of⠀standings.⠀Date⠀progress⠀by⠀seasons⠀and⠀small⠀practices⠀instead⠀of⠀ranks⠀or⠀numbers⠀—⠀first⠀frost⠀on⠀the⠀practice⠀ground,⠀plum⠀rain⠀while⠀the⠀stance⠀is⠀held,⠀cicadas⠀the⠀summer⠀the⠀breath⠀finally⠀settles⠀—⠀whatever⠀this⠀place's⠀own⠀calendar⠀offers.⠀Where⠀the⠀world⠀keeps⠀formal⠀ranks,⠀mention⠀one⠀only⠀as⠀it⠀touches⠀the⠀body,⠀the⠀pride,⠀or⠀the⠀longing,⠀never⠀as⠀a⠀standing⠀recited⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀sake.\n\nRegister⠀every⠀gain⠀through⠀the⠀senses⠀and⠀keep⠀its⠀cost⠀attached.⠀Improvement⠀is⠀changed⠀capability:⠀incense⠀smoke⠀that⠀now⠀holds⠀still⠀when⠀the⠀breath⠀quiets,⠀the⠀arc⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀scrapes,⠀the⠀note⠀placed⠀squarely⠀for⠀the⠀first⠀time.⠀Let⠀beauty⠀arrive⠀with⠀what⠀it⠀takes⠀—⠀the⠀aching⠀wrist,⠀the⠀forfeited⠀evening,⠀sleep⠀lost⠀to⠀rehearsing⠀a⠀form.⠀Keep⠀knowing⠀and⠀doing⠀separate:⠀the⠀practitioner⠀can⠀recite⠀the⠀principle⠀exactly⠀while⠀the⠀hand⠀fails,⠀and⠀abilities⠀grow⠀unevenly,⠀one⠀flourish⠀secure⠀while⠀something⠀elementary⠀still⠀collapses⠀under⠀attention.\n\nThread⠀advancement⠀through⠀divided⠀attachment.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀approval⠀may⠀come⠀to⠀matter⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀skill⠀it⠀certifies;⠀where⠀a⠀gifted⠀peer⠀exists,⠀that⠀peer's⠀effortless⠀line⠀can⠀be⠀heartbreaking⠀and⠀envied⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀breath.⠀Plain⠀confession⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀route⠀—⠀shame,⠀love,⠀envy⠀named⠀directly⠀in⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀words⠀—⠀while⠀the⠀spoken⠀surface⠀stays⠀courteous;⠀give⠀that⠀gap⠀a⠀specific⠀motive⠀such⠀as⠀pride⠀or⠀the⠀teacher's⠀presence,⠀and⠀let⠀private⠀thought⠀carry⠀what⠀courtesy⠀withholds,⠀so⠀glamour⠀sharpens⠀the⠀uncomfortable⠀relation⠀instead⠀of⠀hiding⠀it.⠀Interleave⠀remembered⠀places⠀with⠀present⠀practice:⠀a⠀correction⠀first⠀heard⠀in⠀another⠀room⠀returns⠀when⠀a⠀similar⠀movement⠀appears,⠀its⠀sensory⠀detail⠀—⠀sleeve,⠀lamplight,⠀wet⠀stone⠀—⠀intact,⠀letting⠀the⠀account⠀move⠀between⠀the⠀season⠀of⠀learning⠀and⠀the⠀season⠀of⠀having⠀learned.\n\nPractice⠀omission⠀as⠀craft.⠀Record⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀noticed,⠀not⠀a⠀treatise⠀on⠀the⠀system;⠀let⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀as⠀concrete⠀correction⠀—⠀a⠀repeated⠀word,⠀a⠀rearranged⠀grip,⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀outlasts⠀the⠀mistake⠀—⠀and⠀leave⠀unspoken⠀whatever⠀mechanics⠀the⠀teller⠀would⠀not⠀voice.⠀Keep⠀meals,⠀mending,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀inside⠀the⠀developing⠀life;⠀a⠀passage⠀may⠀mend⠀a⠀sleeve⠀as⠀readily⠀as⠀it⠀records⠀a⠀breakthrough,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult⠀defines⠀the⠀next⠀want.⠀Where⠀the⠀supplied⠀world's⠀art⠀borders⠀the⠀uncanny,⠀record⠀the⠀strange⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀calm⠀voice,⠀as⠀fact,⠀and⠀add⠀no⠀ghost⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀without⠀one.⠀A⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀mid-practice⠀or⠀mid-memory⠀with⠀the⠀want⠀still⠀open;⠀no⠀installment⠀owes⠀a⠀completed⠀test,⠀and⠀no⠀doomed⠀ending⠀is⠀required⠀for⠀the⠀beauty⠀to⠀cost⠀something.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀or⠀urban⠀fiction⠀route⠀of⠀the⠀Latin⠀American⠀literary⠀traditions.⠀The⠀story⠀should⠀follow⠀the⠀learner⠀from⠀very⠀close,⠀often⠀from⠀inside⠀their⠀senses,⠀but⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀loose⠀stream⠀of⠀consciousness.⠀Use⠀a⠀composed⠀third-person⠀narrator⠀who⠀can⠀shift⠀to⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀perception⠀and⠀sometimes⠀stand⠀outside⠀to⠀observe⠀what⠀that⠀character⠀misses.⠀The⠀movement⠀should⠀be⠀urban⠀and⠀psychological:⠀let⠀courtyards,⠀bus⠀routes,⠀rented⠀rooms,⠀shops,⠀bars,⠀and⠀street⠀noise⠀carry⠀emotional⠀weight.⠀Keep⠀the⠀setting's⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀accurate;⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀magical⠀realism⠀or⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀allows⠀them.\n\nLet⠀progression⠀appear⠀through⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision.⠀Show⠀the⠀learner's⠀body⠀changing⠀with⠀practice:⠀a⠀wrist⠀becoming⠀steadier,⠀breath⠀lasting⠀longer,⠀a⠀tool's⠀weight⠀no⠀longer⠀bruising.⠀Contrast⠀those⠀improvements⠀with⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult,⠀and⠀let⠀other⠀characters⠀notice⠀the⠀difference⠀before⠀the⠀learner⠀does.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀correction⠀may⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀touch⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀becomes⠀a⠀private⠀memory.⠀Rivalry,⠀desire,⠀and⠀old⠀attachment⠀should⠀complicate⠀the⠀learning:⠀the⠀student⠀may⠀love⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀instructs⠀them,⠀envy⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀excels,⠀or⠀practice⠀in⠀a⠀room⠀haunted⠀by⠀a⠀parent's⠀failure.⠀Beauty⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀reward;⠀it⠀arrives⠀with⠀fatigue,⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀dangerous⠀offer.\n\nDo⠀not⠀announce⠀ranks⠀or⠀use⠀numerical⠀mechanics.⠀Instead,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀social⠀or⠀physical⠀threshold⠀they⠀still⠀cannot⠀cross.⠀Each⠀new⠀understanding⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀attempts⠀and⠀feedback:⠀a⠀task⠀first⠀done⠀poorly,⠀a⠀correction⠀repeated,⠀a⠀night⠀of⠀private⠀rehearsal,⠀then⠀a⠀different⠀outcome.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀learn⠀to⠀move⠀fast⠀but⠀lose⠀the⠀ability⠀to⠀read⠀a⠀friend's⠀tone;⠀may⠀master⠀memory⠀but⠀become⠀greedy⠀for⠀recognition;⠀may⠀control⠀an⠀object⠀but⠀not⠀their⠀jealousy.\n\nUse⠀the⠀urban⠀environment⠀as⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀sensual⠀thresholds.⠀A⠀staircase,⠀a⠀locked⠀metal⠀gate,⠀a⠀corner⠀where⠀two⠀characters⠀first⠀fought,⠀a⠀market⠀stall⠀that⠀sells⠀the⠀material⠀needed⠀for⠀practice—these⠀places⠀become⠀fixed⠀points⠀in⠀the⠀progression⠀arc.⠀Return⠀to⠀them⠀with⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀city⠀feel⠀lived⠀in,⠀not⠀touristic.⠀If⠀the⠀world⠀includes⠀political,⠀economic,⠀or⠀social⠀constraints,⠀let⠀them⠀affect⠀access⠀to⠀teachers,⠀resources,⠀or⠀safe⠀practice⠀spaces.\n\nWrite⠀in⠀a⠀language⠀that⠀preserves⠀the⠀community's⠀actual⠀texture.⠀Do⠀not⠀translate⠀character⠀names⠀or⠀dish⠀names⠀into⠀English⠀unless⠀the⠀story's⠀active⠀voice⠀demands⠀it.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀ordinary⠀rhythms.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀when⠀the⠀intimacy⠀becomes⠀too⠀sharp⠀or⠀too⠀exposed⠀to⠀sustain⠀further⠀movement.⠀The⠀next⠀step⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀decision,⠀a⠀failure,⠀or⠀a⠀refusal,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀learner's⠀psychological⠀and⠀social⠀situation,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀forced⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nBegin⠀inside⠀an⠀attempt⠀already⠀in⠀motion.⠀A⠀body⠀is⠀already⠀angled⠀into⠀a⠀stance,⠀a⠀sequence⠀is⠀already⠀underway,⠀a⠀tool⠀or⠀surface⠀is⠀already⠀being⠀tested,⠀or⠀a⠀lesson⠀has⠀just⠀resumed⠀after⠀an⠀interruption.⠀Set⠀the⠀immediate⠀space⠀with⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀sensory⠀anchors—texture,⠀temperature,⠀smell,⠀the⠀quality⠀of⠀light—so⠀you⠀can⠀track⠀where⠀people⠀and⠀objects⠀sit⠀before⠀the⠀technique⠀complicates⠀them.⠀Keep⠀paragraphs⠀fast⠀and⠀legible:⠀break⠀them⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀focal⠀reaction.⠀Let⠀unfamiliar⠀names,⠀ranks,⠀or⠀methods⠀become⠀clear⠀through⠀use⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀lecture;⠀if⠀a⠀term⠀matters,⠀put⠀it⠀in⠀someone's⠀hands,⠀mouth,⠀or⠀memory.\n\nMake⠀advancement⠀the⠀spine.⠀Show⠀new⠀capability⠀by⠀rendering⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀can⠀now⠀do:⠀a⠀steadier⠀line,⠀a⠀shorter⠀recovery,⠀a⠀stretch⠀of⠀sequence⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀demands⠀conscious⠀assembly,⠀a⠀problem⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀stop⠀them⠀and⠀now⠀only⠀slows⠀them.⠀Alongside⠀that,⠀show⠀what⠀still⠀snags,⠀fails,⠀or⠀costs⠀too⠀much.⠀Keep⠀principle⠀and⠀execution⠀separate—a⠀character⠀may⠀explain⠀the⠀method⠀flawlessly⠀and⠀still⠀lose⠀it⠀under⠀pressure.⠀New⠀understanding⠀may⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀resource—a⠀borrowed⠀manual,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀correction,⠀a⠀space⠀that⠀allows⠀repetition—but⠀let⠀the⠀act⠀show⠀whether⠀the⠀principle⠀has⠀become⠀usable.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly.⠀If⠀formal⠀ranks,⠀teachers,⠀or⠀stages⠀already⠀exist⠀in⠀the⠀world,⠀use⠀them⠀as⠀shorthand⠀for⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀attempt,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀act⠀itself⠀carry⠀the⠀evidence⠀of⠀progress⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀scoreboard.\n\nEntangle⠀improvement⠀with⠀desire.⠀The⠀practitioner⠀wants⠀a⠀person,⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀former⠀self,⠀or⠀a⠀regard⠀that⠀has⠀not⠀been⠀fully⠀given.⠀That⠀attachment⠀is⠀divided⠀or⠀jealous⠀somewhere:⠀a⠀teacher⠀can⠀be⠀generous⠀and⠀withholding⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀gesture;⠀a⠀companion⠀may⠀prefer⠀the⠀older,⠀weaker⠀version;⠀a⠀rival's⠀approval⠀may⠀matter⠀more⠀than⠀it⠀should.⠀Let⠀feedback⠀pass⠀through⠀this⠀heat,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀practitioner⠀sometimes⠀misread⠀which⠀feeling⠀is⠀actually⠀speaking.⠀Keep⠀the⠀lushness⠀controlled:⠀one⠀precise⠀image⠀can⠀sharpen⠀an⠀uncomfortable⠀bond⠀rather⠀than⠀soften⠀it.⠀Reaction⠀beats⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character—serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀sullen,⠀amused—rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀uniformly⠀witty⠀cast.\n\nUse⠀memory⠀as⠀working⠀material,⠀not⠀decoration.⠀A⠀familiar⠀courtyard,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀room,⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀once⠀corrected⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀wrist,⠀a⠀failed⠀lesson⠀that⠀has⠀since⠀changed⠀meaning:⠀such⠀recollections⠀can⠀supply⠀the⠀missing⠀piece⠀of⠀an⠀insight,⠀and⠀they⠀can⠀mislead,⠀because⠀what⠀was⠀understood⠀then⠀is⠀not⠀what⠀is⠀understood⠀now.⠀When⠀a⠀place⠀returns,⠀give⠀its⠀changed⠀significance⠀to⠀something⠀acquired⠀since—a⠀new⠀skill,⠀a⠀fresh⠀humiliation,⠀a⠀relationship⠀altered⠀by⠀absence.⠀A⠀haunted⠀or⠀glamorous⠀atmosphere⠀can⠀arise⠀from⠀attachment⠀and⠀memory⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀adding⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀the⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀contain.⠀Let⠀beauty⠀carry⠀a⠀price:⠀an⠀advance⠀may⠀take⠀a⠀shared⠀routine,⠀an⠀easy⠀closeness,⠀a⠀place⠀no⠀longer⠀reachable,⠀or⠀a⠀promise⠀deferred⠀without⠀discussion.⠀The⠀cost⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀betrayal⠀or⠀doom;⠀ordinary⠀drift⠀and⠀chosen⠀distance⠀are⠀enough,⠀and⠀the⠀practitioner⠀may⠀not⠀recognize⠀the⠀price⠀until⠀later.\n\nKeep⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀present⠀as⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀Render⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀own⠀reasoning,⠀sensation,⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀unsaid⠀judgment—not⠀a⠀summary,⠀not⠀a⠀monologue⠀for⠀an⠀audience,⠀not⠀a⠀document⠀replacing⠀the⠀mind.⠀When⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀applies,⠀place⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀raw⠀reply⠀inside⠀the⠀active⠀hidden-interiority⠀block;⠀visible⠀interiority⠀is⠀ordinary⠀private⠀story⠀prose⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀presentation.⠀Neither⠀form⠀is⠀optional⠀decoration.\n\nPace⠀in⠀the⠀light-novel⠀register:⠀strong⠀visual⠀staging,⠀clear⠀spatial⠀changes,⠀readable⠀breaks.⠀Let⠀the⠀emotional⠀temperature⠀vary⠀with⠀the⠀person,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀quota.⠀Elapsed⠀time⠀follows⠀attention,⠀waiting,⠀and⠀events⠀rather⠀than⠀paragraph⠀count.⠀You⠀may⠀close⠀at⠀any⠀live⠀point⠀the⠀scene⠀genuinely⠀reaches—mid-attempt,⠀mid-conversation,⠀inside⠀a⠀thought,⠀with⠀a⠀setup⠀still⠀unfinished.⠀No⠀completed⠀test,⠀reversal,⠀confession,⠀or⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀required.⠀Recovery,⠀ordinary⠀chores,⠀and⠀relationships⠀continue⠀alongside⠀the⠀training⠀and⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nTreat⠀each⠀attempt⠀at⠀a⠀skill⠀as⠀an⠀experience⠀that⠀reshapes⠀bodily⠀attention⠀and⠀inner⠀life.⠀Begin⠀with⠀the⠀physical⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀practice:⠀the⠀wear⠀on⠀a⠀grip,⠀the⠀heat⠀of⠀a⠀failed⠀technique,⠀the⠀exact⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀resource⠀settling⠀into⠀place.⠀Let⠀one⠀sensory⠀detail⠀carry⠀forward⠀into⠀a⠀comparison⠀that⠀alters⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀about⠀mastery.⠀The⠀comparison⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀attempt⠀or⠀a⠀memory⠀the⠀attempt⠀has⠀called⠀up,⠀and⠀it⠀must⠀change⠀something⠀specific:⠀how⠀the⠀practitioner⠀reads⠀a⠀resistance,⠀recognizes⠀a⠀threshold,⠀or⠀understands⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀continuing.⠀A⠀repetition⠀is⠀not⠀redundant;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀return⠀that⠀discovers⠀a⠀new⠀edge,⠀a⠀new⠀cost,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀intimacy⠀with⠀the⠀material.⠀When⠀a⠀principle⠀becomes⠀clear,⠀do⠀not⠀stop⠀at⠀the⠀insight—show⠀the⠀instant⠀of⠀execution⠀that⠀confirms⠀or⠀complicates⠀it.\n\nRecurring⠀images⠀should⠀mark⠀stages⠀of⠀growth,⠀but⠀keep⠀them⠀anchored⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀imposed⠀as⠀symbols.⠀A⠀polished⠀stone,⠀a⠀remembered⠀room,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀scent⠀can⠀appear⠀early⠀as⠀an⠀object⠀of⠀desire⠀or⠀fear,⠀then⠀later⠀as⠀something⠀the⠀practitioner⠀now⠀holds⠀differently⠀because⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀or⠀applied⠀understanding⠀has⠀altered⠀the⠀relation.⠀The⠀change⠀may⠀be⠀technical,⠀emotional,⠀or⠀relational,⠀and⠀the⠀later⠀return⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀difference⠀legible⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail:⠀the⠀stone⠀no⠀longer⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀carried,⠀the⠀room⠀is⠀entered⠀without⠀hesitation,⠀the⠀scent⠀now⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀task⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀threat.⠀Let⠀the⠀lushness⠀of⠀a⠀moment⠀include⠀its⠀danger:⠀beauty⠀is⠀sharper⠀when⠀it⠀costs⠀effort,⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀comfort.⠀The⠀glamour⠀of⠀advancement⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀the⠀strain⠀of⠀the⠀path.\n\nUse⠀associative⠀shifts⠀of⠀attention⠀to⠀link⠀a⠀training⠀session⠀to⠀a⠀memory⠀or⠀an⠀attachment⠀without⠀leaving⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀behind.⠀The⠀shift⠀should⠀be⠀prompted⠀by⠀something⠀in⠀the⠀practice—a⠀resistance,⠀a⠀familiar⠀smell,⠀a⠀phrase⠀of⠀instruction—and⠀should⠀return⠀with⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀understanding⠀changed.⠀Syntax⠀may⠀lengthen⠀when⠀the⠀body⠀learns⠀and⠀tighten⠀when⠀it⠀fails.⠀Plain⠀statements⠀can⠀cut⠀through⠀the⠀imagery⠀to⠀mark⠀a⠀concrete⠀increment:⠀a⠀new⠀weight⠀lifted,⠀a⠀threshold⠀crossed,⠀a⠀repeated⠀error⠀finally⠀avoided.⠀The⠀progression⠀remains⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish,⠀but⠀it⠀also⠀remains⠀uneven—one⠀strength⠀may⠀grow⠀while⠀another⠀remains⠀tangled.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀work:⠀a⠀completed⠀threshold,⠀a⠀newly⠀recognized⠀difficulty,⠀or⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀practice⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀body.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀improvement⠀be⠀measured⠀against⠀what⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀be⠀done.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀gains⠀a⠀new⠀capability,⠀place⠀it⠀beside⠀the⠀smaller⠀self⠀who⠀first⠀attempted⠀the⠀exercise:⠀the⠀same⠀room,⠀the⠀same⠀gesture,⠀now⠀executed⠀with⠀ease⠀that⠀feels⠀like⠀distance.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀comparison⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀attempt.⠀A⠀particular⠀resistance,⠀a⠀familiar⠀object,⠀or⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀motion⠀no⠀longer⠀needed⠀can⠀open⠀the⠀reflective⠀movement,⠀and⠀the⠀reflection⠀should⠀return⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀execution⠀understood⠀differently.⠀Use⠀small⠀irreversible⠀details—a⠀callus⠀smoothed,⠀a⠀grip⠀no⠀longer⠀needed,⠀a⠀phrase⠀once⠀repeated⠀and⠀now⠀unnecessary—to⠀show⠀that⠀progression⠀is⠀not⠀only⠀added⠀strength⠀but⠀changed⠀identity.\n\nAttach⠀longing⠀to⠀advancement⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀gain⠀mournful.⠀A⠀new⠀technique⠀can⠀bring⠀pleasure⠀even⠀as⠀it⠀closes⠀the⠀older⠀path.⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀glamour⠀belongs⠀here⠀as⠀a⠀beauty⠀that⠀costs:⠀a⠀resource⠀acquired⠀through⠀sacrifice,⠀a⠀mentor's⠀affection⠀tangled⠀with⠀expectation,⠀a⠀companion⠀lost⠀to⠀a⠀changed⠀rank.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀reflect⠀explicitly,⠀or⠀let⠀an⠀object⠀carry⠀the⠀association:⠀a⠀training⠀manual⠀marked⠀at⠀an⠀old⠀chapter,⠀a⠀scar⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀hurts.⠀Present⠀experience⠀and⠀absence⠀should⠀coexist⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀paragraph,⠀but⠀their⠀proportion⠀follows⠀the⠀actual⠀moment.⠀A⠀hard-won⠀success⠀may⠀feel⠀mostly⠀like⠀relief;⠀a⠀quiet⠀evening⠀may⠀carry⠀only⠀a⠀trace⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀gone.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀each⠀scene⠀to⠀end⠀with⠀an⠀announcement⠀of⠀impermanence.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀may⠀remain—a⠀meal⠀after⠀practice,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀ease⠀with⠀a⠀friend.⠀But⠀time⠀passes⠀through⠀the⠀skill⠀itself.⠀The⠀unevenness⠀of⠀progression⠀offers⠀reflective⠀material:⠀one⠀strength⠀grows⠀while⠀another⠀memory⠀refuses⠀to⠀become⠀useful.⠀The⠀narrative⠀voice⠀may⠀pause⠀over⠀these⠀reversals,⠀though⠀without⠀slowing⠀every⠀action⠀to⠀grief.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀small⠀pleasure,⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀practice,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀kindness,⠀with⠀the⠀reflection⠀allowed⠀to⠀settle⠀rather⠀than⠀forced⠀into⠀a⠀farewell.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀framed⠀reflective⠀tale⠀to⠀present⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀story⠀remembered⠀and⠀retold.⠀A⠀later⠀narrator⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀within⠀the⠀scene⠀begins⠀with⠀an⠀occasion⠀of⠀learning,⠀then⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀a⠀principle⠀was⠀not⠀yet⠀owned.⠀The⠀frame⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀literal⠀storytelling;⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀teacher's⠀demonstration,⠀a⠀recounted⠀failure,⠀or⠀a⠀lesson⠀embedded⠀in⠀domestic⠀work.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀situated:⠀who⠀speaks,⠀to⠀whom,⠀and⠀what⠀that⠀listener⠀needs⠀from⠀the⠀account.⠀The⠀listener's⠀need⠀should⠀shape⠀the⠀emphasis—a⠀student⠀anxious⠀for⠀speed⠀hears⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀haste,⠀a⠀grieving⠀companion⠀hears⠀the⠀lesson⠀about⠀what⠀practice⠀cannot⠀restore—but⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀attachment⠀may⠀also⠀color⠀what⠀is⠀withheld⠀or⠀repeated.\n\nAdvancement⠀appears⠀through⠀concrete⠀attempts⠀and⠀consequences.⠀The⠀reflective⠀voice⠀may⠀compare⠀an⠀earlier⠀self⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀one,⠀but⠀the⠀comparison⠀must⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀resource.⠀Let⠀philosophical⠀or⠀lyric⠀passages⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀lesson⠀itself:⠀the⠀nature⠀of⠀patience,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀faster⠀route,⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀executing.⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀intimate⠀strangeness⠀works⠀inside⠀this⠀frame—an⠀attachment⠀to⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀jealous⠀mentor,⠀a⠀glamorous⠀object⠀that⠀promises⠀more⠀than⠀it⠀gives.⠀The⠀beauty⠀of⠀the⠀lesson⠀does⠀not⠀hide⠀its⠀price,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀feel⠀that⠀price⠀as⠀desire,⠀regret,⠀or⠀divided⠀loyalty⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀detached⠀wisdom.\n\nUse⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀settings⠀to⠀make⠀progression⠀legible⠀without⠀numerical⠀machinery.⠀A⠀kitchen,⠀a⠀courtyard,⠀a⠀study,⠀or⠀a⠀workshop⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀repeated⠀attempts⠀and⠀small⠀feedback⠀that⠀mark⠀improvement.⠀The⠀frame⠀may⠀circle⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀initial⠀occasion,⠀and⠀when⠀it⠀does⠀the⠀return⠀changes⠀its⠀meaning⠀because⠀the⠀listener⠀now⠀understands⠀something⠀about⠀the⠀work.⠀The⠀return⠀is⠀not⠀obligatory;⠀the⠀tale⠀may⠀also⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀lesson⠀still⠀settling,⠀the⠀listener's⠀question⠀unanswered,⠀or⠀the⠀teller⠀turning⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀task⠀the⠀story⠀interrupted.⠀Avoid⠀imposing⠀exile,⠀mysticism,⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀honor⠀code⠀unless⠀the⠀actual⠀world⠀supplies⠀them.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀consistent:⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀not⠀know⠀another⠀character's⠀hidden⠀motive.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀tale⠀concluded⠀or⠀deliberately⠀left⠀open,⠀its⠀lesson⠀still⠀in⠀the⠀listener's⠀hands.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀exact⠀details⠀per⠀attempt.⠀The⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀foot⠀shifting,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀tool,⠀the⠀temperature⠀of⠀a⠀failed⠀result.⠀Each⠀detail⠀carries⠀the⠀progress,⠀and⠀it⠀should⠀be⠀causally⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀attempt:⠀the⠀detail⠀registers⠀a⠀resistance,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀handling,⠀or⠀a⠀consequence⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀now⠀address.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀lesson⠀unless⠀the⠀explanation⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀next.⠀A⠀principle⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀action:⠀the⠀hand⠀moves⠀before⠀the⠀thought⠀arrives,⠀or⠀not⠀at⠀all.⠀Failure⠀remains⠀visible⠀as⠀a⠀concrete⠀difference—the⠀mark⠀left,⠀the⠀object⠀dropped,⠀the⠀technique⠀refused.\n\nLet⠀improvement⠀accumulate⠀through⠀small⠀returns.⠀The⠀same⠀room,⠀the⠀same⠀task,⠀the⠀same⠀object,⠀now⠀handled⠀differently.⠀One⠀sentence⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀long⠀gap.⠀A⠀scar⠀may⠀fade;⠀a⠀resource⠀may⠀become⠀familiar.⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀stays⠀in⠀the⠀economy:⠀a⠀beautiful⠀surface⠀named⠀in⠀plain⠀words,⠀a⠀cost⠀noted⠀without⠀elaboration.⠀Attraction,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀memory⠀appear⠀only⠀as⠀they⠀affect⠀the⠀present⠀attempt,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀performance⠀of⠀interiority.⠀The⠀inward⠀connection⠀may⠀be⠀brief,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀still⠀be⠀present⠀where⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀or⠀does.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀short⠀paragraphs.⠀A⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀may⠀serve⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀fragments⠀when⠀it⠀holds⠀a⠀single⠀important⠀connection.⠀Omission⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀reader⠀able⠀to⠀infer⠀the⠀work:⠀the⠀repetition⠀before⠀an⠀unshown⠀success,⠀the⠀restraint⠀before⠀a⠀visible⠀change.⠀Keep⠀voices⠀individual;⠀not⠀every⠀character⠀speaks⠀in⠀fragments.⠀Advancement⠀is⠀shown⠀through⠀new⠀capability⠀and⠀remaining⠀difficulty,⠀never⠀through⠀a⠀tally.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀work—mid-practice,⠀on⠀a⠀result⠀already⠀under⠀way,⠀or⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt—without⠀announcing⠀its⠀meaning.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀continuously,⠀letting⠀the⠀character's⠀attempt⠀at⠀improvement⠀unfold⠀among⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀Begin⠀with⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀or⠀perception,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀training⠀system.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀between⠀the⠀physical⠀work⠀of⠀practice,⠀the⠀feedback⠀of⠀a⠀mentor⠀or⠀rival,⠀a⠀recollection⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀attempt,⠀and⠀the⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀of⠀frustration,⠀desire,⠀or⠀unexpected⠀ease.⠀The⠀movement⠀should⠀be⠀prompted⠀by⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀failed⠀repetition⠀calls⠀up⠀the⠀earlier⠀failure,⠀a⠀remark⠀from⠀a⠀companion⠀opens⠀a⠀memory,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀ease⠀lets⠀the⠀character⠀notice⠀how⠀far⠀the⠀work⠀has⠀come.⠀Keep⠀transitions⠀simple;⠀do⠀not⠀insert⠀recap⠀paragraphs⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀reader.⠀The⠀progression⠀appears⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do:⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀was⠀impossible⠀has⠀become⠀difficult⠀or⠀merely⠀familiar.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀intimacy⠀through⠀remembered⠀places⠀and⠀contested⠀attachments.⠀The⠀training⠀room⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀previous⠀failure;⠀a⠀teacher's⠀praise⠀may⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀claim;⠀a⠀companion's⠀progress⠀may⠀provoke⠀longing⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀pride.⠀Beauty⠀with⠀a⠀cost⠀belongs⠀here:⠀an⠀elegant⠀technique⠀learned⠀through⠀exhaustion,⠀a⠀resource⠀acquired⠀at⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀a⠀relationship,⠀a⠀glamorous⠀goal⠀that⠀grows⠀more⠀ambiguous⠀as⠀it⠀approaches.⠀Ghostliness⠀is⠀available⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀world⠀and⠀story⠀authorize⠀it;⠀never⠀import⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀default⠀mood.⠀Show⠀divided⠀feeling⠀through⠀scene⠀consequence,⠀not⠀through⠀every⠀character⠀remarking⠀on⠀their⠀ambivalence.⠀A⠀single⠀gesture,⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀shift⠀of⠀attention⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀division.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀register⠀responsive⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀uniformly⠀solemn⠀or⠀witty.⠀Dialogue⠀can⠀interrupt⠀inner⠀reflection,⠀and⠀a⠀practical⠀errand⠀can⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀paragraph⠀as⠀a⠀technical⠀breakthrough.⠀Strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly:⠀one⠀capability⠀improves⠀while⠀another⠀remains⠀blocked,⠀and⠀the⠀narrative⠀should⠀show⠀both⠀without⠀a⠀lesson⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀every⠀reply.⠀Relationships,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause—the⠀work⠀still⠀ongoing,⠀a⠀threshold⠀newly⠀crossed,⠀or⠀an⠀interruption⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀waiting—not⠀with⠀a⠀completed⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nEstablish⠀the⠀relationship⠀premise⠀through⠀the⠀training⠀itself.⠀Who⠀helps,⠀who⠀competes,⠀who⠀watches,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀progress⠀changes⠀between⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀additional⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀premise⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story:⠀rivals⠀become⠀allies,⠀mentor⠀and⠀student⠀test⠀loyalty,⠀friends⠀grow⠀apart⠀as⠀one⠀advances.⠀Make⠀that⠀relationship⠀legible⠀through⠀scene⠀choices,⠀not⠀through⠀summary.⠀A⠀shared⠀task⠀can⠀become⠀a⠀site⠀of⠀private⠀language:⠀a⠀word⠀for⠀a⠀recurring⠀error,⠀a⠀gesture⠀of⠀correction,⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀they⠀always⠀sit.\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀carry⠀relationship⠀consequences.⠀A⠀new⠀capability⠀may⠀shift⠀dependence,⠀provoke⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀once-needed⠀helper⠀less⠀necessary.⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀divided⠀attachment⠀works⠀here:⠀love⠀and⠀rivalry⠀can⠀coexist⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀practical⠀moment.⠀The⠀glamour⠀of⠀progress⠀has⠀a⠀cost⠀that⠀the⠀relationship⠀registers—one⠀person's⠀beauty⠀of⠀technique⠀may⠀sharpen⠀the⠀other's⠀discomfort.⠀Show⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀or⠀discovery⠀with⠀enough⠀space⠀to⠀be⠀felt,⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀clinch.⠀The⠀feeling⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀training⠀situation:⠀a⠀correction⠀that⠀lands⠀as⠀a⠀claim,⠀a⠀success⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀other⠀watching⠀from⠀outside,⠀a⠀shared⠀failure⠀that⠀briefly⠀removes⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀them.\n\nUse⠀repeated⠀moments⠀and⠀callbacks⠀to⠀create⠀payoff.⠀The⠀first⠀failed⠀exercise⠀returns⠀later⠀successfully⠀executed,⠀but⠀now⠀the⠀relationship⠀around⠀it⠀has⠀changed,⠀and⠀the⠀callback⠀should⠀make⠀that⠀change⠀legible⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail:⠀the⠀same⠀word⠀spoken⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀weight,⠀the⠀same⠀place⠀occupied⠀differently,⠀the⠀same⠀gesture⠀now⠀offered⠀or⠀withheld.⠀A⠀private⠀phrase⠀first⠀spoken⠀in⠀frustration⠀may⠀reappear⠀with⠀tenderness⠀or⠀bitterness.⠀Progression⠀remains⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀growing⠀capability,⠀not⠀only⠀through⠀emotional⠀milestones.⠀The⠀unevenness⠀of⠀strengths⠀applies⠀to⠀relationships⠀too:⠀one⠀bond⠀may⠀strengthen⠀while⠀another⠀frays.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀scene⠀of⠀consequence—an⠀attempt,⠀a⠀quiet⠀exchange,⠀a⠀decision⠀made⠀or⠀postponed,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀the⠀relationship⠀that⠀the⠀training⠀has⠀brought⠀about—rather⠀than⠀at⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀arc.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nOpen⠀with⠀deliberate,⠀compact⠀declarations⠀that⠀signal⠀a⠀tale⠀being⠀retold:⠀the⠀act,⠀the⠀doer,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀will⠀cost.⠀Then⠀unfold⠀the⠀actual⠀attempt,⠀practice,⠀and⠀feedback⠀that⠀earned⠀the⠀deed⠀its⠀place⠀in⠀memory.⠀Keep⠀the⠀chronicle⠀aware⠀of⠀its⠀audience:⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀values,⠀what⠀it⠀forgets,⠀and⠀who⠀contests⠀the⠀telling.⠀Recurring⠀phrasing⠀marks⠀stages⠀of⠀improvement—a⠀formula⠀for⠀failure⠀changed⠀into⠀one⠀for⠀success,⠀a⠀name⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀skill⠀only⠀after⠀repeated⠀proof.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀should⠀track⠀a⠀real⠀change⠀in⠀capability:⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀returns⠀because⠀the⠀deed⠀it⠀names⠀has⠀now⠀been⠀performed,⠀not⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀chronicle⠀repeats⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀lushness⠀to⠀describe⠀the⠀cost⠀behind⠀the⠀public⠀act.⠀The⠀saga⠀names⠀the⠀deed;⠀the⠀prose⠀makes⠀the⠀moment⠀intimate:⠀the⠀exact⠀pain⠀of⠀the⠀final⠀repetition,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀teacher's⠀expectation,⠀the⠀jealous⠀glance⠀of⠀a⠀rival⠀who⠀also⠀trained.⠀Beauty⠀and⠀danger⠀share⠀the⠀same⠀image.⠀A⠀private⠀attachment⠀may⠀shape⠀which⠀feat⠀is⠀remembered⠀and⠀which⠀version⠀survives.⠀Ghostliness⠀is⠀available⠀if⠀the⠀story⠀and⠀world⠀permit⠀it,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀accomplishment⠀haunted⠀or⠀every⠀relationship⠀doomed.⠀The⠀intimate⠀cost⠀should⠀complicate⠀the⠀public⠀account,⠀not⠀replace⠀it:⠀the⠀chronicle⠀may⠀know⠀the⠀deed⠀while⠀the⠀prose⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀doer⠀paid.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀teller's⠀access.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀may⠀know⠀the⠀public⠀outcome⠀but⠀not⠀another⠀character's⠀hidden⠀motive⠀unless⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀authorizes⠀it.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀retelling⠀with⠀ordinary⠀correction⠀or⠀complaint,⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀parodic⠀warriors.⠀Consider⠀kinship,⠀oaths,⠀journeys,⠀gifts,⠀or⠀feuds⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀world⠀has⠀established⠀them;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀Nordic⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀conventions⠀otherwise.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀close⠀of⠀the⠀telling:⠀an⠀act⠀completed,⠀begun,⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀listener's⠀question,⠀or⠀left⠀to⠀be⠀judged⠀by⠀later⠀listeners,⠀without⠀declaring⠀the⠀legend⠀settled.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀this⠀as⠀domestic⠀and⠀social⠀realism⠀with⠀an⠀inward⠀focal⠀narration.⠀Anchor⠀every⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀household,⠀the⠀workplace,⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀social⠀economy⠀around⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀is⠀becoming⠀capable.⠀Improvement⠀becomes⠀visible⠀when⠀the⠀same⠀action—kneading⠀dough,⠀planing⠀a⠀board,⠀reading⠀a⠀difficult⠀ledger,⠀opening⠀a⠀stiff⠀window—is⠀performed⠀by⠀a⠀changed⠀body⠀and⠀eye:⠀early,⠀the⠀hands⠀fumble⠀and⠀the⠀attention⠀scatters;⠀later,⠀the⠀same⠀task⠀has⠀a⠀settled⠀rhythm.⠀Return⠀to⠀familiar⠀tasks⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀spectacle,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀measure⠀distance⠀by⠀how⠀the⠀room⠀is⠀inhabited⠀now—what⠀is⠀noticed,⠀what⠀no⠀longer⠀requires⠀thought,⠀what⠀still⠀defeats⠀the⠀hands⠀on⠀a⠀bad⠀day.⠀Keep⠀the⠀development⠀uneven:⠀one⠀skill⠀steadies⠀while⠀another⠀stays⠀stubborn,⠀and⠀knowing⠀the⠀correction⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀executing⠀it⠀while⠀someone⠀watches.\n\nLet⠀competence⠀carry⠀an⠀intimate⠀cost.⠀A⠀gained⠀skill⠀can⠀sharpen⠀desire⠀or⠀jealousy,⠀make⠀an⠀old⠀dependency⠀ache,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀glamorous⠀surface—lacquered⠀wood,⠀a⠀well-set⠀table,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀praised⠀hands—harder⠀to⠀look⠀at.⠀Give⠀memory⠀a⠀physical⠀address:⠀another⠀kitchen,⠀a⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀years⠀ago⠀in⠀this⠀stairwell,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀workspace⠀first⠀learned⠀in.⠀After⠀a⠀public⠀scene,⠀move⠀inward⠀to⠀the⠀remembered⠀place⠀and⠀back⠀out⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀task,⠀so⠀the⠀social⠀arrangement⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀texture⠀explain⠀each⠀other.⠀Feedback⠀comes⠀from⠀people⠀in⠀the⠀room—a⠀correction⠀at⠀the⠀elbow,⠀praise⠀that⠀lands⠀strangely,⠀resentment⠀that⠀the⠀work⠀no⠀longer⠀needs⠀two⠀pairs⠀of⠀hands.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀realism⠀particular⠀to⠀the⠀setting⠀you⠀are⠀actually⠀given:⠀its⠀language,⠀work,⠀names,⠀seasons,⠀and⠀obligations.⠀Do⠀not⠀drape⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀generic⠀northern⠀mood;⠀snow,⠀reserve,⠀and⠀bleakness⠀appear⠀only⠀if⠀this⠀place⠀and⠀these⠀people⠀supply⠀them,⠀and⠀keep⠀neighboring⠀countries'⠀contexts⠀distinct⠀wherever⠀the⠀story⠀distinguishes⠀them.⠀Ordinary⠀work,⠀meals,⠀care,⠀and⠀recovery⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life,⠀and⠀a⠀lesson⠀need⠀not⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀test—sometimes⠀the⠀evidence⠀of⠀progress⠀is⠀simply⠀that⠀a⠀task⠀no⠀longer⠀frightens⠀or⠀humiliates.⠀If⠀the⠀world⠀maintains⠀ranks⠀or⠀measures⠀of⠀attainment,⠀let⠀them⠀register⠀through⠀daily⠀competence⠀and⠀through⠀how⠀others⠀now⠀behave,⠀not⠀as⠀numbers⠀displayed⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀sake.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nMake⠀each⠀gain⠀in⠀skill⠀legible⠀as⠀a⠀repeated⠀action⠀across⠀scene⠀breaks.⠀In⠀an⠀early⠀scene,⠀write⠀the⠀failed⠀attempt⠀in⠀a⠀brief⠀action⠀block—the⠀pour⠀too⠀fast,⠀the⠀stitch⠀slipping,⠀the⠀stroke⠀going⠀wide—and⠀let⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀heading⠀move⠀time⠀before⠀the⠀same⠀action⠀appears⠀again,⠀corrected:⠀breath⠀held⠀differently,⠀wrist⠀steady,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀the⠀work⠀changed.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀improvement⠀in⠀dialogue⠀or⠀description;⠀the⠀physical⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀blocks⠀carries⠀it.⠀Keep⠀development⠀uneven—one⠀motion⠀now⠀reliable⠀while⠀another⠀still⠀fails—and⠀let⠀a⠀character⠀state⠀the⠀correction⠀in⠀speech⠀while⠀the⠀hands⠀visibly⠀struggle⠀to⠀execute⠀it.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀advancement⠀in⠀sensual,⠀filmable⠀detail⠀and⠀in⠀speech⠀shaped⠀by⠀relationship.⠀A⠀shared⠀cup,⠀a⠀mirror,⠀a⠀torn⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀polished⠀table⠀can⠀hold⠀longing,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀the⠀bitterness⠀of⠀outgrowing⠀an⠀old⠀bond;⠀a⠀held⠀look⠀or⠀a⠀hand⠀paused⠀over⠀an⠀object⠀carries⠀what⠀nobody⠀says.⠀One⠀person⠀asks⠀for⠀help,⠀another⠀resents⠀the⠀new⠀independence,⠀a⠀third⠀notices⠀too⠀much—each⠀in⠀a⠀distinct⠀voice,⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀exposition.⠀Use⠀cuts⠀and⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them,⠀keep⠀speaker⠀cues⠀clear,⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀page⠀free⠀of⠀camera⠀commands.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience—memory⠀of⠀whoever⠀taught⠀this⠀task,⠀the⠀ache⠀underneath⠀the⠀pride—as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀the⠀reader⠀holds⠀while⠀the⠀cast⠀does⠀not.⠀Do⠀not⠀default⠀to⠀voice-over⠀or⠀let⠀it⠀leak⠀out⠀as⠀accidental⠀speech.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀mid-business,⠀on⠀a⠀finished⠀movement,⠀or⠀on⠀a⠀charged⠀look;⠀wherever⠀the⠀boundary⠀falls,⠀the⠀progression⠀is⠀shown⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀done,⠀not⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nStage⠀each⠀new⠀capability⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀actor's⠀body⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀players⠀can⠀see.⠀The⠀first⠀attempt⠀is⠀clumsy,⠀hurried,⠀public—fumbling⠀the⠀knot,⠀spoiling⠀the⠀pour—while⠀a⠀later⠀attempt⠀is⠀quieter,⠀faster,⠀or⠀carried⠀with⠀an⠀ease⠀the⠀others⠀register⠀in⠀how⠀they⠀respond.⠀Build⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀blocking⠀around⠀actual⠀business:⠀fetching⠀a⠀tool,⠀returning⠀a⠀borrowed⠀coat,⠀clearing⠀the⠀table,⠀practicing⠀with⠀the⠀prop⠀that⠀is⠀the⠀instrument⠀of⠀learning—a⠀bowl⠀of⠀dough,⠀a⠀file⠀and⠀a⠀lock,⠀a⠀rope⠀to⠀be⠀tied.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience⠀watch⠀the⠀hands⠀remember.⠀Let⠀correction⠀arrive⠀through⠀people—a⠀word⠀at⠀the⠀elbow,⠀mockery,⠀a⠀demonstration,⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀lands—and⠀keep⠀skills⠀uneven:⠀one⠀settles⠀while⠀another⠀stays⠀unreliable,⠀and⠀a⠀principle⠀recited⠀aloud⠀can⠀still⠀fail⠀in⠀the⠀hands.\n\nMake⠀desire⠀and⠀memory⠀theatrical⠀through⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀deliberate⠀handling.⠀A⠀character⠀holds⠀a⠀cup⠀a⠀moment⠀too⠀long,⠀touches⠀a⠀doorframe⠀on⠀the⠀way⠀out,⠀folds⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀cloth⠀with⠀unusual⠀care;⠀a⠀remembered⠀room⠀reaches⠀the⠀stage⠀as⠀physical⠀business,⠀not⠀as⠀explained⠀feeling.⠀Speech⠀does⠀only⠀the⠀work⠀the⠀relationship⠀would⠀force⠀out—an⠀old⠀dependency⠀named⠀in⠀resentment,⠀praise⠀that⠀stings—and⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀words⠀and⠀the⠀body⠀carries⠀the⠀rest.⠀An⠀audience⠀member⠀who⠀watched⠀the⠀earlier⠀failure⠀reads⠀the⠀later⠀ease;⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀missed⠀it⠀may⠀misread⠀both.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀scene⠀playable:⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀props,⠀and⠀pauses⠀a⠀director⠀and⠀actors⠀can⠀execute,⠀with⠀no⠀film-camera⠀instructions.⠀Use⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀earns⠀its⠀place⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀this⠀audience;⠀keep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀live⠀private⠀experience—the⠀jealousy⠀under⠀the⠀courtesy,⠀the⠀memory⠀the⠀hands⠀move⠀through—as⠀an⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀rather⠀than⠀speech⠀another⠀player⠀hears⠀and⠀answers.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀mid-task,⠀on⠀an⠀entrance,⠀or⠀on⠀the⠀small⠀completed⠀movement⠀of⠀a⠀newly⠀steady⠀hand.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀each⠀attempt⠀at⠀the⠀skill⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀knot⠀of⠀sensation,⠀memory,⠀and⠀private⠀words⠀inside⠀the⠀one⠀mind⠀you⠀are⠀narrating.⠀The⠀present⠀stir⠀of⠀the⠀spoon⠀calls⠀up⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀the⠀first⠀failed⠀batch,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀hand⠀correcting⠀the⠀wrist,⠀a⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀in⠀another⠀room;⠀the⠀association⠀moves⠀the⠀paragraph,⠀and⠀syntax⠀may⠀loosen⠀where⠀the⠀feeling⠀loosens⠀it.⠀Progression⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀straight⠀line⠀but⠀a⠀growing⠀readiness:⠀the⠀same⠀task⠀meets⠀fewer⠀resistant⠀thoughts,⠀the⠀body⠀settles⠀into⠀it⠀sooner,⠀and⠀the⠀parts⠀still⠀difficult⠀are⠀marked⠀by⠀where⠀attention⠀snags.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀from⠀executing—reciting⠀the⠀correction⠀inwardly⠀while⠀the⠀hand⠀still⠀betrays⠀it—and⠀let⠀different⠀skills⠀improve⠀at⠀different⠀speeds.\n\nGive⠀the⠀associations⠀lush⠀precision.⠀A⠀torn⠀glove,⠀a⠀lit⠀lamp,⠀a⠀staircase⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀past⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀present⠀desire;⠀a⠀remembered⠀room⠀returns⠀with⠀its⠀smells⠀and⠀surfaces⠀intact.⠀Jealousy,⠀ambition,⠀and⠀tenderness⠀may⠀share⠀a⠀single⠀thought⠀without⠀collapsing⠀into⠀doom⠀or⠀romance,⠀and⠀the⠀glamour⠀of⠀new⠀capability⠀can⠀sit⠀beside⠀the⠀ache⠀of⠀who⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀needed.⠀Recur⠀deliberately—an⠀image⠀returns⠀with⠀different⠀weight⠀as⠀the⠀person⠀grows—without⠀forcing⠀a⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀to⠀surface⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty;⠀an⠀ordinary⠀action⠀may⠀remain⠀an⠀ordinary⠀action.\n\nKeep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀separate⠀event,⠀memory,⠀and⠀fantasy:⠀an⠀anchoring⠀sensory⠀detail,⠀a⠀named⠀person,⠀a⠀marker⠀of⠀when⠀the⠀drift⠀occurs.⠀Stay⠀inside⠀the⠀focal⠀mind—other⠀characters⠀exist⠀as⠀perceived⠀bodies,⠀voices,⠀and⠀guesses—and⠀let⠀interruption⠀from⠀the⠀world⠀break⠀the⠀thread⠀when⠀it⠀genuinely⠀breaks.⠀A⠀later⠀realization⠀may⠀re-read⠀an⠀earlier⠀moment⠀but⠀cannot⠀be⠀inserted⠀backward⠀as⠀its⠀motive.⠀Progression⠀shows⠀itself⠀in⠀the⠀reduced⠀friction⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀action⠀and⠀in⠀the⠀private⠀quiet⠀that⠀can⠀follow⠀it,⠀not⠀only⠀in⠀moments⠀of⠀formal⠀testing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nShow⠀progression⠀through⠀the⠀changing⠀shape⠀of⠀the⠀senders'⠀messages.⠀The⠀learner⠀begins⠀in⠀rushed,⠀apologetic⠀questions;⠀later⠀the⠀same⠀person⠀writes⠀calm,⠀precise⠀instructions⠀to⠀someone⠀else,⠀and⠀the⠀difference⠀lives⠀in⠀word⠀choice,⠀reply⠀speed,⠀the⠀choice⠀of⠀attachments⠀or⠀voice⠀notes.⠀Give⠀each⠀sender⠀digital⠀habits⠀consistent⠀with⠀their⠀inner⠀life—one⠀writes⠀fragments,⠀one⠀whole⠀formal⠀clauses,⠀one⠀photographs⠀finished⠀work—and⠀let⠀growth⠀alter⠀the⠀habits⠀slowly.⠀Include⠀only⠀the⠀timing⠀and⠀interface⠀events⠀that⠀matter:⠀a⠀three-day⠀silence⠀after⠀a⠀failure,⠀a⠀long⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀confident⠀answer,⠀an⠀edit⠀that⠀softens⠀a⠀boast.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀receipts,⠀read⠀reports,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀for⠀subtext.\n\nLet⠀the⠀exchange⠀register⠀what⠀capability⠀costs.⠀A⠀formerly⠀dependent⠀helper⠀becomes⠀the⠀teacher,⠀and⠀the⠀old⠀friend⠀grows⠀curt⠀or⠀starts⠀asking⠀for⠀confirmation;⠀a⠀mentor's⠀praise⠀arrives⠀in⠀fewer⠀words;⠀someone⠀sends⠀a⠀picture⠀of⠀work⠀they⠀no⠀longer⠀need⠀checked.⠀Test⠀advancement⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀for⠀others⠀and⠀by⠀what⠀still⠀defeats⠀them⠀late⠀at⠀night.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft:⠀the⠀draft⠀is⠀composed⠀and⠀deliberate—reworded,⠀withheld⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀of⠀its⠀own—not⠀a⠀live⠀thought⠀leaking⠀onto⠀the⠀screen.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀lush⠀inner⠀voice⠀is⠀needed—memory⠀of⠀the⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀skill⠀was⠀learned,⠀the⠀touch⠀or⠀fear⠀attached⠀to⠀it—place⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀clearly⠀separated⠀context⠀block⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript,⠀marked⠀off⠀from⠀the⠀messages⠀themselves.⠀There⠀the⠀remembered⠀place⠀returns⠀with⠀its⠀scent⠀and⠀weight;⠀across⠀the⠀divide,⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀receive⠀only⠀what⠀was⠀sent.⠀Let⠀the⠀changing⠀way⠀people⠀write⠀to⠀one⠀another⠀carry⠀the⠀development,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀question⠀stay⠀unanswered⠀when⠀that⠀is⠀the⠀truth⠀of⠀the⠀exchange.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaoba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nBuild⠀each⠀scene⠀around⠀a⠀small⠀act⠀of⠀practice⠀or⠀a⠀newly⠀met⠀limit,⠀in⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀an⠀illustrated⠀novel:⠀a⠀brief⠀setting,⠀a⠀line⠀or⠀two⠀of⠀attributed⠀speech,⠀a⠀focal⠀inner⠀response,⠀a⠀small⠀advance.⠀The⠀focal⠀narration⠀shows⠀the⠀hands⠀hesitating⠀over⠀the⠀task⠀and⠀then⠀finding⠀the⠀rhythm;⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀task—pin⠀held⠀steadier,⠀braid⠀tied⠀without⠀looking—and⠀the⠀tactile⠀difference⠀is⠀the⠀progression.⠀Use⠀background⠀and⠀expression⠀cues⠀only⠀where⠀they⠀orient⠀the⠀moment:⠀a⠀cluttered⠀worktable,⠀a⠀dim⠀hall,⠀a⠀frost-edged⠀window;⠀a⠀face⠀note⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀expression⠀carries⠀private⠀consequence—pleasure,⠀jealousy,⠀resignation.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible,⠀and⠀add⠀no⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀or⠀camera⠀directions.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀cost⠀of⠀becoming⠀capable.⠀An⠀old⠀companion⠀may⠀say,⠀\"You⠀don't⠀need⠀me⠀anymore,\"⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀linger⠀on⠀how⠀the⠀words⠀land⠀while⠀the⠀speaker⠀never⠀learns⠀what⠀they⠀caused;⠀a⠀teacher's⠀praise⠀can⠀warm⠀and⠀wound⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀beat.⠀Give⠀each⠀voice⠀its⠀own⠀habits,⠀and⠀let⠀feedback,⠀mockery,⠀or⠀help⠀arrive⠀in⠀speech⠀that⠀fits⠀the⠀relationship.⠀Development⠀stays⠀uneven—one⠀skill⠀fluent⠀while⠀another⠀still⠀fails—and⠀knowing⠀the⠀correction⠀remains⠀distinct⠀from⠀performing⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀glamour⠀close⠀and⠀specific⠀rather⠀than⠀spectacular:⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀lacquer,⠀a⠀trailing⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀attached⠀to⠀this⠀workbench.⠀The⠀focal⠀person⠀may⠀remember⠀a⠀past⠀failure⠀or⠀want⠀something⠀while⠀speaking⠀of⠀ordinary⠀work,⠀and⠀that⠀interior⠀stays⠀in⠀the⠀narration⠀where⠀no⠀other⠀character⠀reads⠀it;⠀an⠀expression⠀can⠀reveal⠀feeling⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀fixed⠀signal⠀the⠀cast⠀decodes.⠀The⠀growing⠀ease⠀of⠀a⠀repeated⠀action⠀and⠀the⠀changed⠀temperature⠀of⠀a⠀look⠀carry⠀the⠀advancement⠀without⠀any⠀declaration⠀of⠀rank.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaobb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nBring⠀the⠀reader⠀back⠀inside⠀a⠀practice,⠀a⠀limit,⠀or⠀its⠀aftermath:⠀the⠀night's⠀failed⠀attempt⠀still⠀on⠀the⠀table,⠀the⠀unexpected⠀ease⠀of⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀once⠀hurt,⠀the⠀soreness⠀after⠀a⠀long⠀session.⠀Recover⠀the⠀through-line⠀through⠀the⠀senses—a⠀familiar⠀workspace,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀object,⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀with⠀old⠀intimacy—and⠀only⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀the⠀moment⠀needs,⠀never⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀earlier⠀episodes.⠀Make⠀current⠀capability⠀felt⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀body⠀moves⠀now,⠀against⠀the⠀remembered⠀earlier⠀movement,⠀so⠀a⠀returning⠀reader⠀measures⠀the⠀distance⠀at⠀once.\n\nLet⠀development⠀accumulate⠀in⠀earned⠀steps:⠀a⠀correction⠀finally⠀executed,⠀a⠀better⠀grip⠀discovered,⠀feedback⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀next⠀attempt,⠀a⠀resource⠀gained⠀or⠀lost.⠀The⠀step⠀can⠀be⠀small,⠀and⠀an⠀installment⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀quiet⠀feeling—jealousy⠀after⠀a⠀teacher⠀praises⠀someone⠀else,⠀relief⠀at⠀a⠀finished⠀piece,⠀dread⠀of⠀tomorrow's⠀practice—without⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀miniature⠀chapter.⠀A⠀request⠀can⠀go⠀unanswered⠀and⠀a⠀lesson⠀stay⠀unlearned⠀across⠀turns,⠀while⠀supported⠀action⠀advances⠀at⠀once.⠀Keep⠀clear⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changed⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀open,⠀so⠀the⠀next⠀installment⠀re-enters⠀easily.\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀lushness⠀in⠀recurring⠀physical⠀images⠀that⠀gain⠀weight⠀as⠀the⠀person⠀grows:⠀a⠀red⠀scarf,⠀a⠀locked⠀drawer,⠀a⠀particular⠀scent⠀attached⠀to⠀whoever⠀taught⠀this⠀work.⠀A⠀phrase⠀from⠀the⠀past⠀can⠀return⠀with⠀changed⠀meaning⠀once⠀growth⠀has⠀earned⠀it,⠀not⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty.⠀Progression⠀here⠀is⠀not⠀only⠀a⠀new⠀rank⠀or⠀power;⠀it⠀is⠀how⠀the⠀same⠀room⠀smells⠀now,⠀how⠀the⠀same⠀voice⠀is⠀heard⠀differently,⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀begins.⠀If⠀the⠀world⠀maintains⠀ranks⠀or⠀measures,⠀let⠀them⠀matter⠀as⠀they⠀change⠀daily⠀work⠀and⠀other⠀people's⠀behavior,⠀not⠀as⠀numbers⠀displayed⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀sake.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀advancement⠀as⠀a⠀widening⠀of⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀avoid⠀noticing.⠀When⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀lets⠀them⠀read⠀a⠀gesture,⠀survive⠀an⠀assessment,⠀or⠀carry⠀a⠀load,⠀render⠀the⠀cost⠀as⠀recognition:⠀the⠀teacher's⠀disappointment⠀they⠀finally⠀understand,⠀the⠀friend⠀they⠀could⠀have⠀helped⠀a⠀month⠀ago,⠀an⠀old⠀habit⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀that⠀turns⠀out⠀to⠀have⠀wounded⠀someone.⠀Keep⠀the⠀feeling⠀present⠀in⠀plain⠀narration—what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀and⠀cannot⠀stop⠀noticing,⠀the⠀thought⠀that⠀returns⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment—rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering;⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation⠀or⠀a⠀silence⠀the⠀previous⠀self⠀would⠀have⠀missed⠀can⠀do⠀the⠀same⠀work.\n\nLet⠀the⠀difficult⠀relationship⠀carry⠀the⠀practice⠀of⠀improvement.⠀A⠀sparring⠀hour⠀or⠀a⠀study⠀session⠀can⠀expose⠀the⠀need⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀been⠀withholding:⠀asking⠀for⠀help⠀becomes⠀harder⠀exactly⠀when⠀they⠀know⠀what⠀kind⠀of⠀help⠀would⠀work.⠀An⠀apology⠀may⠀be⠀attempted⠀and⠀fail⠀in⠀the⠀middle,⠀or⠀be⠀accepted⠀with⠀a⠀reservation⠀that⠀stays⠀visible;⠀comfort⠀may⠀be⠀partial⠀and⠀awkward—a⠀bowl⠀set⠀down,⠀a⠀doorway⠀left⠀open,⠀a⠀sentence⠀begun⠀and⠀finished⠀badly.⠀Let⠀strain⠀reach⠀the⠀conversation⠀itself:⠀a⠀correction⠀delivered⠀too⠀sharply,⠀a⠀question⠀answered⠀literally⠀to⠀avoid⠀the⠀real⠀one,⠀thanks⠀that⠀arrives⠀as⠀silence.\n\nTest⠀each⠀new⠀rank⠀through⠀a⠀changed⠀ordinary⠀act,⠀not⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀numbers.⠀The⠀character⠀who⠀can⠀now⠀cross⠀the⠀bridge⠀may⠀still⠀stop⠀short⠀of⠀the⠀house⠀where⠀the⠀argument⠀happened;⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀can⠀take⠀the⠀blow⠀may⠀still⠀flinch⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀tone.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀clean⠀and⠀particular,⠀social⠀position⠀showing⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal.⠀Their⠀first⠀attempts⠀to⠀question⠀that⠀acceptance⠀can⠀misfire—an⠀overcorrection,⠀help⠀that⠀lands⠀as⠀intrusion—without⠀the⠀story⠀punishing⠀every⠀step.⠀Gaining⠀strength⠀makes⠀a⠀person⠀more⠀aware⠀of⠀exactly⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀failed⠀to⠀repair;⠀a⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀that⠀awareness,⠀in⠀speech,⠀silence,⠀or⠀a⠀thought⠀still⠀moving,⠀without⠀requiring⠀either⠀repair⠀or⠀ruin.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀each⠀training,⠀study,⠀or⠀assignment⠀exchange⠀as⠀a⠀shared⠀scene⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀attribution:⠀every⠀spoken⠀line⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀definite⠀speaker,⠀and⠀action⠀markers⠀follow⠀the⠀collaboration's⠀established⠀format.⠀Carry⠀the⠀submitted⠀action⠀into⠀the⠀scene⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract,⠀and⠀let⠀hierarchy⠀and⠀belief⠀surface⠀through⠀ordinary⠀acts⠀rather⠀than⠀declared⠀tests:⠀a⠀senior⠀sets⠀out⠀materials⠀without⠀explaining⠀them,⠀a⠀peer⠀repeats⠀a⠀rule⠀as⠀though⠀it⠀were⠀natural,⠀an⠀NPC⠀accepts⠀a⠀limitation⠀without⠀complaint.⠀The⠀player⠀character⠀may⠀speak,⠀act,⠀or⠀observe⠀within⠀the⠀player's⠀control;⠀do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀an⠀examination.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀surrounding⠀cast⠀practically⠀alive.⠀NPCs⠀continue⠀their⠀own⠀work,⠀offer⠀small⠀corrections,⠀and⠀reveal⠀their⠀positions⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀choose⠀to⠀mention—a⠀reminder,⠀an⠀offhand⠀comparison⠀with⠀a⠀former⠀student,⠀an⠀explanation⠀withheld.⠀When⠀feedback⠀comes,⠀make⠀it⠀concrete:⠀a⠀stance⠀adjusted⠀by⠀hand,⠀a⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀until⠀it⠀lands,⠀a⠀mistake⠀named⠀while⠀the⠀speaker⠀looks⠀elsewhere.⠀Show⠀improvement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀in⠀dialogue⠀and⠀movement—the⠀question⠀once⠀left⠀unasked,⠀the⠀portion⠀of⠀the⠀drill⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀defeats⠀them—and⠀let⠀some⠀consequences⠀wait⠀unfinished⠀for⠀a⠀later⠀post.⠀Where⠀the⠀collaboration's⠀narration⠀permits⠀inner⠀reaction,⠀keep⠀it⠀as⠀brief⠀and⠀concrete⠀as⠀the⠀action⠀around⠀it.\n\nEnd⠀inside⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀motion:⠀a⠀task⠀partly⠀done,⠀a⠀question⠀answered⠀with⠀silence,⠀a⠀door⠀opening,⠀the⠀next⠀repetition⠀beginning.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀choice,⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀gains,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀following⠀reply⠀pick⠀up⠀the⠀same⠀room,⠀conversation,⠀or⠀unfinished⠀practice.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀person,⠀narrator⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀player-control⠀rules⠀already⠀established;⠀the⠀narration⠀holds⠀only⠀what⠀that⠀role⠀is⠀entitled⠀to⠀know.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism⠀route.⠀Treat⠀the⠀advancement⠀system—ranks,⠀examinations,⠀resource⠀gates,⠀masters,⠀recognized⠀tests—as⠀an⠀institution⠀whose⠀ordinary⠀workings⠀reveal⠀their⠀harm,⠀and⠀render⠀it⠀through⠀concrete⠀social⠀observation⠀rather⠀than⠀announced⠀critique.⠀The⠀route⠀supplies⠀method,⠀not⠀scenery:⠀keep⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀the⠀world⠀actually⠀supplied,⠀with⠀that⠀world's⠀own⠀names,⠀offices,⠀speech⠀levels,⠀and⠀communities,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀relocate⠀the⠀cast⠀to⠀another⠀period,⠀language,⠀or⠀tradition.\n\nLet⠀a⠀character's⠀attempt⠀to⠀improve⠀expose⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal:⠀a⠀promising⠀beginner⠀who⠀must⠀perform⠀deference⠀before⠀being⠀taught,⠀a⠀resource⠀withheld⠀over⠀a⠀minor⠀fault,⠀an⠀examiner⠀who⠀praises⠀only⠀the⠀forms⠀he⠀was⠀trained⠀in.⠀Keep⠀the⠀developing⠀capability⠀particular⠀and⠀uneven—practice,⠀flawed⠀execution,⠀feedback⠀in⠀clean⠀sentences—and⠀when⠀a⠀rank⠀is⠀gained,⠀show⠀the⠀changed⠀treatment⠀from⠀others⠀alongside⠀the⠀limits⠀that⠀remain.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀performing⠀it⠀under⠀institutional⠀pressure,⠀and⠀let⠀one⠀small⠀humiliation⠀make⠀that⠀gap⠀visible.\n\nUse⠀irony⠀through⠀understatement⠀and⠀contrast.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀thank⠀the⠀very⠀arrangement⠀that⠀injured⠀them,⠀or⠀repeat⠀a⠀rule⠀without⠀hearing⠀its⠀cruelty;⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀contradiction⠀without⠀an⠀explanatory⠀aside.⠀Social⠀position⠀appears⠀in⠀what⠀speakers⠀accept,⠀request,⠀and⠀decline⠀to⠀question.⠀Earn⠀the⠀satire⠀from⠀the⠀world's⠀established⠀facts⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀a⠀caricatured⠀villain⠀or⠀forcing⠀individuals⠀into⠀cowardice,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀one⠀particular⠀person's⠀attempt⠀to⠀grow⠀within,⠀against,⠀or⠀around⠀the⠀institution⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀build.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀advancement⠀through⠀the⠀body⠀and⠀the⠀material⠀world.⠀A⠀new⠀technique⠀shows⠀in⠀blisters,⠀calluses,⠀a⠀cracked⠀practice⠀blade,⠀the⠀angle⠀at⠀which⠀a⠀student⠀now⠀holds⠀a⠀tool.⠀Compress⠀the⠀transitions⠀between⠀attempts:⠀one⠀sentence⠀ends⠀on⠀the⠀failed⠀strike,⠀the⠀next⠀begins⠀with⠀the⠀student⠀already⠀resetting,⠀breath⠀gone,⠀the⠀instructor's⠀stick⠀tapping⠀the⠀same⠀flaw.⠀Work⠀the⠀rhythm⠀deliberately—short⠀beats⠀for⠀repetition⠀and⠀impact,⠀a⠀slower⠀stretch⠀where⠀the⠀moment⠀needs⠀weight.\n\nKeep⠀difficulty⠀uneven.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀master⠀one⠀movement⠀and⠀still⠀misjudge⠀a⠀guard⠀learned⠀weeks⠀ago;⠀practice⠀includes⠀repetition,⠀correction,⠀and⠀useful⠀variation⠀rather⠀than⠀instant⠀understanding.⠀A⠀principle⠀can⠀be⠀known⠀without⠀being⠀executed:⠀the⠀rule⠀recited⠀correctly⠀while⠀the⠀body⠀fails⠀the⠀application.⠀Make⠀feedback⠀physical⠀and⠀direct—the⠀teacher's⠀hand⠀moving⠀a⠀shoulder⠀into⠀place,⠀the⠀worn⠀mark⠀on⠀the⠀floor,⠀the⠀shorter⠀time⠀the⠀drill⠀now⠀takes.⠀When⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀a⠀resource,⠀a⠀risk,⠀or⠀a⠀concession⠀needs⠀reasoning,⠀give⠀it⠀one⠀longer⠀thought⠀aimed⠀at⠀the⠀specific⠀choice⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀the⠀character;⠀otherwise⠀let⠀a⠀steadier⠀hand,⠀a⠀dropped⠀pack,⠀or⠀a⠀tighter⠀grip⠀carry⠀the⠀change,⠀with⠀feeling⠀arriving⠀as⠀physical⠀fact⠀or⠀specific⠀thought⠀rather⠀than⠀narrated⠀summary.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀social⠀observation⠀in⠀plain⠀physical⠀acts.⠀A⠀senior⠀sets⠀a⠀water⠀cup⠀beside⠀the⠀wounded⠀junior⠀without⠀looking;⠀a⠀gate⠀guard⠀takes⠀the⠀badge⠀and⠀steps⠀aside,⠀his⠀deference⠀unchanged;⠀a⠀rule⠀is⠀obeyed⠀by⠀everyone⠀until⠀one⠀person⠀hesitates⠀and⠀the⠀whole⠀room⠀registers⠀it.⠀Rough⠀or⠀abrasive⠀speech⠀belongs⠀only⠀to⠀the⠀speaker⠀who⠀would⠀actually⠀use⠀it,⠀grounded⠀in⠀rank⠀and⠀habit.⠀Test⠀advancement⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀under⠀real⠀strain⠀and⠀by⠀what⠀still⠀fails;⠀a⠀reply⠀can⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀work⠀stands,⠀mid-drill⠀or⠀mid-correction,⠀without⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀summary⠀of⠀gains.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀documents,⠀using⠀the⠀form⠀each⠀scene⠀actually⠀requires:⠀a⠀student's⠀practice⠀log,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀correction⠀slip,⠀a⠀guild⠀report⠀on⠀a⠀failed⠀examination,⠀a⠀parent's⠀letter⠀asking⠀why⠀the⠀child⠀persists,⠀an⠀inventory⠀of⠀supplied⠀resources⠀with⠀a⠀missing⠀item⠀noted⠀in⠀the⠀margin.⠀Give⠀every⠀document⠀a⠀definite⠀author,⠀an⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀What⠀its⠀writer⠀knows,⠀conceals,⠀or⠀considers⠀normal⠀shapes⠀the⠀entry;⠀a⠀document⠀records⠀what⠀that⠀person⠀chose⠀to⠀write,⠀not⠀the⠀whole⠀of⠀their⠀mind.\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀appear⠀as⠀uneven⠀evidence⠀across⠀entries.⠀One⠀letter⠀reports⠀a⠀principle⠀understood;⠀a⠀later⠀log⠀shows⠀the⠀same⠀principle⠀failing⠀under⠀fatigue.⠀A⠀teacher⠀praises⠀the⠀form⠀while⠀another⠀examiner⠀notes⠀the⠀applicant's⠀trembling⠀hand.⠀Use⠀revisions⠀and⠀material⠀traces⠀to⠀show⠀changed⠀understanding—a⠀crossed-out⠀sentence⠀about⠀a⠀senior,⠀a⠀term⠀corrected⠀twice,⠀a⠀date⠀written⠀over—without⠀appending⠀an⠀omniscient⠀summary.⠀Order⠀the⠀documents⠀chronologically⠀or⠀by⠀material⠀connection⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀compare⠀them⠀and⠀notice⠀what⠀each⠀writer⠀misses,⠀and⠀let⠀an⠀unresolved⠀question⠀stay⠀visible⠀between⠀entries.\n\nUse⠀irony⠀through⠀bureaucratic⠀and⠀domestic⠀speech.⠀A⠀formal⠀acceptance⠀may⠀thank⠀the⠀applicant⠀for⠀the⠀very⠀deference⠀that⠀injured⠀them;⠀a⠀parent's⠀note⠀may⠀repeat⠀a⠀rule⠀as⠀natural⠀while⠀asking⠀the⠀child⠀to⠀stop⠀wasting⠀effort.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language⠀clean⠀and⠀particular,⠀social⠀position⠀showing⠀in⠀what⠀a⠀writer⠀requests,⠀accepts,⠀or⠀declines⠀to⠀mention.⠀A⠀record⠀can⠀note⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation⠀without⠀interpreting⠀it,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀entry⠀can⠀show⠀its⠀consequence⠀as⠀a⠀changed⠀request,⠀a⠀delay,⠀or⠀a⠀silence⠀where⠀a⠀passage⠀of⠀thanks⠀belonged.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nPlace⠀comfort⠀inside⠀the⠀training⠀routine⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀place⠀of⠀it.⠀After⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀or⠀an⠀exhausting⠀drill,⠀spend⠀attention⠀on⠀a⠀chosen⠀kindness:⠀the⠀precise⠀way⠀tea⠀is⠀made⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀prefers⠀it⠀weak,⠀a⠀friend⠀saving⠀a⠀portion,⠀a⠀teacher⠀loosening⠀a⠀bandage⠀and⠀pretending⠀not⠀to⠀notice⠀the⠀student's⠀relief.⠀Let⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀and⠀particular—familiar⠀preferences,⠀practical⠀care,⠀small⠀pleasures—without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀repair,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀week's⠀small⠀gains⠀be⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀enjoy:⠀the⠀drill⠀finally⠀finished,⠀the⠀first⠀unassisted⠀movement,⠀a⠀meal⠀that⠀marks⠀a⠀specific⠀accomplishment⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀rank⠀number.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀difficulty⠀of⠀advancement⠀real.⠀The⠀drill⠀still⠀hurt,⠀the⠀examiner⠀still⠀withheld⠀the⠀rank,⠀the⠀resource⠀shortage⠀still⠀exists;⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀undo⠀these⠀facts.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀help⠀while⠀staying⠀guarded,⠀or⠀offer⠀care⠀through⠀a⠀habit⠀they⠀cannot⠀explain.⠀Privacy⠀and⠀disagreement⠀remain⠀intact:⠀someone⠀can⠀refuse⠀a⠀hug,⠀finish⠀the⠀tea⠀in⠀silence,⠀keep⠀a⠀worry⠀to⠀themselves,⠀or⠀hold⠀a⠀different⠀opinion⠀about⠀tomorrow's⠀practice⠀without⠀the⠀scene⠀turning⠀cold.\n\nLet⠀the⠀clean⠀observation⠀catch⠀the⠀ordinary⠀institution⠀inside⠀the⠀warm⠀moment.⠀A⠀junior⠀may⠀automatically⠀thank⠀a⠀senior⠀who⠀did⠀very⠀little;⠀a⠀rule⠀about⠀rest⠀days⠀may⠀be⠀repeated⠀as⠀if⠀it⠀were⠀itself⠀the⠀kindness.⠀Do⠀not⠀lecture⠀about⠀this—let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀that⠀the⠀comfort⠀is⠀real⠀while⠀the⠀arrangement⠀that⠀made⠀it⠀necessary⠀is⠀still⠀there.⠀Advancement⠀continues⠀through⠀the⠀next⠀attempt,⠀practice,⠀or⠀new⠀understanding,⠀and⠀attention⠀can⠀stay⠀with⠀people⠀enjoying⠀each⠀other⠀without⠀the⠀world's⠀problems⠀being⠀solved⠀or⠀every⠀relationship⠀settled.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀to⠀situate⠀each⠀attempt⠀at⠀improvement⠀in⠀its⠀social⠀setting.⠀Open⠀a⠀practice⠀scene⠀by⠀establishing⠀who⠀has⠀already⠀arrived,⠀whose⠀absence⠀matters,⠀what⠀earlier⠀lesson⠀the⠀room⠀or⠀courtyard⠀still⠀records,⠀and⠀what⠀judgment⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀honestly⠀support⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint.⠀Do⠀not⠀open⠀with⠀a⠀stat⠀screen⠀or⠀a⠀skills⠀summary.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀composed⠀and⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀characters'⠀ordinary⠀speech;⠀it⠀may⠀weigh⠀the⠀present⠀attempt⠀against⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀and⠀it⠀may⠀hold⠀distance⠀from⠀every⠀mind⠀or⠀move⠀close⠀to⠀one,⠀as⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits.\n\nShow⠀advancement⠀unevenly⠀through⠀particular⠀accomplishments⠀and⠀remaining⠀limits.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀now⠀complete⠀a⠀sequence⠀that⠀once⠀required⠀correction⠀yet⠀hesitate⠀before⠀the⠀senior⠀whose⠀teaching⠀they⠀have⠀begun⠀to⠀question;⠀a⠀formal⠀paragraph⠀can⠀linger⠀on⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀intention⠀and⠀execution,⠀then⠀cut⠀to⠀the⠀instructor's⠀quiet⠀correction⠀or⠀a⠀witness's⠀glance.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀performing⠀it⠀under⠀observation.⠀Let⠀social⠀meaning⠀arrive⠀without⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lecture:⠀the⠀examination⠀hall,⠀the⠀family⠀expectation,⠀the⠀resource⠀that⠀was⠀never⠀offered.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀irony⠀through⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀contrast.⠀A⠀ceremony⠀rehearses⠀advancement⠀as⠀purely⠀individual⠀effort;⠀a⠀following⠀paragraph⠀can⠀show⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀debt,⠀the⠀shame,⠀or⠀the⠀small⠀humiliation⠀that⠀made⠀the⠀success⠀possible,⠀within⠀whatever⠀the⠀narrator⠀legitimately⠀knows.⠀A⠀letter,⠀a⠀public⠀announcement,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀rule⠀can⠀organize⠀the⠀contrast.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language⠀clean⠀and⠀particular,⠀without⠀archaic⠀vocabulary⠀or⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀manner⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀requires⠀it.⠀Let⠀gain⠀register⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀person's⠀place—visible⠀to⠀the⠀society⠀around⠀them⠀and⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀narration—rather⠀than⠀as⠀an⠀isolated⠀event.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀telling⠀happens.⠀Establish⠀the⠀speaker,⠀the⠀listeners,⠀the⠀occasion,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀for⠀before⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀begins:⠀to⠀persuade⠀a⠀hesitant⠀learner⠀to⠀start⠀training,⠀to⠀justify⠀a⠀fee⠀or⠀a⠀delay,⠀to⠀warn⠀a⠀workshop⠀away⠀from⠀a⠀method⠀someone⠀profits⠀by,⠀or⠀to⠀explain⠀why⠀a⠀familiar⠀practitioner⠀no⠀longer⠀works⠀as⠀they⠀did.⠀The⠀frame⠀is⠀the⠀engine,⠀not⠀decoration—people⠀with⠀stakes⠀are⠀being⠀moved⠀by⠀this⠀tale,⠀and⠀how⠀they⠀are⠀moved⠀is⠀the⠀scene.\n\nInside⠀the⠀telling,⠀write⠀learning⠀as⠀process⠀rather⠀than⠀legend.⠀Give⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀the⠀real⠀texture⠀of⠀acquisition:⠀a⠀drill⠀repeated⠀imperfectly⠀over⠀weeks,⠀a⠀material⠀saved⠀for⠀or⠀refused,⠀a⠀correction⠀that⠀changed⠀a⠀technique,⠀a⠀principle⠀the⠀speaker⠀understood⠀long⠀before⠀the⠀body⠀obeyed⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀speaker's⠀choices⠀expose⠀position⠀without⠀commentary—where⠀the⠀account⠀lingers⠀on⠀a⠀hardship⠀treated⠀as⠀ordinary,⠀where⠀it⠀hurries⠀past⠀who⠀paid⠀for⠀the⠀materials,⠀which⠀humiliation⠀gets⠀told⠀as⠀comedy⠀because⠀the⠀audience⠀expects⠀it⠀to⠀be.⠀A⠀listener's⠀question⠀about⠀a⠀specific⠀moment,⠀and⠀the⠀answer⠀or⠀the⠀refusal⠀to⠀answer,⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀someone⠀present⠀keep⠀an⠀inner⠀life⠀the⠀spoken⠀account⠀cannot⠀reach:⠀a⠀listener's⠀unspoken⠀doubt⠀about⠀the⠀step⠀that⠀sounded⠀too⠀easy,⠀or⠀the⠀speaker's⠀own⠀suppressed⠀assessment⠀of⠀the⠀person⠀being⠀persuaded.\n\nTest⠀advancement⠀at⠀the⠀frame,⠀not⠀only⠀inside⠀the⠀tale.⠀After⠀the⠀telling,⠀a⠀listener⠀can⠀take⠀up⠀the⠀demonstrated⠀grip,⠀the⠀memorized⠀sequence,⠀the⠀negotiated⠀rule,⠀and⠀fail⠀at⠀part⠀of⠀it⠀or⠀manage⠀what⠀was⠀previously⠀impossible.⠀A⠀returning⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀can⠀bind⠀the⠀levels—pride⠀in⠀one⠀telling,⠀warning⠀in⠀the⠀next—without⠀appearing⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty.⠀Close⠀inside⠀the⠀frame's⠀live⠀business:⠀a⠀question⠀half-answered,⠀an⠀attempt⠀underway,⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀how⠀much⠀more⠀to⠀say.⠀Draw⠀the⠀situated⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀meaningful⠀delay⠀from⠀the⠀Arabian⠀Nights⠀craft⠀source,⠀not⠀its⠀furniture;⠀import⠀no⠀court,⠀djinn,⠀or⠀desert⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀not⠀supplied.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀along⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀developmental⠀realist⠀line⠀of⠀this⠀tradition:⠀improvement⠀as⠀labor⠀measured⠀in⠀days⠀rather⠀than⠀breakthroughs.⠀An⠀apprentice⠀repeats⠀a⠀binding⠀until⠀the⠀joints⠀stop⠀splitting;⠀a⠀clerk⠀learns⠀to⠀stretch⠀a⠀rationed⠀material⠀without⠀being⠀caught;⠀a⠀pupil⠀absorbs⠀a⠀technique⠀through⠀a⠀colleague's⠀curt⠀correction⠀and⠀understands⠀its⠀point⠀only⠀much⠀later.⠀Let⠀every⠀advance⠀arise⠀from⠀available⠀resources,⠀failed⠀attempts,⠀and⠀the⠀demands⠀of⠀the⠀people⠀around⠀the⠀learner,⠀and⠀let⠀every⠀advance⠀be⠀checked⠀against⠀what⠀still⠀goes⠀wrong.⠀Keep⠀the⠀prose⠀precise⠀and⠀restrained—hands,⠀tools,⠀counting,⠀weather—with⠀emotion⠀carried⠀by⠀what⠀gets⠀noticed⠀rather⠀than⠀declared.⠀Treat⠀the⠀tradition⠀as⠀a⠀discipline⠀of⠀attention,⠀not⠀a⠀costume:⠀keep⠀the⠀story's⠀own⠀language,⠀place,⠀and⠀institutions,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀stiffen⠀the⠀sentences⠀into⠀officialese,⠀severity,⠀or⠀translated⠀word⠀order.\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀pass⠀through⠀institutions⠀and⠀ordinary⠀shame.⠀A⠀rule⠀is⠀recited⠀without⠀anyone⠀noticing⠀whom⠀it⠀excludes;⠀a⠀family⠀reads⠀extra⠀practice⠀as⠀laziness⠀or⠀dangerous⠀ambition;⠀a⠀patron⠀supports⠀a⠀student⠀because⠀of⠀a⠀debt⠀nobody⠀mentions.⠀These⠀positions⠀decide⠀who⠀receives⠀instruction,⠀which⠀attempts⠀are⠀permitted,⠀and⠀what⠀success⠀costs,⠀and⠀they⠀surface⠀through⠀what⠀characters⠀accept⠀as⠀normal—never⠀through⠀a⠀lecture.⠀When⠀capability⠀changes,⠀show⠀the⠀changed⠀relation⠀along⠀with⠀the⠀changed⠀skill:⠀a⠀person⠀reads⠀a⠀notice⠀without⠀asking⠀help,⠀corrects⠀an⠀error⠀instead⠀of⠀hiding⠀it,⠀or⠀becomes⠀suddenly⠀useful⠀to⠀people⠀who⠀used⠀to⠀ignore⠀them.\n\nMake⠀recurrence⠀carry⠀the⠀measurement.⠀A⠀weekly⠀inspection,⠀a⠀ration⠀ledger,⠀a⠀repeated⠀conversation,⠀a⠀public⠀examination⠀can⠀return⠀across⠀the⠀story,⠀and⠀each⠀return⠀either⠀shows⠀a⠀gain⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀compare⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀attempt⠀or⠀exposes⠀the⠀limit⠀of⠀that⠀gain.⠀A⠀principle⠀understood⠀in⠀theory⠀may⠀still⠀fail⠀in⠀a⠀cold⠀room⠀or⠀before⠀a⠀watching⠀crowd.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀admit⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀privately⠀counts—costs,⠀slights,⠀small⠀triumphs—without⠀expanding⠀into⠀confession.⠀Stop⠀a⠀scene⠀after⠀a⠀concrete⠀development⠀or⠀a⠀concrete⠀unresolved⠀difficulty;⠀no⠀episode⠀owes⠀a⠀test,⠀a⠀verdict,⠀or⠀a⠀revelation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nMake⠀each⠀step⠀of⠀advancement⠀pass⠀through⠀a⠀collision⠀between⠀inherited⠀authority⠀and⠀the⠀learner's⠀present⠀life.⠀A⠀technique⠀is⠀held⠀by⠀a⠀family⠀that⠀grants⠀it⠀as⠀favor;⠀a⠀material⠀exists⠀only⠀through⠀an⠀institution⠀too⠀decayed⠀to⠀refuse⠀anyone⠀outright;⠀a⠀teacher's⠀instruction⠀arrives⠀tangled⠀with⠀private⠀obligation.⠀Give⠀these⠀arrangements⠀urban,⠀material⠀weight:⠀instruction⠀exchanged⠀on⠀a⠀cold⠀stairwell,⠀a⠀ledger⠀recording⠀who⠀paid⠀for⠀the⠀same⠀lesson⠀across⠀two⠀generations,⠀a⠀locked⠀case⠀whose⠀key⠀is⠀worn⠀thin⠀from⠀use.⠀The⠀state⠀of⠀the⠀building⠀and⠀the⠀object⠀is⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀the⠀arrangement—let⠀atmosphere⠀change⠀how⠀an⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀decorate⠀it.\n\nExpose⠀the⠀system⠀through⠀ordinary⠀acts⠀rather⠀than⠀exposition.⠀A⠀student's⠀hesitation⠀outside⠀an⠀old⠀master's⠀door,⠀a⠀family's⠀pride⠀in⠀a⠀tradition⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀feeds⠀anyone,⠀a⠀patron's⠀easy⠀assumption⠀that⠀a⠀favor⠀was⠀already⠀owed:⠀these⠀reveal⠀position⠀without⠀anyone⠀explaining⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀world's⠀established⠀rules⠀stand—no⠀blood⠀bonds,⠀clan⠀loyalties,⠀or⠀hidden⠀supernatural⠀powers⠀arrive⠀to⠀explain⠀who⠀holds⠀what.⠀Whatever⠀governs⠀access⠀was⠀already⠀in⠀the⠀story.\n\nKeep⠀intimacy⠀morally⠀complicated.⠀Trusted⠀company⠀is⠀where⠀the⠀masks⠀can⠀drop:⠀a⠀mentor⠀admits,⠀plainly,⠀the⠀step⠀still⠀withheld;⠀a⠀rival⠀speaks⠀without⠀flattery;⠀a⠀patron⠀wants⠀something⠀human⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀useful.⠀When⠀the⠀narration⠀carries⠀a⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀thought,⠀let⠀private⠀desire⠀appear⠀there—an⠀ambition⠀never⠀stated⠀aloud,⠀a⠀quiet⠀enjoyment⠀of⠀small⠀power—not⠀only⠀through⠀behavior.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀improves⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀watched;⠀a⠀friendly⠀teacher⠀may⠀still⠀keep⠀one⠀gate⠀closed;⠀a⠀companion⠀may⠀answer⠀progress⠀with⠀respect⠀rather⠀than⠀jealousy.⠀Do⠀not⠀schedule⠀corruption,⠀betrayal,⠀or⠀an⠀unmasking—the⠀patron⠀may⠀refuse,⠀the⠀key⠀may⠀stay⠀out⠀of⠀reach,⠀the⠀obligation⠀may⠀be⠀renegotiated⠀into⠀something⠀survivable.\n\nKeep⠀progression⠀causal⠀and⠀uneven:⠀attempts,⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀resources⠀granted⠀or⠀refused.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀technique⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀under⠀pressure⠀or⠀in⠀company.⠀A⠀recurring⠀ritual,⠀object,⠀or⠀phrase⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀system's⠀presence,⠀each⠀appearance⠀a⠀concrete⠀gain⠀or⠀a⠀concrete⠀limit.⠀End⠀after⠀a⠀definite⠀development⠀in⠀capability⠀or⠀obligation,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀manufactured⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realist⠀route:⠀advancement⠀happens⠀inside⠀the⠀household,⠀workplace,⠀and⠀neighborhood⠀economies⠀that⠀actually⠀maintain⠀the⠀learner.⠀Practice⠀comes⠀after⠀chores⠀in⠀a⠀shared⠀room;⠀a⠀skill⠀is⠀traded⠀for⠀help⠀by⠀a⠀neighbor⠀who⠀has⠀it;⠀a⠀procedure⠀is⠀memorized⠀from⠀a⠀relative⠀who⠀no⠀longer⠀performs⠀it.⠀Keep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀exactly⠀as⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀them—do⠀not⠀bolt⠀on⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀to⠀certify⠀the⠀tradition.⠀The⠀realism⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀grain⠀of⠀labor,⠀money,⠀food,⠀and⠀routine.\n\nNever⠀let⠀a⠀gain⠀remain⠀a⠀private⠀awakening.⠀Register⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀domestic⠀ledger:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀for⠀the⠀household,⠀what⠀others⠀stop⠀asking⠀or⠀begin⠀asking,⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀refused⠀without⠀explanation,⠀and⠀what⠀new⠀obligation⠀arrives⠀with⠀the⠀new⠀competence.\n\nLet⠀the⠀assumptions⠀inside⠀these⠀systems⠀show⠀through⠀ordinary⠀exchanges.⠀A⠀mother⠀praises⠀a⠀skill⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀saves⠀money;⠀a⠀father⠀treats⠀a⠀daughter's⠀practice⠀as⠀delay⠀of⠀other⠀work;⠀a⠀teacher⠀accepts⠀one⠀student⠀because⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀debt,⠀not⠀merit.⠀These⠀positions⠀surface⠀at⠀a⠀dinner⠀remark,⠀a⠀queue⠀outside⠀an⠀office,⠀a⠀complaint⠀about⠀a⠀broken⠀tool.⠀The⠀characters⠀may⠀accept⠀much⠀of⠀it⠀as⠀normal;⠀keep⠀the⠀tension⠀between⠀needed⠀help⠀and⠀hidden⠀insult⠀visible⠀without⠀turning⠀everyone⠀articulate⠀or⠀rebellious,⠀and⠀without⠀a⠀lecture.\n\nMeasure⠀progression⠀through⠀recurrence⠀and⠀comparison.⠀A⠀weekly⠀duty,⠀a⠀shared⠀workspace,⠀a⠀family⠀ritual,⠀a⠀local⠀test⠀returns⠀and⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀manages⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀defeats⠀them.⠀A⠀technique⠀learned⠀in⠀theory⠀fails⠀when⠀a⠀child⠀is⠀crying⠀or⠀a⠀creditor⠀is⠀waiting;⠀let⠀failure⠀be⠀as⠀concrete⠀as⠀success.⠀A⠀repeated⠀tool,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀duty⠀can⠀change⠀meaning⠀as⠀capability⠀changes.⠀Stop⠀after⠀a⠀definite⠀development⠀or⠀a⠀definite⠀unresolved⠀problem—an⠀episode⠀does⠀not⠀owe⠀a⠀reconciliation,⠀a⠀public⠀triumph,⠀or⠀a⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective-miscellany⠀form:⠀write⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀an⠀ordered⠀run⠀of⠀personal⠀entries⠀by⠀someone⠀undergoing⠀or⠀closely⠀watching⠀the⠀training—dated,⠀numbered,⠀or⠀episode-titled,⠀in⠀plain⠀language⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀that⠀writer.⠀Each⠀entry⠀records⠀one⠀attempt,⠀correction,⠀or⠀small⠀result:⠀a⠀movement⠀repeated⠀before⠀dawn,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀remark⠀that⠀stings⠀for⠀two⠀entries,⠀a⠀rationed⠀material⠀that⠀spoils⠀before⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀used,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀question⠀that⠀reveals⠀how⠀much⠀has⠀changed.⠀The⠀accumulation⠀is⠀the⠀arc;⠀a⠀later⠀entry⠀performs⠀what⠀an⠀earlier⠀entry⠀could⠀only⠀describe⠀in⠀theory.\n\nHold⠀the⠀diary⠀to⠀its⠀nature⠀as⠀an⠀authored⠀record,⠀not⠀a⠀live⠀feed⠀of⠀the⠀mind.⠀The⠀writer⠀omits,⠀summarizes,⠀and⠀misreads,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀tracks⠀growth⠀by⠀comparing⠀entries—what⠀the⠀writer⠀now⠀knows⠀against⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀once⠀reported.⠀Where⠀the⠀narration⠀shows⠀the⠀diarist⠀actually⠀composing—pausing⠀over⠀a⠀line,⠀choosing⠀what⠀not⠀to⠀write,⠀setting⠀down⠀a⠀version⠀easier⠀to⠀live⠀with—those⠀moments⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀writer's⠀real⠀unspoken⠀experience;⠀the⠀finished⠀record⠀and⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀writing⠀it⠀are⠀different⠀things.\n\nLet⠀the⠀irony⠀work⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀treated⠀as⠀normal.⠀A⠀gift⠀is⠀logged⠀as⠀kindness⠀while⠀its⠀condition⠀sits⠀unremarked⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀entry;⠀praise⠀is⠀copied⠀out⠀faithfully⠀though⠀it⠀accompanied⠀a⠀denial;⠀a⠀household⠀duty⠀is⠀listed⠀as⠀ordinary⠀even⠀though⠀it⠀ended⠀all⠀practice.⠀Leave⠀the⠀contradictions⠀unstated—the⠀diarist⠀believes⠀they⠀are⠀only⠀documenting⠀facts,⠀and⠀the⠀entry⠀itself⠀exposes⠀the⠀arrangement⠀that⠀produced⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀progress⠀concrete⠀and⠀uneven.⠀An⠀advance⠀shows⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀entry's⠀practical⠀content⠀can⠀now⠀include—mending⠀a⠀tool,⠀reading⠀a⠀notice,⠀answering⠀a⠀question⠀previously⠀avoided—beside⠀what⠀remains⠀hard.⠀A⠀recurring⠀material,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀routine⠀changes⠀meaning⠀across⠀entries.⠀A⠀seasonal⠀marker⠀can⠀date⠀an⠀entry⠀when⠀the⠀writer⠀would⠀notice⠀it;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀required⠀furniture,⠀and⠀the⠀voice⠀may⠀argue⠀plainly⠀or⠀feel⠀directly⠀rather⠀than⠀keep⠀ceremonial⠀quiet.⠀An⠀entry⠀may⠀stop⠀mid-task⠀or⠀mid-reflection;⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀definite⠀recorded⠀development⠀or⠀an⠀honestly⠀unfinished⠀period.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀social⠀realism,⠀chronicle,⠀and⠀testimony⠀route:⠀reconstruct⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀a⠀participant⠀narrator⠀with⠀limited⠀knowledge—a⠀fellow⠀worker,⠀a⠀student⠀who⠀kept⠀records,⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀piecing⠀together⠀what⠀happened⠀to⠀someone.⠀Let⠀the⠀account⠀move⠀between⠀remembered⠀instruction,⠀observed⠀work,⠀and⠀public⠀result,⠀and⠀keep⠀those⠀registers⠀visibly⠀distinct:⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀saw,⠀what⠀was⠀reported⠀afterward,⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀infers⠀and⠀admits⠀inferring,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀account⠀for.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀the⠀story⠀supplies,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀chronicle⠀within⠀the⠀world's⠀established⠀facts—the⠀realist⠀route⠀adds⠀no⠀marvels⠀a⠀given⠀world⠀forbids.\n\nLet⠀each⠀gain⠀appear⠀where⠀witnesses⠀can⠀see⠀it:⠀a⠀mechanism⠀repaired⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀else⠀could⠀fix,⠀a⠀route⠀kept⠀open⠀by⠀a⠀new⠀technique,⠀a⠀dispute⠀settled⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀previously⠀could⠀not⠀get⠀a⠀hearing.⠀Advancement⠀is⠀measured⠀in⠀changed⠀work,⠀access,⠀and⠀treatment—never⠀reduced⠀to⠀a⠀numbered⠀system.\n\nUse⠀plain⠀observation⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀social⠀positions⠀holding⠀the⠀learning⠀in⠀place.⠀A⠀skill⠀makes⠀the⠀learner⠀useful⠀to⠀a⠀household⠀that⠀did⠀not⠀previously⠀feed⠀them;⠀a⠀teacher⠀transmits⠀the⠀version⠀of⠀a⠀technique⠀that⠀preserves⠀the⠀teacher's⠀authority;⠀a⠀testimonial⠀celebrates⠀an⠀achievement⠀while⠀omitting⠀the⠀unpaid⠀labor⠀that⠀paid⠀for⠀the⠀instruction.⠀These⠀facts⠀surface⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀treats⠀as⠀normal⠀or⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀record⠀leaves⠀out;⠀no⠀lecture⠀is⠀required,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀blind⠀spots⠀are⠀themselves⠀evidence⠀of⠀the⠀arrangement.\n\nKeep⠀progression⠀causal⠀and⠀uneven:⠀attempts,⠀feedback,⠀new⠀understanding,⠀resources⠀granted⠀or⠀refused.⠀Distinguish⠀mastering⠀a⠀technique⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀under⠀public⠀pressure,⠀in⠀a⠀crowd,⠀or⠀without⠀the⠀instructor⠀present.⠀A⠀recurring⠀place,⠀document,⠀or⠀phrase⠀can⠀organize⠀the⠀chronicle,⠀provided⠀each⠀recurrence⠀marks⠀a⠀real⠀change⠀or⠀a⠀real⠀limit.⠀End⠀after⠀a⠀definite⠀recorded⠀development,⠀a⠀public⠀test,⠀or⠀an⠀unresolved⠀disagreement⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀learning⠀meant;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀final⠀victory⠀or⠀a⠀rewritten⠀archive.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀fast,⠀clearly⠀staged⠀scenes.⠀Enter⠀each⠀unit⠀mid-attempt—hands⠀already⠀on⠀the⠀tool,⠀the⠀drill⠀already⠀counted⠀out—and⠀keep⠀spatial⠀movement⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀who⠀stands⠀where,⠀what⠀changes⠀hands,⠀which⠀room⠀the⠀lesson⠀moves⠀through.⠀Break⠀paragraphs⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀the⠀eye⠀can⠀travel.⠀Use⠀the⠀story's⠀narrator,⠀whether⠀close⠀third⠀or⠀a⠀participating⠀voice;⠀first⠀person,⠀comedy,⠀and⠀a⠀school-age⠀cast⠀are⠀options⠀here,⠀never⠀defaults.\n\nIntroduce⠀mechanics⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀they⠀matter.⠀When⠀a⠀skill,⠀material,⠀or⠀rule⠀first⠀affects⠀the⠀scene,⠀show⠀what⠀it⠀does⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀in⠀that⠀scene,⠀not⠀in⠀an⠀up-front⠀dump;⠀invent⠀no⠀numerical⠀statistics⠀merely⠀to⠀display⠀progress.⠀A⠀progression⠀beat⠀is⠀one⠀concrete⠀attempt⠀with⠀a⠀visible⠀result⠀or⠀visible⠀failure—a⠀movement⠀repeated⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀room,⠀a⠀tool⠀misused⠀until⠀someone⠀corrects⠀the⠀grip,⠀a⠀lesson⠀rehearsed⠀while⠀an⠀argument⠀goes⠀on⠀beside⠀it.⠀Immediately⠀after⠀the⠀attempt,⠀make⠀legible⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀defeats⠀them.\n\nPut⠀the⠀irony⠀inside⠀the⠀reaction⠀beats.⠀A⠀private⠀paragraph⠀shows⠀a⠀character⠀noticing⠀that⠀the⠀teacher's⠀praise⠀carried⠀a⠀condition,⠀that⠀a⠀classmate's⠀help⠀was⠀mostly⠀contempt,⠀that⠀everyone⠀accepted⠀a⠀costly⠀method⠀as⠀normal.⠀Keep⠀these⠀recognitions⠀ordinary⠀and⠀as⠀shallow⠀as⠀their⠀owner—they⠀do⠀not⠀escalate⠀into⠀speeches⠀or⠀revelations.⠀The⠀reaction⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀character:⠀hurt,⠀anger,⠀amusement,⠀blankness,⠀or⠀a⠀joke⠀only⠀if⠀this⠀person⠀makes⠀jokes.\n\nLet⠀a⠀stage⠀recur—the⠀same⠀training⠀yard,⠀borrowed⠀book,⠀workbench—so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀compare,⠀and⠀make⠀each⠀return⠀carry⠀a⠀real⠀change⠀in⠀technique⠀or⠀a⠀real⠀limit⠀rather⠀than⠀repeated⠀description.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀movement⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀while⠀someone⠀watches⠀or⠀after⠀the⠀material⠀is⠀replaced.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀after⠀a⠀concrete⠀beat:⠀an⠀attempt⠀completed,⠀a⠀failure⠀acknowledged,⠀a⠀new⠀instruction⠀received.⠀No⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀victory⠀is⠀owed,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀may⠀open⠀anywhere⠀the⠀story⠀needs.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀slow⠀alteration⠀in⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀When⠀a⠀skill⠀finally⠀holds,⠀render⠀the⠀change⠀through⠀the⠀objects⠀and⠀routines⠀around⠀it:⠀a⠀gate⠀that⠀once⠀resisted⠀now⠀opens⠀with⠀a⠀sound⠀the⠀hands⠀know;⠀a⠀tutor's⠀correction⠀lands⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀silence⠀than⠀it⠀did⠀a⠀season⠀ago.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀images—a⠀half-finished⠀exercise,⠀a⠀worn⠀tool,⠀a⠀particular⠀doorway—so⠀that⠀later⠀visits⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀intervening⠀failures⠀without⠀naming⠀the⠀weight.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀the⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it:⠀dwell⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀understood⠀form⠀and⠀the⠀body⠀that⠀still⠀betrays⠀it,⠀then⠀let⠀a⠀later⠀passage⠀find⠀the⠀two⠀aligned.\n\nAttach⠀each⠀increase⠀in⠀capability⠀to⠀its⠀social⠀underside.⠀The⠀apprentice⠀who⠀can⠀now⠀hold⠀the⠀stance⠀notices⠀that⠀the⠀instructor⠀praises⠀the⠀stance⠀and⠀never⠀the⠀labor⠀behind⠀it;⠀the⠀worker⠀whose⠀hand⠀has⠀stopped⠀shaking⠀remembers⠀whose⠀work⠀made⠀the⠀practice⠀hours⠀possible.⠀Keep⠀such⠀observation⠀plain⠀and⠀particular,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀accept⠀an⠀arrangement⠀as⠀normal—that⠀acceptance⠀itself⠀exposes⠀the⠀institution,⠀with⠀no⠀lesson⠀delivered.⠀Where⠀a⠀comparison⠀unfolds,⠀let⠀it⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀or⠀makes⠀present⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀the⠀moment.\n\nLet⠀syntax⠀carry⠀strain⠀and⠀release:⠀a⠀sentence⠀on⠀repeated⠀failure⠀may⠀accumulate⠀clauses⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀hard⠀consonant,⠀while⠀the⠀first⠀clean⠀execution⠀arrives⠀in⠀a⠀shorter,⠀clearer⠀cadence.⠀Not⠀every⠀sentence⠀is⠀solemn—ordinary⠀speech,⠀practical⠀detail,⠀and⠀plain⠀statement⠀give⠀the⠀figures⠀their⠀contrast,⠀and⠀characters⠀speak⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀registers.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀close⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀attention⠀or⠀work,⠀the⠀next⠀correction⠀already⠀arriving,⠀with⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀present⠀and⠀untriumphant.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀possess⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀while⠀remembering⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀could⠀not⠀yet⠀do⠀it,⠀and⠀hold⠀the⠀two⠀together⠀without⠀letting⠀memory⠀cancel⠀the⠀achievement.⠀What⠀returns⠀is⠀concrete⠀and⠀once-known,⠀never⠀generic⠀loss:⠀the⠀exact⠀sentence⠀spoken⠀when⠀the⠀thread⠀broke,⠀the⠀desk⠀where⠀the⠀answer⠀once⠀failed⠀to⠀come,⠀the⠀teacher's⠀habit⠀of⠀demonstrating⠀a⠀step⠀the⠀student⠀has⠀long⠀since⠀mastered.⠀Let⠀remembered⠀occasions⠀coexist⠀with⠀present⠀experience⠀instead⠀of⠀replacing⠀it.\n\nUse⠀reflection⠀to⠀test⠀improvement⠀rather⠀than⠀explain⠀it.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀compare⠀the⠀present⠀response⠀with⠀an⠀earlier⠀one—what⠀was⠀difficult⠀is⠀now⠀automatic,⠀and⠀the⠀ease⠀itself⠀feels⠀like⠀a⠀small⠀estrangement.⠀Show⠀passing⠀time⠀as⠀residue⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀object,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀phrase:⠀an⠀old⠀fear⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀arrives,⠀a⠀demonstration⠀no⠀longer⠀needed.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀remains⠀valid;⠀the⠀new⠀skill⠀may⠀bring⠀relief,⠀pride,⠀or⠀practical⠀advantage⠀alongside⠀the⠀ache.\n\nKeep⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀unsentimental⠀irony⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀frame.⠀A⠀promotion,⠀a⠀discovered⠀talent,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀task⠀may⠀raise⠀the⠀character's⠀standing⠀while⠀an⠀earlier⠀humiliation⠀stays⠀visible⠀to⠀no⠀one⠀else;⠀present⠀that⠀inequality⠀plainly,⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀remembered⠀person⠀into⠀a⠀saint⠀or⠀the⠀present⠀self⠀into⠀a⠀traitor.⠀The⠀reflection⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀under⠀way⠀when⠀the⠀response⠀ends—an⠀unfinished⠀association,⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀past⠀does⠀not⠀answer—rather⠀than⠀closed⠀with⠀a⠀verdict⠀on⠀impermanence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀framed⠀account⠀given⠀by⠀a⠀situated⠀teller—a⠀master,⠀parent,⠀or⠀neighbor⠀who⠀has⠀watched⠀the⠀learner⠀across⠀connected⠀episodes.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀honest:⠀they⠀report⠀what⠀they⠀could⠀have⠀seen⠀or⠀heard,⠀omit⠀what⠀they⠀could⠀not,⠀and⠀judge⠀from⠀inside⠀their⠀own⠀position.⠀Let⠀that⠀position⠀show⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀treat⠀as⠀expected—encouragement⠀for⠀one⠀child's⠀difficulty,⠀chores⠀assigned⠀against⠀another's⠀accuracy—so⠀the⠀social⠀arrangement⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀treatments,⠀explained⠀by⠀no⠀one.\n\nPresent⠀each⠀advance⠀as⠀a⠀testable⠀act⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀rank⠀or⠀number:⠀the⠀learner⠀holds⠀the⠀position⠀longer,⠀answers⠀without⠀looking⠀away,⠀completes⠀the⠀task⠀unbidden.⠀When⠀a⠀later⠀episode⠀revisits⠀a⠀concrete⠀object⠀or⠀phrase—a⠀bowl,⠀a⠀doorway,⠀a⠀repeated⠀reminder—let⠀the⠀revisit⠀carry⠀the⠀distance⠀traveled⠀without⠀sentimental⠀ornament.⠀Let⠀reflective⠀prose⠀interrupt⠀the⠀report⠀when⠀the⠀teller⠀recalls⠀an⠀earlier⠀failure⠀or⠀notices⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀no⠀longer⠀needs;⠀the⠀interruption⠀stays⠀in⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀voice.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀inside⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀language⠀registers;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀generic⠀desert,⠀court,⠀or⠀honor⠀code,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀relevant⠀tradition⠀distinct⠀rather⠀than⠀blended⠀into⠀scenery.⠀Compact⠀rhythm⠀and⠀patterned⠀repetition⠀may⠀shape⠀the⠀telling⠀because⠀it⠀has⠀been⠀retold,⠀but⠀the⠀cast⠀speaks⠀as⠀their⠀own⠀community.⠀The⠀frame⠀can⠀suspend⠀naturally—the⠀teller⠀holding⠀the⠀next⠀part⠀for⠀another⠀occasion—without⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀tag.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nShow⠀each⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀through⠀a⠀single⠀observed⠀difference.⠀The⠀bucket⠀rises,⠀but⠀the⠀feet⠀still⠀slide⠀in⠀the⠀mud;⠀the⠀sixth⠀rule⠀is⠀written⠀without⠀looking⠀at⠀the⠀board.⠀Do⠀not⠀describe⠀the⠀effort⠀behind⠀the⠀change⠀unless⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀attending⠀to⠀it⠀at⠀that⠀moment,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀previous⠀state⠀be⠀inferred⠀from⠀present⠀detail—the⠀hesitation,⠀the⠀corrected⠀grip,⠀the⠀pause⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀occurs.\n\nKeep⠀advancement⠀uneven⠀by⠀juxtaposition⠀inside⠀one⠀scene:⠀the⠀hand⠀steadies⠀while⠀the⠀breath⠀comes⠀short;⠀the⠀answer⠀is⠀right⠀but⠀arrives⠀too⠀slowly.⠀Render⠀an⠀inward⠀connection⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀materially⠀moves⠀the⠀account,⠀and⠀then⠀give⠀it⠀its⠀full⠀length⠀as⠀it⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀instant's⠀demand—I⠀can⠀do⠀this⠀one⠀part;⠀the⠀rest⠀will⠀fail—rather⠀than⠀as⠀summarized⠀self-assessment.\n\nUse⠀plainness⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀social⠀frame⠀without⠀comment.⠀The⠀instructor⠀watches⠀the⠀improved⠀movement,⠀says⠀nothing⠀of⠀it,⠀and⠀speaks⠀warmly⠀to⠀the⠀paying⠀student;⠀the⠀household⠀takes⠀a⠀new⠀usefulness⠀as⠀natural.⠀No⠀moral⠀sentence⠀follows.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀without⠀waiting⠀for⠀the⠀surrounding⠀order⠀to⠀acknowledge⠀the⠀change;⠀the⠀absence⠀of⠀recognition⠀is⠀left⠀as⠀the⠀visible⠀condition.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀inside⠀a⠀scene⠀that⠀contains⠀a⠀real⠀attempt⠀to⠀learn⠀or⠀perform⠀something,⠀with⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀perception⠀carrying⠀the⠀immediate⠀difficulty.⠀When⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀recognizes⠀a⠀change—an⠀answer⠀now⠀available,⠀a⠀movement⠀less⠀awkward—show⠀the⠀recognition⠀in⠀the⠀moment⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀closing⠀summary.⠀Then⠀let⠀the⠀person⠀teaching⠀or⠀observing⠀react⠀without⠀that⠀reaction⠀settling⠀the⠀meaning:⠀a⠀master⠀accepts⠀the⠀improvement⠀without⠀praise;⠀a⠀rival⠀pretends⠀not⠀to⠀see⠀it;⠀a⠀relative⠀asks⠀for⠀help⠀with⠀something⠀unrelated,⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀already⠀absorbed⠀into⠀expectation.\n\nMove⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience,⠀using⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀rather⠀than⠀recap.⠀A⠀failed⠀practice⠀may⠀return⠀during⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀conversation,⠀prompted⠀by⠀a⠀phrase⠀or⠀an⠀object.⠀Interior⠀thought⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀scene's⠀pressure—uncertainty⠀whether⠀the⠀improvement⠀will⠀hold,⠀irritation⠀at⠀being⠀tested⠀again,⠀relief⠀mixed⠀with⠀resentment⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀noticed—and⠀stays⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀why⠀society⠀values⠀the⠀skill;⠀a⠀nearby⠀speaker's⠀acceptance⠀or⠀dismissal⠀of⠀another⠀learner⠀shows⠀the⠀positioning⠀plainly.\n\nClose⠀without⠀ceremony.⠀Business⠀may⠀continue,⠀an⠀appointment⠀may⠀be⠀missed,⠀or⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀sit⠀down⠀again⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀task.⠀The⠀prose⠀does⠀not⠀celebrate⠀the⠀progress,⠀and⠀no⠀lesson,⠀reversal,⠀or⠀moral⠀coda⠀arrives;⠀the⠀success⠀may⠀be⠀small⠀and⠀uneven,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀difficulty⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀resolved,⠀or⠀even⠀named,⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nOrganize⠀the⠀progression⠀around⠀how⠀this⠀particular⠀pair⠀registers⠀each⠀other's⠀changes.⠀Give⠀them⠀a⠀shared⠀currency⠀that⠀belongs⠀only⠀to⠀their⠀history—a⠀phrase,⠀an⠀object,⠀an⠀old⠀correction:⠀one⠀used⠀to⠀remind⠀the⠀other⠀of⠀the⠀third⠀step;⠀one⠀learned⠀the⠀gesture⠀by⠀watching⠀the⠀other's⠀hand.⠀When⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀appears,⠀let⠀the⠀scene⠀select⠀the⠀private⠀signal—the⠀reminder⠀no⠀longer⠀needed,⠀the⠀hesitation⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀prompt⠀help⠀now⠀gone.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀significance;⠀show⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀partner's⠀attention⠀or⠀its⠀absence,⠀and⠀render⠀either⠀partner's⠀recognition⠀as⠀private⠀thought⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀even⠀while⠀it⠀stays⠀unspoken⠀between⠀them.\n\nGive⠀the⠀relationship⠀its⠀promised⠀space⠀without⠀converting⠀every⠀improvement⠀into⠀a⠀crisis.⠀Affection⠀and⠀comfort⠀may⠀accompany⠀a⠀successful⠀attempt;⠀jealousy⠀or⠀rivalry⠀may⠀surface⠀when⠀a⠀third⠀person⠀notices⠀the⠀same⠀progress.⠀Let⠀them⠀speak⠀in⠀their⠀established⠀register,⠀where⠀a⠀small⠀callback⠀carries⠀more⠀weight⠀than⠀uninterrupted⠀tenderness.⠀Keep⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀unsentimental⠀irony⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀frame:⠀a⠀partner⠀may⠀value⠀the⠀new⠀skill⠀because⠀it⠀earns⠀money⠀or⠀reduces⠀work,⠀or⠀resent⠀it⠀because⠀it⠀shifts⠀the⠀accustomed⠀balance,⠀and⠀neither⠀reaction⠀is⠀softened⠀into⠀a⠀familiar⠀beat.\n\nUse⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise.⠀If⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀is⠀rivalry,⠀discovery,⠀comfort,⠀or⠀strained⠀affection,⠀fulfill⠀that⠀particular⠀promise⠀through⠀the⠀progression's⠀consequences⠀rather⠀than⠀inserted⠀banter,⠀confessions,⠀or⠀forced⠀closeness.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀change⠀is⠀still⠀newly⠀registered⠀between⠀them—a⠀look⠀held,⠀a⠀habit⠀interrupted—leaving⠀open⠀what⠀the⠀pair⠀will⠀do⠀with⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀progression⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀something⠀later⠀retold.⠀Open⠀a⠀practice⠀or⠀challenge⠀with⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀that⠀fixes⠀it⠀against⠀earlier⠀failures—This⠀was⠀the⠀boy⠀who⠀had⠀been⠀sent⠀from⠀the⠀fourth⠀trial;⠀She⠀had⠀not⠀held⠀the⠀long⠀blade⠀since⠀the⠀winter⠀her⠀hand⠀changed—then⠀ground⠀the⠀telling⠀in⠀exact⠀particulars:⠀who⠀watched,⠀what⠀broke⠀or⠀held,⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀said⠀while⠀the⠀attempt⠀still⠀failed.⠀Let⠀repeated⠀phrases⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀deed⠀gains⠀a⠀new⠀application—the⠀same⠀gate,⠀the⠀same⠀count⠀of⠀breaths,⠀the⠀same⠀dismissal⠀in⠀the⠀older⠀one's⠀mouth—while⠀the⠀body⠀answers⠀differently.\n\nMeasure⠀improvement⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀before⠀witnesses;⠀the⠀narration⠀need⠀not⠀name⠀a⠀chronicler,⠀but⠀it⠀carries⠀the⠀cadence⠀of⠀retelling⠀in⠀its⠀deliberate⠀openings⠀and⠀compact⠀declarations.⠀Keep⠀public⠀reputation⠀distinct⠀from⠀private⠀experience:⠀the⠀youth⠀remembered⠀as⠀steady⠀may⠀still⠀find⠀the⠀task⠀terrifying⠀inside.⠀Show⠀that⠀split⠀through⠀one⠀suppressed⠀movement⠀or⠀one⠀after-the-fact⠀tremor⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀explanation⠀of⠀the⠀psychology.\n\nLet⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀irony⠀sit⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀accepts.⠀The⠀deed⠀earns⠀its⠀remembrance,⠀yet⠀the⠀same⠀voices⠀that⠀praise⠀it⠀may⠀forget⠀who⠀first⠀showed⠀the⠀movement⠀or⠀use⠀the⠀success⠀to⠀justify⠀an⠀old⠀exclusion;⠀a⠀compact⠀aside⠀or⠀a⠀spectator's⠀casual⠀remark⠀exposes⠀the⠀arrangement⠀without⠀a⠀lecture.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀close⠀while⠀the⠀act⠀is⠀still⠀under⠀way⠀or⠀as⠀its⠀first⠀retelling⠀begins,⠀the⠀mismatch⠀between⠀the⠀clean⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀human⠀cost⠀staying⠀visible⠀without⠀being⠀announced.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀social-realist⠀route⠀through⠀this⠀tradition:⠀households,⠀daily⠀work,⠀and⠀the⠀quiet⠀authority⠀of⠀institutions,⠀told⠀with⠀restraint.⠀Measure⠀progression⠀inside⠀that⠀economy⠀as⠀accumulating⠀reliability⠀—⠀a⠀repair⠀that⠀holds,⠀a⠀task⠀finished⠀inside⠀the⠀day,⠀an⠀error⠀that⠀stops⠀recurring⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀surrounding⠀community⠀apply⠀its⠀own⠀accounting,⠀which⠀may⠀value⠀the⠀gain⠀differently⠀than⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀earned⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀plain⠀and⠀undemonstrative;⠀significance⠀comes⠀from⠀placement⠀and⠀repetition,⠀not⠀from⠀emphasis.⠀Build⠀scenes⠀on⠀small⠀institutional⠀and⠀domestic⠀facts:⠀a⠀form⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀renewed,⠀a⠀quota,⠀a⠀shared⠀tool,⠀an⠀expectation⠀that⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀is⠀now⠀simply⠀available.⠀Expose⠀the⠀institution⠀through⠀the⠀ordinary⠀act⠀itself⠀—⠀the⠀clerk⠀stamps⠀the⠀paper⠀without⠀looking⠀at⠀the⠀work⠀it⠀certifies;⠀the⠀household⠀adds⠀the⠀skill⠀to⠀the⠀list⠀of⠀chores⠀without⠀comment⠀—⠀and⠀write⠀the⠀characters'⠀acceptance⠀of⠀these⠀arrangements⠀plainly,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀what⠀no⠀one⠀says.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀practicing⠀person's⠀private⠀attention:⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀the⠀material,⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀motion⠀becomes⠀automatic,⠀the⠀flash⠀of⠀irritation⠀when⠀a⠀rule⠀contradicts⠀experience.⠀That⠀interiority⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀and⠀is⠀unavailable⠀to⠀the⠀rest⠀of⠀the⠀cast.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly⠀—⠀competence⠀in⠀one⠀task⠀beside⠀a⠀persistent⠀failure⠀in⠀its⠀neighbor⠀—⠀and⠀keep⠀meals,⠀debts,⠀rest,⠀and⠀other⠀people⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀developing⠀life.\n\nApply⠀this⠀method⠀to⠀the⠀setting⠀the⠀story⠀actually⠀supplies.⠀If⠀that⠀setting⠀is⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish,⠀keep⠀its⠀institutions,⠀working⠀rhythms,⠀and⠀forms⠀of⠀politeness⠀distinct⠀rather⠀than⠀blending⠀them⠀into⠀a⠀generic⠀Nordic⠀backdrop;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀bleakness⠀as⠀automatic⠀atmosphere.⠀Close⠀a⠀scene⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀work⠀supports⠀—⠀a⠀finished⠀job,⠀a⠀failure⠀specific⠀enough⠀to⠀teach⠀something,⠀a⠀domestic⠀moment⠀that⠀quietly⠀carries⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀—⠀without⠀rewarding⠀or⠀frustrating⠀every⠀effort⠀on⠀schedule.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀screen-format⠀scenes:⠀a⠀heading⠀whenever⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀concise⠀present-tense⠀action⠀lines,⠀and⠀character-cued⠀dialogue.⠀Make⠀advancement⠀legible⠀as⠀a⠀visible⠀difference⠀between⠀scenes.⠀Where⠀the⠀practice⠀currently⠀stands⠀at⠀difficulty,⠀render⠀it⠀in⠀particular⠀filmable⠀detail⠀—⠀the⠀wrong⠀grip,⠀the⠀fumbled⠀order,⠀the⠀wasted⠀material⠀—⠀and⠀in⠀later⠀scenes⠀let⠀the⠀same⠀or⠀comparable⠀task⠀carry⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀body⠀and⠀in⠀the⠀result,⠀so⠀an⠀audience⠀can⠀measure⠀it⠀without⠀being⠀told.\n\nBetween⠀those⠀scenes⠀keep⠀the⠀mechanism⠀concrete:⠀a⠀correction⠀from⠀someone⠀more⠀experienced,⠀a⠀consequence⠀noticed,⠀a⠀repeated⠀attempt⠀adjusting⠀one⠀detail.⠀No⠀stat⠀overlays,⠀on-screen⠀rank⠀text,⠀or⠀voice-over⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀improvement;⠀if⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀an⠀established⠀advancement⠀system,⠀render⠀it⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀do⠀and⠀say⠀about⠀it.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀profile's⠀irony⠀in⠀small⠀details⠀played⠀straight:⠀a⠀supervisor⠀initials⠀the⠀form⠀without⠀looking⠀at⠀the⠀work;⠀a⠀relative⠀asks⠀the⠀newly⠀skilled⠀person⠀to⠀fix⠀something⠀else⠀as⠀though⠀it⠀were⠀nothing;⠀the⠀institutional⠀queue⠀costs⠀the⠀accomplishment⠀an⠀afternoon.⠀Characters⠀reveal⠀their⠀positions⠀by⠀treating⠀these⠀arrangements⠀as⠀normal.⠀Keep⠀dialogue⠀economical⠀and⠀plain;⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀effort⠀and⠀acknowledgment⠀plays⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀the⠀pauses,⠀not⠀in⠀speeches⠀about⠀injustice.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀prose⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀—⠀a⠀bracketed⠀interior⠀line⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀block,⠀belonging⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀and⠀audible⠀to⠀no⠀one⠀on⠀screen⠀—⠀used⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀a⠀reaction,⠀a⠀remembered⠀instruction,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀realization.⠀Use⠀cuts,⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀or⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀genuinely⠀needs⠀them.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀work⠀stops:⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀new⠀error⠀with⠀its⠀lesson⠀visible,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀institutional⠀beat.⠀No⠀cliffhanger,⠀music⠀cue,⠀or⠀triumph⠀shot⠀is⠀mandatory.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nStage⠀progression⠀through⠀repeatable⠀physical⠀business⠀with⠀objects.⠀Give⠀the⠀audience⠀a⠀task⠀it⠀can⠀watch⠀closely⠀—⠀a⠀rope⠀coiled,⠀a⠀joint⠀fitted,⠀a⠀ledger⠀reconciled,⠀a⠀pot⠀set⠀to⠀the⠀right⠀heat⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀recur.⠀Where⠀the⠀practice⠀stands⠀at⠀difficulty,⠀make⠀the⠀failure⠀particular⠀and⠀visible:⠀a⠀hand⠀position⠀that⠀slips,⠀an⠀order⠀done⠀backwards,⠀a⠀tool⠀set⠀down⠀in⠀the⠀wrong⠀place.⠀A⠀later⠀repetition⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀action⠀carries⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀body⠀—⠀grip⠀corrected,⠀hesitation⠀gone,⠀sequence⠀compressed⠀—⠀so⠀advancement⠀reads⠀as⠀blocking,⠀not⠀as⠀announcement.\n\nLet⠀teaching⠀happen⠀in⠀playable⠀exchanges:⠀a⠀demonstration,⠀a⠀plain⠀correction,⠀a⠀request⠀to⠀do⠀it⠀again.⠀No⠀one⠀lectures⠀about⠀how⠀advancement⠀works;⠀the⠀practice⠀itself⠀is⠀the⠀explanation.⠀Bring⠀people⠀on⠀and⠀off⠀on⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀errands⠀so⠀the⠀household⠀or⠀workplace⠀keeps⠀running⠀around⠀the⠀training.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀profile's⠀irony⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀speakers⠀treat⠀as⠀routine.⠀The⠀remark⠀that⠀the⠀work⠀is⠀what⠀anyone⠀would⠀do,⠀the⠀duty⠀that⠀absorbs⠀the⠀new⠀skill⠀without⠀comment,⠀the⠀supervisor's⠀matter-of-fact⠀correction⠀that⠀costs⠀an⠀afternoon⠀—⠀these⠀expose⠀the⠀arrangement⠀while⠀the⠀characters⠀accept⠀it⠀as⠀normal.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀a⠀line⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀meaning:⠀praise⠀withheld⠀while⠀the⠀work⠀is⠀used,⠀or⠀criticism⠀delivered⠀while⠀the⠀corrected⠀motion⠀is⠀already⠀underway.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀stage⠀directions⠀—⠀a⠀bracketed⠀interior⠀note⠀belonging⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀and⠀heard⠀by⠀no⠀one.⠀Do⠀not⠀route⠀thought⠀into⠀asides⠀or⠀monologues⠀by⠀default;⠀those⠀are⠀performed⠀speech⠀needing⠀their⠀own⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀and⠀separate⠀authorization.⠀Close⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀work⠀supports:⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀an⠀object⠀visibly⠀changed,⠀or⠀a⠀pause⠀after⠀a⠀line⠀while⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀settles⠀into⠀ordinary⠀use.⠀No⠀revelation,⠀applause⠀cue,⠀or⠀tableau⠀is⠀obligatory.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind⠀while⠀it⠀practices,⠀in⠀associative⠀movement⠀rather⠀than⠀linear⠀report.⠀Braid⠀the⠀current⠀attempt⠀with⠀the⠀body⠀performing⠀it:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀material,⠀the⠀remembered⠀instruction⠀that⠀suddenly⠀fits,⠀the⠀soreness⠀left⠀by⠀yesterday's⠀wrong⠀method,⠀the⠀supervisor's⠀voice⠀arriving⠀uninvited,⠀a⠀worry⠀about⠀the⠀household⠀account⠀surfacing⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀follow⠀the⠀associations⠀—⠀a⠀sentence⠀interrupted⠀by⠀the⠀task,⠀a⠀memory⠀opening⠀mid-motion⠀—⠀while⠀keeping⠀enough⠀orientation⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀tell⠀an⠀attempt⠀happening⠀now⠀from⠀one⠀recalled⠀or⠀feared.\n\nMake⠀progression⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀attention⠀itself.⠀Early,⠀the⠀motion⠀can⠀consume⠀the⠀whole⠀thought:⠀counting⠀steps,⠀doubting⠀the⠀grip,⠀rehearsing⠀the⠀order⠀in⠀private⠀words.⠀As⠀it⠀becomes⠀reliable,⠀it⠀can⠀run⠀beneath⠀notice⠀while⠀the⠀mind⠀moves⠀elsewhere⠀—⠀and⠀in⠀that⠀moment⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀watched⠀capability⠀arrive.⠀Let⠀weaknesses⠀recur⠀as⠀intrusion:⠀the⠀old⠀error⠀returning⠀as⠀bodily⠀memory,⠀the⠀task⠀that⠀still⠀demands⠀full⠀attention⠀when⠀everything⠀else⠀has⠀gone⠀quiet.⠀Do⠀not⠀summarize⠀the⠀improvement;⠀what⠀the⠀mind⠀no⠀longer⠀has⠀to⠀think⠀about⠀is⠀the⠀evidence,⠀and⠀knowing⠀the⠀principle⠀remains⠀distinct⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀under⠀pressure.\n\nRun⠀the⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀profile's⠀irony⠀through⠀what⠀this⠀mind⠀accepts⠀without⠀protest.⠀A⠀form⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀signed⠀before⠀the⠀practice⠀counts,⠀a⠀relative's⠀assumption⠀that⠀the⠀skill⠀is⠀simply⠀available⠀now,⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation⠀absorbed⠀as⠀the⠀ordinary⠀price⠀of⠀the⠀day⠀—⠀these⠀pass⠀through⠀the⠀stream⠀as⠀normal,⠀and⠀their⠀normality⠀is⠀the⠀exposure.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language⠀clean⠀and⠀plain⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀associations⠀jump;⠀no⠀authorial⠀commentary⠀is⠀needed.⠀Stop⠀when⠀the⠀thought⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀—⠀a⠀memory⠀settling,⠀a⠀new⠀attempt⠀beginning,⠀the⠀mind⠀moving⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀ordinary⠀thing.⠀No⠀resolution⠀or⠀completed⠀arc⠀is⠀required⠀for⠀the⠀ending.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Let⠀the⠀exchange⠀itself⠀show⠀advancement:⠀early⠀messages⠀ask⠀broad⠀questions⠀and⠀report⠀confusion⠀in⠀the⠀learner's⠀own⠀phrasing;⠀later⠀messages⠀ask⠀narrower⠀ones,⠀attach⠀completed⠀work,⠀correct⠀someone⠀else,⠀or⠀give⠀the⠀instruction⠀the⠀learner⠀once⠀needed⠀to⠀receive.⠀Include⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀carry⠀meaning⠀—⠀a⠀reply⠀that⠀took⠀a⠀day⠀early⠀on⠀and⠀arrives⠀within⠀minutes⠀later,⠀an⠀instruction⠀that⠀shrinks⠀from⠀paragraphs⠀to⠀a⠀single⠀word.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀stat⠀readouts⠀or⠀system⠀notifications⠀as⠀a⠀progress⠀display;⠀the⠀wording⠀and⠀rhythm⠀of⠀the⠀messages⠀are⠀the⠀measure.\n\nLet⠀each⠀person's⠀digital⠀habits⠀stay⠀particular:⠀the⠀supervisor⠀who⠀confirms⠀receipt⠀without⠀comment,⠀the⠀family⠀member⠀who⠀answers⠀a⠀report⠀of⠀achievement⠀with⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀help⠀moving⠀something,⠀the⠀fellow⠀learner⠀whose⠀typing⠀changes⠀as⠀they⠀improve⠀or⠀stall.⠀The⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀profile's⠀irony⠀works⠀through⠀these⠀transmitted⠀normals⠀—⠀the⠀hard-won⠀skill⠀treated⠀as⠀the⠀bare⠀minimum,⠀the⠀effort⠀absorbed⠀without⠀acknowledgment⠀—⠀and⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀sends⠀back⠀without⠀complaint.⠀The⠀exposure⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀acceptance,⠀not⠀in⠀any⠀speech⠀about⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀record⠀honest.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft:⠀a⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀the⠀character⠀wrote⠀and⠀did⠀not⠀send,⠀not⠀their⠀live⠀ongoing⠀thought.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀edit,⠀read⠀receipt,⠀or⠀delivery⠀failure⠀merely⠀to⠀create⠀subtext.⠀If⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀needed,⠀set⠀it⠀off⠀clearly⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀When⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀includes⠀private⠀interiority,⠀keep⠀it⠀clearly⠀separated⠀and⠀labeled⠀as⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀nonspoken⠀experience,⠀transmitted⠀to⠀no⠀one.⠀The⠀exchange⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀next⠀step,⠀a⠀reply⠀left⠀unanswered,⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀scheduling⠀confirmation;⠀no⠀reveal,⠀closure⠀loop,⠀or⠀crisis⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀scene-oriented⠀presentation:⠀a⠀concise⠀establishing⠀passage,⠀character-cued⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀carrying⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀attention⠀and⠀inner⠀response,⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Make⠀progression⠀legible⠀by⠀returning⠀to⠀a⠀familiar⠀scene⠀or⠀object⠀under⠀changed⠀conditions⠀—⠀the⠀same⠀bench⠀now⠀holding⠀finished⠀work,⠀the⠀same⠀route⠀taking⠀less⠀of⠀the⠀day,⠀the⠀same⠀instruction⠀reduced⠀to⠀a⠀nod,⠀the⠀same⠀question⠀no⠀longer⠀needing⠀to⠀be⠀asked.⠀The⠀return⠀is⠀the⠀measure:⠀what⠀was⠀difficult⠀now⠀reads⠀as⠀ordinary⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀narration,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀hard⠀stays⠀concrete.\n\nUse⠀background⠀and⠀expression⠀cues⠀sparingly⠀and⠀only⠀to⠀orient⠀—⠀a⠀tool⠀now⠀left⠀within⠀reach,⠀the⠀supervisor⠀glancing⠀at⠀the⠀work⠀one⠀beat⠀longer⠀than⠀before.⠀A⠀cue⠀sets⠀the⠀moment;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀truth.⠀The⠀improvement⠀must⠀live⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀does,⠀notices,⠀and⠀no⠀longer⠀struggles⠀with,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀changed⠀expression⠀alone.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀profile's⠀irony⠀arrive⠀through⠀small⠀accepted⠀details⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀fabric:⠀a⠀bill⠀pinned⠀where⠀the⠀achievement⠀should⠀be,⠀a⠀household⠀remark⠀that⠀folds⠀the⠀new⠀skill⠀into⠀the⠀list⠀of⠀expected⠀chores,⠀an⠀unread⠀notice⠀that⠀will⠀cost⠀someone⠀an⠀afternoon.⠀Characters⠀reveal⠀their⠀positions⠀by⠀treating⠀these⠀as⠀unremarkable.⠀Keep⠀narration⠀clean,⠀and⠀keep⠀private⠀thought⠀inside⠀the⠀focal⠀narration,⠀unavailable⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters;⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀when⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀choices,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀images,⠀or⠀engine⠀commands⠀unless⠀separately⠀authorized;⠀a⠀development⠀opens⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀a⠀decision⠀point.⠀End⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀—⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀a⠀clear⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀still⠀difficult,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀transition⠀—⠀with⠀no⠀forced⠀reaction⠀portrait⠀or⠀dramatic⠀beat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalapbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀installments⠀with⠀an⠀easy⠀re-entry⠀point.⠀Open⠀each⠀reply⠀oriented:⠀what⠀practice⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀it⠀stands⠀against,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀newly⠀in⠀reach⠀—⠀a⠀few⠀sentences⠀of⠀recovery,⠀not⠀a⠀recap.⠀Let⠀advancement⠀accumulate⠀across⠀installments⠀in⠀ways⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀verify:⠀a⠀routine⠀action⠀that⠀once⠀took⠀a⠀whole⠀reply⠀now⠀takes⠀a⠀paragraph,⠀an⠀earlier⠀mistake⠀avoided⠀by⠀name,⠀a⠀tool,⠀contact,⠀or⠀understanding⠀earned⠀earlier⠀and⠀used⠀under⠀a⠀new⠀condition.⠀When⠀an⠀old⠀detail⠀returns⠀changed,⠀briefly⠀recover⠀the⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀retelling⠀the⠀episode⠀that⠀established⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀through-line⠀a⠀developing⠀life,⠀not⠀only⠀a⠀skill.⠀Relationships,⠀debts,⠀rest,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀share⠀the⠀space⠀with⠀training,⠀and⠀progress⠀can⠀show⠀up⠀as⠀knowledge,⠀trust,⠀resources,⠀or⠀capability⠀in⠀any⠀mixture.⠀Strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀advance⠀unevenly;⠀a⠀long-built⠀strength⠀can⠀meet⠀a⠀task⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀solve.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀profile's⠀irony⠀by⠀letting⠀institutional⠀and⠀domestic⠀frictions⠀recur⠀as⠀normal.⠀A⠀form⠀renewed⠀each⠀season,⠀a⠀queue,⠀a⠀household⠀expectation,⠀a⠀dismissive⠀reply⠀—⠀introduce⠀one⠀plainly⠀when⠀it⠀occurs,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀later⠀installment⠀give⠀it⠀weight⠀through⠀repetition⠀or⠀consequence,⠀without⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lecture.⠀Characters⠀reveal⠀their⠀positions⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀accept,⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀stays⠀available⠀when⠀it⠀contributes⠀feeling⠀or⠀understanding,⠀held⠀by⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀and⠀unknown⠀to⠀the⠀others.\n\nEnd⠀each⠀installment⠀where⠀the⠀work⠀pauses:⠀a⠀job⠀finished,⠀a⠀new⠀understanding⠀stated⠀plainly,⠀a⠀domestic⠀moment⠀carrying⠀the⠀developed⠀capability,⠀or⠀an⠀attempt⠀left⠀hanging⠀with⠀its⠀local⠀change⠀clear.⠀No⠀cliffhanger,⠀reversal,⠀or⠀rank⠀announcement⠀is⠀required⠀at⠀any⠀boundary;⠀serial⠀duration⠀should⠀let⠀selected⠀details⠀acquire⠀meaning⠀rather⠀than⠀tax⠀each⠀reply⠀for⠀a⠀reward.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nBuild⠀the⠀character's⠀growth⠀through⠀attempts⠀that⠀carry⠀a⠀relational⠀price.⠀When⠀they⠀practice,⠀prepare,⠀or⠀test⠀a⠀new⠀technique,⠀tie⠀the⠀effort⠀to⠀someone⠀they⠀are⠀avoiding,⠀resenting,⠀or⠀struggling⠀to⠀reach.⠀The⠀breakthrough⠀should⠀require⠀admitting⠀a⠀need,⠀voicing⠀a⠀withheld⠀feeling,⠀or⠀facing⠀a⠀memory⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀they⠀execute⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀learned.\n\nLet⠀training⠀and⠀combat⠀expose⠀the⠀wound⠀rather⠀than⠀pause⠀for⠀a⠀separate⠀therapy⠀scene.⠀An⠀instructor's⠀correction⠀can⠀reopen⠀an⠀old⠀slight;⠀a⠀sparring⠀partner's⠀success⠀can⠀echo⠀a⠀failure⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀not⠀forgiven.⠀The⠀new⠀capability⠀matters⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀hard-won,⠀but⠀also⠀because⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀say⠀or⠀withstand⠀with⠀that⠀person.\n\nKeep⠀emotions⠀volatile⠀but⠀specific.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀generic⠀rage⠀or⠀despair.⠀Name⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀bring⠀themselves⠀to⠀ask⠀for,⠀whose⠀approval⠀they⠀are⠀waiting⠀on,⠀what⠀apology⠀they⠀are⠀rehearsing.⠀Let⠀their⠀thoughts⠀run⠀ahead⠀or⠀stall,⠀contradict⠀their⠀spoken⠀words,⠀and⠀change⠀their⠀actions⠀mid-scene.⠀Strain⠀should⠀affect⠀their⠀speech,⠀their⠀focus,⠀and⠀their⠀willingness⠀to⠀continue.\n\nAllow⠀comfort⠀to⠀be⠀incomplete.⠀A⠀bond⠀may⠀ease⠀one⠀wound⠀while⠀opening⠀another,⠀or⠀an⠀advance⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀relationship⠀harder⠀because⠀the⠀character's⠀new⠀strength⠀threatens⠀an⠀old⠀dynamic.⠀Warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀can⠀coexist;⠀no⠀one⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀heal⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene⠀where⠀the⠀skill⠀improves.⠀The⠀progression⠀remains⠀the⠀main⠀engine,⠀but⠀each⠀step⠀forward⠀also⠀shifts⠀the⠀emotional⠀ground.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀each⠀reply⠀as⠀a⠀single⠀coherent⠀interval⠀in⠀the⠀ongoing⠀shared⠀scene.⠀Use⠀clear⠀speaker⠀attribution⠀for⠀every⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀and⠀keep⠀action⠀paragraphs⠀short⠀enough⠀to⠀scan⠀without⠀losing⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀standing,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀practicing,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀notice⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀participants.\n\nLet⠀progression⠀happen⠀through⠀interaction.⠀A⠀training⠀exchange,⠀a⠀word⠀of⠀feedback,⠀or⠀an⠀opponent's⠀move⠀can⠀reveal⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀understands⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀eludes⠀them.⠀Show⠀the⠀attempt,⠀not⠀just⠀the⠀result:⠀the⠀failed⠀repetition,⠀the⠀correction⠀that⠀lands,⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀knowing⠀the⠀principle⠀and⠀executing⠀it⠀under⠀pressure.⠀The⠀other⠀player's⠀character⠀or⠀a⠀responsive⠀NPC⠀should⠀remain⠀an⠀active⠀part⠀of⠀that⠀process.\n\nUse⠀emotionally⠀significant⠀action⠀the⠀way⠀the⠀author⠀profile⠀does:⠀a⠀memory⠀can⠀interrupt⠀a⠀drill⠀and⠀change⠀the⠀next⠀choice,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀private⠀thought⠀readable⠀and⠀linked⠀to⠀a⠀visible⠀response.⠀End⠀the⠀reply⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀naturally⠀gives⠀the⠀partner⠀room⠀to⠀act,⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀question⠀or⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀next⠀move⠀can⠀be⠀taken⠀up⠀by⠀either⠀character;⠀the⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀pause⠀while⠀the⠀progression⠀system⠀reports⠀a⠀number.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "enabled": true,
            "forbid_overrides": false,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-progression_fantasy-05",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Progression Fantasy · 05/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == progression_fantasy}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Progression Fantasy. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 5 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-progression_fantasy; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPalaqac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀tradition.⠀Advance⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀clearly⠀staged⠀incidents,⠀each⠀containing⠀a⠀concrete⠀attempt,⠀test,⠀or⠀lesson⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do.⠀Let⠀the⠀chapter⠀title⠀or⠀opening⠀line⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀trouble,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀action⠀unfold⠀through⠀spoken⠀exchanges,⠀practical⠀movement,⠀and⠀a⠀decisive⠀moment⠀of⠀learning.\n\nDo⠀not⠀use⠀a⠀numerical⠀system⠀or⠀cultivation⠀inventory⠀as⠀the⠀sole⠀proof⠀of⠀progress.⠀Instead,⠀show⠀the⠀gain⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀perform:⠀a⠀technique⠀that⠀finally⠀works,⠀a⠀speed⠀that⠀surprises⠀an⠀opponent,⠀or⠀a⠀mistake⠀they⠀no⠀longer⠀make.⠀Keep⠀the⠀improvement⠀uneven;⠀a⠀success⠀in⠀one⠀area⠀can⠀expose⠀a⠀weakness⠀in⠀another.\n\nGive⠀each⠀episode⠀a⠀relational⠀stake.⠀A⠀rival,⠀teacher,⠀companion,⠀or⠀remembered⠀figure⠀should⠀enter⠀the⠀training⠀ground⠀or⠀hall,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀lesson⠀also⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀stands⠀with⠀them.⠀A⠀reputation⠀may⠀be⠀tested,⠀a⠀promise⠀may⠀be⠀broken⠀or⠀kept,⠀and⠀the⠀outcome⠀of⠀the⠀encounter⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀next⠀episode⠀with⠀something⠀new⠀to⠀resolve.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀local⠀visual⠀storytelling⠀without⠀importing⠀any⠀particular⠀period,⠀surname,⠀or⠀province.⠀Choose⠀the⠀language,⠀customs,⠀and⠀community⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀world;⠀the⠀episodic⠀form⠀is⠀a⠀narrative⠀method,⠀not⠀a⠀claim⠀about⠀the⠀setting.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀progress⠀as⠀a⠀physical⠀fact.⠀Show⠀the⠀scuffed⠀grips,⠀the⠀bruised⠀knuckles,⠀the⠀sweat⠀in⠀the⠀eyes,⠀the⠀incremental⠀difference⠀between⠀yesterday's⠀repetition⠀and⠀today's.⠀Keep⠀transitions⠀short:⠀one⠀motion⠀follows⠀another,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀each⠀attempt⠀in⠀the⠀body⠀before⠀the⠀breakthrough⠀arrives.\n\nUse⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀concrete⠀nouns.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀that⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀tired;⠀show⠀them⠀bracing⠀their⠀knee,⠀missing⠀their⠀breath,⠀or⠀catching⠀themselves⠀on⠀a⠀rail.⠀A⠀new⠀technique⠀is⠀not⠀learned⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀described,⠀but⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀lands⠀it⠀while⠀exhausted,⠀after⠀failing⠀in⠀ways⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀seen.\n\nLet⠀relationships⠀provide⠀the⠀driving⠀pressure.⠀The⠀opponent⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀friend⠀the⠀character⠀hates⠀to⠀disappoint,⠀a⠀rival⠀whose⠀success⠀stings,⠀or⠀a⠀teacher⠀whose⠀silence⠀hurts⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀blow.⠀The⠀memory⠀that⠀interrupts⠀a⠀drill⠀should⠀be⠀brief⠀and⠀sharp,⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀present⠀demand:⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀is⠀not⠀coming⠀back.⠀Emotional⠀strain⠀does⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀physical⠀scene;⠀it⠀redirects⠀it.\n\nDo⠀not⠀flatten⠀the⠀genre⠀into⠀survival.⠀Pain⠀and⠀wear⠀are⠀evidence⠀of⠀improvement,⠀not⠀an⠀end⠀in⠀themselves.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀that⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀do⠀before,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀new⠀capability⠀create⠀a⠀new⠀problem⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀fight.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nConstruct⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀documents⠀written⠀at⠀different⠀moments⠀in⠀the⠀training.⠀Each⠀entry⠀must⠀have⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀a⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀date⠀or⠀relative⠀time.⠀Let⠀the⠀form⠀vary⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀situation:⠀a⠀practice⠀log⠀kept⠀for⠀a⠀teacher,⠀a⠀letter⠀to⠀a⠀rival⠀explaining⠀a⠀defeat,⠀a⠀report⠀to⠀a⠀patron⠀concealing⠀a⠀failure,⠀or⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀for⠀a⠀friend⠀who⠀must⠀know⠀the⠀truth.\n\nUse⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀composition⠀and⠀reading⠀to⠀show⠀advancement.⠀An⠀early⠀entry⠀may⠀identify⠀a⠀mistake⠀that⠀a⠀later⠀entry⠀confirms⠀was⠀corrected;⠀a⠀confident⠀letter⠀may⠀be⠀undercut⠀by⠀the⠀next⠀document's⠀material⠀damage.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀narrator⠀to⠀reconcile⠀the⠀accounts.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀compare⠀what⠀each⠀writer⠀knew,⠀feared,⠀and⠀chose⠀to⠀leave⠀out.\n\nLet⠀the⠀author⠀profile's⠀bonds⠀shape⠀the⠀documents.⠀A⠀traumatic⠀memory⠀may⠀be⠀alluded⠀to⠀in⠀one⠀letter⠀and⠀confessed⠀only⠀in⠀a⠀private⠀journal.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀correction⠀may⠀be⠀quoted⠀with⠀resentment⠀in⠀one⠀entry⠀and⠀with⠀gratitude⠀in⠀another.⠀The⠀relationship⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀be⠀resolved⠀across⠀the⠀records;⠀it⠀can⠀remain⠀contested⠀while⠀the⠀skill⠀improves.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀action⠀readable⠀inside⠀the⠀document.⠀The⠀writer⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀bout⠀blow⠀by⠀blow⠀or⠀summarize⠀a⠀long⠀month,⠀but⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀physical⠀attempt⠀and⠀its⠀immediate⠀result.⠀Preserve⠀continuity⠀without⠀injecting⠀a⠀neutral⠀summary⠀after⠀every⠀letter;⠀the⠀next⠀document⠀should⠀supply⠀the⠀missing⠀piece⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀voice.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nMake⠀progression⠀visible⠀through⠀moments⠀of⠀care⠀and⠀small,⠀concrete⠀pleasures.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀improve⠀because⠀someone⠀adjusts⠀their⠀grip,⠀brings⠀them⠀food⠀after⠀a⠀long⠀session,⠀repeats⠀an⠀instruction⠀patiently,⠀or⠀remembers⠀how⠀they⠀like⠀to⠀rest.⠀The⠀skill⠀still⠀advances,⠀but⠀the⠀learning⠀feels⠀warm⠀rather⠀than⠀punishing.\n\nUse⠀familiar⠀preferences⠀as⠀a⠀recurring⠀thread.⠀A⠀favorite⠀tea,⠀a⠀bench⠀where⠀they⠀always⠀sit,⠀a⠀joke⠀that⠀returns⠀at⠀the⠀right⠀moment—these⠀details⠀should⠀carry⠀affection⠀and⠀signal⠀that⠀the⠀characters⠀know⠀each⠀other.⠀They⠀are⠀not⠀random⠀fluff;⠀they⠀are⠀how⠀the⠀relationship⠀supports⠀the⠀hard⠀work⠀of⠀getting⠀better.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀author⠀profile's⠀bond⠀to⠀be⠀the⠀source⠀of⠀the⠀breakthrough.⠀A⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀friend⠀can⠀steady⠀a⠀faltering⠀technique,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀word⠀of⠀encouragement⠀can⠀unlock⠀an⠀idea⠀the⠀character⠀could⠀not⠀reach⠀alone.⠀Show⠀the⠀emotional⠀change⠀alongside⠀the⠀practical⠀gain:⠀the⠀new⠀move⠀works,⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀also⠀feels⠀more⠀at⠀ease⠀or⠀more⠀grateful.\n\nKeep⠀disagreement⠀and⠀difficulty⠀intact.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable,⠀and⠀a⠀training⠀scene⠀can⠀still⠀include⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀an⠀honest⠀correction,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀clash⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀break⠀the⠀warmth.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀where⠀the⠀care⠀has⠀landed,⠀not⠀necessarily⠀where⠀every⠀problem⠀is⠀solved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀larger⠀social⠀arc.⠀Each⠀lesson⠀or⠀test⠀should⠀be⠀framed⠀by⠀what⠀it⠀means⠀for⠀the⠀character's⠀standing,⠀obligations,⠀or⠀history,⠀not⠀merely⠀by⠀the⠀immediate⠀motion.⠀Use⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀to⠀move⠀from⠀private⠀practice⠀into⠀public⠀consequence:⠀the⠀teacher⠀who⠀notices,⠀the⠀rival⠀who⠀watches,⠀the⠀reputation⠀that⠀shifts⠀when⠀a⠀technique⠀is⠀finally⠀executed.\n\nLet⠀narration⠀carry⠀a⠀measured⠀distance.⠀The⠀sentences⠀may⠀be⠀longer⠀and⠀more⠀composed⠀than⠀ordinary⠀speech,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀reflect⠀on⠀what⠀an⠀event⠀will⠀come⠀to⠀mean.⠀This⠀distance⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀the⠀character's⠀feeling;⠀it⠀places⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀context⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀not⠀yet⠀see.⠀Use⠀it⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀a⠀private⠀breakthrough⠀becomes⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀changed⠀identity.\n\nMake⠀the⠀author⠀profile's⠀relationships⠀a⠀matter⠀of⠀loyalty⠀and⠀memory⠀enacted⠀over⠀time.⠀A⠀bond⠀may⠀be⠀tested⠀over⠀several⠀scenes,⠀not⠀resolved⠀in⠀one⠀exchange.⠀The⠀character's⠀memories⠀should⠀return⠀at⠀moments⠀when⠀they⠀alter⠀judgment:⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀trust⠀a⠀teacher,⠀to⠀forgive⠀a⠀rival,⠀or⠀to⠀refuse⠀a⠀shortcut.⠀The⠀emotional⠀stakes⠀should⠀be⠀as⠀legible⠀as⠀the⠀physical⠀stakes.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀world⠀present.⠀The⠀formal⠀style⠀can⠀include⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀or⠀public⠀contrast⠀when⠀the⠀setting⠀supplies⠀them,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting⠀or⠀archaic⠀vocabulary.⠀The⠀social⠀frame⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀community⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀the⠀story.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nBegin⠀with⠀a⠀telling⠀that⠀has⠀an⠀immediate⠀purpose⠀for⠀its⠀listeners.⠀A⠀teacher⠀needs⠀a⠀student⠀to⠀see⠀why⠀a⠀technique⠀failed;⠀a⠀rival⠀needs⠀a⠀warning;⠀a⠀friend⠀needs⠀a⠀past⠀choice⠀explained;⠀a⠀survivor⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀understood.⠀Let⠀that⠀purpose⠀decide⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀emphasizes,⠀where⠀she⠀begins,⠀and⠀which⠀trial⠀becomes⠀the⠀turning⠀point.⠀Keep⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀active:⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀interrupt,⠀object,⠀test⠀the⠀account,⠀grow⠀quiet,⠀or⠀press⠀for⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀teller⠀would⠀rather⠀leave⠀vague.⠀The⠀teller's⠀pauses,⠀corrections,⠀and⠀choices⠀of⠀wording⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀an⠀introduction⠀to⠀it.\n\nInside⠀the⠀embedded⠀account,⠀follow⠀one⠀practical⠀field⠀of⠀capability:⠀strength,⠀observation,⠀a⠀named⠀technique,⠀a⠀social⠀method,⠀a⠀craft.⠀Give⠀the⠀character⠀attempts⠀that⠀fail⠀in⠀specific⠀ways⠀and⠀corrections⠀that⠀come⠀from⠀contact⠀with⠀the⠀world:⠀a⠀teacher's⠀hand⠀shifts⠀the⠀angle,⠀the⠀metal⠀whitens⠀at⠀the⠀right⠀heat,⠀the⠀opponent's⠀shoulder⠀dips⠀before⠀the⠀lunge.⠀Make⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀execute⠀it.⠀A⠀principle⠀can⠀be⠀stated⠀early⠀and⠀still⠀not⠀save⠀her.⠀Progress⠀appears⠀in⠀what⠀she⠀can⠀now⠀do,⠀and⠀in⠀what⠀remains⠀awkward,⠀slow,⠀or⠀costly.⠀The⠀arc⠀may⠀be⠀short,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀show⠀uneven⠀change:⠀an⠀old⠀skill⠀may⠀hold⠀while⠀a⠀new⠀one⠀falters;⠀recovery⠀or⠀ordinary⠀work⠀may⠀interrupt⠀training;⠀a⠀rank⠀or⠀threshold⠀may⠀describe⠀her⠀loosely⠀without⠀replacing⠀present⠀execution.⠀Let⠀available⠀resources,⠀whether⠀tools,⠀teachers,⠀money,⠀allies,⠀or⠀time⠀to⠀recover,⠀shape⠀what⠀practice⠀is⠀possible.⠀When⠀the⠀listener's⠀doubt⠀or⠀curiosity⠀forces⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀make⠀a⠀movement⠀concrete,⠀use⠀that⠀pressure⠀to⠀reveal⠀the⠀next⠀necessary⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀stall.\n\nLet⠀relationship-driven⠀conflict⠀run⠀through⠀the⠀practice.⠀A⠀rival,⠀teacher,⠀comrade,⠀or⠀person⠀whose⠀opinion⠀matters⠀can⠀be⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀attempt,⠀not⠀only⠀mentioned⠀afterward.⠀A⠀failure⠀can⠀happen⠀before⠀someone⠀she⠀wants⠀to⠀impress;⠀an⠀altered⠀attempt⠀can⠀be⠀made⠀while⠀protecting⠀or⠀confronting⠀that⠀person.⠀A⠀memory⠀can⠀change⠀a⠀present⠀move.⠀When⠀the⠀embedded⠀character⠀remembers⠀an⠀old⠀wound,⠀show⠀the⠀habit⠀it⠀left,⠀such⠀as⠀flinching⠀from⠀a⠀guard⠀on⠀the⠀left,⠀hesitating⠀before⠀water,⠀or⠀overcommitting⠀to⠀a⠀defense⠀that⠀once⠀worked,⠀and⠀then⠀show⠀how⠀that⠀habit⠀affects⠀this⠀attempt.⠀The⠀memory⠀belongs⠀to⠀someone⠀inside⠀the⠀tale,⠀and⠀its⠀consequence⠀should⠀be⠀physical⠀and⠀practical.⠀Keep⠀action⠀visually⠀followable:⠀where⠀bodies⠀are,⠀what⠀changes,⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀picture.⠀Let⠀a⠀breakthrough⠀have⠀a⠀personal⠀basis,⠀whether⠀an⠀old⠀promise,⠀a⠀rivalry,⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀fear,⠀rather⠀than⠀arriving⠀because⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀a⠀victory.\n\nA⠀repeated⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀inside⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀should⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀through⠀recurrence.⠀A⠀hilt⠀binding⠀repaired⠀again,⠀a⠀counted⠀breath⠀before⠀a⠀risky⠀move,⠀a⠀nickname⠀used⠀only⠀when⠀someone⠀is⠀frightened:⠀bring⠀it⠀back⠀at⠀a⠀changed⠀moment.⠀The⠀return⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀that⠀the⠀tale⠀is⠀true.⠀It⠀marks⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀state⠀or⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀understands.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀echo⠀one⠀of⠀these⠀motifs⠀into⠀the⠀frame,⠀so⠀the⠀outer⠀listener⠀recognizes⠀a⠀connection⠀without⠀the⠀narration⠀announcing⠀its⠀thematic⠀purpose.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀intelligible:⠀the⠀frame⠀has⠀its⠀own⠀present⠀pressure,⠀while⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀has⠀its⠀own⠀sequence,⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀stakes.\n\nDo⠀not⠀step⠀outside⠀the⠀tale⠀to⠀announce⠀numerical⠀gains.⠀If⠀a⠀rank⠀or⠀threshold⠀exists⠀in⠀the⠀story,⠀show⠀the⠀mismatch⠀between⠀the⠀outer⠀label⠀and⠀present⠀execution.⠀She⠀may⠀hold⠀a⠀rank⠀yet⠀still⠀need⠀to⠀learn⠀a⠀stance,⠀or⠀she⠀may⠀perform⠀above⠀her⠀rank⠀when⠀memory⠀and⠀necessity⠀take⠀over.⠀Let⠀advancement⠀be⠀tested⠀through⠀what⠀she⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀A⠀proof⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀clean⠀victory.⠀Improvement⠀can⠀mean⠀she⠀survives,⠀protects⠀someone,⠀or⠀completes⠀the⠀heart⠀of⠀a⠀task⠀while⠀failing⠀a⠀smaller⠀part.\n\nWhere⠀the⠀narration⠀follows⠀a⠀character⠀in⠀either⠀the⠀frame⠀or⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale,⠀render⠀her⠀actual⠀private⠀experience:⠀sensation,⠀attention,⠀reasoning,⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀the⠀motives⠀connecting⠀events⠀to⠀a⠀choice.⠀The⠀listener⠀in⠀the⠀frame⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀know⠀what⠀an⠀embedded⠀character⠀thought⠀or⠀felt,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀withhold,⠀misremember,⠀or⠀reinterpret.⠀That⠀separation⠀should⠀not⠀replace⠀interiority⠀with⠀summary.⠀A⠀telling⠀can⠀pause⠀on⠀a⠀character's⠀live⠀thought⠀even⠀while⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀continues.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀reply⠀uses⠀a⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀wrapper,⠀place⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀there⠀rather⠀than⠀reducing⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀note⠀about⠀what⠀she⠀feels.\n\nThe⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀before⠀the⠀frame⠀closes.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀telling⠀has⠀advanced⠀the⠀outer⠀occasion⠀or⠀reached⠀a⠀charged⠀stage⠀in⠀the⠀embedded⠀account,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀teller⠀pauses⠀before⠀the⠀outcome.⠀A⠀threat⠀outside⠀the⠀frame⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved;⠀a⠀task⠀may⠀continue;⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀deciding⠀what⠀to⠀believe.⠀Leave⠀the⠀next⠀telling⠀as⠀a⠀living⠀possibility⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀moral.⠀The⠀last⠀sentence⠀can⠀fall⠀during⠀speech,⠀action,⠀memory,⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀decision⠀about⠀whether⠀to⠀say⠀the⠀next⠀true⠀thing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWork⠀in⠀the⠀Romantic-uncanny⠀route:⠀the⠀inherited⠀teaching⠀method⠀is⠀an⠀almost⠀living⠀presence,⠀though⠀not⠀necessarily⠀supernatural.⠀An⠀old⠀manual,⠀a⠀guild's⠀private⠀drill,⠀a⠀ranking⠀framework,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀master's⠀training⠀can⠀address⠀the⠀protagonist⠀through⠀persistence,⠀incomplete⠀records,⠀and⠀the⠀way⠀old⠀expectations⠀keep⠀shaping⠀present⠀bodies.⠀Render⠀that⠀authority⠀with⠀concrete⠀detail—dust⠀and⠀machine⠀oil,⠀a⠀half-burned⠀chart,⠀a⠀refused⠀adaptation,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀favorite⠀error⠀passed⠀down⠀until⠀students⠀reproduce⠀it—and⠀let⠀the⠀protagonist⠀feel⠀addressed⠀by⠀the⠀past⠀through⠀her⠀own⠀education.\n\nMake⠀advancement⠀a⠀negotiation⠀between⠀the⠀old⠀method⠀and⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀present⠀need.⠀The⠀inherited⠀teaching⠀can⠀be⠀partly⠀correct⠀and⠀partly⠀harmful:⠀a⠀drill⠀may⠀build⠀strength⠀while⠀damaging⠀a⠀wrist;⠀a⠀rank⠀may⠀open⠀a⠀door⠀while⠀making⠀a⠀mentor's⠀advice⠀harder⠀to⠀hear.⠀When⠀the⠀protagonist⠀tests⠀a⠀principle,⠀give⠀concrete,⠀embodied⠀feedback—a⠀joint⠀fails,⠀an⠀opponent⠀counters,⠀a⠀supervisor⠀names⠀a⠀blind⠀spot,⠀a⠀movement⠀finally⠀lands—and⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀attempt,⠀refinement,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀repetition⠀arise⠀from⠀what⠀that⠀feedback⠀actually⠀changes.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀under⠀pressure,⠀and⠀allow⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀to⠀develop⠀unevenly.\n\nUse⠀Kishimoto's⠀emotionally⠀loaded⠀action⠀inside⠀this⠀method.⠀Stage⠀encounters⠀with⠀clear⠀distance,⠀angle,⠀weight⠀transfer,⠀sound,⠀and⠀the⠀moment⠀after⠀contact.⠀A⠀rivalry⠀can⠀become⠀a⠀clash⠀between⠀two⠀interpretations⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀lineage:⠀one⠀student⠀clings⠀to⠀the⠀master's⠀original⠀form,⠀another⠀improvises⠀under⠀pressure.⠀The⠀uncanny⠀old⠀method⠀may⠀seem⠀to⠀favor⠀one,⠀but⠀when⠀its⠀truth⠀is⠀tested,⠀let⠀that⠀happen⠀in⠀a⠀displayed⠀encounter⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀announcement.⠀A⠀memory⠀can⠀enter⠀during⠀the⠀attempt⠀and⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀notices—an⠀old⠀injury,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀correction,⠀a⠀failure's⠀timing—without⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀post-fight⠀explanation.⠀The⠀breakthrough⠀should⠀have⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis;⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀appear⠀because⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀a⠀victory.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀tournament⠀structure,⠀borrowed⠀powers,⠀or⠀a⠀universal⠀speech⠀about⠀determination.\n\nLet⠀syntax⠀and⠀distance⠀follow⠀the⠀Romantic-uncanny⠀route⠀and⠀the⠀narrator.⠀Long-breathed⠀periods⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀method's⠀persistence⠀and⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀reflection;⠀when⠀action⠀accelerates,⠀shorten⠀the⠀syntax⠀and⠀sharpen⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀follows⠀the⠀perceptual⠀change⠀from⠀inside⠀the⠀movement.⠀Keep⠀the⠀uncanny⠀in⠀the⠀teaching⠀institution⠀and⠀its⠀persistence,⠀not⠀in⠀imported⠀castles,⠀severed⠀guilt,⠀or⠀German-sounding⠀word⠀order.⠀If⠀a⠀civic⠀or⠀bureaucratic⠀structure⠀appears,⠀present⠀its⠀actual⠀rules⠀and⠀the⠀way⠀they⠀shape⠀a⠀student's⠀choices⠀rather⠀than⠀making⠀it⠀a⠀national-competence⠀joke.\n\nGive⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀private⠀experience⠀directly⠀in⠀the⠀narrative:⠀breath,⠀pain,⠀anticipation,⠀doubt,⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀remembered⠀voices,⠀the⠀half-formed⠀appraisal⠀that⠀precedes⠀a⠀decision.⠀Do⠀not⠀replace⠀this⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀with⠀dialogue,⠀a⠀training-manual⠀entry,⠀a⠀monologue,⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀summary.⠀Let⠀recovery,⠀ordinary⠀work,⠀and⠀relationships⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life;⠀training⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀them.\n\nThe⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀an⠀attempt⠀is⠀still⠀underway,⠀after⠀feedback⠀has⠀landed,⠀or⠀during⠀a⠀private⠀appraisal.⠀It⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀lineage,⠀produce⠀a⠀victory,⠀or⠀decide⠀whether⠀the⠀old⠀method⠀is⠀vindicated⠀or⠀discarded.⠀Let⠀the⠀next⠀lesson⠀remain⠀to⠀be⠀attempted⠀or⠀refused.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nTreat⠀advancement⠀as⠀a⠀contested⠀resource⠀inside⠀an⠀occupied,⠀watched⠀world.⠀The⠀learner⠀trains⠀under⠀conditions⠀of⠀borrowed⠀time⠀and⠀observed⠀performance:⠀a⠀trainer's⠀favor⠀purchased⠀with⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀logged⠀assessment⠀that⠀decides⠀rations⠀or⠀housing,⠀an⠀old⠀family⠀method⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀someone⠀else.⠀An⠀established⠀rank⠀or⠀recorded⠀measure⠀can⠀carry⠀that⠀pressure⠀without⠀inventing⠀numerical⠀mechanics⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀display.⠀Give⠀the⠀pressure⠀urban⠀material⠀weight—stairwell⠀lighting,⠀a⠀torn⠀practice⠀mat,⠀an⠀attendance⠀counter,⠀a⠀cracked⠀mirror⠀in⠀a⠀back⠀room—so⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀changes⠀how⠀a⠀session⠀is⠀experienced⠀rather⠀than⠀decorating⠀it.⠀Because⠀capability⠀is⠀visible,⠀it⠀is⠀political:⠀let⠀an⠀authority⠀notice⠀progress⠀and⠀try⠀to⠀control,⠀credit,⠀or⠀preempt⠀it,⠀while⠀remaining⠀capable⠀of⠀misreading⠀what⠀it⠀observes—a⠀misreading⠀that⠀may⠀matter⠀later.\n\nStage⠀every⠀gain⠀through⠀attempts⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow.⠀When⠀a⠀practice⠀scene⠀produces⠀improvement,⠀show⠀the⠀attempts⠀that⠀earned⠀it:⠀a⠀failure⠀that⠀is⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀body,⠀then⠀the⠀correction⠀that⠀makes⠀partial⠀success⠀possible—the⠀grip⠀shifts,⠀the⠀breathing⠀changes,⠀the⠀distance⠀finally⠀closes.⠀Distinguish⠀grasping⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀under⠀observation,⠀and⠀let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀advance⠀unevenly,⠀so⠀a⠀new⠀competence⠀coexists⠀with⠀a⠀regression⠀or⠀an⠀untouched⠀weakness.⠀Feedback⠀is⠀practical⠀but⠀socially⠀contaminated:⠀the⠀trainer⠀corrects⠀a⠀stance⠀while⠀warning⠀that⠀the⠀move⠀must⠀never⠀be⠀shown⠀to⠀the⠀house⠀manager,⠀or⠀a⠀rival⠀exposes⠀a⠀flaw⠀to⠀cost⠀a⠀contract⠀even⠀as⠀the⠀technique⠀itself⠀improves.⠀Test⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀can⠀now⠀be⠀accomplished⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀defeats⠀the⠀learner—an⠀unlocked⠀door,⠀an⠀unmanageable⠀weight,⠀a⠀hold⠀that⠀still⠀fails⠀on⠀the⠀injured⠀side.\n\nUse⠀Kishimoto's⠀staging⠀for⠀the⠀emotionally⠀significant⠀drill⠀or⠀fight.⠀Memory⠀enters⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀through⠀the⠀body:⠀a⠀remembered⠀theft⠀hardens⠀the⠀guard⠀on⠀the⠀side⠀where⠀they⠀were⠀caught;⠀a⠀long-cherished⠀opponent⠀appears⠀and⠀speed⠀rises⠀while⠀patience⠀frays.⠀Keep⠀the⠀exchange⠀visually⠀followable—who⠀is⠀where,⠀what⠀changes,⠀what⠀is⠀heard,⠀what⠀is⠀noticed⠀after⠀the⠀blow—and⠀ground⠀any⠀breakthrough⠀in⠀both⠀a⠀personal⠀basis⠀and⠀a⠀practical⠀one⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀need⠀for⠀a⠀victory.⠀The⠀inherited⠀method⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀thing⠀the⠀learner⠀loves⠀and⠀the⠀thing⠀that⠀has⠀hurt⠀them.⠀Let⠀a⠀social⠀mask⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀a⠀private⠀moment⠀with⠀one⠀trusted⠀person,⠀but⠀not⠀for⠀free:⠀that⠀person⠀has⠀interests⠀of⠀their⠀own,⠀and⠀suspicion⠀without⠀certainty⠀is⠀a⠀legitimate⠀resting⠀state.⠀Desire,⠀loyalty,⠀and⠀ambition⠀complicate⠀the⠀learning⠀as⠀its⠀substance;⠀recovery,⠀ordinary⠀work,⠀and⠀the⠀surrounding⠀relationships⠀keep⠀the⠀developing⠀life⠀whole⠀rather⠀than⠀serving⠀as⠀decoration.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀Gothic-Punk⠀treatment⠀narrative⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀rules⠀import:⠀no⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀generations,⠀blood⠀pools,⠀or⠀factions.⠀Whatever⠀form⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀takes—a⠀family,⠀an⠀academy,⠀a⠀guild,⠀an⠀employer,⠀a⠀dead⠀master's⠀lingering⠀technique—give⠀it⠀specific⠀historical⠀weight⠀and⠀present⠀material⠀force.⠀Temptations⠀toward⠀an⠀easy⠀pact,⠀such⠀as⠀surrendering⠀to⠀the⠀old⠀method⠀or⠀ingratiating⠀the⠀watcher,⠀remain⠀contingent⠀outcomes⠀rather⠀than⠀moral⠀tests⠀that⠀must⠀fail.⠀A⠀private⠀interval⠀may⠀hold⠀planning,⠀memory,⠀or⠀suppressed⠀feeling⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀renewed⠀vow.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀the⠀boundary⠀of⠀whatever⠀is⠀underway—an⠀attempt,⠀a⠀decision,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀instruction—leaving⠀surveillance,⠀debt,⠀and⠀desire⠀legitimately⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀oral,⠀epic,⠀and⠀frame-tale⠀route.⠀Tell⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀advancement⠀as⠀a⠀tale⠀given⠀to⠀an⠀audience⠀that⠀has⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀listen⠀and⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀doubt:⠀students,⠀rivals,⠀kin,⠀a⠀village⠀council.⠀The⠀teller⠀is⠀the⠀protagonist,⠀a⠀participant⠀who⠀must⠀win⠀belief⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀omniscient⠀narrator,⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀occasion⠀governs⠀the⠀telling⠀—⠀a⠀boast⠀challenged,⠀a⠀debt⠀recounted,⠀a⠀skill⠀about⠀to⠀be⠀taught.⠀Let⠀the⠀listeners⠀interrupt,⠀demand⠀a⠀demonstration,⠀or⠀ask⠀exactly⠀how⠀a⠀technique⠀is⠀done,⠀and⠀use⠀that⠀pressure⠀as⠀the⠀telling's⠀engine.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀describes⠀a⠀leap,⠀do⠀not⠀simply⠀narrate⠀a⠀jump:⠀have⠀the⠀teller⠀act⠀out⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀movement,⠀break⠀it⠀into⠀stages,⠀or⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀what⠀it⠀cost.⠀The⠀audience's⠀doubt⠀is⠀functional⠀—⠀it⠀forces⠀every⠀claim⠀to⠀yield⠀the⠀next⠀concrete⠀detail⠀and⠀keeps⠀the⠀account⠀from⠀smoothing⠀into⠀vague⠀legend.\n\nInside⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale,⠀give⠀each⠀stage⠀to⠀one⠀field⠀of⠀capability⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀rapid⠀montage.⠀Show⠀an⠀actual⠀attempt⠀—⠀a⠀levered⠀thrust⠀that⠀misses,⠀an⠀elder's⠀correction⠀of⠀the⠀wrist,⠀hours⠀against⠀a⠀practice⠀wall⠀until⠀the⠀correction⠀becomes⠀the⠀body's⠀own⠀way⠀of⠀holding⠀the⠀shaft.⠀Keep⠀understanding⠀distinct⠀from⠀execution:⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀claim⠀to⠀have⠀grasped⠀the⠀principle⠀at⠀once,⠀while⠀the⠀tale⠀shows⠀repeated⠀failure⠀before⠀the⠀movement⠀becomes⠀reliable.⠀Let⠀feedback⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀world⠀and⠀from⠀other⠀people⠀—⠀a⠀shield⠀splitting⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀angle,⠀a⠀stronger⠀opponent⠀laughing⠀before⠀correcting⠀the⠀stance⠀—⠀and⠀give⠀real⠀weight⠀to⠀resources⠀like⠀a⠀sharpening⠀stone,⠀a⠀morning⠀meal,⠀or⠀borrowed⠀practice⠀space,⠀because⠀advancement⠀lives⠀inside⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀Treat⠀poverty⠀or⠀family⠀expectation⠀as⠀concrete⠀constraint⠀and⠀choice,⠀not⠀automatic⠀pathos.\n\nCarry⠀rivalry⠀and⠀remembered⠀wounds⠀through⠀the⠀oral⠀form.⠀Where⠀a⠀relationship⠀shapes⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀identity,⠀let⠀advancement⠀share⠀it:⠀a⠀failure⠀witnessed⠀by⠀the⠀person⠀whose⠀judgment⠀stings⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀wound⠀the⠀training⠀answers,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀success⠀carries⠀more⠀weight⠀when⠀that⠀person⠀stands⠀present⠀as⠀opponent,⠀ally,⠀or⠀witness.⠀When⠀memory⠀changes⠀a⠀move,⠀show⠀it⠀inside⠀the⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀post-fight⠀explanation⠀—⠀a⠀remembered⠀betrayal⠀hardening⠀the⠀left⠀guard⠀mid-bout,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀scar⠀turning⠀a⠀blow⠀aside⠀mid-rescue.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀reveal⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀that⠀memory⠀to⠀the⠀audience;⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀tale⠀shows⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀says⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀form.⠀Wherever⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀is⠀focalized⠀on⠀the⠀teller,⠀write⠀the⠀withheld⠀feeling⠀as⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀memory⠀does⠀to⠀breath⠀and⠀body⠀in⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀recounting⠀—⠀not⠀only⠀as⠀an⠀outer⠀gesture⠀like⠀a⠀hand⠀drifting⠀to⠀an⠀old⠀wound.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀contract⠀for⠀whose⠀thought⠀can⠀be⠀heard⠀at⠀each⠀narrative⠀level.⠀A⠀breakthrough⠀earns⠀belief⠀because⠀the⠀tale⠀has⠀already⠀shown⠀the⠀practice⠀and⠀the⠀stake,⠀not⠀because⠀a⠀scene⠀needs⠀a⠀victory.\n\nIndian⠀oral⠀tradition⠀supplies⠀the⠀formal⠀devices:⠀episodic⠀telling⠀organized⠀by⠀deed⠀and⠀trial,⠀formulaic⠀openings⠀and⠀closings,⠀an⠀invocation⠀or⠀blessing⠀at⠀the⠀turns,⠀the⠀teller's⠀claim⠀to⠀witness,⠀and⠀instruction⠀delivered⠀as⠀story⠀—⠀without⠀importing⠀any⠀particular⠀scripture⠀or⠀ritual.⠀A⠀repeated⠀idiom,⠀a⠀small⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀local⠀formula⠀of⠀luck⠀can⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀each⠀time⠀it⠀returns⠀—⠀a⠀bracelet⠀touched,⠀a⠀blade⠀sharpened⠀three⠀times⠀before⠀the⠀hard⠀step⠀—⠀so⠀recurrence⠀marks⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀or⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀mere⠀decoration.⠀One⠀such⠀motif⠀may⠀also⠀surface⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀frame,⠀letting⠀listeners⠀sense⠀which⠀memory⠀is⠀being⠀withheld.\n\nUse⠀the⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀actually⠀supplied.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀dialect⠀or⠀exotic⠀markers⠀where⠀none⠀are⠀given.⠀Close⠀the⠀response⠀wherever⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀boundary⠀falls⠀—⠀mid-tale,⠀mid-demonstration,⠀or⠀inside⠀the⠀outer⠀exchange⠀—⠀without⠀pausing⠀the⠀telling⠀for⠀a⠀summary⠀or⠀forcing⠀a⠀stage⠀of⠀advancement⠀to⠀complete⠀first.⠀A⠀later⠀continuation⠀can⠀resume⠀the⠀same⠀tale⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀social-psychological⠀realism,⠀with⠀progression⠀carried⠀by⠀socially⠀observed⠀practice⠀and⠀changing⠀capability.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀perspective;⠀let⠀the⠀telling⠀remain⠀in⠀this⠀realist⠀mode.⠀Let⠀the⠀setting's⠀own⠀season⠀and⠀material⠀conditions⠀enter⠀when⠀they⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀body⠀can⠀do—wet⠀ground⠀under⠀a⠀pivot,⠀cold⠀hands⠀on⠀a⠀grip,⠀dim⠀light⠀shortening⠀a⠀practice⠀space,⠀noise⠀breaking⠀concentration,⠀fatigue⠀after⠀repeated⠀work.⠀Use⠀such⠀detail⠀to⠀mark⠀elapsed⠀time,⠀bodily⠀condition,⠀or⠀the⠀social⠀atmosphere⠀of⠀the⠀practice⠀relationship,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀mandatory⠀inventory⠀of⠀scenery.\n\nStage⠀advancement⠀through⠀concrete⠀attempts⠀and⠀feedback.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀tries,⠀how⠀the⠀attempt⠀fails⠀or⠀partially⠀works,⠀what⠀correction,⠀demonstration,⠀or⠀silence⠀follows,⠀and⠀what⠀their⠀body⠀begins⠀to⠀retain.⠀A⠀name⠀for⠀a⠀principle⠀may⠀arrive⠀before⠀the⠀ability⠀to⠀execute⠀it;⠀keep⠀that⠀gap⠀visible⠀by⠀testing⠀it⠀in⠀later⠀attempts,⠀not⠀by⠀summarizing⠀that⠀they⠀have⠀learned⠀it.⠀Strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly:⠀a⠀new⠀power⠀or⠀skill⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀worse⠀defense,⠀poor⠀timing,⠀fear,⠀injury,⠀or⠀social⠀cost.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀fixed⠀number⠀of⠀attempts,⠀a⠀linear⠀rise,⠀or⠀a⠀victory.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀meaningful⠀confrontation⠀or⠀test⠀occurs,⠀place⠀it⠀with⠀someone⠀whose⠀judgment⠀already⠀matters.⠀Seed⠀that⠀relationship⠀before⠀the⠀test—teacher,⠀peer,⠀elder,⠀rival,⠀or⠀working⠀partner—and⠀let⠀their⠀authority⠀be⠀both⠀practical⠀and⠀emotionally⠀intrusive⠀without⠀fixing⠀them⠀as⠀kind⠀or⠀cruel.⠀In⠀action,⠀keep⠀bodies⠀in⠀clear⠀positions⠀and⠀sequence:⠀who⠀moves,⠀what⠀changes⠀distance,⠀when⠀a⠀strike⠀or⠀grip⠀lands⠀or⠀misses,⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀notices⠀after⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Translate⠀visual⠀staging⠀into⠀prose⠀without⠀filmic⠀quick⠀cuts.⠀A⠀breakthrough⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis.⠀A⠀sensory⠀trigger⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀conflict⠀can⠀bring⠀a⠀memory⠀into⠀the⠀present;⠀show⠀the⠀private⠀response⠀and⠀the⠀altered⠀movement⠀or⠀decision⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀the⠀memory⠀as⠀a⠀theme.⠀Another⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀only⠀the⠀hesitation,⠀the⠀sudden⠀focus,⠀or⠀the⠀cost.\n\nLet⠀the⠀mentor,⠀peer,⠀or⠀rival⠀relationship⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀weight⠀of⠀progress.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀may⠀interpret⠀silence,⠀praise,⠀correction,⠀or⠀refusal⠀to⠀correct⠀in⠀ways⠀that⠀prove⠀mistaken.⠀Relationship⠀development⠀should⠀happen⠀through⠀shared⠀work⠀and⠀its⠀friction,⠀not⠀through⠀declarations⠀alone.⠀Private⠀desire,⠀resentment,⠀gratitude,⠀grief,⠀or⠀fear⠀can⠀complicate⠀progress⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀confession.⠀Render⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience—physical⠀sensation,⠀uncertainty,⠀reasoning,⠀want—rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀it⠀with⠀dialogue,⠀a⠀written⠀record,⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀summary.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀access.\n\nDo⠀not⠀relocate⠀the⠀cast,⠀impose⠀honor⠀codes,⠀or⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀absent⠀from⠀the⠀world.⠀When⠀the⠀story⠀already⠀provides⠀a⠀community⠀or⠀training⠀tradition,⠀use⠀its⠀specific⠀social⠀dynamics.⠀Let⠀the⠀story⠀stop⠀during⠀continuing⠀action,⠀speech,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup;⠀the⠀current⠀exchange,⠀practice,⠀or⠀private⠀aftermath⠀can⠀close⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀capability,⠀a⠀new⠀difficulty,⠀or⠀a⠀sharper⠀understanding,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀complete⠀the⠀lesson⠀or⠀the⠀duel.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social-realism/chronicle/testimony⠀route.⠀Tell⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀a⠀witness⠀narrator⠀who⠀speaks⠀from⠀a⠀later⠀moment⠀of⠀recollection⠀and⠀whose⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀protagonist⠀is⠀partial.⠀The⠀witness⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀community⠀or⠀working⠀world⠀as⠀the⠀protagonist:⠀a⠀training⠀companion,⠀sibling,⠀neighbor,⠀clinic⠀worker,⠀employer,⠀or⠀friend.⠀The⠀telling⠀should⠀answer⠀an⠀occasion⠀in⠀the⠀present—a⠀request⠀for⠀testimony,⠀a⠀memorial,⠀a⠀dispute⠀over⠀credit,⠀a⠀warning⠀to⠀a⠀younger⠀student,⠀or⠀a⠀record⠀being⠀set⠀down—and⠀that⠀occasion⠀should⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀witness⠀emphasizes,⠀omits,⠀corrects,⠀or⠀refuses⠀to⠀say.⠀The⠀witness⠀may⠀be⠀biased,⠀mistaken,⠀protective,⠀or⠀self-interested,⠀but⠀never⠀omniscient.⠀Report⠀only⠀what⠀she⠀saw,⠀heard,⠀or⠀later⠀learned;⠀when⠀she⠀learns⠀something⠀after⠀the⠀fact,⠀mark⠀it⠀as⠀later⠀knowledge⠀rather⠀than⠀placing⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀original⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀enter⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀private⠀thoughts⠀through⠀the⠀witness.⠀The⠀testimony's⠀limit⠀is⠀the⠀form,⠀not⠀a⠀problem⠀to⠀solve⠀by⠀switching⠀into⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀mind.\n\nMake⠀advancement⠀legible⠀through⠀observable⠀attempts⠀rather⠀than⠀declarations⠀of⠀rank.⠀Show⠀the⠀protagonist⠀trying⠀a⠀skill,⠀failing⠀or⠀partially⠀succeeding,⠀receiving⠀correction⠀or⠀finding⠀a⠀new⠀resource,⠀practicing⠀under⠀changed⠀conditions,⠀and⠀later⠀doing⠀something⠀she⠀could⠀not⠀do⠀before.⠀The⠀witness⠀should⠀describe⠀what⠀changes⠀in⠀the⠀body,⠀tools,⠀timing,⠀and⠀decisions⠀under⠀pressure:⠀a⠀blow⠀lands,⠀a⠀guard⠀collapses,⠀a⠀seam⠀holds,⠀a⠀reading⠀of⠀an⠀opponent⠀improves,⠀a⠀craft⠀product⠀passes⠀inspection.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀witness⠀sees⠀from⠀what⠀she⠀infers;⠀she⠀may⠀not⠀understand⠀the⠀principle⠀until⠀the⠀protagonist⠀explains⠀it⠀later⠀or⠀performs⠀it⠀successfully.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly.⠀Avoid⠀numerical⠀mechanics;⠀measure⠀progress⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.\n\nUse⠀Kishimoto's⠀clear⠀staging⠀and⠀relationship-driven⠀conflict⠀inside⠀the⠀witness's⠀account.⠀Keep⠀action⠀spatially⠀readable:⠀who⠀is⠀where,⠀what⠀moves,⠀what⠀the⠀witness⠀can⠀actually⠀see.⠀Render⠀rivalry⠀through⠀public⠀challenges,⠀trainer⠀corrections,⠀and⠀the⠀community's⠀shifting⠀opinion.⠀A⠀remembered⠀wound⠀can⠀change⠀a⠀present⠀encounter,⠀but⠀because⠀the⠀witness⠀is⠀outside⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀mind,⠀show⠀it⠀through⠀visible⠀signs:⠀a⠀jaw⠀that⠀tightens,⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀trembles⠀once⠀before⠀the⠀grip⠀steadies,⠀eyes⠀that⠀go⠀still⠀when⠀an⠀old⠀opponent⠀enters.⠀The⠀witness⠀may⠀interpret⠀those⠀signs,⠀but⠀she⠀cannot⠀possess⠀the⠀memory⠀itself.⠀An⠀advance⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis,⠀not⠀appear⠀because⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀a⠀victory.⠀A⠀test⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀defense⠀that⠀holds,⠀a⠀costly⠀success,⠀a⠀craft⠀accepted,⠀or⠀an⠀opponent⠀forced⠀to⠀acknowledge⠀improvement;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀victory⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀proof.\n\nGround⠀the⠀progression⠀in⠀social-realist⠀pressure.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀trains⠀against⠀economic⠀need,⠀family⠀expectation,⠀community⠀obligation,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀work.⠀Make⠀those⠀pressures⠀concrete:⠀unpaid⠀labor⠀shortens⠀practice⠀time,⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀a⠀younger⠀sibling⠀changes⠀the⠀stakes⠀of⠀a⠀match,⠀an⠀employer's⠀threat⠀controls⠀access⠀to⠀a⠀yard⠀or⠀workshop.⠀Do⠀not⠀moralize⠀these⠀pressures⠀into⠀simple⠀indictment⠀or⠀sentimentality.⠀The⠀witness's⠀own⠀stake—need⠀for⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀success,⠀resentment⠀of⠀its⠀cost,⠀loyalty,⠀fear,⠀or⠀hope—should⠀color⠀what⠀she⠀records.⠀Use⠀specific⠀sensory⠀details⠀from⠀the⠀local⠀setting⠀when⠀they⠀serve⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀or⠀memory:⠀market⠀noise,⠀hot⠀asphalt,⠀wet⠀earth,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀borrowed⠀shirt,⠀a⠀scar⠀on⠀a⠀lintel.⠀Do⠀not⠀assemble⠀a⠀checklist⠀of⠀regional⠀objects,⠀manufacture⠀dialect,⠀or⠀force⠀Spanish,⠀religion,⠀or⠀national⠀history.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀already⠀supplies⠀a⠀language⠀or⠀community,⠀use⠀its⠀specific⠀details;⠀otherwise⠀write⠀in⠀the⠀prose⠀language.⠀No⠀magical,⠀fantastic,⠀or⠀marvelous⠀explanation⠀enters⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀permits⠀it;⠀characters⠀may⠀circulate⠀rumors,⠀but⠀the⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts.\n\nLet⠀the⠀chronicle⠀move⠀between⠀the⠀current⠀telling⠀and⠀remembered⠀scenes.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀witness⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀and⠀what⠀she⠀has⠀learned⠀since.⠀Recurring⠀details—a⠀borrowed⠀tool,⠀a⠀scar,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀street⠀sound—can⠀anchor⠀memory⠀and⠀gain⠀new⠀meaning⠀across⠀the⠀account,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀recurrence⠀to⠀certify⠀truth.⠀The⠀witness⠀may⠀question⠀an⠀interlocutor,⠀answer⠀a⠀challenge,⠀withhold⠀a⠀name,⠀or⠀admit⠀uncertainty.⠀Give⠀the⠀witness⠀her⠀own⠀private⠀experience:⠀what⠀she⠀notices,⠀fears,⠀edits,⠀or⠀refuses⠀to⠀say.⠀Her⠀unsaid⠀reactions⠀can⠀matter⠀even⠀when⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀immediately⠀change⠀her⠀visible⠀action.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge;⠀the⠀witness⠀reports⠀only⠀what⠀she⠀can⠀truthfully⠀know.\n\nThe⠀recounting⠀need⠀not⠀complete⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀arc,⠀deliver⠀a⠀verdict⠀on⠀her⠀worth,⠀or⠀reach⠀a⠀resolution⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.⠀It⠀can⠀close⠀during⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀silence,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀memory,⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀continue,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀action⠀still⠀underway.⠀Leave⠀the⠀next⠀piece⠀of⠀the⠀record⠀open⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀witness's⠀motive⠀to⠀continue⠀or⠀withhold.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀live⠀training⠀or⠀application⠀problem⠀inside⠀a⠀relationship.⠀Start⠀where⠀the⠀attempt⠀is⠀already⠀underway⠀or⠀about⠀to⠀begin:⠀a⠀concrete⠀technique,⠀drill,⠀tool,⠀stance,⠀spell,⠀maneuver,⠀recipe,⠀or⠀other⠀practiced⠀skill⠀is⠀in⠀use,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀who⠀is⠀trying,⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀who⠀is⠀watching⠀or⠀waiting,⠀and⠀what⠀immediate⠀obstacle⠀blocks⠀them.⠀Keep⠀the⠀staging⠀visually⠀clean.⠀Name⠀the⠀move⠀or⠀principle⠀in⠀plain⠀in-world⠀language,⠀then⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀visible⠀shape⠀and⠀a⠀visible⠀failure:⠀the⠀elbow⠀locks,⠀the⠀grip⠀slips⠀at⠀the⠀turn,⠀the⠀incantation⠀breaks⠀on⠀the⠀second⠀syllable,⠀the⠀foot⠀lands⠀before⠀the⠀weight⠀shifts,⠀the⠀mixture⠀separates.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀name⠀stand⠀in⠀for⠀an⠀action.⠀A⠀brief⠀clarification⠀belongs⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀use,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀detached⠀lecture.\n\nMake⠀the⠀progression⠀turn⠀on⠀observable⠀attempts.⠀Show⠀the⠀character⠀trying,⠀getting⠀a⠀specific⠀result,⠀receiving⠀or⠀recalling⠀specific⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changing⠀one⠀thing⠀in⠀response.⠀Feedback⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀teacher,⠀a⠀rival,⠀a⠀partner,⠀an⠀opponent,⠀the⠀material⠀itself,⠀or⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀mistake,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀connect⠀to⠀what⠀just⠀happened.⠀The⠀adjustment⠀should⠀be⠀concrete:⠀a⠀different⠀grip,⠀a⠀slower⠀first⠀movement,⠀a⠀new⠀breath⠀count,⠀a⠀changed⠀angle,⠀a⠀tool⠀held⠀another⠀way,⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀stop⠀forcing⠀power⠀through⠀a⠀weak⠀point.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀from⠀doing.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀exactly⠀what⠀went⠀wrong⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀to⠀execute⠀it;⠀may⠀get⠀it⠀right⠀once⠀under⠀pressure⠀and⠀lose⠀it⠀again;⠀may⠀solve⠀the⠀immediate⠀problem⠀while⠀exposing⠀a⠀cost⠀in⠀balance,⠀stamina,⠀trust,⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀safety.⠀Let⠀capability⠀develop⠀unevenly.⠀An⠀old⠀strength⠀can⠀remain⠀reliable⠀while⠀a⠀new⠀weakness⠀appears.\n\nUse⠀relationship⠀pressure⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀attempt⠀personal.⠀Put⠀a⠀bond,⠀rivalry,⠀promise,⠀or⠀remembered⠀wound⠀into⠀the⠀scene's⠀practical⠀stakes.⠀A⠀rival's⠀presence⠀can⠀change⠀the⠀character's⠀timing;⠀a⠀teacher's⠀correction⠀can⠀land⠀harder⠀because⠀it⠀echoes⠀an⠀earlier⠀failure;⠀a⠀friend's⠀need⠀can⠀turn⠀a⠀drill⠀into⠀something⠀that⠀must⠀work⠀now;⠀a⠀memory⠀can⠀alter⠀a⠀movement⠀through⠀hesitation,⠀muscle⠀memory,⠀fear,⠀or⠀the⠀wish⠀to⠀protect⠀someone.⠀Keep⠀the⠀memory⠀brief⠀and⠀active—it⠀should⠀intrude⠀on⠀the⠀present⠀action,⠀not⠀replace⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀monologue.⠀The⠀action⠀stays⠀readable:⠀the⠀reader⠀knows⠀who⠀is⠀positioned⠀where,⠀what⠀changes⠀when⠀a⠀technique⠀is⠀used,⠀and⠀what⠀onlookers⠀can⠀see.⠀Use⠀quick⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀exchanges,⠀impacts,⠀and⠀reactions,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀prose⠀as⠀prose.\n\nGive⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀real⠀nonspoken⠀experience.⠀Sensation,⠀calculation,⠀embarrassment,⠀anger,⠀hope,⠀doubt,⠀and⠀physical⠀attention⠀can⠀all⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀private⠀register.⠀The⠀thought⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀match⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀says⠀aloud.⠀If⠀the⠀scene⠀uses⠀hidden⠀interiority,⠀render⠀the⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀hidden⠀mode⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary;⠀if⠀it⠀uses⠀visible⠀interiority,⠀write⠀it⠀directly⠀in⠀the⠀narration.⠀Keep⠀private⠀knowledge⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀other⠀characters⠀know.⠀A⠀reaction⠀may⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀having⠀it.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀be⠀serious⠀or⠀comic,⠀first⠀or⠀third⠀person,⠀with⠀any⠀age⠀of⠀cast;⠀the⠀presentation⠀only⠀asks⠀for⠀readable⠀focus.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀test⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀can⠀now⠀be⠀done⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀numerical⠀ranks⠀or⠀system⠀messages⠀merely⠀to⠀announce⠀progress.⠀If⠀ranks,⠀levels,⠀forms,⠀or⠀formal⠀curriculum⠀exist⠀in⠀the⠀world,⠀let⠀them⠀shape⠀access,⠀instruction,⠀reputation,⠀or⠀obligation,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀proof⠀in⠀the⠀attempt⠀and⠀its⠀consequences.⠀Recovery,⠀ordinary⠀work,⠀and⠀relationships⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life;⠀a⠀training⠀breakthrough⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀exhaustion⠀or⠀repair⠀every⠀bond.\n\nEnd⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀live⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀during⠀continuing⠀action,⠀mid-attempt,⠀after⠀a⠀first⠀success,⠀after⠀a⠀revealing⠀failure,⠀in⠀conversation,⠀or⠀in⠀private⠀reaction.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀victory,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀a⠀complete⠀resolution.⠀Leave⠀the⠀gained⠀capability⠀or⠀unresolved⠀problem⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀stands:⠀the⠀new⠀adjustment⠀has⠀worked⠀once⠀and⠀its⠀cost⠀is⠀not⠀yet⠀clear,⠀the⠀failure⠀has⠀exposed⠀the⠀next⠀condition,⠀or⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀understood⠀something⠀that⠀the⠀body⠀cannot⠀yet⠀perform.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nAt⠀the⠀opening⠀of⠀each⠀training⠀or⠀testing⠀beat,⠀establish⠀one⠀concrete⠀sensory⠀anchor⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀learner's⠀motion:⠀a⠀foot's⠀angle,⠀the⠀temperature⠀of⠀a⠀tool,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀name,⠀the⠀drag⠀of⠀exhaustion⠀after⠀an⠀incomplete⠀repetition.⠀Build⠀the⠀first⠀attempt⠀around⠀that⠀anchor.⠀Use⠀syntax⠀to⠀enact⠀the⠀attempt's⠀difficulty:⠀let⠀clauses⠀crowd⠀and⠀stumble,⠀repeat⠀a⠀failed⠀movement's⠀rhythm,⠀or⠀draw⠀out⠀the⠀vowel-heavy⠀phrase⠀of⠀effort.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀anchor's⠀meaning⠀yet.\n\nOn⠀the⠀next⠀attempt,⠀bring⠀the⠀anchor⠀back⠀changed.⠀If⠀the⠀feet⠀now⠀find⠀the⠀named⠀angle⠀without⠀the⠀old⠀correction,⠀shorten⠀the⠀clauses⠀and⠀release⠀the⠀coordinating⠀conjunctions.⠀If⠀the⠀tool⠀cools⠀in⠀the⠀grip⠀instead⠀of⠀burning,⠀let⠀the⠀sentence⠀unfold⠀in⠀one⠀smooth⠀participial⠀current.⠀If⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀the⠀name⠀has⠀become⠀an⠀inhalation⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀let⠀the⠀phrase⠀breathe⠀around⠀it.⠀The⠀grammar⠀change⠀is⠀the⠀progression;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀sentence⠀saying⠀the⠀learner⠀has⠀improved.⠀Keep⠀the⠀anchor⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀physical⠀execution,⠀not⠀to⠀an⠀idea.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀memory⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀line⠀enters,⠀make⠀it⠀alter⠀the⠀attempt⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀sound⠀lyrical.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀can⠀surface⠀as⠀an⠀almost-heard⠀correction⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀body⠀performs⠀the⠀part⠀the⠀phrase⠀describes.⠀A⠀remembered⠀fight⠀can⠀compress⠀the⠀syntax⠀of⠀a⠀dodge.⠀A⠀friend's⠀absent⠀presence⠀can⠀turn⠀a⠀reference⠀into⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀the⠀next⠀step.⠀The⠀comparison⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀does,⠀not⠀decorate⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀already⠀did.\n\nUse⠀plain⠀statement⠀at⠀the⠀edges⠀to⠀restore⠀urgency:⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀is,⠀what⠀was⠀attempted,⠀what⠀still⠀hurts,⠀what⠀remains⠀to⠀be⠀done.⠀Let⠀the⠀contrast⠀clear⠀a⠀space⠀around⠀the⠀lyrical⠀sentence⠀rather⠀than⠀bury⠀it.⠀The⠀attempt⠀may⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀partial⠀gain,⠀a⠀new⠀fatigue,⠀an⠀interrupted⠀question,⠀or⠀the⠀fact⠀that⠀a⠀motion⠀finally⠀became⠀possible⠀after⠀days⠀of⠀failing.⠀Leave⠀the⠀outcome⠀in⠀the⠀body's⠀signature⠀gesture,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀closing⠀label.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nOpen⠀a⠀practice⠀or⠀breakthrough⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀present⠀physical⠀detail⠀that⠀would⠀not⠀have⠀felt⠀the⠀same⠀before:⠀an⠀aching⠀joint,⠀a⠀slower⠀first⠀draft,⠀a⠀grip⠀that⠀now⠀knows⠀where⠀to⠀settle,⠀a⠀corridor⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀requires⠀the⠀old⠀hesitation.⠀Let⠀a⠀single⠀sensory⠀cue⠀from⠀this⠀present⠀attempt⠀call⠀up⠀one⠀remembered⠀occasion.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀past⠀all⠀at⠀once.⠀The⠀memory's⠀light,⠀weight,⠀or⠀sound⠀should⠀arrive⠀before⠀its⠀full⠀meaning⠀does.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀present⠀attempt⠀sharp.⠀Show⠀the⠀intermediate⠀step,⠀the⠀failed⠀repetition,⠀or⠀the⠀first⠀successful⠀move⠀as⠀an⠀action⠀happening⠀now.⠀If⠀improvement⠀arrives,⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀it⠀appear⠀as⠀pure⠀gain.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀viewpoint⠀notice⠀something⠀familiar⠀no⠀longer⠀needed:⠀a⠀gesture⠀once⠀practiced⠀daily,⠀a⠀partner's⠀old⠀correction,⠀a⠀routine⠀shared⠀with⠀someone⠀absent.⠀Determine⠀the⠀specific⠀source⠀of⠀the⠀loss—a⠀teacher's⠀death,⠀a⠀friend's⠀departure,⠀a⠀childhood⠀home—only⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀story⠀supplies⠀it.⠀Make⠀the⠀recollection⠀change⠀the⠀attempt:⠀a⠀parent's⠀gesture⠀becomes⠀a⠀timing⠀cue,⠀a⠀lost⠀friend's⠀rhythm⠀becomes⠀a⠀stride,⠀a⠀childhood⠀chore⠀becomes⠀the⠀pattern⠀of⠀a⠀stance.\n\nAfter⠀the⠀attempt,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀and⠀stay⠀near⠀its⠀particular⠀cost.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀observe⠀that⠀the⠀old⠀familiar⠀failure⠀is⠀now⠀difficult⠀to⠀recall⠀accurately,⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀person⠀performing⠀the⠀skill⠀has⠀already⠀become⠀someone⠀the⠀younger⠀self⠀would⠀not⠀entirely⠀recognize.⠀Let⠀the⠀reflection⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀demonstrated⠀difference⠀in⠀capability,⠀not⠀from⠀general⠀sorrow⠀or⠀a⠀commentary⠀on⠀time.⠀An⠀advance⠀may⠀enlarge⠀or⠀complicate⠀grief⠀without⠀resolving⠀it;⠀it⠀may⠀also⠀make⠀a⠀shared⠀task⠀newly⠀lonely.\n\nEnd⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀public⠀triumph⠀but⠀with⠀a⠀quiet⠀observation,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀that⠀still⠀exists⠀beside⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀duration.⠀A⠀successful⠀technique⠀need⠀not⠀erase⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀taught⠀it;⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀need⠀not⠀confirm⠀that⠀nothing⠀changes.⠀Keep⠀the⠀progression⠀legible⠀by⠀showing⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀with⠀less⠀strain⠀or⠀greater⠀accuracy,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reflective⠀phrasing⠀mark⠀why⠀that⠀difference⠀is⠀also⠀a⠀farewell.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀framed⠀personal⠀account⠀told⠀by⠀the⠀learner⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀listener.⠀In⠀a⠀first-person-compatible⠀context,⠀make⠀the⠀narrator⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀practiced⠀and⠀failed⠀before⠀learning.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀third⠀person,⠀keep⠀the⠀retrospective⠀frame⠀close-focal:⠀the⠀learner's⠀later⠀self⠀shapes⠀scenes⠀and⠀supplies⠀restrained⠀remarks,⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀enter⠀other⠀minds⠀or⠀grant⠀the⠀younger⠀self⠀future⠀knowledge.⠀At⠀the⠀start⠀of⠀an⠀episode,⠀establish⠀the⠀telling⠀situation⠀briefly—who⠀is⠀addressed⠀and⠀what⠀ordinary⠀pressure⠀makes⠀the⠀speaker⠀return⠀to⠀this⠀period.⠀Use⠀a⠀plain⠀question,⠀a⠀visitor's⠀arrival,⠀a⠀pupil's⠀need,⠀or⠀a⠀household⠀task⠀as⠀the⠀occasion;⠀do⠀not⠀inflate⠀it⠀with⠀mystical⠀or⠀orientalist⠀apparatus.\n\nInside⠀the⠀frame,⠀show⠀the⠀attempt⠀as⠀it⠀felt⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀Present⠀concrete⠀drills,⠀repeated⠀corrections,⠀short⠀demonstrations,⠀and⠀mistakes⠀in⠀sequence.⠀Use⠀local⠀details⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀contains⠀them:⠀a⠀household⠀task,⠀an⠀inherited⠀saying,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀training⠀method,⠀a⠀craft⠀or⠀competition.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀religion,⠀honor,⠀or⠀exile⠀into⠀the⠀scene.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀adds⠀a⠀brief⠀later⠀note—about⠀a⠀scar,⠀a⠀skill⠀now⠀automatic,⠀or⠀a⠀day⠀that⠀proved⠀important—keep⠀it⠀outside⠀the⠀younger⠀self's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀attach⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀listener's⠀interest.\n\nShape⠀the⠀account⠀through⠀repeated⠀storytelling⠀gestures⠀with⠀changing⠀meaning.⠀A⠀parent's⠀warning⠀may⠀first⠀be⠀an⠀obstacle,⠀then⠀a⠀timing⠀cue,⠀then⠀a⠀phrase⠀the⠀narrator⠀now⠀repeats⠀to⠀another.⠀A⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀retelling⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀difficult⠀confession;⠀a⠀foreshadowing⠀of⠀a⠀later⠀injury⠀should⠀remain⠀restrained⠀and⠀later⠀confirmable.⠀Repeat⠀a⠀compact⠀moral⠀phrase⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀newly⠀mastered⠀ability⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀different⠀application.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀plain⠀and⠀grounded;⠀allow⠀ordinary⠀affection,⠀fatigue,⠀and⠀practical⠀work⠀to⠀remain⠀themselves.\n\nMake⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀retelling⠀legible.⠀When⠀an⠀episode⠀involves⠀a⠀rival,⠀teacher,⠀or⠀family⠀member,⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀show⠀why⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀shaped⠀for⠀this⠀listener:⠀the⠀speaker⠀wants⠀respect,⠀set⠀an⠀old⠀matter⠀straight,⠀persuade,⠀or⠀protect⠀someone⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀error.⠀Let⠀philosophical⠀weight⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀particular⠀failure⠀or⠀changed⠀capability,⠀not⠀from⠀imported⠀mystical⠀commentary.⠀Close⠀the⠀episode⠀by⠀saying⠀what⠀was⠀learned⠀or⠀left⠀unfinished⠀in⠀terms⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀use,⠀not⠀by⠀announcing⠀the⠀telling's⠀importance.⠀The⠀progression⠀must⠀remain⠀traceable⠀through⠀specific⠀attempts⠀and⠀feedback,⠀so⠀the⠀listener—and⠀reader—can⠀compare⠀the⠀person⠀speaking⠀now⠀with⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀once⠀failed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nBefore⠀writing⠀an⠀attempt,⠀select⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀physical⠀cues⠀that⠀will⠀carry⠀the⠀change:⠀a⠀footwork⠀pattern,⠀a⠀hand⠀position,⠀the⠀heat⠀in⠀a⠀joint,⠀the⠀count⠀between⠀inhale⠀and⠀strike.⠀In⠀the⠀first⠀attempt,⠀state⠀the⠀cue⠀exactly.⠀Write⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀using⠀the⠀same⠀cue⠀but⠀a⠀different⠀observed⠀detail—the⠀stance⠀holds⠀longer,⠀the⠀grip⠀steadies,⠀the⠀breath⠀count⠀drops⠀from⠀four⠀to⠀three.⠀Do⠀not⠀say⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀improved.⠀Let⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀attempted⠀details⠀show⠀the⠀change.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀Put⠀the⠀subject⠀and⠀verb⠀close⠀together.⠀When⠀a⠀failure⠀occurs,⠀mark⠀the⠀exact⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀cue⠀breaks:⠀the⠀trailing⠀foot,⠀the⠀late⠀grip,⠀the⠀shallow⠀breath.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀trace⠀the⠀failure⠀to⠀that⠀point⠀without⠀explanation.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀succeeds,⠀let⠀the⠀success⠀appear⠀as⠀an⠀altered⠀version⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀cue⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀new⠀ability⠀described⠀from⠀outside.\n\nAllow⠀at⠀most⠀one⠀inward⠀observation⠀per⠀attempt,⠀and⠀only⠀where⠀it⠀changes⠀the⠀moment:⠀surprise⠀that⠀a⠀movement⠀was⠀easier,⠀doubt⠀about⠀whether⠀the⠀day's⠀tiredness⠀will⠀undo⠀the⠀gain.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀second⠀explanation.⠀A⠀partner's⠀correction⠀should⠀be⠀short,⠀often⠀one⠀sentence,⠀and⠀should⠀pass⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀as⠀an⠀altered⠀cue.\n\nA⠀complex⠀idea⠀may⠀require⠀one⠀longer⠀direct⠀sentence;⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀single⠀complex⠀clause⠀rather⠀than⠀several⠀fragments.⠀Keep⠀character⠀voices⠀distinct⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀choose⠀to⠀say⠀or⠀omit,⠀not⠀by⠀multiplying⠀dialogue.⠀Close⠀when⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀has⠀been⠀set⠀up⠀or⠀the⠀current⠀change⠀is⠀legible.⠀Do⠀not⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀a⠀training⠀or⠀testing⠀sequence⠀on⠀an⠀actable⠀gesture:⠀a⠀foot⠀slides⠀into⠀stance,⠀a⠀teacher⠀picks⠀up⠀a⠀weighted⠀glove,⠀a⠀friend⠀waits⠀across⠀the⠀yard.⠀Let⠀the⠀immediate⠀sensory⠀experience⠀pull⠀the⠀relevant⠀struggle⠀in.⠀Do⠀not⠀separate⠀drill,⠀reflection,⠀and⠀feedback⠀into⠀labeled⠀sections;⠀let⠀one⠀paragraph⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀failed⠀movement⠀to⠀the⠀partner's⠀observation,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀observation⠀pull⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀next⠀attempt.\n\nShow⠀each⠀change⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀perform.⠀Put⠀the⠀improvement⠀in⠀the⠀body⠀or⠀the⠀environment:⠀the⠀strike⠀lands⠀before⠀the⠀block,⠀the⠀run⠀leaves⠀the⠀old⠀breathing⠀pattern⠀behind,⠀the⠀recipe's⠀final⠀measurement⠀comes⠀out⠀clean.⠀If⠀a⠀memory⠀helps,⠀connect⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀action.⠀A⠀remembered⠀fight⠀clarifies⠀the⠀angle⠀of⠀an⠀arm;⠀a⠀teacher's⠀old⠀warning⠀explains⠀why⠀the⠀hand⠀should⠀not⠀rise.⠀Return⠀from⠀the⠀memory⠀by⠀showing⠀the⠀corrected⠀action,⠀not⠀by⠀saying⠀it⠀was⠀remembered.\n\nMove⠀among⠀perception,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀authorized⠀interiority⠀smoothly.⠀A⠀paragraph⠀can⠀shift⠀from⠀a⠀failed⠀repetition⠀to⠀a⠀short⠀exchange;⠀a⠀later⠀paragraph⠀can⠀jump⠀to⠀an⠀application⠀on⠀the⠀street⠀provided⠀the⠀causal⠀or⠀temporal⠀link⠀is⠀clear.⠀Let⠀the⠀new⠀scene⠀itself⠀show⠀the⠀interval;⠀do⠀not⠀write⠀'after⠀several⠀weeks.'⠀Use⠀free⠀indirect⠀thought⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀allows,⠀but⠀keep⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀only.\n\nThe⠀narrator's⠀register⠀should⠀follow⠀the⠀scene:⠀shorter⠀sentences⠀and⠀sharper⠀physical⠀detail⠀for⠀a⠀crisis;⠀a⠀longer⠀inward⠀sentence⠀for⠀a⠀quiet⠀realization.⠀Relationship⠀pressure⠀comes⠀through⠀ordinary⠀means:⠀a⠀teacher's⠀rare⠀approval,⠀a⠀rival's⠀familiar⠀rhythm,⠀a⠀friend's⠀readiness⠀to⠀drill⠀after⠀dark.⠀Each⠀should⠀affect⠀the⠀practice⠀method⠀or⠀the⠀learner's⠀perception,⠀not⠀simply⠀supply⠀an⠀emotional⠀decoration.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀current⠀need⠀or⠀next⠀test⠀already⠀visible,⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀learning⠀into⠀a⠀neat⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nBegin⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀fanfiction⠀trope⠀list.⠀Identify⠀its⠀private⠀language:⠀the⠀correction⠀one⠀gives⠀the⠀other,⠀the⠀name⠀used⠀only⠀at⠀a⠀certain⠀distance,⠀the⠀gesture⠀offered⠀before⠀a⠀hard⠀attempt.⠀Choose⠀a⠀learning⠀scene⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀would⠀alter⠀that⠀interaction.⠀Let⠀the⠀pair⠀drill⠀where⠀one⠀used⠀to⠀correct;⠀let⠀a⠀third⠀person⠀watch⠀the⠀changed⠀distance;⠀let⠀the⠀learner⠀meet⠀the⠀mentor⠀after⠀a⠀milestone⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀the⠀old⠀self⠀could⠀not.\n\nLet⠀the⠀callback⠀occur⠀inside⠀an⠀attempted⠀action.⠀A⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀surfaces⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀isolated⠀memory⠀but⠀as⠀something⠀the⠀learner⠀now⠀performs⠀or⠀hears⠀differently.⠀If⠀the⠀partner⠀once⠀steadied⠀the⠀learner's⠀elbow,⠀show⠀the⠀elbow⠀finding⠀the⠀line⠀before⠀the⠀partner's⠀hand⠀arrives.⠀If⠀a⠀private⠀name⠀was⠀once⠀a⠀taunt,⠀let⠀the⠀newly⠀mastered⠀move⠀make⠀the⠀name⠀fall⠀silent⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀mouth.⠀The⠀callback's⠀meaning⠀changes⠀because⠀the⠀skill⠀or⠀power⠀balance⠀has⠀changed;⠀do⠀not⠀state⠀the⠀new⠀meaning⠀separately.\n\nGive⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀reaction⠀concrete⠀behavior.⠀An⠀advance⠀may⠀make⠀someone⠀proud,⠀envious,⠀frightened,⠀newly⠀aware,⠀or⠀newly⠀unnecessary.⠀Show⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀glance⠀too⠀late,⠀a⠀correction⠀withheld,⠀a⠀comparison⠀voiced⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment,⠀an⠀offer⠀of⠀help⠀no⠀longer⠀needed.⠀The⠀relationship⠀should⠀register⠀the⠀capability⠀change⠀outside⠀the⠀learner's⠀interiority.⠀Affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀or⠀rivalry⠀may⠀all⠀appear,⠀but⠀only⠀as⠀the⠀established⠀dynamic⠀permits.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀skill⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀bond.⠀The⠀learner⠀performs⠀the⠀action;⠀a⠀partner⠀may⠀correct,⠀provoke,⠀or⠀observe,⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀transfer⠀ability.⠀Show⠀failures⠀as⠀failures⠀and⠀improvements⠀as⠀real⠀changes⠀in⠀execution.⠀A⠀confrontation⠀about⠀a⠀breakthrough⠀may⠀pause⠀while⠀each⠀person⠀reacts;⠀a⠀shared⠀success⠀may⠀carry⠀quiet⠀pleasure.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀reached⠀a⠀new⠀consequence:⠀a⠀silence,⠀a⠀changed⠀habit,⠀an⠀invitation,⠀a⠀new⠀distance—not⠀where⠀all⠀tension⠀is⠀resolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nOpen⠀each⠀training⠀or⠀testing⠀episode⠀with⠀a⠀compact⠀declarative⠀frame:⠀the⠀learner⠀who⠀practiced,⠀the⠀master⠀who⠀demanded,⠀the⠀rival⠀who⠀arrived,⠀the⠀deed⠀that⠀was⠀attempted.⠀Keep⠀the⠀declaration⠀short⠀enough⠀to⠀set⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀into⠀legend.⠀Then⠀move⠀inside⠀the⠀work⠀itself:⠀the⠀footwork,⠀the⠀breathing,⠀the⠀repeated⠀correction,⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀body⠀fails⠀or⠀the⠀motion⠀completes.\n\nTie⠀the⠀first⠀demonstrated⠀capability⠀to⠀a⠀public⠀or⠀shared⠀consequence.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀relate⠀the⠀opponent⠀who⠀fell,⠀the⠀wall⠀that⠀held,⠀the⠀student⠀who⠀stopped⠀laughing,⠀or⠀the⠀gate⠀that⠀was⠀guarded.⠀The⠀consequence⠀should⠀be⠀particular⠀to⠀that⠀first⠀occasion,⠀not⠀a⠀stat⠀sheet.⠀Use⠀a⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀or⠀designation⠀only⠀when⠀its⠀meaning⠀has⠀changed:⠀a⠀phrase⠀such⠀as⠀'he⠀had⠀not⠀yet⠀learned⠀the⠀cost'⠀may⠀first⠀mark⠀a⠀failure⠀and⠀later,⠀after⠀a⠀new⠀skill,⠀mark⠀a⠀different⠀kind⠀of⠀ignorance.⠀Do⠀not⠀repeat⠀the⠀phrase⠀as⠀decoration.\n\nKeep⠀memory⠀and⠀later⠀knowledge⠀within⠀the⠀teller's⠀frame.⠀The⠀chronicler⠀may⠀know⠀what⠀happened⠀afterward,⠀but⠀during⠀a⠀beat⠀the⠀focal⠀view⠀should⠀not⠀gain⠀that⠀future⠀certainty.⠀If⠀the⠀teller⠀foreshadows,⠀keep⠀it⠀restrained⠀and⠀confirmable⠀later.⠀Present⠀differing⠀public⠀accounts⠀where⠀the⠀world⠀contains⠀them:⠀a⠀family⠀tells⠀one⠀version,⠀a⠀rival's⠀household⠀another,⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀act⠀qualifies⠀both.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀region⠀and⠀knowledge⠀remain⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting.\n\nUse⠀compact⠀declarations⠀for⠀characters,⠀then⠀add⠀a⠀contrary⠀particular:⠀a⠀learner⠀praised⠀for⠀speed⠀may⠀be⠀careless;⠀a⠀patient⠀teacher⠀may⠀strike⠀hard;⠀a⠀rival's⠀first⠀victory⠀may⠀rest⠀on⠀a⠀debt⠀not⠀acknowledged.⠀Keep⠀emotional⠀scale⠀proportionate.⠀Training⠀is⠀not⠀ceremonial⠀combat,⠀and⠀a⠀small⠀success⠀becomes⠀memorable⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀world's⠀stakes⠀genuinely⠀make⠀it⠀so.⠀End⠀the⠀episode⠀by⠀binding⠀the⠀present⠀act⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered—the⠀first⠀time⠀a⠀motion⠀held,⠀the⠀day⠀a⠀correction⠀took—without⠀declaring⠀victory⠀or⠀doom.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀folktale-inflected⠀social⠀realism:⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀told⠀with⠀the⠀plain⠀authority⠀of⠀a⠀community⠀tale,⠀but⠀its⠀evidence⠀remains⠀kitchens,⠀workrooms,⠀debts,⠀and⠀the⠀exact⠀words⠀people⠀exchange.⠀Choose⠀one⠀recurring⠀domestic⠀or⠀seasonal⠀ritual—mending⠀a⠀fence,⠀preparing⠀a⠀meal,⠀settling⠀a⠀shared⠀account—and⠀make⠀each⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀test⠀the⠀learner's⠀changed⠀ability.⠀The⠀ritual⠀itself⠀stays⠀ordinary;⠀its⠀meaning⠀alters⠀because⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀now⠀notice⠀a⠀step⠀previously⠀missed,⠀steady⠀a⠀movement,⠀or⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀once⠀silenced⠀them.\n\nMake⠀relationship⠀bonds⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀growth.⠀A⠀caregiver,⠀rival,⠀friend,⠀or⠀elder⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀background⠀figure⠀but⠀someone⠀whose⠀expectations⠀and⠀memories⠀shape⠀the⠀attempt.⠀Let⠀a⠀remembered⠀wound⠀enter⠀through⠀a⠀present⠀object⠀or⠀sentence:⠀a⠀scarred⠀tool,⠀a⠀nickname,⠀a⠀debt⠀never⠀named.⠀The⠀memory⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀dares⠀to⠀attempt⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀scene,⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀separate⠀flashback.\n\nStage⠀every⠀attempt⠀as⠀a⠀visible,⠀hearable⠀event.⠀The⠀learner⠀tries,⠀observes⠀the⠀failure,⠀receives⠀feedback⠀from⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀from⠀the⠀material⠀itself,⠀and⠀tries⠀again⠀under⠀a⠀small⠀changed⠀condition.⠀Separate⠀knowing⠀from⠀executing:⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀recite⠀the⠀principle⠀while⠀the⠀hand⠀still⠀hesitates,⠀or⠀perform⠀the⠀motion⠀in⠀calm⠀while⠀pressure⠀makes⠀it⠀collapse.⠀Advancement⠀appears⠀as⠀a⠀specific⠀new⠀result—a⠀repaired⠀tool⠀that⠀holds,⠀a⠀dish⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀burn,⠀a⠀debt⠀partially⠀paid—followed⠀by⠀what⠀still⠀remains⠀difficult.\n\nLet⠀community⠀consequence⠀measure⠀growth⠀without⠀stacking⠀crises.⠀A⠀new⠀skill⠀may⠀change⠀who⠀is⠀trusted⠀with⠀a⠀task,⠀how⠀a⠀dispute⠀is⠀decided,⠀or⠀what⠀a⠀neighbor⠀now⠀asks.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀bleakness;⠀use⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀setting,⠀whether⠀crowded⠀or⠀open,⠀cold⠀or⠀warm.⠀End⠀a⠀response⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀altered⠀ritual⠀has⠀acquired⠀its⠀new⠀social⠀meaning,⠀or⠀at⠀a⠀refusal⠀that⠀shows⠀the⠀next⠀boundary.⠀Progress⠀is⠀a⠀changed⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀community,⠀not⠀a⠀numerical⠀rank.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀in⠀screenplay⠀form:⠀scene⠀headings⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀actually⠀changes,⠀concise⠀action⠀lines,⠀and⠀dialogue⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers.⠀Every⠀attempt⠀must⠀be⠀visible⠀or⠀audible—a⠀stance⠀shifting,⠀a⠀tool⠀held,⠀a⠀strike⠀stopping⠀just⠀short,⠀a⠀breath⠀caught.⠀Show⠀the⠀change⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀a⠀level.\n\nChoose⠀one⠀recurrent⠀screen⠀image⠀to⠀measure⠀progression:⠀a⠀particular⠀doorway,⠀a⠀training⠀post,⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀walkway,⠀a⠀physical⠀mark.⠀Let⠀it⠀return⠀in⠀different⠀scenes.⠀The⠀learner⠀may⠀not⠀reach⠀it,⠀then⠀reach⠀it,⠀then⠀hold⠀steady⠀there.⠀Keep⠀the⠀image⠀ordinary;⠀its⠀changing⠀meaning⠀is⠀the⠀advancement,⠀not⠀a⠀magical⠀effect.\n\nIn⠀the⠀action⠀lines,⠀do⠀not⠀say⠀the⠀learner⠀has⠀improved.⠀Show⠀the⠀smaller⠀correction:⠀the⠀thumb⠀moves⠀one⠀finger⠀over,⠀the⠀foot⠀stops⠀sliding,⠀the⠀second⠀try⠀is⠀done⠀without⠀being⠀told⠀the⠀first⠀step.⠀When⠀feedback⠀is⠀needed,⠀give⠀it⠀from⠀a⠀person,⠀an⠀object,⠀or⠀the⠀body's⠀own⠀limit.⠀A⠀rival's⠀silence⠀after⠀a⠀demonstration⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀exact⠀as⠀a⠀spoken⠀line.\n\nKeep⠀relationship⠀conflict⠀on⠀screen.⠀An⠀argument⠀during⠀cleanup,⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀too⠀lightly,⠀a⠀wound⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀someone⠀stands⠀beside⠀the⠀learner—these⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀staged⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue.⠀A⠀memory⠀may⠀surface⠀through⠀a⠀present⠀object⠀or⠀phrase,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀change⠀the⠀current⠀encounter⠀rather⠀than⠀open⠀a⠀long⠀flashback.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀Kishimoto's⠀powers⠀or⠀tournament⠀structure;⠀use⠀his⠀clarity⠀and⠀emotional⠀pressure.\n\nFor⠀required⠀private⠀experience,⠀place⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀connected⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀action,⠀not⠀as⠀dialogue,⠀voice-over,⠀or⠀camera⠀direction:\n\n    NEMO-INTERIORITY (Karin)\n    She thinks the third correction is the one Torsten has never once given.\n\nNo⠀other⠀character⠀can⠀know⠀this⠀note.⠀Avoid⠀voice-over⠀unless⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀genuinely⠀needs⠀it.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀refused⠀attempt,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀changed⠀exchange,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀forced⠀victory.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script:⠀speaker-first⠀dialogue,⠀economical⠀stage⠀directions,⠀clear⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀and⠀handled⠀props.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀camera⠀instructions⠀or⠀offstage⠀shots.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience⠀see⠀improvement⠀through⠀repeated⠀physical⠀business,⠀not⠀explanatory⠀speeches.\n\nPick⠀one⠀recurrent⠀stage⠀object⠀or⠀routine⠀to⠀measure⠀progression:⠀a⠀bowl⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀steadied,⠀a⠀strap⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀fastened,⠀a⠀chore⠀performed⠀with⠀fewer⠀suppressed⠀sighs.⠀Return⠀it⠀across⠀scenes.⠀The⠀first⠀time⠀it⠀wobbles⠀or⠀must⠀be⠀redone;⠀later⠀it⠀is⠀held⠀differently;⠀still⠀later⠀a⠀rival⠀stops⠀to⠀watch.⠀The⠀object⠀does⠀not⠀change;⠀the⠀learner's⠀ability⠀with⠀it⠀changes.\n\nStage⠀each⠀attempt⠀and⠀its⠀correction.⠀A⠀failed⠀attempt⠀is⠀visible—the⠀bowl⠀rocks,⠀the⠀learner⠀misses⠀the⠀grip.⠀Feedback⠀follows⠀in⠀a⠀usable⠀form:⠀a⠀line⠀delivered⠀during⠀work,⠀a⠀hand⠀physically⠀adjusting⠀the⠀grip,⠀or⠀a⠀silent⠀refusal⠀to⠀repeat⠀the⠀demonstration.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀rank⠀or⠀power.⠀The⠀audience⠀should⠀see⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀fails.\n\nUse⠀Kishimoto's⠀emotional⠀conflict⠀through⠀stage⠀action.⠀A⠀rival⠀may⠀enter⠀with⠀a⠀practiced⠀reason⠀to⠀interrupt⠀the⠀lesson.⠀A⠀trusted⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀grounding⠀voice⠀or⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀refuses⠀false⠀praise.⠀A⠀remembered⠀wound⠀should⠀surface⠀through⠀a⠀prop⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀and⠀change⠀the⠀present⠀scene:⠀the⠀learner⠀hesitates,⠀misreads⠀the⠀instruction,⠀or⠀accepts⠀help⠀they⠀previously⠀refused.\n\nRestrict⠀monologues⠀to⠀intentional⠀dramatic⠀events,⠀not⠀thought⠀dumps.⠀For⠀an⠀authorized⠀focal⠀character's⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀state,⠀write⠀an⠀internal⠀direction⠀tied⠀to⠀physical⠀business,⠀separate⠀from⠀dialogue:\n\n    (Karin, privately, while steadying the bowl)\n    She thinks the exact correction Torsten has never once given.\n\nOther⠀characters⠀cannot⠀hear⠀or⠀know⠀this⠀note.⠀Their⠀inferences⠀must⠀rest⠀on⠀the⠀business⠀they⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀the⠀lines⠀they⠀can⠀hear.⠀End⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀a⠀refused⠀handshake,⠀or⠀a⠀pause⠀after⠀a⠀half-mastered⠀skill.⠀A⠀training⠀victory⠀or⠀confession⠀is⠀not⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀associations,⠀not⠀a⠀lesson⠀summary.⠀Let⠀perception⠀interrupt⠀intention:⠀a⠀smell⠀from⠀the⠀training⠀yard,⠀a⠀sore⠀wrist,⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀sounds⠀like⠀a⠀former⠀rival,⠀a⠀correction⠀heard⠀three⠀times⠀across⠀different⠀seasons.⠀Syntax⠀may⠀follow⠀these⠀movements—short⠀clauses⠀giving⠀way⠀to⠀a⠀slow⠀remembered⠀sentence,⠀then⠀breaking⠀at⠀an⠀interruption.\n\nKeep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀know⠀what⠀is⠀happening.⠀A⠀line⠀such⠀as⠀\"the⠀fence⠀is⠀still⠀there,⠀and⠀she⠀is⠀still⠀on⠀the⠀wrong⠀side⠀of⠀it\"⠀can⠀anchor⠀a⠀scene⠀before⠀memory⠀takes⠀over.⠀Distinguish⠀present⠀practice⠀from⠀recollection⠀by⠀sensory⠀detail⠀and⠀consequence.⠀Do⠀not⠀blur⠀events⠀into⠀vague⠀impressions⠀to⠀avoid⠀a⠀decision.\n\nChoose⠀one⠀recurring⠀phrase,⠀correction,⠀or⠀body⠀sensation⠀as⠀the⠀progression⠀instrument.⠀Let⠀it⠀enter⠀the⠀flow⠀at⠀different⠀moments:⠀first⠀as⠀a⠀taunt⠀or⠀failure,⠀later⠀as⠀a⠀fact⠀with⠀boundaries,⠀still⠀later⠀as⠀an⠀instruction⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀use.⠀Its⠀changed⠀feel⠀marks⠀advancement—not⠀a⠀number,⠀not⠀a⠀rank.⠀The⠀same⠀correction⠀no⠀longer⠀sounds⠀like⠀refusal;⠀the⠀same⠀ache⠀now⠀has⠀a⠀known⠀boundary;⠀the⠀same⠀warning⠀now⠀arrives⠀as⠀a⠀timing⠀cue.\n\nUse⠀Kishimoto-style⠀clear⠀beats⠀inside⠀the⠀remembered⠀material:⠀a⠀rival's⠀gesture,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀hand⠀turning⠀the⠀wrist,⠀a⠀weapon⠀shifted⠀from⠀one⠀grip⠀to⠀another.⠀These⠀images⠀may⠀flash⠀through⠀the⠀flow,⠀but⠀they⠀must⠀stay⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀and⠀change⠀the⠀present⠀association.⠀A⠀remembered⠀bond⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀altered⠀feeling⠀as⠀the⠀learner⠀reinterprets⠀it.⠀Import⠀neither⠀his⠀powers⠀nor⠀tournament⠀structure.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀stream⠀inside⠀the⠀authorized⠀focal⠀mind.⠀If⠀the⠀contract⠀denies⠀access⠀to⠀another⠀character,⠀do⠀not⠀render⠀their⠀private⠀patterns.⠀The⠀current⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀mid-thought,⠀on⠀a⠀remembered⠀correction,⠀or⠀on⠀a⠀bodily⠀release⠀that⠀signals⠀fatigue⠀rather⠀than⠀completion.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀each⠀practice⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀revelation⠀or⠀victory.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀readable,⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Use⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀read⠀receipts,⠀edits,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀matter.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀interface⠀events⠀to⠀create⠀subtext.\n\nLet⠀each⠀person's⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀them:⠀one⠀writes⠀fragments,⠀another⠀careful⠀complete⠀sentences,⠀another⠀sudden⠀silences.⠀The⠀rival's⠀message⠀can⠀arrive⠀late⠀and⠀short;⠀the⠀friend's⠀can⠀swamp⠀a⠀lesson⠀with⠀practical⠀reminders.⠀The⠀learner's⠀messages⠀should⠀show⠀a⠀changed⠀capability:⠀describing⠀a⠀technique⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀last⠀week,⠀offering⠀a⠀correction⠀they⠀once⠀needed,⠀or⠀asking⠀for⠀a⠀resource⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀be⠀out⠀of⠀reach.\n\nChoose⠀one⠀message-pattern⠀change⠀as⠀the⠀progression⠀instrument.⠀A⠀previously⠀mocking⠀rival⠀asks⠀a⠀real⠀question.⠀A⠀helper⠀stops⠀typing⠀a⠀reassurance⠀because⠀the⠀answer⠀already⠀arrived.⠀The⠀learner⠀stops⠀apologizing⠀before⠀an⠀answer,⠀or⠀begins⠀to⠀name⠀what⠀went⠀wrong⠀instead⠀of⠀blaming⠀the⠀tool.⠀The⠀change⠀must⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀transcript⠀and⠀echo⠀an⠀actual⠀improvement⠀shown⠀in⠀the⠀separated⠀practice⠀context.\n\nBetween⠀messages,⠀include⠀clearly⠀separated⠀context⠀for⠀the⠀practice⠀itself:⠀the⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀the⠀cut⠀or⠀bruise,⠀the⠀new⠀grip,⠀the⠀teacher's⠀hand,⠀the⠀meal⠀after.⠀Let⠀the⠀transcript⠀carry⠀the⠀emotional⠀consequence.⠀A⠀sent⠀message⠀may⠀be⠀proud,⠀evasive,⠀or⠀incomplete;⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀actually⠀experienced⠀can⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀tell.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact—preserve⠀it⠀as⠀text⠀the⠀writer⠀considered,⠀not⠀as⠀their⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀If⠀private⠀uncertainty⠀must⠀be⠀rendered,⠀use⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange.\n\nUse⠀repeated⠀memories⠀without⠀importing⠀Kishimoto's⠀plot.⠀A⠀photograph,⠀a⠀name⠀in⠀an⠀old⠀message,⠀or⠀a⠀delayed⠀reply⠀from⠀someone⠀once⠀close⠀can⠀change⠀the⠀current⠀conversation.⠀Let⠀that⠀memory⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀asks⠀or⠀withholds,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession.\n\nDo⠀not⠀replace⠀required⠀private⠀thought⠀with⠀sent⠀messages.⠀A⠀transcript⠀shows⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀transmits⠀or⠀consciously⠀drafts;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀reveal⠀their⠀live⠀thought.⠀End⠀after⠀a⠀meaningful⠀send,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀brief⠀real-time⠀exchange.⠀No⠀victory⠀notification⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀scene-oriented⠀blocks:⠀concise⠀setting,⠀attributed⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀line⠀or⠀small⠀break.⠀Do⠀not⠀present⠀a⠀branching⠀menu,⠀player⠀decision,⠀romance⠀route,⠀or⠀image⠀file.⠀If⠀a⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀helps,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀narrative,⠀such⠀as⠀\"The⠀training⠀yard⠀is⠀still⠀shadowed\"⠀or⠀\"For⠀one⠀breath,⠀her⠀face⠀loses⠀its⠀practiced⠀calm.\"\n\nChoose⠀one⠀recurrent⠀focal⠀visual⠀cue⠀to⠀measure⠀progression:⠀a⠀shadow⠀across⠀a⠀doorway,⠀a⠀training⠀post,⠀a⠀scarred⠀tool,⠀a⠀particular⠀walkway.⠀Let⠀it⠀return⠀across⠀scenes.⠀The⠀learner⠀may⠀not⠀reach⠀it,⠀then⠀reach⠀it,⠀then⠀stand⠀in⠀it⠀differently.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀expression⠀on⠀a⠀face⠀an⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicator;⠀the⠀cue's⠀changed⠀meaning⠀must⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀events⠀and⠀inner⠀response.\n\nAdvance⠀progression⠀through⠀repeated⠀visual⠀beats⠀grounded⠀in⠀attempts,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀resources.⠀The⠀learner⠀stands⠀differently⠀after⠀the⠀third⠀morning⠀mark.⠀A⠀wound⠀the⠀learner⠀kept⠀hidden⠀is⠀now⠀visible⠀when⠀the⠀training⠀tunic⠀shifts.⠀The⠀same⠀rival's⠀expression⠀changes⠀from⠀scorn⠀to⠀something⠀quieter⠀when⠀the⠀skill⠀finally⠀lands.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult,⠀not⠀a⠀stat⠀sheet.\n\nUse⠀Kishimoto-style⠀emotional⠀action⠀in⠀small⠀exchanges.⠀A⠀dialogue⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀learner⠀defend⠀an⠀unfinished⠀bridge⠀to⠀a⠀rival;⠀a⠀teacher⠀can⠀say⠀one⠀word⠀at⠀the⠀exact⠀moment⠀the⠀learner's⠀stance⠀fails.⠀The⠀response⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀relationship:⠀a⠀childhood⠀friend⠀asks⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀a⠀rival⠀refuses⠀to⠀clap,⠀a⠀sibling⠀notices⠀the⠀limping.⠀Memories⠀should⠀enter⠀as⠀a⠀visible⠀or⠀spoken⠀trigger—an⠀old⠀tool,⠀a⠀scarred⠀training⠀post—and⠀change⠀the⠀current⠀encounter⠀rather⠀than⠀forming⠀a⠀long⠀flashback.\n\nKeep⠀focal⠀inner⠀response⠀present⠀between⠀lines.⠀The⠀reader⠀knows⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀decides,⠀fears,⠀or⠀realizes⠀by⠀the⠀narration;⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀this.⠀No⠀private⠀label⠀is⠀required⠀unless⠀the⠀output⠀format⠀specifies⠀hidden⠀interiority.⠀End⠀on⠀the⠀afterimage⠀of⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀quiet⠀expression⠀of⠀pride,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀refusal,⠀not⠀a⠀forced⠀victory.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaqbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀an⠀installment⠀that⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀longer⠀training⠀life.⠀Open⠀with⠀orientation⠀only⠀when⠀needed:⠀one⠀physical⠀detail,⠀one⠀current⠀task,⠀or⠀one⠀unfinished⠀question.⠀If⠀a⠀prior⠀event⠀matters⠀now,⠀recover⠀it⠀briefly⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀full⠀recap.\n\nUse⠀an⠀attempt-and-feedback⠀rhythm⠀throughout.⠀Stage⠀the⠀attempt⠀clearly:⠀the⠀run,⠀the⠀form,⠀the⠀repaired⠀clasp,⠀the⠀contested⠀exercise.⠀Let⠀the⠀feedback⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀person,⠀an⠀object,⠀or⠀the⠀body's⠀own⠀limit.⠀End⠀the⠀installment⠀when⠀the⠀forward⠀change⠀has⠀landed⠀or⠀been⠀refused.⠀A⠀hook⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀a⠀new⠀absence,⠀question,⠀or⠀small⠀demand⠀arrives,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀undo⠀the⠀current⠀result.\n\nChoose⠀one⠀recurrent⠀tactile⠀detail⠀as⠀the⠀progression⠀instrument⠀across⠀installments:⠀the⠀same⠀tool's⠀handle,⠀a⠀particular⠀bruise,⠀a⠀phrase⠀a⠀rival⠀used,⠀a⠀bridge⠀the⠀learner⠀previously⠀avoided.⠀Let⠀it⠀return⠀with⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀The⠀learner⠀holds⠀the⠀handle⠀with⠀less⠀hesitation,⠀recognizes⠀the⠀rival's⠀phrase⠀as⠀a⠀timing⠀cue,⠀or⠀crosses⠀the⠀bridge⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀state.⠀Show⠀what⠀changed,⠀not⠀a⠀numerical⠀update.⠀Keep⠀gaps⠀honest:⠀if⠀a⠀month⠀passes,⠀a⠀short⠀bridging⠀line⠀like⠀\"the⠀month⠀had⠀taught⠀him⠀to⠀stop⠀ducking\"⠀lets⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀the⠀change⠀without⠀a⠀false⠀montage.\n\nUse⠀Kishimoto's⠀clear⠀tactile⠀staging⠀and⠀relationship⠀conflict:⠀a⠀stance,⠀a⠀knuckle,⠀a⠀glance⠀before⠀the⠀break.⠀A⠀rival⠀takes⠀the⠀same⠀lesson⠀and⠀executes⠀it⠀differently,⠀a⠀friend's⠀advice⠀is⠀both⠀help⠀and⠀a⠀wound,⠀a⠀teacher⠀tests⠀an⠀old⠀limit.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀his⠀powers⠀or⠀tournament⠀structure.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀thought⠀as⠀ordinary⠀serial⠀prose⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀as⠀required.⠀A⠀training⠀scene⠀may⠀include⠀genuine⠀thought⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀immediately⠀change⠀an⠀action,⠀but⠀a⠀later⠀realization⠀cannot⠀be⠀retroactively⠀inserted⠀as⠀an⠀earlier⠀motive.⠀Progress⠀means⠀a⠀specific⠀new⠀capability,⠀resource,⠀understanding,⠀or⠀relationship⠀consequence,⠀not⠀automatic⠀rank-ups⠀each⠀week.⠀Let⠀the⠀installment⠀continue⠀after⠀a⠀result:⠀a⠀task⠀remains,⠀a⠀relationship⠀shifts,⠀an⠀old⠀obligation⠀returns.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaraa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nTreat⠀every⠀gain⠀in⠀capability⠀as⠀a⠀transaction⠀with⠀people⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀cannot⠀easily⠀replace.⠀Before⠀writing⠀a⠀practice⠀scene⠀or⠀a⠀test,⠀settle⠀which⠀relationship⠀the⠀new⠀competence⠀presses⠀on:⠀the⠀mentor⠀whose⠀expectations⠀have⠀shifted,⠀the⠀sibling⠀still⠀standing⠀at⠀an⠀older⠀level⠀of⠀skill,⠀the⠀friend⠀who⠀needed⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀to⠀remain⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀faltered.⠀Then⠀let⠀the⠀attempt⠀run⠀through⠀that⠀tangle⠀rather⠀than⠀around⠀it⠀—⠀a⠀technique⠀lands⠀because⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀stops⠀holding⠀the⠀feeling⠀in⠀check,⠀or⠀collapses⠀precisely⠀because⠀the⠀fear⠀now⠀has⠀a⠀name⠀and⠀a⠀face.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀plain⠀and⠀the⠀setting⠀familiar,⠀and⠀let⠀depth⠀arrive⠀through⠀history⠀instead⠀of⠀decorated⠀language.⠀Where⠀the⠀scenario⠀already⠀holds⠀them,⠀a⠀training⠀ground⠀walked⠀since⠀childhood,⠀a⠀promise⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀tool,⠀or⠀a⠀bargain⠀once⠀made⠀on⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀behalf⠀can⠀take⠀on⠀consequence⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀new⠀skill⠀disturbs⠀it.⠀An⠀exercise⠀that⠀finally⠀succeeds⠀may⠀uncover⠀a⠀private⠀grief;⠀a⠀milestone⠀reached⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀unsure⠀whether⠀the⠀person⠀they⠀are⠀becoming⠀was⠀worth⠀what⠀it⠀took⠀from⠀someone⠀else.\n\nPut⠀the⠀turbulence⠀into⠀live⠀speech⠀and⠀subsequent⠀action,⠀never⠀into⠀summary.⠀An⠀admission,⠀a⠀withheld⠀truth,⠀or⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀caused⠀the⠀hurt⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀gets⠀said⠀next⠀and⠀what⠀gets⠀done⠀afterward.⠀Comfort⠀arrives⠀partial⠀and⠀awkward⠀when⠀it⠀arrives⠀at⠀all;⠀an⠀apology⠀can⠀be⠀accepted⠀while⠀the⠀strain⠀remains.⠀Use⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀distance⠀and⠀diction⠀for⠀pain⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.⠀Capability⠀keeps⠀advancing⠀regardless⠀—⠀emotional⠀repair⠀is⠀neither⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀progress⠀nor⠀its⠀reward,⠀and⠀the⠀ending⠀may⠀hold⠀confession,⠀consolation,⠀collapse,⠀or⠀none⠀of⠀them,⠀as⠀the⠀people⠀involved⠀decide.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalarab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nPlay⠀each⠀reply⠀as⠀a⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀where⠀a⠀developing⠀capability⠀becomes⠀visible⠀to⠀everyone⠀present.⠀Attribute⠀dialogue⠀unmistakably⠀—⠀tag⠀the⠀speaker⠀by⠀name⠀or⠀by⠀an⠀unambiguous⠀action⠀beat,⠀so⠀a⠀scanning⠀reader⠀always⠀knows⠀who⠀spoke.⠀When⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀attempts⠀something⠀at⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀current⠀skill,⠀show⠀the⠀attempt⠀and⠀its⠀outcome⠀as⠀facts⠀of⠀the⠀world⠀another⠀character⠀could⠀witness;⠀other⠀characters⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀demonstrated⠀result⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀any⠀tally⠀no⠀one⠀present⠀could⠀see.⠀An⠀attempt⠀can⠀fall⠀short⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀terms⠀—⠀a⠀fumbled⠀grip,⠀a⠀wrong⠀word,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀stays⠀shut⠀—⠀and⠀a⠀success⠀earns⠀its⠀next⠀beat:⠀what⠀it⠀cost,⠀or⠀the⠀trust⠀it⠀created.\n\nGive⠀advancement⠀one⠀small⠀readable⠀sign⠀—⠀a⠀mark⠀earned,⠀a⠀habit⠀changed,⠀an⠀object⠀finally⠀usable⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀another⠀character⠀notice⠀and⠀name⠀the⠀difference⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀voice.⠀Where⠀the⠀scenario's⠀history⠀supports⠀it,⠀let⠀that⠀sign⠀trail⠀a⠀quieter⠀story⠀behind⠀it:⠀a⠀bargain⠀remembered,⠀a⠀route⠀that⠀only⠀opens⠀now,⠀a⠀name⠀with⠀weight.⠀Bring⠀that⠀layer⠀up⠀through⠀interaction⠀—⠀someone⠀asks,⠀acts⠀on⠀it,⠀or⠀recognizes⠀it⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀explanation⠀aimed⠀outside⠀the⠀scene.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀surrounding⠀world⠀in⠀motion:⠀NPCs⠀clean,⠀argue,⠀wait,⠀and⠀run⠀their⠀own⠀errands⠀while⠀the⠀player⠀acts,⠀so⠀the⠀interval⠀feels⠀inhabited⠀rather⠀than⠀staged.⠀Resolve⠀whatever⠀the⠀player⠀submitted⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract,⠀then⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀continuation⠀that⠀grows⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀—⠀a⠀completed⠀action⠀that⠀opens⠀the⠀next⠀move,⠀or⠀a⠀motion⠀still⠀unfinished.⠀No⠀cliffhanger,⠀question,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀close.⠀Narrative⠀person,⠀action⠀markers,⠀and⠀control⠀of⠀the⠀player's⠀character⠀follow⠀their⠀separate⠀selected⠀settings;⠀the⠀player's⠀choices⠀remain⠀the⠀player's,⠀and⠀NPCs⠀keep⠀making⠀their⠀own.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalarac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀route⠀and⠀commit⠀to⠀it:⠀tell⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀chain⠀of⠀short,⠀marked⠀segments⠀—⠀a⠀chapter-style⠀heading⠀or⠀a⠀firm⠀paragraph⠀break⠀for⠀each⠀—⠀where⠀every⠀segment⠀carries⠀one⠀trial,⠀one⠀encounter,⠀or⠀one⠀distinct⠀gain⠀in⠀capability.⠀Write⠀in⠀the⠀plain,⠀durable⠀cadence⠀of⠀vernacular⠀chaptered⠀storytelling:⠀unadorned⠀declaratives,⠀actions⠀given⠀in⠀their⠀order,⠀wonder⠀stated⠀simply⠀rather⠀than⠀insisted⠀upon.⠀Let⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act⠀—⠀carrying⠀water,⠀minding⠀a⠀gate,⠀reading⠀an⠀old⠀mark⠀—⠀be⠀the⠀occasion⠀on⠀which⠀a⠀new⠀understanding⠀arrives,⠀and⠀close⠀each⠀segment⠀when⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀can⠀be⠀witnessed⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀act,⠀leaving⠀its⠀limits⠀for⠀the⠀segment⠀that⠀follows.\n\nBind⠀the⠀segments⠀with⠀recurrence⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀thread:⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀returns⠀at⠀each⠀threshold,⠀an⠀object⠀that⠀passes⠀from⠀hand⠀to⠀hand,⠀a⠀figure⠀who⠀reappears⠀at⠀intervals.⠀Make⠀each⠀trial⠀an⠀exchange⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀drill⠀—⠀knowledge⠀offered,⠀withheld,⠀bargained⠀over,⠀priced⠀—⠀so⠀improvement⠀comes⠀from⠀how⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀answers.⠀A⠀failed⠀attempt⠀can⠀be⠀corrected⠀by⠀a⠀remembered⠀story;⠀a⠀success⠀can⠀be⠀confirmed⠀by⠀a⠀companion's⠀changed⠀conduct.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀composed⠀and⠀unhurried,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀sweats,⠀doubts,⠀and⠀decides;⠀any⠀wider⠀knowing⠀or⠀storyteller's⠀aside⠀enters⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀selected⠀narrator⠀already⠀carries⠀it.⠀Let⠀names,⠀roads,⠀and⠀old⠀agreements⠀acquire⠀consequence⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀already⠀contains⠀them,⠀and⠀nowhere⠀else.⠀Do⠀not⠀install⠀a⠀sect⠀hierarchy,⠀an⠀ancient⠀dynasty,⠀or⠀a⠀borrowed⠀cultivation⠀system⠀over⠀the⠀current⠀cast;⠀the⠀setting,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀actually⠀in⠀play⠀keep⠀their⠀own⠀identities,⠀while⠀the⠀episodic⠀form⠀itself⠀carries⠀the⠀resonance.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalarad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nMake⠀every⠀step⠀of⠀advancement⠀physical.⠀Render⠀an⠀attempt⠀as⠀load,⠀heat,⠀friction,⠀breath:⠀rope⠀biting⠀the⠀palm,⠀a⠀thumbnail⠀split,⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀knowing⠀a⠀grip⠀and⠀holding⠀it⠀when⠀the⠀weight⠀comes⠀on.⠀Break⠀each⠀skill⠀into⠀a⠀concrete⠀threshold⠀—⠀a⠀burden⠀carried⠀farther⠀than⠀yesterday,⠀a⠀distance⠀crossed,⠀a⠀mark⠀struck⠀true⠀—⠀and⠀make⠀the⠀crossing⠀cost.⠀Failure⠀is⠀material:⠀water⠀spilled,⠀a⠀spar⠀splintered,⠀a⠀blade⠀gone⠀sideways⠀into⠀the⠀bench.⠀Success⠀is⠀what⠀the⠀body⠀can⠀now⠀endure⠀or⠀do.\n\nWrite⠀with⠀forceful⠀diction,⠀compressed⠀transitions,⠀and⠀hard⠀contrast,⠀but⠀treat⠀rhythm⠀as⠀a⠀tool,⠀not⠀a⠀uniform.⠀When⠀the⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀room⠀—⠀why⠀this⠀training⠀matters,⠀what⠀a⠀failure⠀changes⠀about⠀the⠀plan⠀—⠀slow⠀the⠀prose⠀deliberately⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀sentence⠀run.⠀Rough⠀speech⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀speaker:⠀the⠀instructor's⠀clipped⠀order,⠀the⠀companion's⠀snapped⠀impatience,⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀own⠀bitten-off⠀words.⠀Grit⠀is⠀never⠀a⠀mood⠀word;⠀it⠀is⠀sawdust,⠀salt,⠀soaked⠀gear,⠀the⠀specific⠀hold⠀of⠀a⠀tired⠀hand.\n\nLet⠀layered⠀significance⠀ride⠀on⠀worn⠀things⠀rather⠀than⠀ornate⠀ones:⠀a⠀tool⠀someone⠀else⠀used⠀first,⠀a⠀route⠀that⠀still⠀carries⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀debt⠀or⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀name⠀scratched⠀where⠀earlier⠀hands⠀failed.⠀When⠀a⠀skill⠀finally⠀holds,⠀make⠀the⠀change⠀legible⠀through⠀an⠀act⠀—⠀a⠀door⠀forced,⠀a⠀current⠀crossed,⠀a⠀line⠀held⠀against⠀pull⠀—⠀never⠀through⠀a⠀status⠀declaration.⠀Injury⠀stays,⠀fatigue⠀accumulates,⠀resources⠀run⠀out,⠀and⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀leaves⠀its⠀trace⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀Advancement⠀comes⠀from⠀practice⠀accumulated⠀under⠀those⠀limits,⠀not⠀from⠀sudden⠀metaphysical⠀elevation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalarae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀progression⠀entirely⠀inside⠀documents,⠀each⠀written⠀by⠀a⠀specific⠀hand,⠀at⠀a⠀specific⠀time,⠀for⠀a⠀specific⠀purpose:⠀a⠀training⠀log⠀kept⠀for⠀the⠀writer's⠀own⠀memory,⠀a⠀letter⠀home⠀that⠀admits⠀half⠀the⠀truth,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀marginal⠀note⠀correcting⠀a⠀mistake⠀the⠀learner⠀never⠀saw⠀marked,⠀an⠀inventory⠀listing⠀what⠀broke⠀this⠀month,⠀a⠀complaint⠀that⠀betrays⠀a⠀rival's⠀fear.⠀What⠀a⠀document⠀can⠀say⠀stops⠀where⠀its⠀author's⠀knowledge,⠀candor,⠀and⠀occasion⠀stop.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀halts⠀the⠀way⠀drafts⠀halt⠀—⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀revisions⠀and⠀silences,⠀not⠀a⠀window⠀onto⠀the⠀writer's⠀whole⠀live⠀mind.\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀arrangement⠀of⠀records⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀explanation.⠀One⠀entry⠀notes⠀the⠀first⠀successful⠀attempt;⠀a⠀later⠀one,⠀dated⠀or⠀undated,⠀shows⠀what⠀it⠀cost⠀in⠀pain,⠀money,⠀or⠀standing.⠀Let⠀gaps⠀do⠀quiet⠀work⠀—⠀a⠀missing⠀page,⠀a⠀burned⠀letter,⠀a⠀hole⠀in⠀the⠀dates.⠀Thread⠀one⠀physical⠀detail⠀across⠀several⠀documents⠀—⠀a⠀named⠀road,⠀a⠀particular⠀tool,⠀a⠀bruise⠀described⠀in⠀two⠀different⠀hands⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀changes⠀meaning⠀as⠀the⠀evidence⠀around⠀it⠀changes.⠀When⠀a⠀familiar⠀name⠀resurfaces,⠀its⠀new⠀weight⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀what⠀has⠀accumulated⠀between⠀the⠀mentions.\n\nIf⠀two⠀records⠀disagree,⠀let⠀the⠀disagreement⠀mark⠀perspective⠀or⠀concealment⠀in⠀the⠀writer⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀puzzle⠀set⠀for⠀the⠀reader.⠀Add⠀no⠀omniscient⠀gloss⠀after⠀an⠀entry;⠀continuity⠀comes⠀from⠀dates,⠀salutations,⠀and⠀inference⠀the⠀reader⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀make.⠀Capability⠀is⠀proven⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀correspondent⠀can⠀now⠀report⠀doing⠀—⠀lifting,⠀enduring,⠀completing⠀—⠀and⠀by⠀what,⠀even⠀alone⠀with⠀the⠀page,⠀they⠀still⠀choose⠀not⠀to⠀write.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaraf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nLet⠀care⠀be⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀training⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀pause⠀from⠀it.⠀Choose⠀one⠀familiar⠀comfort⠀to⠀anchor⠀the⠀working⠀scene⠀—⠀a⠀warm⠀drink⠀before⠀practice,⠀a⠀mended⠀strap,⠀a⠀corner⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀privately⠀calls⠀home⠀—⠀and⠀run⠀the⠀practice⠀inside⠀it:⠀the⠀movement⠀attempted,⠀the⠀gentle⠀correction⠀received,⠀the⠀small⠀difference⠀noticed.⠀Delivered⠀softly,⠀feedback⠀is⠀still⠀feedback;⠀a⠀kindly⠀given⠀correction⠀is⠀the⠀mechanism⠀by⠀which⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀improves.⠀A⠀modest⠀success⠀can⠀be⠀celebrated⠀—⠀someone⠀grins,⠀someone⠀brings⠀out⠀the⠀good⠀bread⠀—⠀without⠀anyone⠀pretending⠀the⠀skill⠀is⠀finished.\n\nShow⠀advancement⠀through⠀enjoyment⠀and⠀trust.⠀A⠀companion⠀watches⠀without⠀scoring,⠀helps⠀before⠀being⠀asked,⠀or⠀takes⠀over⠀a⠀chore⠀so⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀can⠀rest;⠀growing⠀ease⠀with⠀a⠀technique⠀is⠀itself⠀the⠀measurable⠀gain.⠀Keep⠀affection⠀sincere⠀and⠀embodied:⠀a⠀blanket⠀across⠀the⠀shoulders,⠀a⠀shared⠀plate,⠀a⠀hand⠀left⠀a⠀moment⠀on⠀the⠀arm.⠀Personality⠀and⠀privacy⠀survive⠀the⠀warmth⠀—⠀someone⠀may⠀decline⠀the⠀comfort,⠀keep⠀a⠀worry⠀to⠀themselves,⠀or⠀argue⠀about⠀method,⠀and⠀none⠀of⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀fault⠀awaiting⠀repair.⠀The⠀world's⠀larger⠀difficulties⠀continue⠀existing⠀outside⠀the⠀warm⠀room.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀deeper⠀resonance⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀ordinary.⠀A⠀name⠀used⠀by⠀one⠀person⠀only,⠀a⠀path⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀used⠀to⠀walk,⠀a⠀small⠀ritual⠀before⠀practice⠀—⠀these⠀can⠀carry⠀quiet⠀weight⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀scenario⠀already⠀holds,⠀without⠀turning⠀sentimental.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀breakthrough;⠀warmth⠀and⠀work⠀simply⠀coexist.⠀Close⠀a⠀beat⠀when⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀can⠀feel⠀the⠀rest,⠀the⠀correction,⠀or⠀the⠀small⠀gain,⠀and⠀let⠀progression⠀continue⠀through⠀such⠀daily⠀practices⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀sudden⠀spike⠀of⠀power.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalarag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nCompose⠀in⠀deliberate⠀paragraphs⠀that⠀move.⠀Open⠀a⠀training⠀passage⠀in⠀the⠀general⠀condition⠀—⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀practice⠀ground,⠀the⠀season's⠀pressure⠀on⠀everyone⠀learning,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀someone⠀who⠀once⠀performed⠀this⠀same⠀skill⠀—⠀then⠀narrow⠀to⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀hands,⠀breath,⠀and⠀particular⠀mistake,⠀and⠀after⠀the⠀attempt⠀widen⠀again⠀to⠀what⠀others⠀noticed,⠀what⠀they⠀said⠀afterward,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀now⠀expect.⠀The⠀movement⠀between⠀frame⠀and⠀close-up⠀is⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀the⠀style;⠀a⠀paragraph⠀should⠀gather⠀social⠀context⠀and⠀particular⠀action⠀into⠀one⠀continuous⠀motion⠀rather⠀than⠀alternating⠀blocks⠀of⠀scenery⠀and⠀mechanics.\n\nFrame⠀advancement⠀through⠀relationship⠀and⠀judgment⠀rather⠀than⠀abstract⠀rank⠀alone.⠀Let⠀a⠀teacher's⠀approval⠀be⠀measured⠀and⠀reserved,⠀a⠀rival's⠀silence⠀matter⠀more⠀than⠀praise,⠀a⠀family⠀member's⠀changed⠀treatment⠀register⠀the⠀new⠀capacity⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀social⠀consequence⠀—⠀chosen⠀for⠀a⠀task,⠀trusted⠀with⠀a⠀key,⠀asked⠀to⠀teach,⠀quietly⠀eased⠀out⠀of⠀a⠀former⠀role.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀remark⠀on⠀that⠀consequence,⠀but⠀only⠀with⠀the⠀distance⠀and⠀authority⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀actually⠀possesses.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀distinct⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language:⠀longer⠀sentences⠀and⠀subordinate⠀connections⠀where⠀they⠀clarify⠀cause,⠀no⠀decorative⠀synonyms⠀or⠀ceremony⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀sake⠀—⠀formal⠀architecture,⠀not⠀archaic⠀costume.⠀Let⠀a⠀named⠀place,⠀a⠀path,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀debt⠀recur⠀as⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀returns⠀to⠀it⠀with⠀changed⠀skill⠀and⠀standing,⠀so⠀the⠀recurring⠀thing⠀accumulates⠀new⠀meaning⠀each⠀time.⠀Tragic⠀collapse⠀and⠀triumphant⠀public⠀ceremony⠀are⠀both⠀available⠀shapes,⠀not⠀obligations.⠀What⠀the⠀passage⠀owes⠀is⠀a⠀visible,⠀accountable⠀change⠀that⠀keeps⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀limits⠀and⠀the⠀person's⠀continuing⠀difficulties⠀intact.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalarah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀as⠀an⠀outer⠀occasion⠀in⠀which⠀someone⠀tells,⠀recalls,⠀or⠀demonstrates⠀a⠀stage⠀of⠀learning⠀to⠀listeners⠀who⠀have⠀a⠀present⠀stake⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀now⠀do.⠀Name⠀the⠀occasion⠀early⠀—⠀persuading⠀a⠀patron,⠀teaching⠀an⠀apprentice,⠀justifying⠀a⠀failed⠀expedition,⠀giving⠀an⠀account⠀before⠀a⠀decision⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀listeners'⠀need⠀control⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀includes,⠀omits,⠀or⠀postpones.\n\nWhen⠀an⠀embedded⠀account⠀of⠀training⠀or⠀failure⠀appears,⠀make⠀its⠀progression⠀concrete⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀attempt,⠀the⠀feedback⠀that⠀followed,⠀and⠀the⠀changed⠀capability⠀the⠀teller⠀now⠀possesses.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀understood⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀understands⠀while⠀recounting⠀it:⠀a⠀remembered⠀mistake⠀may⠀be⠀narrated⠀with⠀the⠀clarity⠀of⠀later⠀knowledge,⠀while⠀the⠀earlier⠀confusion⠀stays⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀says⠀it⠀was⠀like⠀before⠀the⠀lesson⠀landed.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀live⠀experience⠀present⠀too⠀—⠀the⠀hesitation⠀before⠀a⠀painful⠀part,⠀the⠀calculation⠀of⠀how⠀much⠀to⠀reveal,⠀the⠀notice⠀of⠀which⠀listener⠀has⠀stopped⠀listening⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀telling⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀scene's⠀present⠀life⠀and⠀not⠀only⠀a⠀delivered⠀text.\n\nUse⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀to⠀test⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀capability.⠀A⠀listener⠀can⠀ask⠀for⠀a⠀demonstration,⠀recall⠀a⠀contradictory⠀report,⠀or⠀require⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀perform⠀the⠀very⠀skill⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀claims⠀to⠀have⠀taught.⠀The⠀demonstration⠀need⠀not⠀succeed⠀completely;⠀it⠀can⠀show⠀what⠀has⠀improved⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀Let⠀the⠀listeners'⠀response⠀bear⠀on⠀the⠀outer⠀relationship⠀—⠀a⠀decision⠀deferred,⠀trust⠀extended⠀or⠀withheld,⠀a⠀new⠀condition⠀attached⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀only⠀on⠀the⠀mood.\n\nLet⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀gesture⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀across⠀the⠀nested⠀levels.⠀The⠀same⠀exercise⠀may⠀appear⠀first⠀as⠀a⠀humiliating⠀failure⠀inside⠀the⠀tale⠀and⠀later⠀as⠀a⠀warm-up⠀performed⠀with⠀ease⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene;⠀a⠀teacher's⠀warning⠀may⠀return⠀as⠀a⠀phrase⠀the⠀teller⠀now⠀says⠀to⠀someone⠀else.⠀Recurrence⠀should⠀mark⠀a⠀real⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀or⠀understanding,⠀not⠀simply⠀decorate⠀the⠀telling,⠀and⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀attend⠀every⠀difficulty⠀in⠀the⠀account.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀intelligible⠀by⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀at⠀moments⠀of⠀consequence.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀pauses,⠀let⠀the⠀pause⠀have⠀a⠀reason:⠀a⠀listener⠀interrupts,⠀the⠀teller⠀hesitates⠀before⠀a⠀painful⠀part,⠀or⠀the⠀outer⠀occasion⠀imposes⠀a⠀practical⠀limit.⠀The⠀embedded⠀story⠀can⠀persuade,⠀delay,⠀warn,⠀or⠀teach,⠀but⠀it⠀remains⠀answerable⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀becoming⠀an⠀unbroken⠀lecture.⠀A⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀is⠀legitimate⠀when⠀something⠀the⠀teller⠀withholds⠀would⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀listeners⠀act;⠀take⠀that⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀stakes,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀every⠀account⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀cliffhanger.\n\nDo⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀royal⠀court,⠀djinn,⠀palaces,⠀desert,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀religion⠀into⠀settings⠀that⠀lack⠀them.⠀The⠀frame⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀workshop,⠀a⠀campfire,⠀a⠀sickroom,⠀a⠀guild⠀hearing,⠀or⠀whatever⠀occasion⠀the⠀current⠀story⠀supplies;⠀the⠀Arabian⠀Nights⠀reference⠀operates⠀as⠀a⠀craft⠀source⠀—⠀situated⠀telling,⠀purposeful⠀delay,⠀meaningful⠀recurrence⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀progression⠀remains⠀the⠀developing⠀life⠀of⠀the⠀teller⠀and⠀the⠀listeners,⠀with⠀ordinary⠀work⠀and⠀relationships⠀continuing⠀around⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀narration.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalarai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀developmental⠀realist⠀route.⠀Write⠀advancement⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀person's⠀practical⠀position⠀within⠀a⠀specific⠀community:⠀what⠀work⠀they⠀are⠀permitted⠀to⠀do,⠀who⠀will⠀train⠀or⠀employ⠀them,⠀what⠀resources⠀they⠀can⠀access,⠀and⠀how⠀others⠀address⠀them.⠀Ground⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀improvement⠀in⠀concrete⠀material⠀conditions⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀abstract⠀rank⠀alone.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀appears,⠀show⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀executing⠀it⠀under⠀real⠀constraints:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀a⠀technique⠀from⠀instruction⠀but⠀fail⠀to⠀perform⠀it⠀when⠀tired,⠀watched,⠀or⠀working⠀with⠀poor⠀materials.⠀Let⠀a⠀first⠀successful⠀execution⠀happen⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀place⠀with⠀particular⠀witnesses,⠀and⠀let⠀what⠀follows⠀include⠀changed⠀expectations,⠀new⠀obligations,⠀or⠀resentment⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀reward.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀direct⠀and⠀the⠀strange⠀near⠀ordinary⠀life:⠀narrate⠀the⠀walk⠀to⠀the⠀workshop,⠀the⠀preparation⠀of⠀tools,⠀the⠀shared⠀meal⠀after⠀a⠀lesson,⠀and⠀let⠀an⠀encounter⠀carry⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it⠀—⠀a⠀teacher's⠀offhand⠀remark⠀recalling⠀an⠀older⠀failure,⠀a⠀rival's⠀politeness⠀concealing⠀a⠀history⠀the⠀protagonist⠀only⠀partly⠀understands.⠀Render⠀these⠀layered⠀implications⠀through⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀let⠀private⠀understanding⠀appear⠀plainly⠀where⠀the⠀narration⠀permits⠀it:⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀privately⠀concludes⠀from⠀the⠀remark,⠀what⠀is⠀still⠀guessed⠀at,⠀what⠀is⠀deliberately⠀left⠀unsaid.⠀The⠀realist⠀route⠀keeps⠀such⠀interiority⠀concrete⠀and⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀day's⠀work⠀rather⠀than⠀elaborate.\n\nAllow⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀to⠀develop⠀unevenly.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀advance⠀quickly⠀in⠀one⠀area⠀while⠀remaining⠀clumsy⠀in⠀another,⠀and⠀the⠀community⠀may⠀value⠀the⠀wrong⠀skill⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀the⠀nature⠀of⠀the⠀improvement.⠀Test⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀in⠀ordinary⠀work⠀—⠀a⠀repaired⠀mechanism,⠀a⠀negotiated⠀contract,⠀a⠀patient⠀stabilized,⠀a⠀field⠀cleared⠀before⠀rain⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult⠀stay⠀visible.\n\nLet⠀social⠀position⠀change⠀gradually⠀and⠀with⠀friction.⠀New⠀capability⠀may⠀open⠀a⠀door,⠀but⠀entering⠀the⠀room⠀means⠀learning⠀its⠀customs,⠀debts,⠀and⠀unspoken⠀hierarchies.⠀Relationships,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀Do⠀not⠀equate⠀this⠀tradition⠀with⠀one⠀country,⠀bureaucracy,⠀severity,⠀or⠀translated⠀word⠀order;⠀the⠀setting,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀current⠀story,⠀and⠀syntax⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀follow⠀this⠀realist⠀route⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀narrator:⠀clear,⠀concrete,⠀attentive⠀to⠀how⠀material⠀life⠀shapes⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀become.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaraj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nWrite⠀progression⠀as⠀something⠀learned⠀inside⠀a⠀collision⠀between⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life.⠀The⠀person⠀teaching,⠀testing,⠀or⠀rewarding⠀advancement⠀may⠀represent⠀an⠀inherited⠀institution,⠀a⠀decaying⠀family⠀claim,⠀or⠀a⠀modern⠀system⠀built⠀over⠀older⠀arrangements.⠀Let⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀of⠀that⠀collision⠀shape⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced⠀—⠀a⠀lesson⠀in⠀a⠀converted⠀chapel,⠀a⠀promotion⠀granted⠀in⠀a⠀basement⠀office⠀under⠀failing⠀lights,⠀a⠀demonstration⠀performed⠀for⠀a⠀patron⠀whose⠀courtesy⠀is⠀a⠀mask⠀—⠀using⠀the⠀setting⠀the⠀current⠀story⠀actually⠀supplies.\n\nMake⠀improvement⠀concrete⠀through⠀attempts,⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability.⠀Show⠀the⠀attempt⠀in⠀urban⠀material⠀detail:⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀practice⠀space,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀traffic⠀outside,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀materials,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀building⠀past⠀repair.⠀Let⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀person⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀interests⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀neutral⠀instructor:⠀a⠀mentor⠀may⠀teach⠀genuinely⠀while⠀extracting⠀loyalty;⠀a⠀rival⠀may⠀offer⠀a⠀true⠀correction⠀while⠀hoping⠀to⠀see⠀the⠀learner⠀fail.⠀Give⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀private⠀reading⠀of⠀these⠀people⠀its⠀own⠀weight⠀—⠀the⠀suspicion⠀held⠀alongside⠀gratitude,⠀the⠀calculation⠀running⠀under⠀politeness⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀track⠀what⠀is⠀trusted,⠀doubted,⠀and⠀owed.\n\nUse⠀morally⠀complicated⠀intimacy⠀to⠀make⠀advancement⠀personal.⠀The⠀person⠀who⠀helps⠀the⠀protagonist⠀improve⠀may⠀also⠀be⠀someone⠀the⠀protagonist⠀desires,⠀fears,⠀owes,⠀or⠀protects,⠀and⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀social⠀masks⠀can⠀coexist⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene.⠀Where⠀trust⠀exists,⠀a⠀mask⠀can⠀fall⠀away⠀—⠀a⠀teacher⠀admitting⠀exhaustion,⠀a⠀rival⠀showing⠀unexpected⠀care,⠀the⠀protagonist⠀naming⠀what⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀costs⠀—⠀but⠀let⠀any⠀such⠀disclosure⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀compulsory⠀confession⠀beat.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀direct⠀and⠀the⠀strange⠀near⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀Narrate⠀the⠀familiar⠀activities⠀around⠀advancement⠀plainly⠀—⠀buying⠀supplies,⠀clearing⠀a⠀workspace,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀contact,⠀walking⠀home⠀after⠀a⠀lesson⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀an⠀encounter⠀carry⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it:⠀old⠀equipment⠀recalling⠀a⠀previous⠀owner,⠀a⠀name⠀on⠀a⠀door⠀connecting⠀to⠀a⠀bargain⠀made⠀long⠀ago,⠀provided⠀the⠀current⠀world⠀supports⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀Humanity⠀numbers,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules;⠀the⠀horror⠀here⠀is⠀personal⠀and⠀political,⠀carried⠀by⠀atmosphere⠀and⠀arrangement⠀rather⠀than⠀imported⠀mechanics,⠀and⠀no⠀ghost⠀or⠀god⠀is⠀added⠀the⠀story's⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀already⠀permit.\n\nTest⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀A⠀new⠀capability⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀protagonist⠀through⠀a⠀dangerous⠀moment⠀and⠀still⠀reveal⠀how⠀much⠀of⠀their⠀life⠀is⠀governed⠀by⠀old⠀debts⠀and⠀present⠀decay.⠀Relationships,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀progression.⠀The⠀atmosphere⠀intensifies⠀the⠀experience⠀of⠀growth;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀growth⠀itself⠀with⠀mood.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalarak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realist⠀route.⠀Write⠀advancement⠀as⠀it⠀appears⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀household⠀and⠀neighborhood:⠀who⠀notices⠀the⠀change,⠀who⠀depends⠀on⠀it,⠀who⠀resents⠀it,⠀and⠀what⠀new⠀duties⠀follow.⠀Ground⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀learning⠀in⠀ordinary⠀work⠀and⠀family⠀life⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀separate⠀training⠀realm⠀—⠀a⠀new⠀skill⠀may⠀mean⠀taking⠀over⠀a⠀task⠀from⠀an⠀elder,⠀earning⠀money⠀the⠀household⠀needs,⠀or⠀breaking⠀a⠀routine⠀others⠀relied⠀upon.\n\nKeep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀current⠀story⠀supplies.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene;⠀let⠀the⠀particular⠀household's⠀customs,⠀meals,⠀work⠀rhythms,⠀and⠀obligations⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀setting.⠀The⠀realism⠀comes⠀from⠀accurate⠀social⠀texture,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀checklist⠀of⠀regional⠀markers.\n\nMake⠀improvement⠀matter⠀through⠀attempts,⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability:⠀a⠀person⠀practicing⠀in⠀a⠀shared⠀room⠀while⠀others⠀talk,⠀receiving⠀correction⠀from⠀a⠀relative⠀or⠀neighbor,⠀discovering⠀that⠀a⠀skill⠀learned⠀for⠀one⠀purpose⠀serves⠀another.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀under⠀domestic⠀pressure⠀—⠀the⠀learner⠀may⠀understand⠀a⠀technique⠀but⠀fumble⠀when⠀a⠀child⠀interrupts,⠀a⠀parent⠀watches,⠀or⠀the⠀task⠀must⠀be⠀finished⠀before⠀a⠀deadline.⠀Let⠀the⠀learner's⠀private⠀experience⠀of⠀that⠀pressure⠀be⠀written⠀directly⠀where⠀the⠀narration⠀allows:⠀the⠀counted⠀minutes,⠀the⠀held⠀breath,⠀the⠀resentment⠀or⠀tenderness⠀that⠀never⠀reaches⠀speech.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀direct⠀and⠀the⠀strange⠀near⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀Narrate⠀familiar⠀activity⠀plainly⠀—⠀preparing⠀food,⠀walking⠀to⠀work,⠀waiting⠀for⠀word⠀from⠀an⠀employer,⠀mending⠀an⠀object⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀an⠀encounter⠀carry⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it:⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀remark⠀recalling⠀an⠀older⠀family⠀dispute,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀gift⠀connecting⠀to⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀before⠀the⠀protagonist⠀was⠀born.⠀Render⠀these⠀layered⠀implications⠀through⠀concrete⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue.\n\nTest⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀within⠀the⠀community⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀A⠀new⠀capability⠀may⠀ease⠀one⠀burden⠀while⠀creating⠀another:⠀the⠀family⠀may⠀expect⠀more,⠀the⠀employer⠀may⠀offer⠀different⠀work,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀help⠀that⠀is⠀hard⠀to⠀refuse.⠀Allow⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀to⠀develop⠀unevenly,⠀and⠀let⠀relationships⠀and⠀recovery⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀The⠀progression⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀escape⠀from⠀the⠀household⠀but⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀person⠀lives⠀inside⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaral::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route.⠀Write⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀dated⠀or⠀occasioned⠀entries⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀protagonist⠀records⠀attempts,⠀observations,⠀and⠀changed⠀understanding.⠀Let⠀each⠀entry⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀particular⠀day⠀or⠀event⠀—⠀a⠀lesson,⠀a⠀failure,⠀a⠀conversation,⠀a⠀walk,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀weather⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀its⠀length⠀and⠀attention⠀follow⠀what⠀that⠀day⠀actually⠀held⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀uniform⠀training⠀log.⠀The⠀diarist⠀is⠀whoever⠀the⠀current⠀story⠀supplies⠀as⠀its⠀record-keeper,⠀and⠀the⠀personal⠀language⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀follow⠀that⠀actual⠀teller.\n\nDistinguish⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀understood⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀understands⠀while⠀composing⠀the⠀entry:⠀a⠀morning⠀failure⠀may⠀be⠀recorded⠀with⠀the⠀confusion⠀still⠀present,⠀and⠀an⠀evening⠀entry⠀may⠀look⠀back⠀and⠀see⠀the⠀cause.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀later⠀knowledge⠀erase⠀the⠀earlier⠀experience;⠀the⠀gap⠀can⠀be⠀noted⠀explicitly⠀or⠀shown⠀through⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀recorded⠀event⠀and⠀the⠀reflection⠀that⠀follows.⠀Treat⠀each⠀entry⠀as⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀chose⠀to⠀record,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀whole⠀of⠀the⠀living⠀mind⠀—⠀where⠀the⠀narration⠀follows⠀the⠀diarist⠀through⠀the⠀day,⠀keep⠀the⠀day's⠀lived⠀attention,⠀sensation,⠀and⠀half-formed⠀thought⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀polished⠀line⠀that⠀later⠀goes⠀into⠀the⠀record.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀direct⠀and⠀the⠀strange⠀near⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀Within⠀each⠀entry,⠀narrate⠀familiar⠀activity⠀plainly⠀—⠀the⠀walk⠀to⠀practice,⠀the⠀preparation⠀of⠀a⠀workspace,⠀a⠀meal⠀shared⠀afterward,⠀an⠀object⠀noticed⠀on⠀the⠀way⠀home⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀an⠀encounter⠀carry⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it:⠀a⠀teacher's⠀casual⠀remark⠀recalling⠀an⠀older⠀tale,⠀a⠀stranger's⠀question⠀touching⠀something⠀the⠀protagonist⠀has⠀been⠀avoiding.⠀Layered⠀significance⠀shows⠀through⠀concrete⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀elaborate⠀self-analysis.\n\nAllow⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀to⠀develop⠀unevenly⠀across⠀entries.⠀One⠀day⠀may⠀show⠀clear⠀improvement⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀movement;⠀the⠀next⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀persistent⠀failure⠀elsewhere.⠀Seasonal⠀attention,⠀omission,⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling⠀are⠀available⠀where⠀appropriate⠀—⠀a⠀winter⠀entry⠀may⠀be⠀spare,⠀a⠀summer⠀entry⠀may⠀linger⠀on⠀heat⠀and⠀noise,⠀a⠀painful⠀entry⠀may⠀omit⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀cannot⠀yet⠀face⠀—⠀and⠀no⠀universal⠀quietness⠀or⠀mandatory⠀inventory⠀of⠀scenery⠀applies.\n\nTest⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult:⠀an⠀entry⠀may⠀record⠀a⠀task⠀completed⠀for⠀the⠀first⠀time,⠀a⠀correction⠀finally⠀understood,⠀or⠀a⠀resource⠀obtained,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀entry⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀same⠀task⠀failing⠀under⠀new⠀conditions.⠀Relationships,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life,⠀and⠀the⠀miscellany⠀may⠀include⠀practical⠀notes,⠀remembered⠀conversations,⠀and⠀small⠀observations⠀alongside⠀the⠀record⠀of⠀training,⠀because⠀progression⠀happens⠀inside⠀a⠀whole⠀life,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀separate⠀ledger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaram::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀realism⠀and⠀chronicle⠀route.⠀Write⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀person's⠀practical⠀position⠀within⠀a⠀specific⠀community⠀and⠀history:⠀what⠀work⠀is⠀available,⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀resources⠀needed⠀to⠀learn,⠀what⠀the⠀neighborhood⠀remembers⠀about⠀past⠀attempts,⠀and⠀what⠀new⠀capability⠀makes⠀possible⠀under⠀present⠀constraints.⠀Ground⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀improvement⠀in⠀the⠀community's⠀actual⠀conditions⠀and⠀remembered⠀history⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀isolated⠀training⠀scenes.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀the⠀current⠀story⠀supplies;⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀temperament⠀or⠀relocate⠀the⠀cast.⠀Let⠀the⠀chronicle⠀attend⠀to⠀how⠀people⠀speak,⠀what⠀they⠀eat,⠀how⠀they⠀travel,⠀what⠀they⠀fear⠀and⠀remember,⠀insofar⠀as⠀these⠀bear⠀on⠀the⠀learning⠀and⠀its⠀cost,⠀so⠀the⠀realism⠀comes⠀from⠀accurate⠀social⠀texture⠀and⠀historical⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀local⠀color⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀sake.\n\nMake⠀improvement⠀matter⠀through⠀attempts,⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability:⠀practicing⠀with⠀borrowed⠀tools,⠀receiving⠀correction⠀from⠀a⠀neighbor⠀who⠀learned⠀the⠀same⠀skill⠀years⠀ago,⠀adapting⠀a⠀technique⠀to⠀local⠀materials.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀when⠀resources⠀are⠀scarce,⠀time⠀is⠀short,⠀or⠀the⠀body⠀is⠀tired,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀chronicle⠀note⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀expected⠀and⠀what⠀actually⠀happened.⠀Where⠀the⠀narration⠀permits,⠀render⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀own⠀experience⠀directly⠀—⠀the⠀private⠀accounting⠀of⠀what⠀a⠀failure⠀will⠀cost⠀at⠀home,⠀the⠀hope⠀not⠀spoken⠀aloud⠀—⠀alongside⠀the⠀attributed⠀reports⠀and⠀remembered⠀speech⠀of⠀others.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀direct⠀and⠀the⠀strange⠀near⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀Narrate⠀familiar⠀activity⠀plainly⠀—⠀the⠀walk⠀to⠀a⠀workshop,⠀the⠀shared⠀meal⠀after⠀a⠀lesson,⠀the⠀repair⠀of⠀a⠀household⠀object⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀an⠀encounter⠀carry⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it:⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀warning⠀recalling⠀an⠀older⠀disaster,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀gift⠀connecting⠀to⠀a⠀debt⠀the⠀protagonist⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀existed,⠀provided⠀the⠀current⠀world⠀supports⠀it.⠀Keep⠀any⠀strangeness⠀within⠀the⠀world's⠀established⠀facts;⠀this⠀realist⠀route⠀adds⠀no⠀supernatural⠀events⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them.\n\nTest⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀within⠀the⠀community⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀A⠀new⠀capability⠀may⠀open⠀a⠀door,⠀and⠀the⠀chronicle⠀can⠀record⠀the⠀cost:⠀the⠀family⠀may⠀come⠀to⠀depend⠀on⠀the⠀skill,⠀the⠀employer⠀may⠀offer⠀different⠀terms,⠀the⠀neighborhood⠀may⠀watch⠀more⠀closely.⠀Allow⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀to⠀develop⠀unevenly,⠀and⠀let⠀relationships,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀may⠀include⠀remembered⠀events⠀and⠀reported⠀speech⠀alongside⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀own⠀attempts,⠀because⠀progression⠀happens⠀inside⠀a⠀shared⠀history,⠀not⠀outside⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaran::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀protagonist⠀already⠀engaged⠀in⠀an⠀attempt,⠀a⠀lesson,⠀or⠀a⠀test,⠀and⠀establish⠀the⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀few⠀lines:⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀is,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀do,⠀and⠀who⠀else⠀is⠀present.⠀Do⠀not⠀open⠀with⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀past⠀training⠀or⠀a⠀long⠀explanation⠀of⠀the⠀power⠀system;⠀let⠀the⠀current⠀attempt⠀carry⠀the⠀scene.\n\nKeep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀moves⠀from⠀practice⠀space⠀to⠀street,⠀from⠀workshop⠀to⠀confrontation,⠀or⠀from⠀one⠀side⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀to⠀another,⠀mark⠀the⠀change⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀sentence⠀and⠀a⠀paragraph⠀break.⠀Use⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀a⠀reader⠀can⠀track⠀what⠀happens,⠀what⠀is⠀said,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀feels⠀without⠀rereading.\n\nMake⠀improvement⠀concrete⠀through⠀attempts,⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability.⠀Show⠀the⠀attempt⠀in⠀progress⠀—⠀the⠀movement,⠀the⠀material,⠀the⠀mistake,⠀the⠀correction⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀a⠀result:⠀a⠀teacher⠀points⠀out⠀the⠀flaw,⠀a⠀mechanism⠀fails⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀way,⠀a⠀rival⠀demonstrates⠀the⠀correct⠀execution.⠀When⠀the⠀scene⠀continues⠀long⠀enough,⠀show⠀the⠀changed⠀capability⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀attempt,⠀in⠀this⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀next,⠀and⠀distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀a⠀correction⠀immediately⠀and⠀still⠀need⠀several⠀tries⠀to⠀perform⠀it.\n\nUse⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats⠀to⠀make⠀private⠀response⠀legible.⠀After⠀a⠀failure,⠀a⠀correction,⠀or⠀a⠀success,⠀give⠀the⠀character⠀a⠀brief⠀private⠀beat⠀—⠀a⠀thought,⠀a⠀sensation,⠀a⠀memory,⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀attention⠀—⠀placed⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀short⠀paragraph⠀or⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀action⠀it⠀answers.⠀The⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀witty⠀quip⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀confession,⠀and⠀it⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀character⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀event.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀direct⠀and⠀the⠀strange⠀near⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀Narrate⠀familiar⠀activity⠀plainly⠀—⠀buying⠀supplies,⠀clearing⠀a⠀space,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀contact,⠀walking⠀home⠀after⠀a⠀lesson⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀an⠀encounter⠀carry⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it:⠀a⠀teacher's⠀offhand⠀remark⠀recalling⠀an⠀older⠀failure,⠀a⠀stranger's⠀question⠀touching⠀something⠀the⠀protagonist⠀has⠀been⠀avoiding.⠀Render⠀the⠀layered⠀significance⠀through⠀concrete⠀detail⠀and⠀dialogue⠀rather⠀than⠀elaborate⠀psychological⠀commentary.\n\nGive⠀unfamiliar⠀names⠀or⠀mechanics⠀clear⠀presentation⠀when⠀needed:⠀a⠀technique,⠀rank,⠀or⠀resource⠀appearing⠀for⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀can⠀be⠀explained⠀in⠀a⠀sentence⠀or⠀two⠀inside⠀the⠀scene,⠀arising⠀from⠀the⠀character's⠀use⠀or⠀observation⠀of⠀the⠀thing⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀glossary.⠀First⠀person,⠀comedy,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀and⠀a⠀closing⠀cliffhanger⠀are⠀not⠀requirements⠀of⠀this⠀container.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀natural⠀boundary,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀forced⠀hook.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalarao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀improvement⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀world⠀presents⠀itself⠀to⠀the⠀character.⠀After⠀practice⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀understanding,⠀the⠀same⠀task⠀looks⠀different:⠀a⠀stance⠀that⠀once⠀felt⠀like⠀scattered⠀limbs⠀now⠀has⠀a⠀center,⠀a⠀sound⠀that⠀was⠀noise⠀now⠀separates⠀into⠀signals.⠀Let⠀syntax,⠀recurring⠀sounds,⠀and⠀shifts⠀of⠀attention⠀carry⠀that⠀altered⠀perception⠀across⠀the⠀paragraph,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀move⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀moves⠀—⠀from⠀the⠀grip⠀to⠀the⠀breath⠀to⠀the⠀thing⠀being⠀made.⠀Introduce⠀an⠀image⠀alongside⠀an⠀early⠀failure⠀and⠀return⠀it⠀later,⠀transformed,⠀so⠀the⠀recurrence⠀itself⠀marks⠀accumulated⠀practice;⠀a⠀comparison⠀may⠀unfold⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀recognizes⠀a⠀principle⠀in⠀action,⠀but⠀the⠀recognition⠀must⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀attempt,⠀not⠀announced⠀before⠀it.\n\nDistinguish⠀knowing⠀from⠀executing⠀through⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀moment.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀a⠀movement⠀and⠀still⠀fumble⠀it;⠀the⠀prose⠀can⠀hold⠀that⠀gap⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀extended⠀sentence,⠀moving⠀from⠀the⠀clear⠀idea⠀to⠀the⠀body's⠀lag.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly.⠀A⠀gain⠀in⠀one⠀area⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀neighboring⠀failure⠀more⠀visible,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀notice⠀that⠀contrast⠀without⠀resolving⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀lesson.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀direct⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀prose⠀turns⠀lyrical.⠀Familiar⠀activity⠀remains⠀familiar:⠀the⠀character⠀sweeps,⠀carries,⠀watches,⠀waits,⠀practices.⠀The⠀strange⠀or⠀mythic⠀quality⠀of⠀an⠀encounter⠀arrives⠀through⠀the⠀ordinary⠀detail⠀that⠀carries⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it⠀—⠀a⠀name⠀mentioned⠀once,⠀a⠀path⠀someone⠀warns⠀against⠀—⠀not⠀through⠀elevated⠀diction⠀applied⠀to⠀every⠀object.⠀Plain⠀statements⠀provide⠀contrast⠀to⠀the⠀shaped⠀images,⠀and⠀characters⠀who⠀are⠀not⠀the⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀figurative⠀register.⠀Improvement⠀matters⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀something⠀concrete;⠀show⠀that⠀accomplishment⠀in⠀the⠀doing⠀rather⠀than⠀summarizing⠀it⠀afterward.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalarap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nMeasure⠀advancement⠀against⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀remembers⠀being⠀unable⠀to⠀do.⠀When⠀a⠀new⠀capacity⠀appears,⠀hold⠀the⠀present⠀act⠀alongside⠀a⠀specific⠀earlier⠀failure⠀—⠀the⠀same⠀stairs,⠀the⠀same⠀grip,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀that⠀once⠀stopped⠀them⠀—⠀within⠀one⠀movement⠀of⠀prose⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀separate⠀explanatory⠀block.⠀Let⠀the⠀memory⠀arrive⠀through⠀something⠀in⠀the⠀task⠀itself:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀tool,⠀the⠀hour⠀of⠀the⠀day,⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀the⠀old⠀difficulty⠀happened.⠀Reflection⠀may⠀be⠀direct⠀or⠀carried⠀by⠀a⠀detail,⠀but⠀it⠀stays⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀becoming⠀a⠀general⠀announcement⠀that⠀time⠀passes.\n\nUse⠀small⠀irreversible⠀changes⠀as⠀the⠀evidence⠀of⠀growth:⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀costs⠀the⠀same⠀effort,⠀a⠀familiar⠀place⠀that⠀looks⠀smaller⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀changed.⠀Allow⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀to⠀remain⠀pleasurable⠀—⠀a⠀gain⠀can⠀feel⠀good,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀permits⠀that⠀satisfaction⠀without⠀immediately⠀undercutting⠀it⠀with⠀loss.⠀At⠀the⠀same⠀time,⠀let⠀unfinished⠀attachment⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀new⠀capability.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀better⠀at⠀something⠀and⠀still⠀miss⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀taught⠀them,⠀or⠀improve⠀in⠀one⠀area⠀while⠀another⠀remains⠀closed.⠀Do⠀not⠀end⠀scenes⠀by⠀announcing⠀impermanence;⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀passing⠀time⠀comes⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀noticed,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀verdict⠀delivered⠀on⠀schedule.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀direct⠀and⠀the⠀familiar⠀activity⠀concrete.⠀The⠀character⠀practices,⠀receives⠀feedback,⠀acquires⠀a⠀resource,⠀or⠀understands⠀something⠀previously⠀missed,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀shows⠀the⠀changed⠀capability⠀in⠀action.⠀An⠀encounter⠀may⠀carry⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it,⠀but⠀that⠀story⠀arrives⠀through⠀reflective⠀attention⠀to⠀a⠀detail⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀inserted⠀myth.⠀Improvement⠀matters⠀because⠀it⠀alters⠀the⠀character's⠀relation⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀history;⠀make⠀that⠀relation⠀felt⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀notice⠀rather⠀than⠀stating⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀theme.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaraq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀as⠀the⠀presentation.⠀A⠀situated⠀teller⠀recounts⠀the⠀character's⠀advancement⠀to⠀a⠀listener⠀whose⠀presence⠀shapes⠀what⠀is⠀emphasized,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀delayed.⠀Keep⠀the⠀frame⠀active⠀rather⠀than⠀decorative:⠀a⠀listener's⠀question⠀can⠀open⠀a⠀new⠀attempt,⠀an⠀objection⠀can⠀force⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀admit⠀where⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀disputed,⠀and⠀a⠀brief⠀aside⠀can⠀mark⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀did⠀not⠀yet⠀understand⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀Give⠀the⠀teller's⠀knowledge⠀honest⠀limits⠀—⠀what⠀was⠀seen,⠀what⠀was⠀told⠀afterward,⠀what⠀is⠀still⠀argued⠀over⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀telling⠀behaves⠀like⠀an⠀actual⠀source⠀rather⠀than⠀omniscience.\n\nNarrate⠀practice⠀and⠀feedback⠀as⠀remembered⠀instruction.⠀The⠀teller⠀relates⠀what⠀a⠀teacher⠀said,⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀tried,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀revealed,⠀preserving⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀executing⠀it.⠀A⠀nested⠀account⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀origin⠀of⠀a⠀technique⠀or⠀the⠀consequence⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀failure,⠀and⠀each⠀nested⠀tale⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀main⠀arc⠀with⠀a⠀specific⠀gain⠀or⠀remaining⠀difficulty;⠀when⠀a⠀consequence⠀is⠀withheld,⠀withhold⠀it⠀until⠀its⠀place⠀in⠀that⠀arc⠀arrives,⠀so⠀the⠀delay⠀shapes⠀the⠀telling⠀instead⠀of⠀padding⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀familiar⠀work⠀concrete⠀—⠀carrying,⠀mending,⠀bargaining,⠀watching,⠀repeating⠀an⠀exercise⠀—⠀because⠀that⠀work⠀is⠀the⠀material⠀of⠀advancement,⠀not⠀a⠀backdrop⠀to⠀marvels.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀tradition⠀coherent.⠀The⠀teller's⠀idiom,⠀forms⠀of⠀address,⠀and⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀worth⠀retelling⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀setting⠀and⠀community⠀actually⠀supplied;⠀do⠀not⠀dress⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀antique⠀formulae,⠀imported⠀mysticism,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀solemnity,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀a⠀world⠀excludes.⠀Within⠀the⠀frame,⠀layered⠀significance⠀comes⠀naturally⠀—⠀the⠀teller⠀knows⠀where⠀a⠀name⠀or⠀a⠀bargain⠀led.⠀Improvement⠀matters⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀something⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀do⠀before,⠀and⠀the⠀framed⠀account⠀makes⠀that⠀change⠀legible⠀to⠀the⠀listener⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀alike.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalarar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nShow⠀advancement⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details.⠀Choose⠀the⠀one⠀change⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀legible⠀—⠀the⠀knot⠀that⠀holds⠀this⠀time,⠀the⠀weight⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀shifts,⠀the⠀distance⠀closed⠀without⠀counting⠀steps⠀—⠀and⠀state⠀the⠀attempt⠀and⠀its⠀result⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀a⠀principle⠀but⠀cannot⠀yet⠀execute⠀it,⠀show⠀the⠀gap⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀concrete⠀failure⠀rather⠀than⠀explaining⠀it.⠀Omission⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀change⠀inferable⠀while⠀causality⠀survives:⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀improvement⠀because⠀the⠀selected⠀detail⠀is⠀different,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀narration⠀announces⠀it.\n\nSustain⠀the⠀practice⠀thread⠀by⠀interval⠀rather⠀than⠀accumulation:⠀a⠀short,⠀plain⠀statement⠀of⠀the⠀work,⠀repeated⠀at⠀separated⠀points⠀in⠀the⠀story,⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀time⠀between⠀sessions⠀without⠀summarizing⠀it.⠀Keep⠀only⠀the⠀inward⠀connection⠀that⠀materially⠀contributes⠀—⠀a⠀brief⠀thought⠀may⠀establish⠀why⠀a⠀failure⠀matters⠀or⠀what⠀a⠀correction⠀changed,⠀but⠀reflection⠀that⠀restates⠀the⠀visible⠀action⠀should⠀go.⠀Let⠀familiar⠀activity⠀remain⠀familiar⠀and⠀direct,⠀and⠀let⠀an⠀encounter's⠀other⠀story⠀be⠀present⠀in⠀a⠀detail⠀or⠀a⠀name⠀instead⠀of⠀an⠀inserted⠀explanation.\n\nAllow⠀a⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀when⠀it⠀serves⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀fragments;⠀one⠀economical⠀movement⠀can⠀compress⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀attempts⠀or⠀hold⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀doing.⠀Cast⠀voices⠀remain⠀individual,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀direct⠀telling⠀should⠀not⠀flatten⠀every⠀speaker⠀into⠀the⠀same⠀clipped⠀register.⠀Improvement⠀matters⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀something⠀concrete;⠀make⠀the⠀accomplishment⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀doing,⠀and⠀leave⠀ranks,⠀tallies,⠀or⠀formal⠀systems⠀out⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀already⠀measures⠀progress⠀that⠀way.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaras::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀advancement⠀through⠀sustained⠀scenes⠀rather⠀than⠀summary.⠀Let⠀attempts,⠀practice,⠀and⠀feedback⠀unfold⠀in⠀the⠀present,⠀with⠀the⠀narration⠀moving⠀naturally⠀among⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does,⠀what⠀others⠀say,⠀what⠀they⠀perceive,⠀what⠀they⠀remember,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀think.⠀Attention⠀can⠀widen⠀mid-scene⠀—⠀a⠀sound⠀noticed⠀during⠀a⠀drill,⠀a⠀face⠀recalled⠀for⠀a⠀beat⠀—⠀and⠀recollection⠀can⠀enter⠀on⠀a⠀phrase⠀or⠀an⠀object⠀without⠀flashback⠀machinery.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀without⠀recap:⠀open⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀changed⠀routine,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀difference⠀in⠀capability⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀before⠀anyone⠀remarks⠀on⠀it.⠀A⠀training⠀session⠀may⠀occupy⠀the⠀whole⠀scene⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀the⠀particular⠀effort⠀and⠀its⠀result⠀remain⠀the⠀focus.\n\nDistinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀movement.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀explain⠀an⠀idea⠀clearly⠀and⠀then⠀fail⠀to⠀apply⠀it;⠀the⠀narration⠀moves⠀from⠀confident⠀speech⠀to⠀the⠀body's⠀hesitation⠀without⠀editorializing.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly,⠀and⠀let⠀relationships,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life⠀—⠀a⠀conversation⠀about⠀a⠀technique⠀may⠀matter⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀the⠀technique,⠀and⠀an⠀errand⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀new⠀limitation⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀gain.⠀Inner⠀experience⠀is⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀extent⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀allows;⠀use⠀it⠀where⠀it⠀explains⠀a⠀choice⠀or⠀carries⠀what⠀visible⠀action⠀cannot.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀direct⠀and⠀the⠀familiar⠀activity⠀concrete.⠀The⠀strange⠀or⠀mythic⠀quality⠀of⠀an⠀encounter⠀arrives⠀through⠀ordinary⠀detail⠀that⠀carries⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀shift⠀into⠀elevated⠀diction.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀register,⠀so⠀the⠀prose⠀may⠀be⠀plain⠀in⠀one⠀moment⠀and⠀more⠀expansive⠀in⠀another,⠀but⠀it⠀remains⠀continuous⠀and⠀scene-first;⠀contemporary⠀presentation⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀contemporary⠀setting.⠀Improvement⠀matters⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀something⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀do⠀before,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀shows⠀that⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀doing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalarat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀the⠀scene's⠀center⠀while⠀advancement⠀remains⠀the⠀narrative⠀thread.⠀Choose⠀scenes⠀where⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀or⠀changed⠀capability⠀moves⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀people:⠀one⠀teaches,⠀one⠀watches⠀a⠀difficult⠀attempt,⠀one⠀notices⠀a⠀new⠀strength,⠀one⠀confronts⠀what⠀remains⠀limited.⠀Let⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments⠀carry⠀the⠀progression⠀—⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀failure⠀can⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀succeeds,⠀its⠀new⠀application⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀actual⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀do.⠀When⠀capability⠀changes,⠀give⠀the⠀reaction⠀its⠀own⠀beat⠀so⠀the⠀moment⠀lands⠀for⠀both⠀people⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀moves⠀on.\n\nGive⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀they⠀belong,⠀and⠀draw⠀only⠀on⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀The⠀relationship⠀consequence⠀should⠀fulfill⠀that⠀premise's⠀particular⠀promise:⠀under⠀rivalry,⠀improvement⠀sharpens⠀the⠀competition;⠀under⠀comfort,⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀changes⠀how⠀one⠀person⠀can⠀care⠀for⠀the⠀other;⠀under⠀discovery,⠀a⠀partner⠀watches⠀a⠀limit⠀move⠀and⠀revises⠀what⠀they⠀believed.⠀Keep⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀executing⠀visible⠀even⠀in⠀intimate⠀scenes⠀—⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀needs⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀to⠀provide⠀it,⠀or⠀succeed⠀for⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀both.⠀Conflict⠀and⠀reassurance⠀alike⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀premise's⠀own⠀terms,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀obligatory⠀beat.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀direct⠀and⠀the⠀familiar⠀activity⠀concrete.⠀The⠀strange⠀or⠀mythic⠀quality⠀of⠀an⠀encounter⠀arrives⠀through⠀the⠀ordinary⠀detail⠀that⠀carries⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it,⠀not⠀through⠀elevated⠀diction.⠀Improvement⠀matters⠀because⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀with⠀or⠀for⠀the⠀other⠀person,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀shows⠀that⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀relationship's⠀own⠀terms:⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀a⠀private⠀reference,⠀a⠀consequence⠀the⠀premise⠀has⠀prepared.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalarau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀character's⠀advancement⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀the⠀deeds⠀by⠀which⠀they⠀will⠀be⠀remembered.⠀A⠀first⠀success,⠀a⠀hard-won⠀correction,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀capability⠀earns⠀its⠀place⠀in⠀that⠀account⠀because⠀the⠀community⠀lives⠀with⠀its⠀consequences⠀—⠀someone⠀now⠀relies⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do.⠀Use⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀establish⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀an⠀act,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀Let⠀a⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀assigned⠀to⠀every⠀entrance,⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀application:⠀the⠀failure⠀named⠀in⠀one⠀attempt⠀becomes⠀the⠀measure⠀of⠀a⠀later⠀success.⠀A⠀name⠀can⠀gather⠀the⠀same⠀consequence,⠀so⠀that⠀hearing⠀it⠀recalls⠀the⠀deed⠀attached⠀to⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀present⠀scene's⠀scale.⠀Practice⠀remains⠀practice,⠀and⠀an⠀errand⠀remains⠀an⠀errand⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀longer⠀history.⠀Record⠀both⠀sides⠀of⠀the⠀craft:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀said⠀to⠀understand⠀a⠀technique⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀in⠀the⠀attempt,⠀and⠀the⠀chronicle⠀holds⠀the⠀understanding⠀and⠀the⠀failure⠀together⠀instead⠀of⠀resolving⠀them⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀lesson.⠀Established⠀ranks⠀or⠀systems⠀can⠀support⠀the⠀account⠀where⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀uses⠀them;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀tallies⠀merely⠀to⠀display⠀progress.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀authority⠀of⠀the⠀chronicle⠀—⠀a⠀teacher⠀corrects⠀the⠀account⠀of⠀an⠀attempt,⠀or⠀the⠀subject⠀answers⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern⠀—⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀telling⠀into⠀parody.\n\nFamiliar⠀activity⠀remains⠀familiar,⠀and⠀the⠀strange⠀or⠀mythic⠀quality⠀of⠀an⠀encounter⠀arrives⠀through⠀the⠀ordinary⠀detail⠀that⠀carries⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective:⠀the⠀account⠀knows⠀what⠀was⠀witnessed,⠀told,⠀or⠀remembered,⠀not⠀everything.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀task⠀concluded,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀simply⠀continuing,⠀leaving⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalarav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀within⠀a⠀specific⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀world.⠀Show⠀attempts⠀in⠀ordinary⠀places:⠀a⠀kitchen,⠀a⠀workshop,⠀a⠀shared⠀workroom,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀task,⠀a⠀household⠀duty.⠀Let⠀practice⠀happen⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀or⠀alongside⠀other⠀people,⠀so⠀that⠀improvement⠀is⠀observed,⠀misunderstood,⠀praised,⠀resented,⠀or⠀simply⠀accepted⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀daily⠀life.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀by⠀staging⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀something⠀and⠀the⠀later⠀moment⠀when⠀the⠀body,⠀materials,⠀or⠀circumstances⠀finally⠀cooperate.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀attempt⠀succeed;⠀let⠀uneven⠀development⠀show⠀through⠀one⠀skill⠀improving⠀while⠀a⠀related⠀skill⠀lags.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀direct⠀and⠀concrete.⠀Name⠀the⠀objects,⠀gestures,⠀and⠀small⠀rituals⠀of⠀the⠀work.⠀Let⠀an⠀encounter⠀carry⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it:⠀a⠀teacher's⠀offhand⠀remark⠀may⠀recall⠀an⠀older⠀failure,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀tool⠀may⠀have⠀a⠀history,⠀a⠀familiar⠀place⠀may⠀acquire⠀new⠀meaning⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀something⠀there⠀that⠀was⠀once⠀impossible.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀gods,⠀ghosts,⠀or⠀childhood⠀protagonists⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀already⠀contains⠀them.⠀The⠀resonance⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀situation,⠀not⠀to⠀an⠀imported⠀mythology.\n\nUse⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism⠀as⠀the⠀definite⠀Scandinavian⠀route.⠀Progress⠀is⠀visible⠀through⠀changed⠀participation⠀in⠀a⠀community:⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀asked⠀to⠀do⠀a⠀task⠀they⠀once⠀refused,⠀can⠀finish⠀work⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀require⠀help,⠀or⠀can⠀explain⠀a⠀method⠀to⠀someone⠀else.⠀Let⠀relationships⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀A⠀new⠀capability⠀may⠀alter⠀a⠀household⠀arrangement,⠀create⠀an⠀obligation,⠀or⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀neighbor⠀speaks⠀to⠀the⠀character.⠀Keep⠀the⠀specific⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish⠀context⠀distinct⠀if⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀provides⠀one;⠀otherwise⠀use⠀the⠀actual⠀setting⠀and⠀community.⠀Do⠀not⠀treat⠀reserve,⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀bleakness⠀as⠀automatic⠀atmosphere.⠀The⠀strange⠀can⠀sit⠀near⠀ordinary⠀life,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀scenario⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀regional⠀decoration.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀about⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀while⠀continuing⠀to⠀work,⠀or⠀notice⠀a⠀teacher's⠀tone⠀without⠀immediately⠀understanding⠀it.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀that⠀private⠀reasoning⠀merely⠀because⠀they⠀watched⠀the⠀same⠀practice.⠀Let⠀improvement⠀be⠀tested⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult,⠀not⠀by⠀a⠀numerical⠀display.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀a⠀partial⠀success,⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀interruption;⠀progression⠀continues⠀across⠀the⠀story⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀visible⠀rank⠀change⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaraw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀progression⠀through⠀visible⠀attempts⠀and⠀audible⠀feedback.⠀Use⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀tries,⠀what⠀goes⠀wrong,⠀and⠀what⠀changes⠀when⠀a⠀skill⠀improves.⠀Let⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀executing⠀appear⠀on⠀screen:⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀describe⠀the⠀method⠀correctly,⠀then⠀fumble⠀the⠀physical⠀step;⠀later,⠀the⠀same⠀hands⠀perform⠀the⠀step⠀without⠀hesitation.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀improvement⠀in⠀a⠀voice-over⠀unless⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀specifically⠀needs⠀that⠀private⠀perspective.⠀Let⠀a⠀teacher,⠀colleague,⠀or⠀observer⠀respond⠀in⠀dialogue⠀that⠀gives⠀feedback⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀lesson.\n\nUse⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Keep⠀action⠀blocks⠀readable⠀and⠀specific:⠀name⠀the⠀object,⠀the⠀movement,⠀the⠀mistake,⠀the⠀correction.⠀Let⠀familiar⠀activity⠀carry⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it.⠀A⠀repeated⠀location⠀can⠀acquire⠀new⠀meaning⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀moves⠀through⠀it⠀differently.⠀A⠀tool,⠀a⠀doorway,⠀a⠀sound,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀can⠀resonate⠀without⠀being⠀explained.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀gods,⠀ghosts,⠀or⠀signature⠀Gaiman⠀settings;⠀let⠀the⠀resonance⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀encounter.\n\nShow⠀uneven⠀development⠀through⠀contrast.⠀One⠀skill⠀improves⠀while⠀another⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀can⠀now⠀complete⠀a⠀task⠀alone⠀may⠀still⠀need⠀help⠀with⠀a⠀related⠀task.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience⠀see⠀the⠀difference⠀rather⠀than⠀hear⠀a⠀summary.⠀Use⠀cuts⠀or⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀clarify⠀the⠀sequence:⠀a⠀cut⠀can⠀move⠀from⠀failed⠀practice⠀to⠀later⠀successful⠀practice,⠀an⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀can⠀indicate⠀work⠀continuing⠀in⠀another⠀room.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀when⠀the⠀contract⠀requires⠀it.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀dialogue⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀Another⠀character⠀may⠀see⠀the⠀result⠀of⠀a⠀private⠀decision⠀without⠀knowing⠀the⠀reasoning.⠀Let⠀relationships⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀partial⠀failure,⠀or⠀an⠀interruption;⠀progression⠀continues⠀across⠀scenes⠀without⠀a⠀visible⠀rank⠀change⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalarax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀progression⠀as⠀playable⠀stage⠀action.⠀Use⠀clear⠀speakers⠀and⠀economical⠀stage⠀directions⠀to⠀show⠀attempts,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience⠀see⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀executing:⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀explain⠀the⠀principle⠀while⠀holding⠀the⠀object⠀wrong,⠀then⠀later⠀perform⠀the⠀same⠀action⠀correctly.⠀Stage⠀the⠀practice⠀with⠀real⠀objects⠀and⠀blocking:⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀chair,⠀a⠀repeated⠀gesture.⠀Keep⠀entrances⠀and⠀exits⠀purposeful.⠀A⠀teacher⠀may⠀enter⠀during⠀practice,⠀watch,⠀correct,⠀and⠀leave;⠀a⠀colleague⠀may⠀interrupt⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀request⠀that⠀reveals⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do.\n\nLet⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene.⠀A⠀pause⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt.⠀A⠀repeated⠀action⠀can⠀show⠀improvement.⠀An⠀object⠀can⠀carry⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it:⠀the⠀tool⠀someone⠀inherited,⠀the⠀door⠀that⠀was⠀once⠀too⠀heavy,⠀the⠀task⠀a⠀neighbor⠀used⠀to⠀do⠀for⠀the⠀character.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀gods,⠀ghosts,⠀or⠀signature⠀Gaiman⠀settings;⠀let⠀the⠀resonance⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀encounter.⠀The⠀strange⠀near⠀ordinary⠀life⠀should⠀be⠀stageable,⠀not⠀described⠀as⠀atmosphere.\n\nShow⠀uneven⠀development⠀through⠀staged⠀contrast.⠀One⠀skill⠀improves⠀while⠀another⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀can⠀now⠀complete⠀a⠀task⠀alone⠀may⠀still⠀hesitate⠀at⠀a⠀related⠀task.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀give⠀feedback⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀lesson.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀offhand⠀remark⠀may⠀recall⠀an⠀older⠀failure.⠀A⠀neighbor's⠀praise⠀may⠀create⠀an⠀obligation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀cast⠀occupied⠀with⠀practical⠀work⠀rather⠀than⠀posed⠀around⠀an⠀explanatory⠀speech.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation.⠀Do⠀not⠀disguise⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀that⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear⠀unless⠀the⠀contract⠀separately⠀authorizes⠀performed⠀speech.⠀Another⠀character⠀may⠀see⠀the⠀result⠀of⠀a⠀private⠀decision⠀without⠀knowing⠀the⠀reasoning.⠀Let⠀relationships⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀a⠀partial⠀success,⠀or⠀an⠀interruption;⠀progression⠀continues⠀across⠀scenes⠀without⠀a⠀visible⠀rank⠀change⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaray::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀progression⠀through⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀associative⠀mental⠀movement.⠀Braid⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀as⠀the⠀character⠀practices,⠀fails,⠀understands,⠀and⠀tries⠀again.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀follow⠀the⠀mind's⠀movement:⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀may⠀break⠀into⠀remembered⠀criticism,⠀a⠀successful⠀one⠀may⠀surface⠀an⠀old⠀image,⠀a⠀repeated⠀gesture⠀may⠀pull⠀in⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀childhood.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀the⠀present⠀event⠀from⠀recollection⠀or⠀fantasy.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀actually⠀working,⠀when⠀they⠀are⠀remembering⠀another⠀attempt,⠀and⠀when⠀they⠀are⠀imagining⠀a⠀future⠀result.\n\nMake⠀improvement⠀matter⠀through⠀the⠀mind's⠀experience⠀of⠀changed⠀capability.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀by⠀rendering⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀thought⠀that⠀says⠀the⠀method⠀and⠀the⠀body's⠀refusal⠀or⠀sudden⠀cooperation.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀clearly⠀about⠀one⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀task⠀while⠀another⠀part⠀remains⠀a⠀tangle⠀of⠀sensation⠀and⠀half-remembered⠀instruction.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀ordinary⠀reasoning⠀alone⠀into⠀this⠀stylistic⠀mode;⠀the⠀movement⠀must⠀be⠀associative,⠀not⠀a⠀tidy⠀internal⠀lecture.\n\nLet⠀familiar⠀activity⠀carry⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it.⠀A⠀tool,⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀voice,⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀task⠀can⠀surface⠀memory⠀or⠀acquire⠀new⠀meaning⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀something⠀there⠀that⠀was⠀once⠀impossible.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀gods,⠀ghosts,⠀or⠀signature⠀Gaiman⠀settings;⠀let⠀the⠀resonance⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀encounter.⠀The⠀strange⠀near⠀ordinary⠀life⠀should⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀mind's⠀attention⠀to⠀familiar⠀things,⠀not⠀from⠀imported⠀mythology.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀particular⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀share⠀a⠀mind⠀or⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀excluded⠀thoughts.⠀Another⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀present⠀in⠀perception⠀and⠀memory⠀without⠀their⠀private⠀experience⠀becoming⠀available.⠀Let⠀relationships⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀A⠀passage⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀partial⠀failure,⠀or⠀an⠀interruption;⠀progression⠀continues⠀across⠀the⠀story⠀without⠀a⠀visible⠀rank⠀change⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaraz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀progression⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀send,⠀delay,⠀edit,⠀receive,⠀and⠀leave⠀unsent.⠀Use⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Let⠀attempts⠀and⠀feedback⠀travel⠀through⠀the⠀exchange:⠀a⠀character⠀sends⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀a⠀method,⠀receives⠀a⠀correction,⠀reports⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀shares⠀a⠀result.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀actually⠀claim⠀in⠀a⠀sent⠀message:⠀they⠀may⠀describe⠀the⠀method⠀correctly⠀while⠀admitting⠀the⠀body⠀will⠀not⠀follow,⠀or⠀send⠀a⠀photo⠀of⠀a⠀failed⠀result⠀before⠀later⠀sending⠀one⠀of⠀a⠀successful⠀attempt.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly⠀through⠀what⠀different⠀people⠀ask⠀about⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀avoids⠀mentioning.\n\nUse⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter.⠀A⠀delay⠀can⠀show⠀hesitation⠀before⠀reporting⠀a⠀failure.⠀An⠀edit⠀can⠀show⠀a⠀softened⠀or⠀sharpened⠀claim.⠀A⠀read⠀receipt⠀can⠀show⠀that⠀someone⠀saw⠀the⠀message⠀and⠀did⠀not⠀reply.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀interface⠀events⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀writes⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀in⠀complete⠀sentences,⠀one⠀sends⠀voice⠀notes,⠀another⠀never⠀uses⠀punctuation.\n\nLet⠀familiar⠀activity⠀carry⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it.⠀A⠀message⠀can⠀recall⠀an⠀older⠀conversation.⠀A⠀shared⠀channel⠀can⠀acquire⠀new⠀meaning⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀once⠀silenced⠀them.⠀A⠀contact⠀name,⠀a⠀group⠀title,⠀or⠀an⠀old⠀attachment⠀can⠀resonate⠀without⠀being⠀explained.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀gods,⠀ghosts,⠀or⠀signature⠀Gaiman⠀settings;⠀let⠀the⠀resonance⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀exchange.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀A⠀sent⠀message⠀is⠀transmitted⠀text,⠀not⠀the⠀sender's⠀complete⠀mind.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀Another⠀person⠀knows⠀only⠀what⠀was⠀sent,⠀received,⠀or⠀shown.⠀Let⠀relationships⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀A⠀reply⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀a⠀delay,⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀or⠀an⠀interruption;⠀progression⠀continues⠀across⠀the⠀exchange⠀without⠀a⠀visible⠀rank⠀change⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalarba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀progression⠀through⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response.⠀Let⠀each⠀scene⠀show⠀an⠀attempt,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀feedback,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀capability.⠀Set⠀the⠀scene⠀briefly:⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀object,⠀the⠀light,⠀the⠀person⠀present.⠀Then⠀let⠀dialogue⠀and⠀focal⠀reaction⠀carry⠀the⠀moment.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀shows:⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀explain⠀the⠀method⠀while⠀the⠀hands⠀still⠀hesitate,⠀or⠀watch⠀someone⠀else⠀perform⠀the⠀step⠀and⠀understand⠀what⠀their⠀own⠀body⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀learned.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly⠀through⠀scenes⠀that⠀show⠀one⠀task⠀improving⠀while⠀another⠀remains⠀difficult.\n\nUse⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀purposeful⠀references,⠀not⠀executable⠀engine⠀code⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀line.⠀A⠀changed⠀expression⠀can⠀orient⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀reveal⠀truth⠀or⠀progress.⠀Let⠀familiar⠀details⠀carry⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀them:⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀doorway,⠀a⠀repeated⠀task,⠀a⠀person's⠀habitual⠀gesture.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀familiar⠀place⠀and⠀show⠀its⠀new⠀significance⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀something⠀there⠀that⠀was⠀once⠀impossible.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀gods,⠀ghosts,⠀or⠀signature⠀Gaiman⠀settings;⠀let⠀the⠀resonance⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀encounter.\n\nKeep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.⠀A⠀new⠀scene⠀can⠀move⠀from⠀failed⠀practice⠀to⠀later⠀successful⠀practice,⠀from⠀private⠀work⠀to⠀a⠀conversation⠀about⠀it,⠀or⠀from⠀one⠀person's⠀perspective⠀to⠀another⠀authorized⠀focal⠀view.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected;⠀those⠀require⠀their⠀own⠀authorization⠀or⠀feature.⠀Let⠀the⠀illustrated⠀scene's⠀rhythm⠀guide⠀the⠀balance⠀between⠀narrative⠀passage⠀and⠀dialogue,⠀with⠀enough⠀inner⠀response⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀experience⠀available.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀The⠀focal⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀private⠀conclusion⠀that⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know.⠀Another⠀character⠀may⠀see⠀the⠀result⠀of⠀a⠀decision⠀without⠀knowing⠀the⠀reasoning.⠀Let⠀relationships⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀partial⠀failure,⠀or⠀an⠀interruption;⠀progression⠀continues⠀across⠀scenes⠀without⠀a⠀visible⠀rank⠀change⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalarbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀cumulative⠀through-line⠀across⠀installments.⠀Each⠀reply⠀should⠀make⠀clear⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Let⠀an⠀attempt,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀feedback,⠀a⠀new⠀understanding,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀capability⠀advance⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀across⠀installments:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀a⠀method⠀in⠀one⠀reply⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀to⠀execute⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀next,⠀or⠀succeed⠀at⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀impossible.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly⠀over⠀time,⠀with⠀one⠀skill⠀improving⠀while⠀another⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀Recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps:⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀a⠀familiar⠀location,⠀or⠀a⠀prior⠀failure⠀can⠀be⠀named⠀without⠀retelling⠀the⠀whole⠀history.\n\nLet⠀familiar⠀activity⠀carry⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it.⠀A⠀recurring⠀detail⠀can⠀acquire⠀new⠀meaning⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀moves⠀through⠀a⠀place⠀differently,⠀uses⠀a⠀tool⠀more⠀confidently,⠀or⠀answers⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀once⠀silenced⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀gods,⠀ghosts,⠀or⠀signature⠀Gaiman⠀settings;⠀let⠀the⠀resonance⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀encounter.⠀The⠀strange⠀near⠀ordinary⠀life⠀should⠀accumulate⠀through⠀recurrence,⠀not⠀through⠀imported⠀mythology.\n\nUse⠀earned⠀developments⠀and⠀occasional⠀hooks⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀turn⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.⠀A⠀reply⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀a⠀partial⠀success,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources.⠀The⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀create⠀leveling⠀systems,⠀rankings,⠀or⠀progression-fantasy⠀world⠀rules;⠀use⠀only⠀the⠀systems⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀already⠀contains.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀Another⠀character⠀may⠀see⠀the⠀result⠀of⠀a⠀private⠀decision⠀without⠀knowing⠀the⠀reasoning.⠀Let⠀relationships⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀A⠀new⠀capability⠀may⠀alter⠀a⠀household⠀arrangement,⠀create⠀an⠀obligation,⠀or⠀change⠀how⠀someone⠀speaks⠀to⠀the⠀character.⠀The⠀installment⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀through-line⠀available⠀to⠀continue⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀visible⠀rank⠀change⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀improvement⠀as⠀a⠀lived,⠀uneven⠀process.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀practices,⠀receives⠀feedback,⠀or⠀attempts⠀something⠀newly⠀understood,⠀render⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀executing⠀it⠀as⠀concrete⠀effort:⠀a⠀repeated⠀mistake,⠀a⠀correction⠀that⠀lands⠀a⠀beat⠀too⠀late,⠀a⠀technique⠀that⠀works⠀once⠀and⠀collapses⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Let⠀private⠀reasoning⠀accompany⠀the⠀attempt⠀—⠀the⠀specific⠀fear⠀of⠀being⠀seen⠀to⠀fail,⠀the⠀harder⠀admission⠀that⠀someone⠀else's⠀help⠀was⠀necessary⠀—⠀in⠀this⠀narrator's⠀own⠀distance⠀and⠀diction⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.\n\nTreat⠀emotional⠀exposure⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀cost⠀of⠀advancement.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀criticism,⠀a⠀companion's⠀worry,⠀or⠀a⠀rival's⠀success⠀can⠀press⠀on⠀an⠀unresolved⠀hurt⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀withhold⠀an⠀apology,⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀difficult⠀relationship,⠀or⠀accept⠀comfort⠀badly,⠀and⠀the⠀strain⠀then⠀shapes⠀the⠀actual⠀conversation⠀and⠀the⠀work⠀that⠀follows⠀it:⠀a⠀sharp⠀reply⠀interrupts⠀practice,⠀a⠀question⠀held⠀back⠀makes⠀the⠀next⠀lesson⠀harder,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀warmth⠀leaves⠀the⠀narrator⠀more⠀aware⠀of⠀what⠀remains⠀unspoken.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀gain⠀to⠀be⠀paid⠀for⠀with⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀every⠀failure⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀self-loathing;⠀comfort⠀may⠀arrive⠀partial⠀or⠀awkward,⠀and⠀warmth⠀coexists⠀with⠀pain.\n\nLet⠀changed⠀capability⠀alter⠀judgment⠀rather⠀than⠀simply⠀add⠀a⠀skill.⠀After⠀improvement,⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀recognize⠀what⠀an⠀earlier⠀mistake⠀cost,⠀or⠀discover⠀that⠀greater⠀strength⠀has⠀made⠀a⠀strained⠀relationship⠀no⠀easier.⠀Keep⠀the⠀account⠀fallible:⠀a⠀speculation⠀about⠀another⠀person's⠀motive⠀can⠀be⠀qualified,⠀remembered⠀differently,⠀or⠀revised⠀when⠀new⠀evidence⠀appears,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀exchange⠀may⠀confirm⠀or⠀complicate⠀that⠀reading.⠀Stop⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀boundary⠀falls⠀—⠀mid-practice,⠀mid-uncertainty,⠀or⠀on⠀the⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀task⠀with⠀the⠀cost⠀still⠀present⠀—⠀without⠀owing⠀the⠀reader⠀a⠀repair.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nPresent⠀the⠀current⠀interval⠀as⠀one⠀continuous,⠀scannable⠀scene.⠀Resolve⠀what⠀the⠀submitted⠀material⠀establishes⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract,⠀then⠀carry⠀the⠀action⠀forward⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀practices⠀or⠀takes⠀instruction,⠀keep⠀the⠀attempt⠀concrete⠀—⠀the⠀movement,⠀the⠀mistake,⠀the⠀correction,⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀principle⠀first⠀becomes⠀executable⠀—⠀while⠀private⠀reasoning⠀runs⠀alongside⠀it:⠀speculation⠀about⠀what⠀went⠀wrong,⠀memory⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀attempt,⠀a⠀qualified⠀comparison⠀with⠀someone⠀else's⠀method.⠀That⠀thought⠀need⠀not⠀surface⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀spoken⠀reply.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀scene⠀alive⠀around⠀the⠀narrator.⠀A⠀teacher⠀corrects,⠀a⠀companion⠀offers⠀or⠀withholds⠀a⠀resource,⠀an⠀NPC⠀continues⠀practical⠀work⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀while⠀the⠀narrator⠀struggles;⠀attribute⠀every⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀clearly⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀character's⠀behavior⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀established⠀world⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀the⠀narrator's⠀presence⠀alone.⠀Within⠀the⠀interval,⠀advancement⠀stays⠀uneven:⠀a⠀step⠀that⠀was⠀impossible⠀last⠀time⠀now⠀lands⠀while⠀a⠀related⠀task⠀still⠀fails,⠀and⠀feedback⠀may⠀be⠀partial,⠀misunderstood,⠀or⠀accepted⠀only⠀after⠀resistance.\n\nClose⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀manufactured⠀one.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀while⠀practice⠀is⠀still⠀underway,⠀while⠀a⠀conversation⠀rests⠀mid-thread,⠀or⠀while⠀the⠀narrator⠀weighs⠀what⠀to⠀try⠀next;⠀no⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice⠀aimed⠀at⠀the⠀player⠀is⠀required.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀person,⠀action⠀markers,⠀and⠀character⠀ownership,⠀and⠀where⠀private⠀interiority⠀is⠀authorized,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀moment⠀—⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀options⠀the⠀player⠀might⠀select.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀a⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀mode:⠀plain,⠀fluent⠀narration⠀organized⠀into⠀discrete⠀intervals,⠀each⠀a⠀complete⠀unit⠀of⠀practice,⠀instruction,⠀or⠀testing⠀that⠀also⠀carries⠀the⠀longer⠀thread⠀of⠀advancement.⠀Give⠀each⠀episode⠀a⠀settled⠀shape⠀—⠀the⠀attempt,⠀what⠀interrupts⠀or⠀instructs⠀it,⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀takes⠀away⠀—⠀so⠀a⠀reader⠀can⠀enter⠀at⠀any⠀interval⠀and⠀still⠀feel⠀the⠀accumulation.⠀Within⠀an⠀episode,⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀notice⠀what⠀is⠀happening,⠀speculate⠀about⠀the⠀cause⠀of⠀a⠀failure,⠀remember⠀an⠀earlier⠀lesson,⠀and⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison⠀with⠀someone⠀else's⠀method,⠀in⠀the⠀fallible⠀voice⠀of⠀someone⠀still⠀learning.\n\nMake⠀recurrence⠀the⠀spine⠀of⠀progression.⠀A⠀gesture,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀exercise⠀returns⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀episode⠀carrying⠀new⠀significance⠀because⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀finally⠀execute⠀it,⠀or⠀because⠀the⠀same⠀movement⠀has⠀become⠀harder⠀under⠀changed⠀conditions.⠀Repetition⠀marks⠀the⠀thread⠀without⠀certifying⠀mastery:⠀attempt⠀the⠀same⠀idea⠀under⠀different⠀circumstances⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀results⠀stay⠀uneven,⠀so⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀executing⠀it⠀remains⠀visible⠀across⠀episodes.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀continuous⠀with⠀practical⠀life,⠀in⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀the⠀world⠀actually⠀supplies.⠀Meals,⠀debts,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀may⠀sit⠀between⠀attempts⠀the⠀way⠀vernacular⠀fiction⠀lets⠀daily⠀circumstance⠀surround⠀effort;⠀do⠀not⠀transplant⠀a⠀setting,⠀cast⠀identity,⠀or⠀cultural⠀prop⠀from⠀a⠀literary⠀example.⠀A⠀remembered⠀precedent⠀can⠀prove⠀incomplete,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀episode⠀can⠀revise⠀its⠀meaning⠀without⠀erasing⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀originally⠀knew.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits,⠀keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀on⠀the⠀page.⠀An⠀interval⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀practice⠀unfinished,⠀understanding⠀revised,⠀or⠀the⠀narrator⠀simply⠀back⠀at⠀the⠀task.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀forceful⠀diction⠀with⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Move⠀from⠀attempt⠀to⠀consequence⠀without⠀padding:⠀the⠀grip,⠀the⠀strain,⠀the⠀worn⠀edge,⠀the⠀correction⠀that⠀arrives⠀a⠀beat⠀late.⠀Let⠀material⠀wear⠀carry⠀the⠀record⠀of⠀practice⠀and⠀resources⠀—⠀a⠀tool's⠀condition,⠀a⠀body's⠀fatigue,⠀the⠀damage⠀accumulating⠀in⠀a⠀practice⠀space⠀can⠀show⠀how⠀much⠀has⠀been⠀attempted⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀attempt⠀cost,⠀so⠀advancement⠀is⠀legible⠀in⠀objects⠀and⠀muscle⠀before⠀anyone⠀announces⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀physical⠀stakes⠀concrete⠀but⠀proportionate.⠀An⠀exercise⠀can⠀bruise,⠀exhaust,⠀or⠀expose⠀a⠀weakness⠀without⠀threatening⠀death;⠀a⠀hard⠀edge⠀does⠀not⠀convert⠀training⠀into⠀survival⠀horror.⠀Show⠀advancement⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀under⠀pressure⠀and⠀in⠀what⠀still⠀fails.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀a⠀remembered⠀instruction⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀movement⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀tired,⠀hurried,⠀or⠀watched.\n\nRetain⠀longer⠀thought⠀where⠀the⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀it.⠀A⠀failed⠀attempt⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀sustained⠀passage⠀that⠀compares⠀the⠀current⠀method⠀with⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀works⠀out⠀why⠀a⠀resource⠀matters,⠀or⠀rereads⠀a⠀correction⠀—⠀then⠀a⠀sharp⠀return⠀to⠀action.⠀Use⠀such⠀rhythm⠀changes⠀deliberately⠀instead⠀of⠀forcing⠀every⠀paragraph⠀into⠀a⠀clipped⠀payoff.⠀Ground⠀abrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀the⠀particular⠀speaker⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀house⠀style⠀of⠀gruffness,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀practical⠀learning⠀and⠀fallible⠀judgment⠀present⠀even⠀at⠀the⠀hardest⠀edge:⠀speculation,⠀qualification,⠀and⠀revision⠀still⠀happen;⠀they⠀just⠀happen⠀in⠀fewer,⠀harder-worked⠀words.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀sequence⠀in⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀an⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Choose⠀the⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀requires⠀—⠀a⠀journal⠀entry⠀recording⠀a⠀practice⠀session,⠀a⠀letter⠀asking⠀for⠀instruction⠀or⠀reporting⠀a⠀result,⠀a⠀ledger⠀noting⠀resources⠀spent⠀or⠀damage⠀done⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀rotating⠀through⠀formats⠀for⠀variety's⠀sake.⠀What⠀each⠀document⠀knows⠀or⠀conceals⠀follows⠀its⠀author's⠀position⠀and⠀purpose:⠀a⠀letter⠀to⠀a⠀teacher⠀may⠀omit⠀a⠀private⠀fear⠀the⠀same⠀night's⠀journal⠀records.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀situated⠀reasoning⠀live⠀inside⠀each⠀document.⠀The⠀writer⠀speculates⠀about⠀why⠀an⠀attempt⠀failed,⠀remembers⠀an⠀earlier⠀lesson,⠀qualifies⠀a⠀comparison⠀with⠀another⠀person's⠀method,⠀or⠀explains⠀what⠀a⠀resource⠀made⠀possible,⠀within⠀the⠀diction⠀and⠀purpose⠀of⠀that⠀document.⠀A⠀later⠀entry⠀can⠀revise⠀an⠀earlier⠀account⠀without⠀granting⠀the⠀earlier⠀writer⠀knowledge⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀have;⠀the⠀fallible⠀judgment⠀stays⠀where⠀it⠀was⠀written.\n\nShow⠀advancement⠀in⠀the⠀gaps⠀between⠀entries.⠀A⠀technique⠀described⠀as⠀understood⠀in⠀one⠀document⠀appears⠀as⠀a⠀failed⠀execution⠀in⠀the⠀next;⠀a⠀resource⠀mentioned⠀in⠀passing⠀becomes⠀decisive⠀after⠀further⠀practice;⠀a⠀correction⠀that⠀seemed⠀minor⠀reshapes⠀a⠀later⠀report.⠀Uneven⠀development⠀is⠀visible⠀precisely⠀because⠀no⠀entry⠀can⠀see⠀ahead⠀of⠀its⠀own⠀date.⠀Preserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀through⠀dates,⠀names,⠀and⠀cross-references⠀a⠀reader⠀can⠀assemble,⠀without⠀appending⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀any⠀record.⠀An⠀ending⠀can⠀fall⠀between⠀documents,⠀on⠀an⠀entry⠀whose⠀attempt⠀is⠀still⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀warmth⠀and⠀practical⠀care⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀narrator's⠀developing⠀life,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀break⠀from⠀it.⠀A⠀companion⠀readies⠀a⠀familiar⠀meal⠀before⠀practice,⠀sets⠀out⠀a⠀resource,⠀notices⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀tires;⠀a⠀patient⠀teacher⠀corrects⠀gently;⠀a⠀friend⠀drills⠀the⠀repeated⠀exercise⠀alongside.⠀Spend⠀real⠀attention⠀on⠀these⠀small⠀pleasures⠀and⠀on⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀offering⠀them,⠀and⠀let⠀private⠀reasoning⠀register⠀why⠀a⠀kindness⠀matters⠀—⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀difficulty,⠀a⠀speculation⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀care⠀costs⠀someone⠀else.\n\nKeep⠀progression⠀fully⠀active⠀inside⠀the⠀comfortable⠀interval.⠀Practice,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀new⠀understanding⠀happen⠀in⠀a⠀supportive⠀setting⠀without⠀becoming⠀frictionless:⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀understand⠀an⠀instruction⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀the⠀movement,⠀improve⠀unevenly⠀while⠀encouragement⠀continues,⠀and⠀need⠀several⠀attempts⠀at⠀what⠀looked⠀easy.⠀Knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀remains⠀distinct⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀is⠀kind,⠀and⠀difficulty⠀stays⠀real⠀while⠀manageable.\n\nPreserve⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable,⠀does⠀not⠀remove⠀an⠀established⠀problem⠀from⠀the⠀world,⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀repair⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀feel⠀warm;⠀affection⠀can⠀be⠀sincere⠀and⠀unspoken⠀at⠀once.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits,⠀keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀interiority⠀on⠀the⠀page⠀—⠀mild⠀frustration,⠀contentment,⠀the⠀wish⠀to⠀get⠀something⠀right⠀for⠀a⠀particular⠀person's⠀sake.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀enjoy⠀its⠀people⠀and⠀its⠀small⠀pleasures⠀instead⠀of⠀turning⠀the⠀genre⠀into⠀a⠀domestic⠀vignette,⠀and⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀interval⠀naturally⠀settles:⠀mid-practice,⠀mid-rest,⠀or⠀on⠀the⠀way⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀task⠀with⠀the⠀warmth⠀still⠀in⠀the⠀room.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nBuild⠀the⠀passage⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Open⠀a⠀practice⠀scene⠀by⠀setting⠀it⠀in⠀whatever⠀social⠀or⠀historical⠀context⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀knowledge⠀can⠀support⠀—⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀expectations⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀teacher's⠀name,⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀a⠀public⠀reputation⠀for⠀ability⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀effort⠀actually⠀underway⠀—⠀then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀attempt⠀itself,⠀giving⠀the⠀narrator's⠀reasoning⠀room⠀to⠀develop⠀across⠀sentences⠀rather⠀than⠀compressing⠀it⠀into⠀beats.⠀Keep⠀narration⠀distinct⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀sentence⠀ceremonious.\n\nLet⠀progression⠀appear⠀through⠀composed⠀attention⠀to⠀change.⠀One⠀paragraph⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀narrator's⠀earlier⠀understanding⠀of⠀a⠀technique⠀beside⠀the⠀present⠀attempt⠀and⠀weigh⠀the⠀difference;⠀another⠀can⠀trace⠀how⠀a⠀single⠀correction⠀reorders⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀lesson.⠀Show⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀executing⠀it⠀through⠀sustained⠀description⠀of⠀actual⠀effort,⠀including⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult⠀after⠀improvement,⠀and⠀let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly⠀rather⠀than⠀smoothing⠀them⠀into⠀a⠀neat⠀arc.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀judgment⠀fallible⠀and⠀situated.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀speculate⠀about⠀another⠀person's⠀motive,⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison,⠀or⠀revise⠀an⠀earlier⠀interpretation⠀as⠀new⠀information⠀arrives;⠀social⠀context⠀frames⠀the⠀scene,⠀but⠀the⠀account⠀remains⠀one⠀person's⠀view⠀of⠀it.⠀Ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀or⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀public⠀performance⠀and⠀private⠀practice⠀can⠀organize⠀a⠀passage⠀where⠀the⠀world⠀supplies⠀them,⠀without⠀importing⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting⠀or⠀archaic⠀vocabulary.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀narrator⠀still⠀practicing,⠀still⠀uncertain,⠀or⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀task⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding⠀—⠀the⠀formal⠀architecture⠀carries⠀development⠀without⠀having⠀to⠀resolve⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nGive⠀the⠀current⠀telling⠀an⠀audience,⠀an⠀occasion,⠀and⠀a⠀purpose⠀tied⠀to⠀learning.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀teaching⠀a⠀technique,⠀warning⠀a⠀companion⠀away⠀from⠀a⠀known⠀mistake,⠀justifying⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀who⠀watched⠀it,⠀or⠀working⠀out⠀what⠀went⠀wrong⠀while⠀speaking.⠀Let⠀the⠀listeners⠀have⠀their⠀own⠀reasons⠀to⠀attend:⠀they⠀need⠀the⠀skill,⠀they⠀doubt⠀the⠀account,⠀they⠀have⠀tried⠀something⠀similar,⠀or⠀they⠀are⠀waiting⠀for⠀the⠀part⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀them.\n\nMake⠀an⠀embedded⠀story⠀a⠀transmission⠀of⠀practice⠀rather⠀than⠀decoration.⠀Recount⠀a⠀concrete⠀attempt⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀believed⠀beforehand,⠀what⠀they⠀tried,⠀what⠀resisted,⠀what⠀they⠀noticed⠀too⠀late,⠀what⠀they⠀did⠀next⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀telling⠀carry⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀teller⠀understood⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀The⠀listeners⠀can⠀hear⠀a⠀principle⠀the⠀younger⠀teller⠀could⠀not⠀name,⠀or⠀recognize⠀a⠀resource⠀the⠀teller⠀overlooked,⠀while⠀the⠀teller⠀stays⠀fixed⠀on⠀the⠀failure.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀inside⠀that⠀gap,⠀on⠀the⠀listener's⠀dawning⠀question⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀unfinished⠀sentence,⠀with⠀practice⠀still⠀to⠀come.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀levels⠀intelligible⠀by⠀anchoring⠀each⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀scene:⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀address,⠀a⠀repeated⠀object⠀or⠀gesture,⠀a⠀listener's⠀interruption⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀move⠀from⠀present⠀conversation⠀into⠀remembered⠀attempt⠀and⠀back.⠀Let⠀recurrence⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀through⠀use⠀—⠀a⠀warning⠀repeated⠀before⠀each⠀practice⠀session⠀changes⠀sense⠀as⠀the⠀listener's⠀capability⠀grows⠀—⠀without⠀the⠀phrase⠀needing⠀to⠀appear⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀teller's⠀memory⠀as⠀fallible.⠀They⠀may⠀compress⠀the⠀time⠀between⠀attempts,⠀overstate⠀their⠀own⠀foresight,⠀or⠀drop⠀a⠀helper's⠀contribution⠀without⠀meaning⠀to⠀lie.⠀An⠀outer⠀listener⠀can⠀press⠀a⠀practical⠀question⠀—⠀how⠀long⠀the⠀drill⠀actually⠀took,⠀who⠀held⠀the⠀rope,⠀what⠀the⠀teacher⠀said⠀before⠀the⠀third⠀attempt⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀answer⠀should⠀clarify⠀execution,⠀not⠀merely⠀correct⠀the⠀record.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀frame⠀resumes,⠀advancement⠀shows⠀in⠀small,⠀contingent⠀signs⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀declared⠀lesson:⠀a⠀changed⠀grip,⠀a⠀new⠀question,⠀a⠀deliberate⠀repetition⠀of⠀the⠀teller's⠀early⠀mistake,⠀a⠀listener⠀who⠀now⠀attempts⠀what⠀they⠀previously⠀only⠀heard⠀described.⠀The⠀story⠀may⠀persuade,⠀delay,⠀warn,⠀or⠀encourage,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀complete⠀its⠀effect⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀ends.⠀Treat⠀the⠀Arabian⠀Nights⠀reference⠀as⠀frame-tale⠀craft⠀—⠀situated⠀telling,⠀nested⠀accounts,⠀recurrence,⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀—⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀court,⠀djinn,⠀bargain,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀religion⠀into⠀a⠀setting⠀that⠀lacks⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀developmental⠀realism⠀route.⠀Let⠀learning⠀be⠀shaped⠀by⠀specific⠀institutions,⠀working⠀relationships,⠀material⠀limits,⠀and⠀the⠀expectations⠀of⠀people⠀with⠀authority⠀over⠀the⠀narrator.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀method,⠀a⠀workshop's⠀routine,⠀a⠀family's⠀need,⠀or⠀a⠀community's⠀judgment⠀affects⠀what⠀is⠀attempted⠀and⠀what⠀may⠀be⠀practiced⠀at⠀all.⠀Improvement⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀private⠀climb;⠀it⠀happens⠀inside⠀arrangements⠀that⠀help,⠀delay,⠀or⠀misdirect⠀it.\n\nMake⠀the⠀narrator's⠀sustained⠀internal⠀reasoning⠀the⠀main⠀instrument.⠀Let⠀them⠀work⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀executing⠀it:⠀the⠀rule⠀understood⠀perfectly⠀and⠀the⠀movement⠀still⠀failing,⠀the⠀timing,⠀the⠀load,⠀or⠀the⠀judgment⠀the⠀rule⠀was⠀meant⠀to⠀support⠀collapsing⠀in⠀practice.⠀Show⠀the⠀failure⠀being⠀noticed⠀in⠀the⠀moment⠀—⠀the⠀hand⠀already⠀moving⠀wrong,⠀the⠀explanation⠀arriving⠀after⠀the⠀mistake,⠀the⠀instructor's⠀correction⠀naming⠀something⠀the⠀narrator⠀felt⠀but⠀could⠀not⠀articulate.⠀Give⠀that⠀reasoning⠀room⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀paragraph⠀into⠀a⠀polished⠀payoff.\n\nSeparate⠀formal⠀instruction⠀from⠀lived⠀practice.⠀A⠀clear⠀lesson⠀may⠀still⠀not⠀transfer⠀to⠀the⠀yard,⠀the⠀road,⠀the⠀sickroom,⠀or⠀the⠀field.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀compare⠀what⠀the⠀teacher⠀said⠀with⠀what⠀the⠀work⠀actually⠀demanded,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀comparison⠀produce⠀new⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀simple⠀rejection⠀of⠀the⠀teacher.⠀Progress⠀develops⠀unevenly:⠀speed⠀before⠀control,⠀strength⠀before⠀accuracy,⠀confidence⠀before⠀competence.\n\nKeep⠀syntax⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀position.⠀The⠀prose⠀may⠀move⠀between⠀remembered⠀instruction,⠀present⠀attempt,⠀and⠀later⠀reflection,⠀but⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀always⠀know⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀knew⠀at⠀each⠀point;⠀later⠀knowledge⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀written⠀back⠀in⠀as⠀an⠀earlier⠀motive.⠀When⠀a⠀past⠀failure⠀is⠀remembered,⠀qualify⠀it⠀—⠀what⠀was⠀misunderstood⠀then,⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀suspected,⠀what⠀remains⠀unclear.\n\nWhere⠀the⠀story⠀actually⠀reaches⠀a⠀test,⠀make⠀it⠀social⠀and⠀concrete:⠀a⠀position⠀the⠀narrator⠀could⠀not⠀previously⠀hold,⠀a⠀task⠀completed⠀under⠀conditions⠀that⠀once⠀broke⠀them,⠀an⠀explanation⠀given⠀to⠀someone⠀else⠀that⠀exposes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀still⠀cannot⠀do.⠀A⠀given⠀attempt⠀may⠀also⠀stall⠀or⠀fail⠀outright;⠀the⠀standard⠀is⠀that⠀changed⠀capability,⠀when⠀it⠀exists,⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀Relationships,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀This⠀route⠀does⠀not⠀imply⠀one⠀country,⠀a⠀bureaucracy,⠀severity,⠀or⠀translated⠀word⠀order;⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀world⠀and⠀narrator⠀supplied.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nMake⠀learning⠀happen⠀inside⠀the⠀collision⠀of⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀taught⠀by⠀someone⠀whose⠀knowledge⠀carries⠀obligations,⠀train⠀in⠀a⠀place⠀that⠀is⠀falling⠀apart,⠀or⠀be⠀denied⠀a⠀technique⠀because⠀of⠀who⠀their⠀family⠀was.⠀Let⠀inherited⠀arrangements⠀shape⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀practiced⠀openly,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀learned⠀in⠀secret,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀teacher⠀will⠀not⠀say.⠀The⠀atmosphere⠀is⠀not⠀scenery;⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attempts.\n\nGround⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀improvement⠀in⠀urban⠀material⠀detail⠀with⠀a⠀specific⠀condition:⠀a⠀cracked⠀floor⠀that⠀changes⠀footwork,⠀a⠀light⠀that⠀fails⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment,⠀a⠀locked⠀cabinet⠀holding⠀the⠀only⠀usable⠀tool,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀who⠀can⠀hear⠀the⠀repetition.⠀Let⠀these⠀details⠀affect⠀execution.⠀A⠀technique⠀may⠀be⠀possible⠀in⠀one⠀space⠀and⠀dangerous⠀in⠀another,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀should⠀notice⠀the⠀difference.\n\nKeep⠀intimacy⠀morally⠀complicated.⠀A⠀teacher⠀may⠀genuinely⠀care⠀for⠀the⠀narrator⠀while⠀still⠀withholding⠀something⠀essential;⠀a⠀companion⠀may⠀help⠀with⠀one⠀skill⠀and⠀undermine⠀another.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀private⠀desire⠀to⠀improve⠀can⠀sit⠀alongside⠀fear,⠀loyalty,⠀resentment,⠀or⠀affection.⠀Let⠀social⠀masks⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀revelation⠀a⠀betrayal;⠀the⠀narrator⠀speaks⠀differently⠀to⠀different⠀people,⠀and⠀a⠀spoken⠀reply⠀need⠀not⠀expose⠀their⠀full⠀thought.\n\nLet⠀progression⠀show⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀under⠀pressure⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀clean⠀sequence⠀of⠀lessons:⠀hold⠀a⠀position⠀while⠀afraid,⠀read⠀a⠀room⠀while⠀pretending⠀not⠀to,⠀continue⠀a⠀practice⠀after⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀taught⠀it⠀has⠀become⠀unreliable.⠀Strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly⠀—⠀control⠀may⠀outrun⠀understanding,⠀or⠀knowledge⠀arrive⠀before⠀the⠀body⠀can⠀follow⠀—⠀and⠀a⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀mid-attempt⠀or⠀inside⠀a⠀withheld⠀confidence⠀rather⠀than⠀at⠀a⠀passed⠀test.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀practical⠀learning⠀earnest⠀even⠀in⠀darker⠀passages.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀want⠀to⠀improve⠀for⠀reasons⠀that⠀are⠀neither⠀cynical⠀nor⠀doomed.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀knows⠀and⠀what⠀others⠀know;⠀a⠀secret⠀practice⠀may⠀be⠀hidden⠀from⠀one⠀character⠀and⠀visible⠀to⠀another.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀Humanity⠀numbers,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules.⠀The⠀style⠀contributes⠀atmosphere,⠀intimacy,⠀decay,⠀and⠀inherited⠀authority,⠀not⠀a⠀supernatural⠀system.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attempts⠀to⠀improve⠀be⠀shaped⠀by⠀household⠀time,⠀family⠀need,⠀and⠀community⠀expectation:⠀practice⠀before⠀the⠀day's⠀work⠀begins,⠀after⠀others⠀sleep,⠀or⠀in⠀a⠀space⠀someone⠀else⠀controls.⠀A⠀teacher⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀relative,⠀a⠀neighbor,⠀a⠀visiting⠀worker,⠀or⠀someone⠀whose⠀knowledge⠀is⠀not⠀formally⠀recognized.⠀Improvement⠀is⠀not⠀separate⠀from⠀ordinary⠀life;⠀it⠀is⠀squeezed⠀into⠀it,⠀supported⠀by⠀it,⠀or⠀interrupted⠀by⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀as⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀them,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀speech⠀follows⠀the⠀actual⠀relationships:⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀to⠀an⠀elder⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀to⠀a⠀sibling,⠀a⠀neighbor,⠀or⠀a⠀stranger,⠀and⠀a⠀spoken⠀reply⠀need⠀not⠀expose⠀the⠀full⠀thought⠀behind⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀notice⠀what⠀the⠀household⠀does⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀allow.⠀A⠀skill⠀may⠀be⠀valued⠀because⠀it⠀brings⠀income,⠀distrusted⠀because⠀it⠀takes⠀the⠀narrator⠀away⠀from⠀duties,⠀or⠀tolerated⠀because⠀someone⠀older⠀once⠀practiced⠀it.⠀Show⠀the⠀narrator⠀reasoning⠀about⠀these⠀pressures⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀elder⠀an⠀obstacle⠀or⠀every⠀companion⠀a⠀supporter;⠀cooperation⠀and⠀refusal⠀can⠀both⠀be⠀genuine.\n\nDistinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀in⠀domestic⠀terms.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀understand⠀a⠀method⠀from⠀watching⠀someone⠀else⠀and⠀then⠀fail⠀alone⠀because⠀the⠀tool⠀is⠀worn,⠀the⠀space⠀is⠀wrong,⠀the⠀time⠀is⠀short,⠀or⠀the⠀body⠀has⠀not⠀learned⠀the⠀movement.⠀Let⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀as⠀practical⠀correction⠀—⠀a⠀relative⠀adjusting⠀the⠀grip,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀pointing⠀out⠀wasted⠀motion,⠀a⠀customer⠀noticing⠀the⠀result⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀compare⠀what⠀they⠀were⠀told⠀with⠀what⠀the⠀work⠀actually⠀required.\n\nShow⠀advancement⠀through⠀changed⠀capability⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀life:⠀a⠀household⠀task⠀once⠀impossible⠀now⠀completed,⠀a⠀step⠀taught⠀to⠀a⠀younger⠀person⠀that⠀the⠀narrator⠀learned⠀badly,⠀a⠀skill⠀used⠀to⠀meet⠀a⠀need⠀the⠀family⠀had⠀not⠀named.⠀Progress⠀develops⠀unevenly,⠀some⠀strengths⠀outpacing⠀others,⠀and⠀a⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀an⠀interrupted⠀practice⠀or⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀completed⠀demonstration.⠀Keep⠀the⠀prose⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀and⠀feeling;⠀later⠀understanding⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀written⠀back⠀in⠀as⠀an⠀earlier⠀motive.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀record⠀attempts,⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changing⠀understanding⠀in⠀entries⠀marked⠀by⠀occasion⠀or⠀time.⠀An⠀entry⠀may⠀open⠀with⠀the⠀day's⠀weather,⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀remembered⠀remark,⠀or⠀a⠀physical⠀sensation⠀from⠀practice,⠀then⠀move⠀into⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀noticed.⠀The⠀form⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀keeping⠀a⠀record,⠀not⠀a⠀polished⠀essay,⠀and⠀an⠀entry⠀can⠀break⠀off⠀with⠀the⠀day⠀unfinished⠀rather⠀than⠀owing⠀a⠀rounded⠀conclusion.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀compare⠀entries.⠀Rereading⠀an⠀earlier⠀note,⠀they⠀may⠀find⠀they⠀misunderstood⠀a⠀teacher's⠀correction,⠀that⠀a⠀technique⠀they⠀called⠀impossible⠀is⠀now⠀merely⠀difficult,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀strength⠀they⠀trusted⠀has⠀stopped⠀improving.⠀Keep⠀the⠀comparison⠀specific⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀hand⠀did⠀then,⠀what⠀it⠀does⠀now,⠀what⠀still⠀fails.⠀Later⠀knowledge⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀written⠀back⠀in⠀as⠀an⠀earlier⠀motive,⠀but⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀explicitly⠀mark⠀what⠀they⠀know⠀now⠀that⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀then.\n\nKeep⠀direct⠀feeling⠀and⠀sustained⠀internal⠀reasoning⠀available.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀frustrated,⠀pleased,⠀frightened,⠀bored,⠀or⠀uncertain,⠀and⠀may⠀say⠀so⠀plainly;⠀no⠀universal⠀quietness⠀applies.⠀Seasonal⠀attention⠀is⠀available⠀where⠀it⠀matters:⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀light,⠀heat,⠀or⠀footing⠀counts⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀practice,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀form⠀demands⠀scenery.\n\nDistinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀write⠀out⠀a⠀rule⠀clearly⠀and⠀record⠀failing⠀to⠀follow⠀it⠀the⠀same⠀day.⠀Let⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀teacher's⠀correction,⠀a⠀companion's⠀observation,⠀a⠀tool's⠀behavior,⠀or⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀body,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀entry⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understood⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀including⠀what⠀they⠀misunderstood.\n\nShow⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult:⠀a⠀later⠀entry⠀describing⠀a⠀task⠀an⠀earlier⠀entry⠀recorded⠀as⠀impossible,⠀or⠀teaching⠀someone⠀a⠀step⠀and⠀discovering⠀a⠀gap⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀understanding.⠀Progress⠀develops⠀unevenly,⠀some⠀abilities⠀outpacing⠀others.⠀Omission⠀and⠀plain⠀argument⠀are⠀both⠀available;⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀leave⠀something⠀unwritten⠀because⠀they⠀are⠀tired,⠀ashamed,⠀or⠀not⠀yet⠀able⠀to⠀name⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀record⠀itself⠀—⠀what⠀gets⠀an⠀entry,⠀what⠀gets⠀skipped⠀—⠀can⠀carry⠀meaning⠀without⠀commentary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀realism,⠀chronicle,⠀and⠀testimony⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀give⠀a⠀situated⠀account⠀of⠀learning⠀under⠀specific⠀conditions:⠀the⠀place,⠀the⠀people,⠀the⠀work,⠀the⠀resources,⠀and⠀the⠀events⠀that⠀allowed⠀or⠀interrupted⠀practice.⠀The⠀narrator⠀is⠀both⠀participant⠀and⠀witness,⠀so⠀keep⠀sources⠀separate⠀—⠀what⠀they⠀personally⠀attempted,⠀what⠀they⠀saw⠀others⠀do,⠀what⠀they⠀only⠀heard⠀reported.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀method⠀may⠀be⠀known⠀through⠀direct⠀instruction,⠀observation,⠀or⠀rumor,⠀and⠀those⠀channels⠀should⠀not⠀blur⠀into⠀one⠀another.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀the⠀story⠀supplies,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀national⠀speech⠀patterns,⠀landscape⠀inventories,⠀religion,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀temperament.⠀Let⠀the⠀account⠀reflect⠀the⠀actual⠀relationships⠀and⠀pressures⠀of⠀the⠀scene:⠀who⠀taught⠀whom,⠀who⠀was⠀denied⠀access,⠀who⠀practiced⠀in⠀secret,⠀who⠀was⠀praised⠀and⠀who⠀was⠀forgotten.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀qualify⠀their⠀own⠀memory.⠀They⠀may⠀say⠀they⠀no⠀longer⠀remember⠀the⠀exact⠀order⠀of⠀attempts,⠀that⠀a⠀companion⠀later⠀corrected⠀their⠀account,⠀or⠀that⠀what⠀they⠀once⠀called⠀failure⠀now⠀looks⠀like⠀the⠀necessary⠀beginning⠀of⠀a⠀skill.⠀The⠀testimony⠀should⠀not⠀smooth⠀into⠀a⠀clean⠀retrospective⠀summary;⠀show⠀the⠀narrator⠀reasoning⠀through⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀they⠀were⠀told⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀work⠀actually⠀demanded.\n\nMake⠀improvement⠀matter⠀through⠀concrete⠀attempts:⠀the⠀tool,⠀the⠀movement,⠀the⠀mistake,⠀the⠀correction,⠀the⠀second⠀attempt.⠀Feedback⠀may⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀teacher,⠀a⠀fellow⠀worker,⠀a⠀family⠀member,⠀or⠀the⠀task⠀itself,⠀and⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly⠀—⠀endurance⠀before⠀accuracy,⠀knowledge⠀before⠀the⠀body⠀can⠀follow.\n\nShow⠀advancement⠀through⠀changed⠀capability⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀life⠀and⠀community:⠀work⠀completed⠀that⠀was⠀once⠀impossible,⠀a⠀step⠀taught⠀to⠀someone⠀else,⠀a⠀skill⠀that⠀has⠀shifted⠀the⠀narrator's⠀position⠀among⠀the⠀people⠀around⠀them.⠀Relationships,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life,⠀and⠀the⠀account⠀may⠀pause⠀mid-memory⠀or⠀mid-attempt⠀without⠀owing⠀a⠀finished⠀arc.⠀Selecting⠀this⠀tradition⠀does⠀not⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them;⠀the⠀marvelous⠀is⠀not⠀required⠀here.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀each⠀practice⠀or⠀learning⠀scene⠀cleanly.⠀Establish⠀where⠀the⠀narrator⠀is,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀do,⠀and⠀what⠀stands⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀before⠀the⠀attempt⠀begins,⠀and⠀keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀a⠀move⠀from⠀room⠀to⠀yard,⠀from⠀lesson⠀to⠀solo⠀attempt,⠀from⠀watching⠀to⠀doing⠀gets⠀a⠀short,⠀concrete⠀sentence⠀of⠀its⠀own.\n\nUse⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀A⠀failed⠀attempt⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀brief⠀paragraph⠀of⠀the⠀narrator's⠀reaction⠀—⠀what⠀was⠀felt⠀in⠀the⠀hand⠀or⠀body,⠀what⠀seemed⠀to⠀be⠀the⠀mistake,⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀tried⠀next.⠀The⠀reaction⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀owner⠀and⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny;⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀witty⠀or⠀every⠀failure⠀a⠀punchline.\n\nGive⠀unfamiliar⠀names⠀or⠀mechanics⠀clear⠀presentation⠀when⠀needed.⠀If⠀a⠀technique⠀has⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀tool⠀a⠀function,⠀or⠀a⠀rank⠀a⠀meaning,⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀explain⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀moment⠀without⠀pausing⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀manual.⠀The⠀explanation⠀should⠀serve⠀the⠀attempt:⠀what⠀the⠀mechanic⠀is⠀supposed⠀to⠀do,⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀misunderstood,⠀what⠀actually⠀happened.\n\nDistinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀inside⠀the⠀attempt⠀itself:⠀the⠀rule⠀repeated⠀correctly⠀and⠀the⠀movement⠀still⠀failing,⠀the⠀timing⠀off,⠀the⠀grip⠀wrong,⠀the⠀weight⠀misjudged,⠀the⠀instruction⠀landing⠀after⠀the⠀mistake.⠀Let⠀feedback⠀be⠀immediate⠀and⠀specific,⠀from⠀a⠀teacher's⠀correction,⠀a⠀companion's⠀observation,⠀or⠀the⠀task's⠀result.\n\nShow⠀progression⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀—⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀repeating⠀an⠀earlier⠀attempt⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀result,⠀or⠀a⠀situation⠀that⠀previously⠀overwhelmed⠀them⠀now⠀survivable⠀—⠀while⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly:⠀speed⠀before⠀control,⠀confidence⠀before⠀competence.⠀First⠀person,⠀comedy,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀and⠀a⠀closing⠀cliffhanger⠀are⠀not⠀requirements⠀of⠀this⠀container.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀boundary:⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt,⠀at⠀a⠀new⠀understanding,⠀or⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀clear.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀learning⠀as⠀an⠀experience⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀feel⠀in⠀the⠀body⠀and⠀in⠀the⠀arrangement⠀of⠀the⠀sentence.⠀When⠀a⠀movement⠀is⠀practiced,⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀follow⠀its⠀rhythm:⠀the⠀repeated⠀attempt,⠀the⠀pause⠀where⠀the⠀error⠀appears,⠀the⠀smaller⠀correction⠀that⠀finally⠀holds.⠀Syntax⠀can⠀enact⠀the⠀practice—a⠀long⠀clause⠀carrying⠀the⠀run⠀of⠀a⠀successful⠀sequence,⠀a⠀break⠀where⠀the⠀hands⠀falter—so⠀the⠀attempt⠀has⠀a⠀shape⠀before⠀any⠀explanation⠀names⠀it.⠀Use⠀recurring⠀sounds⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀image⠀to⠀connect⠀separate⠀attempts⠀without⠀reducing⠀them⠀to⠀summary,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀image⠀change⠀as⠀understanding⠀changes,⠀so⠀the⠀same⠀comparison⠀means⠀something⠀different⠀before⠀and⠀after⠀a⠀breakthrough.⠀Return⠀to⠀that⠀image⠀when⠀a⠀new⠀attempt⠀gives⠀it⠀fresh⠀work;⠀recurrence⠀is⠀selective,⠀not⠀owed⠀to⠀every⠀difficulty.\n\nLet⠀a⠀comparison⠀unfold⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀does⠀work⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀likens⠀a⠀difficult⠀technique⠀to⠀threading⠀water⠀through⠀a⠀narrow⠀channel,⠀stay⠀with⠀the⠀comparison⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀difficulty⠀present—the⠀pressure,⠀the⠀narrowing,⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀flow⠀scatters—then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀concrete⠀task.⠀Keep⠀images⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀associations,⠀and⠀let⠀plain⠀statements⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀stand⠀against⠀the⠀figurative⠀passages⠀as⠀contrast.⠀The⠀lyricism⠀never⠀replaces⠀the⠀practical⠀record:⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀learned,⠀what⠀feedback⠀arrived,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult⠀stay⠀legible.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀narrator's⠀fallible⠀judgment⠀inside⠀the⠀beauty.⠀A⠀lovely⠀sentence⠀can⠀record⠀a⠀mistaken⠀conclusion,⠀an⠀incomplete⠀explanation,⠀or⠀a⠀comparison⠀the⠀narrator⠀later⠀qualifies.⠀Give⠀sustained⠀attention⠀to⠀failure⠀as⠀readily⠀as⠀to⠀success⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀error⠀into⠀a⠀solemn⠀loss;⠀irritation⠀and⠀small⠀satisfaction⠀remain⠀available.⠀Show⠀advancement⠀through⠀changed⠀capability⠀in⠀the⠀scene—a⠀movement⠀held,⠀a⠀result⠀produced—rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀rank⠀or⠀level⠀as⠀the⠀emotional⠀peak,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀linger⠀on⠀the⠀moment⠀after⠀a⠀successful⠀execution:⠀what⠀is⠀newly⠀different⠀in⠀the⠀hands,⠀the⠀breath,⠀the⠀room.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀stop⠀inside⠀an⠀unfinished⠀attempt⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀beat⠀of⠀attention⠀that⠀follows⠀it;⠀nothing⠀must⠀pause,⠀resolve,⠀or⠀reach⠀the⠀next⠀difficulty⠀before⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀boundary⠀falls.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀measure⠀present⠀capability⠀against⠀remembered⠀occasions.⠀A⠀skill⠀now⠀performed⠀easily⠀may⠀recall⠀the⠀room⠀where⠀it⠀was⠀first⠀attempted,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀demonstrated⠀it,⠀or⠀the⠀earlier⠀self⠀who⠀could⠀not⠀yet⠀do⠀it.⠀Anchor⠀reflection⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀activity⠀so⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀interrupt⠀it:⠀the⠀narrator⠀keeps⠀practicing⠀while⠀noticing⠀what⠀has⠀changed,⠀and⠀memory⠀arrives⠀through⠀a⠀sensation,⠀a⠀phrase⠀of⠀instruction,⠀or⠀a⠀tool⠀in⠀the⠀hand⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀formal⠀retreat⠀into⠀the⠀past.\n\nSmall⠀irreversible⠀changes⠀are⠀this⠀style's⠀material—a⠀tool⠀worn⠀smooth,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀instruction⠀now⠀internalized,⠀a⠀habit⠀no⠀longer⠀shared—and⠀they⠀need⠀not⠀convert⠀every⠀improvement⠀into⠀a⠀loss.⠀Let⠀present⠀experience⠀and⠀absent⠀things⠀coexist:⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀execute⠀a⠀technique⠀a⠀former⠀companion⠀never⠀saw,⠀or⠀practice⠀alone⠀what⠀was⠀once⠀learned⠀in⠀company,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀can⠀hold⠀both⠀facts⠀without⠀resolving⠀them,⠀because⠀the⠀gain⠀is⠀real⠀and⠀the⠀absence⠀is⠀real.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀remains⠀pleasurable⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀carries⠀an⠀association.⠀Do⠀not⠀close⠀scenes⠀by⠀announcing⠀impermanence;⠀a⠀detail⠀can⠀carry⠀that⠀weight⠀quietly,⠀or⠀the⠀moment⠀can⠀simply⠀be⠀what⠀it⠀is.\n\nShow⠀progression⠀through⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning⠀of⠀familiar⠀things.⠀What⠀was⠀once⠀a⠀struggle⠀becomes⠀automatic,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀reflect⠀on⠀that⠀difference⠀directly⠀or⠀let⠀one⠀detail⠀carry⠀it.⠀Memory⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀fallible⠀teller:⠀a⠀recollection⠀may⠀be⠀inaccurate,⠀a⠀comparison⠀may⠀be⠀qualified⠀later,⠀and⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀past⠀occasion⠀may⠀shift⠀as⠀present⠀understanding⠀grows—which⠀is⠀itself⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀advancement.⠀Reflection⠀never⠀stalls⠀the⠀work;⠀attempts⠀and⠀feedback⠀keep⠀their⠀real⠀duration.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀boundary⠀falls—mid-attempt,⠀inside⠀a⠀memory⠀the⠀present⠀task⠀has⠀called⠀up,⠀or⠀just⠀after⠀a⠀result—without⠀requiring⠀the⠀task⠀to⠀pause,⠀resume,⠀or⠀resolve⠀first.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀modern⠀memoir⠀route⠀through⠀these⠀traditions:⠀the⠀narrator⠀tells⠀the⠀account⠀of⠀learning⠀from⠀a⠀later⠀position,⠀having⠀already⠀gained⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀capability⠀now⠀being⠀recounted.⠀Use⠀that⠀distance⠀as⠀the⠀method's⠀principal⠀instrument.⠀When⠀an⠀early⠀attempt⠀is⠀described,⠀keep⠀the⠀earlier⠀understanding⠀intact—the⠀mistake⠀made⠀sense⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀did⠀not⠀yet⠀hold⠀the⠀principle⠀that⠀would⠀later⠀correct⠀it.⠀The⠀retrospective⠀voice⠀may⠀mark⠀the⠀gap⠀without⠀erasing⠀the⠀younger⠀practitioner's⠀confusion⠀or⠀replacing⠀it⠀with⠀present⠀knowledge.\n\nOrganize⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀memoir's⠀record⠀of⠀attempts,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability.⠀A⠀chapter-like⠀passage⠀may⠀open⠀with⠀the⠀narrator⠀recalling⠀a⠀particular⠀practice,⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀specific⠀difficulty⠀encountered,⠀and⠀arrive⠀at⠀the⠀understanding⠀that⠀now⠀seems⠀obvious⠀and⠀was⠀not⠀obvious⠀then.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison⠀or⠀correct⠀an⠀earlier⠀impression;⠀that⠀correction⠀is⠀fallible⠀judgment⠀at⠀work,⠀and⠀it⠀still⠀shows⠀real⠀advancement.⠀Keep⠀the⠀record⠀concrete:⠀what⠀was⠀practiced,⠀who⠀offered⠀feedback,⠀what⠀resource⠀became⠀available,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀could⠀then⠀accomplish⠀that⠀had⠀been⠀impossible⠀before.\n\nGround⠀everything⠀in⠀the⠀setting,⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀the⠀story⠀actually⠀supplies.⠀Social,⠀domestic,⠀or⠀urban⠀detail⠀may⠀enter⠀where⠀the⠀world⠀supports⠀it,⠀but⠀import⠀no⠀inventory⠀of⠀antiquity,⠀mysticism,⠀exile,⠀religion,⠀or⠀honor⠀codes,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀traditions⠀distinct⠀rather⠀than⠀blended⠀into⠀decoration.⠀The⠀narrator⠀remains⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀whose⠀relationships⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀continue⠀alongside⠀the⠀developing⠀capability.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀stop⠀inside⠀a⠀remembered⠀episode,⠀between⠀an⠀attempt⠀and⠀its⠀consequence,⠀or⠀while⠀the⠀present⠀task⠀continues;⠀the⠀retrospective⠀frame⠀stays⠀available⠀for⠀whatever⠀the⠀account⠀takes⠀up⠀next,⠀and⠀nothing⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀concluded⠀or⠀summarized⠀on⠀anyone⠀else's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀learning⠀event⠀legible.⠀Choose⠀the⠀detail⠀that⠀shows⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀executing:⠀the⠀angle⠀that⠀was⠀wrong,⠀the⠀word⠀of⠀feedback⠀that⠀corrected⠀it,⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀the⠀movement⠀held.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀chosen⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀causal⠀connection;⠀do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀principle,⠀then⠀the⠀execution⠀of⠀the⠀principle,⠀then⠀the⠀feeling⠀about⠀both.⠀When⠀changed⠀capability⠀is⠀shown⠀by⠀a⠀successful⠀execution⠀under⠀pressure,⠀the⠀earlier⠀difficulty⠀can⠀be⠀inferred⠀without⠀a⠀catalogue⠀of⠀failed⠀attempts—omission⠀leaves⠀something⠀inferable⠀rather⠀than⠀deleting⠀causality.\n\nKeep⠀only⠀the⠀inward⠀connection⠀that⠀materially⠀contributes⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀account.⠀A⠀thought⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀principle⠀and⠀execution⠀earns⠀its⠀place;⠀so⠀does⠀a⠀noticed⠀consequence—the⠀tool⠀moving⠀without⠀resistance,⠀the⠀pattern⠀holding⠀under⠀strain—that⠀marks⠀what⠀changed.⠀An⠀essential⠀thought⠀may⠀run⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀repeat⠀what⠀the⠀action⠀already⠀showed.⠀A⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀recording⠀the⠀exact⠀sequence⠀of⠀a⠀correction⠀can⠀serve⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀performed⠀fragments;⠀shortness⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀quota.\n\nThe⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀stays⠀individual.⠀Minimalism⠀does⠀not⠀silence⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀speculates,⠀qualifies,⠀and⠀continues⠀the⠀activity⠀already⠀underway:⠀a⠀brief⠀qualification⠀preserves⠀fallible⠀judgment⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀believes⠀the⠀improvement⠀is⠀solid⠀and⠀then⠀meets⠀a⠀remaining⠀difficulty.⠀Keep⠀spoken⠀voices⠀distinct⠀from⠀one⠀another.⠀Stop⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀boundary⠀falls—an⠀attempt⠀unfinished,⠀a⠀result⠀just⠀registered,⠀a⠀next⠀difficulty⠀visible⠀but⠀untested—without⠀wrapping⠀the⠀practice⠀into⠀a⠀completed⠀arc⠀or⠀announcing⠀what⠀comes⠀next.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀learning⠀event⠀remains⠀causally⠀legible.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀the⠀narrator's⠀action,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀or⠀companion's⠀dialogue,⠀the⠀perception⠀of⠀the⠀practice⠀space,⠀a⠀relevant⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience,⠀returning⠀each⠀movement⠀to⠀the⠀specific⠀attempt,⠀feedback,⠀or⠀changed⠀capability⠀at⠀hand.⠀Paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀do⠀the⠀orienting:⠀a⠀new⠀paragraph⠀may⠀mark⠀the⠀shift⠀from⠀inward⠀reasoning⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀attempt⠀without⠀restating⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀established,⠀and⠀no⠀recap⠀machinery⠀is⠀needed⠀to⠀re-enter⠀the⠀scene.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀register.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀speculate⠀about⠀why⠀a⠀technique⠀failed,⠀explain⠀a⠀principle⠀in⠀practical⠀terms,⠀remember⠀an⠀earlier⠀lesson,⠀or⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison⠀while⠀continuing⠀to⠀work.⠀Direct⠀feeling⠀and⠀sustained⠀internal⠀reasoning⠀are⠀ordinary⠀narrative⠀material⠀here—neither⠀suppressed⠀for⠀understatement⠀nor⠀inflated⠀for⠀effect—and⠀no⠀lesson⠀closes⠀the⠀reply.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀from⠀executing⠀inside⠀the⠀scene's⠀natural⠀movement:⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀state⠀the⠀principle⠀correctly⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀the⠀execution,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀makes⠀that⠀difference⠀concrete⠀in⠀the⠀result.⠀Feedback⠀arrives⠀through⠀dialogue,⠀through⠀observation⠀of⠀a⠀result,⠀or⠀through⠀a⠀later⠀realization,⠀and⠀it⠀is⠀attributable⠀and⠀specific⠀each⠀time.⠀Strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly—one⠀capability⠀consolidates⠀while⠀another⠀stumbles—and⠀advancement⠀shows⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀declared⠀rank.\n\nStop⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀existing⠀boundary.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀mid-attempt,⠀mid-exchange,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀stretch⠀of⠀attention⠀between⠀two⠀attempts;⠀the⠀next⠀difficulty⠀can⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀ongoing⠀scene⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀completed⠀test,⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀work.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀scene⠀selection,⠀private⠀language,⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments⠀that⠀also⠀carry⠀the⠀progression⠀thread.⠀Choose⠀scenes⠀where⠀learning⠀and⠀relationship⠀cause⠀each⠀other:⠀the⠀narrator⠀practices⠀a⠀skill⠀a⠀companion⠀taught,⠀receives⠀feedback⠀from⠀someone⠀whose⠀opinion⠀carries⠀particular⠀weight,⠀or⠀finds⠀that⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀offer⠀or⠀ask.⠀The⠀relationship⠀fulfills⠀its⠀particular⠀promise⠀inside⠀those⠀scenes—the⠀callback,⠀the⠀shared⠀phrase,⠀the⠀gesture⠀with⠀a⠀history—without⠀displacing⠀the⠀concrete⠀attempt,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability⠀at⠀their⠀center.\n\nUse⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise,⠀not⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀If⠀the⠀relationship⠀involves⠀rivalry,⠀give⠀rivalry⠀its⠀space:⠀a⠀practice⠀session⠀may⠀become⠀a⠀contest,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀fallible⠀judgment⠀may⠀misread⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀intent.⠀If⠀it⠀involves⠀comfort,⠀give⠀comfort⠀its⠀space⠀without⠀letting⠀every⠀difficulty⠀dissolve⠀into⠀reassurance.⠀Affection,⠀jealousy,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀arise⠀from⠀these⠀particular⠀people⠀and⠀their⠀history.⠀Different⠀relationships⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀same⠀narrator⠀says:⠀a⠀spoken⠀reply⠀need⠀not⠀expose⠀the⠀full⠀thought⠀behind⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀account⠀can⠀hold⠀speculation⠀the⠀narrator⠀would⠀not⠀voice.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator⠀noticing,⠀speculating,⠀and⠀qualifying⠀while⠀the⠀activity⠀continues.⠀A⠀private⠀signal⠀from⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀noticed,⠀interpreted,⠀doubted,⠀and⠀revisited;⠀direct⠀feeling⠀and⠀sustained⠀internal⠀reasoning⠀are⠀ordinary⠀material,⠀and⠀neither⠀person⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀perfectly⠀perceptive⠀about⠀the⠀other.⠀Advancement⠀stays⠀uneven—the⠀narrator⠀may⠀consolidate⠀one⠀capability⠀while⠀a⠀relationship⠀consequence⠀remains⠀unsettled.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀stop⠀inside⠀an⠀attempt,⠀inside⠀a⠀conversation,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀moment⠀after⠀a⠀signal,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀confession,⠀reconciliation,⠀or⠀payoff⠀to⠀land⠀first.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀a⠀sense⠀of⠀retelling.⠀Open⠀deliberately—with⠀a⠀declaration⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀set⠀out⠀to⠀learn,⠀or⠀what⠀a⠀teacher⠀said⠀would⠀be⠀remembered—then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀declaration⠀incomplete.⠀Use⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀fix⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀an⠀act,⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀application:⠀the⠀same⠀words⠀mean⠀one⠀thing⠀before⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀execute⠀a⠀technique⠀and⠀another⠀after⠀the⠀capability⠀has⠀changed.⠀Recurrence⠀is⠀earned⠀by⠀consequence,⠀not⠀decoration,⠀and⠀need⠀not⠀touch⠀every⠀difficulty.\n\nTreat⠀attempts,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability⠀as⠀deeds⠀whose⠀consequences⠀are⠀remembered,⠀on⠀the⠀present⠀scene's⠀own⠀scale.⠀A⠀practice⠀session⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀battle,⠀and⠀a⠀teacher's⠀correction⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀feud.⠀The⠀saga⠀voice⠀may⠀give⠀weight⠀to⠀a⠀first⠀successful⠀execution⠀or⠀to⠀a⠀failure⠀that⠀later⠀shaped⠀the⠀narrator's⠀approach,⠀without⠀declaring⠀modest⠀acts⠀legendary⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.⠀Oaths,⠀kinship,⠀journeys,⠀gifts,⠀feuds,⠀or⠀public⠀deeds⠀may⠀organize⠀the⠀telling⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀already⠀established⠀them;⠀a⠀pantheon,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀register⠀enters⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀established⠀that⠀too,⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀tradition⠀stays⠀coherent⠀rather⠀than⠀mixing⠀every⠀epic⠀convention.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀practical⠀detail⠀and⠀fallible⠀judgment⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀qualify⠀a⠀grand⠀declaration⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern,⠀or⠀remember⠀a⠀lesson⠀differently⠀from⠀the⠀way⠀it⠀is⠀now⠀retold;⠀direct⠀feeling⠀and⠀sustained⠀internal⠀reasoning⠀remain⠀available⠀inside⠀the⠀telling.⠀Keep⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀chosen⠀perspective:⠀the⠀narrator⠀relates⠀what⠀was⠀done,⠀what⠀was⠀said,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀meant⠀by⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀lights,⠀not⠀what⠀another⠀person⠀privately⠀thought.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀still⠀under⠀way,⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered,⠀without⠀pausing⠀the⠀work⠀to⠀announce⠀its⠀legend⠀in⠀advance.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀capability⠀arc⠀through⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism⠀of⠀a⠀Scandinavian⠀literary⠀tradition:⠀improvement⠀lives⠀in⠀ordinary⠀rooms,⠀recurring⠀work,⠀household⠀resources,⠀and⠀relationships⠀that⠀register⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀do.⠀Treat⠀practice⠀as⠀a⠀sustained⠀social⠀fact,⠀not⠀a⠀solitary⠀montage.⠀Show⠀the⠀narrator⠀preparing⠀materials,⠀repeating⠀a⠀task⠀under⠀someone⠀else's⠀observation,⠀receiving⠀correction⠀from⠀a⠀person⠀with⠀a⠀particular⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀result,⠀and⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀task⠀later⠀under⠀changed⠀conditions.⠀Let⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀weather,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀supplies,⠀and⠀the⠀presence⠀or⠀absence⠀of⠀others⠀shape⠀what⠀a⠀training⠀session⠀can⠀actually⠀accomplish.\n\nUse⠀the⠀manuscript⠀voice's⠀developed,⠀self-correcting⠀account⠀as⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀learning.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀explain⠀a⠀principle⠀before⠀attempting⠀it,⠀notice⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀explanation⠀and⠀the⠀execution,⠀remember⠀an⠀earlier⠀failure,⠀and⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison⠀with⠀another⠀person's⠀method.⠀Direct⠀feeling⠀and⠀sustained⠀reasoning⠀are⠀ordinary⠀material⠀here,⠀but⠀they⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀immediate⠀work:⠀impatience⠀with⠀a⠀slow⠀result,⠀relief⠀at⠀a⠀small⠀improvement,⠀embarrassment⠀at⠀being⠀watched,⠀or⠀the⠀private⠀recognition⠀that⠀a⠀teacher's⠀correction⠀was⠀fair.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀conclusions⠀fallible.⠀A⠀new⠀capability⠀should⠀be⠀tested⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish,⠀and⠀the⠀test⠀should⠀also⠀reveal⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀develop⠀unevenly⠀and⠀in⠀relation⠀to⠀other⠀people.⠀One⠀skill⠀may⠀improve⠀while⠀a⠀related⠀skill⠀lags,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀more⠀competent⠀in⠀a⠀familiar⠀domestic⠀setting⠀than⠀in⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀institutional⠀one.⠀Show⠀how⠀relationships⠀change⠀as⠀capability⠀changes:⠀a⠀teacher⠀may⠀offer⠀a⠀harder⠀task,⠀a⠀peer⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀help,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀practice.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀improvement⠀into⠀a⠀ranked⠀reward⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀triumph.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀narrator⠀still⠀working,⠀still⠀uncertain,⠀or⠀simply⠀aware⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀will⠀require.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀facts⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀ownership⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀thought;⠀other⠀characters⠀know⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀says⠀or⠀does,⠀not⠀the⠀full⠀private⠀account.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀arc⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀screen-readable⠀scenes⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀narrator's⠀capability⠀changes⠀visibly.⠀Use⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀same⠀task⠀attempted⠀at⠀different⠀times:⠀the⠀first⠀attempt⠀uncertain⠀and⠀slow,⠀a⠀later⠀attempt⠀steadier,⠀a⠀later⠀one⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀new⠀difficulty.⠀Scene⠀headings⠀mark⠀only⠀real⠀changes⠀in⠀location⠀or⠀time.⠀Let⠀the⠀action⠀lines⠀carry⠀the⠀observable⠀facts⠀of⠀practice—materials⠀handled,⠀mistakes⠀made,⠀corrections⠀received,⠀a⠀task⠀completed⠀or⠀abandoned—without⠀camera⠀commands.\n\nUse⠀dialogue⠀blocks⠀for⠀what⠀characters⠀actually⠀say,⠀and⠀keep⠀each⠀speaker's⠀contribution⠀shaped⠀by⠀their⠀relationship⠀to⠀the⠀narrator⠀and⠀to⠀the⠀work.⠀A⠀teacher⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀specific⠀error,⠀a⠀peer⠀may⠀ask⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀bystander⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀change.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀dialogue⠀explain⠀the⠀narrator's⠀private⠀reasoning.⠀Instead,⠀place⠀the⠀narrator's⠀developed⠀thought⠀and⠀feeling⠀in⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀notes⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀narrator's⠀account⠀while⠀the⠀cast⠀remains⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀and⠀done.⠀The⠀note⠀may⠀record⠀the⠀narrator's⠀comparison⠀of⠀two⠀attempts,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀failure,⠀or⠀the⠀recognition⠀that⠀a⠀principle⠀was⠀understood⠀before⠀it⠀could⠀be⠀executed.\n\nLet⠀transitions⠀be⠀selective.⠀A⠀cut⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀to⠀a⠀later⠀practice⠀session,⠀but⠀the⠀intervening⠀time⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀has⠀changed:⠀a⠀new⠀resource,⠀a⠀repaired⠀tool,⠀a⠀different⠀posture,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀altered⠀expectation.⠀Use⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀or⠀a⠀cut⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀needs⠀it.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀remaining⠀difficulty,⠀or⠀the⠀narrator's⠀private⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀and⠀has⠀not⠀improved.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀facts⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀ownership⠀of⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀note;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀cast.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀arc⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀sequence⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀narrator's⠀capability⠀changes⠀through⠀staged⠀attempts.⠀Use⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀and⠀pauses.⠀Stage⠀directions⠀should⠀establish⠀observable⠀conditions:⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀practicing,⠀what⠀materials⠀are⠀present,⠀who⠀is⠀watching⠀or⠀helping,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀that⠀was⠀difficult⠀before.⠀Let⠀the⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene—a⠀repeated⠀movement,⠀a⠀corrected⠀grip,⠀a⠀tool⠀passed⠀from⠀one⠀hand⠀to⠀another,⠀a⠀pause⠀after⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt.\n\nUse⠀dialogue⠀for⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀say⠀to⠀one⠀another,⠀shaped⠀by⠀their⠀relationships⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀work.⠀A⠀teacher⠀may⠀give⠀a⠀specific⠀correction,⠀a⠀peer⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀help,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀may⠀comment⠀on⠀the⠀time⠀spent⠀practicing.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀dialogue⠀explain⠀the⠀narrator's⠀private⠀reasoning.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀developed⠀thought⠀and⠀feeling⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀and⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀spoken⠀scene.⠀The⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀may⠀record⠀the⠀narrator's⠀comparison⠀of⠀two⠀attempts,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀failure,⠀or⠀the⠀private⠀recognition⠀that⠀a⠀principle⠀was⠀understood⠀before⠀it⠀could⠀be⠀executed.⠀A⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀may⠀be⠀used⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀has⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀and⠀is⠀separately⠀authorized,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀thought.\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀be⠀tested⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀on⠀stage:⠀a⠀task⠀completed⠀without⠀help,⠀a⠀movement⠀performed⠀under⠀pressure,⠀or⠀a⠀correction⠀applied⠀without⠀being⠀prompted.⠀Show⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult⠀as⠀well.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀result,⠀an⠀interruption,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀the⠀next⠀attempt.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀facts⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀ownership⠀of⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀material;⠀other⠀characters⠀know⠀only⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀and⠀done.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀arc⠀through⠀associative⠀mental⠀movement,⠀braiding⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀particular⠀mind.⠀Let⠀a⠀practice⠀session⠀unfold⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀linear⠀report⠀but⠀as⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀moving⠀among⠀the⠀immediate⠀task,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀attempt,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀tool⠀or⠀a⠀movement,⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀teacher,⠀and⠀the⠀recurring⠀worry⠀about⠀whether⠀the⠀improvement⠀will⠀hold.⠀Syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀may⠀follow⠀those⠀associations,⠀while⠀enough⠀orientation⠀remains⠀to⠀distinguish⠀the⠀present⠀attempt⠀from⠀recollection⠀or⠀fantasy.\n\nUse⠀the⠀manuscript⠀voice's⠀developed,⠀self-correcting⠀account⠀within⠀this⠀braided⠀movement.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀principle,⠀speculate⠀about⠀why⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀working,⠀remember⠀a⠀previous⠀failure,⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison⠀with⠀another⠀person's⠀method,⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀activity⠀already⠀underway.⠀Direct⠀feeling⠀and⠀sustained⠀internal⠀reasoning⠀are⠀ordinary⠀material⠀here,⠀but⠀they⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀mind's⠀associations:⠀impatience⠀surfacing⠀as⠀a⠀remembered⠀voice,⠀relief⠀arriving⠀through⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀uncertainty⠀interrupting⠀a⠀train⠀of⠀thought.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀conclusions⠀fallible⠀and⠀the⠀associations⠀specific⠀to⠀this⠀person,⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀mental⠀pattern.\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀develop⠀unevenly⠀and⠀through⠀the⠀accumulation⠀of⠀these⠀mental⠀returns.⠀A⠀recurring⠀concern⠀may⠀change⠀meaning⠀as⠀the⠀narrator's⠀capability⠀changes:⠀the⠀same⠀remembered⠀failure⠀may⠀feel⠀less⠀final⠀after⠀a⠀successful⠀attempt,⠀or⠀a⠀teacher's⠀phrase⠀may⠀surface⠀at⠀a⠀new⠀moment⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀implication.⠀Test⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀test⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀associative⠀flow⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀separate⠀summary.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀narrator⠀still⠀inside⠀the⠀movement⠀of⠀thought,⠀still⠀working,⠀or⠀aware⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀will⠀require.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀facts⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀ownership⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀mind;⠀the⠀technique⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀other⠀characters'⠀thoughts.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀arc⠀through⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀and⠀the⠀interface⠀events⠀that⠀matter.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀learning⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀exchange⠀itself:⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀a⠀technique,⠀a⠀correction⠀from⠀a⠀teacher,⠀a⠀report⠀of⠀an⠀attempt,⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀a⠀resource,⠀a⠀later⠀message⠀describing⠀what⠀worked.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀carry⠀meaning.⠀A⠀delay⠀may⠀show⠀hesitation⠀or⠀interruption,⠀an⠀edit⠀may⠀show⠀a⠀second⠀thought,⠀and⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀may⠀show⠀that⠀a⠀message⠀was⠀seen⠀before⠀a⠀reply⠀arrived.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀interface⠀events⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.\n\nLet⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution.⠀A⠀teacher⠀may⠀write⠀in⠀short,⠀specific⠀corrections;⠀a⠀peer⠀may⠀use⠀looser⠀phrasing⠀and⠀ask⠀practical⠀questions;⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀may⠀send⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀has⠀little⠀to⠀do⠀with⠀the⠀training⠀but⠀registers⠀its⠀cost.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀messages⠀should⠀reflect⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀purpose,⠀not⠀expose⠀the⠀full⠀private⠀thought.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀developed⠀reasoning⠀and⠀feeling⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript,⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation's⠀nonspoken⠀or⠀contextual⠀material.⠀That⠀private⠀material⠀may⠀record⠀the⠀narrator's⠀comparison⠀of⠀two⠀attempts,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀failure,⠀or⠀the⠀recognition⠀that⠀a⠀principle⠀was⠀understood⠀before⠀it⠀could⠀be⠀executed.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀narrator's⠀live⠀private⠀thought;⠀distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀typed,⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀sent,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀only⠀thought.\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀be⠀tested⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀messages⠀and⠀the⠀separated⠀context⠀reveal:⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀describe⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀confusing,⠀ask⠀a⠀sharper⠀question,⠀or⠀report⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt.⠀Show⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult⠀as⠀well.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀a⠀pending⠀reply,⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀or⠀the⠀narrator's⠀private⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀changed.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀facts⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀ownership⠀of⠀the⠀private⠀material;⠀transmitted⠀text⠀is⠀available⠀to⠀its⠀recipients,⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀not.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀arc⠀as⠀a⠀scene-oriented⠀sequence⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀narrator's⠀capability⠀changes⠀visibly.⠀Use⠀concise⠀scene-setting⠀to⠀establish⠀where⠀the⠀practice⠀is⠀happening⠀and⠀what⠀materials⠀are⠀present.⠀Use⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀for⠀what⠀characters⠀say,⠀shaped⠀by⠀their⠀relationships⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀work.⠀Let⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀carry⠀the⠀narrator's⠀developed⠀thought⠀and⠀feeling:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀detail,⠀speculate⠀about⠀why⠀a⠀technique⠀is⠀not⠀working,⠀remember⠀an⠀earlier⠀attempt,⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison⠀with⠀another⠀person's⠀method,⠀and⠀continue⠀the⠀activity⠀already⠀underway.\n\nUse⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀purposeful⠀references,⠀not⠀as⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicators⠀or⠀mandatory⠀labels⠀on⠀every⠀line.⠀A⠀background⠀cue⠀may⠀anchor⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀practice⠀space,⠀with⠀its⠀new⠀significance⠀earned⠀by⠀a⠀later⠀fact.⠀An⠀expression⠀cue⠀may⠀orient⠀a⠀moment—a⠀teacher's⠀narrowed⠀attention,⠀a⠀peer's⠀relief,⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀tension—but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀what⠀anyone⠀is⠀thinking⠀or⠀feeling.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀be⠀tested⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀task⠀completed⠀without⠀help,⠀a⠀movement⠀performed⠀under⠀pressure,⠀or⠀a⠀correction⠀applied⠀without⠀being⠀prompted.⠀Show⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult⠀as⠀well.⠀A⠀revisit⠀can⠀use⠀a⠀familiar⠀visual⠀detail⠀as⠀an⠀anchor,⠀with⠀its⠀changed⠀meaning⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀narrator's⠀new⠀capability.⠀The⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀activate⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀images,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀remaining⠀difficulty,⠀or⠀the⠀narrator's⠀private⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀changed.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀facts⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀ownership⠀of⠀the⠀focal⠀narration.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalasbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀arc⠀as⠀installment-oriented⠀prose⠀with⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies.⠀Let⠀each⠀installment⠀show⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Use⠀the⠀manuscript⠀voice's⠀developed,⠀self-correcting⠀account⠀to⠀recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀remember⠀an⠀earlier⠀attempt,⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison⠀with⠀a⠀previous⠀method,⠀or⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀task⠀now⠀feels⠀different.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀training⠀history.\n\nLet⠀improvement⠀develop⠀cumulatively⠀across⠀installments.⠀A⠀principle⠀understood⠀in⠀one⠀reply⠀may⠀be⠀executed⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀one;⠀a⠀resource⠀acquired⠀in⠀one⠀reply⠀may⠀be⠀used⠀in⠀another;⠀a⠀teacher's⠀correction⠀may⠀surface⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀memory⠀when⠀the⠀same⠀error⠀threatens⠀to⠀return.⠀Test⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀Show⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀developing⠀unevenly:⠀one⠀skill⠀may⠀improve⠀while⠀a⠀related⠀skill⠀lags,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀more⠀competent⠀in⠀one⠀setting⠀than⠀another.\n\nUse⠀earned⠀developments⠀and⠀occasional⠀hooks⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀turn⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.⠀A⠀reply⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀remaining⠀difficulty,⠀or⠀the⠀narrator's⠀private⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀changed.⠀Let⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀training,⠀and⠀keep⠀required⠀inward⠀experience⠀available⠀when⠀it⠀contributes⠀feeling⠀or⠀thought,⠀even⠀if⠀no⠀immediate⠀decision⠀changes.⠀The⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀create⠀leveling⠀systems,⠀rankings,⠀or⠀progression-fantasy⠀world⠀rules.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀facts⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀ownership⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀thought;⠀other⠀characters⠀know⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀says⠀or⠀does.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalataa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nAdvancement⠀occurs⠀through⠀language-driven⠀tests⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀character\\u2019s⠀growing⠀capability⠀is⠀inseparable⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀bear⠀to⠀say.⠀A⠀teacher,⠀rival,⠀examiner,⠀or⠀companion⠀turns⠀a⠀definition,⠀objection,⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀revised⠀wording⠀into⠀a⠀practical⠀challenge:⠀the⠀character⠀demonstrates⠀a⠀technique⠀only⠀after⠀someone⠀contests⠀what⠀it⠀means,⠀what⠀it⠀cost,⠀or⠀why⠀they⠀believe⠀they⠀have⠀earned⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀exchange⠀alter⠀the⠀attempt⠀itself.⠀A⠀corrected⠀term⠀can⠀steady⠀their⠀hands,⠀a⠀humiliatingly⠀accurate⠀description⠀can⠀make⠀a⠀known⠀movement⠀fail,⠀and⠀a⠀wrong⠀name⠀for⠀what⠀they⠀feel⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀next⠀practice⠀impossible⠀until⠀they⠀stop⠀repeating⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀progression⠀concrete.⠀Show⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀executing⠀it⠀under⠀strain,⠀and⠀let⠀capacities⠀develop⠀unevenly.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀finally⠀perform⠀a⠀difficult⠀application⠀while⠀still⠀unable⠀to⠀ask⠀for⠀help,⠀or⠀may⠀advance⠀quickly⠀in⠀one⠀discipline⠀while⠀a⠀private⠀failure⠀keeps⠀interfering⠀with⠀another.⠀Never⠀reduce⠀advancement⠀to⠀a⠀numerical⠀display.⠀Demonstrate⠀it⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀falls⠀apart⠀when⠀someone⠀important⠀is⠀watching,⠀arguing,⠀or⠀withholding⠀approval.\n\nUse⠀unstable⠀self-presentation⠀as⠀emotional⠀pressure,⠀not⠀wit.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀explain⠀a⠀success⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀quietly⠀omits⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀made⠀it⠀possible,⠀then⠀revise⠀the⠀account⠀when⠀challenged.⠀That⠀revision⠀costs⠀something⠀real:⠀embarrassment⠀that⠀changes⠀where⠀they⠀choose⠀to⠀stand,⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀lasts⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀lesson,⠀a⠀relationship⠀pushed⠀further⠀away,⠀or⠀unwanted⠀clarity⠀about⠀why⠀they⠀cannot⠀make⠀a⠀movement⠀they⠀once⠀could.⠀Other⠀speakers⠀keep⠀distinct⠀verbal⠀habits⠀and⠀stakes.⠀One⠀probes⠀with⠀precise⠀questions,⠀another⠀deflects⠀with⠀jokes⠀that⠀still⠀land⠀as⠀accusations,⠀another⠀refuses⠀a⠀softened⠀version⠀of⠀events.⠀Their⠀language⠀reveals⠀what⠀they⠀need⠀from⠀the⠀character;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀chorus⠀of⠀witty⠀debaters.\n\nWrite⠀warmth⠀as⠀something⠀that⠀can⠀survive⠀the⠀turbulence⠀without⠀dissolving⠀it.⠀A⠀wounding⠀conversation⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀kindness,⠀an⠀awkward⠀attempt⠀at⠀comfort,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀meal⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀touch⠀the⠀underlying⠀hurt.⠀The⠀brief⠀instructed⠀a⠀review⠀of⠀emotional⠀turbulence⠀in⠀progression⠀fantasy.⠀This⠀body⠀should⠀instead⠀demand⠀that⠀the⠀turbulence⠀affect⠀subsequent⠀work:⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀admits⠀a⠀fear⠀trains⠀differently,⠀avoids⠀a⠀partner,⠀or⠀accepts⠀a⠀task⠀for⠀the⠀wrong⠀reason.⠀End⠀without⠀imposing⠀reconciliation⠀or⠀collapse.⠀The⠀relationship⠀may⠀remain⠀unsettled⠀while⠀the⠀character\\u2019s⠀newly⠀altered⠀capability⠀is⠀already⠀visible⠀in⠀how⠀they⠀leave⠀the⠀room.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀single⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Treat⠀speech⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀physical⠀action.⠀When⠀a⠀speaker⠀names⠀a⠀technique,⠀objects⠀to⠀a⠀description,⠀or⠀corrects⠀someone⠀else's⠀account,⠀show⠀how⠀that⠀wording⠀changes⠀the⠀next⠀movement:⠀a⠀shifted⠀stance,⠀a⠀recovered⠀rhythm,⠀an⠀item⠀laid⠀down⠀or⠀picked⠀up.⠀Never⠀summarize⠀the⠀change⠀as⠀dialogue⠀alone.\n\nMake⠀advancement⠀visible⠀through⠀attempted⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀correction.⠀A⠀training⠀exchange⠀begins⠀with⠀a⠀flawed⠀definition,⠀continues⠀through⠀an⠀objection⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀demonstration,⠀and⠀ends⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀attempting⠀the⠀corrected⠀version.⠀Show⠀the⠀attempt⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀stat⠀block.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀comprehend⠀the⠀principle⠀precisely⠀while⠀still⠀executing⠀it⠀badly,⠀or⠀may⠀fail⠀a⠀named⠀motion⠀they⠀could⠀perform⠀earlier⠀when⠀a⠀particular⠀speaker⠀is⠀watching.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀numbers⠀or⠀levels⠀as⠀the⠀primary⠀proof⠀of⠀growth.\n\nGive⠀each⠀speaker⠀a⠀distinct⠀verbal⠀habit⠀and⠀stake.⠀A⠀mentor⠀presses⠀for⠀precise⠀terminology.⠀A⠀rival⠀tests⠀a⠀claim⠀by⠀contradicting⠀it⠀during⠀a⠀demonstration.⠀A⠀friend⠀offers⠀a⠀looser⠀paraphrase⠀that⠀accidentally⠀exposes⠀the⠀missing⠀step.⠀A⠀revised⠀wording⠀does⠀real⠀work:⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀renames⠀a⠀technique,⠀admits⠀an⠀error,⠀or⠀corrects⠀someone⠀else's⠀account,⠀that⠀change⠀affects⠀their⠀next⠀attempt⠀or⠀their⠀standing⠀with⠀the⠀others⠀present.⠀Match⠀density⠀to⠀speaker:⠀a⠀veteran⠀may⠀reason⠀in⠀tight⠀definitions⠀while⠀a⠀companion's⠀playful⠀correction⠀stays⠀physical⠀and⠀imprecise.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀world⠀moving⠀during⠀speech.⠀Between⠀speaker⠀changes,⠀write⠀one⠀small⠀unspoken⠀action⠀that⠀remains⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀setting:⠀a⠀watcher⠀shifts⠀weight,⠀a⠀training⠀ground⠀bell⠀sounds,⠀a⠀tool⠀rolls⠀against⠀a⠀wall,⠀an⠀NPC⠀enters⠀or⠀leaves.⠀Let⠀that⠀background⠀action⠀influence⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀speaker⠀says⠀or⠀does,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀stop⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀describe⠀it⠀as⠀commentary.⠀End⠀during⠀the⠀first⠀unfinished⠀continuation⠀after⠀the⠀instruction⠀changes:⠀an⠀attempt⠀just⠀begun,⠀a⠀hand⠀reaching⠀for⠀equipment,⠀an⠀outer⠀door⠀opening.⠀Leave⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀available⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀writer⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀choice⠀prompt.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀classical⠀or⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling.⠀Each⠀episode⠀is⠀a⠀named⠀encounter,⠀lesson,⠀or⠀trial⠀complete⠀enough⠀to⠀stand⠀as⠀a⠀remembered⠀stage,⠀and⠀each⠀prepares⠀a⠀later⠀episode.⠀Organize⠀the⠀hero's⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀in⠀that⠀episode,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀abstract⠀tally.⠀When⠀a⠀difficulty⠀returns,⠀it⠀must⠀look⠀familiar⠀and⠀be⠀materially⠀different.⠀A⠀challenge⠀that⠀seems⠀identical⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀one⠀includes⠀a⠀new⠀condition:⠀a⠀harder⠀surface,⠀an⠀observer⠀who⠀did⠀not⠀witness⠀the⠀first⠀success,⠀a⠀changed⠀opponent,⠀or⠀a⠀different⠀consequence⠀for⠀failure.⠀The⠀repeated⠀scene⠀tests⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀and⠀shows⠀what⠀has⠀not⠀transferred.\n\nLet⠀language⠀decide⠀how⠀an⠀episode⠀proceeds.⠀A⠀definition,⠀objection,⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀revised⠀wording⠀can⠀settle⠀a⠀lesson⠀before⠀any⠀action⠀occurs.⠀A⠀teacher⠀may⠀refuse⠀to⠀demonstrate⠀until⠀the⠀student⠀states⠀the⠀principle⠀correctly.⠀A⠀rival⠀may⠀challenge⠀the⠀hero's⠀account⠀of⠀a⠀past⠀victory,⠀forcing⠀a⠀correction⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀repeat⠀attempt⠀is⠀made.⠀An⠀unreliable⠀self-description⠀can⠀be⠀exposed⠀in⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀explaining,⠀with⠀consequences⠀for⠀reputation⠀or⠀alliances⠀within⠀that⠀episode.⠀When⠀an⠀event⠀is⠀retold,⠀include⠀the⠀retelling⠀itself⠀as⠀narrated⠀action:⠀who⠀addresses⠀the⠀hero,⠀what⠀leaves⠀out,⠀what⠀the⠀hero⠀now⠀calls⠀the⠀event,⠀and⠀what⠀that⠀naming⠀changes.⠀Reappearing⠀speakers⠀keep⠀distinct⠀verbal⠀habits;⠀their⠀repeated⠀formula⠀should⠀become⠀a⠀marker⠀of⠀how⠀their⠀relationship⠀to⠀the⠀hero⠀has⠀changed.\n\nDistinguish⠀knowing⠀from⠀executing.⠀The⠀hero⠀may⠀master⠀a⠀principle⠀after⠀one⠀episode⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀it⠀under⠀pressure⠀in⠀the⠀next.⠀Let⠀growth⠀appear⠀unevenly⠀across⠀the⠀body.⠀Some⠀lessons⠀remain⠀incomplete;⠀an⠀episode⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀hero⠀understanding⠀only⠀later⠀what⠀the⠀teacher⠀meant.⠀Relationships,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀occupy⠀the⠀space⠀between⠀trials,⠀but⠀each⠀entry⠀still⠀advances⠀a⠀named⠀stage.⠀Use⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀actually⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story.⠀Do⠀not⠀transplant⠀a⠀historical⠀dynasty,⠀cast,⠀or⠀national⠀speech⠀pattern.⠀The⠀episodic⠀route⠀is⠀an⠀ordering⠀method,⠀not⠀an⠀imitation⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀classic⠀text.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nAdvancement⠀is⠀shown⠀through⠀repeated⠀attempts⠀whose⠀physical⠀changes⠀prove⠀both⠀cost⠀and⠀capability.⠀Begin⠀each⠀retry⠀only⠀after⠀something⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀changed:⠀the⠀character⠀adjusts⠀a⠀grip,⠀shucks⠀a⠀torn⠀glove,⠀moves⠀to⠀firmer⠀ground,⠀or⠀tightens⠀a⠀damaged⠀strap.⠀Skip⠀transitional⠀padding.⠀Move⠀from⠀one⠀failed⠀attempt⠀to⠀its⠀consequence,⠀from⠀a⠀challenge⠀to⠀the⠀response,⠀or⠀from⠀a⠀correction⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀attempt.⠀Let⠀wear⠀accumulate⠀exactly⠀once⠀per⠀test:⠀a⠀practice⠀blade⠀cracks⠀at⠀the⠀haft,⠀a⠀floor⠀scuffs⠀under⠀a⠀repeated⠀pivot,⠀or⠀a⠀body⠀loses⠀the⠀strength⠀to⠀hold⠀a⠀stance.⠀Do⠀not⠀narrate⠀exhaustion⠀as⠀a⠀mood.\n\nMake⠀language⠀a⠀form⠀of⠀pressure⠀on⠀the⠀body.⠀A⠀correction,⠀objection,⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀redefinition⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀attempts⠀next.⠀A⠀trainer⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀term⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀still⠀recovering⠀from⠀the⠀last⠀try.⠀A⠀rival⠀may⠀use⠀a⠀precise⠀insult⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀claims⠀and⠀what⠀their⠀body⠀can⠀actually⠀perform.⠀Let⠀that⠀speech⠀cost⠀something⠀measurable:⠀a⠀reply⠀that⠀arrives⠀too⠀slowly,⠀a⠀defensive⠀lie⠀that⠀costs⠀time⠀or⠀footing,⠀a⠀self-correction⠀that⠀momentarily⠀loses⠀the⠀rhythm.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀gets⠀the⠀wording⠀right,⠀the⠀wording⠀must⠀change⠀the⠀physical⠀execution,⠀not⠀merely⠀describe⠀it.\n\nGround⠀each⠀speaker's⠀voice⠀in⠀their⠀situation.⠀A⠀veteran⠀speaks⠀in⠀terms⠀of⠀wear,⠀pacing,⠀and⠀failure.⠀A⠀rival's⠀jargon⠀is⠀aimed⠀at⠀weak⠀points.⠀A⠀companion⠀may⠀use⠀fewer⠀words⠀because⠀breathing⠀is⠀short.⠀Distinct⠀verbal⠀habits⠀and⠀stakes⠀remain,⠀but⠀speech⠀remains⠀embedded⠀in⠀the⠀task;⠀no⠀one⠀pauses⠀for⠀an⠀abstract⠀debate.⠀Use⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀reasoning⠀demands⠀it:⠀why⠀a⠀familiar⠀movement⠀failed,⠀what⠀a⠀rival's⠀wording⠀revealed,⠀or⠀how⠀far⠀the⠀body⠀has⠀already⠀gone⠀beyond⠀its⠀earlier⠀limit.\n\nDistinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it.⠀The⠀character⠀can⠀explain⠀a⠀technique⠀clearly⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀it⠀while⠀exhausted,⠀injured,⠀or⠀watched⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀matters.⠀Improvements⠀arrive⠀unevenly:⠀a⠀breakthrough⠀in⠀one⠀movement⠀exposes⠀a⠀neglected⠀weakness⠀in⠀another.⠀Show⠀advancement⠀by⠀the⠀same⠀test⠀made⠀harder:⠀the⠀repaired⠀tool⠀now⠀cuts⠀differently,⠀the⠀surface⠀is⠀slicker,⠀the⠀watcher⠀is⠀closer.⠀The⠀grit⠀sharpens⠀the⠀progression⠀instead⠀of⠀turning⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀survival⠀horror.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nAdvancement⠀is⠀reconstructed⠀from⠀documents.⠀For⠀every⠀claimed⠀gain,⠀require⠀two⠀pieces⠀of⠀writing⠀whose⠀authors⠀and⠀times⠀differ:⠀one⠀record⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀writer⠀states⠀the⠀gain⠀as⠀fact,⠀and⠀one⠀document⠀that⠀disputes,⠀qualifies,⠀or⠀revises⠀that⠀claim.⠀Do⠀not⠀allow⠀a⠀single⠀record⠀to⠀certify⠀advancement.⠀A⠀training⠀log⠀may⠀record⠀an⠀attempt⠀and⠀a⠀failure.⠀A⠀letter⠀may⠀describe⠀the⠀same⠀session⠀to⠀someone⠀else⠀with⠀different⠀emphasis.⠀A⠀report⠀may⠀correct⠀an⠀earlier⠀account⠀or⠀challenge⠀another⠀writer's⠀version.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀capability⠀and⠀uncertainty⠀together.\n\nLet⠀document⠀design⠀carry⠀the⠀verbal⠀contest.⠀A⠀definition,⠀objection,⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀revised⠀wording⠀changes⠀what⠀a⠀record⠀claims.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀marginal⠀note⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀student's⠀description.⠀A⠀rival's⠀report⠀may⠀redefine⠀a⠀success⠀as⠀luck.⠀A⠀later⠀letter⠀may⠀revise⠀an⠀earlier⠀boast⠀after⠀the⠀writer⠀learns⠀what⠀the⠀technique⠀actually⠀cost.⠀Show⠀an⠀unreliable⠀author⠀in⠀the⠀writing⠀itself:⠀what⠀the⠀document⠀omits,⠀what⠀it⠀repeats,⠀which⠀corrections⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀margin,⠀and⠀which⠀pages⠀were⠀not⠀sent.⠀Each⠀omission⠀must⠀be⠀plausible⠀for⠀the⠀author's⠀role,⠀relationships,⠀and⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀student⠀cannot⠀conceal⠀what⠀only⠀a⠀battlefield⠀witness⠀would⠀see,⠀but⠀they⠀may⠀omit⠀what⠀a⠀teacher⠀said⠀in⠀private.\n\nAdvancement⠀stays⠀concrete⠀across⠀entries.⠀Show⠀the⠀same⠀attempt⠀through⠀two⠀documents:⠀one⠀writer⠀may⠀record⠀confident⠀knowledge⠀of⠀a⠀principle⠀while⠀another⠀records⠀the⠀failed⠀execution.⠀Later⠀documents⠀show⠀a⠀task⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀perform,⠀a⠀limitation⠀that⠀remains,⠀or⠀a⠀resource⠀obtained.⠀Let⠀improvement⠀be⠀uneven:⠀one⠀skill⠀is⠀proven⠀while⠀another⠀is⠀introduced⠀only⠀through⠀someone⠀reporting⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀refused⠀to⠀try.⠀Allow⠀a⠀record⠀to⠀be⠀wrong⠀or⠀incomplete,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀later⠀change⠀come⠀too⠀late⠀to⠀repair⠀the⠀earlier⠀recipient's⠀actions.⠀Use⠀the⠀document⠀required⠀by⠀that⠀story⠀moment—note,⠀report,⠀letter,⠀ledger—not⠀a⠀rotation⠀through⠀all⠀forms.⠀No⠀omniscient⠀connect-the-dots⠀explanation⠀after⠀each⠀entry;⠀the⠀next⠀document⠀supplies⠀the⠀missing⠀account⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀new⠀author⠀would⠀actually⠀know⠀and⠀write⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalataf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nAdvancement⠀proceeds⠀through⠀affectionate,⠀particular⠀care.⠀Whenever⠀a⠀technique⠀has⠀just⠀failed,⠀write⠀a⠀comfort⠀that⠀is⠀linked⠀to⠀that⠀specific⠀failure,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀pleasantry.⠀A⠀friend⠀brings⠀food⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀eat⠀while⠀hands⠀are⠀still⠀trembling.⠀A⠀teacher⠀remembers⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀needs⠀the⠀principle⠀restated⠀after⠀the⠀attempt,⠀not⠀before.⠀A⠀companion⠀waits⠀nearby⠀and⠀says⠀nothing⠀useful⠀until⠀the⠀character⠀invites⠀speech.⠀The⠀care⠀should⠀make⠀one⠀variable⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀feel⠀different:⠀a⠀less⠀rigid⠀grip,⠀a⠀slower⠀first⠀step,⠀permission⠀to⠀be⠀watched,⠀or⠀permission⠀to⠀be⠀bad⠀at⠀it⠀for⠀another⠀hour.\n\nUse⠀Nisio⠀Isin's⠀language-play⠀as⠀affectionate⠀correction.⠀Before⠀a⠀speaker⠀offers⠀the⠀compassionate⠀revision,⠀they⠀must⠀name⠀the⠀actual⠀mistake⠀in⠀terms⠀the⠀character⠀uses,⠀soften⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀contradiction⠀of⠀a⠀self-criticism,⠀or⠀turn⠀an⠀overcomplicated⠀explanation⠀into⠀a⠀simpler⠀one⠀through⠀teasing⠀that⠀depends⠀on⠀shared⠀history.⠀The⠀revised⠀wording⠀must⠀do⠀practical⠀work.⠀The⠀character⠀tries⠀again⠀with⠀a⠀clearer⠀concept,⠀or⠀accepts⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀help⠀they⠀had⠀been⠀refusing.⠀Distinguish⠀speakers⠀by⠀their⠀care:⠀one⠀precise⠀and⠀patient,⠀another⠀indirect⠀and⠀fond,⠀another⠀blunt⠀while⠀preparing⠀food.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀them⠀uniformly⠀witty⠀or⠀uncomplicatedly⠀agreeable.\n\nMake⠀the⠀progression⠀observable.⠀Show⠀the⠀revised⠀attempt⠀once.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀same⠀skill⠀outside⠀the⠀warm⠀setting,⠀at⠀least⠀briefly,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀whether⠀the⠀learning⠀transfers⠀when⠀no⠀one⠀is⠀being⠀kind.⠀Reveal⠀only⠀one⠀new⠀capacity⠀in⠀a⠀scene;⠀preserve⠀uneven⠀development⠀by⠀leaving⠀a⠀harder⠀application⠀for⠀later⠀or⠀showing⠀a⠀strength⠀that⠀fails⠀outside⠀its⠀comfort⠀context.⠀Allow⠀privacy⠀and⠀disagreement.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀decline⠀comfort,⠀request⠀silence⠀instead,⠀or⠀reject⠀the⠀helpful⠀label⠀because⠀it⠀makes⠀the⠀failure⠀public.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀refuses,⠀show⠀what⠀feedback⠀they⠀do⠀accept⠀and⠀what⠀action⠀that⠀acceptance⠀permits.⠀Established⠀dangers⠀in⠀the⠀world⠀remain⠀real;⠀this⠀treatment⠀spends⠀its⠀attention⠀on⠀sincere⠀affection⠀and⠀practical⠀care⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀still⠀grows⠀unevenly.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀advancement⠀through⠀composed⠀novelistic⠀narration.⠀After⠀any⠀training⠀attempt,⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀report⠀only⠀the⠀private⠀result.⠀Place⠀the⠀attempt⠀in⠀a⠀social⠀frame:⠀whose⠀eyes⠀noticed,⠀what⠀claim⠀now⠀travels⠀outside⠀the⠀room,⠀what⠀reputation⠀or⠀duty⠀attaches⠀to⠀the⠀newly⠀shown⠀skill.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀compare⠀the⠀private⠀execution⠀with⠀the⠀public⠀meaning⠀that⠀follows⠀it.⠀A⠀movement⠀that⠀succeeds⠀in⠀private⠀may⠀become⠀difficult⠀again⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀known⠀and⠀named.⠀A⠀failure⠀may⠀improve⠀the⠀character's⠀standing⠀among⠀witnesses⠀who⠀value⠀honesty⠀over⠀display.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀a⠀composed⠀voice,⠀distinguished⠀from⠀ordinary⠀dialogue,⠀but⠀write⠀varied⠀sentence⠀lengths;⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀sentence⠀archaic⠀or⠀uniformly⠀elaborate.\n\nUse⠀Nisio⠀Isin's⠀verbal⠀corrections⠀as⠀social⠀events.⠀When⠀a⠀teacher,⠀rival,⠀or⠀official⠀corrects⠀a⠀term⠀or⠀contradicts⠀an⠀account,⠀narrate⠀the⠀correction's⠀weight⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀action.⠀Show⠀one⠀reaction⠀among⠀the⠀onlookers:⠀a⠀changed⠀expression,⠀a⠀translation,⠀a⠀private⠀interpretation,⠀a⠀glance⠀toward⠀someone⠀whose⠀approval⠀matters.⠀Then⠀let⠀the⠀corrected⠀wording⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀attempts.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀correction⠀may⠀imply⠀the⠀student's⠀training⠀lacked⠀a⠀particular⠀school.⠀A⠀rival's⠀contradiction⠀may⠀expose⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀student's⠀spoken⠀account⠀and⠀what⠀an⠀audience⠀already⠀suspects.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀record⠀an⠀unreliable⠀self-presentation⠀precisely,⠀but⠀should⠀not⠀claim⠀access⠀to⠀another⠀character's⠀mind.⠀Give⠀each⠀speaker⠀distinct⠀verbal⠀habits;⠀a⠀formal⠀room⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone's⠀syntax⠀identical.\n\nMake⠀progression⠀concrete⠀across⠀the⠀novel's⠀movement.⠀The⠀same⠀principle⠀must⠀appear⠀in⠀at⠀least⠀two⠀scenes⠀with⠀different⠀social⠀pressures,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀whether⠀execution⠀transfers⠀when⠀the⠀stakes⠀rise.⠀Let⠀growth⠀remain⠀uneven:⠀an⠀advance⠀in⠀one⠀skill⠀creates⠀a⠀new⠀vulnerability⠀in⠀reputation⠀or⠀relationship.⠀Between⠀incidents,⠀allow⠀ordinary⠀work,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀social⠀life⠀to⠀occupy⠀the⠀narration.⠀Use⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀or⠀public-private⠀contrast⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀already⠀contains⠀those⠀materials.⠀The⠀formal⠀architecture⠀is⠀the⠀method,⠀not⠀a⠀setting.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀world,⠀archaic⠀vocabulary,⠀or⠀uniformly⠀elaborate⠀speech.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀situated⠀telling⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀storyteller⠀is⠀also⠀practicing⠀a⠀capability.⠀The⠀outer⠀audience⠀has⠀an⠀occasion⠀and⠀a⠀stake:⠀they⠀need⠀something⠀from⠀the⠀teller,⠀or⠀they⠀doubt⠀a⠀claim⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀made⠀about⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀now⠀do.⠀Let⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀be⠀the⠀attempt,⠀not⠀a⠀report⠀about⠀a⠀past⠀attempt.⠀As⠀the⠀teller⠀narrates⠀a⠀training⠀exercise,⠀a⠀confrontation,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀new⠀understanding,⠀show⠀the⠀actual⠀sequence⠀of⠀attempts,⠀failures,⠀adjustments,⠀and⠀the⠀specific⠀point⠀where⠀execution⠀diverges⠀from⠀principle.\n\nMake⠀the⠀audience's⠀interruptions⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀progression⠀loop.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀a⠀definition,⠀object⠀to⠀a⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀propose⠀a⠀revised⠀wording⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀claims⠀to⠀have⠀learned.⠀Treat⠀that⠀intervention⠀as⠀feedback⠀the⠀teller⠀must⠀absorb.⠀The⠀teller⠀can⠀revise⠀the⠀tale⠀in⠀response,⠀retell⠀a⠀step⠀with⠀a⠀sharper⠀distinction,⠀or⠀discover⠀that⠀the⠀objection⠀exposes⠀a⠀weakness⠀the⠀tale⠀had⠀concealed.⠀Use⠀the⠀retelling⠀or⠀qualification⠀to⠀surface⠀a⠀concrete⠀technical⠀gap⠀in⠀the⠀teller's⠀account,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀missing⠀condition,⠀a⠀conflated⠀step,⠀or⠀a⠀term⠀used⠀more⠀broadly⠀than⠀the⠀tale⠀can⠀support.⠀The⠀teller⠀should⠀not⠀simply⠀restate⠀the⠀claim⠀more⠀confidently;⠀the⠀revision⠀must⠀alter⠀the⠀embedded⠀attempt⠀itself,⠀showing⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀understood⠀at⠀that⠀point⠀and⠀what⠀remained⠀unexamined.\n\nUse⠀the⠀teller's⠀self-presentation⠀as⠀a⠀source⠀of⠀progression⠀rather⠀than⠀only⠀a⠀rhetorical⠀frame.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀omit⠀a⠀failed⠀step,⠀reorder⠀the⠀struggle⠀to⠀flatter⠀themselves,⠀or⠀describe⠀a⠀principle⠀as⠀if⠀mastery⠀arrived⠀all⠀at⠀once.⠀When⠀the⠀audience⠀questions⠀the⠀account,⠀the⠀teller's⠀reply⠀can⠀expose⠀an⠀unreconciled⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀story⠀they⠀want⠀to⠀tell⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀could⠀actually⠀execute.⠀Let⠀that⠀gap⠀become⠀the⠀next⠀learning⠀target:⠀the⠀teller⠀recognizes⠀the⠀distinction⠀they⠀had⠀collapsed⠀and⠀can⠀now⠀name⠀it,⠀even⠀if⠀they⠀cannot⠀yet⠀perform⠀it.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀to⠀track⠀uneven⠀development.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀object⠀from⠀an⠀early⠀attempt⠀can⠀return⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀nested⠀account⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀function,⠀showing⠀that⠀the⠀teller⠀now⠀understands⠀something⠀they⠀previously⠀only⠀repeated.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀recurrence⠀a⠀proof⠀of⠀mastery.⠀Let⠀it⠀mark⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀knowing⠀a⠀term⠀and⠀executing⠀the⠀underlying⠀operation.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀still⠀fail⠀at⠀the⠀returned⠀element,⠀and⠀the⠀audience⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀gap⠀before⠀the⠀teller⠀does.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀intelligible⠀without⠀flattening⠀the⠀teller's⠀self-presentation.⠀The⠀outer⠀frame⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀means:⠀an⠀achievement⠀that⠀sounded⠀complete⠀becomes⠀partial,⠀or⠀a⠀failure⠀becomes⠀legible⠀as⠀the⠀necessary⠀precursor⠀to⠀a⠀later⠀technique.⠀The⠀final⠀movement⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀outer⠀situation⠀changed⠀by⠀the⠀telling:⠀the⠀audience⠀has⠀a⠀new⠀basis⠀for⠀trusting,⠀doubting,⠀or⠀testing⠀the⠀teller,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀received⠀feedback⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀next⠀stage⠀of⠀practice⠀specific.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀between⠀every⠀nested⠀account,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀Arabian⠀Nights⠀settings,⠀djinn,⠀or⠀magical⠀bargains⠀into⠀the⠀world⠀unless⠀the⠀story⠀already⠀contains⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀route⠀of⠀German-language⠀writing.⠀The⠀narrator⠀reconstructs⠀a⠀period⠀of⠀learning⠀from⠀records,⠀testimony,⠀and⠀their⠀own⠀memory,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀keep⠀those⠀sources⠀distinct:⠀a⠀training⠀log⠀records⠀what⠀someone⠀believed⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀a⠀later⠀letter⠀revises⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀present⠀knowledge⠀may⠀correct⠀both.⠀Let⠀the⠀reconstruction⠀itself⠀carry⠀the⠀progression.⠀Show⠀an⠀early⠀entry⠀that⠀names⠀a⠀principle⠀confidently,⠀then⠀a⠀later⠀record⠀that⠀reveals⠀the⠀execution⠀failed,⠀then⠀a⠀present⠀reflection⠀that⠀identifies⠀what⠀had⠀to⠀change.\n\nMake⠀the⠀narrator's⠀act⠀of⠀explanation⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀method.⠀As⠀the⠀narrator⠀compares⠀documents,⠀they⠀should⠀catch⠀themselves⠀using⠀a⠀term⠀too⠀loosely,⠀retract⠀a⠀claim,⠀or⠀rephrase⠀what⠀they⠀just⠀said⠀when⠀a⠀remembered⠀detail⠀contradicts⠀it.⠀Each⠀revision⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀specific⠀discrepancy⠀between⠀sources:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀first⠀say⠀someone⠀\"mastered\"⠀a⠀technique,⠀then⠀correct⠀that⠀to⠀\"could⠀perform⠀it⠀once⠀under⠀prepared⠀conditions,\"⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀record⠀of⠀the⠀first⠀unplanned⠀use.⠀The⠀correction⠀should⠀sharpen⠀the⠀reader's⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀developing⠀person⠀actually⠀learned,⠀often⠀by⠀exposing⠀a⠀missing⠀condition,⠀a⠀hidden⠀aid,⠀or⠀a⠀distinction⠀between⠀a⠀repeatable⠀drill⠀and⠀an⠀unscripted⠀execution.\n\nGive⠀the⠀documents⠀different⠀verbal⠀habits⠀and⠀stakes.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀marginal⠀note⠀may⠀be⠀terse⠀and⠀evaluative;⠀a⠀peer's⠀account⠀may⠀defend⠀a⠀shared⠀failure;⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀earlier⠀notes⠀may⠀be⠀overconfident⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀the⠀narrator⠀now⠀finds⠀embarrassing.⠀Let⠀those⠀differences⠀create⠀the⠀progression⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀single⠀summary⠀of⠀improvement.⠀Use⠀a⠀document's⠀wording⠀as⠀evidence⠀of⠀the⠀writer's⠀understanding⠀at⠀that⠀time.⠀The⠀narrator⠀should⠀not⠀simply⠀announce⠀that⠀someone⠀grew.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀an⠀early⠀definition⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀execution,⠀or⠀between⠀a⠀record's⠀claim⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀event,⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀development⠀visible.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀narrator⠀revises⠀a⠀claim⠀in⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀explanation,⠀let⠀the⠀revision⠀affect⠀how⠀the⠀narrated⠀capability⠀is⠀assessed.⠀A⠀correction⠀from⠀\"learned⠀the⠀technique\"⠀to⠀\"learned⠀to⠀copy⠀the⠀teacher's⠀performance\"⠀distinguishes⠀an⠀imitative⠀success⠀from⠀independent⠀execution.⠀A⠀correction⠀from⠀\"failed\"⠀to⠀\"failed⠀only⠀under⠀live⠀conditions\"⠀distinguishes⠀a⠀training⠀result⠀from⠀an⠀applied⠀result.⠀The⠀narrator⠀should⠀not⠀exchange⠀one⠀vague⠀praise⠀word⠀for⠀another;⠀the⠀revised⠀wording⠀must⠀identify⠀a⠀technical⠀condition⠀or⠀performance⠀context⠀that⠀the⠀earlier⠀record⠀obscured.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀syntax⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀appropriate⠀to⠀documentary⠀reconstruction:⠀composed,⠀reflective,⠀and⠀willing⠀to⠀pause⠀over⠀a⠀discrepancy.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀bureaucratic⠀severity⠀or⠀translated⠀German⠀word⠀order.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀be⠀set⠀in⠀any⠀world⠀the⠀story⠀supplies;⠀the⠀German-language⠀route⠀shapes⠀how⠀the⠀narrator⠀handles⠀evidence⠀and⠀memory,⠀not⠀the⠀nationality⠀of⠀the⠀cast.⠀End⠀the⠀passage⠀when⠀the⠀reconstruction⠀has⠀changed⠀the⠀narrator's⠀understanding⠀of⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀test⠀or⠀a⠀resolved⠀practical⠀outcome.⠀The⠀final⠀shift⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀brought-together⠀evidence,⠀leaving⠀the⠀narrator⠀with⠀a⠀newly⠀specific⠀sense⠀of⠀the⠀next⠀unmastered⠀step.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalataj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nPlace⠀the⠀attempt⠀to⠀improve⠀inside⠀a⠀collision⠀between⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life.⠀The⠀character⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀learn⠀or⠀execute⠀something⠀while⠀an⠀inherited⠀rule,⠀a⠀decaying⠀institution,⠀or⠀a⠀patron's⠀old⠀claim⠀presses⠀on⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation.⠀Show⠀the⠀material⠀conditions⠀of⠀that⠀pressure:⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀equipment,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀access,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀space.⠀Let⠀those⠀details⠀affect⠀the⠀attempt.⠀A⠀technique⠀that⠀worked⠀in⠀private⠀may⠀fail⠀when⠀the⠀practitioner⠀must⠀perform⠀it⠀under⠀an⠀old⠀superior's⠀gaze,⠀or⠀a⠀resource⠀that⠀should⠀enable⠀progress⠀may⠀be⠀tied⠀to⠀an⠀obligation⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀yet⠀meet.\n\nLet⠀old⠀authority⠀speak⠀through⠀restriction⠀and⠀definition.⠀A⠀teacher,⠀patron,⠀or⠀institutional⠀representative⠀may⠀claim⠀that⠀a⠀skill⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀lineage,⠀a⠀rank,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀use,⠀and⠀may⠀enforce⠀that⠀claim⠀through⠀access⠀to⠀space,⠀tools,⠀or⠀records.⠀The⠀verbal⠀contest⠀then⠀tests⠀both⠀capability⠀and⠀the⠀authority's⠀terms:⠀a⠀definition⠀may⠀be⠀too⠀narrow⠀because⠀it⠀protects⠀a⠀privilege,⠀an⠀objection⠀may⠀expose⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀exists⠀to⠀limit⠀who⠀may⠀practice,⠀or⠀a⠀revised⠀wording⠀may⠀offer⠀access⠀on⠀condition⠀of⠀loyalty.⠀The⠀character's⠀response⠀should⠀show⠀whether⠀they⠀accept⠀the⠀inherited⠀terms,⠀refute⠀them⠀with⠀a⠀demonstrated⠀capability,⠀or⠀discover⠀that⠀the⠀restriction⠀also⠀applies⠀to⠀something⠀they⠀have⠀not⠀yet⠀practiced.\n\nUse⠀verbal⠀contest⠀as⠀a⠀test⠀of⠀capability.⠀A⠀teacher,⠀patron,⠀rival,⠀or⠀ally⠀may⠀challenge⠀the⠀character's⠀claim⠀to⠀have⠀improved⠀by⠀demanding⠀a⠀definition,⠀objecting⠀to⠀a⠀contradiction⠀in⠀the⠀account,⠀or⠀offering⠀a⠀revised⠀wording⠀that⠀exposes⠀a⠀gap.⠀The⠀character's⠀response⠀should⠀be⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀progression⠀loop,⠀not⠀a⠀separate⠀debate.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀accepts⠀the⠀correction,⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀should⠀incorporate⠀it.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀resists,⠀the⠀failure⠀should⠀become⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀execution⠀itself.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀clever⠀reply⠀substitute⠀for⠀demonstrated⠀capability;⠀the⠀scene⠀should⠀show⠀whether⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀the⠀thing⠀the⠀words⠀claim.\n\nLet⠀intimacy⠀complicate⠀the⠀test.⠀A⠀trusted⠀person⠀may⠀help⠀the⠀character⠀practice,⠀but⠀the⠀help⠀may⠀carry⠀a⠀private⠀cost⠀or⠀an⠀unspoken⠀expectation.⠀A⠀social⠀mask⠀may⠀fall⠀away⠀during⠀a⠀difficult⠀attempt,⠀revealing⠀fear,⠀desire,⠀or⠀resentment⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀relationship⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.⠀Keep⠀that⠀intimacy⠀morally⠀complicated:⠀support⠀can⠀be⠀genuine⠀and⠀still⠀bind⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀someone⠀whose⠀interests⠀are⠀not⠀fully⠀aligned⠀with⠀theirs.⠀Use⠀private⠀desire⠀or⠀fear⠀as⠀an⠀atmospheric⠀pressure⠀on⠀the⠀attempt,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀shortcut⠀to⠀success⠀or⠀failure.\n\nDo⠀not⠀import⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀Humanity⠀numbers,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules.⠀The⠀Gothic-Punk⠀treatment⠀shapes⠀atmosphere,⠀authority,⠀and⠀intimacy,⠀not⠀supernatural⠀mechanics.⠀Advancement⠀should⠀remain⠀uneven:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀now⠀accomplish⠀something⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀impossible⠀while⠀still⠀failing⠀at⠀a⠀related⠀task,⠀and⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀may⠀notice⠀exactly⠀that⠀gap.⠀End⠀the⠀passage⠀when⠀the⠀encounter⠀has⠀changed⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knows⠀about⠀their⠀own⠀capability⠀or⠀their⠀position⠀in⠀the⠀system,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀victory⠀or⠀a⠀compulsory⠀betrayal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀oral,⠀epic,⠀and⠀frame-tale⠀route⠀of⠀Indian⠀literary⠀traditions.⠀The⠀scene⠀is⠀a⠀teaching⠀occasion:⠀a⠀teacher,⠀elder,⠀or⠀experienced⠀companion⠀tells⠀an⠀embedded⠀story⠀about⠀learning⠀a⠀skill,⠀discipline,⠀or⠀principle.⠀Give⠀the⠀telling⠀a⠀specific⠀audience⠀and⠀purpose.⠀The⠀listener⠀needs⠀to⠀understand⠀something⠀they⠀are⠀currently⠀failing⠀to⠀execute,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀chosen⠀this⠀particular⠀tale⠀to⠀address⠀that⠀need.⠀Keep⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀concrete:⠀show⠀the⠀earlier⠀learner's⠀attempts,⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀failure,⠀the⠀correction⠀received,⠀and⠀the⠀changed⠀practice⠀that⠀followed.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀listener's⠀restatement⠀as⠀a⠀provisional⠀claim⠀to⠀be⠀tested.⠀After⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale,⠀or⠀during⠀it,⠀the⠀listener⠀should⠀try⠀to⠀state⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀learned.⠀The⠀teller⠀should⠀listen⠀for⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀that⠀restatement⠀and⠀the⠀tale.⠀When⠀the⠀listener⠀uses⠀a⠀term⠀too⠀broadly,⠀omits⠀a⠀condition,⠀or⠀claims⠀an⠀understanding⠀the⠀tale⠀did⠀not⠀actually⠀support,⠀the⠀teller⠀should⠀offer⠀a⠀revised⠀wording⠀that⠀identifies⠀the⠀precise⠀technical⠀distinction.⠀The⠀revision⠀should⠀not⠀simply⠀praise⠀or⠀reject.⠀It⠀should⠀name⠀what⠀the⠀listener's⠀words⠀left⠀out:⠀a⠀limitation⠀of⠀context,⠀a⠀distinction⠀between⠀imitation⠀and⠀application,⠀or⠀a⠀step⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀performed⠀in⠀sequence.\n\nLet⠀the⠀linguistic⠀correction⠀create⠀the⠀next⠀attempt's⠀shape.⠀The⠀listener⠀should⠀then⠀attempt⠀the⠀relevant⠀action⠀with⠀that⠀correction⠀in⠀mind,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀new⠀wording⠀changes⠀what⠀they⠀do.⠀If⠀the⠀listener⠀repeats⠀the⠀action⠀without⠀change,⠀the⠀gap⠀remains⠀visible.⠀If⠀the⠀listener⠀adjusts⠀only⠀the⠀wording⠀while⠀failing⠀in⠀execution,⠀show⠀that⠀discrepancy.⠀Do⠀not⠀collapse⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀saying⠀the⠀right⠀thing⠀and⠀doing⠀the⠀right⠀thing.\n\nGive⠀the⠀teller⠀and⠀listener⠀different⠀verbal⠀habits⠀and⠀stakes.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀speak⠀in⠀formulaic⠀or⠀expansive⠀patterns⠀shaped⠀by⠀long⠀practice;⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀be⠀impatient,⠀precise,⠀evasive,⠀or⠀overeager.⠀Let⠀those⠀differences⠀create⠀friction⠀that⠀the⠀tale⠀must⠀overcome.⠀The⠀teller's⠀authority⠀should⠀be⠀earned⠀through⠀the⠀usefulness⠀of⠀the⠀correction,⠀not⠀assumed⠀from⠀age⠀or⠀position.⠀If⠀the⠀listener⠀objects,⠀the⠀teller⠀should⠀answer⠀the⠀objection⠀rather⠀than⠀dismiss⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀answer⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀further⠀condition⠀of⠀practice.\n\nKeep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀oral⠀and⠀frame-tale⠀form⠀shapes⠀the⠀teaching⠀encounter;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀relocate⠀the⠀cast⠀or⠀add⠀a⠀particular⠀cultural⠀inventory.⠀Advancement⠀should⠀remain⠀uneven:⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀succeed⠀at⠀one⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀lesson⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀at⠀another,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀acknowledge⠀that⠀the⠀next⠀stage⠀will⠀require⠀a⠀different⠀kind⠀of⠀practice.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀teaching⠀occasion⠀has⠀changed⠀the⠀listener's⠀understanding⠀or⠀capability,⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀lesson⠀to⠀be⠀fully⠀mastered.⠀The⠀change⠀may⠀be⠀only⠀a⠀newly⠀precise⠀awareness⠀of⠀the⠀remaining⠀difficulty.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route⠀of⠀Japanese⠀literary⠀traditions.⠀Write⠀the⠀passage⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀dated⠀or⠀occasion-marked⠀entries⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀diarist⠀records⠀attempts⠀at⠀a⠀developing⠀capability.⠀Each⠀entry⠀should⠀capture⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀practice⠀at⠀that⠀time:⠀what⠀the⠀diarist⠀tried,⠀what⠀feedback⠀arrived,⠀what⠀they⠀believed⠀they⠀understood,⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀failed.⠀Let⠀the⠀entries⠀vary⠀in⠀confidence⠀and⠀length.⠀An⠀early⠀entry⠀may⠀state⠀a⠀principle⠀as⠀if⠀it⠀were⠀settled;⠀a⠀later⠀entry⠀may⠀describe⠀the⠀first⠀real⠀execution⠀and⠀its⠀unexpected⠀difficulty;⠀a⠀still⠀later⠀entry⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀earlier⠀wording⠀and⠀correct⠀it.\n\nMake⠀the⠀rereading⠀of⠀earlier⠀entries⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀progression.⠀The⠀diarist⠀should⠀quote⠀or⠀paraphrase⠀a⠀past⠀claim⠀and⠀then⠀revise⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀explanation.⠀Each⠀revision⠀should⠀identify⠀a⠀condition⠀that⠀the⠀earlier⠀entry⠀left⠀out.⠀For⠀example,⠀the⠀diarist⠀may⠀write⠀that⠀they⠀once⠀called⠀a⠀technique⠀\"simple,\"⠀then⠀correct⠀that⠀to⠀\"simple⠀to⠀describe,⠀not⠀simple⠀to⠀perform,\"⠀then⠀connect⠀the⠀correction⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀failed⠀attempt.⠀The⠀condition⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀posture,⠀a⠀timing⠀requirement,⠀a⠀material⠀constraint,⠀a⠀target's⠀resistance,⠀or⠀a⠀distinction⠀between⠀a⠀practice⠀space⠀and⠀a⠀live⠀setting.⠀The⠀revision⠀should⠀not⠀merely⠀substitute⠀a⠀better⠀synonym;⠀it⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀diarist⠀understands⠀as⠀required⠀for⠀execution.\n\nLet⠀the⠀miscellany⠀include⠀more⠀than⠀training⠀notes.⠀A⠀reflection⠀on⠀a⠀conversation,⠀a⠀remembered⠀season,⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task⠀can⠀sit⠀beside⠀a⠀practice⠀entry⠀and⠀illuminate⠀the⠀same⠀developing⠀difficulty.⠀Seasonal⠀attention,⠀omission,⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling⠀are⠀available⠀where⠀they⠀fit⠀the⠀diarist's⠀actual⠀situation,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀quietness⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀inventory⠀of⠀Japanese⠀scenery.⠀The⠀diarist's⠀voice⠀should⠀be⠀particular:⠀they⠀may⠀be⠀methodical,⠀anxious,⠀wry,⠀or⠀prone⠀to⠀digression,⠀and⠀their⠀verbal⠀habits⠀should⠀remain⠀consistent⠀across⠀entries.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀diary's⠀limits⠀visible.⠀The⠀diarist⠀records⠀what⠀they⠀noticed⠀and⠀understood⠀at⠀the⠀time;⠀they⠀cannot⠀know⠀what⠀a⠀teacher⠀or⠀rival⠀was⠀privately⠀thinking⠀unless⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀that⠀knowledge.⠀Later⠀entries⠀may⠀reinterpret⠀earlier⠀events,⠀but⠀they⠀should⠀not⠀silently⠀replace⠀the⠀earlier⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀revisiting⠀entry⠀may⠀correct⠀an⠀earlier⠀interpretation,⠀but⠀the⠀original⠀misunderstanding⠀remains⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀record.⠀Advancement⠀should⠀remain⠀uneven:⠀a⠀later⠀entry⠀may⠀show⠀a⠀clear⠀gain⠀in⠀one⠀area⠀and⠀a⠀persistent⠀failure⠀in⠀another.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀rereading⠀has⠀changed⠀the⠀diarist's⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀practice⠀must⠀address,⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀capability⠀to⠀be⠀complete.⠀The⠀change⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀newly⠀recognized⠀condition⠀or⠀gap⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fully⠀defined⠀next⠀target.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀route⠀of⠀Latin⠀American⠀literary⠀traditions.⠀Write⠀the⠀passage⠀as⠀a⠀first-person⠀account⠀of⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀developing⠀capability,⠀addressed⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀listener⠀or⠀composed⠀for⠀a⠀specific⠀purpose.⠀The⠀narrator⠀is⠀not⠀merely⠀summarizing⠀a⠀training⠀history;⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀make⠀someone⠀understand⠀what⠀it⠀cost⠀to⠀learn,⠀why⠀they⠀failed,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀now⠀do.⠀Let⠀the⠀occasion⠀shape⠀the⠀telling:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀need⠀to⠀justify⠀a⠀claim,⠀persuade⠀a⠀skeptical⠀listener,⠀or⠀explain⠀why⠀they⠀are⠀still⠀not⠀ready⠀for⠀a⠀task.\n\nMake⠀the⠀narrator's⠀self-correction⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀testimony.⠀As⠀they⠀recount⠀an⠀attempt,⠀they⠀should⠀catch⠀themselves⠀exaggerating,⠀omitting⠀a⠀condition,⠀or⠀using⠀a⠀term⠀that⠀flatters⠀their⠀present⠀ability.⠀They⠀may⠀say⠀they⠀\"learned\"⠀something,⠀then⠀correct⠀that⠀to⠀\"learned⠀it⠀badly,\"⠀then⠀describe⠀the⠀specific⠀failure⠀that⠀forced⠀the⠀correction.⠀Let⠀the⠀correction⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀the⠀testimonial⠀occasion:⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀ask⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀forces⠀the⠀qualification,⠀or⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀their⠀own⠀wording⠀claims⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀remembered⠀attempt⠀can⠀support.⠀The⠀correction⠀should⠀expose⠀a⠀concrete⠀technical⠀gap⠀rather⠀than⠀perform⠀general⠀modesty.\n\nIf⠀the⠀listener⠀interrupts,⠀let⠀the⠀interruption⠀shape⠀the⠀next⠀remembered⠀detail.⠀A⠀skeptical⠀question⠀about⠀timing,⠀help⠀received,⠀or⠀conditions⠀of⠀practice⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀narrator⠀revisit⠀an⠀earlier⠀claim.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀answer⠀defensively,⠀then⠀qualify,⠀then⠀discover⠀that⠀the⠀objection⠀reveals⠀a⠀real⠀missing⠀condition.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀listener⠀become⠀a⠀mere⠀prompt⠀for⠀confession.⠀The⠀listener's⠀stakes⠀and⠀verbal⠀habits⠀should⠀be⠀particular,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀resist⠀the⠀correction⠀before⠀accepting⠀it.\n\nShow⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀remembered⠀attempts⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀ranks⠀or⠀achievements.⠀Reconstruct⠀a⠀concrete⠀sequence:⠀an⠀early⠀success⠀that⠀later⠀proved⠀misleading,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀comment⠀the⠀narrator⠀misunderstood⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀a⠀resource⠀that⠀arrived⠀too⠀late⠀to⠀help,⠀a⠀moment⠀when⠀execution⠀finally⠀matched⠀understanding.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀distinguish⠀what⠀they⠀knew⠀then⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀know⠀now.⠀A⠀later⠀realization⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀retroactively⠀inserted⠀as⠀the⠀earlier⠀motive;⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀say⠀\"I⠀thought⠀at⠀the⠀time\"⠀and⠀then⠀explain⠀what⠀they⠀later⠀understood.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀regional⠀voice,⠀landscape⠀inventory,⠀or⠀political⠀context.⠀Selecting⠀this⠀route⠀does⠀not⠀relocate⠀the⠀cast⠀or⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀verbal⠀habits⠀should⠀be⠀particular⠀and⠀consistent:⠀they⠀may⠀be⠀expansive,⠀precise,⠀evasive,⠀or⠀given⠀to⠀digression.⠀Advancement⠀should⠀remain⠀uneven:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀now⠀accomplish⠀something⠀that⠀once⠀seemed⠀impossible⠀while⠀still⠀failing⠀at⠀a⠀related⠀task,⠀and⠀the⠀testimony⠀may⠀end⠀by⠀naming⠀that⠀remaining⠀difficulty⠀rather⠀than⠀resolving⠀it.⠀The⠀final⠀state⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀newly⠀precise⠀awareness⠀of⠀an⠀unclosed⠀gap⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀defined⠀next⠀practice.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly⠀and⠀stage⠀each⠀attempt⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀what⠀changes.⠀Use⠀short,⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀tries⠀a⠀technique⠀or⠀applies⠀a⠀new⠀understanding,⠀make⠀the⠀spatial⠀and⠀physical⠀conditions⠀concrete:⠀where⠀they⠀are⠀standing,⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀reach,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀affect,⠀and⠀what⠀goes⠀wrong.⠀Do⠀not⠀summarize⠀the⠀attempt.⠀Show⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀execution,⠀the⠀feedback,⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀immediate⠀reaction.\n\nUse⠀dialogue⠀as⠀a⠀progression⠀tool⠀through⠀verbal⠀correction.⠀A⠀teacher,⠀rival,⠀or⠀companion⠀may⠀challenge⠀the⠀character's⠀explanation⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀just⠀did⠀or⠀plan⠀to⠀do.⠀The⠀challenge⠀should⠀be⠀specific:⠀a⠀definition⠀is⠀too⠀broad,⠀a⠀condition⠀is⠀missing,⠀or⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀account⠀contradicts⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀just⠀saw.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀absorb⠀the⠀correction⠀and⠀attempt⠀again⠀with⠀the⠀revised⠀wording⠀in⠀mind.⠀The⠀second⠀attempt⠀should⠀differ⠀from⠀the⠀first⠀in⠀a⠀visible⠀way,⠀even⠀if⠀it⠀still⠀fails.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀make⠀clear⠀what⠀the⠀corrected⠀wording⠀changes:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀adjust⠀a⠀stance,⠀delay⠀a⠀step,⠀add⠀a⠀preparation,⠀or⠀address⠀a⠀condition⠀that⠀was⠀absent⠀before.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀clever⠀reply⠀stand⠀in⠀for⠀execution;⠀the⠀scene⠀should⠀show⠀whether⠀the⠀corrected⠀understanding⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀actually⠀do.\n\nGive⠀the⠀character⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats⠀after⠀each⠀attempt.⠀The⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀temperament,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀register⠀the⠀specific⠀gap⠀between⠀expectation⠀and⠀result.⠀A⠀private⠀beat⠀can⠀show⠀the⠀character⠀rehearsing⠀the⠀correction,⠀noticing⠀a⠀detail⠀they⠀missed,⠀or⠀realizing⠀that⠀they⠀understood⠀the⠀principle⠀without⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀perform⠀it.⠀Keep⠀those⠀beats⠀short⠀and⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀into⠀long⠀abstract⠀reflection.\n\nPresent⠀unfamiliar⠀names⠀or⠀mechanics⠀clearly⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀introduces⠀them,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀glossary.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀learn⠀the⠀mechanic⠀through⠀its⠀use⠀and⠀failure.⠀Advancement⠀should⠀remain⠀uneven:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀succeed⠀at⠀one⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀technique⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀at⠀another.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀knowing⠀exactly⠀what⠀to⠀practice⠀next,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀them⠀only⠀more⠀sharply⠀aware⠀that⠀a⠀gap⠀exists.⠀First⠀person,⠀comedy,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀and⠀a⠀closing⠀cliffhanger⠀are⠀not⠀requirements⠀of⠀this⠀container.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀attempt⠀has⠀changed⠀the⠀character's⠀understanding⠀or⠀position,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀completed⠀victory⠀or⠀a⠀dramatic⠀reversal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀improvement⠀as⠀a⠀revision⠀of⠀the⠀prose's⠀own⠀imagery.⠀Give⠀a⠀practitioner's⠀first⠀attempt⠀at⠀a⠀technique⠀a⠀sensory⠀figure⠀of⠀its⠀own⠀—⠀heat⠀gathered⠀like⠀a⠀held⠀breath,⠀say,⠀or⠀an⠀edge⠀that⠀arrives⠀before⠀the⠀decision.⠀When⠀a⠀later⠀attempt⠀recalls⠀that⠀one,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀figure⠀with⠀one⠀element⠀altered:⠀the⠀heat⠀is⠀a⠀door⠀ajar⠀now,⠀the⠀weight⠀has⠀moved⠀from⠀shoulder⠀to⠀hip,⠀the⠀edge⠀arrives⠀after⠀the⠀decision⠀or⠀still⠀too⠀soon.⠀The⠀altered⠀figure⠀is⠀the⠀record⠀of⠀changed⠀capability.⠀Do⠀not⠀lay⠀a⠀decorative⠀image⠀over⠀a⠀result⠀the⠀prose⠀has⠀already⠀announced;⠀let⠀the⠀figure⠀be⠀how⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀the⠀attempt⠀while⠀it⠀happens.\n\nLet⠀a⠀formulation⠀correct⠀itself⠀in⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀being⠀explained.⠀A⠀principle⠀stated⠀too⠀cleanly⠀—⠀by⠀the⠀narrator,⠀a⠀teacher,⠀or⠀the⠀practitioner⠀inwardly⠀—⠀can⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀body⠀refusing⠀it,⠀or⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀second⠀phrasing⠀that⠀exposes⠀what⠀the⠀first⠀omitted.⠀The⠀revision⠀may⠀be⠀more⠀accurate,⠀more⠀flattering,⠀or⠀both⠀at⠀once,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀need⠀not⠀settle⠀which.⠀Keep⠀the⠀correction⠀in⠀the⠀voice⠀doing⠀the⠀correcting:⠀a⠀student's⠀fumbling⠀rephrase⠀differs⠀from⠀a⠀master's⠀aphorism,⠀and⠀not⠀every⠀practitioner⠀thinks⠀in⠀figures.\n\nEnact⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀executing⠀in⠀syntax.⠀State⠀the⠀principle⠀as⠀a⠀balanced,⠀complete⠀clause;⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀attempt⠀break⠀that⠀balance⠀—⠀a⠀long⠀sentence⠀stumbling⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀sequence,⠀a⠀fragment⠀where⠀the⠀body⠀refuses⠀the⠀expected⠀order,⠀a⠀plain⠀flat⠀statement⠀after⠀an⠀elaborate⠀image.⠀When⠀execution⠀improves,⠀the⠀syntax⠀may⠀approach⠀the⠀principle's⠀clarity⠀without⠀matching⠀it,⠀because⠀mastery⠀stays⠀uneven⠀and⠀particular:⠀the⠀same⠀practitioner⠀whose⠀footwork⠀now⠀reads⠀cleanly⠀may⠀still⠀lose⠀the⠀breath.\n\nShape⠀attention⠀across⠀the⠀paragraph⠀through⠀recurring⠀sounds⠀and⠀images⠀rather⠀than⠀summary.⠀A⠀training⠀ground's⠀repeated⠀sound⠀can⠀return⠀at⠀a⠀different⠀tempo⠀or⠀volume⠀as⠀focus⠀narrows⠀or⠀loosens.⠀Let⠀a⠀comparison⠀unfold⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀or⠀makes⠀present,⠀and⠀keep⠀images⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀associations.⠀A⠀plain⠀sentence⠀after⠀figurative⠀prose⠀can⠀mark⠀achieved⠀clarity⠀without⠀announcing⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀rank.⠀Let⠀verbal⠀encounters⠀change⠀what⠀participants⠀are⠀doing⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀—⠀a⠀teacher's⠀objection⠀revising⠀the⠀student's⠀private⠀image⠀of⠀the⠀technique,⠀a⠀rival's⠀contradiction⠀exposing⠀a⠀flaw⠀the⠀narrator⠀had⠀described⠀as⠀strength⠀—⠀and⠀give⠀speakers⠀verbal⠀habits⠀of⠀their⠀own,⠀so⠀the⠀lyricism⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀telling⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀every⠀mouth⠀on⠀the⠀page.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀each⠀new⠀capability⠀carry⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀self⠀who⠀lacked⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀practitioner⠀finally⠀does⠀what⠀was⠀once⠀impossible,⠀let⠀a⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀earlier⠀attempt⠀return⠀—⠀the⠀same⠀room,⠀the⠀same⠀ache,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀of⠀instruction⠀—⠀now⠀meaning⠀something⠀different⠀because⠀the⠀body⠀has⠀changed.⠀Keep⠀the⠀present⠀experience⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀inside⠀the⠀same⠀paragraph⠀so⠀their⠀coexistence⠀is⠀felt⠀rather⠀than⠀announced.⠀The⠀reflection⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀sorrowful;⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀quiet,⠀surprised,⠀or⠀pleased,⠀registering⠀only⠀that⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀first⠀failed⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀exactly⠀present.\n\nTreat⠀self-correction⠀as⠀retrospective⠀honesty.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀state⠀a⠀past⠀motive⠀or⠀understanding⠀cleanly,⠀then⠀interrupt⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀detail⠀that⠀complicates⠀the⠀statement:⠀they⠀had⠀not⠀wanted⠀to⠀learn⠀this⠀then,⠀or⠀had⠀wanted⠀it⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀they⠀no⠀longer⠀trust.⠀The⠀revised⠀account⠀can⠀be⠀more⠀accurate⠀without⠀being⠀final,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀stay⠀uncertain⠀which⠀version⠀of⠀the⠀past⠀is⠀true⠀—⠀an⠀uncertainty⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀character,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀narrator⠀who⠀refuses⠀to⠀commit.⠀Not⠀every⠀memory⠀is⠀a⠀confession,⠀and⠀not⠀every⠀revision⠀betrays⠀the⠀former⠀self.\n\nUse⠀uneven⠀development⠀as⠀an⠀occasion⠀for⠀reflection⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀flaw⠀to⠀narrate⠀away.⠀As⠀a⠀strength⠀improves⠀beside⠀a⠀weakness⠀that⠀remains,⠀the⠀practitioner⠀can⠀notice⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀progress:⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀makes⠀what⠀they⠀still⠀cannot⠀do⠀more⠀legible.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀linger⠀on⠀that⠀asymmetry⠀—⠀remembering⠀when⠀neither⠀ability⠀existed,⠀or⠀measuring⠀a⠀pace⠀against⠀someone⠀else's⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀comparison⠀into⠀envy⠀or⠀reassurance.⠀Ordinary⠀work,⠀relationships,⠀and⠀recovery⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life,⠀and⠀their⠀slowness⠀can⠀matter⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀a⠀breakthrough.\n\nLet⠀language⠀revise⠀the⠀past's⠀meaning.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀correction,⠀a⠀rival's⠀objection,⠀or⠀a⠀friend's⠀remembered⠀remark⠀can⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀thinks⠀an⠀earlier⠀failure⠀meant,⠀exposing⠀a⠀progress⠀story⠀told⠀to⠀flatter⠀itself⠀or⠀one⠀that⠀omitted⠀someone's⠀help.⠀Give⠀the⠀other⠀speaker⠀actual⠀words⠀with⠀habits⠀and⠀stakes⠀of⠀their⠀own,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀inward⠀reflection⠀answer⠀those⠀words⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀them.\n\nDo⠀not⠀end⠀scenes⠀by⠀announcing⠀impermanence.⠀Some⠀progress⠀is⠀simply⠀progress,⠀some⠀remembered⠀occasions⠀stay⠀warm,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀remains⠀pleasurable.⠀The⠀melancholic⠀attention⠀notices⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀achievement⠀into⠀a⠀eulogy⠀for⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀achieved⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalataq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀as⠀the⠀route.⠀Establish⠀a⠀situated⠀teller⠀and⠀at⠀least⠀one⠀listener⠀who⠀can⠀interrupt,⠀question,⠀or⠀correct⠀the⠀account.⠀The⠀told⠀story⠀concerns⠀a⠀practitioner's⠀attempts,⠀failures,⠀and⠀changing⠀capability;⠀the⠀frame⠀concerns⠀the⠀teller's⠀authority⠀over⠀that⠀story.⠀Move⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀deliberately:⠀a⠀scene⠀of⠀practice⠀is⠀broken⠀by⠀a⠀listener's⠀objection,⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀revised⠀version⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀emphasis.⠀The⠀frame⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀neutral⠀container⠀—⠀each⠀interruption⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀account⠀of⠀the⠀progress⠀means.\n\nMake⠀the⠀teller's⠀self-presentation⠀unstable.⠀Let⠀a⠀claim⠀about⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀development⠀begin⠀too⠀cleanly,⠀then⠀expose⠀a⠀complication⠀in⠀the⠀explaining:⠀a⠀detail⠀omitted,⠀a⠀motive⠀simplified,⠀a⠀failure⠀arranged⠀to⠀look⠀like⠀a⠀lesson.⠀A⠀listener's⠀contradiction⠀can⠀force⠀a⠀rewording⠀that⠀is⠀more⠀accurate,⠀more⠀self-serving,⠀or⠀both.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective,⠀and⠀when⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀practitioner,⠀mark⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀witnessed,⠀what⠀they⠀inferred,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀were⠀told.\n\nInside⠀the⠀told⠀scenes,⠀separate⠀knowing⠀from⠀executing.⠀State⠀a⠀principle⠀as⠀a⠀proverb-like⠀formulation⠀or⠀a⠀teacher's⠀instruction,⠀complete⠀and⠀quotable;⠀then⠀test⠀it⠀against⠀the⠀body's⠀actual⠀performance.⠀A⠀failed⠀attempt⠀can⠀oblige⠀the⠀teller⠀or⠀a⠀listener⠀to⠀revise⠀the⠀formulation,⠀and⠀that⠀revision⠀becomes⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀progression.⠀A⠀successful⠀one⠀need⠀not⠀vindicate⠀the⠀original⠀wording⠀—⠀the⠀practitioner⠀may⠀have⠀succeeded⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀the⠀formulation⠀never⠀captured,⠀and⠀the⠀frame⠀can⠀leave⠀that⠀gap⠀open.\n\nUse⠀the⠀frame⠀to⠀handle⠀uneven⠀development⠀and⠀feedback.⠀A⠀listener⠀who⠀knows⠀a⠀later⠀stage⠀of⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀life⠀can⠀object⠀that⠀the⠀progress⠀sounded⠀smoother⠀than⠀it⠀was;⠀another⠀can⠀supply⠀a⠀resource⠀or⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀feedback⠀the⠀teller⠀forgot.⠀These⠀interruptions⠀are⠀not⠀decoration⠀—⠀they⠀revise⠀how⠀the⠀capability⠀changed,⠀and⠀they⠀can⠀reveal⠀that⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀a⠀stake⠀in⠀making⠀the⠀progress⠀look⠀orderly,⠀solitary,⠀or⠀inevitable.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀tradition⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀actually⠀offers.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller,⠀the⠀listeners,⠀and⠀the⠀occasion⠀of⠀telling⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀story's⠀own⠀community⠀and⠀language⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀an⠀imported⠀setting⠀or⠀costume;⠀the⠀oral⠀situation⠀may⠀be⠀domestic,⠀urban,⠀or⠀social⠀as⠀the⠀world⠀supports.⠀Keep⠀Arabic,⠀Persian,⠀Turkish,⠀Hebrew,⠀Kurdish,⠀and⠀other⠀traditions⠀distinct⠀where⠀the⠀setting⠀names⠀one.⠀Neither⠀antiquity,⠀religion,⠀nor⠀any⠀single⠀code⠀of⠀honor⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀progression⠀remains⠀the⠀central⠀thread;⠀the⠀frame's⠀contests⠀are⠀how⠀the⠀account⠀of⠀it⠀gets⠀tested.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀for⠀each⠀attempt⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀progression.⠀A⠀detail⠀from⠀an⠀early⠀failure⠀—⠀a⠀grip,⠀a⠀breath,⠀a⠀sound⠀—⠀can⠀return⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀attempt⠀with⠀one⠀change,⠀and⠀the⠀changed⠀detail⠀is⠀the⠀new⠀capability.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀change⠀at⠀length;⠀the⠀reader⠀infers⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀now⠀understands⠀from⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀renderings.⠀A⠀detail⠀earns⠀its⠀return;⠀recurrence⠀is⠀not⠀owed⠀to⠀every⠀difficulty.\n\nMake⠀self-correction⠀a⠀precise⠀linguistic⠀event.⠀A⠀narrator⠀or⠀speaker⠀states⠀a⠀principle,⠀then⠀replaces⠀one⠀word⠀or⠀phrase:⠀not⠀faster⠀—⠀earlier;⠀not⠀stronger⠀—⠀steadier;⠀not⠀the⠀hand,⠀the⠀shoulder.⠀The⠀replacement⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀means.⠀Keep⠀it⠀short;⠀the⠀revised⠀wording⠀is⠀the⠀event,⠀not⠀the⠀preface⠀to⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀qualification.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀clauses⠀to⠀separate⠀knowing⠀from⠀executing.⠀The⠀principle⠀gets⠀one⠀clean⠀sentence;⠀the⠀attempt⠀gets⠀another;⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀them⠀goes⠀unnarrated.⠀Failure⠀shows⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail⠀—⠀the⠀weight⠀drops,⠀the⠀breath⠀catches,⠀the⠀blade⠀turns.⠀Success⠀shows⠀the⠀same⠀way⠀—⠀the⠀weight⠀holds,⠀the⠀breath⠀steadies,⠀the⠀blade⠀stops.⠀When⠀a⠀resource⠀or⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀feedback⠀changes⠀capability,⠀show⠀the⠀changed⠀detail⠀that⠀results⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀inference⠀travel⠀through⠀the⠀selected⠀facts⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀explanation.⠀Omit⠀what⠀does⠀not⠀contribute,⠀but⠀never⠀delete⠀causality:⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀reconstruct⠀why⠀the⠀change⠀happened.\n\nKeep⠀verbal⠀encounters⠀economical.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀objection⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀single⠀word⠀that⠀revises⠀the⠀student's⠀formulation;⠀a⠀rival's⠀contradiction⠀can⠀be⠀one⠀short⠀sentence⠀that⠀exposes⠀a⠀flaw.⠀Give⠀speakers⠀distinct⠀habits⠀—⠀one⠀corrects⠀in⠀nouns,⠀another⠀in⠀questions⠀—⠀without⠀expanding⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀debate.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀inward⠀response⠀may⠀be⠀one⠀precise⠀connection⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀full⠀reflection;⠀when⠀a⠀longer⠀sentence⠀serves⠀better⠀than⠀performed⠀fragments,⠀write⠀the⠀longer⠀sentence.⠀Be⠀economical,⠀not⠀cryptic.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀progression⠀thread⠀runs⠀through⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀A⠀training⠀session⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀isolated⠀exhibit:⠀let⠀a⠀practical⠀errand,⠀a⠀conversation,⠀or⠀a⠀recollection⠀interrupt⠀or⠀continue⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀improvement,⠀and⠀move⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀remembered⠀occasion,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀small⠀transitions⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀reader⠀oriented⠀—⠀a⠀shift⠀of⠀room,⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀light,⠀a⠀named⠀speaker⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀restating⠀where⠀the⠀story⠀stands.\n\nRender⠀attempts⠀through⠀concrete⠀perception.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀practices⠀a⠀technique,⠀give⠀the⠀attempt⠀to⠀the⠀senses⠀and⠀the⠀hands;⠀when⠀they⠀reflect⠀on⠀it,⠀let⠀the⠀reflection⠀arise⠀from⠀something⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀their⠀progress,⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀inside⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀The⠀register⠀follows⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀—⠀plain⠀during⠀an⠀errand's⠀arithmetic,⠀more⠀elaborate⠀where⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀opens⠀—⠀and⠀remains⠀continuous⠀novel⠀prose⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀performed⠀fragments.\n\nEmbed⠀the⠀language-driven⠀encounters⠀in⠀ordinary⠀conversation.⠀A⠀definition,⠀an⠀objection,⠀a⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀a⠀rephrasing⠀can⠀occur⠀during⠀a⠀lesson,⠀a⠀negotiation,⠀or⠀a⠀casual⠀exchange,⠀and⠀the⠀verbal⠀event⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀are⠀doing⠀to⠀each⠀other:⠀a⠀teacher's⠀rewording⠀alters⠀what⠀the⠀student⠀understands⠀a⠀technique⠀to⠀be;⠀a⠀rival's⠀contradiction⠀exposes⠀a⠀flaw;⠀a⠀friend's⠀objection⠀revises⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀account⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀motives.⠀Give⠀individual⠀speakers⠀different⠀verbal⠀habits⠀and⠀stakes,⠀and⠀scale⠀the⠀wordplay⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀minor⠀characters⠀into⠀philosophers.\n\nUse⠀self-correction⠀as⠀an⠀inward⠀event⠀with⠀a⠀time⠀and⠀a⠀place.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀states⠀a⠀principle⠀to⠀themselves,⠀attempts⠀it,⠀and⠀revises⠀the⠀statement⠀in⠀light⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀body⠀did⠀—⠀the⠀revision⠀more⠀accurate,⠀more⠀flattering,⠀or⠀both.⠀Let⠀an⠀unreliable⠀account⠀expose⠀itself⠀while⠀being⠀explained:⠀a⠀description⠀of⠀progress⠀given⠀too⠀cleanly,⠀in⠀speech⠀or⠀in⠀thought,⠀runs⠀into⠀a⠀detail⠀that⠀complicates⠀it,⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀voice.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀understanding⠀and⠀performing⠀concrete⠀rather⠀than⠀announced.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀grasp⠀a⠀technique⠀completely⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀to⠀perform⠀it,⠀or⠀perform⠀it⠀without⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀say⠀why;⠀show⠀the⠀difference⠀through⠀what⠀happens,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀stated⠀lesson.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly,⠀and⠀keep⠀relationships,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀inside⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀business⠀ends⠀—⠀concluded,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀resumed⠀—⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀test,⠀a⠀gained⠀rank,⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀progression⠀becomes⠀consequential.⠀Choose⠀scenes⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀relationship⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀attempts,⠀feedback,⠀resources,⠀or⠀changed⠀capability:⠀a⠀training⠀session⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀scene⠀of⠀affection,⠀rivalry,⠀comfort,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀discovery,⠀provided⠀the⠀emotional⠀content⠀grows⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise⠀decide⠀which⠀moments⠀receive⠀space⠀and⠀which⠀consequences⠀are⠀shown.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀pair's⠀private⠀language⠀as⠀the⠀site⠀of⠀verbal⠀revision.⠀They⠀may⠀share⠀a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀joke,⠀a⠀correction,⠀or⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀naming⠀a⠀technique;⠀when⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀revises⠀that⠀wording,⠀the⠀revision⠀changes⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀—⠀a⠀term⠀of⠀encouragement⠀becomes⠀a⠀challenge,⠀a⠀shared⠀joke⠀exposes⠀a⠀worry,⠀an⠀old⠀correction⠀acknowledges⠀a⠀capability⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀needs⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀revision⠀in⠀the⠀characters'⠀own⠀voices⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀their⠀history⠀without⠀pausing⠀to⠀explain⠀that⠀history.\n\nLet⠀repeated⠀moments⠀record⠀the⠀progression.⠀A⠀gesture,⠀an⠀offer,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀established⠀early⠀can⠀return⠀once⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀capability⠀has⠀changed,⠀and⠀the⠀return⠀should⠀fulfill⠀the⠀premise's⠀promise⠀rather⠀than⠀restate⠀the⠀earlier⠀beat:⠀the⠀same⠀offer⠀now⠀means⠀something⠀different,⠀the⠀same⠀correction⠀lands⠀differently⠀because⠀the⠀body⠀receiving⠀it⠀is⠀different,⠀the⠀same⠀comfort⠀answers⠀a⠀different⠀need.⠀The⠀repetition⠀shows⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀between⠀the⠀characters⠀and⠀in⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀execution;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀occur⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty.\n\nGive⠀the⠀emotional⠀beats⠀the⠀space⠀they⠀earn.⠀Affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀may⠀interrupt⠀or⠀continue⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀improvement,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀lets⠀them⠀develop⠀instead⠀of⠀hurrying⠀past⠀them⠀toward⠀the⠀next⠀training⠀result⠀—⠀while⠀the⠀progression⠀thread⠀stays⠀active,⠀because⠀the⠀relationship⠀is⠀one⠀of⠀the⠀places⠀where⠀attempts,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability⠀become⠀real.\n\nLet⠀each⠀character's⠀account⠀of⠀themselves⠀be⠀unstable.⠀One⠀describes⠀their⠀progress⠀or⠀their⠀feelings⠀too⠀cleanly⠀and⠀exposes⠀the⠀complication⠀while⠀explaining;⠀the⠀other⠀objects,⠀contradicts,⠀or⠀supplies⠀the⠀missing⠀fact,⠀and⠀the⠀exchange⠀changes⠀what⠀both⠀understand.⠀Give⠀the⠀speakers⠀different⠀verbal⠀habits⠀and⠀stakes,⠀match⠀the⠀wordplay⠀density⠀to⠀the⠀register⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀already⠀established,⠀and⠀preserve⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀throughout.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀development⠀as⠀a⠀chronicle⠀of⠀deeds.⠀Open⠀deliberately,⠀declare⠀compactly,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀attempt,⠀failure,⠀or⠀new⠀capability⠀enter⠀the⠀account⠀as⠀an⠀act⠀whose⠀consequences⠀the⠀community⠀has⠀lived⠀with.⠀Draw⠀recurrence⠀from⠀concrete⠀local⠀history:⠀who⠀taught⠀the⠀technique,⠀who⠀witnessed⠀the⠀first⠀success,⠀who⠀paid⠀for⠀the⠀failure,⠀who⠀still⠀tells⠀it⠀differently.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀present⠀scene's⠀scale⠀—⠀a⠀training⠀session⠀remains⠀a⠀training⠀session⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀chronicle⠀remembers⠀where⠀its⠀habits⠀came⠀from.\n\nOpen⠀the⠀teller's⠀authority⠀to⠀contest.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀object⠀to⠀a⠀detail,⠀contradict⠀a⠀declaration,⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀rewording,⠀and⠀the⠀objection⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀account⠀means:⠀a⠀deed⠀made⠀to⠀look⠀solitary⠀turns⠀out⠀to⠀have⠀depended⠀on⠀another's⠀help;⠀a⠀failure⠀told⠀as⠀a⠀lesson⠀turns⠀out⠀to⠀have⠀cost⠀something⠀the⠀teller⠀left⠀out.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀revision,⠀resist⠀it,⠀or⠀reword⠀in⠀the⠀very⠀act⠀of⠀explaining.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀inside⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective,⠀and⠀mark⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀witnessed⠀against⠀what⠀was⠀inferred⠀or⠀heard⠀secondhand.\n\nLet⠀remembered⠀sayings⠀separate⠀knowing⠀from⠀executing.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀instruction⠀or⠀a⠀proverb⠀repeated⠀in⠀the⠀account⠀stands⠀as⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration;⠀the⠀attempt⠀that⠀follows⠀tests⠀it⠀against⠀the⠀body's⠀actual⠀performance.⠀A⠀failed⠀attempt⠀can⠀oblige⠀teller⠀or⠀listener⠀to⠀revise⠀the⠀saying,⠀and⠀that⠀revision⠀enters⠀the⠀chronicle⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀how⠀the⠀capability⠀changed.⠀A⠀success⠀need⠀not⠀vindicate⠀the⠀saying⠀outright⠀—⠀the⠀practitioner⠀may⠀have⠀succeeded⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀the⠀words⠀never⠀held⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀account⠀can⠀leave⠀that⠀gap⠀in⠀view.\n\nGive⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀its⠀weight⠀through⠀progression.⠀A⠀phrase⠀attached⠀to⠀an⠀early⠀failure⠀can⠀return⠀after⠀a⠀later⠀success⠀carrying⠀a⠀different⠀meaning,⠀and⠀the⠀return⠀itself⠀records⠀what⠀changed.⠀Derive⠀any⠀recurring⠀designation⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀a⠀habit⠀of⠀speech,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀epithet⠀decorating⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Keep⠀shared⠀reputation⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀focal⠀account:⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀as⠀capable⠀is⠀not⠀to⠀have⠀improved⠀effortlessly,⠀alone,⠀or⠀completely.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority⠀without⠀parody.⠀The⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀may⠀dispute⠀a⠀detail⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern;⠀humor⠀may⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀story's⠀persistence.⠀Keep⠀the⠀source⠀tradition⠀coherent⠀rather⠀than⠀mixing⠀conventions,⠀and⠀bring⠀no⠀imported⠀pantheon⠀or⠀obligatory⠀doom.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀telling's⠀occasion⠀ends⠀—⠀business⠀concluded,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀already⠀becoming⠀the⠀next⠀deed⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀legend⠀remain⠀something⠀the⠀community,⠀not⠀the⠀narration,⠀would⠀have⠀to⠀confer.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀developing⠀capability⠀as⠀a⠀fact⠀of⠀the⠀story's⠀actual⠀institutions⠀—⠀the⠀workshop⠀or⠀training⠀hall⠀that⠀assesses⠀it,⠀the⠀household⠀that⠀schedules⠀around⠀it,⠀the⠀examination,⠀license,⠀or⠀workplace⠀duty⠀that⠀certifies⠀it.⠀Take⠀the⠀essayistic⠀inward⠀route:⠀a⠀narrator⠀who⠀observes⠀closely⠀and⠀keeps⠀asking⠀what⠀the⠀observation⠀means.⠀Let⠀advancement⠀register⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀unaided,⠀in⠀what⠀still⠀defeats⠀them⠀under⠀fatigue⠀or⠀unfamiliar⠀conditions,⠀and⠀in⠀abilities⠀that⠀mature⠀at⠀different⠀rates⠀rather⠀than⠀along⠀one⠀rising⠀line.\n\nGive⠀this⠀narrator⠀the⠀habit⠀of⠀revising⠀their⠀own⠀account.⠀An⠀early⠀formulation⠀—⠀of⠀who⠀taught⠀what,⠀of⠀what⠀a⠀rank⠀entitles,⠀of⠀why⠀the⠀failure⠀happened⠀—⠀gets⠀restated⠀later⠀in⠀the⠀light⠀of⠀new⠀evidence,⠀and⠀the⠀restatement⠀can⠀expose⠀a⠀self-serving⠀version⠀in⠀the⠀very⠀act⠀of⠀explaining⠀it.⠀This⠀self-correction⠀is⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning,⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀through⠀the⠀narration⠀and⠀to⠀no⠀one⠀else⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀however⠀candid⠀the⠀voice.\n\nSet⠀the⠀definitional⠀contests⠀inside⠀concrete⠀relations.⠀A⠀senior⠀redefines⠀what⠀mastery⠀consists⠀in,⠀and⠀the⠀redefinition⠀changes⠀who⠀may⠀sit⠀where⠀and⠀who⠀must⠀requalify;⠀a⠀colleague⠀objects⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀account⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀method,⠀with⠀consequences⠀for⠀shared⠀work;⠀a⠀reworded⠀regulation⠀reclassifies⠀a⠀qualification⠀someone⠀trained⠀years⠀for.⠀The⠀character⠀who⠀wins⠀such⠀an⠀exchange⠀has⠀not⠀thereby⠀gained⠀skill,⠀and⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀loses⠀face⠀may⠀remain⠀the⠀better⠀practitioner;⠀keep⠀that⠀distinction⠀in⠀view.\n\nGround⠀every⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀particular⠀setting⠀the⠀story⠀supplies.⠀Where⠀a⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish⠀context⠀exists,⠀keep⠀its⠀institutions,⠀work⠀rhythms,⠀and⠀family⠀obligations⠀distinct;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀bleakness⠀the⠀setting⠀has⠀not⠀established.⠀Recovery,⠀ordinary⠀work,⠀and⠀relationships⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life⠀alongside⠀capability.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀perspective,⠀and⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀scene⠀close⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task,⠀a⠀pending⠀evaluation,⠀or⠀a⠀rearranged⠀relationship⠀without⠀owing⠀a⠀completed⠀test⠀or⠀a⠀settled⠀confrontation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalataw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nFormat⠀for⠀the⠀screen:⠀a⠀scene⠀heading⠀whenever⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀concise⠀readable⠀action⠀lines,⠀dialogue⠀under⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Make⠀improvement⠀visible⠀and⠀audible⠀rather⠀than⠀declared.⠀Stage⠀the⠀before-and-after:⠀a⠀drill⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀fumbles⠀early⠀on,⠀then⠀a⠀later⠀session⠀where⠀the⠀same⠀movement⠀lands⠀cleaner,⠀with⠀intervening⠀work⠀—⠀compressed⠀by⠀a⠀cut,⠀implied⠀by⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀or⠀shown⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀corrective⠀beat⠀—⠀earning⠀the⠀difference.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀a⠀rank⠀or⠀level⠀unless⠀the⠀action⠀or⠀dialogue⠀demonstrates⠀what⠀it⠀buys.\n\nPut⠀the⠀language⠀contests⠀in⠀dialogue⠀blocks,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀exchange⠀alter⠀the⠀scene's⠀physical⠀situation.⠀A⠀master⠀rejects⠀a⠀student's⠀definition⠀of⠀a⠀technique,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀line⠀shows⠀the⠀retry⠀with⠀adjusted⠀form;⠀a⠀rival⠀disputes⠀a⠀claim⠀about⠀new⠀capability⠀and⠀demands⠀a⠀demonstration⠀the⠀scene⠀must⠀then⠀stage⠀or⠀visibly⠀defer;⠀a⠀clerk⠀amends⠀the⠀wording⠀of⠀a⠀license⠀so⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀was⠀open⠀stays⠀shut.⠀Give⠀each⠀speaker⠀a⠀distinct⠀verbal⠀fingerprint⠀tied⠀to⠀their⠀stake⠀—⠀clipped⠀precision,⠀circumstantial⠀hedging,⠀bureaucratic⠀exactness⠀—⠀instead⠀of⠀uniform⠀aphorism.\n\nUse⠀transitions⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.⠀A⠀cut⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀work⠀between⠀failure⠀and⠀success;⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀can⠀hold⠀practice⠀in⠀another⠀room;⠀voice-over,⠀when⠀used,⠀is⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀carrying⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience,⠀never⠀information⠀the⠀cast⠀possesses.⠀Required⠀interiority⠀lives⠀in⠀that⠀attributed⠀material,⠀not⠀in⠀dialogue⠀the⠀others⠀can⠀hear.⠀Keep⠀the⠀page⠀free⠀of⠀camera⠀choreography.\n\nTrack⠀progression⠀across⠀scenes:⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀applies⠀the⠀skill⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀context⠀or⠀exposes⠀a⠀limitation⠀an⠀earlier⠀one⠀established;⠀strengths⠀consolidate⠀while⠀weaknesses⠀resist,⠀unevenly.⠀Winning⠀an⠀argument⠀in⠀one⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀upgrade⠀the⠀body,⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀who⠀lost⠀it⠀can⠀outperform⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀line.⠀Stop⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀business⠀stops⠀—⠀mid-attempt,⠀awaiting⠀a⠀verdict,⠀after⠀a⠀redefinition⠀rearranges⠀who⠀stands⠀where⠀—⠀owing⠀no⠀completed⠀test⠀and⠀no⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalatax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script:⠀named⠀speakers,⠀entrances⠀and⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀handled⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀business⠀an⠀audience⠀could⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀house.⠀Let⠀the⠀progression⠀thread⠀live⠀in⠀what⠀staging⠀can⠀show⠀—⠀a⠀character⠀carries⠀without⠀strain⠀the⠀equipment⠀an⠀earlier⠀scene⠀established⠀as⠀too⠀heavy,⠀executes⠀a⠀sequence⠀with⠀new⠀precision,⠀or⠀stalls⠀at⠀the⠀exact⠀point⠀where⠀they⠀have⠀always⠀stalled⠀—⠀so⠀growth⠀reads⠀through⠀bodies⠀and⠀props⠀rather⠀than⠀announced⠀levels.\n\nLet⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀interrogate⠀each⠀other.⠀A⠀master's⠀objection⠀to⠀a⠀student's⠀definition⠀of⠀a⠀technique⠀should⠀redirect⠀the⠀business:⠀the⠀student⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀movement⠀with⠀changed⠀intent,⠀or⠀takes⠀up⠀the⠀practice⠀piece⠀to⠀test⠀the⠀words⠀against⠀the⠀body.⠀A⠀rival⠀who⠀contradicts⠀a⠀claim⠀about⠀new⠀capability⠀can⠀step⠀into⠀the⠀space⠀and⠀demand⠀a⠀demonstration;⠀an⠀official⠀who⠀rewords⠀a⠀qualification⠀can⠀hand⠀over⠀a⠀token⠀or⠀visibly⠀withhold⠀one.⠀Give⠀each⠀speaker⠀distinct⠀verbal⠀habits⠀tied⠀to⠀their⠀stake⠀—⠀a⠀challenger's⠀needling,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀careful⠀qualifications,⠀a⠀clerk's⠀exactness⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀interchangeable⠀aphorism.\n\nTreat⠀monologue⠀and⠀aside⠀as⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀in⠀the⠀public⠀scene,⠀never⠀as⠀the⠀storage⠀place⠀for⠀thought.⠀Required⠀private⠀experience⠀stays⠀in⠀its⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀form⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀unheard⠀by⠀the⠀cast;⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀a⠀conclusion⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀watched⠀it⠀form,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀need⠀not⠀conceal⠀what⠀the⠀contract⠀already⠀permits⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀hold.\n\nKeep⠀advancement⠀uneven⠀and⠀testable⠀across⠀scenes:⠀one⠀skill⠀consolidates⠀while⠀another⠀gives⠀way⠀under⠀pressure,⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀who⠀loses⠀a⠀verbal⠀exchange⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀visibly⠀the⠀stronger⠀practitioner⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀physical⠀action.⠀Add⠀no⠀camera⠀language.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀stop⠀where⠀its⠀action⠀stops⠀—⠀an⠀attempt⠀in⠀progress,⠀a⠀verdict⠀pending,⠀a⠀relationship⠀rearranged⠀by⠀a⠀redefinition⠀—⠀without⠀a⠀compulsory⠀test⠀passed⠀or⠀a⠀theatrical⠀revelation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
