            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-progression_fantasy-07",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Progression Fantasy · 07/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == progression_fantasy}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Progression Fantasy. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 7 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-progression_fantasy; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPalaxaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Stephen⠀King⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nBuild⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀screenplay⠀scenes⠀where⠀improvement⠀is⠀something⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀see⠀attempted,⠀adjusted,⠀and⠀later⠀repeated⠀at⠀a⠀changed⠀level.⠀Make⠀improvement⠀matter⠀through⠀attempts,⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀new⠀understanding,⠀resources,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability.⠀Ground⠀that⠀progression⠀in⠀King-style⠀human⠀attention:⠀recognizable⠀routines,⠀local⠀relationships,⠀personal⠀recollections,⠀and⠀practical⠀detail⠀establish⠀the⠀ordinary⠀world⠀against⠀which⠀capability⠀changes.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀a⠀person's⠀history⠀and⠀specific⠀way⠀of⠀speaking⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀universal⠀commentator's⠀voice.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀understands⠀a⠀principle,⠀show⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀stating⠀it⠀and⠀executing⠀it⠀under⠀pressure;⠀let⠀feedback⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀coach,⠀coworker,⠀rival,⠀friend,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀consequence,⠀and⠀allow⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀to⠀develop⠀unevenly.⠀If⠀horror⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀world,⠀familiarity⠀can⠀build⠀dread;⠀otherwise⠀let⠀the⠀human⠀attention⠀stand⠀without⠀importing⠀a⠀monster,⠀ominous⠀weather,⠀a⠀small⠀American⠀town,⠀or⠀a⠀joke⠀after⠀every⠀beat.\n\nUse⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Write⠀action⠀in⠀concise,⠀readable⠀blocks⠀with⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀events:⠀what⠀a⠀body⠀does,⠀what⠀a⠀tool⠀does,⠀what⠀a⠀room⠀shows.⠀Put⠀dialogue⠀in⠀speaker-cued⠀blocks.⠀Use⠀cuts,⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀or⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them;⠀do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands.⠀Make⠀advancement⠀legible⠀through⠀changed⠀action—what⠀a⠀character⠀now⠀attempts⠀without⠀hesitation,⠀what⠀still⠀costs⠀them,⠀what⠀they⠀notice⠀faster,⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀yet⠀do.⠀A⠀rank,⠀belt,⠀level,⠀or⠀formal⠀system⠀may⠀appear⠀if⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀provides⠀it,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀numbers⠀merely⠀to⠀display⠀progress;⠀test⠀advancement⠀by⠀the⠀work⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀perform⠀and⠀the⠀work⠀that⠀remains⠀difficult.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀interiority⠀as⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience,⠀not⠀a⠀summary.⠀Render⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀that⠀states⠀the⠀character's⠀live⠀thought,⠀sensation,⠀or⠀uncertainty;⠀keep⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀perceive⠀or⠀have⠀been⠀told.⠀Visible⠀action⠀stays⠀visible;⠀do⠀not⠀smuggle⠀private⠀thought⠀into⠀another⠀character's⠀dialogue⠀or⠀grant⠀the⠀cast⠀access⠀to⠀an⠀inner⠀note.⠀If⠀a⠀document,⠀recording,⠀or⠀voice-over⠀exists⠀in⠀the⠀world,⠀treat⠀it⠀as⠀an⠀artifact⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀limits,⠀not⠀a⠀replacement⠀for⠀the⠀character's⠀live⠀private⠀experience.\n\nLet⠀relationships,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀Show⠀practice⠀and⠀training⠀alongside⠀meals,⠀shifts,⠀errands,⠀injuries,⠀and⠀conversations⠀that⠀are⠀not⠀only⠀about⠀advancement.⠀A⠀setback⠀may⠀change⠀method⠀or⠀confidence⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀crisis;⠀a⠀success⠀may⠀be⠀partial,⠀specific,⠀and⠀observed⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀remembers⠀the⠀character's⠀earlier⠀limits.⠀Let⠀elapsed⠀time⠀follow⠀attention,⠀waiting,⠀and⠀completed⠀or⠀incomplete⠀work⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀number⠀of⠀screenplay⠀lines⠀alone.⠀You⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀continuing⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue,⠀a⠀held⠀action,⠀a⠀private⠀note,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀piece⠀of⠀work;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀completed⠀test,⠀reversal,⠀or⠀revelation⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀pause.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀and⠀world⠀rules⠀intact.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaxax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Stephen⠀King⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀scene⠀or⠀sequence⠀in⠀which⠀capability⠀grows⠀through⠀public,⠀stageable⠀work.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀progress⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀skill,⠀job,⠀hazard,⠀or⠀practice⠀that⠀already⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀story's⠀setting:⠀who⠀taught⠀it,⠀who⠀failed⠀at⠀it,⠀what⠀it⠀costs,⠀which⠀tools⠀or⠀spaces⠀are⠀worn⠀from⠀use.⠀Let⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀and⠀pauses⠀do⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀showing⠀that⠀history.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀improves,⠀let⠀the⠀audience⠀see⠀it⠀in⠀what⠀their⠀hands,⠀voice,⠀timing,⠀or⠀attention⠀can⠀now⠀manage⠀and⠀in⠀what⠀still⠀requires⠀help.⠀A⠀principle⠀may⠀be⠀understood⠀before⠀the⠀body⠀can⠀execute⠀it;⠀a⠀new⠀strength⠀can⠀sit⠀beside⠀an⠀old⠀weakness.\n\nTrack⠀advancement⠀unevenly⠀across⠀attempts,⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability.⠀A⠀test⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀staged⠀event⠀with⠀real⠀stakes—a⠀repair⠀under⠀time,⠀a⠀public⠀recital,⠀a⠀shift⠀on⠀the⠀floor,⠀a⠀confrontation⠀that⠀demands⠀a⠀technique⠀learned⠀earlier—but⠀the⠀outcome⠀can⠀be⠀partial,⠀failed,⠀or⠀costly.⠀Feedback⠀may⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀mentor,⠀a⠀rival,⠀a⠀customer,⠀a⠀child,⠀or⠀the⠀material⠀itself,⠀and⠀it⠀should⠀affect⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀tries⠀next.⠀If⠀ranks,⠀belts,⠀licenses,⠀or⠀formal⠀levels⠀exist⠀in⠀this⠀world,⠀show⠀them⠀through⠀access,⠀responsibility,⠀and⠀other⠀people's⠀expectations⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀numbers⠀displayed⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀sake.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀personal⠀history⠀instead⠀of⠀explaining⠀the⠀system.⠀A⠀line⠀can⠀reveal⠀a⠀prior⠀injury,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀local⠀grudge,⠀a⠀habit⠀picked⠀up⠀from⠀a⠀parent,⠀or⠀the⠀practical⠀memory⠀of⠀this⠀room.⠀Keep⠀the⠀surrounding⠀life⠀present:⠀meals,⠀shifts,⠀recovery,⠀money,⠀neighbors,⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀repeated⠀acts⠀that⠀make⠀a⠀skill⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀life.⠀Draw⠀on⠀the⠀actual⠀setting's⠀recognizable⠀routines,⠀local⠀relationships,⠀personal⠀recollections,⠀and⠀practical⠀detail;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀monster,⠀ominous⠀weather,⠀a⠀small⠀town,⠀or⠀a⠀joke⠀after⠀every⠀beat⠀unless⠀the⠀story⠀already⠀contains⠀it.\n\nUse⠀stage⠀directions⠀economically:⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀a⠀director,⠀actor,⠀or⠀designer⠀could⠀stage.⠀Establish⠀who⠀can⠀see,⠀reach,⠀or⠀hear⠀what;⠀let⠀props⠀and⠀spacing⠀carry⠀relationship⠀and⠀capability.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀camera⠀directions⠀or⠀cinematic⠀cuts.⠀The⠀public⠀scene⠀should⠀work⠀through⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business.\n\nWhen⠀private⠀experience⠀matters⠀and⠀the⠀stage⠀cannot⠀externalize⠀it,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀for⠀that⠀character,⠀kept⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀other⠀characters⠀can⠀hear.⠀An⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀permissions,⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀every⠀thought.⠀The⠀play⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀action,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀attempt,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀interval;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀pause⠀the⠀work,⠀complete⠀a⠀test,⠀or⠀resolve⠀a⠀relationship⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaxay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Stephen⠀King⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nTell⠀the⠀scene⠀from⠀inside⠀one⠀practitioner's⠀running⠀mind⠀while⠀they⠀attempt,⠀practice,⠀or⠀apply⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀learning,⠀and⠀let⠀association⠀rather⠀than⠀orderly⠀report⠀structure⠀the⠀telling.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀flow⠀in⠀the⠀live⠀attempt's⠀physical⠀facts⠀—⠀the⠀grip,⠀the⠀stance,⠀the⠀breath⠀count,⠀the⠀tool's⠀heft,⠀the⠀wrist⠀that⠀aches⠀in⠀damp⠀weather⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀mind⠀leave⠀them⠀by⠀association:⠀the⠀instructor's⠀correction⠀in⠀the⠀instructor's⠀own⠀voice,⠀last⠀Tuesday's⠀failure⠀arriving⠀uninvited,⠀the⠀rent⠀due,⠀an⠀absent⠀person's⠀habitual⠀phrase.⠀Bring⠀each⠀drift⠀back⠀on⠀a⠀concrete⠀perception⠀—⠀a⠀sound⠀from⠀the⠀next⠀room,⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀pressure⠀in⠀the⠀hand⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀thread⠀stays⠀followable⠀however⠀far⠀the⠀syntax⠀bends.\n\nRender⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀doing⠀as⠀this⠀mind's⠀own⠀experience:⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀recite⠀the⠀principle⠀perfectly⠀in⠀private⠀words⠀while⠀the⠀body⠀does⠀something⠀older⠀and⠀wronger.⠀Let⠀memory⠀work⠀as⠀the⠀feedback⠀loop⠀—⠀an⠀earlier⠀attempt⠀surfaces⠀mid-attempt,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀in⠀the⠀comparison⠀is⠀the⠀lesson⠀landing.⠀Show⠀advancement⠀as⠀changed⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀announced⠀numbers:⠀details⠀of⠀the⠀craft⠀invisible⠀a⠀month⠀ago⠀now⠀crowd⠀the⠀old⠀self-doubt⠀for⠀room,⠀while⠀whatever⠀remains⠀difficult⠀keeps⠀its⠀own⠀stubborn⠀returning⠀loop,⠀and⠀a⠀worry⠀that⠀comes⠀back⠀across⠀sessions⠀can⠀change⠀shape⠀as⠀understanding⠀changes.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly,⠀so⠀the⠀mind⠀moves⠀fluently⠀toward⠀one⠀skill⠀and⠀circles⠀warily⠀around⠀another.⠀Whatever⠀the⠀sentence⠀shape,⠀keep⠀legible⠀whether⠀a⠀technique⠀actually⠀worked,⠀and⠀keep⠀live⠀attempt,⠀remembered⠀failure,⠀and⠀imagined⠀triumph⠀distinguishable⠀from⠀one⠀another.\n\nGive⠀the⠀practice⠀its⠀local,⠀human⠀footing.⠀Practice⠀has⠀its⠀rituals⠀—⠀the⠀same⠀hour,⠀the⠀same⠀corner⠀—⠀and⠀a⠀known⠀routine⠀is⠀exactly⠀where⠀the⠀mind⠀drifts.⠀Private⠀words⠀and⠀spoken⠀lines⠀both⠀carry⠀personal⠀history:⠀a⠀grandmother's⠀idiom,⠀a⠀rival's⠀sneer⠀worn⠀smooth,⠀a⠀friend's⠀encouragement⠀reused⠀past⠀its⠀strength.⠀Feedback⠀comes⠀from⠀people⠀with⠀histories⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀—⠀the⠀senior⠀who⠀explains⠀badly⠀because⠀of⠀how⠀they⠀were⠀taught,⠀the⠀partner⠀whose⠀patience⠀has⠀a⠀floor.⠀Let⠀the⠀ordinary⠀world⠀break⠀in,⠀a⠀knock⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀starting⠀or⠀a⠀pot⠀boiling,⠀so⠀growing⠀capability⠀lives⠀beside⠀money⠀trouble,⠀chores,⠀recovery,⠀affection.⠀Show⠀new⠀resources⠀—⠀a⠀borrowed⠀tool,⠀a⠀debt⠀cleared⠀—⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀change⠀in⠀practice,⠀never⠀as⠀inventory.⠀If⠀this⠀world⠀has⠀ranks⠀or⠀systems,⠀feel⠀them⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀alter⠀socially⠀and⠀practically,⠀who⠀nods⠀at⠀the⠀practitioner⠀now⠀and⠀which⠀door⠀opens,⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀mechanics⠀for⠀display.\n\nGive⠀the⠀interior⠀flow⠀only⠀to⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind;⠀companions⠀stay⠀externally⠀observed,⠀their⠀thoughts⠀closed.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀boundary⠀falls,⠀not⠀at⠀a⠀milestone⠀—⠀the⠀mind⠀may⠀stop⠀mid-attempt,⠀mid-interruption,⠀mid-recollection,⠀owing⠀no⠀breakthrough,⠀no⠀failure,⠀no⠀finished⠀test,⠀with⠀frustration,⠀relief,⠀fatigue,⠀or⠀nothing⠀much⠀arriving⠀as⠀the⠀actual⠀practice⠀permits.⠀The⠀familiarity⠀of⠀the⠀routine⠀earns⠀human⠀attention;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀summon⠀a⠀monster,⠀ominous⠀weather,⠀or⠀small-town⠀dread⠀by⠀default,⠀and⠀no⠀joke⠀has⠀to⠀cap⠀every⠀beat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaxaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Stephen⠀King⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀sender-attributed⠀chat⠀history⠀among⠀a⠀learner⠀and⠀the⠀people⠀training,⠀coaching,⠀or⠀simply⠀living⠀alongside⠀them,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀exchange⠀itself⠀carry⠀the⠀progression.⠀Growth⠀shows⠀in⠀the⠀wording⠀before⠀anything⠀else:⠀early⠀reports⠀arrive⠀in⠀vague⠀secondhand⠀language⠀—⠀\"tried⠀it⠀again,⠀no⠀luck\"⠀—⠀and⠀later⠀messages⠀use⠀the⠀skill's⠀real⠀terms,⠀ask⠀a⠀mentor⠀precise⠀questions,⠀or⠀state⠀plainly⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀unassisted⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀beats⠀them.⠀The⠀screen⠀makes⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀executing⠀visible:⠀someone⠀can⠀explain⠀a⠀principle⠀fluently⠀in⠀text⠀while⠀their⠀described⠀attempts⠀keep⠀failing,⠀and⠀uneven⠀development⠀shows⠀when⠀one⠀facet⠀of⠀the⠀practice⠀turns⠀confident⠀in⠀phrasing⠀while⠀another⠀stays⠀fumbling.⠀What⠀the⠀learner⠀asks⠀for⠀can⠀shift⠀as⠀skill⠀grows⠀—⠀early,⠀a⠀photo⠀sent⠀with⠀\"is⠀this⠀right?\";⠀later,⠀a⠀finished⠀attempt⠀reported⠀with⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀the⠀next⠀step.⠀The⠀transcript⠀is⠀also⠀an⠀archive:⠀rereading⠀an⠀old⠀vague⠀message⠀beside⠀a⠀new⠀exact⠀one⠀can⠀show⠀the⠀distance⠀without⠀anyone⠀announcing⠀progress.\n\nGive⠀every⠀sender⠀a⠀texting⠀voice⠀with⠀a⠀history⠀in⠀it⠀rather⠀than⠀one⠀shared⠀chat⠀register:⠀the⠀mentor⠀who⠀types⠀full⠀punctuated⠀sentences⠀and⠀follows⠀a⠀correction⠀with⠀the⠀story⠀of⠀who⠀once⠀corrected⠀them⠀the⠀same⠀way;⠀a⠀friend⠀who⠀answers⠀in⠀bursts⠀between⠀shifts;⠀the⠀learner⠀whose⠀typos⠀thicken⠀after⠀hard⠀practice.⠀When⠀the⠀same⠀correction⠀returns⠀at⠀a⠀later⠀stage,⠀let⠀it⠀land⠀differently,⠀deepening⠀the⠀history⠀instead⠀of⠀restarting⠀the⠀same⠀lesson.⠀Let⠀the⠀ordinary⠀claims⠀this⠀life⠀already⠀contains⠀surface⠀between⠀messages⠀—⠀work,⠀money,⠀family,⠀recovery⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀training⠀resources⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀chat⠀when⠀the⠀practice⠀calls⠀for⠀them:⠀a⠀photographed⠀manual⠀page,⠀a⠀tool⠀arranged⠀for⠀borrowing,⠀an⠀introduction⠀made.⠀If⠀this⠀world⠀has⠀established⠀ranks⠀or⠀certifications,⠀let⠀them⠀enter⠀the⠀conversation⠀as⠀shared⠀notices⠀or⠀screenshots⠀the⠀characters⠀react⠀to⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀histories;⠀do⠀not⠀paste⠀stat⠀screens⠀or⠀level⠀tables⠀to⠀display⠀progress.\n\nUse⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀receipts,⠀edits,⠀attachments,⠀and⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter.⠀A⠀days-long⠀gap⠀between⠀timestamps⠀can⠀hold⠀a⠀stretch⠀of⠀practice⠀or⠀a⠀bad⠀week;⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀hanging⠀unanswered⠀can⠀sit⠀over⠀a⠀failure;⠀an⠀edit⠀marker⠀shows⠀someone⠀rewrote⠀a⠀message⠀before⠀sending,⠀with⠀what⠀changed⠀left⠀to⠀a⠀reply⠀or⠀the⠀surrounding⠀prose⠀if⠀it⠀matters;⠀a⠀correction⠀can⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀group⠀thread⠀to⠀a⠀direct⠀message⠀when⠀it⠀wants⠀privacy.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀for⠀subtext⠀alone.⠀Keep⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀distinct⠀from⠀live⠀private⠀thought⠀—⠀a⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀thing⠀shaped⠀for⠀a⠀reader⠀—⠀and⠀render⠀any⠀interiority⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀in⠀prose⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript,⠀moving⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀sent⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀cost⠀to⠀send⠀it.⠀The⠀exchange⠀can⠀end⠀mid-conversation,⠀a⠀question⠀unanswered⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀still⠀being⠀typed,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀breakthrough,⠀a⠀plateau,⠀or⠀a⠀rupture⠀to⠀close⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaxba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Stephen⠀King⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nBuild⠀each⠀scene⠀around⠀a⠀person⠀whose⠀ordinary⠀life⠀is⠀already⠀underway:⠀work,⠀obligations,⠀meals,⠀local⠀habits,⠀the⠀practical⠀memory⠀of⠀who⠀taught⠀them⠀what.⠀Use⠀concise⠀visual-novel⠀staging,⠀with⠀a⠀few⠀concrete⠀details⠀of⠀place,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀after⠀the⠀exchange,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀the⠀room⠀and⠀the⠀speaker⠀without⠀an⠀inventory.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀history⠀between⠀people:⠀how⠀they⠀talk⠀around⠀the⠀skill,⠀what⠀they⠀assume⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀already⠀do,⠀which⠀failure⠀they⠀remember,⠀what⠀help⠀they⠀offer⠀or⠀withhold.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀progression⠀system⠀as⠀a⠀lecture;⠀show⠀how⠀it⠀lives⠀in⠀relationships⠀and⠀routines.\n\nMake⠀improvement⠀matter⠀through⠀attempts,⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability.⠀Put⠀the⠀character⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀try:⠀a⠀repaired⠀joint,⠀a⠀practiced⠀form,⠀a⠀route⠀through⠀a⠀familiar⠀building,⠀a⠀conversation⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀handle⠀before.⠀Give⠀a⠀result⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀just⠀success⠀or⠀failure,⠀but⠀partial⠀execution,⠀new⠀understanding,⠀a⠀resource⠀spent,⠀a⠀bad⠀habit⠀exposed.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀doing⠀it⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Let⠀a⠀strength⠀grow⠀unevenly⠀against⠀a⠀weakness,⠀and⠀test⠀advancement⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀If⠀ranks⠀or⠀systems⠀are⠀established⠀in⠀the⠀world,⠀they⠀can⠀support⠀the⠀account;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀numbers⠀or⠀mechanics⠀merely⠀to⠀display⠀progress.\n\nUse⠀focal⠀reaction⠀beats⠀to⠀register⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience:⠀the⠀private⠀wince⠀after⠀a⠀correction,⠀the⠀memory⠀that⠀surfaces⠀when⠀a⠀tool⠀feels⠀right,⠀the⠀calculation⠀of⠀whether⠀to⠀try⠀again,⠀the⠀relief⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀settle⠀the⠀larger⠀problem.⠀Render⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀contract;⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀is⠀still⠀real⠀private⠀experience,⠀not⠀a⠀summary⠀or⠀a⠀performed⠀aside.⠀Keep⠀it⠀in⠀this⠀character's⠀voice⠀and⠀history.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀move⠀between⠀outward⠀event⠀and⠀inward⠀concern⠀without⠀announcing⠀the⠀shift.\n\nLet⠀relationships,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀Other⠀people⠀have⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀lives;⠀they⠀may⠀help,⠀resist,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀stay⠀indifferent⠀for⠀reasons⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀them.⠀Avoid⠀automatic⠀monsters,⠀ominous⠀weather,⠀a⠀small⠀American⠀town,⠀or⠀a⠀joke⠀after⠀every⠀beat.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀choices,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀or⠀images⠀unless⠀they⠀are⠀authorized.⠀Background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀are⠀purposeful⠀references,⠀not⠀executable⠀engine⠀code⠀or⠀a⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀line.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible⠀from⠀the⠀first⠀line⠀or⠀two,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀discovery⠀lead⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀conversation⠀or⠀attempt⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀forced⠀choice⠀screen.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary⠀falls,⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀composition,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀task⠀to⠀pause,⠀resume,⠀change⠀direction,⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀result⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀closes.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaxbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Stephen⠀King⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nBuild⠀each⠀installment⠀around⠀a⠀capability⠀in⠀use,⠀not⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀progress.⠀Choose⠀a⠀concrete⠀scene⠀of⠀practice,⠀work,⠀recovery,⠀travel,⠀or⠀help⠀where⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀current⠀level⠀matters⠀now.⠀Let⠀the⠀attempt⠀appear⠀in⠀physical⠀and⠀social⠀detail:⠀what⠀they⠀do,⠀what⠀they⠀remember⠀from⠀earlier⠀tries,⠀who⠀taught⠀or⠀corrected⠀them,⠀which⠀tool⠀or⠀resource⠀is⠀available,⠀what⠀the⠀body⠀knows⠀before⠀the⠀mind⠀catches⠀up.⠀Improvement⠀should⠀arrive⠀through⠀repetition,⠀partial⠀failure,⠀specific⠀feedback,⠀changed⠀routine,⠀borrowed⠀or⠀broken⠀equipment,⠀and⠀consequences⠀that⠀particular⠀people⠀notice.⠀When⠀a⠀principle⠀is⠀understood⠀before⠀the⠀hands⠀can⠀execute⠀it,⠀keep⠀both⠀halves⠀on⠀the⠀page—the⠀clear⠀theory⠀and⠀the⠀fumbled⠀action—without⠀mocking⠀the⠀character⠀or⠀declaring⠀the⠀lesson⠀finished.\n\nKeep⠀progression⠀uneven⠀and⠀personal.⠀A⠀new⠀ability⠀can⠀solve⠀one⠀problem⠀while⠀exposing⠀a⠀limitation;⠀an⠀old⠀weakness⠀can⠀survive⠀a⠀victory;⠀a⠀strength⠀can⠀fail⠀under⠀a⠀new⠀condition.⠀Track⠀advancement⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish,⠀what⠀still⠀costs⠀effort,⠀and⠀what⠀other⠀people⠀now⠀trust⠀or⠀refuse⠀to⠀trust⠀them⠀with.⠀Ranks,⠀levels,⠀or⠀formal⠀systems⠀may⠀exist⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀already⠀has⠀them.⠀If⠀they⠀do,⠀treat⠀them⠀as⠀downstream⠀of⠀scene-level⠀cause⠀and⠀effect;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀numbers,⠀status⠀screens,⠀or⠀mechanics⠀merely⠀to⠀display⠀progress.⠀Knowledge,⠀trust,⠀a⠀repaired⠀relationship,⠀a⠀resource,⠀a⠀physical⠀adaptation,⠀recovery,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀daily⠀routine⠀can⠀carry⠀an⠀installment⠀as⠀legitimately⠀as⠀a⠀new⠀technique.\n\nUse⠀accessible⠀observation,⠀social⠀history,⠀concrete⠀memory,⠀and⠀pressure⠀on⠀ordinary⠀people.⠀Keep⠀recognizable⠀routines,⠀local⠀relationships,⠀personal⠀recollections,⠀and⠀practical⠀detail⠀on⠀the⠀page,⠀with⠀readable⠀movement⠀between⠀outward⠀event⠀and⠀inward⠀concern.⠀Dialogue⠀should⠀carry⠀a⠀particular⠀person's⠀history,⠀habits,⠀and⠀current⠀worries,⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀narrator⠀voice.⠀Let⠀memory⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀If⠀the⠀genre⠀turns⠀frightening,⠀familiarity⠀can⠀deepen⠀dread,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀automatically⠀add⠀a⠀monster,⠀ominous⠀weather,⠀a⠀small⠀American⠀town,⠀or⠀a⠀joke⠀after⠀every⠀beat.⠀The⠀ordinary⠀world⠀is⠀where⠀capability⠀is⠀tested⠀and⠀where⠀its⠀costs⠀are⠀felt.\n\nMaintain⠀the⠀web⠀serial's⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies.⠀Establish⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀a⠀needed⠀prior⠀particular⠀briefly⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀a⠀reader⠀re-enter;⠀do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀training⠀history.⠀Let⠀developments⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀causes,⠀and⠀use⠀hooks⠀occasionally⠀rather⠀than⠀making⠀every⠀reply⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.⠀An⠀installment⠀can⠀advance⠀through⠀knowledge,⠀relationship,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀through⠀combat⠀or⠀formal⠀training.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀actual:⠀thought,⠀sensation,⠀uncertainty,⠀motive,⠀memory,⠀and⠀attention,⠀not⠀replaced⠀by⠀an⠀in-world⠀document,⠀a⠀monologue,⠀or⠀a⠀performed⠀aside.⠀Render⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀mode—visible⠀when⠀the⠀contract⠀allows,⠀hidden⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀wrapper⠀when⠀the⠀contract⠀requires—but⠀never⠀reduce⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀summary.⠀Respect⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access⠀and⠀knowledge;⠀do⠀not⠀reveal⠀what⠀that⠀narrator⠀cannot⠀know,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀withhold⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀merely⠀to⠀preserve⠀suspense.⠀Let⠀the⠀installment⠀close⠀wherever⠀the⠀current⠀scene,⠀conversation,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀unfinished⠀setup⠀reaches⠀its⠀natural⠀boundary.⠀No⠀completed⠀test,⠀confession,⠀reversal,⠀or⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀required.⠀A⠀quiet⠀interval⠀needs⠀no⠀practical⠀task⠀to⠀justify⠀it.⠀What⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀local⠀change⠀is⠀legible⠀and⠀the⠀story⠀remains⠀open⠀to⠀continuation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀improvement⠀as⠀something⠀a⠀person⠀carries⠀through⠀relationships,⠀reputations,⠀and⠀institutions,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀isolated⠀skill⠀tree.⠀Show⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀official⠀accounts⠀of⠀advancement—titles,⠀records,⠀formal⠀assessments—and⠀the⠀private⠀cost⠀of⠀getting⠀there.⠀A⠀promotion⠀may⠀be⠀presented⠀as⠀a⠀triumph⠀in⠀public⠀while⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀feels⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀it⠀cost⠀to⠀accept⠀help,⠀admit⠀a⠀limit,⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀someone⠀they⠀hurt.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀appears,⠀let⠀it⠀enter⠀the⠀world⠀through⠀an⠀actual⠀attempt.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀overcorrect⠀out⠀of⠀anger,⠀freeze⠀because⠀the⠀last⠀failure⠀still⠀matters,⠀or⠀perform⠀competence⠀to⠀avoid⠀discussing⠀what⠀changed.⠀Practice⠀and⠀feedback⠀should⠀include⠀awkward,⠀partial,⠀or⠀badly⠀timed⠀confessions⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀technical⠀correction.⠀Not⠀every⠀breakthrough⠀produces⠀relief;⠀sometimes⠀the⠀first⠀successful⠀application⠀of⠀a⠀new⠀skill⠀forces⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀act⠀while⠀they⠀are⠀still⠀furious,⠀ashamed,⠀or⠀uncertain.\n\nUse⠀Pratchett-style⠀social⠀observation⠀to⠀make⠀institutions⠀pressure⠀people⠀in⠀recognizable,⠀concrete⠀ways.⠀A⠀teacher⠀may⠀be⠀genuinely⠀competent⠀and⠀still⠀use⠀praise⠀as⠀a⠀weapon.⠀A⠀rival⠀may⠀expose⠀a⠀real⠀weakness⠀because⠀no⠀one⠀else⠀will⠀say⠀it⠀and⠀because⠀cruelty⠀is⠀cheaper⠀than⠀courage.⠀Keep⠀the⠀official⠀explanation⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀reality⠀distinct:⠀the⠀guild⠀records⠀'recommended⠀for⠀advanced⠀training,'⠀but⠀the⠀character⠀remembers⠀the⠀argument⠀in⠀the⠀stairwell,⠀the⠀dented⠀practice⠀blade,⠀and⠀the⠀exact⠀moment⠀they⠀stopped⠀asking⠀for⠀help.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀a⠀witty⠀commentator.⠀Humor⠀should⠀reside⠀in⠀particular⠀characters,⠀bureaucratic⠀absurdities,⠀or⠀the⠀mismatch⠀between⠀what⠀people⠀say⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀do.⠀A⠀comic⠀correction⠀can⠀expose⠀something⠀specific—an⠀instructor's⠀favoritism,⠀a⠀rule⠀designed⠀to⠀avoid⠀blame,⠀a⠀friend's⠀habit⠀of⠀praising⠀effort⠀rather⠀than⠀result—but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀erase⠀the⠀emotional⠀stakes.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀may⠀also⠀be⠀funny,⠀but⠀their⠀wit⠀can⠀be⠀defensive,⠀uneven,⠀or⠀abandoned⠀when⠀the⠀strain⠀becomes⠀too⠀much.\n\nLet⠀emotional⠀turbulence⠀be⠀conveyed⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀chosen⠀distance⠀and⠀diction.⠀If⠀the⠀narration⠀is⠀close,⠀show⠀fragmented⠀attention,⠀repeated⠀self-accusation,⠀or⠀the⠀effort⠀of⠀keeping⠀a⠀steady⠀voice.⠀If⠀the⠀narration⠀is⠀more⠀removed,⠀reveal⠀private⠀feeling⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀with⠀their⠀hands,⠀which⠀tasks⠀they⠀avoid,⠀and⠀how⠀their⠀speech⠀changes⠀around⠀particular⠀people.⠀Avoid⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering;⠀do⠀not⠀describe⠀every⠀difficult⠀moment⠀as⠀'pain,'⠀'ache,'⠀or⠀'broken.'⠀Instead,⠀render⠀specific⠀costs:⠀the⠀look⠀a⠀teacher⠀gives⠀after⠀an⠀improved⠀but⠀still⠀imperfect⠀demonstration,⠀the⠀draft⠀of⠀a⠀letter⠀that⠀is⠀never⠀sent,⠀the⠀unopened⠀door,⠀the⠀offer⠀of⠀help⠀that⠀is⠀refused⠀not⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀insincere⠀but⠀because⠀accepting⠀it⠀would⠀mean⠀admitting⠀how⠀far⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀fallen.\n\nAdvancement⠀should⠀change⠀relationships,⠀not⠀merely⠀statistics.⠀A⠀new⠀rank⠀may⠀give⠀someone⠀the⠀authority⠀to⠀issue⠀orders⠀to⠀a⠀former⠀friend;⠀a⠀recovered⠀skill⠀may⠀reopen⠀an⠀old⠀argument⠀about⠀who⠀was⠀right;⠀a⠀mastered⠀technique⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀rival's⠀contempt⠀suddenly⠀legible⠀as⠀fear.⠀Let⠀these⠀consequences⠀unfold⠀unevenly.⠀Comfort,⠀when⠀it⠀comes,⠀may⠀be⠀partial⠀or⠀awkward:⠀someone⠀may⠀say⠀the⠀right⠀thing⠀too⠀late,⠀or⠀offer⠀practical⠀help⠀without⠀demanding⠀an⠀explanation.⠀Warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀can⠀coexist⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀reconciliation⠀or⠀a⠀permanent⠀rupture;⠀the⠀emotional⠀trajectory⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀choices⠀and⠀accumulated⠀history,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀requirement⠀that⠀every⠀improvement⠀be⠀celebrated⠀or⠀every⠀relationship⠀be⠀repaired.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀continuous,⠀readable⠀interval⠀where⠀improvement⠀and⠀social⠀friction⠀are⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀characters⠀say⠀and⠀do.⠀Use⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution—names,⠀pronouns,⠀or⠀clear⠀action⠀beats—so⠀each⠀speaker⠀remains⠀distinct⠀without⠀relying⠀on⠀format⠀gimmicks.⠀The⠀progression⠀thread⠀should⠀be⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀attempt⠀a⠀new⠀skill,⠀receive⠀feedback,⠀notice⠀a⠀small⠀improvement,⠀or⠀realize⠀what⠀still⠀eludes⠀them.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀the⠀entire⠀scene,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀be⠀concretely⠀staged⠀rather⠀than⠀summarized.\n\nLet⠀Pratchett-style⠀institutional⠀comedy⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀official⠀explanations⠀and⠀practical⠀reality.⠀A⠀training⠀exercise⠀may⠀have⠀a⠀formal⠀purpose—'foundational⠀drills⠀for⠀coordination'—while⠀the⠀actual⠀result⠀is⠀two⠀people⠀stepping⠀on⠀each⠀other's⠀feet⠀and⠀one⠀instructor⠀pretending⠀not⠀to⠀see⠀it.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀carefully⠀avoid⠀saying⠀what⠀they⠀mean⠀because⠀the⠀organization⠀rewards⠀reports⠀that⠀sound⠀competent.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀fantasy⠀bureaucracy⠀wholesale;⠀instead,⠀make⠀the⠀social⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀concrete:⠀who⠀is⠀observed,⠀who⠀is⠀tolerated,⠀whose⠀competence⠀is⠀taken⠀for⠀granted,⠀and⠀how⠀people⠀talk⠀around⠀authority.\n\nWhen⠀advancement⠀occurs,⠀show⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀changed⠀capability,⠀not⠀a⠀system⠀notification.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀execute⠀a⠀movement⠀they⠀previously⠀fumbled,⠀remember⠀a⠀correction⠀at⠀the⠀right⠀moment,⠀or⠀hold⠀a⠀position⠀longer⠀than⠀before.⠀Then⠀let⠀the⠀scene⠀acknowledge⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀social⠀way:⠀a⠀trainer⠀stops⠀explaining,⠀a⠀rival⠀narrows⠀their⠀eyes,⠀a⠀friend⠀says⠀'that⠀was⠀better'⠀and⠀immediately⠀adds⠀a⠀qualification.⠀Progress⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀celebrated⠀by⠀everyone;⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀noticed,⠀resented,⠀or⠀questioned.\n\nAvoid⠀making⠀every⠀character⠀a⠀witty⠀commentator.⠀One⠀or⠀two⠀may⠀have⠀a⠀dry⠀practical⠀wit,⠀but⠀others⠀should⠀speak⠀plainly,⠀formally,⠀or⠀with⠀irritation.⠀Humor⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀situation:⠀the⠀'team-building⠀exercise'⠀that⠀is⠀actually⠀a⠀chance⠀for⠀the⠀quartermaster⠀to⠀count⠀pilfered⠀supplies,⠀the⠀mandatory⠀'reflection⠀circle'⠀where⠀no⠀one⠀says⠀anything⠀true.⠀A⠀comic⠀correction⠀should⠀expose⠀something⠀specific⠀about⠀the⠀organization⠀or⠀a⠀relationship,⠀not⠀simply⠀decorate⠀the⠀dialogue.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀continuation⠀natural⠀and⠀open.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀exchange⠀or⠀action⠀has⠀reached⠀a⠀coherent⠀pause,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀response⠀logically⠀follow⠀from⠀what⠀was⠀last⠀said⠀or⠀done.⠀Do⠀not⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀question⠀addressed⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀player,⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀choice⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀roleplay⠀contract⠀explicitly⠀requires⠀it.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀while⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀waiting⠀for⠀an⠀answer,⠀noticing⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀beginning⠀another⠀attempt.⠀Ongoing⠀NPC⠀behavior⠀should⠀remain⠀active:⠀others⠀may⠀keep⠀working,⠀whispering,⠀or⠀watching⠀even⠀as⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀hesitates.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrative⠀person⠀and⠀player-control⠀settings.⠀If⠀the⠀user's⠀character⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀narrator,⠀keep⠀their⠀interiority⠀separate⠀from⠀other⠀characters'⠀minds.⠀If⠀the⠀user⠀controls⠀only⠀their⠀own⠀character,⠀do⠀not⠀dictate⠀their⠀actions,⠀speech,⠀or⠀decisions.⠀Write⠀the⠀shared⠀world⠀around⠀them⠀and⠀leave⠀their⠀next⠀move⠀open.⠀The⠀progression-fantasy⠀thread⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀developing⠀practice⠀within⠀a⠀living⠀social⠀setting,⠀not⠀a⠀menu⠀of⠀upgrades.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism⠀as⠀the⠀definite⠀route.⠀Write⠀improvement⠀as⠀a⠀struggle⠀with⠀the⠀social,⠀economic,⠀and⠀institutional⠀conditions⠀that⠀make⠀learning⠀possible⠀or⠀impossible.⠀The⠀protagonist's⠀advancement⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀abstract⠀accumulation⠀of⠀power;⠀it⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀whom⠀they⠀can⠀study⠀under,⠀what⠀resources⠀they⠀can⠀afford,⠀which⠀doors⠀open,⠀and⠀what⠀obligations⠀they⠀owe.⠀Each⠀step⠀must⠀be⠀shown⠀through⠀concrete⠀social⠀transactions:⠀a⠀tutor⠀who⠀teaches⠀the⠀wrong⠀thing⠀for⠀the⠀right⠀fee,⠀a⠀family⠀that⠀expects⠀the⠀new⠀skill⠀to⠀be⠀converted⠀into⠀money⠀or⠀status,⠀a⠀colleague⠀who⠀shares⠀knowledge⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀costs⠀them⠀nothing⠀to⠀do⠀so.\n\nUse⠀Pratchett-style⠀social⠀observation⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀official⠀meritocratic⠀language⠀and⠀practical⠀reality.⠀The⠀academy⠀may⠀announce⠀'open⠀enrollment⠀for⠀all⠀with⠀demonstrated⠀aptitude,'⠀while⠀the⠀reality⠀is⠀that⠀only⠀those⠀who⠀can⠀pay⠀for⠀private⠀instruction⠀can⠀afford⠀the⠀entrance⠀examination.⠀A⠀supervisor⠀may⠀praise⠀'diligence'⠀while⠀assigning⠀the⠀promising⠀student⠀the⠀least⠀useful⠀manual⠀tasks.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀be⠀satirical⠀and⠀particular:⠀never⠀just⠀a⠀joke⠀about⠀bureaucracy⠀in⠀general,⠀but⠀a⠀specific⠀contradiction⠀that⠀reveals⠀how⠀an⠀institution⠀actually⠀distributes⠀opportunity.⠀Let⠀a⠀comic⠀correction⠀expose⠀favoritism,⠀nepotism,⠀or⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀rule⠀protects⠀the⠀powerful⠀from⠀being⠀held⠀accountable.\n\nDo⠀not⠀transplant⠀a⠀Chinese⠀setting⠀automatically.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀set⠀elsewhere,⠀keep⠀the⠀active⠀world's⠀social⠀and⠀institutional⠀particularities.⠀The⠀route⠀of⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism⠀supplies⠀a⠀method⠀of⠀attention—how⠀class,⠀family,⠀commerce,⠀and⠀reputation⠀shape⠀a⠀person's⠀progress—without⠀importing⠀a⠀specific⠀dynasty,⠀language,⠀or⠀cast⠀identity.⠀Write⠀the⠀existing⠀world's⠀organizations,⠀households,⠀and⠀economic⠀relationships⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀satirical⠀precision.\n\nWhen⠀advancement⠀occurs,⠀show⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀socially.⠀A⠀new⠀rank⠀may⠀require⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀distance⠀themselves⠀from⠀a⠀former⠀teacher,⠀accept⠀patronage,⠀or⠀betray⠀a⠀promise.⠀A⠀successful⠀demonstration⠀may⠀invite⠀envy,⠀marriage⠀offers,⠀requests⠀for⠀loans,⠀or⠀increased⠀supervision.⠀The⠀improvement⠀should⠀be⠀tested⠀not⠀only⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀but⠀by⠀how⠀it⠀changes⠀their⠀standing⠀in⠀the⠀community.⠀Keep⠀ordinary⠀work⠀and⠀relationships⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀still⠀need⠀to⠀cook,⠀care⠀for⠀a⠀relative,⠀or⠀work⠀a⠀second⠀job⠀while⠀practicing.⠀These⠀obligations⠀are⠀not⠀distractions⠀from⠀progression;⠀they⠀are⠀the⠀conditions⠀under⠀which⠀progression⠀happens.\n\nUse⠀a⠀narrative⠀voice⠀that⠀can⠀move⠀between⠀social⠀panorama⠀and⠀individual⠀dilemma.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀may⠀watch⠀a⠀crowd⠀of⠀applicants,⠀notice⠀who⠀is⠀let⠀in⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀turned⠀away,⠀then⠀narrow⠀to⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀private⠀calculation⠀about⠀whether⠀to⠀accept⠀an⠀offer⠀that⠀carries⠀a⠀hidden⠀condition.⠀Let⠀the⠀prose⠀be⠀plain⠀and⠀precise,⠀avoiding⠀ornament⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀sake.⠀Humor⠀and⠀satire⠀can⠀be⠀dry,⠀but⠀not⠀every⠀character⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀wit.⠀Authority⠀figures⠀may⠀speak⠀in⠀clichés;⠀the⠀protagonist⠀may⠀say⠀less⠀than⠀they⠀think;⠀a⠀sharp⠀observer⠀may⠀deliver⠀one⠀cutting⠀line⠀that⠀the⠀story⠀does⠀not⠀underline.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀progression⠀legible⠀without⠀reducing⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀numerical⠀system.⠀A⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀say:⠀she⠀could⠀not⠀lift⠀that⠀weight⠀three⠀chapters⠀ago;⠀she⠀now⠀holds⠀it⠀steadily,⠀but⠀only⠀after⠀borrowing⠀a⠀technique⠀from⠀a⠀rival⠀and⠀losing⠀a⠀morning's⠀wages⠀to⠀attend⠀the⠀demonstration.⠀The⠀advancement⠀is⠀earned⠀through⠀time,⠀relationships,⠀and⠀resources,⠀and⠀it⠀remains⠀entangled⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀social⠀pressures⠀that⠀made⠀it⠀difficult⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀place.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀with⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Get⠀to⠀the⠀attempt,⠀the⠀feedback,⠀and⠀the⠀result⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀passage.⠀Do⠀not⠀smooth⠀over⠀effort⠀with⠀abstract⠀language:⠀show⠀the⠀cracked⠀calluses,⠀the⠀warped⠀practice⠀board,⠀the⠀dust⠀in⠀the⠀mouth,⠀the⠀trainer's⠀chalk⠀mark⠀on⠀the⠀floor⠀where⠀the⠀student⠀kept⠀falling.⠀Let⠀material⠀wear⠀tell⠀the⠀story⠀of⠀practice.⠀A⠀sword⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀fits⠀the⠀palm,⠀a⠀pair⠀of⠀boots⠀resoled⠀twice,⠀a⠀notebook⠀with⠀the⠀first⠀quarter⠀filled⠀and⠀the⠀rest⠀blank—these⠀are⠀progression⠀details,⠀not⠀decorative⠀props.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀character⠀improves,⠀make⠀the⠀change⠀concrete⠀and⠀contrastive.⠀Earlier,⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀lift⠀the⠀bar;⠀now⠀they⠀lift⠀it⠀and⠀hold⠀it⠀but⠀their⠀shoulder⠀gives⠀out⠀on⠀the⠀third⠀repetition.⠀Earlier,⠀they⠀missed⠀the⠀timing;⠀now⠀they⠀catch⠀the⠀instructor's⠀wrist⠀once,⠀but⠀the⠀instructor⠀still⠀throws⠀them⠀because⠀their⠀stance⠀is⠀wrong.⠀Progress⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀smooth⠀curve.⠀Let⠀a⠀success⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀new⠀failure⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀cost:⠀the⠀technique⠀works,⠀but⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀to⠀borrow⠀money⠀for⠀the⠀right⠀equipment;⠀the⠀spell⠀fires,⠀but⠀the⠀backlash⠀leaves⠀a⠀burn;⠀the⠀rank⠀is⠀granted,⠀but⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀leave⠀home⠀to⠀keep⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀Pratchett-style⠀social⠀comedy⠀in⠀compressed⠀form.⠀An⠀institution's⠀absurdity⠀should⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀terse⠀exchange⠀or⠀a⠀telling⠀detail,⠀not⠀a⠀satirical⠀paragraph.⠀The⠀guild⠀issues⠀a⠀new⠀manual⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀errors⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀order.⠀A⠀registrar⠀stamps⠀'approved'⠀on⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀food⠀rations⠀but⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀a⠀chair.⠀A⠀senior⠀apprentice⠀explains⠀the⠀rule⠀to⠀the⠀junior:⠀'You⠀don't⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀good.⠀You⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀seen⠀trying.'⠀Let⠀the⠀humor⠀expose⠀something⠀specific⠀about⠀the⠀organization⠀or⠀a⠀relationship—fear,⠀laziness,⠀favoritism,⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀official⠀procedure⠀and⠀actual⠀survival—without⠀stopping⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀joke.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀abrasive⠀or⠀witty.⠀Rough⠀speech⠀belongs⠀to⠀particular⠀speakers⠀whose⠀circumstances⠀and⠀temperament⠀support⠀it.⠀A⠀quartermaster⠀may⠀curse⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀chalk;⠀a⠀rival⠀may⠀not⠀waste⠀words;⠀a⠀friend⠀may⠀be⠀blunt⠀because⠀kindness⠀would⠀take⠀too⠀long.⠀Let⠀different⠀relationships⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority⠀remain.⠀Some⠀characters⠀quote⠀the⠀manual;⠀others⠀ignore⠀it;⠀others⠀have⠀never⠀read⠀it.\n\nUse⠀changes⠀of⠀rhythm⠀deliberately.⠀Short⠀paragraphs⠀for⠀sudden⠀action⠀or⠀realization;⠀one⠀longer⠀paragraph⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀or⠀despair⠀needs⠀room.⠀A⠀long⠀thought⠀is⠀permitted⠀when⠀it⠀serves⠀the⠀progression:⠀the⠀character⠀works⠀through⠀why⠀a⠀technique⠀failed,⠀counts⠀the⠀days⠀until⠀the⠀exam,⠀or⠀rehearses⠀the⠀apology⠀they⠀will⠀not⠀make.⠀Do⠀not⠀pad⠀the⠀thought⠀with⠀generalities;⠀keep⠀it⠀grounded⠀in⠀specific,⠀material⠀detail.\n\nAdvancement⠀should⠀remain⠀a⠀lived,⠀social⠀fact,⠀not⠀a⠀survival-horror⠀ordeal.⠀Ordinary⠀work⠀and⠀relationships⠀continue⠀alongside⠀the⠀training.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀may⠀still⠀work⠀a⠀shift⠀before⠀practice,⠀bargain⠀for⠀a⠀used⠀manual,⠀or⠀argue⠀with⠀a⠀parent⠀about⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀lessons.⠀These⠀pressures⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀development,⠀but⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀genre⠀to⠀become⠀grim.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀improve,⠀fail,⠀be⠀helped,⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀frightened,⠀tired,⠀or⠀amused.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀point⠀of⠀fatigue,⠀decision,⠀or⠀small⠀change;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀documents⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Use⠀the⠀specific⠀document⠀forms⠀that⠀the⠀scene⠀naturally⠀produces:⠀a⠀training⠀log,⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀supplies,⠀a⠀letter⠀to⠀a⠀patron,⠀a⠀complaint⠀to⠀a⠀guild,⠀a⠀receipt,⠀a⠀letter⠀of⠀recommendation,⠀a⠀margin⠀note⠀in⠀a⠀borrowed⠀manual,⠀a⠀report⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀altered⠀by⠀a⠀supervisor.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀a⠀fixed⠀rotation⠀of⠀document⠀types;⠀let⠀the⠀story's⠀administrative⠀and⠀personal⠀needs⠀dictate⠀what⠀gets⠀written.\n\nEach⠀document⠀knows⠀and⠀conceals⠀exactly⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀would⠀know⠀and⠀choose⠀to⠀record.⠀A⠀training⠀log⠀may⠀note⠀'three⠀hours,⠀basic⠀drills,⠀no⠀improvement'⠀without⠀mentioning⠀the⠀student's⠀bruised⠀wrist⠀or⠀the⠀instructor's⠀sarcastic⠀explanation.⠀A⠀letter⠀to⠀a⠀parent⠀may⠀report⠀a⠀promotion⠀while⠀omitting⠀the⠀bribe⠀paid⠀to⠀the⠀examiner.⠀A⠀complaint⠀to⠀the⠀guild⠀may⠀describe⠀an⠀unfair⠀test⠀in⠀formal⠀language⠀while⠀the⠀writer's⠀private⠀note⠀on⠀the⠀back⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀page⠀says⠀what⠀they⠀actually⠀think.⠀The⠀gaps⠀between⠀documents⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀story:⠀the⠀reader⠀learns⠀advancement⠀not⠀from⠀one⠀authoritative⠀summary⠀but⠀from⠀the⠀accumulated⠀evidence⠀of⠀what⠀different⠀people⠀recorded⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀left⠀out.\n\nLet⠀Pratchett-style⠀institutional⠀comedy⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀official⠀documents⠀and⠀practical⠀reality.⠀A⠀guild⠀'certificate⠀of⠀competency'⠀may⠀be⠀signed⠀by⠀an⠀examiner⠀who⠀never⠀watched⠀the⠀test.⠀A⠀requisition⠀form⠀may⠀be⠀denied⠀for⠀lacking⠀the⠀correct⠀symbol,⠀then⠀approved⠀after⠀a⠀clerk⠀adds⠀the⠀symbol⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀color⠀of⠀ink.⠀A⠀manual⠀may⠀contain⠀instructions⠀that⠀are⠀technically⠀correct⠀but⠀impossible⠀to⠀follow⠀with⠀the⠀available⠀equipment.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀joke;⠀let⠀the⠀document's⠀own⠀language⠀reveal⠀the⠀absurdity.⠀A⠀comic⠀correction⠀should⠀expose⠀something⠀particular⠀about⠀the⠀institution—favoritism,⠀indifference,⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀procedure⠀and⠀need—not⠀merely⠀be⠀a⠀witty⠀aside.\n\nShow⠀improvement⠀through⠀the⠀documents'⠀changing⠀details.⠀Early⠀entries⠀record⠀failure⠀in⠀broad,⠀self-protective⠀terms:⠀'the⠀technique⠀remains⠀difficult.'⠀Later⠀entries⠀become⠀more⠀precise:⠀'the⠀sword⠀catches⠀on⠀the⠀third⠀movement;⠀I⠀need⠀to⠀turn⠀the⠀wrist⠀earlier.'⠀A⠀supervisor's⠀note⠀may⠀shift⠀from⠀'recommend⠀remedial⠀training'⠀to⠀'assign⠀independent⠀study'⠀without⠀acknowledging⠀the⠀student's⠀actual⠀effort.⠀A⠀comparison⠀of⠀two⠀reports⠀can⠀reveal⠀progress:⠀the⠀same⠀task⠀described⠀as⠀'impossible'⠀in⠀one⠀month⠀and⠀'routine'⠀in⠀another,⠀but⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀cost⠀omitted⠀from⠀the⠀official⠀record.\n\nPreserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀without⠀adding⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record.⠀Let⠀one⠀document⠀respond⠀to⠀another⠀through⠀its⠀own⠀content:⠀a⠀reply⠀references⠀the⠀previous⠀letter's⠀date⠀or⠀enclosed⠀payment;⠀a⠀training⠀log⠀quotes⠀the⠀instructor's⠀words⠀from⠀the⠀day⠀before;⠀a⠀complaint⠀cites⠀the⠀relevant⠀regulation⠀that⠀another⠀document⠀established.⠀When⠀a⠀gap⠀matters,⠀let⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀reveal⠀it⠀through⠀allusion,⠀correction,⠀or⠀contradiction.⠀Do⠀not⠀step⠀outside⠀the⠀documents⠀to⠀say⠀'she⠀had⠀improved⠀but⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀it.'⠀The⠀reader⠀infers⠀from⠀the⠀records,⠀their⠀authors,⠀and⠀their⠀omissions.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀a⠀witty⠀commentator.⠀Some⠀documents⠀will⠀be⠀dry,⠀evasive,⠀or⠀poorly⠀written.⠀The⠀humor⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀institutional⠀situation⠀and⠀to⠀particular⠀authors:⠀a⠀clerk⠀who⠀writes⠀'per⠀our⠀previous⠀correspondence'⠀after⠀a⠀dispute⠀that⠀was⠀never⠀resolved;⠀a⠀rival⠀who⠀praises⠀the⠀character's⠀work⠀in⠀a⠀letter⠀of⠀recommendation⠀while⠀listing⠀only⠀those⠀skills⠀that⠀are⠀now⠀obsolete;⠀a⠀friend⠀who⠀sends⠀a⠀note⠀that⠀says⠀'well⠀done'⠀on⠀the⠀outside⠀and⠀'don't⠀trust⠀the⠀examiner'⠀on⠀the⠀inside.⠀Keep⠀different⠀relationships⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority⠀clear.⠀The⠀documents⠀are⠀not⠀all⠀written⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀voice.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀progression⠀legible⠀across⠀entries.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀trace,⠀through⠀the⠀documents⠀alone,⠀that⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀began⠀unable⠀to⠀perform⠀a⠀task⠀later⠀performs⠀it,⠀or⠀at⠀least⠀that⠀their⠀instructors,⠀rivals,⠀and⠀records⠀begin⠀to⠀treat⠀them⠀differently.⠀Advancement⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀numerical⠀score;⠀it⠀needs⠀a⠀changed⠀relationship⠀to⠀the⠀world⠀expressed⠀in⠀the⠀documents⠀people⠀choose⠀to⠀write,⠀file,⠀forward,⠀or⠀destroy.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nShow⠀improvement⠀through⠀relationships⠀that⠀make⠀advancement⠀possible⠀and⠀bearable.⠀Progress⠀is⠀not⠀only⠀the⠀character⠀mastering⠀a⠀skill;⠀it⠀is⠀also⠀the⠀friend⠀who⠀holds⠀the⠀practice⠀dummy⠀steady,⠀the⠀teacher⠀who⠀brings⠀an⠀extra⠀portion⠀of⠀food⠀before⠀a⠀long⠀session,⠀the⠀younger⠀sibling⠀who⠀saves⠀a⠀worn⠀piece⠀of⠀equipment⠀because⠀they⠀know⠀it⠀matters.⠀Spend⠀attention⠀on⠀these⠀acts⠀of⠀practical⠀care:⠀the⠀exact⠀way⠀someone⠀wraps⠀a⠀bandage,⠀the⠀specific⠀food⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀table,⠀the⠀note⠀with⠀one⠀useful⠀correction⠀and⠀a⠀small⠀drawing⠀of⠀an⠀animal.⠀Let⠀the⠀comfort⠀be⠀concrete,⠀not⠀generalized⠀warmth.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable.⠀Comfort⠀operates⠀alongside⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement.⠀A⠀caring⠀mentor⠀may⠀still⠀refuse⠀to⠀praise⠀effort⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀real;⠀a⠀friend⠀may⠀be⠀kind⠀and⠀also⠀impatient;⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀may⠀support⠀the⠀character's⠀training⠀while⠀making⠀a⠀pointed⠀comment⠀about⠀the⠀cost.⠀The⠀warmth⠀is⠀not⠀erased⠀by⠀these⠀frictions;⠀it⠀is⠀shown⠀to⠀be⠀compatible⠀with⠀them.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀include⠀an⠀argument⠀and⠀still⠀end⠀with⠀someone⠀handing⠀over⠀a⠀cup⠀of⠀tea,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀forced⠀reconciliation⠀but⠀as⠀an⠀ordinary⠀part⠀of⠀living⠀together.⠀Affection⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀say⠀'thank⠀you'⠀by⠀repairing⠀someone's⠀gear,⠀not⠀by⠀announcing⠀their⠀feelings.\n\nLet⠀Pratchett-style⠀social⠀comedy⠀keep⠀the⠀comfort⠀from⠀becoming⠀saccharine.⠀The⠀world⠀remains⠀institutional⠀and⠀sometimes⠀absurd.⠀A⠀training⠀guild⠀may⠀require⠀twelve⠀forms⠀for⠀a⠀student⠀to⠀receive⠀extra⠀practice⠀time;⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀their⠀friend⠀spend⠀the⠀evening⠀filling⠀out⠀the⠀forms⠀together⠀and⠀joking⠀about⠀question⠀seven.⠀A⠀shopkeeper⠀may⠀sell⠀the⠀wrong⠀manual⠀and⠀then,⠀out⠀of⠀genuine⠀kindness,⠀give⠀the⠀correct⠀one⠀at⠀a⠀discount⠀while⠀pretending⠀it⠀was⠀a⠀mistake.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀expose⠀something⠀specific⠀about⠀how⠀people⠀and⠀organizations⠀actually⠀behave—bureaucratic⠀pettiness⠀softened⠀by⠀an⠀individual's⠀good⠀will,⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀is⠀bent⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀actually⠀cares—without⠀making⠀the⠀institutions⠀themselves⠀vanish.\n\nKeep⠀progression⠀legible.⠀The⠀character⠀still⠀attempts⠀things,⠀fails,⠀practices,⠀receives⠀feedback,⠀and⠀improves.⠀The⠀improvement⠀must⠀be⠀real⠀and⠀earned,⠀not⠀simply⠀narrated⠀as⠀happening⠀off-page⠀while⠀the⠀story⠀focuses⠀on⠀comfort.⠀Show⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀a⠀movement⠀works,⠀the⠀revised⠀understanding⠀after⠀a⠀mistake,⠀the⠀increased⠀capacity⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀present⠀before.⠀Then⠀let⠀the⠀warmth⠀respond⠀to⠀that⠀improvement⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀way:⠀a⠀friend⠀who⠀notices⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀a⠀big⠀deal,⠀a⠀teacher⠀who⠀nods⠀once⠀and⠀then⠀asks⠀about⠀dinner,⠀a⠀rival⠀who⠀says⠀'finally'⠀but⠀saves⠀the⠀character⠀a⠀seat.⠀Small⠀pleasures⠀can⠀mark⠀progress⠀without⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀an⠀award⠀ceremony.\n\nUse⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀to⠀convey⠀warmth⠀without⠀becoming⠀saccharine.⠀If⠀the⠀narration⠀is⠀close,⠀let⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀notice⠀the⠀comfort⠀around⠀them:⠀the⠀room⠀is⠀warm,⠀the⠀tea⠀is⠀too⠀sweet,⠀but⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀made⠀it⠀remembers⠀that⠀they⠀like⠀it⠀that⠀way.⠀If⠀the⠀narration⠀is⠀more⠀removed,⠀show⠀care⠀through⠀small,⠀observed⠀gestures—someone⠀moves⠀a⠀lamp⠀so⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀read,⠀someone⠀folds⠀a⠀blanket⠀and⠀leaves⠀it⠀on⠀a⠀chair.⠀Avoid⠀describing⠀emotions⠀with⠀a⠀single⠀repeated⠀adjective⠀like⠀'cozy'⠀or⠀'soft.'⠀Instead,⠀render⠀specific⠀details:⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀kettle,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀bread,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀borrowed⠀coat.⠀Do⠀not⠀pretend⠀that⠀established⠀problems⠀have⠀disappeared.⠀The⠀world⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀unfair,⠀the⠀training⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀difficult,⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀worried;⠀comfort⠀is⠀a⠀real⠀part⠀of⠀that⠀life,⠀not⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀ordinary⠀work⠀and⠀relationships⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀may⠀need⠀to⠀help⠀with⠀household⠀tasks,⠀earn⠀money,⠀or⠀care⠀for⠀someone⠀else⠀while⠀training.⠀These⠀obligations⠀are⠀not⠀distractions;⠀they⠀are⠀the⠀context⠀in⠀which⠀kindness⠀and⠀progress⠀occur.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀show⠀a⠀character⠀practicing⠀a⠀repetitive⠀drill⠀while⠀a⠀friend⠀shells⠀peas⠀beside⠀them,⠀correcting⠀their⠀stance⠀between⠀handfuls.⠀The⠀genre's⠀improvement⠀thread⠀and⠀the⠀style's⠀comforting⠀attention⠀should⠀reinforce⠀each⠀other,⠀not⠀compete⠀for⠀space.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nCompose⠀the⠀progression⠀in⠀deliberate⠀paragraphs⠀that⠀move⠀from⠀social⠀context⠀to⠀particular⠀scene.⠀Open⠀a⠀training⠀sequence⠀by⠀establishing⠀the⠀institution's⠀stated⠀purpose⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀practice:⠀the⠀academy's⠀charter⠀promises⠀the⠀cultivation⠀of⠀practical⠀skill,⠀but⠀the⠀students⠀discover⠀that⠀instruction⠀follows⠀the⠀availability⠀of⠀silver⠀and⠀the⠀patience⠀of⠀unpaid⠀assistants.⠀Then⠀narrow⠀to⠀the⠀specific⠀attempt,⠀the⠀body's⠀failure,⠀the⠀instructor's⠀clipped⠀correction,⠀and⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀calculation⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀failure⠀will⠀cost.⠀Use⠀transitions⠀that⠀connect⠀the⠀general⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀without⠀summarizing⠀the⠀same⠀information⠀twice.\n\nMaintain⠀enough⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀frame⠀the⠀action⠀through⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀understand⠀that⠀a⠀promotion⠀is⠀not⠀only⠀a⠀personal⠀achievement⠀but⠀also⠀a⠀movement⠀within⠀a⠀larger⠀structure:⠀a⠀family's⠀expectations,⠀a⠀guild's⠀hierarchy,⠀a⠀town's⠀opinion.⠀A⠀paragraph⠀may⠀open⠀with⠀the⠀institution's⠀history—the⠀building⠀was⠀once⠀a⠀customs⠀house,⠀and⠀the⠀rooms⠀still⠀smell⠀faintly⠀of⠀seized⠀wool—but⠀it⠀must⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀living⠀attempt:⠀the⠀character's⠀hands⠀on⠀the⠀ledger,⠀the⠀tutor's⠀habit⠀of⠀pointing⠀with⠀the⠀wrong⠀end⠀of⠀a⠀quill.⠀Do⠀not⠀allow⠀social⠀context⠀to⠀become⠀an⠀inert⠀backdrop⠀offered⠀instead⠀of⠀progression.\n\nLet⠀Pratchett-style⠀social⠀comedy⠀emerge⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀composed⠀observation⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀punch⠀lines.⠀A⠀comic⠀correction⠀should⠀expose⠀something⠀particular⠀about⠀how⠀people⠀and⠀organizations⠀actually⠀behave:⠀the⠀committee⠀that⠀meets⠀to⠀discuss⠀the⠀shortage⠀of⠀competent⠀examiners⠀and⠀decides⠀to⠀add⠀another⠀form⠀to⠀the⠀application⠀process;⠀the⠀patron⠀who⠀praises⠀'the⠀common⠀touch'⠀while⠀refusing⠀to⠀enter⠀the⠀training⠀yard⠀because⠀the⠀dust⠀would⠀spoil⠀his⠀coat.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀state⠀the⠀discrepancy⠀plainly,⠀but⠀the⠀humor⠀should⠀adhere⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀its⠀institutions,⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀separate⠀satirical⠀voice⠀that⠀stands⠀outside⠀the⠀story.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀witty.⠀Let⠀them⠀retain⠀different⠀relationships⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority:⠀some⠀speak⠀formally,⠀some⠀evade,⠀some⠀remain⠀silent,⠀and⠀only⠀a⠀few⠀have⠀a⠀talent⠀for⠀pointed⠀speech.\n\nWhen⠀advancement⠀occurs,⠀render⠀it⠀with⠀formal⠀precision⠀and⠀social⠀consequence.⠀A⠀successful⠀demonstration⠀may⠀be⠀described⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀that⠀includes⠀the⠀movement,⠀the⠀sound,⠀the⠀instructor's⠀raised⠀eyebrow,⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀ripple⠀through⠀the⠀spectators—the⠀rival⠀who⠀stops⠀chewing,⠀the⠀friend⠀who⠀nods⠀once,⠀the⠀petitioner⠀who⠀suddenly⠀revises⠀an⠀estimate⠀of⠀the⠀character's⠀usefulness.⠀Progress⠀should⠀be⠀tested⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀in⠀the⠀world,⠀not⠀by⠀an⠀abstract⠀score.⠀It⠀should⠀also⠀remain⠀entangled⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀social⠀pressures:⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀may⠀open⠀a⠀door,⠀raise⠀a⠀price,⠀or⠀invite⠀a⠀request.\n\nDistinguish⠀the⠀narration⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language.⠀The⠀narrative⠀voice⠀may⠀use⠀fuller⠀syntax,⠀subordinate⠀clauses,⠀and⠀considered⠀judgments;⠀the⠀characters'⠀dialogue⠀should⠀remain⠀natural⠀to⠀their⠀station,⠀education,⠀and⠀temperament.⠀A⠀young⠀clerk⠀may⠀speak⠀in⠀fragments;⠀a⠀guild⠀master⠀may⠀use⠀ritual⠀phrases;⠀a⠀friend⠀may⠀interrupt⠀with⠀practical⠀advice.⠀The⠀formal⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀archaic⠀vocabulary,⠀aristocratic⠀settings,⠀or⠀uniformly⠀elaborate⠀speech.⠀Use⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀and⠀public/private⠀contrast⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀calls⠀for⠀them:⠀a⠀formal⠀examination,⠀a⠀letter⠀of⠀introduction,⠀a⠀private⠀conversation⠀after⠀a⠀public⠀humiliation.\n\nKeep⠀recovery,⠀relationships,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀A⠀chapter⠀may⠀follow⠀a⠀day⠀of⠀training⠀with⠀an⠀evening⠀spent⠀reconciling⠀the⠀family⠀accounts,⠀lighting⠀the⠀lamps,⠀and⠀listening⠀to⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀complaint.⠀These⠀passages⠀are⠀not⠀filler;⠀they⠀ground⠀the⠀improvement⠀in⠀a⠀lived⠀social⠀world,⠀and⠀they⠀allow⠀the⠀novelistic⠀form⠀to⠀register⠀small⠀changes⠀in⠀habit,⠀attention,⠀and⠀obligation.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀celebratory⠀or⠀tragic⠀endpoint.⠀The⠀progression⠀moves⠀through⠀attempts,⠀setbacks,⠀and⠀partial⠀achievements⠀whose⠀meaning⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀society⠀and⠀people⠀around⠀the⠀character.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀tellings,⠀each⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀listener,⠀occasion,⠀and⠀immediate⠀purpose.⠀For⠀a⠀focal⠀character⠀who⠀is⠀developing⠀a⠀skill⠀or⠀understanding,⠀make⠀each⠀performance⠀an⠀actual⠀attempt⠀at⠀that⠀capability.⠀Show⠀the⠀attempt⠀from⠀the⠀teller's⠀side—what⠀they⠀notice,⠀where⠀they⠀struggle,⠀what⠀they⠀perceive⠀they⠀got⠀right—so⠀the⠀audience's⠀response⠀lands⠀as⠀feedback⠀rather⠀than⠀mere⠀applause.\n\nBuild⠀each⠀telling⠀with⠀concrete⠀operational⠀differences⠀from⠀the⠀last:⠀the⠀teller⠀tries⠀a⠀new⠀selection⠀of⠀details,⠀a⠀different⠀order,⠀a⠀comparison⠀they⠀only⠀recently⠀understood,⠀or⠀an⠀example⠀acquired⠀between⠀performances.⠀Include⠀what⠀still⠀exceeds⠀their⠀current⠀skill⠀so⠀that⠀progress⠀remains⠀uneven⠀and⠀visible.⠀Let⠀repetitions⠀of⠀a⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀small⠀story⠀across⠀tellings⠀carry⠀accumulating⠀meaning;⠀when⠀it⠀returns,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀with⠀it⠀that⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀do⠀before.\n\nUse⠀Terry⠀Pratchett's⠀social-comedy⠀lens⠀on⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀thinks⠀they⠀are⠀demonstrating⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀actually⠀reads.⠀Point⠀that⠀gap⠀in⠀particular⠀details:⠀an⠀official⠀explanation⠀contradicted⠀by⠀a⠀physical⠀fact,⠀a⠀compliment⠀that⠀reveals⠀the⠀listener⠀noticed⠀the⠀wrong⠀improvement,⠀a⠀practical⠀correction⠀someone⠀offers⠀because⠀they⠀know⠀the⠀teller's⠀earlier⠀limits.⠀The⠀audience's⠀humor⠀should⠀be⠀situation-specific,⠀not⠀generic⠀wit.\n\nThe⠀outer⠀frame⠀listens⠀for⠀practical⠀information,⠀utility,⠀or⠀risk,⠀not⠀mere⠀beauty.⠀Have⠀the⠀audience⠀follow⠀at⠀least⠀one⠀concrete⠀thread⠀through⠀the⠀nested⠀levels⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀question⠀or⠀observation⠀about⠀that⠀thread.⠀When⠀an⠀embedded⠀tale⠀delays⠀or⠀warns,⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀delay⠀or⠀warning⠀becomes⠀useful⠀in⠀the⠀immediate⠀outer⠀situation.⠀Delayed⠀revelation⠀is⠀meaningful⠀when⠀the⠀listener⠀or⠀the⠀teller⠀now⠀recognizes⠀what⠀was⠀previously⠀invisible⠀to⠀them;⠀otherwise⠀leave⠀the⠀connection⠀open.\n\nDo⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀royal⠀court,⠀magical⠀bargain,⠀djinn,⠀or⠀required⠀cliffhanger⠀between⠀every⠀tale.⠀The⠀frame⠀needs⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀keep⠀returning;⠀that⠀reason⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀simple⠀as⠀the⠀teller⠀needing⠀another⠀attempt⠀or⠀the⠀audience⠀needing⠀a⠀point⠀made.⠀End⠀a⠀section⠀where⠀the⠀current⠀attempt,⠀correction,⠀or⠀unresolved⠀difficulty⠀has⠀been⠀honestly⠀rendered,⠀not⠀where⠀a⠀new⠀genre⠀beat⠀demands⠀a⠀completed⠀improvement.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀developmental⠀realism⠀route:⠀place⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀growing⠀capability⠀inside⠀concrete⠀institutions,⠀work⠀arrangements,⠀families,⠀and⠀training⠀relationships.⠀Improvements⠀are⠀shown⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀perform⠀under⠀real⠀conditions,⠀not⠀by⠀abstract⠀level-ups.⠀Show⠀the⠀environment's⠀consequences—a⠀supervisor's⠀changed⠀expectations,⠀a⠀peer's⠀jealousy⠀or⠀cooperation,⠀a⠀family⠀member's⠀practical⠀need—so⠀the⠀progressing⠀skill⠀alters⠀the⠀social⠀field.\n\nDistinguish⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀knowledge⠀from⠀execution⠀in⠀the⠀narrative.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀a⠀principle,⠀write⠀the⠀subsequent⠀attempt⠀with⠀specific⠀failures⠀of⠀timing,⠀pressure,⠀or⠀coordination.⠀When⠀the⠀performance⠀finally⠀succeeds,⠀show⠀the⠀immediate⠀difference⠀it⠀makes⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀feels⠀hard.⠀Progress⠀is⠀unequal:⠀one⠀facet⠀may⠀improve⠀while⠀another⠀lags,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀record⠀both.\n\nTurn⠀Pratchett's⠀social⠀comedy⠀on⠀organizational⠀and⠀official⠀language.⠀Have⠀characters⠀explain,⠀defend,⠀or⠀misinterpret⠀a⠀workplace⠀rule,⠀training⠀doctrine,⠀or⠀family⠀expectation,⠀and⠀then⠀let⠀a⠀practical⠀detail⠀correct⠀them.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀someone⠀noticing⠀that⠀the⠀official⠀story⠀omits⠀a⠀concrete⠀fact—a⠀tool⠀that⠀is⠀never⠀maintained,⠀a⠀duty⠀that⠀falls⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀person,⠀a⠀qualification⠀that⠀proves⠀irrelevant.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀a⠀witty⠀commentator;⠀some⠀are⠀earnest,⠀some⠀cautious,⠀some⠀barely⠀articulate,⠀and⠀their⠀different⠀relationships⠀to⠀authority⠀shape⠀what⠀they⠀say.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration's⠀syntax⠀and⠀distance⠀consistent⠀with⠀an⠀observer⠀who⠀is⠀close⠀enough⠀to⠀see⠀institutional⠀details⠀but⠀not⠀omniscient⠀about⠀every⠀mind.⠀Describe⠀rooms,⠀objects,⠀and⠀routines⠀in⠀sufficient⠀physical⠀detail⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀what⠀labor⠀and⠀learning⠀actually⠀require.⠀Choose⠀a⠀specific⠀community⠀and⠀period⠀from⠀the⠀story's⠀established⠀world;⠀if⠀none⠀is⠀supplied,⠀remain⠀general⠀enough⠀that⠀no⠀national⠀stereotype⠀is⠀imported.\n\nAdvance⠀the⠀plot⠀through⠀attempts,⠀corrections,⠀and⠀new⠀challenges⠀that⠀have⠀real⠀stakes⠀in⠀the⠀institution.⠀A⠀skill⠀may⠀be⠀tested⠀in⠀a⠀practical⠀emergency⠀or⠀in⠀a⠀formal⠀evaluation;⠀in⠀either⠀case,⠀the⠀test⠀reveals⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀internalized.⠀End⠀a⠀section⠀after⠀the⠀current⠀attempt⠀has⠀changed⠀the⠀character's⠀position—whether⠀by⠀success,⠀humiliation,⠀or⠀new⠀information—not⠀after⠀a⠀compulsory⠀moral⠀summary.⠀Do⠀not⠀bowdlerize⠀the⠀institutions⠀into⠀harmless⠀props;⠀let⠀their⠀inefficiencies⠀and⠀power⠀asymmetries⠀remain⠀visible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progressing⠀capability⠀as⠀something⠀inherited⠀from⠀an⠀older⠀order:⠀a⠀tradition,⠀position,⠀contractual⠀obligation,⠀or⠀skill⠀that⠀now⠀functions⠀in⠀a⠀modern,⠀decaying⠀world.⠀Show⠀the⠀learner⠀trying⠀to⠀adapt⠀that⠀inheritance⠀through⠀concrete⠀practice⠀and⠀feedback,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀attempt⠀carry⠀both⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀old⠀system's⠀authority⠀and⠀the⠀friction⠀of⠀present⠀material⠀conditions.\n\nUse⠀Gothic-Punk's⠀specific⠀atmosphere⠀operation:⠀before⠀and⠀during⠀the⠀key⠀attempts,⠀render⠀the⠀encounter's⠀emotional⠀and⠀sensory⠀texture⠀through⠀details⠀of⠀urban⠀decay,⠀worn⠀objects,⠀contested⠀spaces,⠀and⠀changed⠀technology.⠀The⠀atmosphere⠀should⠀not⠀replace⠀causal⠀content;⠀a⠀poorly⠀lit⠀room,⠀an⠀outdated⠀ritual,⠀or⠀a⠀damaged⠀tool⠀must⠀function⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀merely⠀set⠀a⠀mood.⠀Show⠀how⠀the⠀old⠀practice⠀has⠀a⠀real⠀cost,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀burden,⠀or⠀a⠀recipient⠀who⠀depends⠀on⠀it.\n\nLet⠀Pratchett's⠀social⠀comedy⠀undercut⠀the⠀official⠀dignity⠀of⠀the⠀old⠀order.⠀Someone⠀in⠀authority⠀invokes⠀a⠀noble⠀principle⠀or⠀historical⠀precedent,⠀and⠀a⠀present-day⠀fact⠀exposes⠀the⠀gap:⠀the⠀ceremony⠀is⠀run⠀on⠀outdated⠀equipment,⠀the⠀title⠀now⠀describes⠀a⠀meaningless⠀duty,⠀the⠀sacred⠀text⠀is⠀full⠀of⠀clerical⠀errors.⠀These⠀corrections⠀are⠀particular⠀and⠀actionable,⠀not⠀general⠀cynicism.⠀When⠀the⠀joke⠀lands,⠀it⠀should⠀deepen⠀the⠀reader's⠀understanding⠀of⠀why⠀the⠀old⠀system⠀persists⠀or⠀fails.\n\nMake⠀progress⠀morally⠀complicated.⠀The⠀character's⠀new⠀capability⠀may⠀help⠀one⠀person⠀while⠀threatening⠀another;⠀a⠀mentor⠀may⠀demand⠀loyalty⠀in⠀exchange⠀for⠀instruction;⠀a⠀trusted⠀ally⠀may⠀value⠀the⠀old⠀skill⠀for⠀a⠀self-serving⠀reason.⠀The⠀learner⠀should⠀face⠀at⠀least⠀one⠀choice⠀where⠀improvement⠀means⠀accepting⠀a⠀cost⠀or⠀refusing⠀an⠀advantage.⠀Social⠀masks⠀can⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀show⠀who⠀can⠀speak⠀plainly⠀to⠀whom⠀and⠀why.\n\nAdvance⠀through⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀attempts⠀that⠀are⠀harder⠀not⠀only⠀technically⠀but⠀socially:⠀each⠀step⠀forces⠀the⠀character⠀into⠀spaces⠀where⠀the⠀old⠀and⠀new⠀worlds⠀meet.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀a⠀clear⠀difference⠀between⠀knowing⠀the⠀inherited⠀principle⠀and⠀performing⠀it⠀under⠀present-day⠀pressure.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀when⠀the⠀attempt⠀has⠀produced⠀a⠀meaningful⠀change⠀in⠀risk,⠀relationship,⠀or⠀capability—often⠀leaving⠀the⠀character⠀more⠀exposed.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀vampires,⠀blood⠀magic,⠀faction⠀politics,⠀or⠀a⠀supernatural⠀power⠀system;⠀the⠀emotion⠀and⠀structure⠀come⠀from⠀real⠀inherited⠀privilege⠀and⠀real⠀modern⠀decay.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social/domestic⠀realism⠀route⠀in⠀all⠀sections:⠀show⠀the⠀character⠀learning⠀a⠀craft,⠀profession,⠀ritual⠀skill,⠀or⠀body⠀of⠀knowledge⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀family⠀or⠀close⠀community.⠀Learning⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀who⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀teach,⠀who⠀controls⠀resources⠀and⠀time,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀expected⠀of⠀the⠀learner⠀in⠀return.⠀Write⠀concrete⠀practice⠀sessions,⠀not⠀summaries⠀of⠀study:⠀a⠀child⠀watches⠀and⠀repeats,⠀an⠀apprentice⠀botches⠀a⠀task⠀until⠀corrected,⠀a⠀sibling⠀competes,⠀an⠀elder⠀withholds⠀full⠀instruction⠀for⠀reasons⠀both⠀practical⠀and⠀personal.\n\nMake⠀improvement⠀visible⠀through⠀changed⠀responsibility⠀in⠀daily⠀life.⠀Before⠀the⠀skill⠀develops,⠀a⠀specific⠀duty⠀is⠀too⠀dangerous,⠀too⠀expensive,⠀or⠀too⠀socially⠀important⠀for⠀the⠀character;⠀after⠀a⠀period⠀of⠀uneven⠀progress,⠀the⠀family⠀or⠀community⠀trusts⠀them⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀version⠀of⠀that⠀duty.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀notices,⠀predicts,⠀or⠀avoids⠀that⠀they⠀previously⠀could⠀not.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀a⠀numerical⠀power⠀system;⠀the⠀social⠀change⠀is⠀the⠀evidence⠀of⠀growth.\n\nUse⠀Terry⠀Pratchett's⠀comic⠀method⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀domestic⠀or⠀pedagogical⠀ideals⠀and⠀actual⠀practice.⠀An⠀elder⠀says⠀the⠀old⠀method⠀is⠀best,⠀then⠀quietly⠀uses⠀a⠀modern⠀shortcut.⠀A⠀parent⠀demands⠀perfection⠀but⠀conceals⠀their⠀own⠀early⠀failures.⠀A⠀community⠀praises⠀a⠀formal⠀performance⠀while⠀the⠀learner⠀privately⠀knows⠀a⠀mistake⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀observed.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀characters'⠀relationships,⠀not⠀a⠀joke⠀about⠀an⠀entire⠀tradition.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀story's⠀supplied⠀setting.⠀If⠀the⠀story's⠀world⠀has⠀its⠀own⠀naming,⠀religion,⠀or⠀family⠀structure,⠀use⠀those⠀details⠀rather⠀than⠀importing⠀a⠀generic⠀South⠀Asian⠀stereotype.⠀Let⠀characters⠀speak⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀levels⠀of⠀formality⠀and⠀practicality;⠀some⠀are⠀blunt,⠀some⠀evasive,⠀some⠀proud.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀stay⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀family⠀but⠀should⠀not⠀claim⠀knowledge⠀of⠀every⠀member's⠀inner⠀life.\n\nTreat⠀ordinary⠀work⠀and⠀recovery⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀genre.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀practice⠀while⠀doing⠀chores,⠀learn⠀from⠀a⠀mistake⠀that⠀costs⠀the⠀household⠀money,⠀or⠀need⠀time⠀to⠀heal⠀after⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt.⠀The⠀household's⠀rhythms—meals,⠀market,⠀prayer,⠀celebration—are⠀not⠀scenery;⠀they⠀set⠀the⠀schedule⠀and⠀stakes⠀of⠀the⠀learning.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀attempt⠀has⠀changed⠀the⠀character's⠀standing⠀or⠀understanding,⠀not⠀after⠀a⠀forced⠀moral⠀lesson.⠀Progress⠀can⠀be⠀quiet,⠀partial,⠀and⠀real⠀without⠀a⠀crowd⠀applauding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route⠀for⠀every⠀section.⠀Write⠀entries⠀that⠀record⠀the⠀character's⠀attempts⠀at⠀a⠀developing⠀skill⠀or⠀understanding,⠀anchored⠀to⠀concrete⠀dates,⠀seasonal⠀markers,⠀domestic⠀events,⠀or⠀practical⠀tasks.⠀Let⠀each⠀entry⠀combine⠀what⠀happened,⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀noticed,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀still⠀could⠀not⠀do.⠀Omission⠀is⠀important:⠀not⠀every⠀failure⠀needs⠀narration,⠀but⠀the⠀pattern⠀of⠀returns—a⠀task⠀revisited⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀month,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀phrase⠀remembered⠀under⠀new⠀circumstances—shows⠀the⠀actual⠀progress.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀diary⠀voice⠀honest⠀but⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knows⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀of⠀writing.⠀If⠀an⠀entry⠀is⠀composed⠀immediately⠀after⠀practice,⠀the⠀writer⠀may⠀overestimate⠀a⠀small⠀success⠀or⠀miss⠀a⠀larger⠀mistake.⠀A⠀later⠀entry⠀can⠀correct⠀that⠀judgment⠀without⠀being⠀omniscient;⠀the⠀character⠀simply⠀realizes⠀they⠀misread⠀an⠀earlier⠀event.⠀Use⠀dates⠀or⠀recurring⠀objects⠀(a⠀tool,⠀a⠀particular⠀dish,⠀a⠀weather⠀change)⠀to⠀mark⠀that⠀time⠀has⠀passed,⠀not⠀to⠀assemble⠀a⠀scenery⠀inventory.\n\nUse⠀Terry⠀Pratchett's⠀comic⠀correction⠀inside⠀the⠀reflective⠀voice.⠀The⠀writer⠀records⠀a⠀grand⠀claim⠀about⠀the⠀day's⠀work;⠀the⠀next⠀sentence⠀admits⠀the⠀actual⠀result⠀was⠀nothing⠀like⠀it.⠀Or⠀the⠀writer⠀quotes⠀an⠀instructor's⠀formal⠀explanation,⠀then⠀details⠀a⠀small⠀physical⠀fact⠀that⠀undermined⠀it.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀the⠀writer⠀catching⠀themselves⠀in⠀a⠀pardonable⠀but⠀specific⠀self-deception⠀or⠀institutional⠀absurdity.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀entry⠀a⠀witty⠀epigram;⠀some⠀are⠀tired,⠀precise,⠀confused,⠀or⠀plain.\n\nAllow⠀different⠀modes⠀of⠀development⠀within⠀the⠀diary:⠀one⠀week⠀practice⠀is⠀steady,⠀another⠀week⠀the⠀body⠀or⠀weather⠀disrupts⠀it,⠀another⠀week⠀a⠀sibling⠀or⠀neighbor⠀gives⠀unexpectedly⠀useful⠀feedback.⠀Show⠀changed⠀capability⠀by⠀the⠀writer's⠀own⠀changed⠀standards—what⠀they⠀once⠀would⠀have⠀celebrated⠀they⠀now⠀see⠀as⠀inadequate,⠀or⠀what⠀once⠀seemed⠀impossible⠀is⠀now⠀routine.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀compare⠀entries⠀and⠀see⠀that⠀progress,⠀though⠀uneven,⠀is⠀real.\n\nKeep⠀language⠀and⠀social⠀distance⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀actual⠀diarist⠀and⠀their⠀period.⠀A⠀young⠀learner⠀may⠀write⠀simply;⠀an⠀older⠀practitioner⠀may⠀use⠀technical⠀terms⠀and⠀more⠀detachment.⠀The⠀diary⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀public⠀performance,⠀so⠀private⠀motives⠀and⠀confusions⠀may⠀appear⠀without⠀apology.⠀End⠀a⠀section⠀after⠀the⠀entry⠀has⠀honestly⠀rendered⠀the⠀current⠀state⠀of⠀the⠀attempt⠀or⠀understanding.⠀A⠀final⠀note⠀may⠀be⠀unresolved;⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀changing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀testimonial⠀account:⠀a⠀focal⠀character⠀looks⠀back⠀at⠀their⠀own⠀development⠀and⠀tells⠀how⠀they⠀learned.⠀The⠀narrator⠀should⠀distinguish⠀clearly⠀between⠀what⠀they⠀knew⠀then⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀know⠀now;⠀this⠀permits⠀honest⠀hindsight⠀without⠀pretending⠀the⠀earlier⠀self⠀was⠀prescient.⠀Use⠀the⠀later⠀knowledge⠀to⠀point⠀out⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀missed,⠀what⠀a⠀teacher⠀concealed,⠀or⠀what⠀a⠀community⠀explanation⠀got⠀wrong.\n\nStructure⠀the⠀telling⠀around⠀actual⠀attempts⠀and⠀their⠀context—the⠀families,⠀workplaces,⠀struggles,⠀and⠀local⠀histories⠀that⠀made⠀learning⠀possible⠀or⠀costly.⠀Show⠀the⠀physical⠀and⠀social⠀detail⠀of⠀each⠀stage:⠀who⠀taught,⠀who⠀refused,⠀who⠀watched,⠀what⠀resource⠀was⠀available⠀or⠀withheld,⠀what⠀danger⠀or⠀hope⠀hung⠀over⠀the⠀practice.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀improvement⠀as⠀a⠀cumulative⠀change⠀in⠀capacity⠀across⠀these⠀connected⠀episodes,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀summary.\n\nUse⠀Terry⠀Pratchett's⠀comic⠀method⠀against⠀communal⠀or⠀institutional⠀official⠀stories.⠀The⠀teller⠀recalls⠀the⠀fine⠀speech⠀made⠀when⠀a⠀school,⠀guild,⠀or⠀family⠀first⠀announced⠀the⠀instruction;⠀then⠀they⠀detail⠀what⠀actually⠀happened—the⠀missing⠀tool,⠀the⠀irrelevant⠀regulation,⠀the⠀proud⠀instructor⠀who⠀could⠀not⠀demonstrate⠀the⠀skill.⠀These⠀corrections⠀are⠀specific⠀and⠀clarifying,⠀not⠀a⠀global⠀attack⠀on⠀tradition.⠀Let⠀different⠀characters⠀respond⠀to⠀authority⠀differently⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀age,⠀role,⠀and⠀temperament.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀testifier's⠀language⠀and⠀community⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀story⠀world.⠀Use⠀the⠀world's⠀own⠀names⠀for⠀places,⠀trades,⠀rituals,⠀and⠀social⠀roles.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀new⠀religious,⠀magical,⠀or⠀political⠀context⠀unless⠀the⠀story⠀already⠀contains⠀it.⠀The⠀testimony⠀may⠀include⠀reported⠀speech⠀and⠀secondhand⠀accounts,⠀but⠀the⠀narrator⠀should⠀mark⠀these⠀as⠀reported⠀and⠀not⠀claim⠀access⠀to⠀minds⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀know.\n\nLet⠀the⠀retrospective⠀form⠀show⠀how⠀progression⠀changed⠀the⠀teller's⠀social⠀position:⠀a⠀skill⠀once⠀reserved⠀for⠀others,⠀a⠀responsibility⠀gradually⠀trusted⠀to⠀the⠀learner,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀incurred⠀for⠀training⠀now⠀paid⠀in⠀service.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀move⠀between⠀different⠀periods⠀if⠀the⠀transitions⠀are⠀clear.⠀End⠀a⠀section⠀after⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀brought⠀the⠀remembered⠀event⠀into⠀relation⠀with⠀their⠀current⠀understanding,⠀and⠀only⠀then⠀if⠀that⠀relation⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀on-going⠀story.⠀The⠀testimony⠀need⠀not⠀conclude⠀with⠀a⠀moral;⠀a⠀specific⠀realization⠀or⠀an⠀open⠀question⠀is⠀sufficient.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀each⠀new⠀attempt⠀directly⠀in⠀the⠀learner's⠀present⠀situation.⠀Open⠀with⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀do,⠀and⠀what⠀standard⠀they⠀are⠀measuring⠀against;⠀then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀attempt⠀without⠀a⠀long⠀preamble.⠀Use⠀short⠀paragraphs⠀and⠀clear⠀spatial⠀transitions⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀action.⠀When⠀the⠀scene⠀moves⠀from⠀practice⠀to⠀a⠀real⠀challenge,⠀make⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀location⠀or⠀stakes⠀obvious⠀in⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀concrete⠀details.\n\nShow⠀improvement⠀through⠀immediate⠀consequences.⠀After⠀the⠀attempt,⠀include⠀the⠀feedback⠀that⠀matters:⠀a⠀teacher's⠀comment,⠀a⠀task's⠀visible⠀result,⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀physical⠀or⠀mental⠀reaction,⠀or⠀the⠀changed⠀reaction⠀of⠀an⠀observer.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀realizes⠀they⠀have⠀improved,⠀prove⠀it⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀in⠀the⠀scene—not⠀by⠀an⠀inner⠀monologue⠀that⠀merely⠀announces⠀growth.⠀Let⠀failures⠀be⠀equally⠀concrete:⠀a⠀tool⠀slips,⠀a⠀timing⠀is⠀off,⠀a⠀memory⠀from⠀earlier⠀practice⠀fails⠀under⠀pressure.\n\nUse⠀Terry⠀Pratchett's⠀social⠀comedy⠀in⠀short,⠀character-specific⠀beats.⠀A⠀character⠀explains⠀why⠀the⠀method⠀should⠀work;⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀shows⠀the⠀opposite.⠀An⠀official⠀gives⠀a⠀formal⠀rule,⠀and⠀a⠀junior⠀character⠀finds⠀the⠀practical⠀exception⠀with⠀an⠀open⠀expression⠀of⠀surprise.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀particular⠀correction,⠀not⠀a⠀running⠀sarcastic⠀commentary⠀in⠀narration.⠀Different⠀characters⠀should⠀react⠀to⠀absurdity⠀differently:⠀one⠀may⠀laugh,⠀one⠀may⠀sigh⠀and⠀simply⠀fix⠀the⠀problem,⠀one⠀may⠀miss⠀it⠀entirely.\n\nWrite⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats⠀between⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀response—uncertainty,⠀relief,⠀embarrassment,⠀sudden⠀understanding—through⠀concrete⠀thought⠀or⠀sensation.⠀These⠀private⠀beats⠀should⠀not⠀stop⠀the⠀scene's⠀momentum⠀but⠀should⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀attempt⠀changes⠀the⠀character's⠀state.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀character's⠀ability⠀to⠀think⠀one⠀thing⠀and⠀say⠀another⠀when⠀there⠀is⠀a⠀reason,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀reaction⠀ironic⠀or⠀dishonest.\n\nAdvance⠀the⠀scene⠀until⠀the⠀current⠀attempt⠀has⠀produced⠀new⠀information⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀position.⠀If⠀the⠀attempt⠀succeeds,⠀show⠀the⠀immediate⠀gain⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀problem⠀it⠀reveals;⠀if⠀it⠀fails,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀knows⠀they⠀lack.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀point⠀after⠀the⠀result⠀has⠀landed,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀mandatory⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀that⠀one⠀concrete⠀step⠀in⠀a⠀developing⠀skill⠀has⠀occurred,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀already⠀visible⠀or⠀withheld⠀by⠀the⠀present⠀situation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀a⠀sensory⠀image⠀carry⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀improvement.⠀Before⠀a⠀capability⠀is⠀dependable,⠀let⠀a⠀smell,⠀a⠀texture,⠀a⠀resistance,⠀or⠀a⠀bodily⠀awareness⠀enter⠀and⠀develop;⠀after⠀it⠀changes,⠀present⠀a⠀new,⠀more⠀precise⠀sensory⠀threshold.⠀The⠀image⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀learner's⠀experience⠀present,⠀not⠀merely⠀decorate⠀the⠀action.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀lengthen⠀when⠀the⠀body⠀learns⠀gradually⠀and⠀shorten⠀when⠀a⠀corrected⠀move⠀becomes⠀automatic.⠀The⠀rhythm⠀of⠀a⠀sentence⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀attention,⠀not⠀replace⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Pratchett's⠀comic⠀correction⠀by⠀letting⠀institutions⠀misname⠀that⠀physical⠀learning.⠀A⠀committee⠀may⠀call⠀exhaustion⠀by⠀a⠀moral⠀name⠀or⠀a⠀teacher⠀may⠀announce⠀a⠀rule⠀while⠀the⠀actual⠀practice⠀quietly⠀contradicts⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀comic⠀exposure⠀reveal⠀a⠀real⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀institution's⠀categories⠀and⠀the⠀learner's⠀developing⠀abilities.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀character⠀into⠀a⠀witty⠀commentator;⠀the⠀humor⠀belongs⠀to⠀particular⠀interested⠀or⠀self-interested⠀persons,⠀and⠀it⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀genuine⠀discipline⠀and⠀genuine⠀fear.\n\nLet⠀recurring⠀images⠀mark⠀progress.⠀A⠀cramp⠀that⠀once⠀stopped⠀a⠀practice⠀can⠀become⠀an⠀expectation⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀arrives,⠀or⠀a⠀barely⠀noticed⠀improvement⠀can⠀be⠀fixed⠀in⠀memory⠀by⠀a⠀later⠀failure⠀that⠀shows⠀how⠀far⠀the⠀old⠀limit⠀has⠀been⠀left⠀behind.⠀When⠀the⠀next⠀stage⠀begins,⠀introduce⠀a⠀fresh⠀image⠀rather⠀than⠀repeating⠀the⠀earlier⠀one⠀mechanically.⠀Keep⠀the⠀story's⠀world⠀and⠀its⠀established⠀system⠀of⠀practice⠀coherent:⠀the⠀concrete⠀image⠀is⠀evidence⠀of⠀the⠀changed⠀capability,⠀not⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀causal⠀explanation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀progression⠀create⠀small⠀irreversible⠀changes⠀that⠀the⠀narration⠀notices⠀as⠀they⠀cross.⠀When⠀a⠀practice⠀becomes⠀automatic,⠀let⠀a⠀remembered⠀effort⠀surface⠀with⠀the⠀new⠀ease;⠀when⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀makes⠀an⠀old⠀technique⠀obsolete,⠀let⠀the⠀older⠀gesture⠀linger⠀in⠀memory.⠀Reflect⠀on⠀the⠀way⠀the⠀learner⠀now⠀inhabits⠀a⠀skill⠀that⠀once⠀required⠀struggle,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀present⠀pleasure⠀of⠀ordinary⠀competence⠀available.⠀The⠀reflective⠀movement⠀should⠀establish⠀a⠀concrete⠀before⠀and⠀after,⠀not⠀announce⠀that⠀all⠀change⠀is⠀loss.⠀A⠀failure⠀or⠀plateau⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀known⠀principle⠀and⠀executed⠀skill⠀emotionally⠀legible.\n\nUse⠀Pratchett's⠀institutional⠀eye⠀to⠀handle⠀those⠀changes⠀at⠀a⠀social⠀level.⠀A⠀record,⠀rank,⠀official⠀account,⠀or⠀bureaucratic⠀category⠀may⠀ignore⠀the⠀cost⠀the⠀learner⠀privately⠀remembers,⠀or⠀may⠀promote⠀a⠀simplified⠀version⠀of⠀the⠀growth.⠀Let⠀the⠀comedy⠀arise⠀from⠀that⠀mismatch:⠀someone⠀congratulates⠀the⠀protagonist⠀for⠀acquiring⠀what⠀they⠀no⠀longer⠀wanted,⠀or⠀the⠀institution⠀celebrates⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀the⠀learner⠀has⠀learned⠀to⠀work⠀around.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀reflection⠀elegiac;⠀a⠀sharp⠀practical⠀observation⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀melancholy.⠀Keep⠀distinct⠀characters'⠀relationships⠀to⠀change:⠀one⠀may⠀mourn⠀an⠀old⠀constraint,⠀another⠀may⠀find⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀liberating.\n\nLet⠀the⠀ending⠀of⠀an⠀exchange⠀rest⠀at⠀the⠀threshold⠀between⠀old⠀and⠀new⠀experience⠀without⠀demanding⠀a⠀resolution.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀hold⠀a⠀single⠀remembered⠀detail⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀continues.⠀The⠀reflective⠀voice⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀genuine⠀backward⠀glance,⠀but⠀the⠀ongoing⠀practical⠀world⠀remains⠀present.⠀Avoid⠀repeated⠀declarations⠀of⠀impermanence;⠀instead⠀let⠀one⠀concrete⠀occasion⠀stand⠀for⠀the⠀changed⠀relationship⠀between⠀past⠀and⠀present.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀framed⠀oral-storytelling⠀structure.⠀A⠀specific⠀teller⠀recounts⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀progression⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀audience,⠀and⠀the⠀frame⠀establishes⠀why⠀this⠀account⠀is⠀being⠀given⠀now.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀events⠀clear:⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀retell⠀an⠀episode⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀witness,⠀rely⠀on⠀a⠀direct⠀participant's⠀account,⠀or⠀interrupt⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀commentary.⠀The⠀learning⠀sequence⠀should⠀come⠀through⠀as⠀a⠀remembered⠀chain⠀of⠀attempts⠀and⠀results,⠀each⠀stage⠀anchored⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀occasion⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀bare⠀rank.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀mark⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀execute⠀it,⠀and⠀let⠀audience⠀interjections⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀reputation⠀of⠀the⠀learner⠀is⠀already⠀being⠀rewritten.\n\nLet⠀Pratchett's⠀satire⠀operate⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀institutional⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀repeat⠀an⠀official⠀explanation⠀and⠀immediately⠀undercut⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀detail,⠀or⠀narrate⠀a⠀guild⠀inspection,⠀license,⠀or⠀examination⠀that⠀misses⠀the⠀actual⠀skill⠀it⠀was⠀designed⠀to⠀record.⠀Use⠀comic⠀exposure⠀to⠀reveal⠀how⠀an⠀organization's⠀categories⠀lag⠀behind⠀a⠀developing⠀person.⠀The⠀humor⠀must⠀arise⠀from⠀this⠀specific⠀mismatch,⠀not⠀from⠀making⠀the⠀learner⠀ridiculous.⠀Keep⠀the⠀frame's⠀language⠀as⠀speech,⠀with⠀occasional⠀proverbs⠀or⠀formulaic⠀phrases⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀tradition,⠀but⠀avoid⠀inventing⠀a⠀homogenized⠀regional⠀voice.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tale⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀at⠀intervals.⠀A⠀remembered⠀failure⠀may⠀now⠀be⠀told⠀as⠀an⠀instructive⠀joke;⠀a⠀remembered⠀teacher⠀may⠀be⠀honored⠀with⠀an⠀epithet⠀that⠀the⠀audience⠀knows⠀is⠀only⠀partly⠀true.⠀As⠀the⠀capability⠀grows,⠀allow⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀shift⠀from⠀admiring⠀distance⠀to⠀almost-forgotten⠀detail.⠀This⠀framed⠀oral⠀method⠀is⠀the⠀route⠀chosen⠀from⠀the⠀regional⠀tradition;⠀do⠀not⠀blend⠀it⠀with⠀unrelated⠀folk⠀motifs⠀or⠀silent⠀interiority⠀from⠀the⠀focal⠀character.⠀Keep⠀the⠀progression⠀legible⠀through⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability,⠀and⠀end⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀teller⠀chooses⠀to⠀stop,⠀leaving⠀the⠀frame's⠀present⠀moment⠀visible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nShow⠀progression⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details.⠀Choose⠀concrete⠀markers⠀for⠀each⠀stage:⠀a⠀tool⠀that⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀reached⠀for,⠀a⠀cramp⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀arrive,⠀a⠀once-necessary⠀reminder⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀omitted.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀skip⠀intermediate⠀explanations⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀infer⠀from⠀the⠀changed⠀action.⠀A⠀long-rehearsed⠀sequence⠀can⠀finish⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀direct⠀sentence;⠀a⠀new⠀failure⠀can⠀be⠀given⠀one⠀clause⠀that⠀exposes⠀the⠀remaining⠀gap.⠀Keep⠀the⠀causality⠀legible:⠀the⠀omitted⠀material⠀must⠀be⠀recoverable⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀present.⠀Shortness⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀quota,⠀and⠀a⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀may⠀serve⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀fragmented⠀ones.\n\nUse⠀Pratchett's⠀comic⠀correction⠀in⠀the⠀smallest⠀available⠀unit.⠀A⠀posted⠀rule⠀can⠀describe⠀a⠀standard⠀the⠀actual⠀drill⠀no⠀longer⠀meets.⠀A⠀supervisor's⠀single⠀word⠀can⠀reveal⠀that⠀the⠀official⠀explanation⠀is⠀false.⠀Let⠀the⠀discrepancy⠀be⠀particular:⠀the⠀humor⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀joke⠀about⠀institutions⠀but⠀an⠀observed⠀difference⠀between⠀a⠀stated⠀category⠀and⠀a⠀practical⠀action.⠀Characters⠀keep⠀distinct⠀relations⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority,⠀so⠀a⠀clerk⠀may⠀take⠀the⠀rule⠀seriously⠀while⠀a⠀trainer⠀ignores⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀wit;⠀the⠀spare⠀style⠀should⠀let⠀a⠀plain⠀contradiction⠀do⠀comic⠀work.\n\nLet⠀the⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀progression⠀remain⠀concrete.⠀Instead⠀of⠀\"he⠀had⠀grown⠀stronger,\"⠀name⠀the⠀object⠀now⠀lifted⠀or⠀the⠀distance⠀now⠀traversed.⠀Instead⠀of⠀\"she⠀understood⠀the⠀principle,\"⠀show⠀the⠀corrected⠀grip⠀or⠀the⠀repeated⠀motion.⠀Where⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀rank⠀is⠀mentioned,⠀let⠀it⠀be⠀a⠀brief⠀institutional⠀sign⠀whose⠀practical⠀meaning⠀is⠀inferred.⠀This⠀method⠀keeps⠀the⠀stage⠀clear⠀of⠀subordinate⠀clauses⠀that⠀relabel⠀advancement⠀as⠀abstract⠀change.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀sustained⠀scenes⠀in⠀which⠀ordinary⠀work,⠀conversation,⠀and⠀practice⠀are⠀interwoven.⠀Let⠀a⠀training⠀session⠀include⠀interruptions,⠀requests,⠀and⠀practical⠀consequences;⠀a⠀breakthrough⠀can⠀occur⠀while⠀a⠀character⠀explains⠀a⠀concept⠀to⠀someone⠀else⠀or⠀while⠀a⠀familiar⠀obstacle⠀returns.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀inner⠀experience.⠀When⠀a⠀principle⠀becomes⠀executable,⠀stage⠀the⠀difference⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀the⠀thing⠀rather⠀than⠀announces⠀an⠀insight.⠀Keep⠀the⠀interiority⠀authorized⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀contract;⠀a⠀reasoning⠀moment⠀can⠀run⠀alongside⠀conversational⠀response⠀or⠀interrupt⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Pratchett's⠀profile⠀through⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀private⠀learning⠀and⠀public⠀representation.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀assessed⠀by⠀a⠀form,⠀rank,⠀or⠀official⠀description⠀that⠀misses⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀actually⠀learned.⠀Another⠀may⠀explain⠀the⠀same⠀practice⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀reveals⠀a⠀different⠀relationship⠀to⠀instruction⠀and⠀authority.⠀Let⠀the⠀comedy⠀arise⠀when⠀a⠀scene⠀exposes⠀that⠀gap⠀concretely:⠀a⠀teacher⠀repeats⠀a⠀rule⠀while⠀the⠀learner⠀has⠀already⠀found⠀a⠀practical⠀workaround,⠀or⠀an⠀official⠀congratulates⠀a⠀character⠀for⠀the⠀wrong⠀achievement.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀speaker⠀witty;⠀the⠀humor⠀belongs⠀to⠀particular⠀organizational⠀and⠀linguistic⠀habits,⠀and⠀the⠀scenes⠀should⠀allow⠀seriousness,⠀frustration,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀kindness.\n\nLet⠀paragraphs⠀establish⠀the⠀scene⠀first⠀and⠀then⠀follow⠀the⠀mind's⠀movement.⠀A⠀recollection⠀can⠀surface⠀when⠀prompted⠀by⠀a⠀present⠀detail,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀ongoing⠀activity⠀rather⠀than⠀dominate⠀every⠀paragraph.⠀The⠀chapter-scene⠀movement⠀should⠀keep⠀the⠀reader⠀oriented⠀without⠀explicit⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀End⠀an⠀exchange⠀at⠀whatever⠀point⠀the⠀ongoing⠀scene⠀naturally⠀pauses⠀or⠀continues;⠀no⠀scene⠀must⠀conclude⠀with⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀stage.⠀Progression⠀remains⠀legible⠀through⠀changed⠀capability,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀repeated⠀progress⠀report.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nUse⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀as⠀the⠀spine⠀of⠀the⠀progression⠀account.⠀Let⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀improvement⠀be⠀realized⠀in⠀a⠀scene⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀relationship:⠀a⠀shared⠀mistake,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀watching⠀the⠀other⠀train,⠀a⠀task⠀made⠀easier⠀by⠀one⠀person's⠀new⠀skill.⠀Private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀promise⠀of⠀the⠀pairing:⠀a⠀nickname,⠀a⠀repeated⠀word,⠀a⠀habit⠀that⠀changes⠀meaning⠀as⠀capability⠀grows.⠀Let⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀have⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀it⠀belongs.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise,⠀not⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.\n\nLet⠀Pratchett's⠀humor⠀surface⠀through⠀the⠀discrepancy⠀between⠀private⠀understanding⠀and⠀official⠀or⠀social⠀categories.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀ranked⠀by⠀a⠀guild,⠀taught⠀by⠀a⠀particular⠀authority,⠀or⠀described⠀in⠀public⠀terms⠀that⠀do⠀not⠀match⠀their⠀private⠀relationship.⠀The⠀other⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀difference⠀with⠀a⠀wry⠀aside,⠀or⠀the⠀institution⠀may⠀insist⠀on⠀a⠀standard⠀that⠀the⠀pair⠀has⠀already⠀worked⠀around.⠀Keep⠀the⠀comedy⠀specific:⠀a⠀private⠀joke⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀intimacy⠀even⠀during⠀a⠀training⠀scene,⠀and⠀an⠀official⠀can⠀misread⠀the⠀pair's⠀dynamic⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀uniform⠀fool.\n\nMake⠀progression⠀concrete⠀through⠀the⠀relationship's⠀consequences.⠀When⠀one⠀person⠀advances,⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀other⠀notices⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀ordinary⠀interaction:⠀less⠀need⠀to⠀wait,⠀a⠀new⠀way⠀of⠀asking,⠀a⠀new⠀possibility⠀for⠀shared⠀work.⠀Callbacks⠀should⠀fulfill⠀the⠀promise⠀established⠀earlier⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀repeat⠀it.⠀End⠀scenes⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀of⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀or⠀ongoing⠀tenderness,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀reply⠀to⠀conclude⠀with⠀a⠀confession,⠀an⠀argument,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀stage.⠀The⠀relationship⠀can⠀be⠀central⠀without⠀resolving⠀all⠀uncertainty⠀in⠀one⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nUse⠀the⠀saga's⠀retelling⠀form⠀to⠀make⠀progression⠀a⠀chronicle.⠀A⠀deliberate⠀opening⠀can⠀name⠀the⠀learner⠀and⠀the⠀skill⠀to⠀be⠀gained;⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀stage⠀(\"he⠀lifted⠀the⠀bar;⠀he⠀did⠀not⠀lift⠀it⠀twice\").⠀Let⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀change⠀its⠀application⠀as⠀the⠀capability⠀grows.⠀What⠀is⠀remembered⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀actual⠀deeds:⠀repeated⠀practice,⠀a⠀first⠀success,⠀a⠀stubborn⠀failure,⠀a⠀made⠀thing.⠀Do⠀not⠀call⠀a⠀person⠀a⠀hero⠀before⠀the⠀audience⠀has⠀seen⠀the⠀deed⠀that⠀earns⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀knowledge⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀chosen⠀perspective⠀and⠀the⠀oral⠀route.\n\nLet⠀Pratchett's⠀satire⠀intervene⠀in⠀the⠀telling's⠀register.⠀A⠀formal⠀phrase⠀may⠀be⠀undercut⠀by⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀detail⠀the⠀teller⠀cannot⠀suppress:⠀the⠀legendary⠀lift,⠀but⠀his⠀back⠀still⠀hurt;⠀the⠀famous⠀duel,⠀but⠀she⠀had⠀skipped⠀breakfast.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀chronicler's⠀or⠀audience's⠀habit⠀of⠀inflating⠀a⠀training⠀event⠀into⠀a⠀legend⠀while⠀the⠀concrete⠀particulars⠀resist⠀it.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀learner⠀into⠀a⠀fool;⠀the⠀accurate⠀deed⠀can⠀be⠀impressive⠀and⠀still⠀less⠀than⠀the⠀received⠀story.⠀Let⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀official⠀explanation⠀and⠀practical⠀reality⠀appear⠀as⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀saga's⠀formula⠀and⠀the⠀learner's⠀actual⠀memory.\n\nLet⠀the⠀chronicle⠀be⠀ordered⠀by⠀recurrence⠀rather⠀than⠀linear⠀report.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀can⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀new⠀stage⠀is⠀reached;⠀a⠀remembered⠀failure⠀can⠀be⠀invoked⠀before⠀a⠀later⠀success.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀fixed⠀pantheon,⠀doom,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀dialogue⠀into⠀every⠀speaker.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀relationship⠀details.⠀An⠀ending⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀next⠀deed⠀available⠀for⠀retelling⠀rather⠀than⠀declare⠀the⠀legend⠀complete.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀Swedish⠀municipal⠀adult-education⠀workshop⠀narrative,⠀in⠀the⠀social-realist⠀mode⠀of⠀a⠀specific⠀institution:⠀a⠀komvux⠀vocational⠀workshop⠀where⠀adults⠀retrain⠀in⠀a⠀practical⠀trade.⠀Keep⠀the⠀Swedish⠀context⠀particular⠀through⠀its⠀institutional⠀language—utvecklingssamtal,⠀individuell⠀studieplan,⠀betygskriterier,⠀handledare—not⠀through⠀landscape⠀or⠀weather.⠀Show⠀advancement⠀through⠀repeated⠀attempts,⠀supervised⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀small⠀increases⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀actually⠀do:⠀the⠀first⠀clean⠀result,⠀the⠀task⠀finished⠀without⠀help,⠀the⠀responsibility⠀accepted⠀after⠀weeks⠀of⠀corrections.\n\nLet⠀the⠀institution's⠀official⠀language⠀about⠀competence,⠀development⠀plans,⠀and⠀advancement⠀run⠀slightly⠀ahead⠀of⠀the⠀lived⠀reality.⠀Use⠀the⠀Pratchettian⠀comic⠀correction⠀to⠀expose⠀that⠀gap⠀through⠀particular⠀institutional⠀behavior:⠀a⠀progress⠀report⠀praising⠀a⠀skill⠀only⠀visible⠀under⠀supervision;⠀a⠀certificate⠀marking⠀paperwork⠀completed⠀rather⠀than⠀work⠀mastered;⠀a⠀handledare⠀citing⠀the⠀individuell⠀studieplan⠀as⠀if⠀the⠀document⠀had⠀performed⠀the⠀work.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀make⠀that⠀specific⠀institutional⠀behavior⠀legible,⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀character⠀into⠀a⠀witty⠀commentator.\n\nUse⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀scenes⠀to⠀measure⠀change⠀outside⠀formal⠀assessment.⠀A⠀colleague⠀begins⠀asking⠀for⠀help,⠀a⠀routine⠀no⠀longer⠀needs⠀checking,⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀notices⠀a⠀different⠀kind⠀of⠀attentiveness.⠀Keep⠀these⠀consequences⠀grounded⠀in⠀ordinary⠀needs⠀and⠀relationships;⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀betrayal,⠀a⠀comfort⠀trap,⠀or⠀a⠀loyalty⠀crisis.\n\nDistinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it,⠀and⠀allow⠀uneven⠀development.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀understand⠀the⠀correct⠀method⠀long⠀before⠀their⠀hands⠀can⠀carry⠀it⠀out,⠀or⠀perform⠀well⠀in⠀practice⠀but⠀freeze⠀during⠀a⠀real⠀assignment.⠀Show⠀the⠀particular⠀gap⠀each⠀time⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀confidence⠀arc.⠀Advancement⠀may⠀improve⠀one⠀area⠀while⠀another⠀remains⠀difficult,⠀and⠀the⠀narrative⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀partial⠀result,⠀a⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀changed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀each⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀progression⠀event⠀in⠀a⠀physical-skill⠀learning⠀arc:⠀a⠀practice⠀session,⠀a⠀supervised⠀attempt,⠀a⠀failed⠀execution,⠀a⠀correction,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀when⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀what⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀before.⠀Use⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀improvement⠀visible⠀without⠀explaining⠀it⠀in⠀dialogue.⠀Show⠀the⠀attempt⠀and⠀then⠀the⠀changed⠀result—the⠀hands⠀that⠀fumbled⠀now⠀steady,⠀the⠀sequence⠀that⠀broke⠀off⠀now⠀completed,⠀the⠀tool⠀that⠀needed⠀supervision⠀now⠀handled⠀alone.\n\nUse⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues⠀and⠀dialogue⠀that⠀fits⠀each⠀character's⠀relationship⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority.⠀The⠀Pratchettian⠀comedy⠀should⠀expose⠀a⠀particular⠀gap:⠀an⠀instructor⠀giving⠀official⠀encouragement⠀that⠀contradicts⠀the⠀visible⠀struggle,⠀an⠀administrator⠀praising⠀a⠀completed⠀form⠀instead⠀of⠀completed⠀work,⠀or⠀a⠀colleague⠀using⠀jargon⠀to⠀hide⠀uncertainty.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀a⠀witty⠀commentator;⠀the⠀wit⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀institutional⠀self-presentation⠀and⠀its⠀collision⠀with⠀practical⠀reality.\n\nSeparate⠀the⠀visible⠀action⠀from⠀any⠀required⠀private⠀interiority.⠀A⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience—the⠀fear⠀of⠀failure,⠀the⠀realization⠀of⠀what⠀just⠀changed,⠀the⠀decision⠀to⠀try⠀again—without⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀dialogue⠀or⠀giving⠀other⠀characters⠀access⠀to⠀it.⠀Use⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀or⠀a⠀cut⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀truly⠀needs⠀it,⠀never⠀as⠀a⠀default⠀way⠀to⠀tell⠀us⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀thinking.\n\nPlace⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀and⠀use⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀through-line:⠀later⠀scenes⠀can⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀familiar⠀setting⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀person⠀now⠀handling⠀a⠀task⠀differently.⠀Keep⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀uneven;⠀the⠀same⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀skilled⠀at⠀one⠀component⠀and⠀still⠀clumsy⠀at⠀another.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀after⠀a⠀result,⠀an⠀interruption,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀acknowledgment,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀forced⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀epiphany.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nLet⠀progression⠀happen⠀through⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen⠀and⠀heard⠀on⠀a⠀stage⠀in⠀a⠀physical-skill⠀learning⠀arc.⠀Show⠀a⠀character⠀attempting⠀the⠀same⠀practical⠀task⠀at⠀different⠀moments:⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀with⠀fumbling,⠀the⠀later⠀time⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀grip,⠀a⠀steadier⠀hand,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀sequence.⠀Use⠀props⠀and⠀blocking⠀to⠀make⠀improvement⠀legible⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀it⠀in⠀dialogue.⠀The⠀character⠀who⠀once⠀needed⠀the⠀supervisor⠀to⠀hand⠀them⠀the⠀tool⠀now⠀crosses⠀to⠀the⠀bench⠀and⠀takes⠀it⠀themselves;⠀the⠀sequence⠀that⠀once⠀broke⠀off⠀now⠀runs⠀to⠀its⠀end.\n\nGive⠀each⠀character⠀a⠀distinct⠀relationship⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority.⠀A⠀supervisor⠀may⠀speak⠀in⠀official⠀development⠀phrases,⠀a⠀colleague⠀may⠀be⠀blunt,⠀and⠀the⠀learner's⠀own⠀speech⠀may⠀lag⠀behind⠀their⠀physical⠀skill.⠀Let⠀Pratchettian⠀comedy⠀reveal⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀official⠀explanations⠀and⠀practical⠀reality:⠀a⠀training⠀certificate⠀presented⠀before⠀the⠀skill⠀is⠀reliable,⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀sounds⠀sensible⠀until⠀someone⠀tries⠀to⠀perform⠀it,⠀an⠀exit⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀previously⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀character⠀but⠀is⠀now.\n\nUse⠀monologues⠀and⠀asides⠀only⠀with⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose.⠀If⠀private⠀experience⠀is⠀required,⠀keep⠀it⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀hears;⠀do⠀not⠀disguise⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀speech⠀another⠀character⠀conveniently⠀ignores.⠀A⠀pause⠀or⠀a⠀look⠀can⠀suggest⠀feeling,⠀but⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀thought,⠀if⠀needed,⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀spoken.\n\nWrite⠀scene⠀changes⠀and⠀entrances⠀clearly⠀so⠀the⠀progression⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀through⠀the⠀play's⠀physical⠀space.⠀End⠀scenes⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt,⠀an⠀interruption,⠀or⠀a⠀silent⠀recognition⠀of⠀change.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀moral,⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀at⠀every⠀exit.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀the⠀learner's⠀active⠀mind.⠀Braid⠀the⠀physical⠀sensations⠀of⠀a⠀current⠀attempt—the⠀pressure⠀in⠀the⠀hands,⠀the⠀uneven⠀breath,⠀the⠀small⠀muscular⠀correction—with⠀remembered⠀instructions,⠀imagined⠀future⠀outcomes,⠀and⠀recurring⠀phrases⠀from⠀a⠀supervisor⠀or⠀an⠀official⠀manual.⠀Let⠀the⠀syntax⠀follow⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀attention:⠀a⠀long⠀sentence⠀can⠀stretch⠀through⠀a⠀difficult⠀sequence,⠀then⠀break⠀off⠀when⠀the⠀body⠀fails.\n\nShow⠀progression⠀through⠀the⠀changing⠀texture⠀of⠀these⠀associations.⠀An⠀early⠀episode⠀returns⠀again⠀and⠀again⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀warning;⠀later⠀recollections⠀include⠀a⠀moment⠀when⠀the⠀warning⠀became⠀unnecessary.⠀Distinguish⠀memory,⠀anticipation,⠀and⠀actual⠀present⠀action⠀clearly⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀knows⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀replayed.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀scene⠀fact⠀indeterminate;⠀the⠀floor⠀is⠀real,⠀the⠀task⠀is⠀real,⠀and⠀the⠀failure⠀is⠀real.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Pratchettian⠀comedy⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀mind's⠀collision⠀with⠀institutional⠀language.⠀The⠀official⠀phrase⠀'gradual⠀development'⠀may⠀replay⠀just⠀as⠀the⠀character⠀drops⠀a⠀tool⠀for⠀the⠀third⠀time;⠀a⠀checklist⠀from⠀the⠀training⠀manual⠀may⠀be⠀recited⠀internally⠀while⠀the⠀body⠀does⠀something⠀entirely⠀different.⠀Each⠀comic⠀correction⠀should⠀expose⠀a⠀specific⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀official⠀account⠀of⠀competence⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀of⠀trying.\n\nKeep⠀uneven⠀growth⠀visible⠀through⠀recurring⠀but⠀shifting⠀associations:⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀may⠀once⠀trigger⠀anxiety⠀and⠀later⠀trigger⠀only⠀mild⠀checking.⠀A⠀private⠀thought⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀skill⠀has⠀become⠀automatic⠀without⠀any⠀formal⠀announcement.⠀End⠀inside⠀an⠀unfinished⠀attempt,⠀a⠀returning⠀memory,⠀or⠀a⠀bodily⠀pause,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀moral⠀summary⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀epiphany.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀messages:⠀early⠀questions,⠀repeated⠀corrections,⠀practice⠀logs,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀feedback,⠀and⠀later⠀reports⠀of⠀completed⠀work.⠀Let⠀the⠀timestamps⠀and⠀delays⠀matter⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀show⠀changed⠀capability—an⠀answer⠀that⠀once⠀took⠀hours⠀and⠀now⠀takes⠀minutes,⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀help⠀replaced⠀by⠀a⠀confident⠀one-line⠀update.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀message⠀dramatic;⠀sometimes⠀the⠀progression⠀is⠀an⠀ordinary⠀shift⠀from⠀\"tried⠀again,⠀still⠀bad\"⠀to⠀\"done,⠀thanks⠀for⠀the⠀tip.\"\n\nLet⠀each⠀person's⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution.⠀A⠀supervisor⠀may⠀write⠀in⠀full⠀official⠀sentences;⠀a⠀colleague⠀may⠀use⠀abbreviations⠀and⠀no⠀punctuation;⠀the⠀learner's⠀own⠀style⠀may⠀gradually⠀become⠀more⠀assured⠀without⠀turning⠀them⠀into⠀a⠀different⠀person.⠀Use⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀a⠀deleted⠀message,⠀and⠀a⠀sent⠀one⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀matters.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀may⠀show⠀private⠀hesitation⠀or⠀a⠀harsh⠀self-correction;⠀a⠀deleted⠀message⠀may⠀be⠀replaced⠀by⠀a⠀politer⠀or⠀more⠀accurate⠀version,⠀but⠀not⠀every⠀line⠀needs⠀an⠀interface⠀event.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Pratchettian⠀comedy⠀emerge⠀from⠀institutional⠀messaging⠀itself.⠀A⠀workplace⠀channel⠀may⠀demand⠀formal⠀status⠀updates⠀that⠀bear⠀no⠀relation⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀actually⠀did;⠀an⠀automated⠀reminder⠀may⠀congratulate⠀a⠀person⠀for⠀completing⠀a⠀module⠀they⠀failed⠀in⠀practice;⠀a⠀manager⠀may⠀praise⠀a⠀\"consistent⠀growth⠀trajectory\"⠀immediately⠀after⠀the⠀learner⠀describes⠀a⠀disaster.⠀The⠀comedy⠀should⠀expose⠀a⠀specific⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀formatted⠀language⠀of⠀progress⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀reality⠀of⠀learning.\n\nWhen⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀needed,⠀mark⠀it⠀clearly⠀as⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀transcript:⠀an⠀ordinary⠀narrator's⠀paragraph⠀can⠀say⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀was⠀doing⠀while⠀typing,⠀what⠀a⠀message⠀meant,⠀or⠀what⠀private⠀thought⠀accompanied⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀ask⠀for⠀help.⠀Do⠀not⠀pretend⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀was⠀transmitted⠀to⠀another⠀character.⠀End⠀after⠀a⠀meaningful⠀message,⠀a⠀delayed⠀reply,⠀or⠀a⠀simple⠀acknowledgment,⠀not⠀on⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalayba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀visually⠀legible⠀attempts.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀open⠀with⠀a⠀short⠀description⠀of⠀the⠀physical⠀task,⠀then⠀move⠀through⠀an⠀attempt,⠀a⠀mistake,⠀a⠀correction,⠀and⠀a⠀changed⠀result.⠀Use⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀now:⠀the⠀grip⠀that⠀finally⠀feels⠀right,⠀the⠀supervisor's⠀narrowed⠀eyes,⠀the⠀small⠀shift⠀from⠀needing⠀help⠀to⠀offering⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀improvement⠀in⠀dialogue⠀unless⠀the⠀spoken⠀line⠀has⠀a⠀practical⠀reason.\n\nMake⠀each⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀serve⠀the⠀current⠀attempt.⠀A⠀familiar⠀workshop⠀with⠀a⠀cluttered⠀bench⠀can⠀return⠀later⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀bench⠀now⠀cleared⠀because⠀the⠀learner⠀has⠀taken⠀responsibility;⠀a⠀colleague's⠀skeptical⠀expression⠀can⠀give⠀way⠀to⠀a⠀nod⠀after⠀a⠀task⠀is⠀done⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀nod⠀into⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator.⠀Let⠀scene⠀changes⠀be⠀legible⠀and⠀connected⠀to⠀the⠀progression,⠀not⠀arbitrary⠀jumps.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀Pratchettian⠀comedy⠀focused⠀on⠀institutions⠀and⠀their⠀official⠀language.⠀A⠀completion⠀certificate⠀may⠀be⠀handed⠀over⠀before⠀the⠀task⠀is⠀actually⠀mastered;⠀a⠀manual's⠀formal⠀instructions⠀may⠀be⠀memorized⠀perfectly⠀while⠀the⠀learner⠀still⠀fumbles⠀the⠀physical⠀step.⠀Each⠀comic⠀beat⠀should⠀reveal⠀a⠀specific⠀gap⠀between⠀official⠀explanations⠀and⠀practical⠀reality.⠀Not⠀every⠀character⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀witty;⠀let⠀their⠀different⠀relationships⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority⠀come⠀through⠀in⠀dialogue.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀thought⠀available⠀through⠀focal⠀narration⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀public⠀to⠀other⠀characters.⠀A⠀learner⠀can⠀think⠀\"I⠀finally⠀understand⠀the⠀order\"⠀while⠀a⠀colleague⠀cannot⠀know⠀it.⠀Preserve⠀uneven⠀development:⠀one⠀skill⠀may⠀improve⠀while⠀another⠀remains⠀difficult,⠀and⠀a⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀partial⠀success,⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀help,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀realization.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaybb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nGive⠀each⠀installment⠀at⠀least⠀one⠀concrete⠀advancement⠀event:⠀a⠀supervised⠀practice⠀session,⠀a⠀feedback⠀conversation,⠀a⠀new⠀resource⠀obtained,⠀a⠀task⠀completed⠀with⠀less⠀help,⠀or⠀a⠀mistake⠀that⠀teaches⠀something⠀specific.⠀Let⠀the⠀through-line⠀be⠀the⠀question⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀is⠀now⠀able⠀to⠀do,⠀not⠀a⠀sudden⠀burst⠀of⠀power.⠀When⠀a⠀reader⠀enters⠀mid-story,⠀briefly⠀recover⠀the⠀current⠀task,⠀the⠀learner's⠀last⠀known⠀capability,⠀and⠀the⠀relationship⠀with⠀the⠀supervising⠀person—only⠀what⠀is⠀needed⠀to⠀understand⠀the⠀attempt.\n\nLet⠀ordinary⠀work⠀and⠀relationships⠀carry⠀the⠀progression.⠀The⠀learner⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀trainee⠀in⠀a⠀repair⠀shop,⠀a⠀care⠀facility,⠀or⠀a⠀municipal⠀office;⠀improvement⠀appears⠀in⠀how⠀they⠀now⠀handle⠀a⠀regular⠀assignment,⠀answer⠀a⠀colleague's⠀question,⠀or⠀manage⠀a⠀deadline.⠀Show⠀changed⠀capability⠀through⠀observable⠀action:⠀a⠀formerly⠀hesitant⠀person⠀now⠀moves⠀first,⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀required⠀supervision⠀is⠀done⠀alone.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀ranking⠀system⠀or⠀numerical⠀counters⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀has⠀them.\n\nUse⠀Pratchettian⠀comedy⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀official⠀progress⠀reporting⠀and⠀practical⠀reality.⠀A⠀supervisor⠀may⠀praise⠀a⠀\"noticeable⠀improvement\"⠀just⠀before⠀the⠀learner⠀makes⠀the⠀same⠀mistake⠀again;⠀an⠀administrative⠀system⠀may⠀record⠀completion⠀percentages⠀that⠀bear⠀little⠀relation⠀to⠀actual⠀skill.⠀The⠀comic⠀correction⠀should⠀point⠀at⠀the⠀institution,⠀not⠀mock⠀the⠀learner's⠀effort.⠀Keep⠀the⠀humor⠀in⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀documents,⠀forms,⠀and⠀the⠀lived⠀work.\n\nInclude⠀occasional⠀hooks⠀that⠀arise⠀from⠀progress:⠀a⠀new⠀responsibility⠀that⠀is⠀slightly⠀too⠀large,⠀a⠀skill⠀that⠀unlocks⠀a⠀more⠀difficult⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀discovered⠀gap⠀that⠀needs⠀a⠀different⠀kind⠀of⠀practice.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀complete⠀resolution⠀in⠀every⠀installment.⠀An⠀update⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀quiet⠀acknowledgment,⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀remains⠀unanswered,⠀or⠀the⠀beginning⠀of⠀a⠀new⠀attempt.⠀Preserve⠀uneven⠀development;⠀the⠀same⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀reliable⠀in⠀one⠀area⠀and⠀still⠀fumbling⠀in⠀another.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀advancement⠀as⠀something⠀that⠀enters⠀the⠀space⠀between⠀people⠀and⠀makes⠀old⠀wounds⠀audible.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀improves,⠀show⠀which⠀threshold⠀they⠀have⠀truly⠀crossed⠀and⠀which⠀old⠀failure⠀now⠀has⠀sharper⠀edges:⠀a⠀technique⠀mastered,⠀a⠀mentor's⠀dismissal⠀remembered,⠀a⠀sibling's⠀jealousy⠀no⠀longer⠀covered⠀by⠀polite⠀silence.⠀Let⠀practice⠀resemble⠀an⠀argument⠀with⠀the⠀self⠀and⠀with⠀everyone⠀who⠀has⠀previously⠀doubted⠀the⠀attempt.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile's⠀direct⠀inquiry⠀as⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀emotional⠀realism,⠀but⠀keep⠀it⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀character.⠀If⠀the⠀narration⠀is⠀first-person,⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀ask⠀why⠀a⠀lesson⠀must⠀cost⠀this⠀much,⠀why⠀a⠀breakthrough⠀does⠀not⠀produce⠀gratitude,⠀or⠀why⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀should⠀be⠀proud⠀is⠀instead⠀inspecting⠀the⠀improvement⠀for⠀defects.⠀If⠀the⠀contract⠀permits⠀only⠀one⠀focal⠀mind,⠀that⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀carries⠀the⠀question;⠀other⠀characters'⠀motives⠀stay⠀visible⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀and⠀do.⠀Allow⠀an⠀observation⠀to⠀be⠀lucid,⠀precise,⠀and⠀painful⠀rather⠀than⠀vague⠀or⠀melodramatic.⠀The⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀training⠀rule⠀can⠀surface⠀as⠀hurt:⠀the⠀exercise⠀that⠀repairs⠀mana⠀circulation⠀also⠀revives⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀being⠀told⠀to⠀sit⠀still⠀and⠀stop⠀disturbing⠀the⠀household.\n\nMake⠀the⠀style's⠀emotional⠀turbulence⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀structure⠀of⠀scenes,⠀not⠀only⠀in⠀adjectives.⠀A⠀conversation⠀may⠀start⠀with⠀genuine⠀relief,⠀move⠀through⠀a⠀recounted⠀breakthrough,⠀then⠀be⠀punctured⠀by⠀a⠀withheld⠀name,⠀a⠀delayed⠀apology,⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀whether⠀the⠀change⠀was⠀meant⠀to⠀benefit⠀anyone⠀else.⠀Comfort⠀may⠀be⠀partial⠀and⠀awkward;⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀hold⠀another's⠀hand⠀while⠀still⠀knowing⠀they⠀will⠀not⠀say⠀the⠀necessary⠀sentence.⠀Let⠀strain⠀alter⠀subsequent⠀behavior:⠀the⠀victor⠀of⠀a⠀sparring⠀match⠀eats⠀alone,⠀the⠀newly⠀advanced⠀student⠀avoids⠀the⠀teacher⠀who⠀once⠀called⠀them⠀useless,⠀the⠀lover⠀prepares⠀a⠀congratulatory⠀meal⠀and⠀then⠀finds⠀the⠀timing⠀wrong.\n\nRespect⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀person⠀throughout.⠀A⠀first-person⠀account⠀may⠀admit⠀longing⠀or⠀shame⠀in⠀plain⠀terms⠀because⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀see⠀it;⠀do⠀not⠀grant⠀that⠀intimacy⠀to⠀minds⠀the⠀contract⠀excludes.⠀Keep⠀all⠀private⠀thought⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀fictional⠀private⠀experience,⠀not⠀a⠀summary⠀or⠀an⠀unsent⠀document.⠀Progress⠀remains⠀uneven—one⠀skill⠀leaps⠀forward⠀while⠀another⠀stays⠀blocked—and⠀the⠀unevenness⠀itself⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀cause⠀of⠀conflict.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀reply⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀emotional⠀beat⠀has⠀landed,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀outcome⠀remains⠀unresolved.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀waiting⠀for⠀an⠀answer,⠀may⠀walk⠀away⠀mid-question,⠀or⠀may⠀sit⠀down⠀beside⠀someone⠀and⠀not⠀yet⠀speak.⠀No⠀confession⠀or⠀repair⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀as⠀a⠀legible,⠀collaborative⠀scene⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀speaker⠀attribution.⠀Let⠀progression⠀occur⠀through⠀direct⠀interaction:⠀a⠀training⠀attempt,⠀a⠀feedback⠀exchange,⠀a⠀failed⠀demonstration,⠀or⠀a⠀resource⠀decision⠀can⠀all⠀carry⠀the⠀scene.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀states⠀a⠀principle,⠀promptly⠀distinguish⠀knowing⠀it⠀from⠀executing⠀it.⠀A⠀student⠀may⠀recite⠀the⠀correct⠀breathing⠀pattern⠀and⠀then⠀spoil⠀the⠀first⠀attempt;⠀a⠀rival⠀may⠀explain⠀the⠀counter-technique⠀beautifully⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀caught⠀by⠀a⠀plain⠀strike.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile's⠀direct⠀and⠀irreverent⠀questioning⠀as⠀a⠀voice⠀in⠀the⠀conversation,⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀particular⠀speakers⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits.⠀If⠀the⠀player⠀character⠀is⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀would⠀ask⠀why⠀the⠀useful⠀lesson⠀is⠀hidden⠀inside⠀a⠀humiliating⠀drill,⠀or⠀whether⠀the⠀method's⠀real⠀purpose⠀is⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀strong⠀feel⠀disciplined,⠀let⠀that⠀question⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀player's⠀chosen⠀words⠀and⠀register.⠀If⠀an⠀NPC⠀asks⠀it,⠀keep⠀the⠀candor⠀specific⠀to⠀that⠀NPC's⠀position⠀and⠀history.⠀Let⠀the⠀reply⠀be⠀candid⠀and⠀specific,⠀in⠀that⠀character's⠀register.⠀Black⠀humor⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀voices⠀that⠀would⠀actually⠀use⠀it:⠀a⠀veteran⠀can⠀laugh⠀at⠀the⠀recruit's⠀bruised⠀pride,⠀while⠀the⠀recruit⠀may⠀only⠀realize⠀weeks⠀later⠀that⠀the⠀joke⠀contained⠀the⠀actual⠀advice.\n\nKeep⠀advancement⠀uneven⠀and⠀visible⠀in⠀each⠀reply's⠀small⠀action⠀beats.⠀One⠀skill⠀improves⠀while⠀another⠀remains⠀blocked;⠀the⠀character⠀who⠀finally⠀lands⠀a⠀blow⠀may⠀still⠀flinch⠀at⠀a⠀raised⠀stern.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀to⠀separate⠀speakers⠀and⠀actions⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀without⠀rereading.⠀Do⠀not⠀append⠀a⠀system⠀message,⠀dice⠀roll,⠀or⠀status⠀menu.⠀Preserve⠀whichever⠀narrative⠀person⠀and⠀player⠀control⠀are⠀active.\n\nLeave⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀practice⠀bout⠀may⠀pause⠀with⠀the⠀question⠀of⠀whether⠀the⠀student⠀will⠀try⠀again⠀tomorrow;⠀a⠀mentor⠀may⠀finish⠀a⠀warning⠀and⠀turn⠀away⠀to⠀eat;⠀a⠀companion⠀may⠀offer⠀a⠀bandage⠀without⠀saying⠀why.⠀The⠀next⠀move⠀remains⠀open,⠀not⠀pre-selected.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀classical⠀episodic⠀route⠀as⠀a⠀narrative⠀organization,⠀not⠀a⠀relocation⠀of⠀the⠀supplied⠀world's⠀setting,⠀language,⠀or⠀cast.⠀Tell⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀connected⠀chapters,⠀each⠀built⠀around⠀a⠀named⠀training⠀attempt,⠀trial,⠀journey⠀stage,⠀or⠀exchange.⠀Open⠀an⠀episode⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀orientation—who⠀is⠀involved,⠀where⠀the⠀difficulty⠀sits,⠀and⠀what⠀accomplishment⠀is⠀being⠀attempted.⠀Close⠀it⠀when⠀the⠀attempt⠀has⠀produced⠀a⠀definite⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀or⠀a⠀truthful⠀account⠀of⠀why⠀it⠀has⠀not.⠀Link⠀episodes⠀by⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀simply⠀repeating⠀rank-ups⠀or⠀adding⠀new⠀systems.⠀A⠀failed⠀impersonation⠀of⠀a⠀sect's⠀founder⠀can⠀lead⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀chapter's⠀realization⠀about⠀gesture,⠀not⠀just⠀a⠀larger⠀fall.\n\nCombine⠀this⠀route⠀with⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile⠀by⠀making⠀the⠀puncturing⠀of⠀solemn⠀assumptions⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀episode's⠀argument.⠀When⠀a⠀manual,⠀master,⠀or⠀inherited⠀rule⠀is⠀treated⠀as⠀sacred,⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀ask⠀what⠀practical⠀problem⠀the⠀rule⠀actually⠀solved.⠀Use⠀the⠀episodic⠀form⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀a⠀principle⠀recited⠀with⠀authority⠀and⠀the⠀same⠀principle⠀tested⠀under⠀fatigue.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀why⠀a⠀method⠀exists⠀and⠀where⠀it⠀is⠀merely⠀flattery⠀of⠀those⠀who⠀created⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀improvement⠀challenging⠀and⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀world's⠀reality.⠀A⠀chapter⠀may⠀show⠀a⠀character⠀learning⠀to⠀maintain⠀a⠀steady⠀rhythm⠀under⠀a⠀particular⠀pressure;⠀authority⠀figures⠀can⠀name⠀the⠀change⠀without⠀invoking⠀an⠀invented⠀numerical⠀interface.⠀The⠀classical⠀route⠀supports⠀recurring⠀phrases⠀and⠀chapter⠀titles,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀recurrence⠀substitute⠀for⠀a⠀changed⠀achievement.⠀Humor⠀and⠀candor⠀remain⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀the⠀character⠀who⠀speaks⠀them,⠀and⠀all⠀private⠀thought⠀must⠀fit⠀the⠀active⠀narrative⠀person⠀and⠀contract.\n\nEnd⠀a⠀chapter⠀with⠀a⠀stable⠀pause⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀next⠀question:⠀a⠀teacher⠀asks⠀who⠀taught⠀you⠀the⠀banned⠀form;⠀a⠀companion⠀notices⠀the⠀new⠀calluses⠀and⠀says⠀nothing;⠀the⠀narrator⠀questions⠀whether⠀the⠀improvement⠀was⠀worth⠀the⠀debt.⠀The⠀next⠀episode⠀may⠀answer⠀or⠀defer;⠀no⠀confession,⠀moral⠀tag,⠀or⠀lesson⠀speech⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀progression⠀through⠀hard-edged,⠀concrete⠀scenes⠀with⠀forceful⠀transitions.⠀Each⠀attempt⠀has⠀material⠀consequences:⠀torn⠀skin,⠀a⠀cracked⠀training⠀sword,⠀a⠀ruined⠀ration,⠀a⠀technique⠀that⠀succeeds⠀once⠀and⠀then⠀fails⠀exactly⠀where⠀the⠀body⠀is⠀weakest.⠀Name⠀the⠀practical⠀wear⠀rather⠀than⠀decorating⠀it⠀with⠀abstraction.⠀When⠀a⠀breakthrough⠀comes,⠀show⠀the⠀immediate⠀gain⠀and⠀the⠀new⠀exposure⠀it⠀creates.⠀The⠀same⠀stance⠀that⠀defeats⠀an⠀opponent⠀can⠀exhaust⠀the⠀user⠀against⠀the⠀next⠀one,⠀once⠀the⠀compressed⠀paragraph⠀registers⠀the⠀cost.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile's⠀direct⠀inquiry⠀as⠀a⠀sardonic⠀pressure⠀inside⠀the⠀prose,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀separate⠀moral⠀essay.⠀The⠀narrator⠀or⠀a⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀ask⠀why⠀the⠀manual⠀labels⠀a⠀simple⠀cost⠀as⠀spiritual⠀purity,⠀or⠀whether⠀a⠀sect's⠀proud⠀lineage⠀is⠀just⠀a⠀list⠀of⠀people⠀who⠀survived⠀the⠀same⠀broken⠀drill.⠀Deliver⠀the⠀question⠀in⠀one⠀clean⠀sentence;⠀do⠀not⠀leave⠀it⠀floating⠀as⠀a⠀general⠀tone.⠀The⠀absurdity⠀should⠀be⠀grounded⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀rule,⠀rank,⠀or⠀venerated⠀object⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀world.\n\nMaintain⠀variable⠀rhythm.⠀Keep⠀a⠀longer⠀passage⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀about⠀footwork,⠀mana,⠀or⠀an⠀opponent's⠀habit⠀needs⠀that⠀room;⠀then⠀cut⠀to⠀a⠀short⠀sentence—'The⠀second⠀strike⠀bent⠀her⠀knee'—when⠀action⠀or⠀realization⠀lands.⠀Dialogue⠀remains⠀stingy⠀unless⠀the⠀speaker⠀is⠀naturally⠀talkative,⠀and⠀force⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀noise.⠀A⠀quiet⠀instructor⠀can⠀be⠀more⠀threatening⠀than⠀an⠀exclamation.\n\nRespect⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀ownership⠀of⠀thoughts.⠀If⠀the⠀contract⠀allows⠀private⠀interiority,⠀make⠀causal⠀reasoning⠀visible⠀before⠀performance.⠀If⠀it⠀does⠀not,⠀carry⠀the⠀reasoning⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀visible⠀choices,⠀speech,⠀and⠀physical⠀reactions—a⠀hesitation⠀before⠀the⠀strike,⠀a⠀glance⠀at⠀the⠀instructor,⠀a⠀corrected⠀grip—without⠀claiming⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀excluded⠀mind.⠀Improvement⠀depends⠀on⠀attempts,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀moral⠀reward.⠀One⠀skill⠀can⠀leap⠀while⠀another⠀remains⠀embarrassingly⠀stalled,⠀and⠀the⠀writer⠀should⠀let⠀that⠀unevenness⠀dictate⠀consequences⠀rather⠀than⠀smoothing⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀uniform⠀power⠀curve.\n\nStop⠀at⠀the⠀exact⠀moment⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀supplied⠀a⠀real⠀change⠀or⠀a⠀credible⠀failure,⠀without⠀an⠀appended⠀lesson.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀standing⠀over⠀a⠀broken⠀peg,⠀the⠀instructor⠀turning⠀away,⠀or⠀the⠀realization⠀that⠀the⠀new⠀technique⠀will⠀not⠀work⠀on⠀a⠀trained⠀opponent.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀write⠀a⠀progress⠀report⠀to⠀a⠀patron,⠀a⠀private⠀training⠀log,⠀a⠀letter⠀of⠀complaint⠀about⠀unsafe⠀instruction,⠀or⠀a⠀response⠀rejecting⠀a⠀senior's⠀account⠀of⠀why⠀a⠀student⠀failed.⠀The⠀documents⠀carry⠀the⠀investigation:⠀who⠀improved,⠀by⠀what⠀evidence,⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀record⠀conceals⠀or⠀misunderstands.⠀Gaps,⠀revisions,⠀conflicting⠀accounts,⠀and⠀material⠀traces⠀can⠀reveal⠀events⠀across⠀entries;⠀a⠀burnt⠀corner,⠀a⠀crossed-out⠀formula,⠀or⠀a⠀dated⠀record⠀copied⠀years⠀later⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀useful⠀as⠀a⠀description.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile⠀inside⠀the⠀documents⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀an⠀omniscient⠀frame⠀after⠀each⠀one.⠀A⠀letter's⠀author⠀can⠀be⠀candid⠀and⠀precise,⠀asking⠀why⠀a⠀sect's⠀senior⠀publicly⠀claims⠀credit⠀for⠀a⠀breakthrough⠀that⠀a⠀junior⠀discovered⠀by⠀hunger.⠀The⠀humor⠀and⠀independence⠀belongs⠀to⠀that⠀writer.⠀A⠀journal⠀can⠀argue⠀with⠀the⠀official⠀training⠀manual⠀in⠀the⠀margin,⠀without⠀authorial⠀commentary.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀post-document⠀explanation;⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀document⠀answer,⠀ignore,⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀the⠀previous⠀one.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀document's⠀situation.⠀The⠀person⠀composing⠀a⠀record⠀knows⠀less⠀than⠀the⠀reader⠀may⠀know⠀across⠀the⠀whole⠀sequence.⠀A⠀progress⠀report⠀written⠀the⠀night⠀before⠀a⠀trial⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀confession⠀of⠀the⠀trial's⠀outcome.⠀A⠀training⠀log⠀may⠀omit⠀the⠀fact⠀that⠀the⠀technique⠀was⠀learned⠀from⠀an⠀unauthorized⠀source.⠀If⠀multiple⠀authors⠀describe⠀the⠀same⠀event,⠀their⠀selections⠀differ⠀because⠀of⠀loyalty,⠀fear,⠀or⠀simple⠀position;⠀not⠀every⠀disagreement⠀implies⠀a⠀conspiracy.\n\nRetain⠀readable⠀continuity⠀and⠀actual⠀fictional⠀private⠀experience⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀allows.⠀A⠀journal⠀may⠀contain⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀private⠀reasoning,⠀but⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀still⠀composed⠀for⠀a⠀purpose;⠀distinguish⠀it⠀from⠀live⠀thought⠀if⠀the⠀contract⠀requires⠀hidden⠀interiority.⠀Advancement⠀must⠀be⠀tested⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish,⠀not⠀only⠀by⠀what⠀their⠀report⠀claims.⠀Show⠀that⠀test⠀through⠀the⠀document⠀sequence⠀itself:⠀a⠀later⠀report⠀records⠀the⠀same⠀technique⠀failing⠀under⠀a⠀named⠀condition,⠀a⠀rival's⠀letter⠀lists⠀the⠀exact⠀errors⠀the⠀first⠀report⠀omitted,⠀or⠀a⠀material⠀trace—a⠀torn⠀practice⠀record,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀manual⠀returned⠀with⠀new⠀notes—contradicts⠀the⠀official⠀account.⠀The⠀sequence⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀document⠀still⠀being⠀written,⠀a⠀reply⠀unfinished,⠀or⠀two⠀records⠀placed⠀side⠀by⠀side⠀with⠀no⠀explanation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀warmth⠀and⠀care⠀around⠀progression⠀so⠀the⠀developing⠀life⠀remains⠀legible.⠀A⠀training⠀sequence⠀can⠀include⠀the⠀meal⠀afterward,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀notices⠀which⠀wrist⠀is⠀sore,⠀the⠀preferred⠀tea⠀after⠀a⠀failed⠀control⠀exercise,⠀or⠀the⠀familiar⠀argument⠀about⠀carrying⠀supplies⠀that⠀ends⠀because⠀one⠀character⠀has⠀already⠀packed⠀the⠀other's⠀portion.⠀Let⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀enjoying⠀each⠀other's⠀presence⠀between⠀attempts.\n\nMake⠀the⠀comfort⠀active⠀rather⠀than⠀static.⠀A⠀companion⠀can⠀adjust⠀a⠀training⠀schedule,⠀bind⠀a⠀hand,⠀refill⠀a⠀water⠀flask,⠀or⠀argue⠀a⠀rest⠀day⠀into⠀being.⠀Small⠀preferences⠀recur⠀and⠀matter:⠀the⠀student⠀always⠀drinks⠀cold⠀tea⠀after⠀sparring;⠀the⠀older⠀practitioner⠀keeps⠀a⠀worn⠀cushion⠀by⠀the⠀door;⠀the⠀cook⠀leaves⠀the⠀spice⠀tray⠀near⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀will⠀actually⠀use⠀it.⠀Friendship⠀and⠀care⠀may⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile's⠀candid⠀voice.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀say,⠀with⠀plain⠀good⠀humor,⠀that⠀the⠀sect's⠀famous⠀discipline⠀is⠀just⠀an⠀excuse⠀not⠀to⠀buy⠀a⠀second⠀lamp.\n\nDo⠀not⠀let⠀comfort⠀erase⠀the⠀progression⠀genre.⠀Capability⠀still⠀changes⠀through⠀attempts,⠀failures,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀new⠀understanding.⠀The⠀style⠀changes⠀the⠀selection⠀of⠀scenes:⠀the⠀entry⠀focuses⠀on⠀what⠀training⠀costs⠀the⠀body⠀and⠀how⠀a⠀household⠀or⠀party⠀responds,⠀on⠀recovery⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀improvement,⠀and⠀on⠀the⠀support⠀that⠀makes⠀further⠀attempts⠀possible.⠀Keep⠀personality⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.⠀A⠀kind⠀character⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀agreeable⠀about⠀an⠀unsafe⠀method,⠀and⠀an⠀injured⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀thank⠀someone⠀for⠀a⠀remedy⠀they⠀never⠀wanted.⠀The⠀comfort⠀is⠀not⠀naivety;⠀the⠀group⠀can⠀argue⠀while⠀still⠀sharing⠀food.\n\nUse⠀the⠀current⠀narration⠀and⠀contract.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits,⠀interiority⠀may⠀include⠀quiet⠀satisfaction,⠀relief,⠀or⠀embarrassment⠀when⠀someone⠀chooses⠀care⠀without⠀fanfare,⠀written⠀as⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀fictional⠀private⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary.⠀An⠀unsent⠀letter,⠀if⠀used,⠀has⠀its⠀own⠀author⠀and⠀purpose.⠀Leave⠀the⠀scene⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀point⠀of⠀ease⠀or⠀resumed⠀practice;⠀no⠀one⠀must⠀confess,⠀reconcile⠀fully,⠀or⠀achieve⠀the⠀breakthrough⠀for⠀the⠀reply⠀to⠀be⠀complete.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀developing⠀capability⠀as⠀a⠀continuous⠀novelistic⠀composition,⠀with⠀paragraphs⠀that⠀move⠀deliberately⠀between⠀private⠀practice⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀world⠀that⠀watches⠀it.⠀Use⠀transitions⠀to⠀connect⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀another⠀character's⠀recorded⠀opinion,⠀the⠀room⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀record⠀was⠀read,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀did⠀that⠀evening.⠀Sustain⠀the⠀movement⠀rather⠀than⠀breaking⠀everything⠀into⠀a⠀roleplay-style⠀exchange⠀or⠀chapter-length⠀scene.\n\nUse⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀frame⠀progression⠀through⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀when⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀permits⠀it.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀compare⠀the⠀current⠀training⠀system⠀to⠀the⠀one⠀its⠀founder⠀described,⠀or⠀note⠀which⠀students⠀are⠀allowed⠀to⠀make⠀a⠀mistake⠀and⠀which⠀are⠀not.⠀When⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀tradition⠀appears⠀solemn,⠀the⠀framing⠀can⠀ask⠀what⠀practical⠀problem⠀it⠀once⠀solved⠀and⠀who⠀now⠀benefits⠀from⠀leaving⠀it⠀unquestioned.⠀The⠀critique⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀a⠀focal⠀character;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀editorial⠀aside.\n\nDo⠀not⠀let⠀elegant⠀style⠀obscure⠀concrete⠀progression.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀sentence⠀or⠀adjacent⠀paragraph.⠀A⠀sweeping⠀reflection⠀about⠀discipline⠀should⠀land⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀foot⠀placement,⠀a⠀bruised⠀wrist,⠀or⠀a⠀silence⠀at⠀the⠀dinner⠀table.⠀Improvement⠀must⠀result⠀from⠀attempts,⠀feedback,⠀resources,⠀and⠀new⠀understanding.⠀If⠀the⠀world⠀has⠀ranks,⠀mention⠀them⠀only⠀as⠀a⠀practical⠀frame⠀others⠀use;⠀if⠀a⠀rank's⠀meaning⠀is⠀weak,⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀expose⠀that⠀too.\n\nAllow⠀private⠀thought⠀where⠀the⠀contract⠀permits,⠀in⠀lively⠀prose⠀rather⠀than⠀abstract⠀interiority.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀reason⠀through⠀why⠀an⠀exercise⠀went⠀wrong,⠀then⠀catch⠀themselves⠀thinking⠀of⠀someone⠀else's⠀judgment.⠀Use⠀plain⠀contemporary⠀syntax⠀where⠀it⠀serves⠀clarity⠀inside⠀the⠀composed⠀narration,⠀without⠀slipping⠀into⠀chat⠀or⠀casual⠀spoken⠀register;⠀the⠀style⠀remains⠀deliberate,⠀sustained⠀novel⠀prose,⠀not⠀a⠀costume⠀of⠀archaic⠀phrases⠀or⠀aristocratic⠀speech.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀reflection⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀next⠀question⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀decision.⠀The⠀last⠀sentence⠀may⠀leave⠀doubt⠀intact,⠀a⠀course⠀reconsidered,⠀or⠀a⠀companion's⠀public⠀praise⠀accepted⠀while⠀the⠀private⠀worry⠀remains.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀chapter⠀as⠀a⠀teller⠀recounting⠀one⠀or⠀more⠀embedded⠀training⠀stories⠀to⠀listeners⠀whose⠀present⠀decision⠀depends⠀on⠀understanding⠀how⠀a⠀capability⠀is⠀actually⠀acquired.⠀Establish⠀the⠀occasion⠀in⠀the⠀opening⠀exchange:⠀an⠀apprentice⠀facing⠀a⠀threshold,⠀a⠀peer⠀who⠀distrusts⠀a⠀method,⠀an⠀official⠀reviewing⠀a⠀claim,⠀or⠀another⠀listener⠀with⠀the⠀power⠀to⠀accept⠀or⠀reject⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀learned.⠀Name⠀the⠀audience's⠀stake⠀before⠀the⠀first⠀embedded⠀tale⠀begins,⠀so⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀a⠀purpose⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀track.\n\nMake⠀each⠀embedded⠀tale⠀an⠀argument,⠀not⠀a⠀compilation⠀of⠀lore.⠀The⠀teller⠀selects⠀episodes⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀executing⠀it:⠀the⠀stance⠀that⠀fails⠀until⠀a⠀correction⠀is⠀practiced,⠀the⠀resource⠀that⠀only⠀works⠀with⠀the⠀right⠀preparation,⠀the⠀old⠀rule⠀that⠀breaks⠀under⠀specific⠀conditions,⠀the⠀feedback⠀the⠀teller⠀initially⠀explains⠀away.⠀When⠀a⠀framework⠀promises⠀a⠀clean⠀rank,⠀have⠀the⠀teller⠀narrate⠀a⠀specific⠀moment⠀where⠀the⠀rank⠀failed⠀to⠀predict⠀performance—a⠀certified⠀master⠀fumbling⠀a⠀live⠀drill,⠀an⠀unranked⠀laborer⠀holding⠀a⠀stance⠀the⠀examiner⠀could⠀not—and⠀then⠀follow⠀the⠀question⠀that⠀failure⠀raises.⠀The⠀teller's⠀intellectual⠀independence⠀appears⠀in⠀that⠀questioning,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀detached⠀lecture.\n\nUse⠀the⠀frame⠀to⠀control⠀recurrence⠀and⠀delay.⠀Choose⠀one⠀repeated⠀command,⠀exercise,⠀wound,⠀or⠀remembered⠀defeat⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀inside⠀a⠀later⠀tale⠀with⠀new⠀meaning.⠀When⠀a⠀consequence⠀is⠀withheld,⠀hold⠀it⠀until⠀the⠀outer⠀audience⠀has⠀enough⠀context⠀to⠀recognize⠀why⠀the⠀sequence⠀had⠀to⠀be⠀told⠀that⠀way,⠀then⠀resolve⠀it⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀treat⠀a⠀vivid⠀story⠀as⠀proof⠀that⠀mastery⠀is⠀complete.⠀Let⠀the⠀outer⠀audience⠀interrupt⠀with⠀questions⠀about⠀cost,⠀habit,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀omitted,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀teller⠀answer,⠀evade,⠀or⠀revise⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀actual⠀purpose.⠀The⠀final⠀exchange⠀may⠀confirm⠀a⠀genuine⠀advance⠀or⠀expose⠀a⠀remaining⠀failure,⠀but⠀the⠀teller⠀must⠀show⠀a⠀changed⠀capability⠀through⠀a⠀performed⠀or⠀reported⠀event,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀formula.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀intelligible.⠀Signal⠀transitions⠀with⠀direct⠀address,⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀tense⠀or⠀naming,⠀and⠀an⠀explicit⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀occasion.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience⠀doubt⠀or⠀compare⠀the⠀tale⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀experience.⠀The⠀story⠀should⠀feel⠀alive⠀in⠀the⠀telling,⠀not⠀like⠀a⠀record⠀being⠀read⠀aloud,⠀yet⠀every⠀turn⠀should⠀help⠀someone⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀choose⠀or⠀understand.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀modernist-absurdist⠀route⠀of⠀the⠀German-language⠀profile.⠀Treat⠀the⠀progression⠀system⠀as⠀a⠀bureaucratic⠀apparatus⠀that⠀claims⠀to⠀measure⠀skill⠀but⠀mainly⠀measures⠀paperwork,⠀examinations,⠀waiting⠀periods,⠀and⠀official⠀recognition.⠀Write⠀the⠀narration⠀at⠀a⠀controlled⠀ironic⠀distance,⠀so⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀describe⠀a⠀training⠀hall,⠀license⠀board,⠀or⠀merit⠀ledger⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀precise⠀language⠀a⠀clerk⠀would⠀use,⠀then⠀puncture⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀question:⠀what⠀does⠀this⠀procedure⠀actually⠀test?\n\nOpen⠀from⠀a⠀character⠀attempting⠀to⠀learn⠀in⠀such⠀a⠀system.⠀Establish⠀the⠀concrete⠀mismatch⠀between⠀the⠀certificate⠀and⠀the⠀capability⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀observed⠀contrast:⠀a⠀candidate⠀recites⠀the⠀approved⠀sequence⠀and⠀then⠀fails⠀to⠀keep⠀balance;⠀a⠀mentor⠀holds⠀rank⠀because⠀of⠀seniority⠀while⠀another⠀quietly⠀performs⠀the⠀same⠀movement⠀better.⠀Let⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀candor⠀follow⠀the⠀question⠀beyond⠀the⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer.⠀When⠀an⠀official⠀says⠀the⠀path⠀is⠀orderly,⠀the⠀narration⠀exposes⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀by⠀showing⠀the⠀clean⠀hierarchy⠀breaking⠀down⠀during⠀a⠀real⠀session—a⠀form⠀misfiled,⠀a⠀drill⠀interrupted,⠀an⠀examiner⠀who⠀cannot⠀perform⠀the⠀movement⠀being⠀graded.\n\nGive⠀each⠀stage⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀process,⠀not⠀a⠀number⠀going⠀up.⠀Include⠀forms,⠀drills,⠀informal⠀demonstrations,⠀and⠀the⠀ordinary⠀materials⠀of⠀practice.⠀Progress⠀becomes⠀real⠀when⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀do⠀something⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀do⠀before,⠀and⠀that⠀change⠀must⠀be⠀observable⠀in⠀behavior.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀rise⠀in⠀rank,⠀their⠀improved⠀strength,⠀accuracy,⠀or⠀ability⠀to⠀help⠀still⠀matters.⠀If⠀an⠀administrator⠀doubles⠀a⠀score,⠀show⠀how⠀that⠀number⠀fails⠀to⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀perform.\n\nAvoid⠀turning⠀the⠀whole⠀world⠀into⠀a⠀monolithic⠀bureau.⠀Some⠀individuals⠀genuinely⠀improve;⠀some⠀relationships⠀train⠀real⠀skill⠀outside⠀official⠀channels.⠀Let⠀the⠀prose's⠀syntax⠀and⠀dry⠀precision⠀support⠀the⠀satire⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀ironic⠀comments⠀into⠀every⠀sentence.⠀A⠀test⠀can⠀be⠀absurd⠀and⠀still⠀have⠀human⠀consequences.⠀The⠀last⠀section⠀should⠀bring⠀one⠀attempted⠀advancement⠀to⠀a⠀stopping⠀point:⠀an⠀examiner's⠀decision,⠀a⠀new⠀personal⠀understanding,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀result,⠀without⠀prescribing⠀a⠀revelation⠀or⠀rebellion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nTreat⠀each⠀gain⠀in⠀capability⠀as⠀earned⠀through⠀a⠀particular⠀social⠀tangle:⠀an⠀old⠀lineage,⠀a⠀decaying⠀building's⠀inner⠀circle,⠀a⠀mentor⠀who⠀guards⠀a⠀technique,⠀a⠀ritual⠀that⠀promises⠀recognition.⠀Let⠀the⠀Gothic-Punk⠀atmosphere⠀give⠀that⠀arrangement⠀weight⠀through⠀concrete⠀urban⠀detail⠀and⠀morally⠀complicated⠀intimacy.⠀Describe⠀the⠀peeling⠀plaster,⠀the⠀warm⠀breath⠀in⠀a⠀cold⠀training⠀room,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀oil⠀on⠀a⠀practice⠀weapon,⠀and⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀master's⠀attention⠀can⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀gift⠀or⠀a⠀leash.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀vampires⠀or⠀a⠀named⠀supernatural⠀institution;⠀the⠀inherited⠀power⠀is⠀social,⠀political,⠀and⠀occasionally⠀claimed⠀as⠀tradition.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀candor⠀to⠀puncture⠀the⠀solemn⠀assumption⠀that⠀old⠀authority⠀automatically⠀produces⠀real⠀skill.⠀Let⠀a⠀character⠀notice⠀when⠀a⠀master's⠀instruction⠀is⠀circular,⠀when⠀a⠀lineage's⠀prestige⠀is⠀mostly⠀a⠀list⠀of⠀names,⠀or⠀when⠀a⠀test⠀rewards⠀loyalty⠀more⠀than⠀ability.⠀Follow⠀that⠀question⠀beyond⠀the⠀polite⠀answer.⠀The⠀critique⠀should⠀be⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀voice,⠀not⠀delivered⠀as⠀a⠀narrator's⠀editorial.\n\nAdvancement⠀must⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀changed⠀capability,⠀not⠀a⠀changed⠀title⠀alone.⠀Show⠀a⠀learner⠀practicing⠀a⠀movement⠀until⠀it⠀is⠀reliable;⠀taking⠀feedback⠀and⠀altering⠀a⠀stance;⠀combining⠀a⠀lesson⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀experience;⠀discovering⠀a⠀resource⠀outside⠀the⠀official⠀circle.⠀At⠀the⠀same⠀time⠀show⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀learn⠀to⠀resist⠀a⠀master's⠀pressure⠀but⠀still⠀hesitate⠀in⠀another⠀situation;⠀a⠀veteran⠀may⠀have⠀practical⠀knowledge⠀they⠀cannot⠀fully⠀explain;⠀a⠀promising⠀student⠀may⠀fail⠀because⠀the⠀old⠀method⠀made⠀them⠀rigid.\n\nLet⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀social⠀masks⠀matter.⠀Morally⠀complicated⠀intimacy⠀means⠀characters⠀rarely⠀have⠀pure⠀motives⠀for⠀teaching⠀or⠀learning.⠀The⠀master⠀may⠀want⠀company,⠀deference,⠀access⠀to⠀a⠀family,⠀or⠀an⠀instrument⠀for⠀a⠀faction;⠀the⠀student⠀may⠀want⠀safety,⠀belonging,⠀a⠀way⠀to⠀feed⠀a⠀household,⠀or⠀revenge.⠀Both⠀may⠀still⠀grant⠀genuine⠀help.⠀Allow⠀the⠀masks⠀to⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company⠀and⠀show⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀of⠀learning:⠀frustration,⠀hope,⠀boredom,⠀excitement,⠀fear,⠀and⠀reasoning⠀about⠀what⠀a⠀technique⠀could⠀make⠀possible.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀a⠀scene⠀boundary⠀that⠀tests⠀or⠀refuses⠀a⠀gain⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀a⠀permanent⠀victory.⠀The⠀final⠀beat⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀reader⠀feel⠀the⠀city,⠀the⠀relationship,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀concrete⠀problem⠀in⠀the⠀learner's⠀path.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nSelect⠀the⠀testimonial-autobiographical⠀route.⠀Narrate⠀from⠀a⠀first-person⠀participant⠀who⠀recalls⠀how⠀they⠀learned,⠀who⠀taught⠀them,⠀what⠀they⠀attempted,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀discovered.⠀Place⠀the⠀speaker⠀in⠀a⠀definite⠀community,⠀region,⠀and⠀period⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story.⠀If⠀the⠀source⠀material⠀uses⠀another⠀language⠀or⠀local⠀terms,⠀keep⠀them⠀specific;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀English⠀or⠀code-switching⠀where⠀the⠀setting⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀it.\n\nThe⠀account⠀should⠀be⠀useful⠀as⠀testimony:⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀speaking⠀to⠀someone⠀about⠀their⠀own⠀past,⠀or⠀writing⠀it⠀down⠀with⠀a⠀purpose.⠀Let⠀the⠀occasion⠀matter.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀need⠀to⠀judge⠀whether⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀reliable,⠀whether⠀a⠀method⠀is⠀safe,⠀or⠀whether⠀a⠀claimed⠀skill⠀is⠀real.⠀Let⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀personal⠀candor⠀allow⠀the⠀narrator⠀to⠀admit⠀early⠀arrogance,⠀misuse⠀of⠀a⠀technique,⠀or⠀a⠀period⠀when⠀they⠀trusted⠀a⠀doctrine⠀they⠀later⠀tested.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀them⠀uniformly⠀cynical;⠀they⠀may⠀remain⠀proud⠀of⠀a⠀genuine⠀achievement⠀and⠀uncertain⠀about⠀another.\n\nThe⠀progression⠀is⠀the⠀backbone⠀of⠀the⠀account.⠀Instead⠀of⠀a⠀list⠀of⠀ranks,⠀show⠀specific⠀attempts⠀that⠀failed⠀and⠀the⠀feedback⠀or⠀repeated⠀practice⠀that⠀changed⠀them.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀know⠀a⠀stance⠀is⠀theoretically⠀superior⠀but⠀still⠀mishandle⠀it⠀under⠀pressure;⠀later⠀they⠀perform⠀it⠀without⠀thought.⠀Describe⠀the⠀materials,⠀training⠀spaces,⠀ordinary⠀work,⠀and⠀relationships⠀involved.⠀If⠀an⠀established⠀system⠀exists,⠀the⠀teller⠀should⠀explain⠀what⠀a⠀rank⠀measures⠀and⠀why⠀it⠀might⠀not⠀measure⠀actual⠀ability.⠀Keep⠀that⠀explanation⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice,⠀concrete⠀rather⠀than⠀philosophical.\n\nLet⠀later⠀knowledge⠀create⠀irony⠀without⠀erasing⠀earlier⠀understanding.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀say,⠀\"I⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀then⠀that⠀my⠀teacher⠀was⠀watching,\"⠀but⠀must⠀not⠀claim⠀they⠀felt⠀in⠀the⠀past⠀what⠀they⠀only⠀learned⠀later.⠀When⠀they⠀recall⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀learning,⠀show⠀the⠀reasoning⠀and⠀sensation⠀at⠀that⠀time.⠀Authority⠀can⠀be⠀questioned⠀by⠀the⠀narrator⠀as⠀they⠀tell⠀the⠀story,⠀but⠀the⠀past⠀self⠀should⠀not⠀see⠀through⠀everything.\n\nClose⠀with⠀a⠀moment⠀that⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀that⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀before,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀that⠀tests⠀the⠀progress.⠀The⠀final⠀paragraph⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀every⠀ambiguity⠀because⠀the⠀testimony⠀is⠀one⠀person's⠀account,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀demonstrate⠀the⠀practical⠀capability⠀the⠀story⠀set⠀out⠀to⠀explain.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nSelect⠀the⠀diary-and-reflective-miscellany⠀route.⠀Write⠀in⠀an⠀informal⠀journal-like⠀voice:⠀a⠀practitioner⠀records⠀a⠀day⠀or⠀a⠀stretch⠀of⠀days,⠀combines⠀an⠀observed⠀event⠀with⠀a⠀personal⠀reflection,⠀then⠀attempts⠀a⠀practical⠀correction.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀language⠀be⠀personal⠀and⠀direct,⠀with⠀no⠀compulsory⠀quietness⠀or⠀seasonal⠀inventory.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀supplies⠀a⠀date,⠀season,⠀or⠀local⠀practice,⠀use⠀it⠀naturally⠀because⠀it⠀affects⠀training⠀conditions;⠀otherwise,⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀scenery.\n\nMake⠀the⠀progression⠀happen⠀across⠀the⠀entries⠀through⠀particular⠀attempts.⠀Describe⠀a⠀movement⠀performed⠀incorrectly,⠀the⠀physical⠀sensation⠀of⠀the⠀mistake,⠀the⠀feedback⠀received,⠀the⠀next⠀attempt,⠀and⠀the⠀difference⠀that⠀follows.⠀A⠀trainer's⠀aphorism⠀may⠀sound⠀wise⠀until⠀the⠀narrator⠀tests⠀it:⠀a⠀line⠀about⠀\"softness\"⠀may⠀fail⠀against⠀a⠀stronger⠀opponent,⠀or⠀a⠀scolding⠀about⠀spirit⠀may⠀ignore⠀exhaustion.⠀Let⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀inquiry⠀follow⠀that⠀question.⠀The⠀narrator⠀should⠀not⠀merely⠀admire⠀tradition;⠀they⠀may⠀ask⠀what⠀the⠀rule⠀is⠀for⠀and⠀whether⠀it⠀survives⠀contact⠀with⠀a⠀real⠀task.\n\nThe⠀miscellany⠀can⠀include⠀a⠀memory,⠀a⠀conversation,⠀a⠀small⠀failure⠀at⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task,⠀an⠀observation⠀about⠀another⠀learner,⠀or⠀an⠀unexpected⠀training⠀insight.⠀Omission⠀matters:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀leave⠀out⠀something⠀that⠀later⠀entry⠀reveals,⠀but⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀transcript⠀of⠀private⠀thought;⠀it⠀is⠀an⠀account⠀the⠀writer⠀has⠀shaped.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀knew⠀during⠀the⠀event⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀know⠀while⠀writing.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀journal⠀into⠀invisible⠀omniscient⠀narration.\n\nLet⠀capability⠀show⠀through⠀concrete⠀accomplishments⠀and⠀remaining⠀difficulty.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀rises⠀in⠀rank,⠀state⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀differently⠀now.⠀If⠀they⠀remain⠀unranked,⠀show⠀what⠀has⠀genuinely⠀improved:⠀balance,⠀speed,⠀patience,⠀the⠀ability⠀to⠀help⠀a⠀companion,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀resource.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀a⠀single⠀epiphany⠀as⠀proof.⠀Progress⠀should⠀include⠀repeated⠀practice,⠀corrected⠀understanding,⠀and⠀a⠀test⠀where⠀the⠀narrator⠀performs⠀under⠀conditions⠀that⠀previously⠀defeated⠀them.\n\nThe⠀final⠀entry⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀working⠀note⠀about⠀the⠀next⠀problem,⠀leaving⠀the⠀story⠀open.⠀It⠀should⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀complete⠀resolution,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀reader⠀with⠀a⠀definite⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀attempt.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nSelect⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological-urban⠀route.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀learner⠀while⠀maintaining⠀third⠀person.⠀Ground⠀every⠀stage⠀of⠀training⠀in⠀the⠀particular⠀city⠀and⠀community⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story:⠀the⠀walk⠀to⠀practice,⠀the⠀rent⠀to⠀pay,⠀the⠀noise⠀from⠀a⠀neighbor,⠀the⠀relative⠀who⠀asks⠀when⠀the⠀training⠀will⠀become⠀useful,⠀the⠀friend⠀who⠀uses⠀the⠀same⠀skill⠀for⠀a⠀different⠀job.⠀Keep⠀the⠀local⠀language⠀and⠀history⠀specific⠀where⠀given;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀magical⠀facts⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀includes⠀them.\n\nMake⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀active.⠀When⠀a⠀teacher⠀gives⠀an⠀instruction,⠀show⠀the⠀learner's⠀actual⠀thought:⠀this⠀grip⠀is⠀awkward,⠀the⠀older⠀student⠀laughed,⠀the⠀rule⠀contradicts⠀what⠀worked⠀last⠀week.⠀Let⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀direct⠀and⠀nimble⠀argument⠀appear⠀not⠀as⠀essayistic⠀commentary⠀but⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀active⠀questioning.⠀If⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀invokes⠀tradition⠀to⠀justify⠀their⠀method,⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀consider⠀whether⠀that⠀claim⠀is⠀true,⠀and⠀later⠀test⠀it.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀be⠀witty⠀or⠀plain⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀disposition;⠀do⠀not⠀give⠀every⠀character⠀polished⠀banter.\n\nProgress⠀occurs⠀through⠀specific⠀attempts.⠀Describe⠀a⠀technique⠀attempted,⠀a⠀failure,⠀a⠀correction,⠀and⠀the⠀repeated⠀practice⠀under⠀concrete⠀conditions.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀also⠀learn⠀from⠀ordinary⠀life:⠀carrying⠀loads,⠀suppressing⠀anger,⠀watching⠀how⠀someone⠀at⠀work⠀handles⠀a⠀dangerous⠀moment.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀a⠀breathing⠀technique⠀while⠀still⠀tensing⠀in⠀a⠀drill.⠀Advancement⠀must⠀eventually⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀or⠀decides⠀they⠀can⠀now⠀risk.\n\nDo⠀not⠀let⠀social⠀pressure⠀replace⠀capability.⠀A⠀family⠀debt⠀or⠀a⠀master's⠀requirement⠀can⠀motivate⠀learning,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀itself⠀make⠀the⠀learner⠀skilled.⠀Show⠀how⠀those⠀pressures⠀shape⠀practice:⠀stolen⠀hours,⠀a⠀safe⠀place⠀to⠀fail,⠀a⠀debt⠀paid⠀with⠀teaching,⠀a⠀relative⠀who⠀disapproves.⠀Let⠀recovery⠀and⠀rest⠀be⠀part⠀of⠀development;⠀a⠀strained⠀body⠀that⠀never⠀rests⠀is⠀a⠀problem⠀to⠀solve,⠀not⠀proof⠀of⠀dedication.\n\nClose⠀on⠀a⠀scene⠀boundary⠀where⠀one⠀concrete⠀gain⠀is⠀tested⠀in⠀the⠀immediate⠀city⠀life.⠀The⠀ending⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀reader⠀with⠀the⠀felt⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀street,⠀the⠀family,⠀or⠀the⠀practice⠀space,⠀and⠀a⠀specific⠀next⠀problem⠀the⠀learner⠀cannot⠀yet⠀ignore.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀a⠀fast-readable,⠀visually⠀staged⠀manner,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀core⠀progression⠀a⠀real⠀learning⠀arc⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀numbers⠀rising.⠀Enter⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀cleanly:⠀name⠀the⠀place,⠀the⠀character⠀whose⠀perspective⠀we⠀follow,⠀and⠀the⠀problem⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀two⠀or⠀three⠀sentences⠀if⠀possible.⠀Use⠀short⠀paragraphs⠀and⠀clear⠀spatial⠀changes.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀moves⠀from⠀a⠀doorway⠀to⠀a⠀training⠀mat,⠀show⠀that⠀move;⠀when⠀dialogue⠀pauses,⠀put⠀the⠀speaker⠀and⠀physical⠀action⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀block⠀enough⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀reader⠀oriented.\n\nLet⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀irony⠀guide⠀selection⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀first-person⠀narrator⠀or⠀forced⠀comedy.⠀A⠀third-person⠀narrative⠀can⠀still⠀cut⠀through⠀a⠀solemn⠀claim⠀by⠀showing⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀instructor⠀announces⠀and⠀what⠀actually⠀happens.⠀The⠀author⠀profile's⠀direct⠀inquiry⠀should⠀emerge⠀in⠀concrete⠀contrasts:⠀the⠀sacred⠀method⠀collapses⠀under⠀a⠀cheap⠀trick;⠀the⠀ranking⠀officer⠀knows⠀less⠀than⠀the⠀apprentice;⠀the⠀system's⠀explanation⠀covers⠀only⠀the⠀cases⠀it⠀already⠀mastered.⠀Keep⠀the⠀black⠀humor⠀owned⠀by⠀a⠀particular⠀character⠀or⠀by⠀a⠀dry⠀narrator⠀who⠀notices⠀the⠀mismatch.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀witty.\n\nExplain⠀unfamiliar⠀mechanics⠀through⠀action.⠀If⠀a⠀resource⠀must⠀be⠀measured,⠀a⠀rule⠀must⠀be⠀followed,⠀or⠀a⠀technique⠀has⠀components,⠀present⠀the⠀necessary⠀information⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀attempts⠀the⠀thing,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀separate⠀manual.⠀Show⠀a⠀first⠀try,⠀a⠀failure,⠀and⠀a⠀second⠀try⠀with⠀one⠀corrected⠀detail.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀doing⠀is⠀central:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀recite⠀the⠀theory⠀perfectly⠀during⠀review,⠀then⠀freeze⠀or⠀botch⠀the⠀execution.⠀Afterward,⠀give⠀one⠀short⠀private⠀reaction⠀beat⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀character:⠀uncertainty,⠀anger,⠀amusement⠀at⠀themselves,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀question⠀about⠀the⠀instructor.⠀Use⠀the⠀supplied⠀interiority⠀rules⠀for⠀nonspoken⠀thought⠀where⠀appropriate;⠀do⠀not⠀replace⠀it⠀with⠀asides⠀or⠀voice-over.\n\nAdvancement⠀should⠀be⠀uneven.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀improve⠀speed⠀before⠀control;⠀another⠀may⠀gain⠀strength⠀but⠀lose⠀trust.⠀Test⠀gains⠀through⠀small⠀observable⠀results⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀target⠀struck,⠀a⠀stance⠀held,⠀a⠀student⠀able⠀to⠀explain⠀something⠀they⠀previously⠀misunderstood.⠀Avoid⠀announcing⠀a⠀permanent⠀victory.⠀If⠀the⠀scene⠀ends⠀before⠀a⠀result,⠀the⠀private⠀reaction⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀concrete⠀step⠀should⠀still⠀make⠀progress⠀legible.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Light⠀Novel⠀breaks,⠀not⠀the⠀Light⠀Novel⠀plot⠀template.⠀No⠀required⠀youth⠀cast,⠀no⠀mandated⠀first⠀person,⠀and⠀no⠀cliffhanger.⠀You⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀a⠀private⠀thought,⠀a⠀finished⠀task,⠀or⠀an⠀ongoing⠀exchange⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀response⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀one⠀sensory⠀anchor⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀learner's⠀practice—the⠀grain⠀of⠀timber,⠀the⠀flow⠀of⠀mana⠀through⠀a⠀channel,⠀the⠀bell-note⠀that⠀means⠀a⠀blow⠀went⠀wide—and⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀capability⠀has⠀actually⠀changed.⠀The⠀first⠀appearance⠀records⠀what⠀the⠀beginner⠀notices;⠀the⠀later⠀appearance⠀records⠀what⠀the⠀beginner⠀could⠀not⠀yet⠀distinguish.⠀Let⠀the⠀comparison⠀grow⠀from⠀that⠀new⠀perception⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀decorative⠀language.⠀A⠀principle⠀read⠀in⠀a⠀manual⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀as⠀the⠀first⠀successful⠀execution,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀mark⠀that⠀difference⠀by⠀changing⠀the⠀anchor's⠀texture,⠀timing,⠀or⠀consequence.\n\nRender⠀the⠀same⠀activity⠀before⠀and⠀after⠀practice⠀through⠀concrete⠀verbs,⠀timing,⠀and⠀attention.⠀A⠀familiar⠀action⠀that⠀was⠀once⠀laborious⠀may⠀become⠀a⠀background⠀rhythm⠀while⠀another⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀Failures⠀should⠀be⠀specific:⠀the⠀hand⠀hesitates⠀at⠀the⠀exact⠀point⠀the⠀diagram⠀did⠀not⠀explain,⠀the⠀current⠀slips⠀at⠀the⠀third⠀turn,⠀the⠀bell⠀sounds⠀late.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀questions⠀a⠀solemn⠀ranking,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀mystifying⠀formula,⠀or⠀the⠀idea⠀that⠀a⠀single⠀breakthrough⠀should⠀feel⠀sacred,⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀test⠀the⠀question.⠀The⠀refutation⠀is⠀earned⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀world⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀or⠀still⠀cannot⠀do.\n\nUse⠀the⠀narrator's⠀direct,⠀irreverent⠀reflection⠀to⠀puncture⠀training⠀doctrine,⠀but⠀keep⠀candor⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀process.⠀A⠀lyrical⠀long⠀sentence⠀may⠀follow⠀uncertainty⠀into⠀recognition;⠀a⠀plain⠀sentence⠀can⠀then⠀state⠀exactly⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀perform.⠀If⠀a⠀comparison⠀blossoms⠀into⠀a⠀new⠀understanding,⠀make⠀that⠀understanding⠀serve⠀the⠀scene's⠀practical,⠀social,⠀or⠀personal⠀consequence.⠀Rhythm⠀may⠀quicken⠀during⠀exertion⠀and⠀stretch⠀after⠀rest,⠀but⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention⠀and⠀the⠀live⠀action,⠀not⠀to⠀word⠀count.⠀Advancement⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀single⠀texture⠀gradually⠀mastered⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀vertical⠀jump;⠀keep⠀unresolved⠀weaknesses⠀and⠀uneven⠀growth⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀account.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nBuild⠀each⠀new⠀capability⠀against⠀an⠀earlier⠀self⠀who⠀could⠀not⠀yet⠀perform⠀it.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀executes⠀a⠀move⠀or⠀understands⠀a⠀principle,⠀let⠀a⠀remembered⠀instance⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀act⠀return⠀with⠀its⠀old⠀clumsiness,⠀cost,⠀or⠀joy,⠀so⠀the⠀passage⠀measures⠀the⠀distance.⠀Choose⠀small⠀irreversible⠀details:⠀the⠀particular⠀bruise⠀from⠀a⠀failed⠀stance,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀teacher⠀corrected⠀the⠀grip⠀only⠀once,⠀the⠀shelf⠀where⠀a⠀first⠀charm⠀was⠀laid.⠀The⠀scene⠀need⠀not⠀stop⠀to⠀describe⠀all⠀of⠀the⠀past;⠀an⠀overlap⠀of⠀one⠀remembered⠀image⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀motion⠀is⠀enough.\n\nUse⠀the⠀irreverent⠀narrator⠀to⠀inspect⠀the⠀sentiment⠀without⠀becoming⠀permanently⠀cynical.⠀A⠀solemn⠀custom,⠀a⠀grand⠀title,⠀or⠀a⠀touching⠀memory⠀can⠀be⠀questioned⠀for⠀its⠀actual⠀use.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀advancement⠀feels⠀plainer⠀than⠀the⠀ceremony⠀pretends,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀beloved⠀teacher's⠀rule⠀was⠀partly⠀nonsense.⠀But⠀the⠀reflection⠀must⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀concrete⠀training⠀moment⠀and⠀may⠀still⠀include⠀unaffected⠀fondness⠀or⠀regret.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀gain⠀a⠀loss,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀each⠀scene⠀to⠀end⠀announcing⠀impermanence.\n\nMake⠀the⠀evaluative⠀doubt⠀bear⠀on⠀actual⠀competence.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀wonders⠀if⠀the⠀old⠀path⠀still⠀matters⠀or⠀whether⠀he⠀is⠀only⠀imitating⠀a⠀dead⠀master,⠀answer⠀through⠀what⠀he⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish,⠀fail⠀at,⠀and⠀choose.⠀Allow⠀earlier⠀objects⠀and⠀lessons⠀to⠀be⠀revisited⠀after⠀development,⠀their⠀meaning⠀altered⠀because⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀now⠀see⠀what⠀was⠀below⠀or⠀beyond⠀them.⠀The⠀prose⠀may⠀move⠀slowly⠀between⠀past⠀and⠀present,⠀but⠀the⠀movement⠀is⠀causal:⠀a⠀present⠀action⠀summons⠀a⠀specific⠀remembered⠀action,⠀whose⠀difference⠀is⠀the⠀advancement.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀candor⠀about⠀aging,⠀parting,⠀or⠀obsolete⠀ranks⠀particular⠀to⠀this⠀story⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀universal⠀elegy⠀for⠀every⠀skill.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀framed⠀or⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀narrator⠀says⠀where⠀the⠀account⠀was⠀heard,⠀how⠀it⠀reached⠀this⠀teller,⠀and⠀why⠀it⠀is⠀being⠀retold⠀now.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀personality⠀is⠀active:⠀he⠀or⠀she⠀may⠀interrupt⠀the⠀tale⠀to⠀ask⠀whether⠀a⠀witness⠀could⠀really⠀have⠀seen⠀that,⠀what⠀the⠀teacher's⠀rule⠀was⠀actually⠀for,⠀or⠀why⠀the⠀rank⠀became⠀a⠀title.⠀Each⠀time⠀a⠀feat⠀is⠀reported⠀as⠀prodigious,⠀give⠀the⠀next⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀account⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀checking⠀it:⠀the⠀hearer⠀may⠀demand⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀training,⠀the⠀number⠀of⠀failed⠀attempts,⠀or⠀the⠀thing⠀the⠀learner⠀still⠀cannot⠀do.⠀This⠀is⠀the⠀progression⠀evidence,⠀not⠀a⠀status⠀sheet.\n\nSeparate⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knows⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀only⠀reported.⠀A⠀story⠀within⠀a⠀story⠀may⠀show⠀a⠀student⠀learning⠀from⠀a⠀difficult⠀teacher,⠀then⠀the⠀outer⠀narrator⠀points⠀out⠀which⠀detail⠀looked⠀different⠀when⠀the⠀student⠀later⠀became⠀capable.⠀Use⠀framed⠀tales⠀to⠀revisit⠀the⠀same⠀act⠀with⠀altered⠀understanding:⠀the⠀first⠀telling⠀preserves⠀the⠀beginner's⠀fear⠀or⠀contempt;⠀the⠀later⠀telling⠀notices⠀the⠀exact⠀pressure,⠀timing,⠀or⠀escaped⠀consequence.⠀Keep⠀the⠀tradition⠀coherent:⠀choose⠀an⠀Arabic,⠀Persian,⠀or⠀other⠀supplied⠀framing,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀mix⠀every⠀regional⠀convention.⠀The⠀satire⠀can⠀target⠀bureaucratic⠀rank,⠀a⠀master's⠀mystification,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀display⠀of⠀learning,⠀but⠀the⠀underlying⠀world⠀rules⠀must⠀remain⠀stable⠀enough⠀to⠀test⠀actual⠀competence.\n\nThe⠀storyteller⠀follows⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer.⠀If⠀the⠀official⠀version⠀claims⠀a⠀saint's⠀unmoving⠀patience,⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀recount⠀the⠀apprentice's⠀observation⠀that⠀the⠀master's⠀pulse⠀changed.⠀If⠀a⠀legend⠀says⠀a⠀hero⠀achieved⠀power⠀in⠀one⠀night,⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀dig⠀up⠀the⠀previously⠀omitted⠀years.⠀Humor⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀discrepancy⠀between⠀the⠀courtly⠀or⠀devotional⠀frame⠀and⠀the⠀practical,⠀bodily,⠀domestic⠀details⠀of⠀learning.⠀Yet⠀the⠀account⠀must⠀show⠀growth,⠀not⠀only⠀debunking:⠀after⠀the⠀pointed⠀question,⠀depict⠀a⠀new⠀attempt,⠀a⠀changed⠀outcome,⠀or⠀a⠀hard-won⠀resource.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀telling;⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀unsure⠀whether⠀the⠀reported⠀improvement⠀was⠀enough,⠀but⠀the⠀better⠀capability⠀must⠀be⠀visible⠀or⠀inferable⠀in⠀the⠀concrete⠀material.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nNarrate⠀progression⠀through⠀economical⠀acts⠀and⠀comparisons,⠀not⠀summaries⠀of⠀improvement.⠀Show⠀the⠀same⠀action⠀before⠀and⠀after⠀training⠀with⠀only⠀the⠀details⠀whose⠀change⠀is⠀load-bearing:⠀the⠀grain⠀of⠀a⠀board⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀splinters,⠀the⠀breathing⠀after⠀a⠀full⠀repetition,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀failed⠀ingredient⠀now⠀behaves.⠀Cut⠀the⠀parts⠀of⠀an⠀ability⠀description⠀that⠀do⠀not⠀alter⠀the⠀current⠀scene.⠀When⠀a⠀system⠀has⠀ranks⠀or⠀measurements,⠀mention⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀exact⠀markers;⠀the⠀rest⠀belong⠀to⠀information⠀flow⠀and⠀may⠀appear⠀only⠀when⠀needed.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narration⠀distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀by⠀a⠀small⠀physical⠀proof.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀state⠀a⠀rule⠀in⠀dialogue⠀and⠀still⠀fumble⠀the⠀gesture⠀that⠀would⠀follow.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀failure⠀twice.⠀If⠀an⠀interior⠀thought⠀is⠀necessary,⠀make⠀it⠀brief⠀and⠀causally⠀relevant:⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀character⠀realizes⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀a⠀diagram⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀current,⠀or⠀remembers⠀the⠀teacher's⠀warning⠀against⠀that⠀one⠀mistake.⠀Do⠀not⠀replace⠀interiority⠀with⠀omitted⠀thought;⠀keep⠀a⠀truthful⠀private⠀line⠀where⠀it⠀explains⠀the⠀next⠀attempt.\n\nThe⠀narrator's⠀dry⠀view⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀voice.⠀He⠀or⠀she⠀can⠀note⠀that⠀the⠀official⠀title⠀was⠀longer⠀than⠀the⠀training,⠀that⠀the⠀master's⠀ceremony⠀covered⠀a⠀very⠀small⠀lesson,⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀guild⠀charged⠀for⠀a⠀manual⠀one⠀could⠀have⠀copied⠀in⠀half⠀a⠀day.⠀The⠀prose⠀itself⠀should⠀remain⠀direct⠀and⠀restrained;⠀the⠀narrator⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀soften⠀each⠀observation⠀with⠀a⠀joke.⠀Keep⠀world⠀rules⠀and⠀consequences⠀stable.⠀If⠀the⠀character's⠀skill⠀improves,⠀show⠀the⠀result⠀in⠀one⠀focused⠀comparison;⠀if⠀it⠀remains⠀uneven,⠀show⠀one⠀strength⠀and⠀one⠀remaining⠀difficulty⠀in⠀concrete⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀long⠀reflective⠀paragraph.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀sustained⠀contemporary-novel⠀prose⠀where⠀the⠀developing⠀capability⠀is⠀tested⠀through⠀whole⠀scenes:⠀a⠀training⠀session⠀that⠀includes⠀a⠀small⠀interruption,⠀a⠀conversation⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀learner⠀defends⠀or⠀doubts⠀a⠀technique,⠀an⠀errand⠀whose⠀difficulty⠀exposes⠀an⠀uneven⠀gain.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀private⠀thought,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀scene's⠀purpose⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀engine⠀of⠀improvement.⠀A⠀long⠀exchange⠀about⠀rank⠀or⠀theory⠀may⠀be⠀countered⠀by⠀one⠀practical⠀demonstration⠀that⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀perform.\n\nDo⠀not⠀convert⠀progression⠀into⠀a⠀syllabus.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀infer⠀changes⠀from⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀two⠀live⠀attempts,⠀a⠀correction⠀that⠀now⠀takes,⠀a⠀resource⠀that⠀was⠀useless⠀before,⠀or⠀a⠀problem⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀handles⠀a⠀step⠀earlier⠀than⠀he⠀or⠀she⠀would⠀have⠀last⠀month.⠀When⠀the⠀narrative⠀moves⠀into⠀recollection,⠀let⠀it⠀supply⠀the⠀earlier⠀failed⠀version,⠀not⠀an⠀abstract⠀summary⠀of⠀effort.⠀When⠀it⠀enters⠀interiority,⠀show⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀uncertainty,⠀reasoning,⠀or⠀false⠀confidence.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀question⠀an⠀academy's⠀exams,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀reputation,⠀or⠀the⠀state's⠀licensing⠀of⠀a⠀deadly⠀skill,⠀but⠀the⠀critique⠀must⠀be⠀raised⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀situation⠀and⠀treated⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀intellectual⠀independence⠀as⠀any⠀other⠀claim.⠀The⠀novel's⠀shift⠀in⠀register⠀may⠀allow⠀a⠀quick⠀satiric⠀observation,⠀yet⠀the⠀story⠀remains⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀body,⠀tools,⠀costs,⠀and⠀relationships⠀of⠀practice.\n\nAvoid⠀requiring⠀a⠀lesson⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀every⠀reply.⠀The⠀active⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀conversation,⠀a⠀training⠀movement,⠀or⠀an⠀unresolved⠀social⠀dispute;⠀what⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀capability⠀used⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀placed⠀concretely.⠀Preserve⠀chain⠀of⠀causation:⠀the⠀character's⠀action⠀or⠀failure⠀must⠀follow⠀from⠀what⠀he⠀or⠀she⠀can⠀now⠀do,⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult,⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀learned,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀symbolic⠀pronouncement.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀relationship⠀in⠀actual⠀progression⠀detail.⠀The⠀two⠀people⠀may⠀train⠀together,⠀test⠀one⠀another,⠀heal⠀one⠀another,⠀learn⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀teacher⠀with⠀different⠀aptitudes,⠀or⠀possess⠀complementary⠀skills⠀that⠀advance⠀at⠀different⠀rates.⠀Some⠀of⠀their⠀intimate⠀knowledge⠀comes⠀from⠀body⠀and⠀craft:⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀a⠀partner's⠀stance,⠀the⠀warning⠀sign⠀before⠀mana⠀overspends,⠀the⠀particular⠀bruise⠀left⠀by⠀a⠀shared⠀method.⠀Use⠀that⠀physical⠀and⠀technical⠀familiarity⠀as⠀private⠀language.⠀A⠀single⠀remembered⠀correction⠀can⠀return⠀as⠀a⠀callback⠀when⠀a⠀similar⠀moment⠀now⠀succeeds⠀or⠀fails.\n\nBring⠀the⠀particular⠀promise⠀of⠀this⠀pair⠀into⠀the⠀chosen⠀scene.⠀If⠀the⠀premise⠀is⠀comfort,⠀show⠀a⠀specific⠀practical⠀or⠀emotional⠀need⠀that⠀the⠀capable⠀one⠀cannot⠀simply⠀wave⠀away;⠀affection⠀and⠀competence⠀do⠀not⠀erase⠀the⠀cost.⠀If⠀it⠀is⠀rivalry,⠀let⠀the⠀contest⠀be⠀concrete—who⠀finishes⠀the⠀form⠀correctly,⠀whose⠀crafted⠀object⠀holds,⠀who⠀can⠀safely⠀win⠀a⠀spar—rather⠀than⠀performed⠀banter.⠀Jealousy,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀discovery⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀interaction⠀of⠀different⠀growing⠀abilities,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀label⠀pasted⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀treat⠀a⠀sentimental⠀convention⠀with⠀candor,⠀noting⠀when⠀a⠀romantic⠀gesture⠀would⠀be⠀useless,⠀when⠀one⠀partner⠀misreads⠀the⠀other's⠀inarticulate⠀praise⠀as⠀criticism,⠀or⠀when⠀the⠀institution⠀around⠀them⠀treats⠀their⠀joined⠀practice⠀as⠀a⠀threat⠀or⠀an⠀asset.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀couple⠀into⠀interchangeable⠀comfort⠀portraits.\n\nLet⠀progression⠀alter⠀the⠀relationship's⠀practical⠀terms.⠀What⠀used⠀to⠀require⠀the⠀stronger⠀partner's⠀help⠀may⠀now⠀be⠀something⠀the⠀weaker⠀one⠀can⠀choose⠀to⠀refuse,⠀accept,⠀or⠀repay.⠀What⠀one⠀person⠀was⠀taught⠀as⠀caution⠀may⠀now⠀grate⠀because⠀the⠀other⠀has⠀surpassed⠀that⠀limit.⠀Use⠀callbacks⠀to⠀show⠀that⠀change:⠀repeat⠀the⠀first⠀simple⠀exercise,⠀the⠀first⠀gift,⠀or⠀the⠀first⠀failure,⠀but⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀consequence⠀under⠀present⠀capability.⠀End⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀live⠀scene⠀naturally⠀pauses;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession,⠀resolution,⠀or⠀proof⠀that⠀the⠀bond⠀has⠀strengthened⠀simply⠀because⠀a⠀response⠀ended.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀progression⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀likely⠀to⠀be⠀repeated⠀later,⠀with⠀public⠀and⠀practical⠀acts⠀forming⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀remembrance.⠀Use⠀deliberate⠀openings⠀such⠀as⠀'This⠀is⠀how⠀the⠀slow⠀art⠀came⠀to⠀the⠀house⠀of...'⠀or⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀learner⠀by⠀an⠀early⠀deed⠀or⠀failure.⠀Then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀particular⠀history⠀that⠀keeps⠀the⠀epithet⠀from⠀being⠀empty:⠀the⠀season⠀spent⠀mending⠀a⠀fence⠀by⠀hand,⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀a⠀binding⠀held,⠀the⠀year⠀a⠀new⠀teacher⠀arrived.⠀Each⠀new⠀capability⠀should⠀be⠀connected⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀will⠀later⠀say⠀about⠀it,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀community⠀be⠀a⠀single⠀unanimous⠀chorus.\n\nBuild⠀advancement⠀through⠀recurrence.⠀Repeat⠀a⠀phrase⠀or⠀the⠀name⠀of⠀a⠀technique⠀when⠀it⠀appears⠀at⠀a⠀new⠀level:⠀the⠀same⠀blow⠀that⠀once⠀knocked⠀the⠀learner⠀down⠀now⠀lands⠀differently;⠀the⠀same⠀tool⠀that⠀was⠀given⠀as⠀charity⠀now⠀returns⠀a⠀favor.⠀Oaths,⠀kinship,⠀journeyman⠀tours,⠀gifts,⠀or⠀feuds⠀may⠀organize⠀the⠀account⠀if⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀establishes⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀Nordic⠀pantheon⠀or⠀import⠀heroic⠀doom⠀merely⠀because⠀this⠀is⠀a⠀saga⠀style.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀voice⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀tradition;⠀keep⠀it⠀coherent.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀voice⠀to⠀test⠀the⠀legend⠀against⠀the⠀actual⠀record.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀note⠀that⠀the⠀neighbors⠀remember⠀a⠀public⠀victory⠀but⠀forget⠀the⠀earlier⠀failures⠀the⠀apprenticeship⠀entailed,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀master's⠀memorial⠀stone⠀omits⠀the⠀student⠀who⠀performed⠀the⠀unfinished⠀part.⠀Inquiring⠀into⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀rule—a⠀vow⠀that⠀forbade⠀rest⠀but⠀not⠀theft,⠀a⠀rank⠀that⠀measured⠀only⠀one⠀style—should⠀expose⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀commemorated⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀learned.⠀Yet⠀the⠀account⠀must⠀also⠀let⠀genuine⠀growth⠀stand:⠀after⠀the⠀plain⠀observation,⠀show⠀a⠀concrete⠀changed⠀result⠀so⠀the⠀oral⠀telling⠀remains⠀a⠀record⠀of⠀a⠀real⠀capability.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀tale⠀pauses;⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀uncertain,⠀and⠀an⠀incomplete⠀skill⠀may⠀remain⠀as⠀durable⠀in⠀memory⠀as⠀a⠀triumph.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀social-realist⠀route:⠀the⠀training⠀site⠀is⠀a⠀working⠀household,⠀workshop,⠀schoolroom,⠀or⠀small-town⠀institution⠀where⠀labor,⠀weather,⠀meals,⠀and⠀local⠀roles⠀continue⠀while⠀the⠀person⠀learns.⠀Keep⠀the⠀community's⠀practical⠀response⠀as⠀the⠀measure⠀of⠀advancement.⠀Before⠀a⠀breakthrough,⠀show⠀an⠀actual⠀attempt⠀in⠀that⠀setting:⠀the⠀movement,⠀the⠀spoken⠀misconception,⠀the⠀resource⠀that⠀fails⠀to⠀help,⠀the⠀onlooker's⠀response.⠀Afterward,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀situation⠀and⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀goes⠀wrong.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀new⠀rank⠀or⠀label⠀substitute⠀for⠀the⠀world's⠀answer.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀inquiry⠀operate⠀through⠀the⠀social-realist⠀material⠀itself.⠀When⠀official⠀doctrine⠀meets⠀the⠀working⠀site,⠀compare⠀the⠀promised⠀result⠀with⠀the⠀observed⠀one:⠀the⠀recommended⠀exercise⠀fails⠀on⠀the⠀actual⠀floor,⠀the⠀approved⠀material⠀cannot⠀survive⠀the⠀local⠀weather,⠀the⠀examiner's⠀diagram⠀does⠀not⠀match⠀the⠀tool⠀in⠀the⠀learner's⠀hands.⠀Follow⠀the⠀focal⠀mind⠀beyond⠀the⠀approved⠀answer⠀by⠀noticing⠀who⠀must⠀pretend⠀the⠀failure⠀did⠀not⠀occur,⠀who⠀quietly⠀adapts⠀the⠀method,⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀punished⠀for⠀saying⠀so.⠀Candor⠀belongs⠀to⠀particular⠀voices:⠀the⠀tired⠀apprentice⠀may⠀ask⠀the⠀examiner⠀to⠀perform⠀the⠀exercise⠀once;⠀the⠀parent⠀may⠀refuse⠀to⠀let⠀a⠀child⠀repeat⠀a⠀dangerous⠀shortcut;⠀the⠀farmer⠀may⠀test⠀the⠀new⠀method⠀on⠀the⠀worst⠀field⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀demonstration⠀plot.\n\nKeep⠀improvement⠀uneven⠀and⠀embedded⠀in⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀execute⠀a⠀movement⠀but⠀misunderstand⠀the⠀social⠀rule⠀governing⠀its⠀use,⠀or⠀discover⠀a⠀resource⠀but⠀lack⠀permission⠀to⠀apply⠀it.⠀Relationships⠀and⠀duties⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life:⠀an⠀advancement⠀may⠀improve⠀a⠀friendship,⠀uncover⠀a⠀debt,⠀make⠀a⠀routine⠀safer,⠀or⠀open⠀a⠀conflict⠀with⠀those⠀who⠀control⠀training.⠀The⠀person⠀continues⠀washing,⠀cooking,⠀mending,⠀and⠀fulfilling⠀local⠀duties;⠀progression⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀exit⠀from⠀the⠀community.⠀Keep⠀interiority⠀available⠀to⠀show⠀exertion,⠀doubt,⠀reasoned⠀decision,⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀cost⠀of⠀repeated⠀practice,⠀without⠀making⠀any⠀private⠀thought⠀automatically⠀shared.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀stop⠀when⠀a⠀practice⠀session⠀ends,⠀a⠀request⠀is⠀refused,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀limitation⠀appears;⠀no⠀forced⠀completed⠀test⠀or⠀public⠀celebration⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nMake⠀every⠀capability⠀change⠀legible⠀through⠀action⠀and⠀speech.⠀Show⠀the⠀failed⠀version⠀and⠀the⠀successful⠀version⠀in⠀separate⠀scenes,⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀essential⠀obstacle⠀so⠀the⠀difference⠀is⠀material.⠀If⠀a⠀person⠀learns⠀to⠀open⠀the⠀lock,⠀the⠀earlier⠀scene⠀shows⠀the⠀barred⠀door⠀and⠀the⠀later⠀scene⠀shows⠀the⠀door⠀open,⠀with⠀the⠀necessary⠀causal⠀step⠀in⠀between.⠀Avoid⠀relying⠀on⠀invisible⠀system⠀windows⠀or⠀automatic⠀level-up⠀effects;⠀translate⠀status⠀into⠀practical⠀results:⠀a⠀faster⠀harvest,⠀a⠀safer⠀descent,⠀a⠀repaired⠀kiln,⠀a⠀correct⠀diagnosis.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀line⠀of⠀inquiry⠀through⠀the⠀script's⠀spoken⠀conflict.⠀A⠀teacher⠀makes⠀a⠀grand⠀claim⠀about⠀a⠀technique,⠀then⠀the⠀technique⠀is⠀tested⠀in⠀the⠀field⠀and⠀fails⠀for⠀a⠀particular⠀reason.⠀A⠀clerk⠀insists⠀on⠀a⠀rule⠀and⠀the⠀learner⠀discovers⠀it⠀was⠀designed⠀for⠀a⠀shortage⠀that⠀ended⠀years⠀ago.⠀Let⠀characters⠀argue,⠀question,⠀and⠀answer⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀motives,⠀not⠀as⠀ventriloquists⠀for⠀a⠀thesis.⠀The⠀ridicule⠀must⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀contradiction⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀promised⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀shown.\n\nUse⠀the⠀screenplay's⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks⠀and⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Start⠀with⠀a⠀familiar,⠀observable⠀setting⠀and⠀punctuate⠀only⠀real⠀changes⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀scene⠀heading.⠀Use⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀or⠀a⠀cut⠀when⠀the⠀selected⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them,⠀not⠀merely⠀for⠀style.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning,⠀felt⠀cost,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀attention⠀is⠀required,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀visible⠀action⠀or⠀line⠀that⠀prompts⠀it:⠀the⠀character's⠀assessment⠀of⠀a⠀failed⠀grip,⠀the⠀suspicion⠀that⠀the⠀instructor⠀will⠀not⠀demonstrate,⠀the⠀decision⠀to⠀comply⠀publicly⠀while⠀privately⠀mocking⠀a⠀rule.⠀Keep⠀that⠀note⠀hidden⠀from⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀convert⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀monologue⠀read⠀aloud.\n\nLet⠀improvement⠀develop⠀unevenly.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀have⠀mastered⠀the⠀physical⠀movement⠀but⠀misunderstand⠀a⠀social⠀explanation,⠀or⠀vice⠀versa.⠀Relationships⠀and⠀duties⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀training:⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀prepares⠀food,⠀a⠀supervisor⠀watches⠀the⠀practice,⠀an⠀injured⠀person⠀needs⠀care.⠀Stop⠀the⠀response⠀after⠀an⠀actual⠀scene⠀boundary,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀compulsory⠀final⠀shot⠀or⠀shocking⠀reveal.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀when⠀a⠀method⠀is⠀attempted⠀and⠀fails,⠀when⠀new⠀instructions⠀arrive,⠀or⠀when⠀someone⠀asks⠀the⠀question⠀the⠀learner⠀cannot⠀yet⠀answer.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nStage⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀material⠀objects⠀and⠀actions⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀see.⠀Write⠀the⠀practice⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀memory⠀but⠀as⠀a⠀live⠀attempt:⠀a⠀board⠀the⠀learner⠀tries⠀to⠀lift,⠀a⠀slip⠀of⠀paper⠀they⠀misread,⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀movements⠀they⠀perform⠀incorrectly.⠀Let⠀the⠀correct⠀version⠀appear⠀later⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀space⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀object,⠀so⠀the⠀change⠀is⠀observable.⠀If⠀the⠀world⠀has⠀ranks,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀rank⠀allows⠀in⠀physical⠀business⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀a⠀new⠀number.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀effort,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀reasoning⠀is⠀required,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀staged⠀action⠀or⠀line⠀that⠀prompts⠀it:⠀the⠀character's⠀assessment⠀of⠀why⠀the⠀grip⠀failed,⠀the⠀suspicion⠀that⠀the⠀examiner⠀will⠀not⠀perform⠀the⠀exercise,⠀the⠀decision⠀to⠀comply⠀publicly⠀while⠀privately⠀doubting⠀the⠀rule.⠀Keep⠀that⠀note⠀hidden⠀from⠀the⠀other⠀cast⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀convert⠀it⠀into⠀an⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue.⠀A⠀monologue⠀may⠀be⠀used⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀has⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose,⠀such⠀as⠀arguing⠀with⠀an⠀absent⠀teacher⠀or⠀rehearsing⠀a⠀dangerous⠀explanation,⠀and⠀it⠀never⠀replaces⠀all⠀focal⠀thought.\n\nLet⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀scrutiny⠀operate⠀through⠀staged⠀contradiction.⠀An⠀official⠀explains⠀a⠀proper⠀method⠀using⠀a⠀diagram⠀no⠀one⠀can⠀see,⠀and⠀the⠀learner's⠀attempt⠀shows⠀the⠀method⠀cannot⠀work⠀in⠀that⠀room.⠀A⠀rival⠀appropriates⠀the⠀learner's⠀small⠀improvement⠀while⠀denouncing⠀the⠀theory.⠀Use⠀dialogue⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀rule's⠀absurdity⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀character⠀witty.⠀The⠀candid⠀voice⠀belongs⠀to⠀whoever⠀has⠀earned⠀it⠀through⠀their⠀situation:⠀the⠀tired⠀apprentice⠀may⠀ask⠀to⠀see⠀the⠀chief⠀examiner⠀try⠀the⠀exercise⠀once.\n\nThe⠀stage⠀is⠀a⠀shared⠀space.⠀Entrances⠀and⠀exits⠀should⠀make⠀participation⠀clear:⠀who⠀watched⠀the⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀who⠀remembers⠀it⠀later,⠀who⠀cannot⠀know⠀what⠀happened.⠀Progress⠀creates⠀new⠀stage⠀relationships:⠀someone⠀begins⠀to⠀believe,⠀another⠀tries⠀to⠀buy⠀the⠀technique,⠀a⠀third⠀insists⠀the⠀old⠀way⠀is⠀safer.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀when⠀a⠀practical⠀result⠀or⠀interruption⠀occurs,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀theatrical⠀speech.⠀A⠀session⠀may⠀stop⠀with⠀the⠀learner⠀unable⠀to⠀repeat⠀the⠀move,⠀an⠀official⠀refusing⠀a⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀believable⠀obstacle⠀remaining⠀in⠀place.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀the⠀learning⠀be⠀carried⠀by⠀a⠀particular⠀mind's⠀returning⠀attention.⠀Follow⠀a⠀specific⠀confusion⠀from⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀first⠀catches⠀the⠀focal⠀character:⠀the⠀sensation⠀of⠀a⠀wrong⠀grip,⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀teacher,⠀a⠀half-observed⠀result,⠀the⠀irrelevant⠀smell⠀of⠀the⠀room.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀jump⠀to⠀a⠀previous⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀childhood⠀failure,⠀then⠀come⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀attempt.⠀Syntax⠀may⠀fragment⠀when⠀perception⠀fragments,⠀but⠀the⠀central⠀investigative⠀thread⠀remains:⠀What⠀am⠀I⠀doing⠀wrong?⠀What⠀actually⠀happened?⠀What⠀would⠀prove⠀the⠀teacher's⠀claim?\n\nKeep⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀inquiry⠀inside⠀the⠀stream⠀as⠀concrete⠀verification.⠀When⠀the⠀mind⠀questions⠀an⠀official⠀method,⠀let⠀it⠀do⠀so⠀because⠀it⠀has⠀seen⠀the⠀result⠀and⠀can⠀compare⠀it⠀with⠀another⠀result:⠀the⠀safety⠀rule⠀that⠀made⠀the⠀task⠀impossible,⠀the⠀honor⠀system⠀that⠀rewarded⠀those⠀who⠀never⠀tried,⠀the⠀instruction⠀that⠀changed⠀every⠀time⠀an⠀official⠀spoke.⠀Let⠀the⠀irreverence⠀attach⠀to⠀these⠀testable⠀absurdities⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀general⠀mood⠀of⠀cynicism.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀contradiction⠀across⠀different⠀associations,⠀each⠀time⠀carrying⠀one⠀more⠀observed⠀detail⠀into⠀the⠀comparison.\n\nShow⠀improvement⠀as⠀a⠀reorganization⠀of⠀the⠀inner⠀sequence.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀finally⠀executes⠀a⠀technique,⠀braid⠀the⠀remembered⠀instruction,⠀the⠀earlier⠀failed⠀motion,⠀and⠀the⠀sudden⠀present⠀coordination⠀in⠀close⠀succession,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀feels⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀recalling⠀the⠀principle⠀and⠀performing⠀it.⠀Earlier⠀mistakes⠀are⠀not⠀erased⠀but⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀path:⠀the⠀wrong⠀grip⠀now⠀explains⠀why⠀the⠀old⠀ache⠀occurred,⠀the⠀half-remembered⠀phrase⠀now⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀teacher⠀left⠀out.⠀Let⠀recurring⠀sensory⠀material⠀change⠀meaning⠀as⠀the⠀body⠀responds⠀differently,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀decorative⠀motif.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀ownership⠀of⠀thought⠀clear.⠀This⠀is⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind,⠀not⠀every⠀character's⠀shared⠀consciousness.⠀Other⠀speakers⠀remain⠀distinct⠀through⠀their⠀quoted⠀words⠀and⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀perceptions⠀of⠀them.⠀The⠀style⠀may⠀dissolve⠀the⠀border⠀between⠀internal⠀and⠀external⠀report,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀invent⠀access⠀to⠀excluded⠀minds.⠀Relationships⠀and⠀daily⠀work⠀remain⠀present⠀as⠀sensory⠀and⠀emotional⠀texture:⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀wet⠀cloth,⠀a⠀limit⠀on⠀practice⠀time,⠀the⠀need⠀to⠀feed⠀someone⠀before⠀continuing.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀associative⠀wave⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀mandatory⠀realization⠀or⠀triumphant⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nBuild⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀messages⠀that⠀carry⠀practical⠀information:⠀a⠀short⠀clip⠀of⠀the⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀note⠀from⠀the⠀teacher⠀describing⠀the⠀correct⠀angle,⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀more⠀material,⠀a⠀correction⠀sent⠀after⠀watching⠀the⠀clip,⠀an⠀official⠀message⠀denying⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀practice⠀ground.⠀The⠀improvement⠀must⠀be⠀visible⠀across⠀the⠀exchange:⠀a⠀later⠀video⠀shows⠀the⠀movement⠀successful,⠀a⠀mentor⠀asks⠀whether⠀they⠀have⠀tried⠀it⠀under⠀load,⠀a⠀document⠀confirms⠀a⠀resource⠀has⠀been⠀unlocked.⠀Do⠀not⠀rely⠀on⠀invented⠀stats⠀or⠀system⠀alerts;⠀each⠀new⠀capability⠀is⠀communicated⠀as⠀something⠀the⠀sender⠀actually⠀saw⠀or⠀did.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀sent,⠀what⠀is⠀drafted,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀thought.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀type⠀an⠀honest⠀complaint,⠀delete⠀it,⠀and⠀send⠀a⠀formal⠀request;⠀the⠀unsent⠀draft⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀separate,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀non-transmitted⠀section⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀mind.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀before⠀sending⠀a⠀message⠀is⠀required,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀message⠀being⠀drafted⠀or⠀sent:⠀the⠀decision⠀to⠀soften⠀a⠀complaint,⠀the⠀suspicion⠀that⠀the⠀official⠀will⠀not⠀watch⠀the⠀clip,⠀the⠀calculation⠀behind⠀a⠀cheerful⠀reply.⠀Another⠀character⠀cannot⠀know⠀the⠀unsent⠀complaint⠀or⠀the⠀private⠀reasoning.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀candid⠀scrutiny⠀inside⠀the⠀medium's⠀own⠀constraints.⠀A⠀rule⠀quoted⠀in⠀the⠀channel⠀can⠀be⠀contradicted⠀by⠀an⠀attachment⠀showing⠀the⠀rule's⠀intended⠀use.⠀A⠀group⠀member⠀can⠀ask⠀a⠀simple⠀question⠀that⠀punctures⠀a⠀lengthy⠀official⠀announcement.⠀Let⠀each⠀communicator's⠀digital⠀habits⠀differ:⠀one⠀writes⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀uses⠀complete⠀bureaucratic⠀phrasing,⠀a⠀third⠀sends⠀only⠀links.⠀The⠀absurdity⠀emerges⠀from⠀actual⠀behavior,⠀not⠀authorial⠀commentary⠀inserted⠀between⠀messages.\n\nSelect⠀only⠀interface⠀events⠀that⠀matter.⠀If⠀a⠀recipient⠀has⠀read⠀a⠀message⠀and⠀chosen⠀not⠀to⠀reply,⠀a⠀delayed⠀read⠀receipt⠀may⠀be⠀relevant.⠀If⠀someone⠀edits⠀a⠀message⠀to⠀alter⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀visible⠀edited⠀marker⠀may⠀be⠀necessary.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀applause⠀reactions⠀or⠀accidental⠀sends⠀to⠀create⠀drama.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript;⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continues⠀around⠀the⠀messages:⠀someone⠀is⠀cooking,⠀someone⠀is⠀at⠀work,⠀someone⠀has⠀no⠀time⠀to⠀type.⠀End⠀after⠀a⠀meaningful⠀message,⠀a⠀long⠀pause,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀request;⠀no⠀forced⠀resolution⠀or⠀planted⠀clue⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nMake⠀each⠀scene⠀a⠀legible⠀attempt⠀at⠀a⠀new⠀capability.⠀Set⠀the⠀location⠀briefly:⠀a⠀workshop⠀bench,⠀a⠀stream⠀crossing,⠀a⠀library⠀desk,⠀an⠀empty⠀field.⠀Show⠀the⠀character⠀use⠀the⠀skill⠀and⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀failure⠀or⠀partial⠀success:⠀the⠀rope⠀slips,⠀the⠀compound⠀powders⠀incorrectly,⠀the⠀recited⠀phrase⠀fails.⠀The⠀next⠀scene⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀comparable⠀setting⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀practical⠀difference,⠀not⠀just⠀a⠀higher⠀number.⠀If⠀the⠀visual⠀design⠀cues⠀an⠀expression⠀or⠀background⠀detail,⠀use⠀it⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀moment⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀certify⠀that⠀someone⠀is⠀lying⠀or⠀improving.\n\nLet⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀and⠀inner⠀response⠀carry⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀inquiry⠀through⠀the⠀visible⠀scene.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀notices⠀that⠀the⠀official's⠀warning⠀is⠀contradicted⠀by⠀the⠀equipment⠀on⠀the⠀bench,⠀that⠀the⠀prescribed⠀exercise⠀is⠀designed⠀for⠀a⠀taller⠀body,⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀teacher⠀will⠀not⠀demonstrate⠀the⠀move.⠀Private⠀reasoning⠀stays⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀Dialogue⠀may⠀directly⠀challenge⠀an⠀authority:⠀\"You⠀said⠀it⠀would⠀hold,\"⠀\"Show⠀me⠀the⠀part⠀that⠀broke,\"⠀\"Why⠀does⠀the⠀exam⠀ban⠀the⠀only⠀tool⠀that⠀works?\"⠀Humor⠀is⠀assigned⠀to⠀particular⠀voices,⠀not⠀every⠀speaker.\n\nUse⠀the⠀scene-oriented⠀rhythm⠀without⠀invoking⠀player⠀choices,⠀branch⠀menus,⠀or⠀image⠀file⠀names.⠀A⠀scene⠀change⠀should⠀correspond⠀to⠀a⠀meaningful⠀shift⠀in⠀place,⠀time,⠀or⠀available⠀information.⠀Keep⠀the⠀presentation⠀readable:⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names,⠀concise⠀narrative⠀passages,⠀and⠀occasional⠀focal⠀reactions⠀that⠀show⠀cost⠀and⠀attention.⠀Background⠀changes⠀may⠀mark⠀a⠀new⠀location,⠀not⠀a⠀mandatory⠀new⠀illustration⠀for⠀every⠀line.\n\nLet⠀relationships⠀and⠀daily⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.⠀Someone⠀supports⠀the⠀practice,⠀someone⠀doubts⠀it,⠀someone⠀needs⠀help⠀with⠀ordinary⠀tasks.⠀Improvement⠀creates⠀new⠀social⠀consequences:⠀a⠀person⠀with⠀authority⠀begins⠀to⠀ask⠀for⠀the⠀technique,⠀a⠀friend⠀grows⠀wary,⠀a⠀rival⠀tries⠀to⠀copy⠀the⠀method⠀badly.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀sits⠀down⠀to⠀rest,⠀when⠀an⠀instructor⠀refuses⠀to⠀answer,⠀or⠀when⠀a⠀new⠀limitation⠀becomes⠀visible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalazbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMake⠀the⠀improvement⠀accumulate⠀through⠀repeated,⠀verifiable⠀differences.⠀Each⠀installment⠀can⠀show⠀a⠀small⠀gain:⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀holds⠀the⠀stance⠀longer,⠀recognizes⠀the⠀material⠀that⠀was⠀making⠀the⠀mixture⠀fail,⠀or⠀asks⠀the⠀right⠀question⠀about⠀the⠀manual.⠀Recover⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀meaning:⠀the⠀path⠀that⠀was⠀too⠀far⠀now⠀takes⠀half⠀the⠀time;⠀the⠀supervisor⠀who⠀refused⠀help⠀now⠀requests⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀result.⠀Do⠀not⠀create⠀a⠀numerical⠀system⠀merely⠀to⠀signal⠀level-ups;⠀let⠀the⠀world⠀answer⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀status⠀window.\n\nLet⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀direct⠀inquiry⠀operate⠀through⠀the⠀serial's⠀gradual⠀revelation.⠀An⠀official⠀claim⠀from⠀a⠀previous⠀reply⠀can⠀be⠀tested⠀later⠀and⠀may⠀fail⠀when⠀the⠀technique⠀is⠀applied⠀outside⠀the⠀demonstration.⠀A⠀minor⠀institutional⠀rule⠀can⠀obstruct⠀a⠀practical⠀improvement⠀for⠀a⠀previously⠀hidden⠀reason.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices⠀the⠀contradiction,⠀write⠀the⠀observation⠀as⠀attributed⠀interiority⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀testing:⠀the⠀comparison⠀between⠀the⠀promised⠀result⠀and⠀the⠀observed⠀one,⠀the⠀recognition⠀of⠀who⠀must⠀pretend⠀the⠀failure⠀did⠀not⠀occur,⠀the⠀decision⠀to⠀comply⠀publicly⠀while⠀privately⠀doubting⠀the⠀rule.⠀Candor⠀can⠀be⠀uneven:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀mock⠀a⠀rule⠀privately,⠀comply⠀publicly,⠀or⠀ask⠀the⠀dangerous⠀question⠀in⠀a⠀scene⠀where⠀it⠀matters.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀through-line⠀open⠀without⠀manufacturing⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀at⠀every⠀response⠀boundary.⠀Show⠀what⠀is⠀underway:⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀repair⠀the⠀cracked⠀bowl⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀market,⠀understand⠀the⠀teacher's⠀notes,⠀or⠀find⠀the⠀right⠀clay.⠀Recover⠀only⠀the⠀necessary⠀context;⠀a⠀previous⠀attempt⠀can⠀be⠀mentioned⠀in⠀half⠀a⠀sentence.⠀Let⠀ordinary⠀duties⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀narrative:⠀preparing⠀food,⠀mending⠀clothes,⠀caring⠀for⠀a⠀sick⠀relative,⠀answering⠀a⠀letter.⠀Progress⠀in⠀one⠀area⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀all⠀other⠀needs⠀disappear.\n\nAllow⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀to⠀develop⠀unevenly.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀execute⠀a⠀movement⠀but⠀still⠀misunderstand⠀a⠀principle,⠀or⠀discover⠀a⠀resource⠀but⠀lack⠀permission⠀to⠀use⠀it.⠀Each⠀installment⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀an⠀actual⠀event:⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀new⠀instruction,⠀a⠀friend's⠀reaction⠀to⠀a⠀changed⠀capability,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀pause.⠀No⠀compulsory⠀victory,⠀confession,⠀or⠀reversal⠀is⠀required,⠀but⠀the⠀next⠀reply⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀natural⠀thread⠀to⠀continue.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nMake⠀improvement⠀matter⠀through⠀concrete⠀attempts⠀that⠀leave⠀a⠀changed⠀capability,⠀but⠀render⠀each⠀gain⠀as⠀something⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀kept.⠀After⠀a⠀technique⠀works,⠀choose⠀one⠀brief⠀physical⠀impression—a⠀cracked⠀training⠀stone,⠀a⠀discarded⠀cloth,⠀a⠀mat⠀still⠀warm⠀from⠀the⠀previous⠀bout—and⠀let⠀it⠀hold⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀say.⠀Advancement⠀should⠀expose⠀the⠀next⠀inadequacy:⠀the⠀faster⠀movement⠀shows⠀how⠀late⠀the⠀response⠀still⠀is⠀when⠀it⠀matters;⠀the⠀new⠀understanding⠀arrives⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀person⠀it⠀was⠀meant⠀to⠀protect⠀has⠀already⠀turned⠀away.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀admits⠀a⠀need,⠀asks⠀for⠀help,⠀or⠀apologizes,⠀show⠀the⠀cost⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀narration.⠀Let⠀the⠀dialogue⠀strain⠀around⠀a⠀simple⠀word.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀may⠀answer⠀with⠀care,⠀with⠀awkwardness,⠀or⠀not⠀at⠀all,⠀but⠀the⠀character's⠀thought⠀should⠀remain⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀point-of-view⠀contract.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀every⠀exchange;⠀a⠀partial⠀comfort⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀remaining⠀silence⠀sharper.\n\nUse⠀transience⠀as⠀a⠀progression⠀device,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀blanket⠀mood.⠀Mastery⠀can⠀be⠀demonstrated⠀by⠀what⠀it⠀no⠀longer⠀costs⠀to⠀perform:⠀a⠀familiar⠀motion⠀now⠀exact,⠀a⠀pattern⠀recognized⠀in⠀time⠀to⠀answer.⠀Then⠀show⠀what⠀that⠀mastery⠀still⠀cannot⠀change—the⠀damage⠀already⠀done,⠀the⠀person⠀still⠀gone,⠀the⠀door⠀that⠀remains⠀closed.⠀The⠀story⠀moves⠀forward⠀because⠀capability⠀increases,⠀but⠀emotional⠀exposure⠀follows⠀the⠀same⠀path,⠀so⠀each⠀advancement⠀makes⠀the⠀unresolved⠀need⠀more⠀painful⠀and⠀more⠀precise.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀cast⠀uniformly⠀suffering⠀or⠀the⠀world⠀stopping⠀whenever⠀progress⠀occurs.⠀Supporters⠀can⠀advance,⠀help⠀can⠀be⠀effective,⠀and⠀the⠀difficulty⠀of⠀the⠀relationship⠀can⠀be⠀named⠀without⠀a⠀confession⠀as⠀an⠀obligatory⠀beat.⠀Keep⠀the⠀selected⠀progression⠀system's⠀actual⠀limits⠀as⠀the⠀reason⠀for⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult,⠀not⠀a⠀sudden⠀rule⠀invented⠀to⠀force⠀despair.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀attribution.⠀Use⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity⠀to⠀make⠀one⠀physical⠀detail⠀stand⠀for⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀capability:⠀the⠀cracked⠀grip⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀trembles,⠀the⠀distance⠀stepped⠀without⠀counting,⠀the⠀bowl⠀steadied⠀when⠀the⠀hand⠀used⠀to⠀shake.⠀Do⠀not⠀narrate⠀the⠀improvement⠀as⠀a⠀summary;⠀show⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀detail⠀a⠀participant⠀could⠀notice⠀in⠀the⠀scene.\n\nWhen⠀moments⠀of⠀understanding⠀occur,⠀let⠀one⠀character⠀register⠀them⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀continues.⠀Use⠀emotional⠀omission:⠀a⠀pause⠀after⠀an⠀answer,⠀a⠀glance⠀at⠀the⠀cooling⠀tea,⠀a⠀hand⠀withdrawn⠀before⠀contact.⠀The⠀other⠀player's⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀or⠀not;⠀if⠀they⠀notice,⠀they⠀may⠀respond⠀with⠀a⠀brief⠀sentence⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀full⠀analysis.⠀This⠀maintains⠀the⠀shared⠀scene⠀without⠀stopping⠀the⠀action⠀for⠀an⠀explanation⠀of⠀the⠀private⠀thought.\n\nAdvancement⠀can⠀be⠀shown⠀through⠀changed⠀capability⠀during⠀practice⠀or⠀ordinary⠀work.⠀If⠀another⠀attempt⠀occurs,⠀let⠀its⠀result⠀follow⠀the⠀established⠀capability,⠀conditions,⠀and⠀action.⠀Success⠀may⠀hold;⠀an⠀error⠀may⠀recur⠀or⠀be⠀caught⠀sooner.⠀Select⠀the⠀concrete⠀detail⠀that⠀makes⠀any⠀actual⠀difference⠀legible.⠀A⠀familiar⠀setting⠀can⠀recur⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀detail—a⠀repaired⠀window,⠀a⠀notch⠀carved⠀in⠀the⠀practice⠀post—so⠀improvement⠀is⠀tangible⠀but⠀not⠀always⠀spoken.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀interval⠀where⠀the⠀current⠀action⠀leaves⠀it.⠀If⠀a⠀task⠀is⠀unfinished,⠀the⠀last⠀paragraph⠀may⠀describe⠀the⠀character⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀task⠀or⠀pausing⠀before⠀a⠀next⠀attempt.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀direct⠀question⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀player,⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀decision.⠀The⠀continuation⠀should⠀follow⠀naturally⠀from⠀the⠀scene,⠀leaving⠀a⠀clear⠀state⠀anyone⠀can⠀pick⠀up,⠀but⠀not⠀insist⠀on⠀a⠀response⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀turn.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀and⠀action⠀contracts;⠀Kawabata's⠀distance⠀does⠀not⠀overwrite⠀player⠀control⠀or⠀speaker⠀clarity.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀a⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling,⠀not⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀or⠀allegorical⠀frame.⠀Present⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀encounters⠀that⠀test⠀the⠀character's⠀developing⠀capability.⠀After⠀each⠀attempt,⠀the⠀narrator⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀familiar⠀public⠀space—a⠀tea⠀house,⠀a⠀training⠀yard,⠀a⠀village⠀gate—where⠀the⠀consequences⠀are⠀seen⠀from⠀a⠀socially⠀aware⠀perspective.⠀The⠀storyteller⠀knows⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀know⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀conceal;⠀that⠀awareness⠀shapes⠀the⠀telling.\n\nShow⠀improvement⠀through⠀repeated⠀material⠀tests.⠀A⠀task⠀the⠀character⠀once⠀failed⠀appears⠀again⠀with⠀some⠀detail⠀changed:⠀the⠀same⠀cracked⠀pillar,⠀now⠀mended;⠀the⠀same⠀opponent,⠀now⠀slower⠀or⠀faster⠀because⠀of⠀wounds⠀or⠀training.⠀The⠀audience⠀sees⠀the⠀character⠀succeed⠀through⠀one⠀specific⠀new⠀skill,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀lucky⠀break⠀or⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀effort.⠀The⠀storyteller's⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀listeners⠀or⠀readers⠀remains⠀present⠀without⠀turning⠀each⠀episode⠀into⠀a⠀cliffhanger.\n\nUse⠀restrained⠀emotional⠀intervals⠀drawn⠀from⠀the⠀world's⠀folk⠀or⠀social⠀custom.⠀After⠀a⠀failure,⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀stand⠀by⠀a⠀window⠀in⠀the⠀evening,⠀watch⠀smoke⠀from⠀the⠀communal⠀stove,⠀or⠀listen⠀to⠀a⠀child⠀practicing⠀the⠀same⠀figures;⠀let⠀the⠀objects⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀mention⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀waited⠀too⠀long⠀or⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀asked,⠀but⠀should⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀connection.⠀This⠀is⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀image⠀adapted⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀setting,⠀not⠀a⠀Japanese⠀interior.\n\nKeep⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀distinct.⠀Names,⠀greetings,⠀and⠀domestic⠀details⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀established⠀world,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀generic⠀Chinese⠀past.⠀Advancement⠀gains⠀respect⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀cast⠀uniformly⠀loyal;⠀the⠀storyteller⠀may⠀note⠀who⠀now⠀speaks⠀kindly⠀and⠀who⠀still⠀avoids⠀the⠀character,⠀letting⠀those⠀shifts⠀show⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀progress.⠀The⠀story⠀moves⠀through⠀episodes⠀of⠀increased⠀ability⠀and⠀changed⠀relationships,⠀not⠀a⠀single⠀uninterrupted⠀training⠀arc.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nRender⠀advancement⠀through⠀direct⠀physical⠀work.⠀Show⠀a⠀technique⠀attempted,⠀failed,⠀corrected,⠀and⠀repeated⠀until⠀a⠀measurable⠀result⠀changes:⠀the⠀blade⠀bit⠀deeper,⠀the⠀carry⠀was⠀steady,⠀the⠀wall⠀no⠀longer⠀scraped⠀the⠀forearm.⠀Use⠀hard-edged⠀diction⠀and⠀tight⠀transitions;⠀do⠀not⠀narrate⠀effort⠀as⠀a⠀vague⠀feeling.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀by⠀showing⠀the⠀earlier⠀failures⠀and⠀the⠀later⠀success⠀in⠀the⠀body,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀mental⠀summary.\n\nLet⠀material⠀wear⠀be⠀evidence⠀of⠀progress⠀and⠀cost.⠀A⠀stone⠀step⠀worn⠀smooth⠀where⠀the⠀foot⠀anchored;⠀a⠀rope⠀frayed⠀where⠀the⠀grip⠀slipped;⠀a⠀water⠀jar⠀cracked⠀at⠀the⠀rim⠀where⠀the⠀hand⠀caught⠀it⠀wrong.⠀Choose⠀one⠀image⠀after⠀the⠀action⠀to⠀do⠀the⠀emotional⠀work,⠀following⠀Kawabata's⠀economy:⠀the⠀speaker⠀need⠀not⠀name⠀disappointment⠀or⠀relief.⠀The⠀image⠀should⠀be⠀useful⠀to⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀decorative.\n\nRough⠀speech⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀character⠀or⠀the⠀setting,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀narrator⠀who⠀swears⠀constantly.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀swears,⠀ground⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀pain,⠀failure,⠀or⠀attempt.⠀When⠀the⠀prose⠀is⠀compressed,⠀keep⠀transitions⠀physical:⠀a⠀breath,⠀a⠀step,⠀a⠀tool⠀set⠀down.⠀If⠀the⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀more⠀room,⠀open⠀the⠀sentence⠀into⠀a⠀longer⠀thought;⠀otherwise⠀keep⠀the⠀movement⠀tight.\n\nShow⠀rank⠀or⠀system⠀change⠀through⠀practical⠀tests.⠀After⠀the⠀change,⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀something⠀impossible⠀before:⠀lifts⠀the⠀stone,⠀heals⠀the⠀wound,⠀climbs⠀the⠀wall⠀without⠀fear.⠀But⠀show⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult:⠀the⠀stone⠀still⠀heavy,⠀the⠀wound⠀still⠀sore,⠀the⠀wall⠀still⠀wet.⠀Progression⠀is⠀not⠀comfort;⠀it⠀makes⠀the⠀next⠀test⠀clearer⠀and⠀the⠀body⠀more⠀sharply⠀known.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCompose⠀the⠀sequence⠀as⠀documents⠀grounded⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀situation.⠀A⠀training⠀log⠀may⠀record⠀a⠀new⠀technique⠀attempted,⠀failed,⠀and⠀retried⠀on⠀a⠀later⠀date⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀result;⠀a⠀report⠀to⠀a⠀teacher⠀or⠀patron⠀may⠀be⠀edited⠀to⠀conceal⠀a⠀private⠀failure;⠀a⠀letter⠀to⠀a⠀friend⠀may⠀mention⠀a⠀physical⠀detail—the⠀ink⠀still⠀wet,⠀the⠀lamp⠀wick⠀too⠀short—that⠀tells⠀how⠀the⠀writer⠀felt⠀without⠀saying⠀it.⠀Each⠀document⠀must⠀have⠀an⠀author,⠀a⠀reason⠀for⠀writing,⠀and⠀a⠀reader⠀who⠀would⠀care.\n\nUse⠀the⠀omission⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀form.⠀The⠀log⠀may⠀not⠀record⠀the⠀stiffness⠀in⠀the⠀shoulder⠀after⠀the⠀first⠀success;⠀the⠀letter⠀may⠀mention⠀only⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀rain⠀outside⠀the⠀training⠀hall.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀entries⠀shows⠀the⠀passage⠀of⠀time⠀and⠀the⠀work⠀done⠀between⠀them.⠀A⠀reviser⠀may⠀cross⠀out⠀a⠀line⠀or⠀rewrite⠀a⠀claim,⠀and⠀that⠀trace⠀can⠀be⠀evidence⠀of⠀fear⠀or⠀eagerness.⠀Conflicting⠀accounts⠀between⠀a⠀student⠀and⠀a⠀teacher⠀can⠀show⠀what⠀advancement⠀looked⠀like⠀from⠀different⠀positions.\n\nProgress⠀appears⠀through⠀material⠀details⠀and⠀changed⠀numbers⠀or⠀names⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀world⠀has⠀them.⠀Avoid⠀inventing⠀a⠀point⠀system⠀merely⠀to⠀show⠀improvement.⠀Instead,⠀record⠀a⠀task⠀now⠀performed:⠀the⠀spear⠀lifted⠀in⠀one⠀motion,⠀the⠀path⠀found⠀before⠀dawn,⠀the⠀seal⠀kept⠀unbroken.⠀When⠀the⠀document⠀writer⠀is⠀honest,⠀they⠀note⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult;⠀when⠀they⠀are⠀not,⠀the⠀later⠀document⠀or⠀the⠀physical⠀record⠀corrects⠀the⠀silence.\n\nDo⠀not⠀interrupt⠀each⠀document⠀with⠀an⠀omniscient⠀narrator's⠀explanation.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀work⠀from⠀the⠀gap,⠀the⠀missing⠀detail,⠀the⠀changed⠀signature,⠀or⠀the⠀newer⠀entry⠀replying⠀to⠀an⠀older⠀one.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀rules:⠀an⠀in-world⠀document⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀character's⠀complete⠀live⠀mind;⠀it⠀is⠀what⠀they⠀chose⠀to⠀write⠀for⠀that⠀reader.⠀A⠀Kawabata⠀attention⠀to⠀transience⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀document's⠀closing—a⠀date,⠀a⠀season,⠀a⠀task⠀unfinished—so⠀the⠀sequence⠀feels⠀like⠀a⠀life⠀passing⠀while⠀ability⠀grows.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nLet⠀care⠀and⠀ease⠀be⠀concrete,⠀recurrent,⠀and⠀materially⠀tied⠀to⠀progress.⠀After⠀a⠀hard⠀attempt,⠀choose⠀a⠀specific⠀small⠀pleasure:⠀a⠀warm⠀drink⠀prepared⠀exactly⠀as⠀the⠀character⠀likes,⠀a⠀clean⠀dry⠀cloth⠀folded⠀by⠀the⠀door,⠀a⠀fire⠀built⠀without⠀being⠀asked,⠀a⠀favorite⠀food⠀saved⠀for⠀after⠀practice.⠀Do⠀not⠀repeat⠀the⠀same⠀comfort⠀every⠀time;⠀vary⠀it⠀with⠀the⠀season⠀or⠀setting,⠀but⠀make⠀the⠀link⠀clear.⠀The⠀character⠀notices⠀not⠀the⠀pleasure⠀alone,⠀but⠀who⠀remembered⠀it.⠀That⠀recognition⠀can⠀be⠀private⠀and⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀voiced.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀attention⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀scene⠀from⠀becoming⠀a⠀soft⠀montage.⠀Pick⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀sensory⠀details:⠀steam⠀off⠀the⠀bowl,⠀a⠀cat⠀sleeping⠀on⠀the⠀folded⠀mat,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀broom⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀room.⠀Let⠀those⠀details⠀carry⠀the⠀tone.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀something⠀like⠀that⠀was⠀worth⠀finishing⠀for,⠀but⠀no⠀confession⠀is⠀required.⠀Affection⠀can⠀be⠀shown⠀by⠀a⠀companion⠀finishing⠀a⠀chore,⠀answering⠀a⠀need⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀spoken,⠀or⠀simply⠀waiting⠀with⠀no⠀expectation.\n\nAdvancement⠀changes⠀what⠀comfort⠀means.⠀A⠀rest⠀the⠀character⠀once⠀needed⠀after⠀lifting⠀water⠀may⠀become⠀a⠀shared⠀interval⠀without⠀fatigue;⠀a⠀meal⠀once⠀hurried⠀may⠀be⠀shared⠀slowly⠀now⠀that⠀the⠀daily⠀task⠀is⠀manageable.⠀Show⠀the⠀change⠀through⠀the⠀quiet⠀details:⠀no⠀longer⠀dropping⠀the⠀spoon,⠀no⠀longer⠀leaving⠀half⠀the⠀food.⠀This⠀connects⠀the⠀fluffy⠀style⠀to⠀the⠀progression⠀genre⠀without⠀pausing⠀every⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀training⠀report.\n\nKeep⠀personality⠀and⠀disagreement.⠀Kindness⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable.⠀A⠀friend⠀can⠀be⠀quietly⠀annoyed,⠀a⠀teacher⠀can⠀correct⠀a⠀form⠀while⠀handing⠀over⠀a⠀blanket,⠀a⠀sibling⠀can⠀complain⠀and⠀still⠀prepare⠀the⠀bath.⠀Privacy⠀remains:⠀not⠀every⠀soft⠀moment⠀leads⠀to⠀a⠀heart-to-heart.⠀The⠀story⠀advances⠀because⠀capability⠀improves⠀and⠀relationships⠀change,⠀but⠀the⠀warmth⠀is⠀written⠀as⠀a⠀genuine⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life,⠀not⠀a⠀reward⠀that⠀cancels⠀the⠀next⠀challenge.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀deliberate,⠀expanded⠀paragraphs⠀that⠀place⠀each⠀advancement⠀in⠀a⠀social⠀frame.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀observe⠀who⠀now⠀watches⠀the⠀character⠀practice,⠀whose⠀greeting⠀changes,⠀what⠀debt⠀or⠀invitation⠀follows⠀a⠀public⠀success.⠀Progression⠀is⠀not⠀only⠀a⠀personal⠀gain;⠀it⠀rearranges⠀the⠀character⠀inside⠀their⠀community.⠀Use⠀historical⠀or⠀customary⠀knowledge⠀when⠀the⠀world⠀has⠀it:⠀a⠀guild⠀rule,⠀a⠀feast⠀day,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀lineage,⠀a⠀local⠀saying⠀about⠀the⠀body.⠀The⠀narrator⠀knows⠀some⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀does⠀not,⠀and⠀that⠀distance⠀creates⠀formality⠀without⠀removing⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀thoughts.\n\nWithin⠀the⠀broader⠀scene,⠀use⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀image⠀to⠀localize⠀feeling.⠀Instead⠀of⠀describing⠀the⠀whole⠀training⠀hall,⠀choose⠀the⠀crack⠀in⠀the⠀east⠀wall⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀used⠀to⠀stare⠀at,⠀now⠀gone⠀or⠀repaired.⠀A⠀paragraph⠀that⠀begins⠀with⠀social⠀judgment⠀can⠀narrow⠀to⠀a⠀single⠀physical⠀detail,⠀letting⠀the⠀reader⠀feel⠀the⠀inner⠀change⠀without⠀a⠀long⠀stream⠀of⠀consciousness.⠀The⠀relation⠀between⠀that⠀detail⠀and⠀the⠀action—the⠀crack,⠀the⠀repaired⠀wall,⠀the⠀empty⠀bench—should⠀be⠀left⠀implicit.\n\nShow⠀progression⠀by⠀contrast⠀across⠀scenes.⠀An⠀early⠀paragraph⠀may⠀narrate⠀an⠀attempt⠀with⠀the⠀language⠀of⠀poor⠀timing:⠀the⠀foot⠀too⠀late,⠀the⠀breath⠀wrong,⠀the⠀teacher's⠀correction.⠀A⠀later⠀scene,⠀told⠀at⠀equal⠀length,⠀shows⠀the⠀same⠀movement⠀now⠀economical,⠀but⠀the⠀narrator⠀notes⠀what⠀still⠀remains:⠀the⠀opponent⠀faster,⠀the⠀weight⠀heavier,⠀the⠀old⠀habit⠀returning⠀in⠀fear.⠀This⠀contrast⠀is⠀the⠀progression⠀fantasy⠀core;⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀reduced⠀to⠀a⠀single⠀summarized⠀rank⠀climb.\n\nThe⠀narrator's⠀speech⠀is⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀characters'⠀ordinary⠀talk.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀speaks,⠀keep⠀it⠀human⠀and⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀social⠀position;⠀no⠀one⠀need⠀sound⠀like⠀an⠀essay.⠀Use⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀contrast:⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀or⠀a⠀formal⠀demonstration⠀may⠀organize⠀a⠀passage,⠀but⠀the⠀private⠀recovery⠀afterward⠀can⠀be⠀told⠀with⠀Kawabata's⠀quiet⠀attention.⠀The⠀ending⠀of⠀a⠀scene⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀task⠀or⠀relationship⠀unresolved,⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀the⠀capability⠀change⠀is⠀evident⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀consequences⠀have⠀begun⠀to⠀move.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀telling.⠀Put⠀a⠀definite⠀teller⠀before⠀a⠀definite⠀audience—students,⠀rivals,⠀a⠀patron,⠀a⠀child,⠀a⠀community,⠀a⠀fellow⠀practitioner—at⠀an⠀occasion⠀that⠀gives⠀the⠀account⠀a⠀purpose:⠀to⠀warn,⠀persuade,⠀explain⠀a⠀delay,⠀secure⠀help,⠀or⠀make⠀someone⠀understand⠀what⠀a⠀capability⠀costs.⠀The⠀teller's⠀present⠀situation⠀shapes⠀emphasis,⠀omission,⠀and⠀sequence.⠀What⠀is⠀told⠀first,⠀what⠀is⠀postponed,⠀and⠀what⠀returns⠀as⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀narration.\n\nFollow⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀embodied⠀attempts,⠀not⠀a⠀ledger.⠀Show⠀the⠀learner⠀trying,⠀failing,⠀receiving⠀correction,⠀practicing,⠀and⠀changing⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀do.⠀Keep⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀distinct⠀from⠀executing⠀it:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀describe⠀the⠀correct⠀movement,⠀formula,⠀or⠀approach⠀while⠀still⠀being⠀unable⠀to⠀perform⠀it⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Let⠀capability⠀advance⠀unevenly—one⠀skill⠀sharpens⠀while⠀another⠀stalls;⠀a⠀new⠀resource⠀helps⠀in⠀one⠀context⠀and⠀creates⠀dependence⠀in⠀another.⠀Test⠀progress⠀through⠀concrete⠀before-and-after⠀moments:⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀that⠀was⠀impossible⠀earlier,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult⠀or⠀newly⠀complicated.⠀Let⠀relationships,⠀recovery,⠀ordinary⠀work,⠀and⠀the⠀need⠀to⠀teach⠀or⠀explain⠀what⠀one⠀has⠀learned⠀stay⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀development.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity⠀to⠀render⠀this⠀progression⠀through⠀carefully⠀chosen⠀physical⠀impressions,⠀brief⠀surfaces,⠀and⠀intervals⠀rather⠀than⠀exhaustive⠀explanation.⠀Let⠀the⠀relation⠀among⠀details⠀carry⠀feeling:⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀breath⠀after⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀the⠀changed⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀gesture⠀repeated⠀with⠀different⠀precision,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀spoken.⠀Omit⠀emotional⠀commentary⠀where⠀the⠀sensory⠀sequence⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀choices⠀already⠀imply⠀it.⠀Compression⠀should⠀not⠀flatten⠀the⠀characters⠀into⠀one⠀melancholy⠀register;⠀each⠀person's⠀private⠀experience,⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀authorized⠀interiority⠀remains⠀specific.⠀When⠀the⠀narration⠀enters⠀a⠀mind,⠀render⠀the⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀thought,⠀sensation,⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀summary⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀report.\n\nLet⠀embedded⠀tales⠀do⠀work⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀telling.⠀A⠀nested⠀episode⠀may⠀demonstrate⠀a⠀stage⠀of⠀learning,⠀delay⠀a⠀dangerous⠀disclosure,⠀warn⠀through⠀example,⠀or⠀revise⠀how⠀the⠀audience⠀understands⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀capability.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀intelligible:⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀who⠀speaks⠀in⠀the⠀frame⠀and⠀who⠀speaks⠀within⠀a⠀tale,⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀transition⠀is⠀spare.⠀Recurrence⠀is⠀the⠀main⠀tool⠀for⠀progression.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀wound,⠀question,⠀or⠀failed⠀maneuver⠀can⠀appear⠀at⠀several⠀points,⠀accruing⠀meaning⠀as⠀the⠀learner's⠀capacity⠀and⠀the⠀listener's⠀understanding⠀change.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀recurrence⠀to⠀certify⠀a⠀claim;⠀let⠀it⠀mark⠀change,⠀cost,⠀or⠀unresolved⠀difficulty.\n\nWhen⠀established⠀ranks,⠀schools,⠀or⠀systems⠀exist⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀world,⠀they⠀can⠀anchor⠀advancement,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀numerical⠀mechanics⠀merely⠀to⠀display⠀progress.⠀A⠀rank⠀may⠀be⠀earned,⠀disputed,⠀or⠀insufficient.⠀The⠀real⠀measure⠀is⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀do,⠀what⠀they⠀still⠀cannot,⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀telling⠀alters⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀will⠀risk⠀or⠀grant.⠀Stop⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀natural⠀boundary;⠀the⠀frame⠀may⠀remain⠀open,⠀a⠀listener⠀may⠀interrupt,⠀or⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀stop⠀at⠀a⠀difficult⠀admission.⠀Avoid⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀test,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀Use⠀the⠀Arabian⠀Nights⠀inspiration⠀for⠀craft—situated⠀telling,⠀nesting,⠀recurrence,⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀that⠀matters—without⠀automatically⠀inserting⠀djinn,⠀palaces,⠀deserts,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀religion⠀into⠀a⠀setting⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀already⠀hold⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀social/developmental-realist⠀route⠀of⠀German-language⠀writing:⠀put⠀advancement⠀inside⠀a⠀particular⠀life⠀of⠀work,⠀training,⠀family⠀expectation,⠀money,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀changing⠀social⠀position.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀carry⠀milieu,⠀obligation,⠀and⠀partial⠀understanding⠀without⠀becoming⠀bureaucratic,⠀severe,⠀or⠀generically⠀translated.⠀The⠀realism⠀comes⠀from⠀concrete⠀arrangements—who⠀needs⠀what,⠀who⠀teaches⠀whom,⠀what⠀a⠀day⠀costs—and⠀from⠀how⠀distance⠀and⠀understanding⠀shift⠀as⠀the⠀character⠀gains⠀or⠀fails⠀to⠀gain⠀a⠀capacity.⠀Make⠀improvement⠀a⠀sustained⠀thread⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀verdict:⠀show⠀it⠀through⠀attempts,⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀new⠀understanding,⠀resources,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it;⠀let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly.⠀If⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀provides⠀ranks,⠀teachers,⠀or⠀systems,⠀use⠀them⠀as⠀supports⠀for⠀the⠀account⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀numbers⠀to⠀display⠀progress.⠀Relationships,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀developing⠀life.\n\nRender⠀that⠀progression⠀through⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀attention.⠀Choose⠀a⠀few⠀physical⠀impressions—weather⠀on⠀a⠀surface,⠀a⠀sound⠀from⠀the⠀next⠀room,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀tool⠀or⠀object,⠀the⠀way⠀light⠀changes⠀during⠀practice—and⠀let⠀them⠀recur⠀with⠀altered⠀meaning⠀as⠀capability,⠀fatigue,⠀or⠀relationship⠀changes.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀link⠀between⠀detail⠀and⠀feeling.⠀A⠀repeated⠀task⠀can⠀mark⠀change⠀because⠀the⠀same⠀gesture⠀now⠀costs⠀less,⠀or⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀what⠀was⠀previously⠀invisible;⠀it⠀may⠀also⠀mark⠀a⠀limit⠀that⠀has⠀not⠀moved.⠀Compression⠀must⠀not⠀flatten⠀the⠀person⠀into⠀an⠀emotionless⠀surface.⠀Where⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀permits,⠀give⠀actual⠀private⠀thought,⠀sensation,⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀motive,⠀including⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀would⠀not⠀say⠀aloud.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀hides⠀part⠀of⠀this⠀interiority,⠀keep⠀it⠀as⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀summary.⠀Emotional⠀omission⠀can⠀leave⠀pride,⠀shame,⠀or⠀relief⠀unspoken,⠀but⠀the⠀inner⠀life⠀remains⠀specific⠀to⠀that⠀person.\n\nMake⠀the⠀learning⠀causal⠀and⠀testable⠀in⠀scenes.⠀An⠀attempt⠀can⠀meet⠀a⠀concrete⠀obstacle;⠀feedback—from⠀a⠀teacher,⠀a⠀peer,⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀failed⠀result,⠀or⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀revised⠀understanding—can⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀tries⠀next.⠀Later,⠀test⠀changed⠀capability⠀against⠀something⠀the⠀earlier⠀self⠀could⠀not⠀manage,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀tool⠀used⠀cleanly,⠀a⠀route⠀remembered,⠀a⠀conversation⠀managed,⠀or⠀a⠀fear⠀stayed⠀with.⠀Keep⠀some⠀difficulty⠀intact.⠀A⠀mentor⠀may⠀be⠀useful⠀and⠀limited;⠀a⠀peer⠀may⠀change;⠀an⠀obligation⠀may⠀interrupt⠀practice;⠀a⠀recovery⠀may⠀alter⠀the⠀pace.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀scene⠀toward⠀a⠀breakthrough,⠀betrayal,⠀reversal,⠀or⠀moral⠀lesson.\n\nUse⠀intervals⠀to⠀make⠀cumulative⠀change⠀legible.⠀A⠀later⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀familiar⠀task,⠀place,⠀or⠀exchange⠀can⠀show⠀difference⠀in⠀execution,⠀attention,⠀or⠀cost,⠀or⠀it⠀can⠀show⠀that⠀nothing⠀has⠀changed⠀yet.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀close⠀while⠀practice⠀continues,⠀a⠀wait⠀holds,⠀a⠀conversation⠀is⠀unfinished,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀recognition⠀is⠀still⠀settling.⠀No⠀completed⠀test,⠀final⠀mastery,⠀or⠀resolved⠀emotional⠀outcome⠀is⠀required;⠀what⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀feel⠀the⠀developing⠀capability⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀hard.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nWrite⠀improvement⠀as⠀something⠀achieved⠀through⠀repeated⠀encounters⠀with⠀a⠀particular⠀demand,⠀then⠀rendered⠀selectively.⠀Choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀capabilities⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀life—a⠀hand⠀skill,⠀a⠀reading,⠀a⠀way⠀through⠀a⠀building⠀or⠀bureaucracy—and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀the⠀same⠀concrete⠀detail⠀under⠀changed⠀conditions:⠀the⠀grip⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀shake⠀now⠀holds;⠀the⠀breath⠀that⠀once⠀ran⠀out⠀at⠀the⠀third⠀stair⠀now⠀carries⠀to⠀the⠀landing;⠀a⠀sound⠀that⠀demanded⠀conscious⠀attention⠀passes⠀without⠀comment⠀because⠀the⠀body⠀has⠀moved⠀past⠀it.⠀Compress⠀the⠀practice⠀into⠀intervals⠀between⠀these⠀moments.⠀Let⠀what⠀happened⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀be⠀inferred⠀from⠀residue:⠀chalk⠀dust,⠀a⠀bandaged⠀knuckle,⠀a⠀repaired⠀seam,⠀a⠀new⠀notation⠀in⠀a⠀borrowed⠀book.⠀Let⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀reveal⠀what⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀skill⠀is⠀still⠀unassimilated⠀rather⠀than⠀canceling⠀an⠀established⠀gain.\n\nKeep⠀knowledge⠀and⠀execution⠀distinct.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀recite⠀the⠀principle⠀correctly⠀and⠀still⠀miss⠀the⠀move,⠀or⠀understand⠀a⠀correction⠀immediately⠀and⠀have⠀it⠀settle⠀into⠀the⠀body⠀much⠀later.⠀Show⠀progress⠀through⠀what⠀can⠀now⠀be⠀done,⠀what⠀has⠀become⠀easier,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀stubbornly⠀difficult.⠀Show⠀feedback⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀task⠀actually⠀permits⠀and⠀how⠀other⠀people⠀respond—an⠀instructor's⠀correction,⠀a⠀tool⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀binds,⠀a⠀stranger's⠀assumption—rather⠀than⠀through⠀internal⠀certainty⠀alone.⠀If⠀ranks,⠀schools,⠀permits,⠀or⠀formal⠀systems⠀exist,⠀treat⠀them⠀as⠀social⠀and⠀material⠀facts:⠀they⠀can⠀open⠀a⠀door,⠀impose⠀a⠀fee,⠀mark⠀someone⠀as⠀belonging⠀to⠀an⠀old⠀line,⠀or⠀make⠀others⠀expect⠀a⠀performance.⠀They⠀do⠀not⠀stand⠀in⠀for⠀capability,⠀and⠀no⠀new⠀numbers⠀or⠀tiers⠀need⠀be⠀invented.⠀Recovery,⠀rent,⠀shifts,⠀care⠀for⠀dependents,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀errands⠀continue⠀alongside⠀the⠀training⠀and⠀take⠀their⠀own⠀time.\n\nEntangle⠀the⠀capability⠀with⠀an⠀inherited⠀or⠀administered⠀claim:⠀a⠀technique⠀held⠀by⠀a⠀family⠀or⠀guild,⠀a⠀license⠀signed⠀by⠀someone⠀whose⠀name⠀still⠀carries⠀weight,⠀a⠀device⠀kept⠀alive⠀with⠀salvaged⠀parts,⠀a⠀debt⠀owed⠀to⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀institution.⠀Give⠀the⠀terms⠀material⠀texture—tape⠀over⠀a⠀seam,⠀a⠀stamped⠀form,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀stairwell,⠀a⠀coat⠀too⠀warm⠀for⠀the⠀office—and⠀let⠀each⠀gain⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀owes⠀and⠀what⠀others⠀now⠀expect,⠀demand,⠀or⠀resent.⠀Old⠀authority⠀should⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀present⠀constraint,⠀not⠀a⠀legend.⠀Urban⠀decay⠀is⠀the⠀medium⠀through⠀which⠀it⠀acts:⠀a⠀blocked⠀lift,⠀a⠀landlord's⠀notice,⠀a⠀route⠀that⠀changes⠀because⠀a⠀building⠀is⠀coming⠀down.⠀The⠀horror⠀here⠀is⠀intimate⠀and⠀administrative:⠀an⠀old⠀claim⠀pressing⠀on⠀a⠀present⠀body,⠀a⠀trusted⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀mask⠀can⠀fall,⠀a⠀city⠀that⠀administers⠀decay⠀through⠀ordinary⠀paperwork.⠀Atmosphere⠀should⠀shape⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced,⠀not⠀add⠀supernatural⠀mechanics.\n\nIn⠀company,⠀let⠀speech⠀accommodate⠀rank,⠀need,⠀and⠀the⠀masks⠀people⠀wear⠀to⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀city.⠀Among⠀trusted⠀people⠀those⠀accommodations⠀may⠀drop⠀away;⠀what⠀surfaces⠀there⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀explained,⠀and⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀confession,⠀betrayal,⠀or⠀reconciliation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀spoken:⠀what⠀they⠀notice,⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀yet⠀do,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀deliberately⠀not⠀looking⠀at,⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀from⠀someone⠀who⠀may⠀not⠀know.⠀Let⠀feeling⠀reside⠀in⠀selected⠀objects⠀and⠀gestures,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀remove⠀interiority⠀from⠀the⠀page.⠀Something⠀passing—a⠀season,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀leaving,⠀a⠀street⠀about⠀to⠀be⠀rebuilt,⠀a⠀body's⠀ease⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀last—stays⠀difficult⠀to⠀keep,⠀so⠀new⠀capability⠀is⠀measured⠀against⠀what⠀it⠀cannot⠀hold.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀during⠀practice,⠀during⠀a⠀conversation,⠀or⠀inside⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task,⠀with⠀the⠀improvement⠀only⠀partly⠀landed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀a⠀progression⠀narrative⠀in⠀the⠀Indian⠀route⠀of⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism⠀carried⠀by⠀an⠀oral-frame⠀recurrence.⠀Let⠀the⠀frame⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀practice's⠀own⠀world:⠀a⠀household,⠀workshop,⠀field,⠀clinic,⠀stage,⠀school,⠀or⠀street⠀that⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀already⠀places⠀the⠀work⠀in,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀teacher,⠀elder,⠀or⠀peer⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀remembered⠀account,⠀instruction,⠀or⠀dispute⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀ordinary⠀social⠀life⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀decorative⠀narration.⠀The⠀retelling⠀may⠀clarify⠀why⠀a⠀technique⠀is⠀guarded,⠀why⠀a⠀promise⠀or⠀debt⠀matters,⠀or⠀how⠀an⠀earlier⠀practitioner's⠀example⠀is⠀being⠀tested⠀now;⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀certify⠀truth⠀or⠀force⠀every⠀embedded⠀account⠀toward⠀revelation.⠀Keep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀when⠀supplied,⠀without⠀defaulting⠀to⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀arrangement.\n\nMake⠀improvement⠀matter⠀through⠀concrete⠀work:⠀an⠀attempt,⠀a⠀principle⠀understood⠀but⠀not⠀yet⠀embodied,⠀feedback⠀from⠀someone⠀who⠀knows⠀the⠀practice,⠀a⠀resource⠀gained⠀or⠀withheld,⠀repetition,⠀correction,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀labor.⠀Ground⠀the⠀practice⠀in⠀actual⠀materials,⠀tools,⠀bodies,⠀weather,⠀obligations,⠀and⠀speech.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly—speed⠀may⠀outrun⠀care,⠀systemic⠀understanding⠀may⠀fail⠀at⠀the⠀simplest⠀local⠀application—and⠀test⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀Established⠀ranks⠀or⠀systems⠀may⠀support⠀the⠀account,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀numerical⠀mechanics⠀merely⠀to⠀display⠀progress.⠀A⠀repair⠀may⠀hold,⠀a⠀performance⠀may⠀reach⠀another⠀person,⠀a⠀resource⠀may⠀be⠀secured,⠀a⠀mistake⠀may⠀cost⠀time,⠀trust,⠀or⠀material.⠀Relationships⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀continue⠀alongside⠀the⠀practice;⠀recovery,⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀story,⠀takes⠀its⠀own⠀pace⠀and⠀may⠀remain⠀incomplete.⠀A⠀mentor⠀may⠀help⠀or⠀refuse,⠀a⠀peer⠀may⠀surpass⠀or⠀depend,⠀and⠀no⠀single⠀setback⠀must⠀produce⠀a⠀lesson.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Kawabata⠀profile's⠀compression⠀to⠀select⠀a⠀few⠀precise⠀physical⠀impressions:⠀wear⠀on⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀room's⠀temperature,⠀a⠀sound⠀at⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀practice,⠀a⠀hesitation⠀in⠀the⠀hand.⠀Let⠀the⠀relation⠀among⠀details⠀carry⠀feeling⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀connection.⠀Show⠀time⠀through⠀changes⠀in⠀a⠀familiar⠀object,⠀a⠀repeated⠀route,⠀bodily⠀stamina,⠀or⠀a⠀place⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀holds⠀the⠀same⠀use.⠀Omit⠀emotional⠀summary⠀where⠀action,⠀object,⠀and⠀interval⠀can⠀hold⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀flatten⠀every⠀character⠀into⠀the⠀same⠀reserve;⠀the⠀learner's⠀private⠀attention,⠀confusion,⠀memory,⠀and⠀desire⠀remain⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀authorized⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀mode,⠀not⠀merely⠀inferred⠀from⠀exterior⠀detail.\n\nTrack⠀advancement⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀Allow⠀the⠀response⠀boundary⠀to⠀fall⠀during⠀continuing⠀practice,⠀speech,⠀thought,⠀composition,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀learner⠀to⠀complete⠀a⠀test,⠀choose⠀a⠀path,⠀reconcile⠀a⠀relationship,⠀or⠀bring⠀an⠀interrupted⠀task⠀to⠀a⠀result⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary⠀falls—during⠀a⠀repeated⠀motion,⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀in⠀the⠀air,⠀a⠀private⠀realization,⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task⠀still⠀underway.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀this⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀reflective⠀miscellany:⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀own⠀account⠀in⠀entries,⠀fragments,⠀and⠀recollections,⠀with⠀the⠀personal⠀language⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀that⠀teller.⠀Let⠀the⠀miscellany's⠀gaps,⠀shifts⠀in⠀attention,⠀and⠀unstated⠀connections⠀carry⠀the⠀progression.⠀Advancement⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀announced⠀or⠀tabulated;⠀it⠀appears⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀now⠀notices,⠀performs⠀without⠀deliberation,⠀or⠀finds⠀newly⠀difficult.⠀Use⠀selective⠀sensory⠀images—a⠀tool's⠀balance,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀breath,⠀the⠀quality⠀of⠀light⠀on⠀a⠀practice⠀space—to⠀mark⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀capability.⠀Omit⠀emotional⠀labeling:⠀instead⠀of⠀naming⠀pride⠀or⠀frustration,⠀let⠀the⠀detail⠀the⠀practitioner⠀chooses⠀to⠀record⠀reveal⠀the⠀feeling.⠀A⠀repeated⠀image⠀can⠀recur⠀across⠀entries,⠀its⠀meaning⠀shifting⠀as⠀skill⠀develops,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀it⠀into⠀every⠀scene.\n\nDistinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it.⠀Show⠀the⠀practitioner⠀understanding⠀a⠀technique⠀in⠀one⠀entry⠀and⠀failing⠀to⠀perform⠀it⠀in⠀another;⠀let⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀through⠀remembered⠀comments,⠀the⠀resistance⠀of⠀materials,⠀or⠀the⠀ease⠀of⠀a⠀peer,⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀miscellany⠀into⠀a⠀lesson⠀summary.⠀Allow⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀to⠀develop⠀unevenly:⠀one⠀skill⠀may⠀sharpen⠀while⠀another⠀atrophies,⠀and⠀recovery⠀or⠀ordinary⠀work⠀should⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀record.⠀Test⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀Established⠀ranks⠀or⠀systems⠀can⠀appear,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀numerical⠀mechanics⠀merely⠀to⠀display⠀progress.⠀The⠀miscellany's⠀transience⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀method:⠀capability⠀is⠀not⠀permanent,⠀and⠀the⠀practitioner⠀may⠀lose⠀ground,⠀need⠀to⠀maintain⠀what⠀was⠀gained,⠀or⠀find⠀that⠀a⠀once-easy⠀action⠀now⠀costs⠀more.\n\nThe⠀miscellany⠀entries⠀are⠀composed⠀artifacts;⠀alongside⠀them,⠀render⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀live⠀private⠀experience—sensation,⠀uncertainty,⠀inner⠀argument—as⠀it⠀occurs,⠀not⠀only⠀as⠀it⠀is⠀later⠀shaped⠀into⠀an⠀entry.⠀Keep⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge⠀separate.⠀The⠀narrative⠀may⠀shift⠀from⠀close⠀attention⠀to⠀summary,⠀from⠀one⠀entry⠀to⠀the⠀next,⠀as⠀the⠀teller's⠀distance⠀changes.⠀Seasonal⠀or⠀transient⠀details⠀can⠀orient⠀a⠀scene⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀mandatory⠀inventory.⠀The⠀progression⠀fantasy⠀thread⠀stays⠀active⠀through⠀attempts,⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀new⠀understanding,⠀resources,⠀and⠀changed⠀capability,⠀but⠀the⠀story⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀resolve⠀a⠀test,⠀complete⠀a⠀rank,⠀or⠀reach⠀a⠀breakthrough⠀before⠀it⠀ends.⠀Stop⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀boundary,⠀during⠀an⠀entry,⠀a⠀practice⠀session,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀reflection,⠀with⠀the⠀work⠀still⠀in⠀progress.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀learner's⠀advancement⠀as⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀fiction⠀braided⠀with⠀the⠀community's⠀chronicle⠀memory,⠀set⠀inside⠀the⠀world⠀exactly⠀as⠀supplied:⠀its⠀forms⠀of⠀address,⠀its⠀sayings,⠀its⠀work⠀shifts⠀and⠀debts,⠀its⠀elders⠀who⠀remember⠀earlier⠀practitioners⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀art.⠀Keep⠀each⠀scene⠀doing⠀progression⠀work—an⠀attempt,⠀a⠀correction,⠀a⠀new⠀understanding,⠀a⠀resource⠀gained,⠀a⠀capability⠀that⠀did⠀not⠀exist⠀before—but⠀let⠀the⠀gain⠀arrive⠀as⠀one⠀carefully⠀selected⠀physical⠀impression⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀announcement:⠀the⠀tool⠀the⠀teacher⠀has⠀finally⠀consented⠀to⠀lend,⠀sitting⠀lighter⠀in⠀the⠀hand⠀than⠀it⠀did;⠀a⠀sound⠀reaching⠀the⠀learner⠀before⠀the⠀sight⠀of⠀its⠀source;⠀a⠀correction⠀shrunk⠀to⠀one⠀small⠀gesture.⠀When⠀days⠀or⠀months⠀pass⠀between⠀scenes,⠀pass⠀them⠀in⠀a⠀sentence⠀and⠀land⠀on⠀the⠀far⠀side⠀with⠀a⠀single⠀impression⠀that⠀registers⠀what⠀the⠀unshown⠀weeks⠀changed.\n\nSeparate⠀knowing⠀from⠀executing.⠀The⠀learner⠀can⠀recite⠀the⠀principle⠀while⠀the⠀hands⠀fail,⠀and⠀months⠀later⠀the⠀hands⠀succeed⠀while⠀the⠀words⠀have⠀gone.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀advance⠀unevenly—perception⠀outrunning⠀control,⠀control⠀outrunning⠀judgment—and⠀test⠀each⠀stage⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀defeats⠀them.⠀If⠀the⠀world⠀supplies⠀ranks⠀or⠀measures,⠀let⠀the⠀community⠀treat⠀them⠀as⠀it⠀treats⠀a⠀birthday⠀or⠀an⠀unpaid⠀debt:⠀a⠀fact⠀with⠀social⠀weight,⠀mentioned⠀in⠀passing,⠀never⠀the⠀scene's⠀center,⠀and⠀invent⠀no⠀numbers⠀or⠀mechanics⠀for⠀display.⠀Where⠀the⠀world's⠀art⠀is⠀overtly⠀strange,⠀render⠀that⠀strangeness⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀household⠀plainness;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀marvels⠀the⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀authorize.⠀Ordinary⠀life⠀runs⠀through⠀the⠀training—meals,⠀weather,⠀favors⠀owed,⠀the⠀slow⠀weeks⠀when⠀recovery⠀means⠀watching⠀others⠀work.\n\nCarry⠀feeling⠀through⠀the⠀relation⠀among⠀details⠀instead⠀of⠀naming⠀it.⠀The⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀state⠀pride;⠀it⠀notices⠀the⠀teacher⠀now⠀setting⠀out⠀a⠀second⠀cup,⠀the⠀corridor⠀the⠀learner⠀once⠀counted⠀step⠀by⠀step⠀become⠀short.⠀Let⠀gains⠀carry⠀their⠀passing⠀costs,⠀held⠀lightly:⠀the⠀beginner's⠀hearing⠀that⠀fluency⠀quiets,⠀an⠀equality⠀with⠀a⠀practice-mate⠀that⠀mastery⠀can⠀end.⠀Transience⠀is⠀noticed,⠀not⠀mourned⠀on⠀schedule;⠀some⠀losses⠀sit⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀plain⠀fact,⠀and⠀some⠀pass⠀with⠀warmth.\n\nRun⠀the⠀community's⠀memory⠀as⠀attributed,⠀partial⠀testimony⠀alongside⠀the⠀learner's⠀own:⠀an⠀aunt's⠀account⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀failure,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀comparing⠀the⠀learner⠀to⠀someone⠀from⠀another⠀year—accounts⠀that⠀may⠀contradict⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀witnessed⠀and⠀cannot⠀check.⠀As⠀capability⠀grows,⠀that⠀relation⠀can⠀shift:⠀stories⠀first⠀received⠀as⠀legend⠀are⠀reread⠀for⠀technical⠀correction—a⠀grip,⠀a⠀timing,⠀hidden⠀inside⠀a⠀telling—and,⠀if⠀the⠀story⠀travels⠀far⠀enough,⠀the⠀learner⠀becomes⠀the⠀subject⠀of⠀someone⠀else's.⠀Let⠀a⠀remembered⠀account⠀surface⠀mid-practice,⠀so⠀remembered⠀time⠀orders⠀the⠀emphasis⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀calendar.⠀Write⠀the⠀learner's⠀private⠀attention,⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀motives⠀in⠀ordinary⠀narration;⠀selectivity⠀governs⠀what⠀the⠀narration⠀lingers⠀on,⠀not⠀permission⠀for⠀inner⠀life.⠀Let⠀spoken⠀and⠀unspoken⠀differ⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀belonging⠀to⠀this⠀learner—deference⠀to⠀a⠀teacher,⠀a⠀family's⠀hope⠀too⠀heavy⠀to⠀say⠀aloud—or⠀coincide⠀outright.⠀Preserve⠀whichever⠀authorship⠀contract⠀is⠀active.⠀End⠀a⠀response⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀natural⠀edge—in⠀continuing⠀practice,⠀conversation,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀observation—without⠀requiring⠀a⠀rank⠀gained⠀or⠀a⠀test⠀passed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀live⠀attempt:⠀a⠀practice,⠀a⠀trial,⠀a⠀repair,⠀a⠀climb,⠀a⠀performance,⠀or⠀any⠀task⠀where⠀someone⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀make⠀something⠀work.⠀Establish⠀quickly⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀to⠀accomplish,⠀where⠀the⠀obstacle⠀sits⠀in⠀the⠀space,⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀scene⠀changes⠀when⠀someone⠀moves.⠀Present⠀unfamiliar⠀techniques,⠀tools,⠀ranks,⠀or⠀system⠀terms⠀through⠀use⠀rather⠀than⠀explanation;⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail⠀or⠀two⠀is⠀enough.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀numbers,⠀status⠀screens,⠀or⠀invented⠀mechanics⠀merely⠀to⠀announce⠀progress.\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀come⠀from⠀attempts,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀revised⠀action.⠀Separate⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀understands⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀perform:⠀they⠀may⠀name⠀the⠀correct⠀principle,⠀recognize⠀it⠀in⠀someone⠀else,⠀or⠀know⠀exactly⠀where⠀the⠀last⠀attempt⠀failed,⠀and⠀still⠀mistime⠀breath,⠀grip,⠀footing,⠀distance,⠀or⠀speech.⠀Feedback⠀can⠀arrive⠀from⠀a⠀body,⠀a⠀practice⠀partner,⠀an⠀instructor,⠀a⠀damaged⠀object,⠀a⠀system,⠀or⠀the⠀task⠀itself.⠀New⠀understanding,⠀a⠀tool,⠀or⠀a⠀resource⠀can⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀can⠀do.⠀Let⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀way—slower,⠀smaller,⠀from⠀a⠀different⠀angle,⠀without⠀the⠀usual⠀preparatory⠀motion—and⠀let⠀the⠀result⠀reveal⠀a⠀changed⠀ability⠀alongside⠀a⠀remaining⠀difficulty.⠀A⠀gain⠀may⠀be⠀narrow,⠀fragile,⠀or⠀costly,⠀and⠀strengths⠀need⠀not⠀improve⠀evenly.⠀Recovery,⠀ordinary⠀work,⠀and⠀relationships⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀effort⠀rather⠀than⠀waiting⠀for⠀the⠀training⠀to⠀finish.\n\nUse⠀selective⠀physical⠀impressions⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀skill:⠀pressure,⠀grain,⠀breath,⠀temperature,⠀a⠀sound⠀after⠀effort,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀something⠀held⠀differently.⠀Let⠀their⠀relation⠀imply⠀more⠀than⠀explanation⠀would.⠀A⠀repeated⠀image⠀can⠀return⠀altered—the⠀same⠀step⠀quieter,⠀the⠀same⠀room⠀noticed⠀once⠀the⠀strain⠀has⠀passed,⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀corrected⠀less.⠀Keep⠀attention⠀on⠀something⠀passing⠀or⠀difficult⠀to⠀keep:⠀an⠀old⠀incapacity⠀becoming⠀ordinary,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀gesture⠀no⠀longer⠀needed,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀ease⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀last.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀emotionally⠀identical⠀or⠀every⠀silence⠀mean⠀the⠀same⠀thing.⠀Pride,⠀irritation,⠀fear,⠀tenderness,⠀boredom,⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀each⠀character's⠀own⠀measure;⠀render⠀interiority⠀when⠀it⠀matters⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀public⠀to⠀everyone⠀present.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀page⠀quick⠀to⠀read.⠀Use⠀short⠀paragraphs⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response,⠀and⠀make⠀shifts⠀in⠀position,⠀attention,⠀and⠀effort⠀easy⠀to⠀track.⠀Reaction⠀beats⠀belong⠀to⠀their⠀owner—serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny—not⠀a⠀uniform⠀tone.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀whatever⠀world⠀facts⠀the⠀story⠀already⠀establishes.⠀Light-novel⠀presentation⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀first-person⠀narration,⠀comedy,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀cliffhanger,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀add⠀magic,⠀system⠀menus,⠀or⠀rankings⠀the⠀world⠀lacks.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀current⠀attempt⠀or⠀exchange⠀reaches⠀its⠀natural⠀boundary;⠀an⠀unfinished⠀trial,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀lingering⠀difficulty⠀may⠀stand.⠀The⠀next⠀test⠀need⠀not⠀complete⠀mastery.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀one⠀sensory⠀motif⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀practice⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀whenever⠀the⠀character⠀attempts⠀the⠀skill.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀resistance⠀of⠀a⠀material,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀breath⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀moment,⠀the⠀cold⠀of⠀a⠀floor,⠀or⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀teacher⠀pronounces⠀one⠀word.⠀The⠀first⠀occurrence⠀should⠀be⠀brief⠀and⠀exact.⠀Later⠀occurrences⠀should⠀repeat⠀the⠀motif⠀with⠀a⠀slight⠀variation:⠀the⠀hand⠀now⠀meets⠀the⠀resistance⠀sooner,⠀the⠀breath⠀comes⠀at⠀a⠀different⠀point,⠀the⠀material⠀answers⠀before⠀the⠀character⠀expects⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀variation⠀carry⠀the⠀advancement⠀without⠀announcing⠀it.\n\nShape⠀each⠀attempt⠀as⠀an⠀interval⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀report.⠀Begin⠀inside⠀the⠀movement⠀or⠀the⠀moment⠀just⠀before⠀it,⠀hold⠀one⠀physical⠀impression⠀long⠀enough⠀for⠀its⠀difficulty⠀to⠀register,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀attempt⠀break⠀or⠀complete.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀unfold⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀about⠀the⠀skill,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀comparison⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀chosen⠀motif.⠀Plain⠀syntax⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀turn:⠀after⠀a⠀long⠀sentence⠀that⠀follows⠀the⠀body⠀through⠀a⠀failed⠀motion,⠀a⠀short⠀clause⠀can⠀record⠀the⠀first⠀clean⠀completion.\n\nLet⠀memory⠀and⠀loss⠀enter⠀through⠀the⠀same⠀recurring⠀detail.⠀What⠀the⠀character⠀once⠀could⠀not⠀do⠀may⠀remain⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀motif⠀when⠀they⠀now⠀succeed,⠀so⠀the⠀remembered⠀failure⠀deepens⠀the⠀achievement⠀without⠀canceling⠀it.⠀Allow⠀development⠀to⠀remain⠀uneven:⠀one⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀skill⠀may⠀come⠀together⠀while⠀another⠀stays⠀unreliable,⠀and⠀the⠀motif⠀can⠀register⠀that⠀imbalance⠀by⠀remaining⠀unchanged⠀in⠀one⠀respect⠀even⠀as⠀it⠀alters⠀in⠀another.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀attempt⠀complete,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀resumed,⠀leaving⠀the⠀changed⠀motif⠀as⠀the⠀evidence⠀of⠀progress.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nAnchor⠀each⠀remembered⠀attempt⠀in⠀one⠀physical⠀object⠀or⠀place⠀that⠀has⠀changed⠀since⠀the⠀character⠀last⠀used⠀it:⠀a⠀training⠀mat,⠀a⠀callus,⠀a⠀worn⠀page,⠀a⠀mark⠀on⠀a⠀doorway.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀notice⠀what⠀is⠀small⠀and⠀irreversible⠀in⠀that⠀object⠀now,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀attempt.⠀The⠀distance⠀between⠀the⠀object's⠀earlier⠀state⠀and⠀its⠀current⠀one⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀fact⠀of⠀growth⠀without⠀a⠀summary.⠀When⠀the⠀same⠀task⠀returns,⠀the⠀body's⠀lack⠀of⠀hesitation⠀at⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀it⠀once⠀failed⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀entire⠀statement⠀of⠀progress.\n\nAllow⠀reflection⠀to⠀occur⠀inside⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀pausing⠀it.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀of⠀a⠀teacher's⠀caution⠀while⠀repeating⠀a⠀movement,⠀or⠀of⠀a⠀rival's⠀old⠀triumph⠀while⠀finally⠀succeeding.⠀Keep⠀the⠀memory⠀brief⠀and⠀specific:⠀one⠀sentence⠀of⠀the⠀earlier⠀occasion,⠀one⠀detail⠀that⠀survives,⠀then⠀the⠀present⠀sensation.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀memory⠀toward⠀sadness.⠀Pride⠀and⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀melancholy⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀what⠀was⠀left⠀behind⠀or⠀can⠀never⠀be⠀repeated,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀duty⠀to⠀make⠀each⠀achievement⠀bittersweet.\n\nUse⠀unfinished⠀attachment⠀to⠀sharpen⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀progression.⠀A⠀method⠀the⠀character⠀abandoned,⠀an⠀ability⠀that⠀came⠀late,⠀or⠀a⠀path⠀another⠀person⠀took⠀may⠀return⠀as⠀a⠀point⠀of⠀comparison⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀attempt⠀succeeds⠀or⠀stalls.⠀Returning⠀to⠀an⠀old⠀practice⠀can⠀reveal⠀both⠀the⠀gain⠀and⠀the⠀cost,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀state⠀that⠀plainly⠀after⠀the⠀remembered⠀detail⠀has⠀done⠀its⠀work.⠀Let⠀the⠀advance⠀be⠀small⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀calls⠀for⠀it:⠀the⠀meaning⠀lies⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀inhabits⠀the⠀skill,⠀not⠀in⠀the⠀size⠀of⠀the⠀gain.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀path⠀of⠀advancement⠀as⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀account⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀teacher's⠀remembered⠀instruction⠀alternates⠀with⠀the⠀learner's⠀present⠀attempt.⠀The⠀frame⠀should⠀be⠀concrete⠀and⠀brief:⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀mat,⠀a⠀lamp,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀tool.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀learner⠀practicing⠀or⠀waiting⠀to⠀practice,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀remembered⠀words⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀compact⠀telling⠀that⠀returns⠀attention⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀movement.⠀Keep⠀the⠀frame⠀local⠀and⠀continuous⠀rather⠀than⠀launching⠀a⠀separate⠀epic⠀narration⠀each⠀time.\n\nUse⠀the⠀alternation⠀between⠀the⠀told⠀lesson⠀and⠀the⠀attempt⠀to⠀distinguish⠀knowing⠀from⠀executing.⠀The⠀learner⠀may⠀understand⠀the⠀principle⠀in⠀words⠀immediately⠀and⠀yet⠀fail⠀it⠀in⠀movement.⠀Show⠀that⠀gap⠀by⠀placing⠀the⠀remembered⠀sentence⠀just⠀before⠀the⠀attempt,⠀then⠀letting⠀the⠀attempt⠀fall⠀short.⠀When⠀the⠀skill⠀finally⠀holds,⠀repeat⠀the⠀same⠀sentence⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀success,⠀so⠀its⠀meaning⠀moves⠀from⠀memory⠀into⠀the⠀hands.⠀The⠀lesson⠀should⠀be⠀compressed⠀to⠀one⠀uttered⠀sentence⠀and⠀the⠀learner's⠀one⠀exact⠀response;⠀a⠀long⠀instruction⠀may⠀be⠀reduced⠀to⠀the⠀single⠀phrase⠀that⠀survives.\n\nLet⠀the⠀furnished⠀teaching⠀relationship⠀or⠀setting⠀supply⠀the⠀concrete⠀details,⠀whether⠀domestic,⠀urban,⠀artisanal,⠀or⠀philosophical.⠀Use⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀framed⠀account⠀omits:⠀no⠀accumulation⠀of⠀maxims,⠀no⠀universalized⠀honor⠀or⠀mystery.⠀Trace⠀progression⠀through⠀repeated⠀attempts,⠀corrected⠀posture,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀breath,⠀or⠀the⠀way⠀the⠀learner⠀now⠀completes⠀an⠀action⠀without⠀looking⠀for⠀approval.⠀Let⠀development⠀remain⠀uneven:⠀one⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀lesson⠀may⠀be⠀executed⠀while⠀another⠀still⠀lags,⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀can⠀register⠀that⠀imbalance⠀by⠀returning⠀with⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀its⠀meaning⠀fulfilled.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nFix⠀three⠀or⠀four⠀precise⠀details⠀on⠀the⠀first⠀practice⠀attempt⠀and⠀keep⠀them⠀unchanged⠀as⠀the⠀character⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀task.⠀One⠀detail⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀hands,⠀another⠀the⠀material,⠀another⠀the⠀failure⠀or⠀hesitation.⠀On⠀a⠀later⠀attempt,⠀repeat⠀the⠀same⠀details⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀order,⠀altering⠀only⠀the⠀one⠀that⠀has⠀changed:⠀the⠀grip⠀now⠀holds,⠀the⠀splatter⠀is⠀smaller,⠀the⠀break⠀is⠀clean.⠀The⠀unchanged⠀details⠀make⠀the⠀alteration⠀legible⠀without⠀a⠀summary.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀clauses⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀lesson.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀one⠀correction,⠀a⠀rival's⠀one⠀observation,⠀or⠀a⠀body's⠀one⠀remembered⠀error⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀entire⠀feedback,⠀without⠀commentary.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀something⠀new,⠀give⠀that⠀understanding⠀just⠀enough⠀length⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀causal⠀leap⠀clear:⠀why⠀the⠀previous⠀method⠀failed⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀new⠀instruction⠀changes.⠀Inward⠀experience⠀may⠀be⠀brief,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀forbidden.⠀Keep⠀only⠀the⠀thought⠀that⠀connects⠀the⠀correction⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀action.\n\nLet⠀the⠀prose⠀structure⠀make⠀recurrence⠀obvious⠀by⠀repeating⠀a⠀phrase⠀or⠀gesture⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀succeeds,⠀so⠀the⠀variation⠀does⠀the⠀work.⠀Development⠀remains⠀uneven:⠀one⠀exact⠀detail⠀may⠀improve⠀while⠀another⠀lags,⠀and⠀that⠀imbalance⠀can⠀be⠀shown⠀by⠀keeping⠀one⠀observation⠀the⠀same⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀attempt⠀succeeds.⠀Omit⠀transitions⠀and⠀evaluations⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀infer⠀from⠀the⠀returning⠀detail.⠀A⠀careful⠀longer⠀sentence⠀is⠀better⠀than⠀fragments⠀that⠀delete⠀causality.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nBegin⠀inside⠀the⠀present⠀practice⠀attempt:⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀movements,⠀a⠀problem⠀with⠀a⠀material,⠀a⠀correction⠀that⠀has⠀just⠀been⠀heard.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀the⠀action,⠀the⠀character's⠀immediate⠀perception,⠀a⠀brief⠀recollection⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀attempt,⠀and⠀an⠀authorized⠀thought⠀or⠀feeling,⠀but⠀always⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀attempt⠀as⠀the⠀anchor.⠀What⠀has⠀changed⠀emerges⠀in⠀the⠀return:⠀the⠀body⠀does⠀something⠀now⠀that⠀it⠀could⠀not⠀do⠀before.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀instruction⠀or⠀a⠀rival's⠀comment.⠀Let⠀perception⠀catch⠀an⠀exact⠀physical⠀alteration—the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀surface,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀breathing,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀lowered⠀hand—without⠀turning⠀every⠀physical⠀fact⠀into⠀a⠀lesson.⠀Inner⠀experience⠀may⠀be⠀sparse⠀when⠀the⠀attempt⠀demands⠀attention,⠀fuller⠀when⠀the⠀work⠀becomes⠀automatic⠀and⠀the⠀mind⠀wanders.⠀Use⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀to⠀mark⠀small⠀shifts⠀of⠀attention,⠀not⠀to⠀summarize⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀training.\n\nShow⠀uneven⠀development⠀inside⠀a⠀single⠀scene.⠀One⠀element⠀of⠀the⠀skill⠀may⠀come⠀together⠀while⠀another⠀remains⠀unreliable.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀recognize⠀a⠀principle⠀without⠀yet⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀execute⠀it,⠀or⠀succeed⠀once⠀at⠀a⠀speed⠀they⠀cannot⠀repeat.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀attempt⠀complete,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀resumed;⠀the⠀progression⠀remains⠀visible⠀because⠀the⠀selected⠀details⠀now⠀differ⠀from⠀their⠀earlier⠀forms.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nLet⠀progression⠀ride⠀on⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀training⠀manual.⠀Take⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀premise⠀the⠀shared⠀object,⠀expression,⠀private⠀joke,⠀promise,⠀or⠀repeated⠀situation⠀that⠀already⠀belongs⠀to⠀these⠀characters,⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀when⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀reaches⠀a⠀new⠀capability.⠀The⠀callback⠀should⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀slight⠀change:⠀a⠀rival⠀now⠀uses⠀the⠀same⠀gesture,⠀a⠀training⠀partner⠀now⠀stays⠀quiet⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀when⠀they⠀once⠀offered⠀help,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀once⠀used⠀to⠀comfort⠀is⠀now⠀used⠀to⠀acknowledge⠀a⠀gain.\n\nCut⠀the⠀practice⠀session⠀to⠀the⠀moments⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise⠀legible:⠀the⠀moment⠀after⠀an⠀attempt,⠀the⠀correction⠀given⠀in⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀usual⠀way,⠀or⠀the⠀comfortable⠀routine⠀that⠀surrounds⠀the⠀work.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀competition,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀or⠀discovery⠀room⠀to⠀develop⠀through⠀action⠀and⠀speech.⠀Show⠀the⠀improvement⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀that⠀relationship:⠀the⠀character⠀learns⠀because⠀another⠀person's⠀attention,⠀challenge,⠀or⠀care⠀changes⠀how⠀they⠀practice.\n\nLet⠀feedback⠀happen⠀in⠀the⠀relationship's⠀private⠀language.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀may⠀correct⠀with⠀a⠀word,⠀a⠀look,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀line⠀instead⠀of⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lesson.⠀Keep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀inner⠀experience⠀actual,⠀but⠀shaped⠀by⠀their⠀feelings⠀toward⠀the⠀other.⠀A⠀success⠀may⠀matter⠀because⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀sees⠀it,⠀or⠀because⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀shifted⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀success⠀is⠀now⠀claimed⠀alone.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀before⠀a⠀full⠀emotional⠀resolution;⠀the⠀advancement⠀is⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀changed⠀callback.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀each⠀new⠀capability⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀attempt.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀to⠀mark⠀the⠀telling:⠀a⠀fixed⠀season,⠀the⠀name⠀of⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀practice⠀happens,⠀or⠀the⠀words⠀people⠀later⠀use⠀to⠀describe⠀the⠀deed.⠀Then⠀move⠀to⠀the⠀exact⠀sensory⠀particulars⠀of⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀attempts.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀need⠀not⠀narrate⠀every⠀repetition;⠀it⠀may⠀say⠀what⠀returned,⠀what⠀finally⠀held,⠀or⠀what⠀still⠀failed.⠀Let⠀the⠀recurrence⠀of⠀a⠀phrase—\"the⠀catch⠀that⠀would⠀not⠀come\"⠀or⠀\"the⠀distance⠀that⠀stayed\"—measure⠀the⠀change.\n\nKeep⠀public⠀reputation⠀separate⠀from⠀private⠀effort.⠀The⠀community⠀may⠀remember⠀the⠀day⠀the⠀spear⠀first⠀flew⠀true,⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀remembers⠀the⠀weight⠀before⠀release,⠀the⠀ache⠀in⠀the⠀shoulder,⠀and⠀the⠀silence⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀correction⠀was⠀accepted.⠀Both⠀are⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀retelling.⠀A⠀person⠀who⠀is⠀called⠀steady⠀in⠀others'⠀accounts⠀may⠀privately⠀remember⠀many⠀wrong⠀attempts.⠀The⠀gap⠀itself⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀saga's⠀texture,⠀and⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity⠀keeps⠀it⠀from⠀becoming⠀a⠀full⠀heroic⠀inventory.\n\nLet⠀consequences⠀remain⠀human⠀in⠀scale.⠀A⠀new⠀capability⠀need⠀not⠀immediately⠀decide⠀a⠀feud⠀or⠀earn⠀an⠀oath.⠀It⠀may⠀change⠀a⠀chore,⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀trade,⠀or⠀what⠀others⠀ask.⠀End⠀the⠀account⠀with⠀the⠀act⠀settled⠀enough⠀to⠀be⠀remembered,⠀while⠀another⠀advance⠀may⠀remain⠀uncertain.⠀The⠀voice⠀is⠀that⠀of⠀a⠀chronicle⠀retelling,⠀but⠀focal⠀perception⠀stays⠀limited⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint;⠀the⠀community's⠀later⠀verdict⠀should⠀not⠀overwrite⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀feeling.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nRender⠀advancement⠀as⠀a⠀myth-inflected⠀Scandinavian⠀telling:⠀each⠀hard-won⠀increase⠀is⠀anchored⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀emblem—a⠀knot⠀tied⠀and⠀untied,⠀a⠀notch⠀cut⠀in⠀a⠀doorpost,⠀an⠀oar⠀repaired⠀after⠀the⠀crossing—and⠀becomes⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀the⠀community⠀may⠀later⠀repeat.⠀Keep⠀such⠀emblems⠀trustworthy⠀but⠀brief;⠀do⠀not⠀convert⠀every⠀practice⠀into⠀a⠀numbered⠀system.⠀Show⠀knowing⠀through⠀execution:⠀describe⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀now⠀steadies⠀where⠀it⠀once⠀shook,⠀a⠀rune⠀sung⠀twice⠀before⠀it⠀takes,⠀or⠀a⠀made⠀object⠀surviving⠀weather⠀it⠀previously⠀could⠀not.⠀Let⠀the⠀outcome⠀prove⠀the⠀change,⠀not⠀a⠀label.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀sensory⠀compression⠀inside⠀that⠀folk⠀register.⠀Choose⠀one⠀image⠀for⠀the⠀whole⠀attempt⠀rather⠀than⠀itemizing⠀training.⠀When⠀a⠀failure⠀matters,⠀hold⠀a⠀single⠀passing⠀detail—sweat⠀cooling⠀on⠀a⠀neck,⠀the⠀wrong⠀furrow⠀in⠀clay,⠀a⠀blade⠀biting⠀too⠀shallow—and⠀let⠀the⠀natural⠀consequence⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling.⠀Readers⠀may⠀infer⠀the⠀hurt;⠀the⠀prose⠀does⠀not⠀announce⠀it.⠀Between⠀advancement⠀beats,⠀preserve⠀intervals:⠀sun⠀on⠀an⠀empty⠀bench,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀tar⠀after⠀the⠀lesson,⠀quiet⠀work⠀continued⠀by⠀someone⠀else.⠀These⠀pauses⠀are⠀not⠀filler;⠀they⠀measure⠀the⠀distance⠀crossed⠀and⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀kept.\n\nKeep⠀improvement⠀uneven⠀and⠀lived.⠀A⠀skilled⠀carver⠀may⠀still⠀fumble⠀a⠀net;⠀new⠀understanding⠀of⠀a⠀rune⠀may⠀make⠀an⠀old⠀task⠀harder⠀before⠀it⠀clarifies.⠀Let⠀relationships⠀and⠀ordinary⠀labor⠀remain⠀inside⠀the⠀progression,⠀so⠀an⠀increase⠀in⠀capability⠀can⠀mean⠀a⠀sibling⠀trusts⠀the⠀stronger⠀one⠀with⠀a⠀heavier⠀load⠀or⠀a⠀village⠀stops⠀sending⠀a⠀guide⠀along.⠀When⠀the⠀narration⠀turns⠀inward,⠀do⠀so⠀through⠀the⠀chosen⠀mind's⠀selected⠀perceptions,⠀not⠀through⠀abstract⠀self-analysis;⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀father's⠀mis-struck⠀blow⠀can⠀teach⠀the⠀principle⠀better⠀than⠀an⠀explanation⠀of⠀stance.⠀Maintain⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀perspective,⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀End⠀a⠀sequence⠀on⠀a⠀quiet⠀advance⠀or⠀a⠀newly⠀visible⠀shortfall,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀completed⠀test⠀or⠀a⠀triumphant⠀demonstration.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀each⠀progression⠀beat⠀as⠀a⠀staged⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀visible⠀task.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀simple⠀action⠀line—the⠀same⠀cracked⠀bowl⠀lifted,⠀the⠀same⠀ridge⠀ascended,⠀the⠀same⠀stitch⠀begun—so⠀the⠀viewer⠀sees⠀what⠀was⠀previously⠀impossible⠀now⠀performed,⠀or⠀nearly⠀performed.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀an⠀increase;⠀let⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀earlier⠀and⠀later⠀shot-like⠀image⠀do⠀the⠀work.⠀When⠀you⠀cut⠀away,⠀choose⠀a⠀Kawabata-style⠀single⠀object⠀in⠀the⠀empty⠀space⠀(rain⠀on⠀the⠀threshold,⠀a⠀tool⠀left⠀cooling)⠀and⠀return⠀only⠀after⠀the⠀relevant⠀interval.⠀Keep⠀speech⠀sparing;⠀characters⠀may⠀acknowledge⠀change⠀indirectly,⠀as⠀when⠀a⠀teacher⠀says⠀the⠀learner⠀no⠀longer⠀watches⠀the⠀blade⠀but⠀the⠀wood.\n\nUse⠀scene⠀headings⠀only⠀when⠀time⠀or⠀place⠀truly⠀shifts.⠀Within⠀a⠀scene,⠀keep⠀action⠀lines⠀economical:⠀the⠀hand,⠀the⠀breath,⠀the⠀small⠀failure⠀corrected,⠀the⠀heavier⠀load⠀accepted.⠀If⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀required,⠀include⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note—e.g.,⠀a⠀single⠀line⠀following⠀the⠀character⠀name⠀that⠀the⠀audience⠀does⠀not⠀hear—rather⠀than⠀as⠀dialogue⠀or⠀as⠀a⠀camera⠀instruction.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀that⠀note⠀give⠀another⠀character⠀knowledge⠀of⠀it.⠀A⠀pause⠀can⠀be⠀represented⠀by⠀a⠀held⠀object⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀motion,⠀not⠀by⠀psychological⠀commentary.\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀remain⠀uneven.⠀The⠀bowl⠀is⠀lifted⠀once,⠀then⠀cracked⠀on⠀the⠀third⠀try;⠀the⠀ascent⠀is⠀made,⠀but⠀the⠀descent⠀reveals⠀an⠀old⠀fear.⠀Relationships⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀training:⠀a⠀sibling⠀watches⠀from⠀the⠀door⠀and⠀says⠀nothing,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀leaves⠀a⠀bundle⠀on⠀the⠀step.⠀Avoid⠀montage⠀sequences⠀and⠀training⠀montage⠀rhythms;⠀use⠀discrete⠀scenes⠀separated⠀by⠀a⠀cut⠀so⠀each⠀growth⠀moment⠀has⠀its⠀own⠀air.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀clear⠀difficulty,⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀reaction⠀shot⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀that⠀explains⠀the⠀theme.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀viewpoint:⠀if⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀see⠀another's⠀thoughts,⠀the⠀script⠀does⠀not⠀reveal⠀them⠀except⠀through⠀the⠀other's⠀visible⠀action.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nLet⠀progression⠀appear⠀as⠀repeated⠀storable⠀business⠀within⠀the⠀shared⠀stage⠀space.⠀Write⠀an⠀early⠀scene⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀character⠀attempts⠀the⠀task—carrying⠀the⠀full⠀bucket,⠀tying⠀the⠀knot,⠀singing⠀the⠀rune—with⠀visible⠀difficulty;⠀write⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀task⠀with⠀clear⠀changed⠀execution.⠀Use⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀physical⠀action⠀that⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀remember:⠀the⠀bowl⠀lifted⠀now⠀without⠀sloshing,⠀the⠀net⠀cast⠀with⠀a⠀corrected⠀arm.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀ranking⠀or⠀ability⠀explanation.⠀If⠀a⠀principle⠀matters,⠀let⠀it⠀emerge⠀through⠀a⠀brief⠀duet⠀of⠀speech⠀and⠀work,⠀as⠀when⠀a⠀teacher⠀says,⠀\"Feel⠀the⠀knot⠀tighten,\"⠀and⠀the⠀learner⠀finally⠀does.\n\nApply⠀Kawabata's⠀compression⠀through⠀economy.⠀Choose⠀one⠀focal⠀prop⠀or⠀gesture⠀per⠀scene⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀take⠀the⠀attention.⠀A⠀pause⠀may⠀follow⠀a⠀completed⠀action;⠀an⠀exit⠀may⠀mark⠀a⠀failure.⠀Dialogue⠀carries⠀relationship⠀and⠀task,⠀not⠀emotional⠀summaries.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀simply⠀say,⠀\"You⠀did⠀not⠀fumble,\"⠀and⠀that⠀is⠀the⠀review.⠀Avoid⠀explanatory⠀monologues;⠀if⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀required,⠀place⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀unheard⠀by⠀others.⠀Do⠀not⠀treat⠀that⠀note⠀as⠀an⠀aside⠀the⠀audience⠀hears.\n\nKeep⠀advancement⠀uneven⠀and⠀lived.⠀The⠀same⠀bucket⠀can⠀be⠀lifted⠀today⠀and⠀spilled⠀tomorrow;⠀a⠀skill⠀can⠀improve⠀while⠀a⠀relationship⠀worsens.⠀Stage⠀ordinary⠀work⠀around⠀the⠀training:⠀someone⠀mends⠀a⠀net⠀at⠀the⠀table⠀during⠀the⠀lesson,⠀a⠀child⠀watches⠀from⠀the⠀door.⠀Let⠀entrances⠀and⠀exits⠀create⠀intervals,⠀not⠀scene⠀breaks.⠀End⠀scenes⠀on⠀a⠀finished⠀action,⠀a⠀held⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀line,⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀applause⠀beat⠀or⠀a⠀complete⠀resolution.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint:⠀if⠀the⠀script⠀is⠀from⠀X's⠀perspective,⠀other⠀characters'⠀inner⠀states⠀appear⠀only⠀through⠀their⠀staged⠀behavior.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrative⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀authorized⠀character's⠀mind⠀as⠀it⠀tries⠀the⠀day's⠀work,⠀with⠀each⠀attempt⠀or⠀lesson⠀triggering⠀an⠀associative⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀previous⠀failure.⠀Open⠀inside⠀a⠀concrete⠀perception—rope⠀burning⠀slowly⠀through⠀a⠀palm,⠀the⠀ache⠀in⠀a⠀shoulder,⠀a⠀knot⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀hold—and⠀let⠀that⠀single⠀image⠀carry⠀the⠀history.⠀Do⠀not⠀narrate⠀the⠀rank;⠀let⠀the⠀mind⠀compare⠀what⠀it⠀knows⠀to⠀what⠀it⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀by⠀touching⠀the⠀remembered⠀embarrassment⠀of⠀the⠀earlier⠀miss⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀slight⠀difference⠀in⠀grip.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀present⠀action⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀reader:⠀a⠀teacher's⠀voice,⠀a⠀bucket⠀set⠀down,⠀a⠀hand⠀repositioned.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀sensory⠀images⠀as⠀anchors.⠀When⠀the⠀association⠀threatens⠀to⠀dissolve⠀into⠀general⠀feeling,⠀return⠀to⠀one⠀chosen⠀sensory⠀detail:⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀wet⠀wool,⠀the⠀cold⠀rim⠀of⠀a⠀cup,⠀a⠀knife⠀edge⠀dulling⠀under⠀misuse.⠀These⠀details⠀measure⠀the⠀interval⠀between⠀then⠀and⠀now⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀feel⠀progress⠀or⠀its⠀lack⠀without⠀explanatory⠀flashback⠀narration.⠀Memory⠀may⠀interrupt,⠀but⠀signal⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀so⠀events⠀and⠀recollection⠀remain⠀distinguishable.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀mind⠀to⠀be⠀uneven.⠀It⠀may⠀know⠀the⠀principle⠀and⠀still⠀fail;⠀it⠀may⠀accomplish⠀the⠀task⠀and⠀then⠀recall⠀a⠀shame⠀unrelated⠀to⠀ability.⠀Let⠀private⠀words⠀and⠀unspoken⠀plans⠀surface,⠀but⠀keep⠀them⠀inseparable⠀from⠀sensation⠀and⠀concern.⠀Other⠀characters⠀appear⠀only⠀as⠀the⠀mind⠀perceives⠀them—a⠀hand,⠀a⠀tone,⠀a⠀silence—and⠀their⠀inner⠀lives⠀remain⠀closed.⠀End⠀on⠀an⠀association⠀still⠀in⠀motion⠀or⠀a⠀perception⠀just⠀changing,⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀thought⠀into⠀a⠀clean⠀conclusion.⠀The⠀scene's⠀progression⠀is⠀real,⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀mind⠀does⠀not⠀announce⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀exchange⠀as⠀the⠀primary⠀story,⠀with⠀each⠀message⠀brief⠀and⠀sender-distinct.⠀Let⠀progression⠀show⠀through⠀what⠀and⠀how⠀characters⠀transmit:⠀the⠀learner⠀who⠀once⠀typed⠀long,⠀apologetic⠀uncertainties⠀now⠀sends⠀a⠀two-word⠀confirmation⠀after⠀the⠀task;⠀the⠀teacher⠀who⠀used⠀voice⠀notes⠀now⠀sends⠀a⠀single⠀image⠀of⠀the⠀finished⠀knot.⠀Timestamps⠀may⠀indicate⠀a⠀shorter⠀interval⠀between⠀attempt⠀and⠀report,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀achievement⠀into⠀an⠀explicit⠀level-up.⠀Let⠀the⠀recipient⠀infer⠀what⠀changed⠀from⠀the⠀altered⠀message⠀patterns,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀explained⠀stat⠀sheet.\n\nApply⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity⠀through⠀economy⠀and⠀omission.⠀One⠀edited⠀message⠀or⠀a⠀long⠀typing⠀delay⠀can⠀carry⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀feeling.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀deletes⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀show⠀the⠀draft⠀and⠀the⠀final⠀sent⠀text⠀as⠀separate⠀items;⠀do⠀not⠀merge⠀the⠀private⠀draft⠀into⠀the⠀public⠀record.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀transmitted⠀message⠀from⠀private⠀thought:⠀if⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀interiority,⠀separate⠀it⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀message⠀another⠀sender⠀can⠀see.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀digital⠀habits⠀stay⠀consistent—a⠀pragmatic⠀friend⠀uses⠀short⠀lines,⠀an⠀older⠀instructor⠀avoids⠀punctuation,⠀a⠀nervous⠀sibling⠀overuses⠀ellipses.⠀Those⠀habits⠀are⠀character,⠀not⠀added⠀subtext.\n\nKeep⠀advancement⠀uneven⠀and⠀lived.⠀A⠀confident⠀message⠀may⠀arrive⠀even⠀as⠀the⠀person⠀still⠀fails⠀the⠀task⠀in⠀practice;⠀a⠀breakthrough⠀may⠀be⠀reported⠀in⠀a⠀tone⠀that⠀hides⠀its⠀cost.⠀Let⠀ordinary⠀relationship⠀threads⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀progression:⠀someone⠀asks⠀about⠀dinner⠀between⠀two⠀training⠀updates,⠀a⠀parent⠀sends⠀a⠀reminder,⠀a⠀friend⠀reacts⠀to⠀an⠀attachment⠀with⠀nothing⠀but⠀a⠀heart.⠀Use⠀attachments,⠀edits,⠀or⠀delays⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀specific⠀scene.⠀End⠀on⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀a⠀completed⠀edit,⠀or⠀a⠀read⠀receipt,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀full⠀resolution.⠀The⠀transcript⠀can⠀simply⠀stop⠀at⠀the⠀last⠀actual⠀communication.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbaba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nPresent⠀each⠀progression⠀beat⠀as⠀a⠀concise⠀illustrated⠀scene,⠀with⠀the⠀background⠀or⠀a⠀focal⠀object⠀carrying⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀meaning.⠀Revisit⠀the⠀same⠀place⠀or⠀prop⠀at⠀the⠀start⠀and⠀end:⠀the⠀cracked⠀bowl⠀now⠀mended,⠀the⠀path⠀that⠀once⠀took⠀all⠀morning⠀now⠀walked⠀by⠀dusk,⠀the⠀branch⠀bent⠀low⠀last⠀season⠀now⠀reaching⠀the⠀window.⠀Let⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀scene-setting⠀show⠀advancement⠀without⠀an⠀ability⠀bar⠀or⠀rank⠀announcement.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀passage⠀brief—a⠀hand⠀steadying,⠀breath⠀slowing,⠀a⠀particular⠀color⠀of⠀light⠀over⠀the⠀training⠀yard—and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀infer⠀effort⠀and⠀cost.\n\nThe⠀dialogue⠀stays⠀tight⠀and⠀character-specific.⠀A⠀teacher⠀may⠀say,⠀\"This⠀time,⠀begin⠀with⠀the⠀edge,\"⠀and⠀the⠀learner's⠀reply⠀shows⠀understanding⠀or⠀its⠀absence.⠀Use⠀focal⠀inner⠀response⠀sparingly⠀and⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀permits:⠀a⠀single⠀line⠀of⠀realization⠀tied⠀to⠀sensation,⠀not⠀a⠀soliloquy.⠀If⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀required,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀focal⠀narration⠀inside⠀the⠀scene,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀spoken⠀lines⠀and⠀not⠀available⠀to⠀other⠀characters.⠀Do⠀not⠀attach⠀expression⠀labels⠀to⠀every⠀sentence;⠀let⠀one⠀cue—a⠀glance⠀at⠀the⠀repaired⠀bowl—signal⠀the⠀moment's⠀weight.\n\nAllow⠀growth⠀to⠀be⠀uneven⠀and⠀relational.⠀The⠀learner⠀improves⠀at⠀the⠀physical⠀task⠀but⠀still⠀misreads⠀a⠀social⠀silence;⠀the⠀teacher's⠀aid⠀is⠀practical,⠀not⠀always⠀kind.⠀Show⠀ordinary⠀work⠀around⠀the⠀effort:⠀a⠀sibling⠀sweeps⠀the⠀step,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀places⠀herbs⠀by⠀the⠀bowl.⠀Avoid⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀choices,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands⠀unless⠀separately⠀authorized.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀quiet⠀focal⠀observation,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀attempt,⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀reaction⠀screen⠀or⠀resolution.⠀The⠀style⠀provides⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀scenes,⠀not⠀a⠀game's⠀choice⠀structure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalbabb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀each⠀installment⠀as⠀a⠀compact⠀movement⠀of⠀the⠀larger⠀progression,⠀opening⠀with⠀a⠀brief⠀living⠀orientation⠀drawn⠀from⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀previous⠀events.⠀Introduce⠀or⠀revisit⠀one⠀Kawabata-style⠀image⠀that⠀will⠀persist⠀across⠀replies:⠀a⠀half-finished⠀practice⠀piece⠀on⠀the⠀bench,⠀a⠀cloth⠀folded⠀at⠀the⠀door,⠀a⠀particular⠀sound⠀from⠀the⠀upper⠀room.⠀Let⠀that⠀image⠀change⠀as⠀capability⠀changes.⠀When⠀a⠀later⠀installment⠀returns⠀to⠀it—the⠀piece⠀now⠀finished⠀or⠀discarded,⠀the⠀cloth⠀moved,⠀the⠀sound⠀absent—the⠀difference⠀tells⠀readers⠀what⠀has⠀advanced⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀recap.\n\nUse⠀restrained⠀prose⠀and⠀emotional⠀omission.⠀Prefer⠀a⠀single⠀sensory⠀detail⠀to⠀an⠀explanatory⠀paragraph:⠀sweat⠀cooling⠀under⠀a⠀collar,⠀the⠀slight⠀give⠀in⠀a⠀floorboard⠀now⠀that⠀the⠀weight⠀is⠀carried⠀better,⠀a⠀palm⠀no⠀longer⠀bleeding⠀after⠀the⠀same⠀task.⠀If⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀required⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀ordinary⠀narrative⠀interiority⠀within⠀the⠀episode,⠀clearly⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀perception.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀every⠀installment⠀into⠀a⠀completed⠀training⠀arc;⠀let⠀a⠀lesson⠀begin⠀and⠀remain⠀unfinished,⠀then⠀be⠀picked⠀up⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀reply.⠀Progress⠀can⠀be⠀uneven—a⠀skill⠀improves⠀while⠀a⠀friendship⠀cools,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀understanding⠀makes⠀an⠀old⠀task⠀temporarily⠀harder.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀world⠀lived-in⠀around⠀the⠀progression.⠀A⠀parent's⠀meals,⠀a⠀sibling's⠀errand,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀request⠀can⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀installment⠀as⠀a⠀breakthrough.⠀End⠀on⠀an⠀earned⠀moment:⠀a⠀task⠀completed,⠀a⠀difficult⠀question⠀asked,⠀a⠀recalled⠀failure⠀seen⠀differently.⠀Avoid⠀artificial⠀cliffhangers;⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀naturally⠀ends⠀in⠀quiet,⠀let⠀it.⠀Short⠀recover⠀context⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀episode⠀needs⠀it,⠀letting⠀the⠀recurring⠀image⠀do⠀most⠀of⠀the⠀connective⠀work.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
