            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-romance-02",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Romance · 02/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == romance}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Romance. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 2 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-romance; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPamadat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀scenes⠀you⠀choose.⠀If⠀the⠀premise⠀is⠀established⠀love,⠀show⠀the⠀habits⠀and⠀accommodations⠀that⠀love⠀has⠀built.⠀If⠀it⠀is⠀slow⠀development,⠀show⠀the⠀particular⠀moments⠀that⠀move⠀the⠀two⠀people⠀closer⠀or⠀hold⠀them⠀apart.⠀If⠀it⠀is⠀repair,⠀show⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀return⠀and⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀still⠀needs⠀mending.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀premise.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀selection⠀do⠀the⠀work:⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀a⠀familiar⠀argument,⠀a⠀private⠀joke,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀care⠀that⠀only⠀these⠀two⠀would⠀recognize.\n\nUse⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments⠀as⠀the⠀relationship's⠀callbacks.⠀A⠀phrase⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀said⠀once⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀now⠀returns⠀to,⠀a⠀gesture⠀that⠀has⠀become⠀a⠀signal,⠀a⠀place⠀or⠀object⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀their⠀history—these⠀recurrences⠀carry⠀the⠀emotional⠀payoff.⠀Each⠀return⠀should⠀add⠀something⠀new:⠀a⠀different⠀context,⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning,⠀a⠀deeper⠀understanding.⠀The⠀payoff⠀is⠀the⠀consequence⠀of⠀the⠀premise,⠀not⠀a⠀reward⠀inserted⠀to⠀please⠀the⠀reader.\n\nKeep⠀McCarthy's⠀physical⠀attention⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀texture.⠀The⠀relationship⠀lives⠀in⠀concrete⠀particulars:⠀the⠀way⠀one⠀person⠀hands⠀the⠀other⠀a⠀cup,⠀the⠀space⠀they⠀leave⠀between⠀them⠀on⠀a⠀bench,⠀the⠀work⠀they⠀do⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀room⠀without⠀speaking.⠀Paratactic⠀movement⠀lets⠀the⠀scene⠀accumulate⠀without⠀over-explaining.⠀Where⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀established⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀speech⠀remains⠀spare⠀and⠀practical,⠀carrying⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀say⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀cannot.⠀The⠀emotional⠀content⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀practical⠀surface⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀meaning⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀established.\n\nGive⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀emotions⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀they⠀belong.⠀Affection⠀may⠀be⠀shown⠀through⠀care⠀rather⠀than⠀declaration.⠀Jealousy⠀may⠀surface⠀as⠀a⠀practical⠀objection⠀or⠀a⠀sharp⠀remark.⠀Comfort⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀hand⠀on⠀a⠀shoulder,⠀a⠀blanket⠀fetched,⠀a⠀silence⠀kept.⠀Rivalry⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀contest⠀over⠀work⠀or⠀attention.⠀Discovery⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀new⠀fact⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀premise's⠀terms.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀it⠀involves.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀relationship's⠀promise⠀fulfilled⠀in⠀a⠀small⠀way,⠀or⠀with⠀its⠀tension⠀still⠀present,⠀or⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀consequence⠀beginning⠀to⠀unfold.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀recognize⠀that⠀this⠀moment⠀belongs⠀to⠀these⠀two⠀people⠀and⠀could⠀not⠀belong⠀to⠀anyone⠀else.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamadau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀relationship⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀the⠀deeds⠀by⠀which⠀these⠀two⠀people⠀will⠀be⠀remembered.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀declaration⠀that⠀establishes⠀the⠀telling's⠀stance:⠀who⠀these⠀two⠀were⠀to⠀each⠀other,⠀what⠀passed⠀between⠀them,⠀what⠀the⠀account⠀will⠀relate.⠀The⠀declaration⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀grand.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀as⠀plain⠀as⠀saying⠀they⠀met⠀in⠀a⠀bad⠀year,⠀or⠀that⠀she⠀kept⠀his⠀promise⠀longer⠀than⠀he⠀did.⠀Let⠀the⠀opening⠀set⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀terms,⠀then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀complicate⠀and⠀fill⠀them.\n\nUse⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀mark⠀the⠀relationship's⠀turns.⠀A⠀journey⠀undertaken,⠀a⠀gift⠀given,⠀a⠀wrong⠀done,⠀a⠀debt⠀repaid,⠀a⠀word⠀kept⠀or⠀broken—these⠀are⠀the⠀acts⠀the⠀chronicle⠀relates.⠀After⠀a⠀declaration,⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀concrete⠀particulars:⠀the⠀weather⠀on⠀the⠀road,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀thing⠀carried,⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀at⠀the⠀door,⠀what⠀work⠀was⠀left⠀undone.⠀Keep⠀the⠀scale⠀human.⠀The⠀deeds⠀are⠀the⠀ordinary⠀acts⠀by⠀which⠀people⠀bind⠀themselves⠀to⠀one⠀another⠀or⠀fail⠀to.\n\nLet⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀carry⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀retelling.⠀A⠀phrase⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀application:⠀the⠀same⠀road⠀traveled⠀again,⠀the⠀same⠀promise⠀spoken⠀under⠀different⠀circumstances,⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀passed⠀from⠀hand⠀to⠀hand.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀should⠀deepen⠀the⠀account⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀it.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀may⠀note⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀of⠀an⠀act.⠀Some⠀acts⠀are⠀remembered⠀only⠀by⠀the⠀two⠀people⠀involved,⠀and⠀that⠀is⠀enough.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀relate⠀what⠀was⠀seen,⠀heard,⠀or⠀later⠀learned,⠀but⠀not⠀the⠀hidden⠀minds⠀of⠀the⠀lovers⠀except⠀through⠀inference⠀or⠀later⠀disclosure.⠀Where⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀established⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀speech⠀remains⠀spare⠀and⠀practical,⠀carrying⠀bargains,⠀refusals,⠀and⠀withheld⠀feeling.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀deed⠀concluded⠀or⠀still⠀in⠀motion,⠀leaving⠀the⠀relationship's⠀final⠀shape⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀resolved.⠀What⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀made⠀the⠀particular⠀history⠀of⠀these⠀two⠀people⠀present⠀and⠀has⠀shown⠀what⠀of⠀it⠀would⠀be⠀worth⠀telling⠀again.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamadav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀the⠀material⠀and⠀institutional⠀conditions⠀that⠀surround⠀the⠀characters:⠀housing,⠀work⠀schedules,⠀wages,⠀weather,⠀shared⠀meals,⠀maintenance,⠀transport,⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀public⠀obligations⠀of⠀family,⠀neighbors,⠀or⠀employers.⠀Choose⠀a⠀definite⠀Scandinavian⠀social-realist⠀route:⠀focus⠀on⠀daily⠀domestic⠀and⠀work⠀rhythms,⠀the⠀concrete⠀costs⠀and⠀repairs⠀of⠀daily⠀life,⠀and⠀the⠀public⠀expectations⠀that⠀shape⠀private⠀choices.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀a⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish⠀context,⠀use⠀its⠀actual⠀institutions,⠀names,⠀domestic⠀details,⠀and⠀seasonal⠀routines.⠀Otherwise⠀keep⠀the⠀method⠀social⠀and⠀concrete⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀national⠀backdrop.\n\nLet⠀attraction⠀appear⠀in⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀notices,⠀repairs,⠀carries,⠀waits⠀for,⠀or⠀remembers⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀stated⠀emotional⠀summaries.⠀Use⠀McCarthy's⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀forceful⠀verbs,⠀paratactic⠀movement,⠀and⠀spare⠀practical⠀speech.⠀A⠀question⠀about⠀a⠀bus⠀schedule,⠀a⠀rent⠀payment,⠀a⠀broken⠀window,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀change⠀can⠀also⠀be⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀whether⠀someone⠀will⠀stay,⠀return,⠀or⠀accept⠀help.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀line⠀into⠀double⠀meaning;⠀let⠀some⠀exchanges⠀remain⠀plainly⠀about⠀work⠀or⠀weather⠀so⠀the⠀charged⠀ones⠀stand⠀out.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀a⠀private⠀conclusion⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀followed⠀its⠀formation.\n\nLet⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism⠀mean⠀that⠀the⠀relationship⠀is⠀tested⠀or⠀confirmed⠀through⠀ordinary⠀obligations⠀rather⠀than⠀isolated⠀dramatic⠀confessions.⠀Show⠀a⠀disagreement⠀about⠀money,⠀a⠀missed⠀appointment,⠀a⠀family⠀demand,⠀or⠀a⠀housing⠀decision⠀as⠀it⠀arises⠀from⠀a⠀specific⠀obligation.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀aftermath:⠀a⠀repair⠀made⠀or⠀postponed,⠀a⠀debt⠀acknowledged⠀or⠀ignored,⠀a⠀routine⠀changed⠀or⠀restored.⠀These⠀material⠀outcomes⠀should⠀carry⠀relationship⠀change⠀without⠀neat⠀reconciliation⠀or⠀permanent⠀rupture.⠀Let⠀the⠀response⠀end⠀at⠀an⠀ordinary⠀threshold—a⠀task⠀completed,⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀routine⠀resumed—rather⠀than⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀climax.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamadaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀camera⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀the⠀microphone⠀can⠀hear:⠀movement⠀through⠀rooms⠀and⠀landscapes,⠀hands⠀on⠀tools⠀and⠀objects,⠀food⠀prepared⠀or⠀left⠀uneaten,⠀clothes⠀worn⠀or⠀changed,⠀distances⠀kept⠀or⠀closed.⠀Use⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀with⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀forceful⠀verbs.⠀Let⠀a⠀character's⠀attention⠀show⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀notice,⠀reach⠀for,⠀repair,⠀or⠀avoid.\n\nWhere⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀established⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀keep⠀dialogue⠀spare⠀and⠀practical.⠀A⠀line⠀about⠀weather,⠀work,⠀money,⠀a⠀vehicle,⠀or⠀a⠀schedule⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀bargain,⠀a⠀warning,⠀an⠀offer,⠀or⠀a⠀withheld⠀motive.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀subtext;⠀let⠀some⠀lines⠀remain⠀plainly⠀practical⠀so⠀the⠀charged⠀ones⠀land.⠀Use⠀scene⠀headings⠀only⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀and⠀use⠀cuts,⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀or⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands.\n\nWhen⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀belongs⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀not⠀as⠀dialogue⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear⠀and⠀not⠀as⠀knowledge⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀cast.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀knows⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀say.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀notice⠀a⠀gesture⠀and⠀draw⠀no⠀conclusion,⠀draw⠀a⠀wrong⠀conclusion,⠀or⠀understand⠀something⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀has⠀not⠀admitted.⠀The⠀reader⠀may⠀know⠀a⠀motive⠀while⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not.\n\nLet⠀the⠀relationship⠀develop⠀through⠀repeated⠀visible⠀actions⠀and⠀their⠀interruptions.⠀A⠀person⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀task,⠀waits⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀place,⠀leaves⠀a⠀door⠀open,⠀or⠀fails⠀to⠀appear.⠀Show⠀the⠀aftermath⠀of⠀such⠀moments⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀explaining⠀it⠀in⠀dialogue.⠀A⠀disagreement⠀can⠀remain⠀unresolved;⠀a⠀request⠀can⠀go⠀unanswered;⠀a⠀decision⠀can⠀be⠀postponed.⠀Stop⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀scene⠀boundary,⠀not⠀a⠀completed⠀beat⠀or⠀reversal.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀and⠀authorship⠀contract.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamadax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀playable⠀physical⠀business⠀and⠀speaker-led⠀dialogue.⠀Use⠀clear⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Let⠀a⠀character's⠀attention⠀show⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀pick⠀up,⠀set⠀down,⠀hand⠀over,⠀or⠀leave⠀behind.⠀A⠀shared⠀task⠀can⠀become⠀a⠀scene⠀about⠀trust⠀or⠀reluctance⠀without⠀either⠀person⠀announcing⠀it.\n\nWhere⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀established⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀keep⠀dialogue⠀spare⠀and⠀practical.⠀A⠀line⠀about⠀a⠀schedule,⠀a⠀payment,⠀a⠀repair,⠀a⠀meal,⠀or⠀a⠀journey⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀bargain,⠀a⠀conviction,⠀or⠀a⠀withheld⠀motive.⠀Let⠀some⠀exchanges⠀remain⠀plainly⠀about⠀the⠀task⠀at⠀hand⠀so⠀the⠀charged⠀ones⠀stand⠀out.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀witty⠀or⠀ready⠀with⠀polished⠀banter.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀speech⠀fit⠀their⠀particular⠀habits⠀and⠀history.\n\nUse⠀stage⠀directions⠀economically⠀to⠀establish⠀observable⠀conditions:⠀who⠀can⠀see⠀an⠀entrance,⠀reach⠀an⠀object,