            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-romance-03",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Romance · 03/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == romance}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Romance. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 3 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-romance; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPamahaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀in⠀concise⠀scene⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀develop⠀through⠀visible⠀returns⠀and⠀audible⠀recurrences,⠀each⠀return⠀anchored⠀to⠀a⠀concrete⠀cue⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀show:⠀a⠀phrase⠀arrives⠀with⠀a⠀coat⠀pocket,⠀a⠀song⠀returns⠀through⠀a⠀particular⠀window,⠀a⠀gesture⠀done⠀in⠀haste⠀is⠀now⠀performed⠀slowly⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀table⠀where⠀it⠀once⠀interrupted⠀a⠀meal.⠀Each⠀return⠀carries⠀a⠀human⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀decorating⠀the⠀scene.\n\nUse⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀layered⠀time⠀within⠀the⠀scene⠀economy.⠀Present⠀the⠀small⠀present⠀action⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀framing⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀object⠀indicate⠀the⠀earlier⠀moment.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀set⠀down⠀a⠀cup⠀that⠀another⠀person⠀once⠀gave,⠀or⠀pause⠀beside⠀the⠀chair⠀where⠀a⠀previous⠀conversation⠀ended.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀full⠀history⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀lines;⠀instead,⠀let⠀the⠀later⠀exchange⠀revise⠀what⠀the⠀earlier⠀image⠀suggested.⠀A⠀cut⠀may⠀place⠀the⠀public⠀account⠀beside⠀the⠀private⠀moment⠀it⠀misreads,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀the⠀cut⠀to⠀supply⠀knowledge⠀the⠀characters⠀lack.\n\nLet⠀rumor⠀and⠀communal⠀memory⠀enter⠀through⠀what⠀characters⠀say⠀to⠀one⠀another,⠀never⠀through⠀an⠀omniscient⠀narrator's⠀summary.⠀A⠀neighbor⠀can⠀report⠀what⠀the⠀town⠀believes,⠀and⠀the⠀couple⠀can⠀confirm,⠀correct,⠀or⠀ignore⠀it.⠀Show⠀who⠀is⠀speaking⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀from⠀the⠀retelling;⠀their⠀version⠀is⠀a⠀social⠀force⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀motives⠀and⠀errors,⠀not⠀a⠀reliable⠀account⠀of⠀private⠀feeling.⠀A⠀later⠀scene⠀can⠀return⠀to⠀that⠀report⠀and⠀revise⠀its⠀meaning⠀without⠀erasing⠀the⠀original⠀statement.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀interiority⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀The⠀note⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀notices,⠀withholds,⠀or⠀fails⠀to⠀say⠀while⠀the⠀visible⠀scene⠀continues.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀dialogue⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear,⠀and⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀automatic⠀voice-over.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀that⠀private⠀content⠀unless⠀the⠀scene⠀gives⠀them⠀a⠀supported⠀reason⠀to⠀perceive⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀cut⠀or⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀is⠀used,⠀attach⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀concrete⠀event:⠀a⠀recurring⠀song⠀or⠀a⠀voice⠀from⠀another⠀room,⠀not⠀a⠀supernatural⠀sign.\n\nThe⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀visible⠀change⠀in⠀attention,⠀or⠀the⠀arrival⠀of⠀a⠀person⠀whose⠀presence⠀alters⠀the⠀moment.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession,⠀embrace,⠀or⠀decision⠀in⠀every⠀scene;⠀a⠀request⠀can⠀remain⠀unanswered⠀and⠀a⠀task⠀can⠀continue⠀across⠀scenes.⠀Let⠀the⠀reaction⠀and⠀private⠀note⠀open⠀the⠀next⠀scene's⠀available⠀conversation⠀rather⠀than⠀close⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamahax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀script.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀become⠀legible⠀through⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀repeated⠀lines.⠀When⠀a⠀phrase⠀returns,⠀keep⠀its⠀exact⠀wording⠀audible⠀and⠀attach⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀concrete⠀prop⠀or⠀position:⠀the⠀line⠀first⠀spoken⠀while⠀setting⠀down⠀a⠀basket⠀may⠀return⠀later⠀when⠀that⠀basket⠀is⠀handed⠀back,⠀or⠀the⠀phrase⠀said⠀at⠀a⠀door⠀may⠀be⠀repeated⠀as⠀someone⠀opens⠀the⠀same⠀door⠀at⠀another⠀hour.⠀The⠀actor⠀can⠀show⠀the⠀change⠀through⠀timing,⠀posture,⠀or⠀handling⠀of⠀the⠀prop.\n\nUse⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀layered⠀time⠀by⠀letting⠀the⠀stage⠀hold⠀a⠀trace⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀established⠀in⠀a⠀previous⠀scene.⠀If⠀a⠀chair⠀was⠀turned⠀during⠀an⠀exit⠀in⠀act⠀one,⠀later⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀find⠀it⠀turned⠀differently⠀and⠀respond;⠀if⠀a⠀cup⠀was⠀moved⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀side⠀of⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀may⠀show⠀someone⠀correcting⠀it⠀or⠀leaving⠀it⠀untouched.⠀Keep⠀these⠀traces⠀economical⠀and⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀scene's⠀practical⠀life.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀or⠀ignore⠀the⠀trace⠀for⠀a⠀supported⠀reason;⠀another⠀may⠀ask⠀about⠀it⠀or⠀use⠀it⠀as⠀an⠀opening⠀to⠀speak.\n\nLet⠀communal⠀memory⠀enter⠀through⠀what⠀characters⠀say⠀about⠀the⠀couple⠀when⠀they⠀are⠀absent⠀or⠀present.⠀A⠀relative,⠀neighbor,⠀or⠀friend⠀can⠀repeat⠀what⠀the⠀town⠀believes,⠀and⠀the⠀couple⠀can⠀correct,⠀confirm,⠀or⠀let⠀it⠀stand.⠀Show⠀who⠀is⠀speaking,⠀to⠀whom⠀they⠀are⠀speaking,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀from⠀the⠀retelling.⠀The⠀public⠀report⠀is⠀a⠀social⠀account⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀motives⠀and⠀errors.⠀A⠀later⠀scene⠀may⠀stage⠀the⠀correction⠀by⠀having⠀a⠀character⠀handle⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀or⠀stand⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀position⠀mentioned⠀in⠀the⠀rumor,⠀without⠀the⠀text⠀explicitly⠀explaining⠀the⠀connection.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀A⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀may⠀be⠀used⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀scene⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀and⠀an⠀intended⠀audience;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀thought.⠀When⠀a⠀private⠀conclusion⠀is⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀or⠀audience,⠀let⠀the⠀actor's⠀visible⠀business⠀indicate⠀its⠀weight:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀count⠀out⠀cutlery⠀more⠀slowly,⠀fold⠀a⠀cloth⠀again,⠀or⠀leave⠀the⠀room⠀by⠀a⠀different⠀door.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀that⠀private⠀content⠀unless⠀a⠀later⠀supported⠀action⠀reveals⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀relying⠀on⠀thematic⠀explanation.⠀A⠀pause⠀can⠀hold⠀a⠀decision,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀or⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀pause⠀conceal⠀guilt⠀or⠀signal⠀an⠀unspoken⠀confession.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀an⠀exit,⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀now⠀say⠀to⠀each⠀other.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀theatrical⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀gathering⠀of⠀witnesses⠀in⠀every⠀scene.⠀Practical⠀life⠀continues:⠀dishes⠀remain⠀to⠀be⠀washed,⠀doors⠀must⠀be⠀locked,⠀and⠀visits⠀must⠀be⠀prepared⠀for.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamahay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀the⠀associative⠀mental⠀movement⠀of⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Begin⠀each⠀movement⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀sensory⠀trigger:⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀cup,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀voice,⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀a⠀sleeve.⠀Let⠀that⠀trigger⠀open⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern,⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀present⠀touch⠀can⠀recall⠀an⠀earlier⠀touch,⠀a⠀phrase⠀can⠀surface⠀during⠀a⠀meal,⠀and⠀a⠀family⠀story⠀can⠀interrupt⠀a⠀private⠀decision.⠀Keep⠀the⠀movement⠀within⠀the⠀focal⠀mind's⠀actual⠀experience.\n\nUse⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀layered⠀time⠀by⠀letting⠀the⠀mind⠀gather⠀a⠀present⠀moment⠀with⠀an⠀earlier⠀one⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀unbroken⠀movement.⠀A⠀sentence⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀to⠀the⠀day⠀the⠀room⠀was⠀first⠀entered,⠀then⠀to⠀what⠀someone⠀said⠀about⠀it⠀years⠀later,⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀with⠀the⠀earlier⠀material⠀pressing⠀on⠀the⠀current⠀choice.⠀Anchor⠀each⠀gathering⠀in⠀a⠀human⠀consequence:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀understands,⠀doubts,⠀wants,⠀or⠀cannot⠀say.⠀Rather⠀than⠀summarizing⠀options,⠀the⠀mind⠀may⠀worry⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀until⠀the⠀present⠀sensation⠀resolves⠀the⠀movement.\n\nLet⠀communal⠀memory⠀enter⠀as⠀material⠀the⠀focal⠀mind⠀has⠀received⠀from⠀others.⠀A⠀rumor,⠀a⠀family⠀account,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀event⠀can⠀surface⠀as⠀remembered⠀speech,⠀but⠀keep⠀its⠀source⠀and⠀uncertainty⠀available.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀believe⠀it,⠀resist⠀it,⠀repeat⠀it⠀inwardly,⠀or⠀discover⠀that⠀it⠀no⠀longer⠀fits⠀the⠀person⠀now⠀present.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀mind's⠀associations⠀become⠀a⠀reliable⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀actually⠀knows⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀partner⠀actually⠀feels.⠀Mark⠀inference,⠀memory,⠀or⠀fantasy⠀with⠀small⠀phrases⠀('she⠀would⠀have⠀said',⠀'they⠀used⠀to⠀tell',⠀'perhaps')⠀when⠀the⠀mind⠀moves⠀beyond⠀its⠀own⠀direct⠀knowledge.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀stream⠀within⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Other⠀characters'⠀thoughts⠀are⠀not⠀available⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀them.⠀Their⠀inner⠀lives⠀may⠀be⠀inferred,⠀remembered,⠀or⠀imagined,⠀but⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀mark⠀those⠀as⠀inference,⠀memory,⠀or⠀fantasy⠀rather⠀than⠀direct⠀access.⠀Preserve⠀orientation⠀by⠀anchoring⠀each⠀burst⠀of⠀association⠀to⠀checkable⠀scene⠀details:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀was⠀closed⠀remains⠀closed,⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀was⠀sent⠀remains⠀sent,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀realization⠀cannot⠀become⠀an⠀earlier⠀motive.⠀If⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀includes⠀another⠀speaker,⠀their⠀actual⠀words⠀interrupt⠀and⠀redirect⠀the⠀flow⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀silently⠀absorbed.\n\nLet⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀follow⠀the⠀associations⠀without⠀losing⠀the⠀reader's⠀grip.⠀A⠀short⠀interruption⠀can⠀break⠀a⠀long⠀recollection;⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀can⠀return⠀as⠀the⠀mind⠀circles⠀a⠀decision.⠀Ordinary⠀reasoning⠀alone⠀is⠀not⠀enough⠀to⠀justify⠀the⠀mode;⠀the⠀movement⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀perception⠀and⠀memory,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀tidy⠀summary⠀of⠀options.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀end⠀when⠀the⠀mind's⠀attention⠀returns⠀to⠀and⠀alters⠀a⠀present⠀perceptual⠀detail:⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀seemed⠀empty⠀now⠀feels⠀inhabited,⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀seemed⠀conclusive⠀now⠀needs⠀another⠀word,⠀or⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀was⠀still⠀now⠀moves.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀relationship⠀to⠀reach⠀a⠀decision⠀in⠀that⠀moment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamahaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀a⠀story⠀carried⠀by⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀may⠀write⠀long,⠀recursive⠀messages;⠀another⠀may⠀reply⠀in⠀fragments;⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀forward⠀what⠀others⠀have⠀said.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀relationship⠀or⠀to⠀what⠀a⠀message⠀means⠀when⠀it⠀arrives.\n\nUse⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀layered⠀time⠀through⠀exact⠀delayed⠀echoes.⠀When⠀a⠀phrase⠀was⠀sent⠀earlier—as⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀longer⠀message,⠀a⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀signature—it⠀may⠀return⠀later⠀verbatim⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀context.⠀Show⠀the⠀return⠀as⠀a⠀quoted⠀block⠀or⠀a⠀forwarded⠀fragment⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀same⠀words⠀again⠀and⠀the⠀lag⠀between⠀the⠀original⠀and⠀the⠀echo.⠀Let⠀the⠀delay⠀carry⠀consequence:⠀a⠀reply⠀that⠀arrives⠀after⠀a⠀night⠀of⠀silence⠀means⠀something⠀different⠀from⠀an⠀immediate⠀answer;⠀a⠀question⠀repeated⠀after⠀an⠀absence⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀the⠀same⠀question.\n\nLet⠀communal⠀memory⠀and⠀rumor⠀enter⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀senders⠀report⠀or⠀forward.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀type⠀what⠀a⠀relative⠀said,⠀paste⠀a⠀message⠀from⠀a⠀group⠀chat,⠀or⠀repeat⠀a⠀version⠀of⠀events⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀corrects.⠀Keep⠀the⠀source⠀of⠀each⠀account⠀legible:⠀attribute⠀the⠀pasted⠀text,⠀mark⠀the⠀forward,⠀or⠀include⠀the⠀original⠀sender's⠀name.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀a⠀forwarded⠀message⠀or⠀a⠀quoted⠀rumor⠀a⠀reliable⠀summary⠀of⠀private⠀feeling;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀social⠀account⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀motives⠀and⠀errors.⠀A⠀later⠀message⠀may⠀reveal⠀that⠀the⠀earlier⠀group⠀chat⠀version⠀was⠀incomplete⠀or⠀edited.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact:⠀if⠀shown,⠀present⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀labeled⠀draft⠀(for⠀example,⠀a⠀temporary⠀block⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀before⠀sending)⠀with⠀its⠀deletion⠀visible,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀When⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀required,⠀separate⠀it⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀boundary⠀and⠀keep⠀its⠀knowledge⠀limits⠀intact.⠀What⠀one⠀person⠀types⠀is⠀not⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀knows⠀unless⠀the⠀transcript⠀shows⠀it⠀being⠀sent⠀and⠀received.\n\nLet⠀the⠀exchange⠀develop⠀through⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀disclosure,⠀disagreement,⠀and⠀care.⠀A⠀message⠀can⠀open⠀a⠀new⠀conversation,⠀revive⠀an⠀old⠀one,⠀or⠀leave⠀a⠀request⠀unanswered.⠀The⠀passage⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀at⠀a⠀meaningful⠀time,⠀a⠀delay⠀before⠀typing,⠀an⠀edit⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀visible⠀message,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀what⠀one⠀person⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀type.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession,⠀reconciliation,⠀or⠀relationship⠀decision⠀in⠀every⠀exchange.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamahba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀in⠀concise⠀scene-oriented⠀passages⠀with⠀clear⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀develop⠀through⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀proximity,⠀disclosure,⠀disagreement,⠀and⠀care,⠀with⠀each⠀scene⠀giving⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀particular⠀reason⠀to⠀notice⠀or⠀remember⠀something⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀person.\n\nUse⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀layered⠀time⠀by⠀letting⠀a⠀scene⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀familiar⠀place,⠀object,⠀or⠀phrase⠀under⠀changed⠀conditions.⠀When⠀a⠀backdrop⠀element⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀scene⠀returns—the⠀same⠀window,⠀table,⠀street,⠀or⠀shelf—identify⠀it⠀briefly⠀in⠀the⠀narration⠀and⠀show⠀exactly⠀one⠀changed⠀condition:⠀a⠀different⠀season⠀outside,⠀a⠀different⠀hour,⠀a⠀different⠀object⠀on⠀the⠀table,⠀or⠀a⠀different⠀person⠀present.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀register⠀what⠀that⠀change⠀means⠀rather⠀than⠀explaining⠀the⠀whole⠀history.⠀A⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀may⠀orient⠀the⠀moment,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicator;⠀a⠀smile⠀or⠀averted⠀gaze⠀means⠀what⠀the⠀scene's⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀focal⠀knowledge⠀support.\n\nLet⠀communal⠀memory⠀and⠀rumor⠀enter⠀through⠀what⠀characters⠀say⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀relative,⠀neighbor,⠀or⠀friend⠀can⠀repeat⠀what⠀the⠀town⠀believes,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀weigh⠀it⠀against⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀seen⠀or⠀heard⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene⠀or⠀an⠀earlier⠀one.⠀Show⠀who⠀is⠀speaking,⠀to⠀whom,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀from⠀the⠀retelling.⠀The⠀public⠀report⠀is⠀a⠀social⠀account⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀motives⠀and⠀errors.⠀A⠀later⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀pictured⠀place⠀may⠀let⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀test⠀that⠀report⠀against⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀arrangement⠀they⠀themselves⠀have⠀observed.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀thought⠀within⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀and⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀a⠀focal⠀conclusion⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀followed⠀its⠀formation.⠀Conversely,⠀do⠀not⠀conceal⠀an⠀authorized⠀focal⠀conclusion⠀until⠀the⠀rest⠀of⠀the⠀cast⠀catches⠀up.⠀Let⠀inner⠀response⠀accompany⠀the⠀scene's⠀visible⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀replace⠀it:⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀outward⠀answer⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀records⠀what⠀they⠀understand,⠀doubt,⠀or⠀would⠀not⠀say.\n\nBackground⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀are⠀purposeful⠀references,⠀not⠀executable⠀engine⠀code⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀line.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.⠀Let⠀scene⠀changes⠀remain⠀legible,⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀scene⠀opening⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀do.⠀The⠀passage⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀focal⠀reaction,⠀a⠀line⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀available⠀conversation,⠀or⠀the⠀arrival⠀of⠀a⠀person⠀whose⠀presence⠀alters⠀the⠀moment.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession,⠀embrace,⠀or⠀relationship⠀decision⠀in⠀every⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamahbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀an⠀installment-oriented⠀story⠀with⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies.⠀Let⠀each⠀installment⠀show⠀what⠀is⠀underway⠀between⠀the⠀characters,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀the⠀reader⠀re-enter⠀the⠀relationship,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀full⠀retelling⠀of⠀earlier⠀installments.\n\nUse⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀layered⠀time⠀by⠀letting⠀a⠀later⠀installment⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀exact⠀earlier⠀particular:⠀restate⠀the⠀phrase⠀in⠀quotation,⠀name⠀the⠀object⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀position,⠀or⠀repeat⠀the⠀promise⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀words.⠀Briefly⠀recover⠀the⠀necessary⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀whole⠀history⠀that⠀first⠀established⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀return⠀revise⠀what⠀the⠀earlier⠀scene⠀suggested⠀without⠀erasing⠀the⠀earlier⠀event.⠀A⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀can⠀now⠀mean⠀something⠀different⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀happened⠀since,⠀but⠀the⠀original⠀moment⠀remains⠀true.⠀Show⠀the⠀revision⠀through⠀a⠀present⠀action⠀or⠀line⠀that⠀the⠀earlier⠀installment⠀did⠀not⠀yet⠀permit,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀narrator's⠀explanation.\n\nLet⠀communal⠀memory⠀and⠀rumor⠀continue⠀across⠀installments.⠀When⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀account⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀installment⠀returns,⠀recover⠀its⠀earlier⠀wording⠀closely⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀notice⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀added,⠀dropped,⠀or⠀corrected.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀now⠀repeat⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀change,⠀challenge⠀it⠀in⠀public,⠀or⠀discover⠀that⠀it⠀influenced⠀someone's⠀decision.⠀Show⠀who⠀is⠀now⠀repeating⠀it⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀want.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀community's⠀version⠀a⠀reliable⠀summary⠀of⠀private⠀feeling;⠀let⠀it⠀be⠀a⠀social⠀force⠀the⠀couple⠀must⠀live⠀with,⠀resist,⠀or⠀ignore⠀for⠀supported⠀reasons.\n\nLet⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀relationship.⠀Uneventful⠀intervals⠀may⠀be⠀compressed,⠀but⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀characters'⠀understanding⠀must⠀remain⠀available.⠀If⠀a⠀person⠀repaired⠀a⠀door,⠀moved⠀away,⠀or⠀changed⠀a⠀habit⠀between⠀installments,⠀that⠀change⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀history⠀and⠀cannot⠀be⠀omitted⠀so⠀the⠀later⠀scene⠀falsely⠀proves⠀the⠀earlier⠀account⠀wrong.⠀New⠀knowledge⠀can⠀qualify⠀an⠀old⠀interpretation⠀without⠀making⠀a⠀character⠀deliberately⠀forget⠀a⠀supported⠀conclusion.\n\nUse⠀earned⠀developments⠀and⠀occasional⠀hooks⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀turn⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀trust,⠀disclosure,⠀disagreement,⠀care,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀belonging⠀together.⠀The⠀installment⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀Serial⠀duration⠀should⠀give⠀selected⠀feelings⠀and⠀facts⠀room⠀to⠀acquire⠀meaning,⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀relationship⠀perpetually⠀recede.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀this⠀romance⠀in⠀short⠀declarative⠀paragraphs⠀separated⠀by⠀white⠀space,⠀so⠀that⠀each⠀beat⠀of⠀exposure⠀lands⠀abruptly⠀instead⠀of⠀being⠀analyzed.⠀Let⠀the⠀strain⠀shape⠀the⠀actual⠀exchange:⠀a⠀person⠀under⠀pressure⠀answers⠀one⠀word⠀too⠀late,⠀asks⠀about⠀something⠀practical⠀instead⠀of⠀the⠀question⠀that⠀matters,⠀or⠀begins⠀a⠀sentence⠀and⠀lets⠀it⠀die.⠀Where⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀reaches⠀for⠀the⠀words⠀that⠀cost⠀most,⠀give⠀that⠀moment⠀its⠀own⠀line,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀refusal⠀be⠀felt.\n\nWork⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀noticed⠀and⠀left⠀unexplained.⠀A⠀remembered⠀phrase,⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀stops⠀halfway⠀across⠀the⠀table,⠀a⠀message⠀read⠀twice⠀and⠀not⠀answered—let⠀these⠀distilled⠀images⠀carry⠀the⠀hurt,⠀phrased⠀in⠀this⠀narrator's⠀own⠀diction⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀borrowed⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.⠀Withholding⠀has⠀a⠀reason⠀this⠀person⠀would⠀recognize:⠀pride,⠀shame,⠀an⠀old⠀injury⠀neither⠀has⠀finished⠀paying⠀for.⠀Render⠀the⠀cost⠀privately—the⠀flare⠀of⠀hope,⠀the⠀impulse⠀to⠀punish,⠀the⠀wish⠀to⠀be⠀wrong⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀person—as⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀actual⠀inner⠀experience,⠀not⠀a⠀stated⠀mood.\n\nWhere⠀the⠀scene⠀turns,⠀let⠀a⠀single⠀action⠀or⠀admission⠀do⠀the⠀turning:⠀a⠀return⠀no⠀one⠀expected,⠀an⠀apology⠀made⠀badly,⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀open.⠀The⠀change⠀does⠀not⠀repair⠀anything⠀by⠀itself.⠀Comfort⠀can⠀be⠀partial⠀and⠀awkward;⠀warmth⠀can⠀arrive⠀while⠀the⠀pain⠀is⠀still⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀Do⠀not⠀push⠀the⠀scene⠀toward⠀reconciliation⠀or⠀tragedy.⠀Let⠀belonging⠀remain⠀a⠀choice⠀made⠀under⠀difficulty,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀stay⠀unresolved⠀if⠀these⠀two⠀people⠀and⠀their⠀history⠀make⠀it⠀so.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀current⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs,⠀with⠀every⠀line⠀of⠀speech⠀unmistakably⠀attributed⠀to⠀its⠀speaker.⠀Keep⠀the⠀exchanges⠀short⠀and⠀exact,⠀in⠀the⠀Gu⠀Long⠀manner:⠀characters⠀answer⠀in⠀a⠀few⠀words,⠀and⠀the⠀meaning⠀gathers⠀around⠀the⠀words—a⠀cup⠀set⠀down⠀too⠀carefully,⠀a⠀glance⠀held⠀a⠀moment⠀past⠀comfort,⠀a⠀name⠀used⠀once⠀when⠀it⠀was⠀not⠀needed.⠀A⠀charged⠀silence⠀is⠀itself⠀a⠀move;⠀leave⠀space⠀for⠀the⠀other⠀participant⠀to⠀fill⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint⠀do⠀the⠀noticing.⠀That⠀character⠀can⠀read⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀avoids⠀saying,⠀remember⠀an⠀earlier⠀exchange,⠀or⠀feel⠀an⠀attraction⠀not⠀yet⠀named—render⠀this⠀as⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀own⠀private⠀experience,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀other⠀character's⠀inner⠀life⠀to⠀what⠀speech⠀and⠀action⠀show,⠀in⠀that⠀character's⠀own⠀voice.⠀Person,⠀action⠀markers,⠀and⠀control⠀of⠀the⠀player's⠀character⠀follow⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀The⠀world⠀stays⠀live⠀around⠀the⠀pair:⠀work⠀continues,⠀people⠀come⠀and⠀go,⠀obligations⠀do⠀not⠀pause⠀for⠀the⠀conversation.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀reply⠀as⠀one⠀coherent⠀interval—a⠀conversation,⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀walk,⠀a⠀room⠀both⠀people⠀are⠀in—rather⠀than⠀a⠀string⠀of⠀disconnected⠀beats.⠀Close⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀naturally⠀hands⠀over⠀the⠀turn:⠀mid-negotiation,⠀after⠀an⠀answer⠀that⠀lands⠀hard,⠀beside⠀a⠀task⠀still⠀unfinished.⠀No⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice⠀is⠀required⠀at⠀the⠀end;⠀the⠀continuation⠀should⠀simply⠀follow⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀between⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀one⠀definite⠀route:⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀narrative.⠀Set⠀the⠀romance⠀inside⠀an⠀actual⠀household⠀and⠀neighborhood⠀of⠀the⠀story's⠀own⠀period,⠀language,⠀and⠀community,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀relationship⠀grow⠀in⠀the⠀spaces⠀that⠀community⠀allows—a⠀shared⠀kitchen,⠀a⠀stairwell,⠀a⠀counter,⠀the⠀hour⠀between⠀one⠀person's⠀return⠀and⠀another's.⠀Feeling⠀moves⠀through⠀household⠀rhythms:⠀who⠀cooks,⠀who⠀pays,⠀which⠀chair⠀belongs⠀to⠀whom,⠀what⠀a⠀late⠀return⠀costs⠀in⠀a⠀building⠀where⠀the⠀door⠀is⠀heard.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀rooms⠀crowded⠀and⠀the⠀speech⠀clipped.⠀A⠀look⠀across⠀a⠀threshold⠀or⠀a⠀sentence⠀left⠀unfinished⠀carries⠀more⠀intimacy⠀than⠀a⠀confession;⠀set⠀white⠀space⠀around⠀such⠀moments⠀so⠀they⠀stand⠀clear⠀of⠀the⠀domestic⠀noise.⠀Elders,⠀in-laws,⠀landlords,⠀and⠀neighbors⠀press⠀through⠀money,⠀schedule,⠀and⠀reputation,⠀but⠀each⠀acts⠀from⠀personal⠀wants,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀stock⠀obstacle.⠀Where⠀the⠀narration⠀permits,⠀give⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀private⠀reading⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀directly—who⠀is⠀owed⠀a⠀greeting,⠀what⠀a⠀tone⠀implies,⠀why⠀a⠀name⠀went⠀unmentioned.\n\nGround⠀every⠀emotional⠀claim⠀in⠀this⠀community's⠀material⠀world:⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀things,⠀the⠀courtesy⠀that⠀matters⠀here,⠀the⠀season's⠀obligations.⠀What⠀the⠀characters⠀record,⠀remember,⠀and⠀avoid⠀reveals⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀belonging⠀together,⠀and⠀the⠀community⠀enforces⠀real⠀consequences⠀for⠀a⠀withheld⠀answer⠀or⠀a⠀chosen⠀loyalty.⠀The⠀romance⠀is⠀not⠀required⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀separation⠀because⠀tradition⠀applies;⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀sustained⠀with⠀difficulty⠀inside⠀the⠀community,⠀or⠀fail⠀for⠀reasons⠀particular⠀to⠀these⠀two.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nBuild⠀the⠀romance⠀out⠀of⠀concrete⠀action⠀and⠀worn⠀material.⠀Attention⠀lives⠀in⠀objects⠀with⠀history:⠀a⠀chipped⠀cup⠀kept⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀hers,⠀a⠀coat⠀mended⠀twice,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀sticks⠀and⠀is⠀shouldered⠀open⠀without⠀comment.⠀Use⠀forceful,⠀plain⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions—cut⠀from⠀one⠀exchange⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀without⠀bridging⠀explanation—and⠀let⠀physical⠀stakes⠀such⠀as⠀cold,⠀exhaustion,⠀money,⠀and⠀an⠀aching⠀body⠀sit⠀beside⠀the⠀emotional⠀ones⠀without⠀hierarchy.\n\nWork⠀the⠀rhythm⠀deliberately.⠀Short⠀hard⠀sentences⠀carry⠀friction⠀and⠀blunt⠀speech;⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀working⠀out⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀means⠀to⠀them,⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀slow⠀and⠀lengthen⠀into⠀real⠀reasoning—the⠀private⠀calculation,⠀the⠀memory⠀that⠀complicates⠀it,⠀the⠀decision⠀not⠀to⠀speak⠀yet.⠀Terse⠀dialogue⠀is⠀not⠀emptiness:⠀people⠀say⠀the⠀practical⠀thing⠀while⠀wanting⠀something⠀else,⠀and⠀a⠀pause⠀after⠀a⠀blunt⠀remark⠀can⠀do⠀more⠀work⠀than⠀an⠀explanation.⠀Keep⠀any⠀roughness⠀in⠀its⠀particular⠀speaker;⠀abrasiveness⠀is⠀a⠀person,⠀not⠀a⠀setting.\n\nLet⠀love⠀be⠀unglamorous⠀and⠀demonstrable:⠀staying⠀to⠀fix⠀a⠀lock,⠀remembering⠀an⠀allergy,⠀refusing⠀to⠀leave⠀during⠀an⠀argument,⠀taking⠀the⠀worse⠀shift.⠀It⠀needs⠀no⠀soft⠀vocabulary—only⠀attention⠀and⠀choice⠀under⠀strain.⠀Close⠀where⠀the⠀beat⠀lands;⠀a⠀feeling⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀be⠀named⠀for⠀an⠀exchange⠀to⠀be⠀over,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀can⠀pick⠀up⠀the⠀weight⠀left⠀unspoken.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀this⠀romance⠀in⠀documents:⠀letters,⠀notes,⠀work⠀logs,⠀household⠀ledgers,⠀messages—whichever⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀calls⠀for,⠀not⠀a⠀fixed⠀rotation⠀of⠀formats.⠀Each⠀document⠀has⠀an⠀author,⠀a⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀composition,⠀and⠀contains⠀only⠀what⠀that⠀writer⠀would⠀choose⠀to⠀record⠀then.⠀A⠀formal⠀letter⠀performs;⠀a⠀scribbled⠀note⠀confesses⠀sideways;⠀a⠀duty⠀log⠀mentions⠀one⠀name⠀more⠀often⠀than⠀duty⠀requires.\n\nLet⠀the⠀emotional⠀truth⠀live⠀in⠀selection,⠀omission,⠀and⠀delay.⠀What⠀is⠀revised,⠀crossed⠀out,⠀left⠀unsent,⠀or⠀answered⠀a⠀day⠀late⠀does⠀the⠀work⠀that⠀spoken⠀scenes⠀would⠀do:⠀a⠀message⠀arrives⠀after⠀the⠀situation⠀has⠀changed;⠀a⠀record⠀contradicts⠀a⠀memory;⠀the⠀tender⠀line⠀sits⠀in⠀a⠀document⠀written⠀for⠀someone⠀else.⠀Use⠀these⠀gaps⠀as⠀structure.⠀After⠀a⠀particularly⠀loaded⠀record,⠀a⠀brief⠀line⠀of⠀present⠀action⠀may⠀show⠀where⠀and⠀by⠀whom⠀it⠀is⠀being⠀read⠀now—without⠀an⠀omniscient⠀voice⠀explaining⠀the⠀sequence⠀after⠀every⠀entry.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀writing⠀alive⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀opens⠀the⠀writer's⠀mind:⠀choosing⠀the⠀second⠀sheet⠀because⠀the⠀first⠀failed,⠀starting⠀one⠀sentence⠀three⠀ways.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀a⠀transcript⠀of⠀the⠀live⠀heart;⠀give⠀genuine⠀private⠀experience⠀its⠀own⠀ground⠀rather⠀than⠀smuggling⠀it⠀into⠀the⠀artifact.⠀The⠀relationship⠀develops⠀across⠀these⠀partial⠀accounts—attention⠀in⠀remembered⠀details,⠀trust⠀in⠀what⠀someone⠀dares⠀to⠀write,⠀rupture⠀in⠀silence—and⠀the⠀gaps⠀between⠀documents⠀may⠀remain⠀gaps⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀measure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀warmth⠀as⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀precise,⠀economical⠀gestures.⠀Comfort⠀is⠀a⠀specific⠀person⠀remembering⠀the⠀right⠀tea,⠀noticing⠀tiredness⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀spoken⠀of,⠀saving⠀the⠀good⠀chair⠀without⠀comment,⠀folding⠀a⠀blanket⠀someone⠀else⠀will⠀use.⠀Use⠀short⠀declarative⠀sentences⠀and⠀small⠀physical⠀facts—a⠀lamp⠀turned⠀on,⠀a⠀cup⠀pushed⠀along⠀the⠀table—and⠀let⠀white⠀space⠀set⠀each⠀kindness⠀apart⠀so⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀seen⠀exactly.\n\nKeep⠀affection⠀sincere⠀but⠀not⠀effusive.⠀A⠀quiet⠀look⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀lands⠀more⠀intimately⠀than⠀a⠀speech;⠀dialogue⠀stays⠀light⠀and⠀natural,⠀with⠀room⠀for⠀gentle⠀teasing⠀and⠀companionable⠀silence.⠀Friction⠀stays⠀manageable⠀and⠀in⠀character—a⠀forgotten⠀errand,⠀a⠀difference⠀over⠀food⠀or⠀noise—settled⠀without⠀lingering⠀bitterness⠀and⠀without⠀erasing⠀the⠀pair's⠀edges,⠀privacy,⠀or⠀standing⠀disagreements.⠀The⠀world⠀keeps⠀its⠀established⠀problems;⠀this⠀interval⠀simply⠀gives⠀the⠀two⠀of⠀them⠀room⠀to⠀enjoy⠀each⠀other⠀inside⠀it.\n\nLet⠀ease⠀do⠀the⠀romantic⠀work.⠀Familiar⠀kindness⠀accumulates⠀into⠀trust,⠀and⠀being⠀known⠀is⠀itself⠀a⠀form⠀of⠀belonging;⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀private⠀pleasure—relief⠀at⠀a⠀familiar⠀step⠀on⠀the⠀stair,⠀the⠀comfort⠀of⠀a⠀preference⠀remembered—is⠀real⠀inner⠀experience,⠀worth⠀rendering⠀rather⠀than⠀summarizing.⠀Where⠀a⠀turn⠀comes,⠀one⠀small⠀gesture⠀can⠀change⠀the⠀room's⠀temperature.⠀The⠀scene⠀needs⠀no⠀confession,⠀repair,⠀or⠀payoff;⠀comfort⠀is⠀the⠀event,⠀and⠀it⠀can⠀end⠀there.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nCompose⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions.⠀Open⠀through⠀social⠀context—a⠀dinner,⠀a⠀workplace⠀gathering,⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀whatever⠀the⠀story⠀supplies—and⠀let⠀that⠀framing⠀establish⠀who⠀is⠀watching,⠀what⠀is⠀owed,⠀and⠀what⠀attention⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀principals⠀costs⠀in⠀this⠀room.⠀Write⠀the⠀narration⠀as⠀composed⠀prose,⠀distinct⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language,⠀moving⠀with⠀enough⠀distance⠀to⠀weigh⠀history,⠀reputation,⠀and⠀consequence⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator's⠀knowledge⠀permits;⠀where⠀it⠀does⠀not,⠀keep⠀the⠀judgment⠀personal⠀and⠀partial.\n\nHold⠀the⠀Gu⠀Long⠀brevity⠀in⠀reserve⠀for⠀the⠀turns.⠀After⠀a⠀long⠀social⠀paragraph,⠀land⠀one⠀short⠀exact⠀sentence—'She⠀had⠀not⠀moved⠀from⠀the⠀doorway'—and⠀let⠀the⠀sudden⠀compression⠀carry⠀the⠀intimacy.⠀Keep⠀pivotal⠀exchanges⠀brief⠀and⠀exact,⠀with⠀withheld⠀explanation⠀creating⠀a⠀distance⠀the⠀social⠀setting⠀makes⠀meaningful:⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀for⠀the⠀room⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀for⠀one⠀person⠀can⠀differ⠀by⠀a⠀single⠀word.⠀White⠀space⠀after⠀such⠀a⠀line⠀lets⠀the⠀shift⠀register⠀before⠀the⠀paragraphs⠀resume.\n\nMake⠀the⠀private⠀decision⠀concrete⠀inside⠀the⠀public⠀frame.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀weighs⠀what⠀others⠀will⠀say,⠀what⠀an⠀invitation⠀means,⠀why⠀a⠀pause⠀at⠀the⠀threshold⠀matters—and⠀then⠀acts,⠀discloses,⠀stays,⠀or⠀argues⠀in⠀observable⠀behavior⠀the⠀relationship⠀can⠀build⠀on.⠀Community⠀judgment⠀and⠀family⠀history⠀bear⠀on⠀the⠀choice⠀without⠀replacing⠀it.⠀Where⠀the⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀allows,⠀a⠀passage⠀may⠀be⠀framed⠀by⠀memory⠀or⠀later⠀understanding;⠀otherwise⠀remain⠀in⠀the⠀present.⠀Ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀and⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀public⠀performance⠀and⠀private⠀feeling⠀may⠀organize⠀a⠀passage⠀when⠀relevant;⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting⠀and⠀archaic⠀vocabulary⠀are⠀not⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀style⠀itself.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀an⠀occasion⠀where⠀one⠀person⠀tells⠀a⠀story⠀to⠀another⠀because⠀the⠀telling⠀itself⠀matters⠀between⠀them.⠀The⠀storyteller⠀may⠀be⠀explaining⠀a⠀past⠀choice,⠀asking⠀for⠀trust⠀without⠀naming⠀it,⠀delaying⠀a⠀departure,⠀or⠀offering⠀a⠀memory⠀as⠀proof⠀of⠀care.⠀Let⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀be⠀the⠀relationship's⠀present⠀tense:⠀the⠀listener⠀stays⠀because⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀being⠀told⠀to⠀them,⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀changes⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀willing⠀to⠀believe,⠀forgive,⠀or⠀admit.\n\nGuide⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀by⠀the⠀storyteller's⠀immediate⠀needs.⠀Each⠀selected⠀image⠀or⠀event⠀should⠀serve⠀a⠀present⠀purpose—to⠀persuade,⠀to⠀comfort,⠀to⠀warn,⠀to⠀test⠀the⠀listener's⠀patience.⠀Use⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compact⠀movement⠀so⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀polished⠀whole⠀but⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀sharp⠀particulars⠀with⠀deliberate⠀gaps.⠀What⠀the⠀teller⠀omits,⠀hesitates⠀over,⠀or⠀describes⠀too⠀precisely⠀is⠀weight-bearing⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀tale⠀become⠀complete⠀or⠀independent;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀gesture⠀aimed⠀at⠀the⠀listener.\n\nLet⠀the⠀listener⠀interrupt,⠀question,⠀or⠀react⠀at⠀moments⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀relationship.⠀A⠀question⠀about⠀timing,⠀a⠀name⠀the⠀teller⠀avoids,⠀or⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀listener⠀remembers⠀differently⠀should⠀shift⠀the⠀balance⠀between⠀them.⠀How⠀the⠀teller⠀responds⠀reveals⠀their⠀patience,⠀evasion,⠀relief,⠀or⠀first⠀honest⠀admission.⠀These⠀interruptions⠀are⠀not⠀background⠀commentary;⠀they⠀show⠀where⠀trust⠀currently⠀stands⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀costing⠀to⠀tell.\n\nMake⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀secretly⠀about⠀the⠀two⠀people⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀It⠀may⠀recount⠀a⠀past⠀encounter,⠀promise,⠀failure,⠀or⠀moment⠀of⠀care⠀that⠀the⠀listener⠀did⠀not⠀fully⠀see.⠀Give⠀the⠀tale⠀a⠀recurring⠀image,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀gesture⠀that⠀accrues⠀meaning⠀and⠀returns⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀with⠀altered⠀weight.⠀Romance⠀develops⠀through⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀repurposed⠀across⠀narrative⠀levels:⠀a⠀shared⠀object⠀may⠀become⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀remembered⠀silence⠀may⠀become⠀a⠀request.\n\nLet⠀the⠀final⠀revelation⠀reorder⠀the⠀present.⠀The⠀story⠀should⠀end⠀by⠀reinterpreting⠀something⠀the⠀listener⠀already⠀knows—why⠀the⠀teller⠀left,⠀why⠀a⠀gift⠀was⠀given,⠀why⠀a⠀silence⠀lasted.⠀The⠀listener's⠀understanding⠀shifts,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀closes⠀on⠀that⠀shift.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀telling⠀to⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀kiss,⠀or⠀a⠀repaired⠀relationship.⠀What⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀said⠀has⠀changed⠀what⠀is⠀legible⠀between⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀the⠀contemporary⠀intimate⠀route:⠀ordinary⠀rooms,⠀workplaces,⠀streets,⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀negotiations⠀of⠀daily⠀life.⠀Let⠀the⠀setting⠀be⠀specific⠀and⠀socially⠀legible—where⠀the⠀characters⠀live,⠀what⠀they⠀do,⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀afford,⠀and⠀the⠀obligations⠀that⠀press⠀on⠀them—without⠀turning⠀the⠀prose⠀into⠀a⠀documentary⠀inventory.⠀The⠀romance⠀lives⠀in⠀how⠀two⠀people⠀move⠀through⠀these⠀conditions⠀together.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀economy⠀to⠀render⠀intimacy⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀noticed⠀and⠀left⠀unsaid.⠀A⠀sentence⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀whole⠀evening:⠀the⠀way⠀one⠀person⠀sets⠀down⠀a⠀cup,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀an⠀answer,⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀two⠀chairs.⠀Record⠀a⠀few⠀precise⠀details⠀and⠀then⠀stop.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀what⠀the⠀details⠀mean;⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀revise⠀their⠀weight.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀accumulated⠀small⠀disclosures⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀single⠀confession.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀reveal⠀something⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀choose⠀to⠀mention,⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀ask,⠀or⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀no⠀longer⠀bother⠀to⠀hide.⠀Let⠀disagreement⠀arise⠀from⠀real⠀differences⠀in⠀need⠀or⠀expectation—time,⠀money,⠀family,⠀work,⠀the⠀wish⠀to⠀be⠀known—and⠀let⠀its⠀aftermath⠀matter.⠀A⠀quarrel⠀need⠀not⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀tidy⠀repair;⠀it⠀can⠀leave⠀a⠀residue⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀characters⠀behave⠀the⠀next⠀day.\n\nReserve⠀the⠀revelation⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀preceding⠀stillness.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀learn⠀late⠀why⠀a⠀character⠀avoided⠀a⠀question,⠀kept⠀a⠀photograph,⠀or⠀returned⠀to⠀a⠀place.⠀When⠀the⠀revelation⠀arrives,⠀it⠀should⠀reorder⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀been⠀shown:⠀an⠀earlier⠀silence⠀becomes⠀a⠀choice,⠀an⠀earlier⠀gesture⠀becomes⠀a⠀test.⠀The⠀revelation⠀should⠀make⠀existing⠀facts⠀legible⠀instead⠀of⠀importing⠀a⠀fresh⠀crisis.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀ending⠀contingent⠀on⠀the⠀particular⠀people.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀stay,⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀leave,⠀a⠀question⠀asked,⠀or⠀a⠀silence⠀finally⠀broken.⠀The⠀relationship⠀has⠀moved⠀when⠀one⠀person⠀understands⠀something⠀they⠀did⠀not,⠀or⠀the⠀other⠀has⠀risked⠀being⠀understood.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀reconciliation,⠀a⠀parting,⠀or⠀a⠀declaration;⠀let⠀the⠀accumulated⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀determine⠀what⠀the⠀final⠀stillness⠀means.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nPlace⠀the⠀couple⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀collision⠀of⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life:⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀an⠀institution,⠀a⠀building⠀with⠀a⠀long⠀history,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀reaches⠀into⠀the⠀present.⠀Let⠀the⠀urban⠀setting⠀be⠀materially⠀concrete—the⠀street,⠀the⠀apartment,⠀the⠀office,⠀the⠀club,⠀the⠀transit⠀line—and⠀let⠀that⠀texture⠀shape⠀how⠀the⠀characters⠀meet,⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀risk,⠀and⠀where⠀they⠀can⠀be⠀alone.⠀The⠀atmosphere⠀is⠀the⠀pressure⠀the⠀relationship⠀moves⠀through.\n\nGive⠀each⠀character⠀a⠀social⠀mask⠀that⠀is⠀functional,⠀not⠀merely⠀theatrical.⠀They⠀may⠀perform⠀competence,⠀obedience,⠀indifference,⠀or⠀charm⠀because⠀the⠀situation⠀demands⠀it.⠀Stage⠀the⠀mask⠀slipping⠀in⠀trusted⠀company:⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀a⠀sentence⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀fit⠀the⠀performance.⠀Use⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compact⠀exchanges⠀to⠀make⠀these⠀slips⠀sharp.⠀A⠀single⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀can⠀reveal⠀that⠀one⠀person⠀has⠀seen⠀the⠀other⠀clearly.\n\nMake⠀intimacy⠀morally⠀complicated⠀without⠀scripting⠀every⠀private⠀moment⠀as⠀a⠀trap.⠀The⠀characters⠀may⠀want⠀different⠀things,⠀may⠀owe⠀loyalty⠀to⠀people⠀who⠀would⠀disapprove,⠀or⠀may⠀be⠀unsure⠀whether⠀trust⠀is⠀safe.⠀Let⠀attraction⠀and⠀care⠀exist⠀alongside⠀these⠀complications.⠀Let⠀difficulty⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀obligations⠀and⠀histories⠀involved,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀universal⠀lesson⠀that⠀love⠀always⠀betrays.\n\nReveal,⠀late,⠀what⠀one⠀character⠀has⠀been⠀carrying⠀or⠀what⠀an⠀institution's⠀decision⠀has⠀cost.⠀The⠀revelation⠀should⠀reorder⠀earlier⠀scenes:⠀a⠀refusal⠀becomes⠀a⠀protection,⠀an⠀absence⠀becomes⠀a⠀sacrifice,⠀a⠀kindness⠀becomes⠀a⠀risk.⠀Use⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀gaps⠀so⠀the⠀reveal⠀is⠀already⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀private⠀moments⠀the⠀couple⠀shared,⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀only⠀now⠀learns⠀to⠀read⠀them.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀scene⠀on⠀the⠀relationship's⠀present⠀condition.⠀The⠀characters⠀may⠀choose⠀each⠀other,⠀separate,⠀agree⠀to⠀wait,⠀or⠀understand⠀something⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀say⠀before.⠀The⠀old⠀authority⠀remains⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀world;⠀what⠀changes⠀is⠀what⠀the⠀two⠀people⠀now⠀know⠀about⠀each⠀other⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀willing⠀to⠀do⠀with⠀that⠀knowledge.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism.⠀Place⠀the⠀characters⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀family,⠀community,⠀workplace,⠀and⠀economic⠀situation.⠀Let⠀their⠀choices⠀about⠀each⠀other⠀be⠀shaped⠀by⠀real⠀constraints:⠀what⠀their⠀families⠀expect,⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀afford,⠀where⠀they⠀can⠀live,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀owe⠀to⠀others.⠀Do⠀not⠀reduce⠀the⠀family⠀to⠀a⠀single⠀oppressive⠀force⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀source⠀of⠀warmth;⠀let⠀its⠀members⠀have⠀their⠀own⠀reasons⠀and⠀claims.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀distilled⠀images⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀these⠀obligations.⠀A⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀closed⠀door,⠀a⠀phone⠀call⠀taken⠀in⠀another⠀room,⠀or⠀a⠀gift⠀accepted⠀and⠀returned⠀can⠀stand⠀for⠀a⠀larger⠀negotiation.⠀Record⠀the⠀image⠀and⠀move⠀on.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀not⠀said,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀withholding⠀for⠀effect,⠀but⠀because⠀the⠀situation⠀makes⠀certain⠀things⠀difficult⠀to⠀say.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀attention⠀and⠀memory.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀is⠀carrying,⠀remember⠀a⠀preference,⠀or⠀choose⠀to⠀stay⠀when⠀leaving⠀would⠀be⠀easier.⠀Let⠀these⠀small⠀acts⠀of⠀care⠀accumulate.⠀Disagreement⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀genuine⠀differences⠀about⠀family,⠀money,⠀the⠀future,⠀or⠀what⠀loyalty⠀requires.⠀Let⠀the⠀aftermath⠀of⠀a⠀quarrel⠀matter:⠀what⠀changes⠀in⠀the⠀household,⠀what⠀is⠀avoided,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀finally⠀addressed.\n\nDelay⠀the⠀revelation⠀that⠀reorders⠀the⠀relationship's⠀history.⠀It⠀may⠀concern⠀a⠀sacrifice⠀one⠀character⠀made,⠀a⠀promise⠀given⠀to⠀a⠀parent,⠀a⠀plan⠀abandoned,⠀or⠀a⠀feeling⠀long⠀concealed.⠀When⠀it⠀arrives,⠀let⠀it⠀explain⠀earlier⠀scenes⠀without⠀excusing⠀everything:⠀a⠀refusal⠀becomes⠀a⠀form⠀of⠀care,⠀a⠀distance⠀becomes⠀a⠀protection,⠀a⠀silence⠀becomes⠀a⠀decision.⠀The⠀revelation⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀relationship⠀more⠀specific,⠀not⠀simpler.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀close⠀on⠀the⠀relationship's⠀actual⠀condition.⠀The⠀characters⠀may⠀decide⠀to⠀marry,⠀to⠀wait,⠀to⠀separate,⠀to⠀defy⠀their⠀families,⠀or⠀to⠀accept⠀a⠀compromise.⠀The⠀decision⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀and⠀their⠀particular⠀obligations.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀happy⠀or⠀tragic⠀ending;⠀let⠀the⠀story's⠀accumulated⠀weight⠀determine⠀what⠀the⠀final⠀image⠀means.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaial::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀social⠀and⠀psychological⠀realism.⠀Place⠀the⠀characters⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀contemporary⠀or⠀historical⠀setting⠀with⠀legible⠀work,⠀housing,⠀and⠀social⠀expectations.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀develop⠀through⠀proximity⠀and⠀routine:⠀shared⠀commutes,⠀repeated⠀encounters,⠀small⠀services,⠀and⠀the⠀gradual⠀accumulation⠀of⠀knowledge⠀about⠀each⠀other's⠀habits⠀and⠀histories.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀details⠀that⠀the⠀characters⠀actually⠀notice⠀and⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀their⠀feeling.\n\nMark⠀the⠀relationship's⠀movement⠀through⠀seasonal⠀and⠀sensory⠀attention.⠀A⠀change⠀in⠀weather,⠀a⠀particular⠀food,⠀or⠀the⠀quality⠀of⠀light⠀in⠀a⠀room⠀can⠀carry⠀emotional⠀weight⠀without⠀being⠀explained.⠀Let⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀economy⠀keep⠀this⠀attention⠀sharp.⠀One⠀precise⠀image⠀per⠀scene⠀is⠀often⠀enough;⠀leave⠀it⠀to⠀work.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀become⠀a⠀meditation⠀that⠀loses⠀the⠀other⠀person.\n\nRender⠀interiority⠀as⠀the⠀characters'⠀actual⠀private⠀experience.⠀One⠀may⠀think⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀said,⠀rehearse⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀notice⠀a⠀feeling⠀and⠀set⠀it⠀aside.⠀Let⠀thought⠀and⠀speech⠀differ⠀for⠀character-specific⠀reasons:⠀caution,⠀embarrassment,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀the⠀wish⠀not⠀to⠀presume.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀feels⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀does⠀not.⠀Use⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀gaps⠀to⠀let⠀a⠀silence⠀carry⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀say.\n\nDelay⠀the⠀revelation⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀preceding⠀stillness.⠀It⠀may⠀concern⠀a⠀past⠀relationship,⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀a⠀plan⠀to⠀leave,⠀or⠀a⠀feeling⠀long⠀hidden.⠀When⠀it⠀arrives,⠀let⠀it⠀reorder⠀earlier⠀scenes:⠀a⠀repeated⠀kindness⠀becomes⠀a⠀choice,⠀a⠀distance⠀becomes⠀a⠀protection,⠀a⠀casual⠀remark⠀becomes⠀a⠀test.⠀The⠀revelation⠀should⠀make⠀existing⠀events⠀legible⠀rather⠀than⠀introducing⠀a⠀new⠀character⠀or⠀crisis.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀changed⠀understanding.⠀The⠀characters⠀may⠀speak,⠀part,⠀sit⠀together⠀in⠀silence,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀small⠀decision⠀that⠀matters.⠀The⠀ending⠀should⠀feel⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀accumulated⠀routine⠀and⠀attention,⠀not⠀imposed⠀by⠀genre.⠀The⠀relationship⠀has⠀moved⠀when⠀one⠀person⠀knows⠀something⠀they⠀did⠀not,⠀or⠀the⠀other⠀has⠀risked⠀being⠀known.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀and⠀urban⠀fiction.⠀Set⠀the⠀characters⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀city,⠀neighborhood,⠀and⠀social⠀situation.⠀Let⠀the⠀streets,⠀transit,⠀housing,⠀work,⠀and⠀local⠀institutions⠀be⠀concrete⠀and⠀particular.⠀The⠀city⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀backdrop;⠀it⠀shapes⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀meet,⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀afford,⠀what⠀they⠀fear,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀remember.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀urban⠀details⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀relationship.\n\nMake⠀the⠀city's⠀pressure⠀felt⠀in⠀dialogue⠀through⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compact⠀exchanges.⠀A⠀conversation⠀can⠀turn⠀on⠀a⠀bus⠀route,⠀a⠀rent⠀increase,⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀that⠀has⠀changed,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀left.⠀Let⠀the⠀characters⠀speak⠀briefly⠀and⠀precisely.⠀What⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀say—about⠀money,⠀the⠀past,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀want—should⠀be⠀as⠀legible⠀as⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀say.⠀Record⠀a⠀few⠀sharp⠀details⠀and⠀then⠀move.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀memory⠀and⠀disclosure.⠀Each⠀character⠀carries⠀a⠀private⠀history:⠀a⠀former⠀love,⠀a⠀family⠀rupture,⠀a⠀migration,⠀a⠀failure,⠀or⠀a⠀hope⠀that⠀has⠀narrowed.⠀Let⠀these⠀histories⠀emerge⠀gradually⠀through⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀chooses⠀to⠀tell,⠀what⠀they⠀avoid,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀notices.⠀Allow⠀attraction⠀and⠀care⠀to⠀exist⠀alongside⠀uncertainty.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀disclosure⠀a⠀test⠀or⠀every⠀memory⠀a⠀wound;⠀some⠀memories⠀are⠀simply⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀a⠀life.\n\nDelay⠀the⠀revelation⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀the⠀relationship.⠀It⠀may⠀concern⠀why⠀one⠀character⠀stayed,⠀why⠀another⠀left,⠀what⠀happened⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀year,⠀or⠀what⠀one⠀has⠀been⠀waiting⠀for.⠀When⠀it⠀arrives,⠀let⠀it⠀reorder⠀the⠀preceding⠀scenes:⠀a⠀repeated⠀route⠀becomes⠀a⠀vigil,⠀a⠀gift⠀becomes⠀a⠀message,⠀a⠀silence⠀becomes⠀a⠀decision.⠀The⠀revelation⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀in⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀been⠀shown.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀close⠀on⠀the⠀relationship's⠀present⠀condition.⠀The⠀characters⠀may⠀choose⠀each⠀other,⠀separate,⠀agree⠀to⠀try⠀again,⠀or⠀understand⠀something⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀say⠀before.⠀The⠀city⠀remains⠀around⠀them,⠀with⠀its⠀pressures⠀and⠀possibilities.⠀What⠀changes⠀is⠀what⠀the⠀two⠀people⠀now⠀know⠀about⠀each⠀other⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀willing⠀to⠀risk.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaian::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀each⠀scene⠀cleanly,⠀with⠀the⠀characters'⠀positions⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀clear⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀few⠀lines.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow;⠀when⠀the⠀characters⠀move⠀from⠀one⠀location⠀to⠀another,⠀mark⠀the⠀change⠀with⠀a⠀short⠀concrete⠀detail.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀always⠀know⠀where⠀the⠀two⠀people⠀are⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing⠀together.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compact⠀dialogue⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship's⠀tension.⠀Let⠀the⠀characters⠀speak⠀briefly,⠀with⠀meaning⠀concentrated⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀choose⠀to⠀say⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀leave⠀out.⠀A⠀single⠀line⠀can⠀shift⠀the⠀scene's⠀temperature.⠀Break⠀paragraphs⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀exchange⠀without⠀losing⠀the⠀emotional⠀thread.⠀Do⠀not⠀pad⠀the⠀dialogue⠀with⠀explanations;⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀reaction⠀beat⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀line⠀meant.\n\nAt⠀the⠀moments⠀that⠀matter,⠀give⠀each⠀character⠀a⠀focused⠀private⠀response.⠀After⠀a⠀significant⠀line⠀or⠀action,⠀move⠀into⠀that⠀character's⠀interiority:⠀what⠀they⠀noticed,⠀what⠀they⠀felt,⠀what⠀they⠀wanted⠀to⠀say⠀and⠀did⠀not.⠀Keep⠀the⠀response⠀brief⠀and⠀specific.⠀Use⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀gaps⠀to⠀let⠀a⠀silence⠀or⠀a⠀hesitation⠀carry⠀weight.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀feels⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀does⠀not.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀repeated⠀encounters⠀and⠀small⠀accumulating⠀changes.⠀Let⠀a⠀scene⠀register⠀any⠀actual⠀change⠀in⠀knowledge,⠀trust,⠀risk,⠀or⠀boundaries,⠀while⠀allowing⠀existing⠀closeness,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀shared⠀time⠀to⠀remain⠀its⠀focus.⠀Let⠀attraction⠀and⠀care⠀develop⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀for⠀each⠀other.⠀Disagreement⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀real⠀differences⠀in⠀need⠀or⠀expectation,⠀and⠀its⠀aftermath⠀should⠀carry⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀scene.\n\nDelay⠀the⠀revelation⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀preceding⠀stillness.⠀It⠀may⠀concern⠀why⠀one⠀character⠀has⠀been⠀distant,⠀what⠀happened⠀in⠀the⠀past,⠀or⠀what⠀one⠀has⠀been⠀trying⠀to⠀say.⠀When⠀it⠀arrives,⠀let⠀it⠀reorder⠀earlier⠀scenes:⠀a⠀repeated⠀gesture⠀becomes⠀a⠀signal,⠀an⠀avoidance⠀becomes⠀a⠀protection,⠀a⠀casual⠀remark⠀becomes⠀a⠀confession.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀the⠀changed⠀understanding,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀left⠀open.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀resolution;⠀let⠀the⠀relationship's⠀actual⠀condition⠀determine⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nCompose⠀the⠀relationship⠀in⠀cadenced⠀passages⠀where⠀sentence⠀rhythm⠀itself⠀registers⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀relational⠀pressure.⠀Open⠀a⠀scene⠀with⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀brief⠀declarative⠀clauses—an⠀action,⠀a⠀placement⠀of⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀direct⠀statement—then⠀let⠀the⠀syntax⠀extend⠀across⠀an⠀image⠀as⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀perceives⠀what⠀that⠀action⠀has⠀altered.⠀The⠀extension⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀private⠀recognition⠀made⠀sensory⠀and⠀grammatical:⠀a⠀lowering⠀of⠀pace⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀waits,⠀a⠀shift⠀from⠀short⠀clauses⠀to⠀a⠀longer⠀subordinate⠀movement⠀where⠀he⠀or⠀she⠀begins⠀to⠀understand,⠀a⠀recurring⠀sound⠀or⠀color⠀returning⠀now⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀altered⠀meaning.⠀Do⠀not⠀attach⠀a⠀lyric⠀expansion⠀to⠀every⠀pause;⠀reserve⠀it⠀for⠀moments⠀when⠀the⠀gap⠀left⠀by⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀white⠀space⠀must⠀become⠀consequential.\n\nLet⠀an⠀image⠀recur⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀later⠀scene⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀evidence.⠀If⠀a⠀cup⠀was⠀touched⠀once⠀in⠀silence,⠀its⠀return⠀should⠀appear⠀at⠀a⠀different⠀angle,⠀in⠀someone⠀else's⠀presence,⠀or⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀implication,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀repetition⠀shows⠀exactly⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀between⠀the⠀pair.⠀The⠀cadence,⠀not⠀a⠀concluding⠀explanation,⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀recognition:⠀a⠀sentence⠀can⠀leave⠀a⠀question⠀incomplete⠀and⠀still⠀complete⠀the⠀private⠀shift.⠀Keep⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀available⠀inside⠀that⠀recognition.⠀The⠀lyric⠀passage⠀may⠀reveal⠀want,⠀fear,⠀or⠀hesitation⠀to⠀speak,⠀but⠀any⠀perception⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀mind⠀stays⠀outside⠀direct⠀access⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀economy⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀withheld⠀between⠀the⠀shaped⠀passages.⠀A⠀brief⠀dialogue⠀line,⠀a⠀single⠀observed⠀gesture,⠀or⠀a⠀room's⠀sudden⠀stillness⠀can⠀create⠀the⠀vacuum⠀that⠀the⠀lyric⠀turn⠀then⠀fills.⠀The⠀shaped⠀prose⠀is⠀not⠀decoration⠀but⠀the⠀consequence⠀of⠀that⠀silence.⠀When⠀a⠀comparison⠀unfolds,⠀unfold⠀it⠀because⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀about⠀the⠀present⠀relationship,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀set⠀piece.⠀Keep⠀the⠀surrounding⠀action⠀plain⠀so⠀the⠀shift⠀in⠀rhythm⠀is⠀felt⠀against⠀it,⠀and⠀finish⠀a⠀reply⠀at⠀the⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀changed⠀awareness,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀conversation⠀after⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nWrite⠀the⠀relationship⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀small,⠀measureable⠀changes:⠀a⠀familiar⠀gesture⠀performed⠀less⠀certainly,⠀an⠀object⠀kept⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀place,⠀a⠀room⠀revisited⠀with⠀one⠀different⠀occupant⠀or⠀light.⠀Open⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀with⠀one⠀declarative⠀observation⠀of⠀such⠀a⠀change,⠀then⠀permit⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀reflection⠀to⠀travel⠀back⠀only⠀far⠀enough⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀change⠀has⠀cost⠀or⠀made⠀newly⠀possible.⠀Keep⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀short⠀and⠀concrete.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀with⠀a⠀question,⠀admission,⠀or⠀renewed⠀attention⠀that⠀could⠀not⠀have⠀arisen⠀before⠀the⠀memory;⠀the⠀recollection⠀must⠀produce⠀the⠀present⠀shift,⠀not⠀merely⠀accompany⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compactness⠀to⠀delay⠀the⠀full⠀reflection⠀until⠀a⠀present⠀revelation⠀or⠀action⠀earns⠀it.⠀A⠀past⠀phrase⠀should⠀not⠀recur⠀until⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀changes⠀its⠀meaning.⠀Let⠀the⠀present⠀event⠀remain⠀lean—a⠀sentence,⠀a⠀failure⠀to⠀answer,⠀a⠀closing⠀door—and⠀let⠀the⠀reflective⠀turn⠀expand⠀afterward,⠀so⠀the⠀melancholy⠀registers⠀as⠀a⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀pre-set⠀mood.⠀Ordinary⠀warmth⠀remains⠀available⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀passage:⠀a⠀shared⠀joke,⠀a⠀practical⠀kindness,⠀or⠀continuing⠀care⠀can⠀appear⠀without⠀being⠀undercut.⠀The⠀reflection⠀may⠀sharpen⠀joy⠀as⠀readily⠀as⠀regret;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀loss⠀or⠀impermanence⠀as⠀the⠀only⠀permitted⠀discovery.\n\nKeep⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀contracted⠀viewpoint.⠀The⠀remembered⠀interior⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character;⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀past⠀motives⠀appear⠀as⠀observed⠀or⠀inferred⠀material,⠀never⠀as⠀direct⠀private⠀access⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀allows⠀it.⠀Chemistry⠀develops⠀through⠀particular⠀timing,⠀obligation,⠀shared⠀history,⠀and⠀the⠀specific⠀ways⠀these⠀two⠀people⠀notice⠀each⠀other⠀across⠀time,⠀not⠀through⠀generic⠀longing.⠀When⠀the⠀recognition⠀arrives,⠀end⠀at⠀its⠀completed⠀internal⠀shift;⠀an⠀unanswered⠀practical⠀question⠀may⠀remain,⠀and⠀the⠀relationship⠀need⠀not⠀conclude,⠀repair,⠀or⠀reverse⠀itself⠀within⠀the⠀response.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀telling⠀as⠀the⠀active⠀narrative⠀structure.⠀Open⠀in⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀voice⠀with⠀one⠀declarative⠀sentence⠀or⠀two⠀that⠀state⠀what⠀is⠀known⠀about⠀the⠀pair—a⠀reputation,⠀a⠀witnessed⠀moment,⠀a⠀question⠀others⠀asked—then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀rendered⠀scene⠀without⠀summarizing⠀the⠀whole⠀history.⠀The⠀teller's⠀interruptions⠀become⠀structural:⠀at⠀a⠀consequential⠀moment,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀frame⠀with⠀a⠀listener's⠀question,⠀a⠀named⠀objection,⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀brief⠀refusal⠀to⠀continue,⠀then⠀resume⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀detail⠀now⠀meaning⠀something⠀different.⠀The⠀gap⠀should⠀create⠀the⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀framed⠀account⠀develop⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀selected⠀moments,⠀not⠀chronology:⠀proximity⠀in⠀one⠀place,⠀a⠀disagreement⠀observed,⠀a⠀small⠀act⠀of⠀care,⠀a⠀later⠀disclosure.⠀Use⠀the⠀teller's⠀limited⠀knowledge⠀as⠀a⠀tool.⠀The⠀teller⠀reports⠀what⠀was⠀seen,⠀heard,⠀or⠀reasonably⠀known;⠀if⠀a⠀private⠀feeling⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀character⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint⠀does⠀not⠀permit⠀direct⠀access,⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀observe⠀its⠀visible⠀consequence⠀or⠀hear⠀a⠀later⠀account⠀instead⠀of⠀inventing⠀interiority.⠀The⠀frame⠀may⠀carry⠀reflective⠀or⠀philosophical⠀prose⠀when⠀the⠀teller⠀weighs⠀significance,⠀but⠀every⠀reflection⠀must⠀connect⠀back⠀to⠀a⠀concrete⠀event⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting's⠀social⠀or⠀domestic⠀texture.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀generic⠀honor⠀code⠀or⠀mystic⠀tableau.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀regional⠀method⠀coherent⠀through⠀actual⠀scene-selection⠀and⠀community⠀texture.⠀Let⠀the⠀setting,⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀particular⠀people⠀supplied⠀govern⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀waiting,⠀courtesy,⠀debt,⠀or⠀public⠀speech;⠀avoid⠀turning⠀local⠀obligation⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀universal⠀rule.⠀The⠀teller's⠀own⠀stake⠀may⠀shape⠀the⠀telling⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀lovers⠀a⠀moral⠀lesson.⠀End⠀a⠀passage⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀delayed⠀detail⠀transforms⠀the⠀recounted⠀event,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀portion⠀pending;⠀the⠀relationship⠀need⠀not⠀resolve,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀need⠀not⠀pronounce⠀its⠀meaning.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀one⠀exact⠀detail⠀per⠀movement⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship's⠀change:⠀a⠀hand⠀placed⠀and⠀removed,⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀unlatched,⠀a⠀plate⠀set⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀place,⠀a⠀question⠀repeated⠀in⠀a⠀lower⠀register.⠀Present⠀the⠀detail⠀in⠀one⠀direct⠀clause⠀and⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀or⠀line⠀of⠀speech⠀follow⠀without⠀analysis.⠀The⠀lack⠀of⠀explanation⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀shift⠀inferable,⠀not⠀evasive;⠀the⠀writer⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀detail⠀for⠀a⠀second⠀time⠀later⠀when⠀a⠀new⠀fact⠀alters⠀what⠀it⠀meant.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀economy⠀so⠀a⠀gesture⠀or⠀sentence⠀is⠀the⠀event.⠀A⠀four-line⠀exchange⠀can⠀end⠀a⠀scene⠀if⠀the⠀last⠀line⠀changes⠀the⠀terms⠀between⠀the⠀characters.⠀Write⠀the⠀exchange⠀as⠀plain,⠀person-specific⠀speech:⠀one⠀speaker⠀may⠀be⠀terse,⠀another⠀more⠀explicit,⠀but⠀neither⠀should⠀perform⠀ellipsis.⠀The⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀may⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀single⠀remembered⠀observation⠀returning⠀with⠀fresh⠀weight—a⠀pause⠀before⠀speech,⠀an⠀object⠀left⠀behind—and⠀the⠀space⠀between⠀the⠀first⠀occurrence⠀and⠀its⠀return⠀should⠀be⠀the⠀structure⠀that⠀does⠀the⠀work,⠀not⠀a⠀summarizing⠀paragraph.\n\nGive⠀only⠀the⠀inward⠀connection⠀that⠀materially⠀contributes.⠀A⠀single⠀clause⠀of⠀private⠀awareness⠀may⠀be⠀enough⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀registered⠀the⠀change;⠀if⠀the⠀thought⠀would⠀require⠀explanation,⠀shorten⠀or⠀let⠀the⠀action⠀complete⠀the⠀recognition.⠀Keep⠀physical⠀grounding⠀precise—what⠀is⠀seen,⠀touched,⠀or⠀heard—so⠀the⠀emotional⠀inference⠀stays⠀anchored.⠀Render⠀private⠀experience⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits,⠀and⠀keep⠀another⠀character's⠀mind⠀observed⠀or⠀inferred⠀rather⠀than⠀directly⠀entered.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀changed⠀detail⠀has⠀been⠀recognized,⠀not⠀when⠀every⠀consequence⠀has⠀been⠀spoken.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaias::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀continuous⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀relevant⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀authorized⠀interiority.⠀Begin⠀each⠀movement⠀with⠀short⠀declarative⠀clauses⠀that⠀establish⠀a⠀concrete⠀action⠀or⠀spoken⠀line,⠀then⠀develop⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀ordinary⠀paragraphing.⠀Let⠀the⠀current⠀moment⠀carry⠀the⠀romance's⠀development:⠀a⠀disclosure,⠀a⠀changed⠀plan,⠀a⠀longer⠀attention,⠀a⠀practical⠀response,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀left⠀partly⠀unformed.⠀Do⠀not⠀interrupt⠀the⠀flow⠀to⠀tell⠀the⠀reader⠀that⠀the⠀preceding⠀material⠀must⠀be⠀reinterpreted;⠀instead,⠀let⠀the⠀later⠀perception⠀discover⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compactness⠀inside⠀the⠀smooth⠀movement.⠀A⠀brief⠀pause⠀in⠀dialogue,⠀a⠀withheld⠀explanation,⠀or⠀a⠀sharply⠀noticed⠀detail⠀can⠀be⠀placed⠀in⠀an⠀ordinary⠀action⠀paragraph.⠀When⠀the⠀later⠀revelation⠀arrives—an⠀action,⠀a⠀sentence,⠀or⠀an⠀authorized⠀private⠀recognition—write⠀it⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀stop⠀but⠀as⠀one⠀more⠀current⠀perception⠀that⠀makes⠀an⠀earlier⠀perception⠀return⠀with⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀The⠀prose⠀may⠀slow⠀slightly,⠀or⠀refocus⠀on⠀the⠀remembered⠀detail,⠀but⠀it⠀remains⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀If⠀a⠀previous⠀fact⠀matters⠀now,⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀perceive⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀dialogue⠀line;⠀the⠀recognition⠀happens⠀in⠀the⠀present,⠀not⠀in⠀an⠀inserted⠀summary.\n\nGive⠀the⠀romance's⠀aftermath⠀enough⠀room⠀within⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀disclosure⠀may⠀produce⠀a⠀practical⠀consequence,⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀attentiveness,⠀or⠀a⠀period⠀of⠀silence⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀immediate⠀resolution.⠀Keep⠀another⠀character's⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀outside⠀the⠀narrator's⠀direct⠀access⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀it,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀claim⠀insight⠀merely⠀to⠀create⠀suspense.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting,⠀contemporary⠀voice,⠀and⠀characters⠀as⠀themselves.⠀A⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀thought,⠀composition,⠀or⠀private⠀realization,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀conversation⠀or⠀moral⠀conclusion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nSelect⠀scenes⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible⠀at⠀once.⠀Begin⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀dynamics⠀the⠀premise⠀establishes—how⠀they⠀met,⠀what⠀they⠀mean⠀to⠀each⠀other,⠀what⠀obligation,⠀history,⠀or⠀desire⠀keeps⠀them⠀in⠀proximity—and⠀let⠀each⠀chosen⠀moment⠀show⠀an⠀existing⠀part⠀of⠀that⠀dynamic⠀rather⠀than⠀introducing⠀an⠀unrelated⠀trope.⠀Private⠀language⠀accumulates⠀deliberately:⠀a⠀phrase,⠀gesture,⠀object,⠀joke,⠀or⠀reference⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀used⠀earlier⠀returns⠀later⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀Plant⠀the⠀callback⠀briefly⠀and⠀without⠀emphasis⠀when⠀it⠀first⠀appears;⠀let⠀its⠀later⠀return⠀do⠀the⠀work.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀brevity⠀to⠀delay⠀a⠀defining⠀revelation.⠀The⠀characters⠀may⠀act⠀around⠀an⠀important⠀feeling,⠀need,⠀or⠀unresolved⠀question;⠀the⠀prose⠀records⠀small⠀movements⠀and⠀sharp⠀exchanges⠀without⠀announcing⠀the⠀hidden⠀content.⠀When⠀the⠀revelation⠀or⠀recognition⠀arrives—an⠀admission,⠀a⠀remembered⠀earlier⠀scene,⠀a⠀choice—write⠀the⠀return⠀of⠀the⠀private⠀language⠀as⠀the⠀event⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀earlier⠀moment.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀now⠀understand⠀why⠀that⠀particular⠀callback⠀mattered,⠀but⠀the⠀story⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀change⠀through⠀the⠀characters'⠀current⠀actions,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀summary⠀paragraph⠀explaining⠀the⠀symbolism.\n\nGive⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀this⠀actual⠀pairing's⠀established⠀tensions⠀make⠀them⠀belong.⠀Do⠀not⠀compress⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀confession⠀and⠀reconciliation;⠀uncertainty⠀and⠀unfinished⠀business⠀may⠀continue⠀across⠀passages,⠀and⠀a⠀warm⠀scene⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀undercut⠀by⠀a⠀new⠀conflict.⠀Keep⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀private⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀available⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀arc,⠀but⠀keep⠀knowledge⠀boundaries⠀intact:⠀another⠀character's⠀hidden⠀motives⠀stay⠀observed⠀or⠀inferred⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀access.⠀Humor,⠀banter,⠀or⠀fluff⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀characters⠀but⠀are⠀not⠀a⠀required⠀beat.⠀The⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀consequences,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀romantic⠀template,⠀are⠀the⠀core.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀relationship⠀as⠀deeds⠀that⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀and⠀retold.⠀Open⠀with⠀one⠀deliberate⠀declarative⠀statement⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀bond⠀or⠀the⠀act⠀that⠀first⠀made⠀it⠀notable,⠀then⠀move⠀directly⠀into⠀the⠀rendered⠀scene.⠀Introduce⠀people⠀through⠀an⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀consequence,⠀not⠀a⠀full⠀portrait.⠀Keep⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀physically⠀concrete:⠀the⠀teller⠀does⠀not⠀float⠀above⠀it.\n\nLet⠀recurrence⠀function⠀as⠀a⠀reevaluation.⠀A⠀promise,⠀a⠀place,⠀or⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀speaking⠀may⠀be⠀repeated⠀in⠀the⠀chronicle,⠀but⠀each⠀return⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀new⠀retelling⠀from⠀a⠀later⠀vantage:⠀someone⠀now⠀describes⠀the⠀earlier⠀act⠀differently,⠀or⠀repeats⠀the⠀phrase⠀while⠀knowing⠀what⠀it⠀led⠀to.⠀This⠀is⠀the⠀saga's⠀memory,⠀not⠀a⠀decorative⠀epithet.⠀Connect⠀one⠀act⠀to⠀another:⠀a⠀choice⠀made⠀in⠀one⠀scene⠀later⠀alters⠀what⠀someone⠀may⠀ask,⠀offer,⠀or⠀refuse.⠀Public⠀or⠀communal⠀recognition⠀may⠀sharpen⠀the⠀private⠀relationship,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀inflate⠀ordinary⠀care⠀into⠀ceremonial⠀combat;⠀the⠀romance⠀remains⠀the⠀central⠀relation⠀being⠀remembered,⠀and⠀any⠀oath,⠀journey,⠀gift,⠀or⠀kinship⠀appears⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀supports⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀as⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀turn.⠀Plant⠀one⠀small⠀act⠀that⠀could⠀be⠀passed⠀over—a⠀delay,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀word⠀held⠀back—without⠀emphasis.⠀Later,⠀when⠀a⠀choice⠀reveals⠀what⠀it⠀meant,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀earlier⠀act⠀as⠀a⠀retold⠀moment⠀now⠀understood⠀differently.⠀That⠀recognition⠀changes⠀the⠀preceding⠀stillness,⠀but⠀the⠀account⠀continues;⠀it⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀next⠀deed⠀pending,⠀with⠀the⠀bond⠀redefined⠀rather⠀than⠀concluded.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀knowledge⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint,⠀and⠀give⠀private⠀interiority⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀as⠀the⠀teller⠀would⠀pause,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀portion⠀of⠀the⠀telling⠀still⠀ahead.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism⠀route:⠀a⠀particular⠀household,⠀workplace,⠀or⠀neighborhood⠀where⠀the⠀relationship⠀develops⠀through⠀ordinary⠀obligations,⠀shared⠀tasks,⠀and⠀the⠀way⠀people⠀arrange⠀their⠀days⠀around⠀one⠀another.⠀Let⠀the⠀setting⠀be⠀specific⠀and⠀inhabited.⠀Meals,⠀errands,⠀weather,⠀work⠀schedules,⠀and⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀shared⠀rooms⠀carry⠀emotional⠀information⠀without⠀being⠀explained.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀brief⠀declarative⠀movement⠀to⠀compress⠀scene⠀transitions⠀and⠀leave⠀meaningful⠀gaps.⠀A⠀short⠀paragraph⠀can⠀move⠀from⠀one⠀hour⠀or⠀one⠀room⠀to⠀the⠀next.⠀What⠀a⠀person⠀notices⠀in⠀that⠀interval⠀matters⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀full⠀account⠀of⠀what⠀happened.⠀Keep⠀descriptions⠀distilled:⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀concrete⠀details⠀stand⠀for⠀a⠀larger⠀change.⠀Show⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀picks⠀up,⠀sets⠀down,⠀rearranges,⠀or⠀leaves⠀alone:⠀a⠀coat⠀moved⠀from⠀a⠀shared⠀hook,⠀a⠀chair⠀turned⠀slightly⠀toward⠀a⠀window,⠀a⠀book⠀returned⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀shelf.⠀The⠀object⠀does⠀the⠀narrative⠀work;⠀do⠀not⠀explain⠀it.\n\nLet⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀work⠀through⠀domestic⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀know⠀something⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀habits,⠀history,⠀or⠀obligations⠀long⠀before⠀they⠀say⠀it⠀aloud.⠀Show⠀that⠀knowledge⠀accumulating⠀in⠀small⠀observations⠀and⠀private⠀reactions,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀stated⠀dossier:⠀noticing⠀which⠀drawer⠀they⠀avoid,⠀which⠀errand⠀they⠀put⠀off,⠀which⠀hour⠀of⠀the⠀week⠀makes⠀them⠀quiet.⠀When⠀the⠀revelation⠀arrives,⠀it⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀earlier⠀ordinary⠀moments⠀rather⠀than⠀arriving⠀as⠀a⠀sudden⠀plot⠀event.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀noticed⠀until⠀it⠀is⠀spoken⠀or⠀shown.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀romantic⠀development⠀particular⠀to⠀these⠀people.⠀Attraction⠀can⠀be⠀immediate⠀or⠀slow,⠀but⠀it⠀appears⠀through⠀specific⠀attention:⠀remembering⠀how⠀someone⠀organizes⠀a⠀shared⠀space,⠀noticing⠀when⠀they⠀sleep⠀badly,⠀choosing⠀to⠀stay⠀late⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀yet⠀named.⠀Show⠀disagreement⠀and⠀uncertainty⠀through⠀the⠀daily⠀round,⠀not⠀as⠀obstacles⠀to⠀be⠀defeated⠀but⠀as⠀moments⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀reveal⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀afraid⠀to⠀risk.⠀Let⠀timing,⠀obligations,⠀and⠀competing⠀wants⠀create⠀complications⠀with⠀meaningful⠀aftermath.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀A⠀character's⠀interiority⠀may⠀be⠀visible⠀prose⠀or⠀hidden⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀contain⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀thought⠀and⠀feeling.⠀What⠀a⠀person⠀declines⠀to⠀explain⠀can⠀carry⠀uncertainty⠀without⠀making⠀them⠀permanently⠀cryptic.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀focal⠀motive⠀while⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀it.\n\nDo⠀not⠀import⠀martial⠀codes,⠀wine,⠀blades,⠀or⠀a⠀perpetually⠀cryptic⠀cast⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀author⠀profile⠀is⠀selected.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀setting⠀bleak⠀or⠀isolated⠀unless⠀the⠀actual⠀story⠀supplies⠀those⠀conditions.⠀Do⠀not⠀silently⠀relabel⠀a⠀particular⠀national⠀or⠀regional⠀setting⠀as⠀generic⠀Scandinavian.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀conversation,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀recognition⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀confession⠀or⠀reversal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀screen-oriented⠀scenes⠀with⠀concise⠀action⠀lines,⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues,⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Keep⠀action⠀blocks⠀readable⠀and⠀specific.⠀Show⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀does⠀with⠀an⠀object,⠀how⠀they⠀enter⠀or⠀leave⠀a⠀room,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀look⠀at⠀before⠀they⠀speak.⠀A⠀short⠀action⠀line⠀carries⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀longer⠀emotional⠀beat:⠀she⠀sets⠀the⠀kettle⠀down,⠀he⠀moves⠀his⠀chair⠀an⠀inch,⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀looks⠀at⠀the⠀door⠀before⠀answering.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compressed⠀exchange⠀style⠀in⠀the⠀dialogue.⠀Let⠀characters⠀speak⠀briefly,⠀leave⠀things⠀unsaid,⠀and⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀with⠀an⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀subject.⠀Meaningful⠀gaps⠀belong⠀between⠀lines⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀between⠀scenes.⠀A⠀pause,⠀a⠀look,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀physical⠀adjustment⠀can⠀stand⠀in⠀for⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀will⠀not⠀say⠀yet.⠀Let⠀the⠀action⠀line⠀around⠀the⠀dialogue⠀register⠀hesitation,⠀habit,⠀or⠀deliberate⠀attention:⠀who⠀pours⠀first,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀looks⠀away⠀when⠀the⠀other⠀speaks.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀witty⠀or⠀perpetually⠀ready⠀with⠀polished⠀banter.\n\nLet⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀work⠀through⠀visible⠀and⠀audible⠀events.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀know⠀something⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀habits,⠀history,⠀or⠀obligations⠀long⠀before⠀they⠀say⠀it⠀aloud.⠀Show⠀the⠀knowledge⠀accumulating⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀camera⠀can⠀register:⠀which⠀object⠀they⠀always⠀handle,⠀which⠀sound⠀makes⠀them⠀glance⠀up,⠀which⠀ordinary⠀errand⠀they⠀never⠀mention.⠀When⠀the⠀revelation⠀arrives,⠀it⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀earlier⠀scenes⠀rather⠀than⠀arriving⠀as⠀a⠀sudden⠀plot⠀event.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀noticed⠀until⠀it⠀is⠀spoken⠀or⠀shown.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀romantic⠀development⠀particular⠀to⠀these⠀people.⠀Attraction⠀can⠀be⠀immediate⠀or⠀slow,⠀but⠀it⠀appears⠀through⠀specific⠀attention⠀and⠀ordinary⠀screen-visible⠀gestures:⠀remembering⠀how⠀someone⠀makes⠀tea,⠀noticing⠀when⠀they⠀sleep⠀badly,⠀choosing⠀to⠀wait⠀for⠀a⠀delayed⠀train⠀or⠀bus⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀yet⠀named.⠀Disagreement⠀and⠀uncertainty⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀relationship,⠀not⠀as⠀obstacles⠀to⠀be⠀defeated⠀but⠀as⠀moments⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀reveal⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀afraid⠀to⠀risk.⠀Let⠀timing,⠀obligations,⠀and⠀competing⠀wants⠀create⠀complications⠀with⠀meaningful⠀aftermath.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀notes⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀The⠀notes⠀are⠀not⠀dialogue⠀and⠀are⠀not⠀knowledge⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀cast.⠀Use⠀cuts,⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀and⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀conversation,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀recognition⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀confession⠀or⠀reversal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaiax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀script⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Let⠀th